const e=JSON.parse(`[{"id":"L1-A01","level":1,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"今天下午，一位男演員和一位女演員來學校和我們聊藝術。男演員很有表演天分，也能在舞臺上邊唱邊演。女演員演了一小段戲。老師問：「她在戲裡做了哪些動作？」我們回答了問題，老師把答案寫在黑板上。","en":"This afternoon, an actor and an actress came to our school and talked with us about art. The actor has a real ability to act, and he is also able to sing and act on stage. The actress acted in a short play. The teacher asked, \\"What actions did she do in the play?\\" We answered the question, and the teacher wrote the answers on the blackboard.","words":[{"en":"ability","zh":"能力、才幹"},{"en":"able","zh":"能夠的、有能力的"},{"en":"about","zh":"關於；約"},{"en":"act","zh":"行動、行為"},{"en":"action","zh":"行動、活動"},{"en":"actor/actress","zh":"演員"},{"en":"afternoon","zh":"午後、下午"},{"en":"also","zh":"也、並且"},{"en":"answer","zh":"答案、回答"},{"en":"art","zh":"藝術、美術"},{"en":"ask","zh":"問、要求"}]},{"id":"L1-A02","level":1,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"今天上午七點，我和阿姨已經在機場了。我們幾乎錯過第一班飛機。兩小時後，我們抵達另一個機場。我第一次到國外旅行，離家好遠！下飛機後，我到外面呼吸新鮮空氣。","en":"At seven a.m. today, my aunt and I were already at the airport. We almost missed the first airplane. Two hours later, we arrived at another airport. It was my first trip abroad, and I was so far away from home! After getting off the plane, I went outside to breathe some fresh air.","words":[{"en":"abroad","zh":"在國外、到國外"},{"en":"after","zh":"在……之後"},{"en":"air","zh":"空氣"},{"en":"airplane/plane","zh":"飛機"},{"en":"airport","zh":"飛機場"},{"en":"almost","zh":"幾乎"},{"en":"already","zh":"已經、早已"},{"en":"another","zh":"另一個、再一個"},{"en":"arrive","zh":"到達、抵達"},{"en":"aunt","zh":"阿姨、姑姑、伯母"},{"en":"away","zh":"離開、在遠處"}]},{"id":"L1-A03","level":1,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"傍晚，我沿著河邊散步，走過一座橋。幾隻鳥從我頭上飛過。我又繞著公園走了一圈。這一帶有很多動物，一隻螞蟻正在搬一小塊蘋果。","en":"In the evening, I walked along the river and across a bridge. Some birds flew above my head. Then I walked around the park again. There are many animals in this area. An ant was carrying a small piece of apple.","words":[{"en":"above","zh":"在上方、超出"},{"en":"across","zh":"越過、穿過"},{"en":"again","zh":"再一次、又"},{"en":"along","zh":"沿著"},{"en":"animal","zh":"動物"},{"en":"ant","zh":"螞蟻"},{"en":"apple","zh":"蘋果"},{"en":"area","zh":"區域、面積"},{"en":"around","zh":"在……周圍；大約"}]},{"id":"L1-A04","level":1,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"三年前，我阿姨搬進一間公寓。昨天，一個和我同年紀的男孩出現在她家門口。他拿著他家狗的照片，說：「狗老得真快！」","en":"Three years ago, my aunt moved into an apartment. Yesterday, a boy my age appeared at her door. He was holding a photo of his dog and said, \\"Dogs get old so fast!\\"","words":[{"en":"age","zh":"年齡"},{"en":"ago","zh":"以前"},{"en":"apartment","zh":"公寓"},{"en":"appear","zh":"出現、顯得"},{"en":"aunt","zh":"阿姨、姑姑、伯母"}]},{"id":"L1-A05","level":1,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"阿姨問：「有人認識門口那個人嗎？」接著，她問那個人：「你需要什麼嗎？」他搖搖頭，說：「有其他住戶在家嗎？我來找另一位住戶。」","en":"My aunt asked, \\"Does anybody know the person at the door?\\" Then she asked him, \\"Do you need anything?\\" He shook his head and said, \\"Are any other people at home? I am looking for another person who lives here.\\"","words":[{"en":"am/a.m.","zh":"上午"},{"en":"another","zh":"另一個、再一個"},{"en":"anybody/anyone","zh":"任何人"},{"en":"anything","zh":"任何事"},{"en":"ask","zh":"問、要求"},{"en":"aunt","zh":"阿姨、姑姑、伯母"}]},{"id":"L1-A06","level":1,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"下午，我們一起做餅乾。阿姨讓我自己加糖。我打翻了碗，只好重來一次。這次我把材料全部拌好，差一點又打翻了碗。","en":"In the afternoon, we made cookies together. My aunt allowed me to add the sugar by myself. I knocked over the bowl, so I had to do it again. This time I mixed everything well, and I almost knocked over the bowl again.","words":[{"en":"add","zh":"加、增加"},{"en":"afternoon","zh":"午後、下午"},{"en":"again","zh":"再一次、又"},{"en":"allow","zh":"允許"},{"en":"almost","zh":"幾乎"},{"en":"aunt","zh":"阿姨、姑姑、伯母"}]},{"id":"L1-A07","level":1,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"回家路上，一隻生氣的狗想攻擊我們。主人立刻採取行動，抓住了牠的項圈。雖然這次攻擊讓我們很害怕，狗沒有咬傷任何人。","en":"On the way home, an angry dog tried to attack us. Its owner took action right away and grabbed its collar. Although the attack made us afraid, the dog did not bite anyone.","words":[{"en":"action","zh":"行動、活動"},{"en":"afraid","zh":"害怕的、恐怕的"},{"en":"although","zh":"雖然、儘管"},{"en":"angry","zh":"生氣的、憤怒的"},{"en":"anybody/anyone","zh":"任何人"},{"en":"attack","zh":"攻擊；（疾病）發作"},{"en":"away","zh":"離開、在遠處"}]},{"id":"L1-A08","level":1,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"雖然我們想去的地方不同，最後大家都同意週末去海邊。我們也約好八點集合。我們總是遵守約定。","en":"Although we wanted to go to different places, in the end we all agreed to go to the beach on the weekend. We also made an agreement to meet at eight. We always keep our agreements.","words":[{"en":"agree(ment)","zh":"同意、贊成"},{"en":"also","zh":"也、並且"},{"en":"although","zh":"雖然、儘管"},{"en":"always","zh":"總是、始終"}]},{"id":"L1-A09","level":1,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"身為班長，我每天七點半到校。老師允許我們在課前聊天約十分鐘。對功課有任何問題，也可以在那時候問。","en":"As the class leader, I arrive at school at seven thirty every day. Our teacher allows us to chat for about ten minutes before class. If we have any questions about our homework, we can also ask then.","words":[{"en":"about","zh":"關於；約"},{"en":"allow","zh":"允許"},{"en":"also","zh":"也、並且"},{"en":"arrive","zh":"到達、抵達"},{"en":"ask","zh":"問、要求"}]},{"id":"L1-A10","level":1,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"放學後，我們沿著街道走去戲院。朋友的手臂有點痠，我替他拿了書包。戲院門口有一張電影海報，海報上的士兵正拿起劍武裝自己，保護這一帶的居民。戲院離我們家只有一條街。","en":"After school, we walked along the street to the theater. My friend's arm was a little sore, so I carried his schoolbag for him. There was a movie poster at the door of the theater. On the poster, a soldier was picking up a sword to arm himself and protect the people in the area. The theater is only one block away from our homes.","words":[{"en":"after","zh":"在……之後"},{"en":"along","zh":"沿著"},{"en":"area","zh":"區域、面積"},{"en":"arm","zh":"手臂"},{"en":"away","zh":"離開、在遠處"}]},{"id":"L1-B01","level":1,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"媽媽用嬰兒車推著寶寶走出水果店。她的袋子還在店裡。她回去拿袋子，把裡面的香蕉放進嬰兒車下方的籃子。","en":"Mom pushed the baby out of the fruit store in a stroller. Her bag was still in the store. She went back for the bag and put the bananas from it into the basket below the stroller.","words":[{"en":"baby","zh":"嬰兒"},{"en":"back","zh":"背部；回來、向後"},{"en":"bag","zh":"袋子、包包"},{"en":"banana","zh":"香蕉"},{"en":"basket","zh":"籃、籃子"},{"en":"below","zh":"在下面"}]},{"id":"L1-B02","level":1,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"天氣很差，棒球比賽提前結束了。我們離場前，我幫教練收起球棒，弟弟去撿最後一顆球。","en":"The weather was bad, so the baseball game ended early. Before we left, I helped the coach put away the bats, and my brother went to pick up the last ball.","words":[{"en":"bad","zh":"壞的、不好的"},{"en":"ball","zh":"球"},{"en":"baseball","zh":"棒球"},{"en":"bat","zh":"蝙蝠、球棒"},{"en":"before","zh":"在……之前"},{"en":"brother","zh":"兄弟"}]},{"id":"L1-B03","level":1,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"一個樂團在銀行門口演出。最後一首歌唱完，四個人一起向觀眾鞠躬。","en":"A band played in front of the bank. When the last song was over, the four of them bowed to the audience together.","words":[{"en":"band","zh":"樂團；帶子"},{"en":"bank","zh":"銀行；河岸"},{"en":"bow","zh":"鞠躬；弓"}]},{"id":"L1-B04","level":1,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"長椅後面有一顆籃球。你看，隊徽下方寫著小美的名字，這顆球屬於她。","en":"There is a basketball behind the bench. Look, Xiao-Mei's name is written below the team logo. This ball belongs to her.","words":[{"en":"ball","zh":"球"},{"en":"basketball","zh":"籃球"},{"en":"behind","zh":"在……背後"},{"en":"belong","zh":"屬於"},{"en":"below","zh":"在下面"},{"en":"bench","zh":"長椅子"}]},{"id":"L1-B05","level":1,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"弟弟在浴室洗了個澡。他回到臥室，小貓已經睡在他的床上了。","en":"My brother took a bath in the bathroom. When he went back to his bedroom, the kitten was already sleeping on his bed.","words":[{"en":"back","zh":"背部；回來、向後"},{"en":"bath","zh":"洗澡；浴缸"},{"en":"bathroom","zh":"浴室、廁所"},{"en":"bed","zh":"床"},{"en":"bedroom","zh":"臥室"},{"en":"brother","zh":"兄弟"}]},{"id":"L1-B06","level":1,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"這是我最喜歡的小屋，因為它就在海灘旁邊。傍晚的海很漂亮，這裡是看夕陽最好的地方。","en":"This is my favorite cabin because it is right beside the beach. The sea is beautiful in the evening, and this is the best place to watch the sunset.","words":[{"en":"beach","zh":"海灘"},{"en":"beautiful","zh":"美麗的"},{"en":"because","zh":"因為"},{"en":"beside","zh":"在旁邊"},{"en":"best","zh":"最好的"}]},{"id":"L1-B07","level":1,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"午休時，我和老闆一起去吃飯。我點了一碗牛肉麵，老闆點了一碟豆子。","en":"At lunch break, I went to eat with my boss. I ordered a bowl of beef noodles, and my boss ordered a plate of beans.","words":[{"en":"bean","zh":"豆子"},{"en":"beef","zh":"牛肉"},{"en":"boss","zh":"老闆、上司"},{"en":"bowl","zh":"碗"},{"en":"break","zh":"打破；休息"}]},{"id":"L1-B08","level":1,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"那個男孩指著泥地上的腳印說：「這是熊的腳印。」沒有人相信他。他很勇敢，但他還是先去找大人幫忙。","en":"The boy pointed at the footprints in the mud and said, \\"These are a bear's footprints.\\" Nobody believed him. He was brave, but he still went to get help from an adult first.","words":[{"en":"bear","zh":"熊；忍受"},{"en":"believe","zh":"相信"},{"en":"boy","zh":"男孩"},{"en":"brave","zh":"勇敢的"}]},{"id":"L1-B09","level":1,"letter":"B","n":9,"zh":"我指著葉子上一隻棕色的小蟲。妹妹問：「牠會變成蜜蜂嗎？」爸爸說：「不會，這是毛毛蟲。牠會變成蝴蝶。」","en":"I pointed at a small brown bug on a leaf. My sister asked, \\"Will it become a bee?\\" Dad said, \\"No, this is a caterpillar. It will become a butterfly.\\"","words":[{"en":"become","zh":"變成、變得"},{"en":"bee","zh":"蜜蜂"},{"en":"brown","zh":"褐色的"},{"en":"bug","zh":"蟲子；（程式）錯誤"},{"en":"butterfly","zh":"蝴蝶"}]},{"id":"L1-B10","level":1,"letter":"B","n":10,"zh":"休息時間開始了。弟弟沒帶水壺，我就在上課鈴響前從隔壁教室拿水來給他。","en":"Break time began. My brother did not bring his water bottle, so I brought him some water from the classroom next door before the bell rang.","words":[{"en":"before","zh":"在……之前"},{"en":"begin","zh":"開始"},{"en":"bell","zh":"鈴、鐘"},{"en":"bottle","zh":"瓶子"},{"en":"break","zh":"打破；休息"},{"en":"bring","zh":"帶來"},{"en":"brother","zh":"兄弟"}]},{"id":"L1-B11","level":1,"letter":"B","n":11,"zh":"那件黑色戲服太大了。姐姐幫我扣上鈕扣，再用腰帶把衣服繫緊。","en":"The black costume was too big. My sister helped me do up the buttons and then pulled it tight with a belt.","words":[{"en":"belt","zh":"皮帶、腰帶"},{"en":"big","zh":"大的"},{"en":"black","zh":"黑色的"},{"en":"button","zh":"鈕釦、按鈕"}]},{"id":"L1-B12","level":1,"letter":"B","n":12,"zh":"一輛腳踏車停在樹和牆之間，擋住了人行道。車主把車推走，讓一位盲人安全通過。","en":"A bicycle was parked between a tree and a wall, and it blocked the sidewalk. The owner moved the bike away so a blind man could pass by safely.","words":[{"en":"between","zh":"在……之間"},{"en":"bicycle/bike","zh":"腳踏車"},{"en":"blind","zh":"盲目的、瞎的"},{"en":"block","zh":"街區；積木；阻擋"}]},{"id":"L1-B13","level":1,"letter":"B","n":13,"zh":"小鳥的身體一直在發抖。我伸手想抱牠，牠咬了我的手指一下。","en":"The little bird's body kept shaking. I reached out to hold it, and it bit my finger.","words":[{"en":"bird","zh":"鳥"},{"en":"bite","zh":"咬、一口"},{"en":"body","zh":"身體"}]},{"id":"L1-B14","level":1,"letter":"B","n":14,"zh":"橋下有一艘藍色的小船。一個小女孩坐在船上。一陣風吹走了她的帽子。","en":"There was a small blue boat under the bridge. A little girl was sitting in the boat. The wind blew her hat away.","words":[{"en":"blow","zh":"吹、吹氣"},{"en":"blue","zh":"藍色的；憂鬱的"},{"en":"boat","zh":"船"},{"en":"bridge","zh":"橋"}]},{"id":"L1-B15","level":1,"letter":"B","n":15,"zh":"候車室裡的電視節目很無趣，我坐在那裡覺得很無聊。我向朋友借了一本書。我剛讀完第一頁，公車就來了。","en":"The TV show in the waiting room was boring, and I felt bored sitting there. I borrowed a book from my friend. I had just finished the first page when the bus came.","words":[{"en":"book","zh":"書、書籍"},{"en":"bored","zh":"感到無聊的"},{"en":"boring","zh":"無聊的、乏味的"},{"en":"borrow","zh":"借、借入"},{"en":"bus","zh":"公車"}]},{"id":"L1-B16","level":1,"letter":"B","n":16,"zh":"我們兩個都在台南出生。媽媽從箱子底部拿出兩個小瓶子。一個瓶子上有我的名字和生日，另一個上面有你的。","en":"Both of us were born in Tainan. Mom took two small bottles from the bottom of the box. One bottle has my name and birthday on it, and the other has yours.","words":[{"en":"bear","zh":"熊；忍受"},{"en":"born","zh":"出生"},{"en":"both","zh":"兩者"},{"en":"bottle","zh":"瓶子"},{"en":"bottom","zh":"底部"},{"en":"box","zh":"盒子、箱子"}]},{"id":"L1-B17","level":1,"letter":"B","n":17,"zh":"爸爸早餐吃麵包，上面塗了奶油。但是媽媽喜歡直接吃剛烤好的麵包。","en":"Dad has bread with butter on it for breakfast. But Mom likes to eat freshly baked bread just as it is.","words":[{"en":"bread","zh":"麵包"},{"en":"breakfast","zh":"早餐"},{"en":"butter","zh":"奶油、黃油"}]},{"id":"L1-B18","level":1,"letter":"B","n":18,"zh":"市府在河上蓋了一座橋，橋上的燈很明亮。現在我們晚上也能搭公車過河。","en":"The city built a bridge over the river, and the lights on the bridge are very bright. Now we can cross the river by bus at night, too.","words":[{"en":"bridge","zh":"橋"},{"en":"bright","zh":"明亮的、聰明的"},{"en":"build","zh":"建立、建築"},{"en":"bus","zh":"公車"}]},{"id":"L1-B19","level":1,"letter":"B","n":19,"zh":"媽媽的花店生意很好。放學後我到店裡，她正忙。我留下來幫忙，一位客人向我買了三朵花。","en":"Business at Mom's flower shop is good. After school I went to the shop, and she was busy. I stayed to help, and a customer came to buy three flowers from me.","words":[{"en":"bus","zh":"公車"},{"en":"business","zh":"生意、商業"},{"en":"busy","zh":"忙碌的、熱鬧的"},{"en":"buy","zh":"買"}]},{"id":"L1-C01","level":1,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"我們做了一個巧克力蛋糕，幫奶奶慶祝生日。她打開卡片，認出了我的字。","en":"We made a chocolate cake to celebrate Grandma's birthday. She opened the card and knew it was my handwriting.","words":[{"en":"cake","zh":"蛋糕"},{"en":"car","zh":"汽車"},{"en":"card","zh":"卡片、紙牌"},{"en":"celebrate","zh":"慶祝、祝賀"},{"en":"chocolate","zh":"巧克力"}]},{"id":"L1-C02","level":1,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"我用手機打電話給爸爸，問他：「你有看到我的相機嗎？」他叫我先檢查桌上的黑色相機盒。相機果然在裡面。","en":"I called Dad on my cellphone and asked him, \\"Have you seen my camera?\\" He told me to check the black camera case on the table first. The camera was in it, just as he said.","words":[{"en":"call","zh":"打電話；叫"},{"en":"camera","zh":"照相機、攝影機"},{"en":"case","zh":"情況；案例；盒子"},{"en":"cellphone","zh":"手機"},{"en":"check","zh":"檢查、確認"}]},{"id":"L1-C03","level":1,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"爸爸把車停在營地外。我戴上棒球帽，對他說：「我可以自己把睡袋搬到帳篷裡。」","en":"Dad parked the car outside the camp. I put on my baseball cap and said to him, \\"I can carry my sleeping bag to the tent by myself.\\"","words":[{"en":"camp","zh":"露營、帳篷"},{"en":"cap","zh":"帽子；蓋子"},{"en":"car","zh":"汽車"},{"en":"carry","zh":"攜帶、運送"}]},{"id":"L1-C04","level":1,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"我幫鄰居照顧小貓。牠想跳起來接球，我把旁邊的水杯移走。鄰居提醒我：「小心，別踩到牠的尾巴。」","en":"I helped my neighbor take care of her cat. It wanted to jump up and catch the ball, so I moved the cup of water next to it. My neighbor told me, \\"Be careful. Don't step on its tail.\\"","words":[{"en":"care","zh":"照顧；在乎"},{"en":"careful","zh":"小心的、謹慎的"},{"en":"cat","zh":"貓"},{"en":"catch","zh":"捕捉、趕上"},{"en":"cup","zh":"杯子、茶杯"}]},{"id":"L1-C05","level":1,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"午餐有兩種選擇，雞肉三明治和起司三明治。我選了雞肉的，裡面還夾了胡蘿蔔。","en":"There were two choices for lunch, a chicken sandwich and a cheese sandwich. I chose the chicken one, and it had carrots in it, too.","words":[{"en":"carrot","zh":"胡蘿蔔"},{"en":"cheese","zh":"乳酪"},{"en":"chicken","zh":"小雞、雞肉"},{"en":"choice","zh":"選擇"},{"en":"choose","zh":"選擇"}]},{"id":"L1-C06","level":1,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"這枝筆很便宜，只要七十五美分。我付了一美元，店員把找給我的零錢放在我手上。","en":"This pen is cheap. It only costs seventy-five cents. I paid one dollar, and the clerk put my change in my hand.","words":[{"en":"cent","zh":"分（錢幣單位）"},{"en":"change","zh":"改變；零錢"},{"en":"cheap","zh":"便宜的"},{"en":"clerk","zh":"店員、職員"},{"en":"cost","zh":"花費；價錢"}]},{"id":"L1-C07","level":1,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"孩子們把椅子圍成一個圓圈，老師站在圓圈中央。音樂一停，每個人都有機會搶到座位。","en":"The children put their chairs in a circle, and the teacher stood in the center of the circle. When the music stops, every child has a chance to get a seat.","words":[{"en":"cent","zh":"分（錢幣單位）"},{"en":"center","zh":"中心、中心點"},{"en":"chair","zh":"椅子"},{"en":"chance","zh":"機會"},{"en":"child","zh":"孩子、兒童"},{"en":"circle","zh":"圓圈"}]},{"id":"L1-C08","level":1,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"我們爬上高塔，看見了市裡最高的教堂。教堂的大鐘剛好敲了十二下。我很確定現在是中午十二點。","en":"We climbed the tall tower and saw the tallest church in the city. The church clock had just struck twelve. I was certain that it was twelve noon.","words":[{"en":"certain","zh":"確定的、某一個的"},{"en":"church","zh":"教堂"},{"en":"city","zh":"城市、市"},{"en":"climb","zh":"攀登、上升"},{"en":"clock","zh":"時鐘、計時器"}]},{"id":"L1-C09","level":1,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"今天輪到我們班打掃走廊了。我掃乾淨角落，小安負責關上窗戶。","en":"Today it was our class's turn to clean the hallway. I swept the corners clean, and Xiao-An closed the windows.","words":[{"en":"class","zh":"班級；課"},{"en":"clean","zh":"乾淨的；打掃"},{"en":"close","zh":"關閉；靠近的"},{"en":"corner","zh":"角落、轉角"}]},{"id":"L1-C10","level":1,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"早上天氣晴朗，天空只有一朵雲。我帶了幾件衣服上山。下午我覺得冷，就穿上外套。","en":"The weather was clear in the morning, and there was only one cloud in the sky. I took some clothes up the mountain. In the afternoon I felt cold, so I put on my coat.","words":[{"en":"clear","zh":"清楚的、明確的"},{"en":"clothes","zh":"衣服"},{"en":"cloud","zh":"雲"},{"en":"coat","zh":"外套"},{"en":"cold","zh":"冷的；感冒"}]},{"id":"L1-C11","level":1,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"我加入了一個集郵社。我們喜歡收集各國的郵票。我指著一張郵票上的鳥，新朋友說：「這種鳥在台灣很常見。」我問他：「牠的羽毛是什麼顏色？」","en":"I joined a stamp club. We like to collect stamps from different countries. I pointed at the bird on one stamp, and my new friend said, \\"This kind of bird is common in Taiwan.\\" I asked him, \\"What color are its feathers?\\"","words":[{"en":"club","zh":"社團、俱樂部"},{"en":"collect","zh":"收集、聚集"},{"en":"color","zh":"顏色"},{"en":"common","zh":"常見的、共同的"},{"en":"country","zh":"國家、鄉村"}]},{"id":"L1-C12","level":1,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"表妹來我家玩，我讓她坐在客廳舒適的沙發上。她喝牛奶，我喝咖啡。","en":"My cousin came to my house, and I let her sit on the comfortable couch in the living room. She drank milk, and I drank coffee.","words":[{"en":"coffee","zh":"咖啡"},{"en":"come","zh":"來"},{"en":"comfortable","zh":"舒服的"},{"en":"couch","zh":"沙發"},{"en":"cousin","zh":"堂兄弟姊妹、表兄弟姊妹"}]},{"id":"L1-C13","level":1,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"用圖書館的電腦改作業很方便。我先存一份副本，再把拼錯的字改正。","en":"It is convenient to correct my homework on the library computer. I save a copy first and then correct the words I spelled wrong.","words":[{"en":"computer","zh":"電腦"},{"en":"convenient","zh":"方便的"},{"en":"copy","zh":"複製；副本"},{"en":"correct","zh":"正確的"}]},{"id":"L1-C14","level":1,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"廚師把剛烤好的餅乾放在架上，讓它們冷卻。我數了數，一共有十二片。","en":"The cook put the freshly baked cookies on the rack to let them cool. I counted them. There were twelve in all.","words":[{"en":"cook","zh":"烹調、煮飯"},{"en":"cookie","zh":"餅乾"},{"en":"cool","zh":"涼爽的；很酷的"},{"en":"count","zh":"數、計算"}]},{"id":"L1-C15","level":1,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"我報名了一門認識亞洲的課程。老師給了我們一張很清楚的地圖，我一下就找到了三個國家。","en":"I signed up for a course about Asia. The teacher gave us a very clear map, and I found three countries right away.","words":[{"en":"clear","zh":"清楚的、明確的"},{"en":"country","zh":"國家、鄉村"},{"en":"course","zh":"課程、路線"}]},{"id":"L1-C16","level":1,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"小安對兔子很著迷。她剪下一張可愛的兔子照片，貼在筆記本的封面上。","en":"Xiao-An is crazy about rabbits. She cut out a cute picture of a rabbit and stuck it on the cover of her notebook.","words":[{"en":"cover","zh":"蓋住、覆蓋"},{"en":"crazy","zh":"瘋狂的"},{"en":"cut","zh":"切、割"},{"en":"cute","zh":"可愛的"}]},{"id":"L1-C17","level":1,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"一頭母牛穿過小路，撞倒了弟弟的杯子。牛奶灑了一地，弟弟哭了。","en":"A cow crossed the path and knocked over my brother's cup. The milk went all over the ground, and my brother cried.","words":[{"en":"cow","zh":"母牛、牛"},{"en":"cross","zh":"穿越；十字"},{"en":"cry","zh":"哭"},{"en":"cup","zh":"杯子、茶杯"}]},{"id":"L1-D01","level":1,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"女兒穿上新洋裝，把卡片交給我。上面寫著：「親愛的爸爸，請記住這個日期。那天來學校跟我跳舞吧！」","en":"My daughter put on her new dress and gave me a card. It said, \\"Dear Dad, please remember this date. Come to school and dance with me that day!\\"","words":[{"en":"dance","zh":"跳舞、舞蹈"},{"en":"date","zh":"日期、約會"},{"en":"daughter","zh":"女兒"},{"en":"day","zh":"天、日子"},{"en":"dear","zh":"親愛的"},{"en":"dress","zh":"洋裝；穿衣服"}]},{"id":"L1-D02","level":1,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"水很深，天也黑了。天黑後游過去很危險，我們決定隔天再來。","en":"The water was deep, and it was getting dark. It is dangerous to swim across after dark, so we decided to come back the next day.","words":[{"en":"dangerous","zh":"危險的"},{"en":"dark","zh":"黑暗的、暗的"},{"en":"day","zh":"天、日子"},{"en":"decide","zh":"決定"},{"en":"deep","zh":"深的"}]},{"id":"L1-D03","level":1,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"鄰居的狗昨晚死了。我第一次看見死去的動物，心裡很難受。媽媽陪著我。她以前也得面對寵物離世這件事。","en":"Our neighbor's dog died last night. It was the first time I saw a dead animal, and I felt very sad. Mom stayed with me. She also had to deal with the death of a pet before.","words":[{"en":"dead","zh":"死的"},{"en":"deal","zh":"交易；處理"},{"en":"death","zh":"死亡"},{"en":"die","zh":"死"},{"en":"dog","zh":"狗"}]},{"id":"L1-D04","level":1,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"老師要我們替一個難懂的字下定義。我的書桌上有兩本字典，兩本對這個字的解釋卻不同。","en":"The teacher asked us to define a difficult word. There are two dictionaries on my desk, but they explain this word in different ways.","words":[{"en":"define","zh":"定義、規定"},{"en":"desk","zh":"書桌、辦公桌"},{"en":"dictionary","zh":"字典、詞典"},{"en":"different","zh":"不同的"},{"en":"difficult","zh":"困難的"}]},{"id":"L1-D05","level":1,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"夏天到了，鴨子的小池塘乾了。我們幫牠們挖了一個新池子，大家的鞋都髒了。","en":"Summer came, and the ducks' small pond went dry. We dug a new pond for them, and everyone's shoes got dirty.","words":[{"en":"dig","zh":"挖"},{"en":"dirty","zh":"髒的"},{"en":"dry","zh":"乾的；弄乾"},{"en":"duck","zh":"鴨子"}]},{"id":"L1-D06","level":1,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"吃完晚餐，妹妹說：「今天我來洗盤子。」我倒了兩杯水，我們一人喝了一杯。","en":"After dinner, my sister said, \\"I will do the dishes today.\\" I poured two glasses of water, and we each drank one.","words":[{"en":"dinner","zh":"晚餐"},{"en":"dish","zh":"盤子；一道菜"},{"en":"drink","zh":"喝；飲料"}]},{"id":"L1-D07","level":1,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"妹妹昨晚做了一個夢。夢裡她是醫生，生病的洋娃娃都來找她。","en":"My sister had a dream last night. In her dream she was a doctor, and all the sick dolls came to see her.","words":[{"en":"doctor/doc","zh":"醫師；博士"},{"en":"doll","zh":"洋娃娃"},{"en":"dream","zh":"夢、夢想"}]},{"id":"L1-D08","level":1,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"一打鉛筆賣兩美元，我買了一盒。我想在假期中每天畫一張圖。","en":"A dozen pencils cost two dollars, so I bought a box. I want to draw one picture every day during the vacation.","words":[{"en":"day","zh":"天、日子"},{"en":"dollar","zh":"元、美元"},{"en":"dozen","zh":"一打（十二個）"},{"en":"draw","zh":"畫；拉"},{"en":"during","zh":"在……的時候"}]},{"id":"L1-D09","level":1,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"公車司機把車開下山坡，在學校前停車。他打開車門，讓學生上車。","en":"The bus driver drove down the hill and stopped in front of the school. He opened the door and let the students get on.","words":[{"en":"door","zh":"門"},{"en":"down","zh":"下、下去"},{"en":"drive","zh":"開車"},{"en":"driver","zh":"司機、駕駛"}]},{"id":"L1-D10","level":1,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"樂團練習期間，屋頂開始漏水。一滴水落在我的鼓上，我趕快把鼓搬開。","en":"During band practice, the roof started to leak. A drop of water fell on my drum, so I quickly moved the drum away.","words":[{"en":"drop","zh":"掉下；一滴"},{"en":"drum","zh":"鼓、鼓聲"},{"en":"during","zh":"在……的時候"}]},{"id":"L1-E01","level":1,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"照片裡有三隻大象，每隻的耳朵都很大。最小的那隻閉著眼睛，靠在媽媽身旁。","en":"There are three elephants in the photo, and each one has big ears. The smallest one has its eyes closed and is leaning against its mother.","words":[{"en":"each","zh":"每個"},{"en":"ear","zh":"耳朵"},{"en":"elephant","zh":"象"},{"en":"eye","zh":"眼睛"}]},{"id":"L1-E02","level":1,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"老師給我們看地球模型，模型上的地球會轉動。隔天我很早就起床，看太陽從東方升起。到了傍晚，我又畫了一張天空的圖。","en":"The teacher showed us a model of the earth, and the earth on the model can turn. The next day I got up early and watched the sun rise in the east. In the evening, I drew a picture of the sky again.","words":[{"en":"ear","zh":"耳朵"},{"en":"early","zh":"早的、提早"},{"en":"earth","zh":"地球、泥土"},{"en":"east","zh":"東方、東"},{"en":"even","zh":"甚至"},{"en":"evening","zh":"傍晚、晚間"}]},{"id":"L1-E03","level":1,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"桌上有一顆蛋和一片吐司，你可以選其中一樣吃。我選了蛋。水煮蛋很容易做，明天我也想自己煮。","en":"There is an egg and a piece of toast on the table. You can eat either one. I chose the egg. Boiled eggs are easy to make, and I want to cook one myself tomorrow.","words":[{"en":"easy","zh":"容易的"},{"en":"eat","zh":"吃"},{"en":"egg","zh":"蛋"},{"en":"either","zh":"（兩者中）任一；也（不）"}]},{"id":"L1-E04","level":1,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"老師給我們看一座新橋的模型。我們寫了一封電子郵件給橋梁工程師。我在信的結尾問她：「除了橋，妳還設計別的東西嗎？」","en":"The teacher showed us a model of a new bridge. We wrote an email to the bridge engineer. At the end of the email I asked her, \\"What else do you design besides bridges?\\"","words":[{"en":"else","zh":"另外、否則"},{"en":"email","zh":"電子郵件"},{"en":"end","zh":"結束、終點"},{"en":"engineer","zh":"工程師"}]},{"id":"L1-E05","level":1,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"我很享受現場音樂，可是今晚的票太貴了。我帶的錢不夠買票，只能站在門口看別人進場。","en":"I enjoy live music, but tonight's tickets were too expensive. I did not have enough money for a ticket, so I could only stand at the door and watch other people enter.","words":[{"en":"enjoy(ment)","zh":"享受、喜歡"},{"en":"enough","zh":"足夠"},{"en":"enter","zh":"進入"},{"en":"expensive","zh":"貴的"}]},{"id":"L1-E06","level":1,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"我在信封上用鉛筆寫地址，寫完才發現有一個錯誤。我拿橡皮擦把門牌號碼擦掉，重新寫了一次。","en":"I wrote the address on the envelope in pencil, and then I found an error. I used an eraser to rub out the house number and wrote it again.","words":[{"en":"envelope","zh":"信封"},{"en":"eraser","zh":"橡皮擦"},{"en":"error","zh":"錯誤"}]},{"id":"L1-E07","level":1,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"老師要我向全班解釋偶數。我在黑板上寫了兩個例子，再請同學做習題。我說：「每一道題都要圈出偶數。」","en":"The teacher asked me to explain even numbers to the class. I wrote two examples on the blackboard and then asked my classmates to do an exercise. I said, \\"Circle the even numbers in every question.\\"","words":[{"en":"even","zh":"甚至"},{"en":"ever","zh":"曾經"},{"en":"every","zh":"每一、所有的"},{"en":"example","zh":"例子"},{"en":"exercise","zh":"運動、練習"},{"en":"explain","zh":"解釋、說明"}]},{"id":"L1-E08","level":1,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"你曾經在海邊過夜嗎？我們上週在海邊露營，天氣非常好。那是一次很棒的經驗。","en":"Have you ever spent a night by the sea? We camped by the sea last week, and the weather was excellent. It was a great experience.","words":[{"en":"ever","zh":"曾經"},{"en":"excellent","zh":"優良的、傑出的"},{"en":"experience","zh":"經歷、經驗"}]},{"id":"L1-E09","level":1,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"大家都期待一場精彩刺激的比賽。除了守門員以外，每個人都很興奮。他是新隊員，場上的一切對他來說都很陌生。","en":"Everyone expected an exciting game. Everybody was excited except the goalkeeper. He was a new player, and everything on the field was new to him.","words":[{"en":"everyone/everybody","zh":"每個人、人人"},{"en":"everything","zh":"每件事物、所有事物"},{"en":"except","zh":"除了……之外"},{"en":"excited","zh":"興奮的"},{"en":"exciting","zh":"令人興奮的、刺激的"},{"en":"expect","zh":"預期、盼望"}]},{"id":"L1-F01","level":1,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"妹妹用手指畫了一隻貓，還把藍色顏料抹到臉上。我問她：「妳感覺如何？」她笑著說：「我很好。」","en":"My sister painted a cat with her fingers and got blue paint on her face. I asked her, \\"How do you feel?\\" She laughed and said, \\"I am fine.\\"","words":[{"en":"face","zh":"臉"},{"en":"feel","zh":"感覺、覺得"},{"en":"fine","zh":"很好的；（天氣）晴朗的"},{"en":"finger","zh":"手指"}]},{"id":"L1-F02","level":1,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"我在外公的電腦裡找到一個舊檔案，裡面有一張照片和一段學校的介紹。我讀到一件有趣的事：我們學校以前是一座工廠。","en":"I found an old file on my grandfather's computer. It had a photo and a short introduction to the school. I read an interesting fact: our school used to be a factory.","words":[{"en":"fact","zh":"事實"},{"en":"factory","zh":"工廠"},{"en":"file","zh":"檔案"},{"en":"find","zh":"找到、發現"}]},{"id":"L1-F03","level":1,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"我先摺好機翼，再畫上星星，就完成了我的紙飛機。第一次試飛失敗了。我把機翼攤平，再試一次。這次它終於飛起來了。","en":"First I folded the wings, and then I drew stars on them. My paper plane was finished. The first flight failed. I made the wings flat and tried again. This time it finally flew.","words":[{"en":"fail","zh":"失敗、不及格"},{"en":"finally","zh":"最後、終於"},{"en":"finish","zh":"完成、結束"},{"en":"first","zh":"第一"},{"en":"fly","zh":"飛、飛翔"}]},{"id":"L1-F04","level":1,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"秋天來了，我家前面的花還開著。今天我去澆花，在花下看見一隻青蛙。","en":"Fall has come, and the flowers in front of my house are still open. Today I went to water the flowers and saw a frog under them.","words":[{"en":"fall","zh":"落下；秋天"},{"en":"flower","zh":"花"},{"en":"frog","zh":"青蛙"},{"en":"front","zh":"前面、開頭"}]},{"id":"L1-F05","level":1,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"我父親是農夫，我們全家住在農場。農場離學校很遠，週末同學才有空來玩。","en":"My father is a farmer, and my family lives on a farm. The farm is far from school, so my classmates are only free to visit on weekends.","words":[{"en":"family","zh":"家庭、家人"},{"en":"far","zh":"遠的、遠地"},{"en":"farm","zh":"農場、農田"},{"en":"farmer","zh":"農夫"},{"en":"father","zh":"父親"},{"en":"free","zh":"免費的、自由的、有空的"}]},{"id":"L1-F06","level":1,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"我和哥哥都是那位知名歌手的歌迷。在音樂節，我們跟著他一起唱歌，玩得很開心。","en":"My brother and I are both fans of that famous singer. At the music festival, we sang along with him and had a lot of fun.","words":[{"en":"famous","zh":"有名的"},{"en":"fan","zh":"風扇；迷"},{"en":"festival","zh":"節日、慶祝"},{"en":"fun","zh":"樂趣、玩笑"}]},{"id":"L1-F07","level":1,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"我要去餵魚，弟弟幫我拿食物。池裡那條胖胖的魚游得最快，第一個吃到飼料。","en":"I was going to feed the fish, and my brother carried the food for me. The fat fish in the pond swam the fastest and got the food first.","words":[{"en":"fast","zh":"快的、快地"},{"en":"fat","zh":"胖的；脂肪"},{"en":"feed","zh":"餵"},{"en":"first","zh":"第一"},{"en":"fish","zh":"魚、魚肉"},{"en":"food","zh":"食物"}]},{"id":"L1-F08","level":1,"letter":"F","n":8,"zh":"幾隻小狗為了搶地板上的球打了起來。球滾進房間，牠們又跟著球跑了進去。","en":"A few puppies had a fight over a ball on the floor. The ball rolled into the room, and they followed it in.","words":[{"en":"few","zh":"很少的、幾個"},{"en":"fight","zh":"對抗、打架"},{"en":"floor","zh":"地板、樓層"},{"en":"follow","zh":"跟隨；遵守"}]},{"id":"L1-F09","level":1,"letter":"F","n":9,"zh":"爸爸在院子裡生了火，準備煮玉米。他要我把鍋子裝滿水。我端著滿滿的一鍋水，小心走到他身旁。","en":"Dad made a fire in the yard to cook corn. He asked me to fill the pot with water. I carried the full pot of water carefully to him.","words":[{"en":"fill","zh":"裝滿、填充"},{"en":"fire","zh":"火、火災"},{"en":"full","zh":"充滿的、完全的"}]},{"id":"L1-F10","level":1,"letter":"F","n":10,"zh":"弟弟想捉弄我，把一雙滑稽的大拖鞋放在我的床邊。我才把腳伸進一隻拖鞋，鞋頭的小鴨就叫了起來。","en":"My brother wanted to fool me, so he put a pair of big funny slippers beside my bed. As soon as I put my foot into one slipper, the little duck on the front made a sound.","words":[{"en":"fool","zh":"傻瓜"},{"en":"foot","zh":"腳"},{"en":"front","zh":"前面、開頭"},{"en":"fun","zh":"樂趣、玩笑"},{"en":"funny","zh":"好笑的、有趣的"}]},{"id":"L1-F11","level":1,"letter":"F","n":11,"zh":"一位外國人在街角看地圖。他指著手機上的外國文字，我只看懂了「車站」這個詞。我替他畫了一張地圖。他很友善，還教我用他的語言說謝謝。","en":"A foreigner was looking at a map on the street corner. He pointed at the foreign words on his phone, and I only understood the word \\"station.\\" I drew a map for him. He was friendly and taught me how to say thank you in his language.","words":[{"en":"foreign","zh":"外國的"},{"en":"foreigner","zh":"外國人、外地人"},{"en":"friend","zh":"朋友"},{"en":"friendly","zh":"友好的、親切的"}]},{"id":"L1-F12","level":1,"letter":"F","n":12,"zh":"攤主請我們免費試吃新鮮水果。我忘了拿叉子，只好回去向他要一支。","en":"The owner of the stand let us try some fresh fruit for free. I forgot to take a fork, so I had to go back and ask him for one.","words":[{"en":"forget","zh":"忘記"},{"en":"fork","zh":"叉子"},{"en":"free","zh":"免費的、自由的、有空的"},{"en":"fresh","zh":"新鮮的"},{"en":"fruit","zh":"水果"}]},{"id":"L1-F13","level":1,"letter":"F","n":13,"zh":"我的朋友從花蓮寄來一封信。他在信裡寫下對未來的計畫：「我長大後想開一間書店。」","en":"My friend sent me a letter from Hualien. In the letter he wrote about his plan for the future: \\"When I grow up, I want to open a bookstore.\\"","words":[{"en":"friend","zh":"朋友"},{"en":"future","zh":"未來、將來"}]},{"id":"L1-G01","level":1,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"我們玩猜影子的遊戲。牆上出現一個巨大的影子。妹妹猜了一下：「是鬼嗎？」我們打開燈，看到了一隻玩具熊。","en":"We played a game of guessing shadows. A giant shadow appeared on the wall. My sister made a guess: \\"Is it a ghost?\\" We turned on the light and saw a toy bear.","words":[{"en":"game","zh":"遊戲、比賽"},{"en":"ghost","zh":"鬼"},{"en":"giant","zh":"巨大的；巨人"},{"en":"guess","zh":"猜"}]},{"id":"L1-G02","level":1,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"爺爺打開花園的柵門，把手套交給我。我們鬆了鬆土，準備在那裡種豆子。","en":"Grandpa opened the garden gate and gave me the gloves. We loosened the ground and got ready to grow beans there.","words":[{"en":"garden","zh":"花園"},{"en":"gate","zh":"大門、登機門"},{"en":"get","zh":"得到、取得"},{"en":"give","zh":"給"},{"en":"glove(s)","zh":"手套"},{"en":"ground","zh":"地面"},{"en":"grow","zh":"成長、種植"}]},{"id":"L1-G03","level":1,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"我旁邊的女孩給了我一個小紙盒。我打開盒子，看到了一把口琴。我一直很想要一把，收到這份禮物好高興。","en":"The girl next to me gave me a small paper box. I opened the box and saw a harmonica. I had always wanted one, so I was very glad to get this gift.","words":[{"en":"get","zh":"得到、取得"},{"en":"gift","zh":"禮物"},{"en":"girl","zh":"女孩"},{"en":"give","zh":"給"},{"en":"glad","zh":"高興的"}]},{"id":"L1-G04","level":1,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"爸爸放下玻璃杯，彎腰看桌子下面。他的眼鏡掉在地上了。","en":"Dad put down his glass and bent down to look under the table. His glasses had fallen on the ground.","words":[{"en":"glass","zh":"玻璃、玻璃杯"},{"en":"glasses","zh":"眼鏡"},{"en":"ground","zh":"地面"}]},{"id":"L1-G05","level":1,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"放學後我們跟老師道了別，一起去看希臘神話展。弟弟說：「好主意！我想看智慧女神的雕像。」","en":"After school we said goodbye to our teacher and went to see a show about Greek myths together. My brother said, \\"Good idea! I want to see the statue of the goddess of wisdom.\\"","words":[{"en":"go","zh":"去、前往"},{"en":"god/goddess","zh":"神、女神"},{"en":"good","zh":"好的"},{"en":"goodbye","zh":"再見"}]},{"id":"L1-G06","level":1,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"七年級那年，祖父開始教我彈吉他。祖母最愛坐在旁邊，跟著我們唱歌。","en":"When I was in seventh grade, my grandfather started to teach me to play the guitar. My grandmother loved to sit beside us and sing along.","words":[{"en":"glove(s)","zh":"手套"},{"en":"grade","zh":"年級；成績"},{"en":"grandfather","zh":"祖父、外公"},{"en":"grandmother","zh":"祖母、外婆"},{"en":"guitar","zh":"吉他"}]},{"id":"L1-G07","level":1,"letter":"G","n":7,"zh":"灰色的兔子蹲在綠色的草上。我把牠畫進筆記本，妹妹看了說：「這是一張很棒的畫！」","en":"The gray rabbit sat on the green grass. I drew it in my notebook, and my sister looked at it and said, \\"This is a great picture!\\"","words":[{"en":"grass","zh":"草"},{"en":"gray","zh":"灰色的"},{"en":"great","zh":"很棒的、偉大的"},{"en":"green","zh":"綠色的"}]},{"id":"L1-G08","level":1,"letter":"G","n":8,"zh":"河邊有一群人在唱歌。戴紅帽子的那個男生彈著吉他，大家跟著拍手。","en":"A group of people were singing by the river. The guy in the red hat was playing the guitar, and everyone clapped along.","words":[{"en":"group","zh":"團體、組"},{"en":"guitar","zh":"吉他"},{"en":"guy","zh":"傢伙、男人"}]},{"id":"L1-H01","level":1,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"哥哥有個習慣。他回家第一件事就是把帽子掛在門邊，接著才梳頭髮。","en":"My brother has a habit. The first thing he does when he gets home is hang his hat by the door, and then he combs his hair.","words":[{"en":"habit","zh":"習慣"},{"en":"hair","zh":"頭髮、毛髮"},{"en":"hang","zh":"懸掛、附著"},{"en":"hat","zh":"帽子"},{"en":"home","zh":"家"}]},{"id":"L1-H02","level":1,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"我把火腿三明治加熱，再切成兩半。我把其中一半遞給妹妹。","en":"I heated the ham sandwich and then cut it in half. I handed one half to my sister.","words":[{"en":"half","zh":"一半、半場"},{"en":"ham","zh":"火腿"},{"en":"hand","zh":"手"},{"en":"heat","zh":"熱、熱度"}]},{"id":"L1-H03","level":1,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"我聽見樓下傳來一陣笑聲，就跑下樓問：「發生什麼事了？」妹妹以前很討厭下雨。今天她穿上新雨鞋，開心地踩著水。我問她：「妳開心嗎？」她笑著點頭。","en":"I heard laughing from downstairs, so I ran down and asked, \\"What happened?\\" My sister used to hate rain. Today she put on her new rain boots and jumped happily in the water. I asked her, \\"Are you happy?\\" She smiled and nodded.","words":[{"en":"happen","zh":"發生"},{"en":"happy","zh":"快樂的、幸福的"},{"en":"hate","zh":"憎恨、憎惡"},{"en":"hear","zh":"聽到、傾聽"}]},{"id":"L1-H04","level":1,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"哥哥摸了摸自己的頭，說：「我頭痛。」他還有一道很難的數學題要做，今天只好先休息。","en":"My brother touched his head and said, \\"I have a headache.\\" He still had a hard math problem to do, but he had to rest today.","words":[{"en":"hard","zh":"困難的；硬的；努力地"},{"en":"head","zh":"頭、頭腦"},{"en":"headache","zh":"頭痛"}]},{"id":"L1-H05","level":1,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"健康課上，老師讓我們用聽診器聽心臟跳動。她問全班：「你們平常怎麼保持健康？」","en":"In health class, the teacher let us listen to the heart beating with a stethoscope. She asked the class, \\"How do you usually keep healthy?\\"","words":[{"en":"health","zh":"健康、衛生"},{"en":"healthy","zh":"健康的"},{"en":"heart","zh":"心、心臟"}]},{"id":"L1-H06","level":1,"letter":"H","n":6,"zh":"海報架很重，同學幫我把它搬進教室。我們量了架子的高度，掛上海報。老師說：「海報掛得太高了，請掛低一點。」","en":"The poster stand was heavy, so my classmate helped me carry it into the classroom. We measured the height of the stand and hung up the poster. The teacher said, \\"The poster is too high. Please hang it lower.\\"","words":[{"en":"hang","zh":"懸掛、附著"},{"en":"heavy","zh":"重的、巨大的"},{"en":"height","zh":"高度、海拔"},{"en":"help","zh":"幫助、幫忙"},{"en":"high","zh":"高的、高階的"}]},{"id":"L1-H07","level":1,"letter":"H","n":7,"zh":"歷史博物館的志工笑著跟我親切地打了聲招呼。我問他：「這裡有地圖嗎？」他給了我一張很有用的地圖。","en":"The volunteer at the history museum smiled and said a friendly hello to me. I asked him, \\"Do you have a map here?\\" He gave me a very helpful map.","words":[{"en":"hello","zh":"哈囉、你好"},{"en":"help","zh":"幫助、幫忙"},{"en":"helpful","zh":"有幫助的、有益的"},{"en":"here","zh":"在這裡、此時"},{"en":"history","zh":"歷史、過去"}]},{"id":"L1-H08","level":1,"letter":"H","n":8,"zh":"舅舅的雞舍在小山丘上。有一隻母雞喜歡躲在門後，我每次都得蹲下來找牠。","en":"My uncle's hen house is on a small hill. One hen likes to hide behind the door, so I have to bend down to find it every time.","words":[{"en":"hen","zh":"母雞"},{"en":"hide","zh":"躲藏、隱藏"},{"en":"hill","zh":"小山"},{"en":"house","zh":"房子"}]},{"id":"L1-H09","level":1,"letter":"H","n":9,"zh":"打棒球是我的嗜好。假日我在家附近的公園練習。爸爸拿著球棒，把球打得很遠。","en":"Playing baseball is my hobby. On holidays I practice in the park near my home. Dad holds the bat and hits the ball very far.","words":[{"en":"hit","zh":"打、擊中"},{"en":"hobby","zh":"嗜好"},{"en":"hold","zh":"握住、拿著；舉行"},{"en":"holiday","zh":"假日、假期"},{"en":"home","zh":"家"}]},{"id":"L1-H10","level":1,"letter":"H","n":10,"zh":"我的家庭作業寫完了，可是我把它忘在家了。我想對老師說實話。我希望她能再給我一天。","en":"I finished my homework. However, I left it at home. I want to be honest with my teacher. I hope she can give me one more day.","words":[{"en":"home","zh":"家"},{"en":"homework","zh":"家庭作業"},{"en":"honest","zh":"誠實的"},{"en":"hope","zh":"希望、期望"},{"en":"however","zh":"然而、無論如何"}]},{"id":"L1-H11","level":1,"letter":"H","n":11,"zh":"我從馬背上摔下來，弄傷了手臂。爸爸帶我去醫院，我們在那裡等了一個小時。","en":"I fell off a horse and hurt my arm. Dad took me to the hospital, and we waited there for an hour.","words":[{"en":"horse","zh":"馬"},{"en":"hospital","zh":"醫院"},{"en":"hour","zh":"小時"},{"en":"hurt","zh":"傷害、(使)傷心"}]},{"id":"L1-H12","level":1,"letter":"H","n":12,"zh":"我起床時肚子很餓。旅館的早餐有熱茶和吐司，我在吐司上塗了蜂蜜。","en":"I was very hungry when I got up. The hotel breakfast had hot tea and toast, and I put honey on my toast.","words":[{"en":"honey","zh":"蜂蜜；親愛的"},{"en":"hot","zh":"熱的；辣的"},{"en":"hotel","zh":"旅館、飯店"},{"en":"hungry","zh":"餓的"}]},{"id":"L1-H13","level":1,"letter":"H","n":13,"zh":"阿姨是家庭主婦，她和丈夫住在一棟老房子裡。我問她：「這棟房子有幾年了？」她說：「一百年了。」","en":"My aunt is a housewife, and she lives with her husband in an old house. I asked her, \\"How old is this house?\\" She said, \\"It is one hundred years old.\\"","words":[{"en":"house","zh":"房子"},{"en":"housewife","zh":"家庭主婦"},{"en":"hundred","zh":"百、百個東西"},{"en":"husband","zh":"丈夫"}]},{"id":"L1-I01","level":1,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"我有個主意。如果你把冰塊放在我的水壺裡，我就能帶冰水去野餐了。","en":"I have an idea. If you put ice in my water bottle, I can take ice water to the picnic.","words":[{"en":"ice","zh":"冰"},{"en":"idea","zh":"主意、辦法"}]},{"id":"L1-I02","level":1,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"我打開桌上的紙盒，裡面有一隻昆蟲。牠只有一英吋長，腳卻很長。","en":"I opened the paper box on the table, and there was an insect inside. It was only one inch long, but its legs were very long.","words":[{"en":"inch","zh":"英寸"},{"en":"insect","zh":"昆蟲"},{"en":"inside","zh":"在……之內"}]},{"id":"L1-I03","level":1,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"我對攝影很感興趣。為了校刊，我採訪了一位攝影師。我問他：「你是從什麼時候開始對攝影有興趣的？」他的回答很有趣。","en":"I am interested in photography. For the school magazine, I interviewed a photographer. I asked him, \\"When did you first take an interest in photography?\\" His answer was very interesting.","words":[{"en":"interest","zh":"興趣；利息"},{"en":"interested","zh":"感興趣的"},{"en":"interesting","zh":"有趣的"},{"en":"interview","zh":"面談、訪問"}]},{"id":"L1-I04","level":1,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"老師邀請我們去一座小島淨灘。行前清單上最重要的項目是手套，我先把手套塞進背包裡。","en":"Our teacher invited us to clean a beach on a small island. The most important item on the list was gloves, so I put my gloves into my backpack first.","words":[{"en":"important","zh":"重要的"},{"en":"invite","zh":"邀請"},{"en":"island","zh":"島"},{"en":"item","zh":"項目、物品"}]},{"id":"L1-J01","level":1,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"哥哥剛才換上夾克和牛仔褲。今天是他到書店做新工作的第一天。","en":"My brother just changed into a jacket and jeans. Today is the first day of his new job at the bookstore.","words":[{"en":"jacket","zh":"夾克、外套"},{"en":"jeans","zh":"牛仔褲"},{"en":"job","zh":"工作"},{"en":"just","zh":"剛剛、正好"}]},{"id":"L1-J02","level":1,"letter":"J","n":2,"zh":"我加入球隊那天，隊友倒了果汁給我，還說了個笑話。教練說：「換你上場了！」我高興得跳了起來。","en":"On the day I joined the team, my teammates poured me some juice and told a joke. The coach said, \\"It is your turn to play!\\" I jumped for joy.","words":[{"en":"join","zh":"參加、加入"},{"en":"joke","zh":"笑話、玩笑"},{"en":"joy","zh":"喜悅"},{"en":"juice","zh":"果汁"},{"en":"jump","zh":"跳"}]},{"id":"L1-K01","level":1,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"媽媽把備用鑰匙收在廚房。今天我忘了帶自己的鑰匙，只好敲門。她放下手上的刀子來幫我開門。","en":"Mom keeps the spare key in the kitchen. Today I forgot to bring my own key, so I had to knock on the door. She put down the knife in her hand and came to open the door for me.","words":[{"en":"keep","zh":"保持、保留"},{"en":"key","zh":"鑰匙；關鍵"},{"en":"kitchen","zh":"廚房"},{"en":"knife","zh":"刀子"},{"en":"knock","zh":"敲"}]},{"id":"L1-K02","level":1,"letter":"K","n":2,"zh":"一個小孩在公園放風箏，另一個小孩在踢球。球碰到了我的膝蓋，我就把球踢回去。","en":"One kid was flying a kite in the park, and another kid was kicking a ball. The ball hit my knee, so I kicked it back.","words":[{"en":"kick","zh":"踢"},{"en":"kid","zh":"小孩；開玩笑"},{"en":"kite","zh":"風箏"},{"en":"knee","zh":"膝蓋"}]},{"id":"L1-K03","level":1,"letter":"K","n":3,"zh":"國王很仁慈。他不讓獵人殺那隻鳥。他輕輕親了牠一下，就放牠走了。","en":"The king was very kind. He did not let the hunter kill the bird. He gave it a gentle kiss and let it go.","words":[{"en":"kill","zh":"殺死"},{"en":"kind","zh":"親切的、仁慈的"},{"en":"king","zh":"國王"},{"en":"kiss","zh":"吻"}]},{"id":"L1-K04","level":1,"letter":"K","n":4,"zh":"來測測你的露營知識吧！你知道怎麼安全使用小刀嗎？","en":"Let's test your knowledge of camping! Do you know how to use a knife safely?","words":[{"en":"knife","zh":"刀子"},{"en":"know","zh":"知道、認識"},{"en":"knowledge","zh":"知識"}]},{"id":"L1-L01","level":1,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"天黑了，我們的小船還在一個大湖上。爸爸打開船頭的燈。靠著燈光，我們看到了前方的陸地。","en":"It was dark, and our small boat was still on a large lake. Dad turned on the lamp at the front of the boat. By its light, we saw land ahead.","words":[{"en":"lake","zh":"湖"},{"en":"lamp","zh":"燈"},{"en":"land","zh":"陸地、土地；降落"},{"en":"large","zh":"大的"},{"en":"light","zh":"光、燈；輕的"}]},{"id":"L1-L02","level":1,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"我想學一門新語言。每堂課我都至少學會講一句新句子，回家就說給妹妹聽。","en":"I want to learn a new language. In every lesson I learn to say at least one new sentence, and I say it to my sister when I get home.","words":[{"en":"language","zh":"語言"},{"en":"learn","zh":"學習、得知"},{"en":"least","zh":"最小、最少"},{"en":"lesson","zh":"課、課業"},{"en":"little","zh":"小的、很少的"}]},{"id":"L1-L03","level":1,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"我們很晚才離開球場。十分鐘後，最後一班公車到了。幸好我們搭上了。","en":"We left the ballpark very late. Ten minutes later, the last bus came. We were lucky to catch it.","words":[{"en":"last","zh":"最後的；上一個；持續"},{"en":"late","zh":"遲的、晚的"},{"en":"later","zh":"以後、隨後"},{"en":"leave","zh":"離開、剩下"},{"en":"left","zh":"左邊的；離開（leave 的過去式）"},{"en":"lucky","zh":"幸運的"}]},{"id":"L1-L04","level":1,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"哥哥在戲裡演律師。我們聽他問：「你怎麼不起來？」那個人說：「我今天太懶了。」大家都笑了。","en":"My brother played a lawyer in the play. We listened to him ask, \\"Why don't you get up?\\" The man said, \\"I am too lazy today.\\" Everybody laughed.","words":[{"en":"laugh","zh":"笑、大笑"},{"en":"lawyer","zh":"律師"},{"en":"lazy","zh":"懶惰的、怠惰的"},{"en":"listen","zh":"聽、傾聽"}]},{"id":"L1-L05","level":1,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"隊長帶我們走左邊的小路。我走到一半腿很痠，他便停下來等我。","en":"The leader led us along the path on the left. Halfway there my legs were sore, so he stopped and waited for me.","words":[{"en":"lead","zh":"引導、帶領"},{"en":"leader","zh":"領導者、領袖"},{"en":"leave","zh":"離開、剩下"},{"en":"left","zh":"左邊的；離開（leave 的過去式）"},{"en":"leg","zh":"腿"}]},{"id":"L1-L06","level":1,"letter":"L","n":6,"zh":"姊姊讓我自己做檸檬水。我只擠了一點檸檬汁，糖也放得比上次少。","en":"My sister let me make the lemonade by myself. I only added a little lemon juice, and I put in less sugar than last time.","words":[{"en":"last","zh":"最後的；上一個；持續"},{"en":"lemon","zh":"檸檬"},{"en":"less","zh":"較少、較小"},{"en":"let","zh":"讓、假設"},{"en":"little","zh":"小的、很少的"}]},{"id":"L1-L07","level":1,"letter":"L","n":7,"zh":"奶奶給我看一封她年輕時的信。她在信裡寫道：「我現在住在鄉下，有時覺得寂寞。還好生活中有書陪我。我常去圖書館借書，再躺在樹下讀。」","en":"Grandma showed me a letter from when she was young. In the letter she wrote, \\"I live in the country now, and sometimes I feel lonely. Luckily, I have books in my life. I often borrow books from the library and lie under a tree to read them.\\"","words":[{"en":"let","zh":"讓、假設"},{"en":"letter","zh":"信；字母"},{"en":"library","zh":"圖書館"},{"en":"lie","zh":"躺；說謊"},{"en":"life","zh":"生活、生命"},{"en":"live","zh":"住、生活"},{"en":"lonely","zh":"孤單的、孤寂的"},{"en":"lucky","zh":"幸運的"}]},{"id":"L1-L08","level":1,"letter":"L","n":8,"zh":"我喜歡畫池塘。老師說：「仔細看看水面。用尺畫一條線，兩端要一樣高。」","en":"I like to paint ponds. The teacher said, \\"Look carefully at the water. Use a ruler to draw a line, and both ends must be on the same level.\\"","words":[{"en":"level","zh":"程度、水準"},{"en":"like","zh":"像；喜歡"},{"en":"line","zh":"線；排隊的隊伍"},{"en":"look","zh":"看；看起來"}]},{"id":"L1-L09","level":1,"letter":"L","n":9,"zh":"妹妹畫了一隻可愛的小獅子。牠的尾巴很長，嘴唇上還沾著牛奶。","en":"My sister drew a lovely little lion. It had a long tail, and there was milk on its lips.","words":[{"en":"lion","zh":"獅子"},{"en":"lip","zh":"嘴唇"},{"en":"little","zh":"小的、很少的"},{"en":"long","zh":"長的、長久的"},{"en":"love","zh":"愛"},{"en":"lovely","zh":"可愛的、美好的"}]},{"id":"L1-L10","level":1,"letter":"L","n":10,"zh":"爸爸很愛做菜。今天他要煮午餐給很多人吃，所以出門前先寫了一張購物清單。","en":"Dad loves to cook. Today he is going to cook lunch for a lot of people, so he wrote a shopping list before he left.","words":[{"en":"leave","zh":"離開、剩下"},{"en":"left","zh":"左邊的；離開（leave 的過去式）"},{"en":"list","zh":"清單、名單"},{"en":"lot","zh":"很多（a lot of）"},{"en":"love","zh":"愛"},{"en":"lunch","zh":"午餐"}]},{"id":"L1-L11","level":1,"letter":"L","n":11,"zh":"我在操場弄丟了錢包。我真幸運，有人在一道矮牆旁看到了它。我聽到身後傳來一個響亮的聲音：「你的錢包在這裡！」","en":"I lost my wallet on the playground. I was really lucky because someone saw it beside a low wall. I heard a loud voice behind me: \\"Your wallet is here!\\"","words":[{"en":"lose","zh":"遺失；輸"},{"en":"loud","zh":"大聲的"},{"en":"low","zh":"低的"},{"en":"lucky","zh":"幸運的"}]},{"id":"L1-M01","level":1,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"我們用學校的機器做了很多張明信片。放學後，我想把其中一張寄給外婆。","en":"We made many postcards with the school's machine. After school, I want to mail one of them to my grandmother.","words":[{"en":"machine","zh":"機器、機械裝置"},{"en":"mail","zh":"郵件；郵寄"},{"en":"make","zh":"做、製造"},{"en":"man","zh":"男人"},{"en":"many","zh":"許多的"}]},{"id":"L1-M02","level":1,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"你介意我明天還書嗎？我犯了個錯，把你的書拿回家了。兩本書的封面一模一樣。你別生氣。","en":"Do you mind if I return the book tomorrow? I made a mistake and took your book home. The covers of the two books are just the same. Please don't be mad.","words":[{"en":"mad","zh":"生氣的；瘋狂的"},{"en":"make","zh":"做、製造"},{"en":"mind","zh":"頭腦、心思；介意"},{"en":"mistake","zh":"錯誤、誤會"}]},{"id":"L1-M03","level":1,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"一個男人在街頭表演魔術。他張開嘴巴，一隻玩具猴子就從他的帽子裡跳了出來。","en":"A man was doing magic on the street. He opened his mouth, and a toy monkey jumped out of his hat.","words":[{"en":"magic","zh":"魔術、魔法"},{"en":"man","zh":"男人"},{"en":"monkey","zh":"猴子"},{"en":"mouth","zh":"嘴、口"}]},{"id":"L1-M04","level":1,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"請在地圖中央找到市場，然後在它的主要入口旁畫一顆星。這個記號是說：「明天在這裡集合。」","en":"Please find the market in the middle of the map, and then draw a star beside its main gate. This mark means, \\"Meet here tomorrow.\\"","words":[{"en":"main","zh":"主要的、重要的"},{"en":"map","zh":"地圖"},{"en":"mark","zh":"記號；分數"},{"en":"market","zh":"市場"},{"en":"mean","zh":"意思是"},{"en":"meet","zh":"見面、遇見"},{"en":"middle","zh":"中間的"}]},{"id":"L1-M05","level":1,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"林先生是我們的新鄰居。他已經結婚了。林太太就站在他身邊。我們的鄰居陳女士正在和他們聊天。","en":"Mr. Lin is our new neighbor. He is married. Mrs. Lin is standing beside him. Our neighbor Ms. Chen is talking with them.","words":[{"en":"married","zh":"已婚的"},{"en":"Mr./Mister","zh":"先生"},{"en":"Mrs.","zh":"太太"},{"en":"Ms.","zh":"女士"}]},{"id":"L1-M06","level":1,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"數學課開始了，我卻找不到尺。小恩說：「你的尺或許在抽屜裡。」抽屜是空的。他把自己的尺借給我：「沒關係。說不定明天就找到了。」","en":"Math class started, but I could not find my ruler. Xiao-En said, \\"Maybe your ruler is in the drawer.\\" The drawer was empty. He lent me his own ruler and said, \\"It doesn't matter. You may find it tomorrow.\\"","words":[{"en":"mathematics/math","zh":"數學"},{"en":"matter","zh":"事情；要緊"},{"en":"may","zh":"可以；表示推測"},{"en":"maybe","zh":"也許、大概"}]},{"id":"L1-M07","level":1,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"我看了看菜單，點了一份套餐。套餐裡有肉和飯。我還點了一杯中杯鮮奶。","en":"I looked at the menu and ordered a set meal. The meal came with meat and rice. I also ordered a medium milk.","words":[{"en":"meal","zh":"一餐"},{"en":"meat","zh":"肉"},{"en":"medium","zh":"中等的"},{"en":"menu","zh":"菜單"},{"en":"milk","zh":"牛奶"}]},{"id":"L1-M08","level":1,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"我在社團的第一次集會上遇見了兩位新成員。他們和我一樣，都對新聞媒體有興趣。","en":"At the club's first meeting, I met two new members. Like me, they are both interested in the news media.","words":[{"en":"media","zh":"媒體"},{"en":"meet","zh":"見面、遇見"},{"en":"meeting","zh":"會議、會面"},{"en":"member","zh":"成員、會員"}]},{"id":"L1-M09","level":1,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"我必須先吃藥，才能進去參觀這座舊煤礦。我跟老師說：「請等我一下。我兩分鐘後就好。」","en":"I must take my medicine before I can go in and visit this old coal mine. I said to my teacher, \\"Please wait a moment. I will be ready in two minutes.\\"","words":[{"en":"medicine","zh":"藥物；醫學"},{"en":"mine","zh":"我的（東西）；礦坑"},{"en":"minute","zh":"分、分鐘"},{"en":"moment","zh":"片刻、瞬間"},{"en":"must","zh":"必須"}]},{"id":"L1-M10","level":1,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"我們鎮上有一座現代化的博物館。建造這座館花了兩百萬元，這筆錢是居民一起捐的。","en":"There is a modern museum in our town. It cost two million dollars to build, and the people of the town gave the money together.","words":[{"en":"million","zh":"百萬"},{"en":"modern","zh":"現代的"},{"en":"money","zh":"錢"},{"en":"museum","zh":"博物館"}]},{"id":"L1-M11","level":1,"letter":"M","n":11,"zh":"媽媽這個月在外地工作，我很想念她。我今天又寫了一封信，告訴她更多學校裡的事。","en":"My mother is working in another city this month, and I miss her very much. Today I wrote another letter and told her more about school.","words":[{"en":"many","zh":"許多的"},{"en":"miss","zh":"想念；錯過"},{"en":"month","zh":"月"},{"en":"more","zh":"多的、程度較大的"},{"en":"mother","zh":"母親"},{"en":"much","zh":"很多的"}]},{"id":"L1-M12","level":1,"letter":"M","n":12,"zh":"早晨五點，月亮還掛在山的上方。同隊的人多數都還在睡，只有我和爸爸起來看日出。","en":"At five in the morning, the moon was still above the mountain. Most of the people on our team were still sleeping. Only Dad and I got up to watch the sunrise.","words":[{"en":"many","zh":"許多的"},{"en":"moon","zh":"月亮、月球"},{"en":"morning","zh":"早晨、早上"},{"en":"most","zh":"最；大多數"},{"en":"mountain","zh":"山"}]},{"id":"L1-M13","level":1,"letter":"M","n":13,"zh":"這部電影的主角是一隻小老鼠。音樂一開始，牠就隨著節奏動了起來。","en":"The main character of this movie is a little mouse. As soon as the music starts, it moves with the beat.","words":[{"en":"main","zh":"主要的、重要的"},{"en":"mouse","zh":"老鼠；滑鼠"},{"en":"move(ment)","zh":"移動；搬家"},{"en":"movie/film","zh":"電影"},{"en":"music","zh":"音樂"}]},{"id":"L1-M14","level":1,"letter":"M","n":14,"zh":"我的鞋上怎麼有這麼多泥巴？我需要更多的水，才能把鞋洗乾淨。","en":"Why is there so much mud on my shoes? I need more water to wash them clean.","words":[{"en":"many","zh":"許多的"},{"en":"more","zh":"多的、程度較大的"},{"en":"much","zh":"很多的"},{"en":"mud","zh":"泥巴"}]},{"id":"L1-N01","level":1,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"我們家附近有一座國家公園。老師帶我們去觀察大自然，還教我們認識幾種鳥的名字。","en":"There is a national park near our home. Our teacher took us there to look at nature and taught us the names of several birds.","words":[{"en":"name","zh":"名字、名稱"},{"en":"national","zh":"國家的、國立的"},{"en":"nature","zh":"自然、大自然"},{"en":"near","zh":"在……附近"}]},{"id":"L1-N02","level":1,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"有一張網纏住了那隻水鳥的脖子。牠需要幫忙。我們剪開網子，牠就飛走了。我永遠不會忘記那一刻。","en":"A net was caught around the water bird's neck. It needed help. We cut the net open, and it flew away. I will never forget that moment.","words":[{"en":"neck","zh":"脖子"},{"en":"need","zh":"需要、必需"},{"en":"net","zh":"網子"},{"en":"never","zh":"從不、決不"}]},{"id":"L1-N03","level":1,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"今天的報紙上有一則好消息。新的游泳池下星期就要開放了。我們可以在家附近游泳，真好！","en":"There is good news in today's newspaper. The new swimming pool will open next week. We can swim near our home. How nice!","words":[{"en":"near","zh":"在……附近"},{"en":"new","zh":"新的"},{"en":"news","zh":"新聞、訊息"},{"en":"newspaper","zh":"報紙"},{"en":"next","zh":"下一個的、其次的"},{"en":"nice","zh":"好的、親切的"}]},{"id":"L1-N04","level":1,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"昨晚我聽到樓梯間傳來噪音。我問爸爸：「外面有人嗎？」他說：「沒有，外面一個人也沒有。是樓下的狗在吵。」","en":"Last night I heard a noise from the stairs. I asked Dad, \\"Is anyone outside?\\" He said, \\"No, nobody is out there. The dog downstairs is being noisy.\\"","words":[{"en":"night","zh":"夜、夜晚"},{"en":"nobody","zh":"無人、沒有人"},{"en":"noise","zh":"噪音、雜音"},{"en":"noisy","zh":"嘈雜的、喧鬧的"}]},{"id":"L1-N05","level":1,"letter":"N","n":5,"zh":"便條上寫著：「中午在車站北門集合。」我提早到了，手上什麼也沒拿，便去幫大家搬箱子。","en":"The note said, \\"Meet at the north gate of the station at noon.\\" I got there early with nothing in my hands, so I helped everyone carry the boxes.","words":[{"en":"noon","zh":"正午、中午"},{"en":"north","zh":"北方、北"},{"en":"note","zh":"筆記；便條"},{"en":"nothing","zh":"沒有東西、沒事"}]},{"id":"L1-N06","level":1,"letter":"N","n":6,"zh":"我現在注意到螢幕上的號碼了。是我的！護理師問我：「你的鼻子很痛嗎？」我說：「不太痛，只是有點癢。」","en":"Now I notice the number on the screen. It is mine! The nurse asked me, \\"Does your nose hurt a lot?\\" I said, \\"Not much. It is just a little itchy.\\"","words":[{"en":"nose","zh":"鼻子"},{"en":"notice","zh":"注意到；通知"},{"en":"now","zh":"現在"},{"en":"number","zh":"數、數字"},{"en":"nurse","zh":"護理師；照護"}]},{"id":"L1-O01","level":1,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"我關了燈。爸爸說：「我們走吧。大家約七點鐘在公園的北門見。」我說：「七點我可以。我來帶路。」","en":"I turned off the light. Dad said, \\"Let's go. Everyone will meet at the north gate of the park at seven o'clock.\\" I said, \\"Seven is OK for me. I will lead the way.\\"","words":[{"en":"O.K./OK/okay","zh":"好、可以"}]},{"id":"L1-O02","level":1,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"我常常去爺爺的辦公室。他的桌上有一張照片，照片裡那位年老的軍官是他的爸爸。","en":"I often go to my grandfather's office. There is a photo on his desk. The old officer in the photo is his father.","words":[{"en":"office","zh":"辦公室"},{"en":"officer","zh":"警官、官員"},{"en":"often","zh":"時常、常常"},{"en":"old","zh":"老的、舊的"}]},{"id":"L1-O03","level":1,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"我只上過一次線上烹飪課。老師說：「打開油瓶，倒一點油到鍋子裡。」","en":"I have taken an online cooking class only once. The teacher said, \\"Open the bottle of oil and pour a little oil into the pan.\\"","words":[{"en":"oil","zh":"油、石油"},{"en":"once","zh":"一次、曾經"},{"en":"online","zh":"線上的"},{"en":"only","zh":"只有、僅僅"},{"en":"open","zh":"開著的、開放的"}]},{"id":"L1-O04","level":1,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"你想點柳橙汁或蘋果汁？這家店還有其他飲料。","en":"Would you like to order orange juice or apple juice? This shop has other drinks, too.","words":[{"en":"orange","zh":"橘色的"},{"en":"order","zh":"點餐；順序；命令"},{"en":"other","zh":"其他的、另外的"}]},{"id":"L1-O05","level":1,"letter":"O","n":5,"zh":"我帶了自己的球去學校。球飛過圍牆，落在學校外面。我只好從大門走出去撿球。","en":"I took my own ball to school. The ball flew over the wall and landed outside the school. I had to walk out through the gate to get it.","words":[{"en":"outside","zh":"外面、外表"},{"en":"own","zh":"自己的"}]},{"id":"L1-P01","level":1,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"我用紙包好茶杯，把它裝進盒子裡。到了郵局，我付了錢，把包裹寄給外婆。","en":"I wrapped the teacup in paper and packed it in a box. At the post office, I paid and sent the package to my grandmother.","words":[{"en":"pack","zh":"打包；一包"},{"en":"package","zh":"包裹"},{"en":"paper","zh":"紙；報告"},{"en":"pay(ment)","zh":"支付、付清"}]},{"id":"L1-P02","level":1,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"翻到最後一頁，看看那幅海邊的圖畫。我的部分是天空，妹妹負責把海塗成藍色。","en":"Turn to the last page and look at the picture of the beach. My part was the sky, and my sister painted the sea blue.","words":[{"en":"page","zh":"頁"},{"en":"paint","zh":"油漆、顏料"},{"en":"part","zh":"部分"},{"en":"picture","zh":"圖畫、照片"}]},{"id":"L1-P03","level":1,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"我看上一條有四個口袋的褲子。這條褲子很漂亮，可是我看了價錢，就把它放回去了。","en":"I liked a pair of pants with four pockets. The pants were pretty, but when I saw the price, I put them back.","words":[{"en":"pair","zh":"一雙、一對"},{"en":"pants","zh":"褲子、長褲"},{"en":"pocket","zh":"口袋"},{"en":"pretty","zh":"漂亮的；相當"},{"en":"price","zh":"價格"},{"en":"put","zh":"放、擺"}]},{"id":"L1-P04","level":1,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"我的父母在公園替我辦生日派對。來參加派對的人各自帶了椅子。我們一起在大樹下吃蛋糕。","en":"My parents held a birthday party for me in the park. The people who came to the party each brought a chair. We ate cake together under a big tree.","words":[{"en":"parent(s)","zh":"父母、父母親"},{"en":"park","zh":"公園；停車"},{"en":"part","zh":"部分"},{"en":"party","zh":"派對"},{"en":"people","zh":"人們"},{"en":"person","zh":"人"}]},{"id":"L1-P05","level":1,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"我喜歡打籃球，今天第一次跟校隊一起練習。一名球員把球傳給我，我投進了第一球。","en":"I like to play basketball, and today I practiced with the school team for the first time. A player passed the ball to me, and I made my first shot.","words":[{"en":"pass","zh":"經過；通過；傳遞"},{"en":"play","zh":"玩、遊戲"},{"en":"player","zh":"選手、球員"},{"en":"practice","zh":"練習"}]},{"id":"L1-P06","level":1,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"我找不到看表演的地方，就向警察問路。他們很有禮貌。其中一位說：「走過銀行就到劇場了。」","en":"I could not find the place for the show, so I asked the police for directions. They were very polite. One of them said, \\"Walk past the bank and you will be at the theater.\\"","words":[{"en":"past","zh":"過去的"},{"en":"place","zh":"地方、地點"},{"en":"police","zh":"警察"},{"en":"polite","zh":"有禮貌的"}]},{"id":"L1-P07","level":1,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"我用原子筆寫錯了名字，擦不掉。老師把一枝鉛筆放在我的桌上，給我一張新的紙。","en":"I wrote the wrong name with a pen and could not rub it out. The teacher put a pencil on my desk and gave me a new piece of paper.","words":[{"en":"paper","zh":"紙；報告"},{"en":"pen","zh":"筆、原子筆"},{"en":"pencil","zh":"鉛筆"},{"en":"piece","zh":"塊、片"},{"en":"put","zh":"放、擺"}]},{"id":"L1-P08","level":1,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"照片裡只有一個人，腳邊有一隻狗。那隻狗脖子上有項圈，也許是他的寵物。","en":"There is only one person in the photo, and there is a dog at his feet. The dog has a collar on its neck. Perhaps it is his pet.","words":[{"en":"perhaps","zh":"也許、大概"},{"en":"person","zh":"人"},{"en":"pet","zh":"寵物"},{"en":"photograph/photo","zh":"相片、照片"}]},{"id":"L1-P09","level":1,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"妹妹花了兩個月為學校的音樂節目做準備。聽她彈鋼琴真是件愉快的事。我為她感到驕傲。","en":"My sister spent two months preparing for the school music program. It is a pleasure to hear her play the piano. I am proud of her.","words":[{"en":"piano","zh":"鋼琴"},{"en":"play","zh":"玩、遊戲"},{"en":"pleasure","zh":"快樂、愉快"},{"en":"prepare","zh":"準備、籌備"},{"en":"program","zh":"節目；計畫"},{"en":"proud","zh":"驕傲的、自豪的"}]},{"id":"L1-P10","level":1,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"我們先在果園採蘋果，再到樹下野餐。媽媽切開蘋果派，在每個人的盤子裡放了一塊。","en":"First we picked apples in the orchard, and then we had a picnic under a tree. Mom cut the apple pie and put a piece on each person's plate.","words":[{"en":"parent(s)","zh":"父母、父母親"},{"en":"person","zh":"人"},{"en":"pick","zh":"挑選；摘"},{"en":"picnic","zh":"野餐、遠足"},{"en":"pie","zh":"派"},{"en":"piece","zh":"塊、片"},{"en":"plate","zh":"盤子"},{"en":"put","zh":"放、擺"}]},{"id":"L1-P11","level":1,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"姑姑送我一份生日禮物。那是一枚粉紅色的小豬胸針，我把它別在書包上。","en":"My aunt gave me a birthday present. It was a little pink pig pin, and I pinned it on my schoolbag.","words":[{"en":"pig","zh":"豬"},{"en":"pin","zh":"別針"},{"en":"pink","zh":"粉紅色的"},{"en":"present","zh":"禮物；現在的；出席的"}]},{"id":"L1-P12","level":1,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"外公在池塘邊種菜。一根長水管把池塘的水引進菜園裡的小水池。","en":"Grandpa plants vegetables by the pond. A long pipe carries water from the pond into a small pool in the vegetable garden.","words":[{"en":"pipe","zh":"管子"},{"en":"plant","zh":"植物；種植"},{"en":"pond","zh":"池塘"},{"en":"pool","zh":"游泳池"}]},{"id":"L1-P13","level":1,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"我們計畫星期五晚上去公立天文臺。老師會指著天空中的幾顆行星，告訴我們它們的名字。","en":"We plan to go to the public observatory on Friday night. The teacher will point at several planets in the sky and tell us their names.","words":[{"en":"plan","zh":"計劃、方案"},{"en":"planet","zh":"行星"},{"en":"point","zh":"點；重點；指"},{"en":"public","zh":"公眾的、公共的"}]},{"id":"L1-P14","level":1,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"電影下午兩點開始。我想讓妹妹開心，特地替她買了這家戲院最受歡迎的焦糖爆米花。","en":"The movie starts at two p.m. I wanted to please my sister, so I bought her the most popular caramel popcorn at this theater.","words":[{"en":"please","zh":"請；使高興"},{"en":"popcorn","zh":"爆米花"},{"en":"popular","zh":"受歡迎的、流行的"}]},{"id":"L1-P15","level":1,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"爸爸把馬鈴薯放進大鍋裡煮湯。我們把熱湯送給附近幾戶貧窮的家庭。","en":"Dad put potatoes in a big pot to make soup. We gave the hot soup to several poor families nearby.","words":[{"en":"poor","zh":"貧窮的；可憐的"},{"en":"pot","zh":"鍋子"},{"en":"potato","zh":"馬鈴薯"},{"en":"put","zh":"放、擺"}]},{"id":"L1-P16","level":1,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"桌上的小風車停了。問題很可能出在電池。弟弟問：「不用電池也有辦法讓它轉嗎？」我打開窗戶說：「看！風力也能帶動它。」","en":"The small windmill on the table stopped. The problem was probably the battery. My brother asked, \\"Is it possible to make it turn without a battery?\\" I opened the window and said, \\"Look! Wind power can turn it, too.\\"","words":[{"en":"possible","zh":"可能的"},{"en":"power","zh":"力量；電力"},{"en":"probably","zh":"大概、或許"},{"en":"problem","zh":"問題"}]},{"id":"L1-P17","level":1,"letter":"P","n":17,"zh":"我把箱子放下，伸手推門，門卻動也不動。弟弟指著門把旁的字說：「從這一側要用拉的。」","en":"I put the box down and reached out to push the door, but it did not move at all. My brother pointed at the words beside the handle and said, \\"You have to pull from this side.\\"","words":[{"en":"point","zh":"點；重點；指"},{"en":"pull","zh":"拉、拖"},{"en":"push","zh":"推、推動"},{"en":"put","zh":"放、擺"}]},{"id":"L1-Q01","level":1,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"兩點一刻，教室裡相當安靜。老師問了個關於故事裡那位皇后的問題。小美反應很快，第一個舉手。","en":"At a quarter past two, the classroom was quite quiet. The teacher asked a question about the queen in the story. Xiao-Mei was quick and was the first to raise her hand.","words":[{"en":"quarter","zh":"四分之一；十五分鐘"},{"en":"queen","zh":"王后、女王"},{"en":"question","zh":"問題、詢問"},{"en":"quick","zh":"快的、迅速的"},{"en":"quiet","zh":"安靜的"},{"en":"quite","zh":"相當、很"}]},{"id":"L1-R01","level":1,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"故事裡的兔子準備好比賽了。裁判舉起小旗子，又把旗子放下。兔子開始跑了。","en":"The rabbit in the story was ready for the race. The judge raised a small flag and then put it down. The rabbit started to run.","words":[{"en":"rabbit","zh":"兔子"},{"en":"race","zh":"賽跑、比賽；種族"},{"en":"raise","zh":"升起、舉起"},{"en":"read","zh":"讀、閱讀"},{"en":"ready","zh":"準備好的"},{"en":"run","zh":"跑、奔跑"}]},{"id":"L1-R02","level":1,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"我們從收音機聽到這座山城的夏天很多雨。下午果真下起雨來。雨停後，天空出現一道彩虹。","en":"We heard on the radio that summers in this mountain town are very rainy. It really did rain in the afternoon. After the rain stopped, a rainbow appeared in the sky.","words":[{"en":"radio","zh":"收音機"},{"en":"rain","zh":"雨、下雨"},{"en":"rainbow","zh":"彩虹"},{"en":"rainy","zh":"下雨的、多雨的"},{"en":"real","zh":"真的、真實的"},{"en":"really","zh":"真的、非常"}]},{"id":"L1-R03","level":1,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"我走到樓梯口，讀了牆上的紙條。為了記住上面的地址，我又念了兩遍。","en":"I reached the stairs and read the note on the wall. To remember the address on it, I repeated it twice.","words":[{"en":"reach","zh":"到達、達到"},{"en":"read","zh":"讀、閱讀"},{"en":"remember","zh":"記得、回憶起"},{"en":"repeat","zh":"重做、重複"}]},{"id":"L1-R04","level":1,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"門口有一排小機器人。妹妹指著其中一隻問：「那是真狗嗎？」我說：「牠也是機器人。我喜歡牠有個理由：牠真的會跳舞。」","en":"There was a row of small robots at the door. My sister pointed at one of them and asked, \\"Is that a real dog?\\" I said, \\"It is a robot, too. I like it for a reason: it can really dance.\\"","words":[{"en":"real","zh":"真的、真實的"},{"en":"really","zh":"真的、非常"},{"en":"reason","zh":"理由、原因"},{"en":"robot","zh":"機器人"},{"en":"row","zh":"排、列；划（船）"}]},{"id":"L1-R05","level":1,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"我在舊相簿裡看到一張親戚們的合照。照片裡，姑姑戴著戒指，手裡拿著一朵紅玫瑰。","en":"I saw a photo of my relatives in an old photo book. In the photo, my aunt was wearing a ring and holding a red rose.","words":[{"en":"red","zh":"紅的、紅色的"},{"en":"relative","zh":"親戚；相對的"},{"en":"ring","zh":"戒指；（鈴）響"},{"en":"rise","zh":"上升、增加"},{"en":"rose","zh":"玫瑰"}]},{"id":"L1-R06","level":1,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"一名記者站在橋上做現場報導。他說：「河水還在上升，請大家留在高處。」","en":"A reporter stood on the bridge and gave a live report. He said, \\"The river is still rising. Please stay in high places.\\"","words":[{"en":"report","zh":"報告、通報"},{"en":"reporter","zh":"記者"},{"en":"rise","zh":"上升、增加"},{"en":"river","zh":"河"}]},{"id":"L1-R07","level":1,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"這間餐廳的老闆很富有。他讓旅人在店裡休息，還免費請他們吃一碗白飯。","en":"The owner of this restaurant is rich. He lets travelers rest in his restaurant and gives them a bowl of rice for free.","words":[{"en":"rest","zh":"休息"},{"en":"restaurant","zh":"餐廳"},{"en":"rice","zh":"米、米飯"},{"en":"rich","zh":"有錢的、豐富的"}]},{"id":"L1-R08","level":1,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"我們沿著這條路騎腳踏車。到了紅色的橋，我們向右轉，就看見了海。","en":"We rode our bikes along this road. At the red bridge, we turned right and saw the sea.","words":[{"en":"red","zh":"紅的、紅色的"},{"en":"ride","zh":"騎、搭乘"},{"en":"right","zh":"對的；右邊"},{"en":"road","zh":"路"}]},{"id":"L1-R09","level":1,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"我的房間裡有幾顆來自海邊的石頭。一顆圓圓的石頭從桌上滾下去，滾進床底。","en":"There are some rocks from the beach in my room. A round rock rolled off the table and under the bed.","words":[{"en":"rock","zh":"岩石、石頭；搖滾樂"},{"en":"roll","zh":"滾動；捲"},{"en":"room","zh":"房間"},{"en":"round","zh":"圓的"}]},{"id":"L1-R10","level":1,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"我們班有個規則：不能踩校園裡的樹根。今天我們沿著一條樹根放好繩子，再用尺量繩子的長度。","en":"Our class has a rule: we cannot step on the tree roots at school. Today we put a rope along one root and then used a ruler to measure how long the rope was.","words":[{"en":"root","zh":"根"},{"en":"rope","zh":"繩子"},{"en":"rule","zh":"規則"},{"en":"ruler","zh":"尺；統治者"}]},{"id":"L1-S01","level":1,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"小貓不見了，妹妹好難過。鄰居從水溝救出小貓。牠平安回家了，妹妹終於露出微笑。","en":"The kitten was missing, and my sister was very sad. Our neighbor saved the kitten from a ditch. It got home safe, and my sister finally smiled.","words":[{"en":"sad","zh":"難過的、悲傷的"},{"en":"safe","zh":"安全的"},{"en":"save","zh":"救；存（錢）；節省"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"smile","zh":"微笑"}]},{"id":"L1-S02","level":1,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"我在小瓶子裡裝了油和一點鹽，把瓶子搖一搖。妹妹把醬汁淋在沙拉上，跟我分著吃。","en":"I put oil and a little salt in a small bottle and shook it. My sister poured the sauce on the salad and shared it with me.","words":[{"en":"salad","zh":"沙拉"},{"en":"salt","zh":"鹽"},{"en":"shake","zh":"搖動、發抖"},{"en":"share","zh":"分享"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"small","zh":"小的"}]},{"id":"L1-S03","level":1,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"街角的商店正在特價。我看中照片裡的一雙藍鞋。店員說：「我們昨天賣掉最後一雙了。不過還有同款的紅鞋。」","en":"The shop on the corner is having a sale. I liked a pair of blue shoes in a photo. The clerk said, \\"We sold the last pair yesterday. But we still have the same shoes in red.\\"","words":[{"en":"sale","zh":"出售；特價"},{"en":"same","zh":"相同的、同樣的"},{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"sell","zh":"賣"},{"en":"shoe(s)","zh":"鞋子"},{"en":"shop","zh":"商店"},{"en":"still","zh":"仍然"}]},{"id":"L1-S04","level":1,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"學校的科學老師給我們幾顆種子。她說：「把種子放在濕紙巾上，明天再來看看。」","en":"Our science teacher at school gave us several seeds. She said, \\"Put the seeds on a wet paper towel and come back to see them tomorrow.\\"","words":[{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"school","zh":"學校"},{"en":"science","zh":"科學"},{"en":"see","zh":"看見；明白"},{"en":"seed","zh":"種子、籽"},{"en":"several","zh":"幾個的、一些的"}]},{"id":"L1-S05","level":1,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"我最喜歡的季節是秋天。我可以從山上看見大海，還有十幾艘一起進港的船。那景象真美！","en":"My favorite season is fall. From the mountain I can see the sea and more than ten ships coming into the harbor together. What a beautiful sight!","words":[{"en":"sea","zh":"海"},{"en":"season","zh":"季節"},{"en":"see","zh":"看見；明白"},{"en":"ship","zh":"船"},{"en":"sight","zh":"景象；視力"}]},{"id":"L1-S06","level":1,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"一位老人家在第二站上了公車。我站起來對他說：「先生，請坐我的座位。」","en":"An old man got on the bus at the second stop. I stood up and said to him, \\"Sir, please sit in my seat.\\"","words":[{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"seat","zh":"座位"},{"en":"second","zh":"第二的；秒"},{"en":"sir","zh":"先生"},{"en":"sit","zh":"坐"},{"en":"stand","zh":"站"},{"en":"stop","zh":"停止"}]},{"id":"L1-S07","level":1,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"我寫了幾句話，感謝志工們在圖書館的服務。學校的秘書幫我把這封信寄給他們。","en":"I wrote several sentences to thank the volunteers for their service at the library. The school secretary helped me send the letter to them.","words":[{"en":"school","zh":"學校"},{"en":"secretary","zh":"秘書"},{"en":"send","zh":"寄、送"},{"en":"sentence","zh":"句子"},{"en":"service","zh":"服務"},{"en":"several","zh":"幾個的、一些的"}]},{"id":"L1-S08","level":1,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"我洗完澡後，肩膀還是很痛，手臂也抬不起來。媽媽問：「你是不是生病了？」我說：「我打球傷到了肩膀。傷得很嚴重。」","en":"After I took a shower, my shoulder was still very sore, and I could not raise my arm. Mom asked, \\"Are you sick?\\" I said, \\"I hurt my shoulder playing ball. It is serious.\\"","words":[{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"serious","zh":"嚴肅的、認真的"},{"en":"shoulder","zh":"肩膀"},{"en":"show","zh":"表演；給……看"},{"en":"shower","zh":"淋浴；陣雨"},{"en":"sick","zh":"生病的"},{"en":"sore","zh":"痠痛的"},{"en":"still","zh":"仍然"}]},{"id":"L1-S09","level":1,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"我們來做星星形狀的餅乾好嗎？做法很簡單。你來壓出星星的形狀，我來把計時器設成十分鐘。","en":"Shall we make star-shaped cookies? It is simple. You press out the star shapes, and I will set the timer for ten minutes.","words":[{"en":"set","zh":"放置；一套"},{"en":"shall","zh":"將"},{"en":"shape","zh":"形狀、形態"},{"en":"simple","zh":"簡單的"},{"en":"star","zh":"星星；明星"}]},{"id":"L1-S10","level":1,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"姊姊在圍欄邊餵綿羊。她的襯衫勾到尖尖的鐵絲，她自己把衣角解開。","en":"My sister was feeding the sheep by the fence. Her shirt got caught on a sharp wire, and she got it free by herself.","words":[{"en":"sharp","zh":"尖的、鋒利的"},{"en":"sheep","zh":"羊"},{"en":"shirt","zh":"襯衫"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"}]},{"id":"L1-S11","level":1,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"我試穿的裙子太短，鞋子的尺寸也不對。店員拿來一件短褲和一雙大一號的鞋讓我試。","en":"The skirt I tried on was too short, and the shoes were the wrong size. The clerk brought a pair of shorts and shoes one size bigger for me to try.","words":[{"en":"shoe(s)","zh":"鞋子"},{"en":"short","zh":"短的；矮的"},{"en":"shorts","zh":"短褲"},{"en":"size","zh":"大小、尺寸"},{"en":"skirt","zh":"裙子"}]},{"id":"L1-S12","level":1,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"一條蛇停在步道右邊，弟弟大聲喊我。我用手勢示意他停下來，然後我們一起慢慢往後退。","en":"A snake stopped on the right side of the path, and my brother shouted to me. I gave him a sign with my hand to stop, and then we slowly stepped back together.","words":[{"en":"shout","zh":"喊叫"},{"en":"side","zh":"旁邊、側邊"},{"en":"sign","zh":"標誌；簽名"},{"en":"slow","zh":"慢的"},{"en":"snake","zh":"蛇"},{"en":"stop","zh":"停止"}]},{"id":"L1-S13","level":1,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"我姊姊愛唱歌。她在上次學校的表演中唱了一首歌。從那時起，她就一直想成為歌手。","en":"My sister loves to sing. She sang a song at the last school show. Since then, she has always wanted to be a singer.","words":[{"en":"school","zh":"學校"},{"en":"shoe(s)","zh":"鞋子"},{"en":"show","zh":"表演；給……看"},{"en":"since","zh":"既然、自……以後"},{"en":"sing","zh":"唱、唱歌"},{"en":"singer","zh":"歌手"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"song","zh":"歌曲"}]},{"id":"L1-S14","level":1,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"早上天空灰灰的，我躺在沙發上睡著了。外面下了雪，所以等我醒來，陽臺上的椅子全白了。","en":"The sky was gray in the morning, and I lay on the sofa and went to sleep. It snowed outside, so when I woke up, the chairs on the balcony were all white.","words":[{"en":"sky","zh":"天空"},{"en":"sleep","zh":"睡覺"},{"en":"snow","zh":"雪；下雪"},{"en":"sofa","zh":"沙發"}]},{"id":"L1-S15","level":1,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"一塊小積木掉進櫃子的縫裡。弟弟很聰明，拿了一把細長的尺把積木推出來。這個方法很慢，但確實有效。","en":"A small block fell into the space behind the cabinet. My brother is smart. He took a long, slim ruler and pushed the block out. This way is slow, but it really works.","words":[{"en":"slim","zh":"瘦的、苗條的"},{"en":"slow","zh":"慢的"},{"en":"small","zh":"小的"},{"en":"smart","zh":"聰明的"},{"en":"space","zh":"空間；太空"}]},{"id":"L1-S16","level":1,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"一名軍人經過操場，聞到一股燒焦的味道。他看到廚房的窗戶冒煙，立刻打電話求救。","en":"A soldier walked past the playground and smelled something burning. He saw smoke coming from the kitchen window and called for help right away.","words":[{"en":"see","zh":"看見；明白"},{"en":"smell","zh":"聞；氣味"},{"en":"smoke","zh":"煙；抽菸"},{"en":"soldier","zh":"士兵、軍人"},{"en":"something","zh":"某事、某物"}]},{"id":"L1-S17","level":1,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"廚房裡某個地方傳來奇怪的聲音。有人把一些紙箱放在桌子底下，其中一個箱子裡有東西在動。","en":"A strange sound came from somewhere in the kitchen. Someone had put some boxes under the table, and something was moving in one of them.","words":[{"en":"someone/somebody","zh":"有人、某人"},{"en":"something","zh":"某事、某物"},{"en":"somewhere","zh":"到某處、在某處"},{"en":"sound","zh":"聲音；聽起來"},{"en":"strange","zh":"奇怪的、陌生的"}]},{"id":"L1-S18","level":1,"letter":"S","n":18,"zh":"我叔叔有時會帶兒子去聽演唱會。他們最喜歡的明星很快就要上台唱最後一首歌了。","en":"My uncle sometimes takes his son to concerts. Their favorite star will soon go on stage to sing the last song.","words":[{"en":"shoe(s)","zh":"鞋子"},{"en":"sing","zh":"唱、唱歌"},{"en":"sometimes","zh":"有時候"},{"en":"son","zh":"兒子"},{"en":"song","zh":"歌曲"},{"en":"soon","zh":"不久、很快"},{"en":"star","zh":"星星；明星"}]},{"id":"L1-S19","level":1,"letter":"S","n":19,"zh":"很抱歉，我今天喉嚨痛，不能說話。我在紙條上寫了「請給我一碗湯」，拿給媽媽看。","en":"I am sorry. I have a sore throat today and cannot speak. I wrote \\"Please give me a bowl of soup\\" on a note and showed it to Mom.","words":[{"en":"show","zh":"表演；給……看"},{"en":"sore","zh":"痠痛的"},{"en":"sorry","zh":"抱歉的；難過的"},{"en":"soup","zh":"湯"},{"en":"speak","zh":"說話"}]},{"id":"L1-S20","level":1,"letter":"S","n":20,"zh":"春天到了，我們要往南走，到外婆家住幾天。我想花一個下午陪她種花。","en":"Spring is here. We are going south to stay at Grandma's house for a few days. I want to spend an afternoon planting flowers with her.","words":[{"en":"shoe(s)","zh":"鞋子"},{"en":"south","zh":"南方、南"},{"en":"spend","zh":"花（錢、時間）"},{"en":"spring","zh":"春天；彈簧"},{"en":"stay","zh":"停留、待"}]},{"id":"L1-S21","level":1,"letter":"S","n":21,"zh":"樓梯下面有一張正方形的桌子。桌子旁還有空位，你可以站在那裡一起拍照。","en":"There is a square table under the stairs. There is still space beside the table, so you can stand there and be in the photo with us.","words":[{"en":"space","zh":"空間；太空"},{"en":"square","zh":"正方形；廣場"},{"en":"stair","zh":"樓梯"},{"en":"stand","zh":"站"},{"en":"still","zh":"仍然"}]},{"id":"L1-S22","level":1,"letter":"S","n":22,"zh":"老師今天出了特別的題目。每個學生要說出最喜歡的學科，再用英文拼出它的名字。","en":"The teacher gave us a special task today. Each student has to say his or her favorite subject and then spell its name in English.","words":[{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"special","zh":"特別的"},{"en":"spell","zh":"拼字"},{"en":"student","zh":"學生"},{"en":"subject","zh":"科目、主題"}]},{"id":"L1-S23","level":1,"letter":"S","n":23,"zh":"從這條街的盡頭出發，一直往前走。在紅綠燈前停下來。車站就在對面。","en":"Start from the end of this street and go straight. Stop at the traffic light. The station is just across the street.","words":[{"en":"start","zh":"開始"},{"en":"station","zh":"車站"},{"en":"stop","zh":"停止"},{"en":"straight","zh":"直的；直直地"},{"en":"street","zh":"街道、馬路"}]},{"id":"L1-S24","level":1,"letter":"S","n":24,"zh":"昨晚那幾本書還在店裡。每本都有一則關於貓的故事。我用細繩把書綁好。我哥哥很強壯，他幫我把書搬回家。","en":"The books were still in the store last night. Each one has a story about a cat. I tied the books with string. My brother is strong, and he helped me carry them home.","words":[{"en":"still","zh":"仍然"},{"en":"store","zh":"商店"},{"en":"story","zh":"故事；樓層"},{"en":"string","zh":"線、細繩"},{"en":"strong","zh":"強壯的、堅固的"}]},{"id":"L1-S25","level":1,"letter":"S","n":25,"zh":"我怕問笨問題，一直不敢舉手。姐姐晚上陪我讀書。第二天我很確定答案，就舉手了。我們的讀書計畫很成功。","en":"I was afraid of asking stupid questions, so I never raised my hand. My sister studied with me in the evening. The next day I was sure of the answer, so I raised my hand. Our study plan was successful.","words":[{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"study","zh":"研讀；研究"},{"en":"stupid","zh":"笨的"},{"en":"successful","zh":"成功的"},{"en":"sure","zh":"確定的；當然"}]},{"id":"L1-S26","level":1,"letter":"S","n":26,"zh":"我去超級市場買了一袋糖。妹妹在檸檬汁裡加了一匙，喝了一口。「夠甜了！」她說。","en":"I went to the supermarket and bought a bag of sugar. My sister added a spoonful to the lemon juice and took a sip. \\"It is sweet enough!\\" she said.","words":[{"en":"say","zh":"說、講"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"sugar","zh":"糖"},{"en":"supermarket","zh":"超級市場"},{"en":"sweet","zh":"甜的"}]},{"id":"L1-S27","level":1,"letter":"S","n":27,"zh":"今天很晴朗，太陽照進我的房間。姐姐在窗前放了一盆花，想給我一個驚喜。看到花盆上有我的名字，我好驚訝。","en":"It is sunny today, and the sun is shining into my room. My sister put a pot of flowers by the window to give me a surprise. I was so surprised to see my name on the pot.","words":[{"en":"see","zh":"看見；明白"},{"en":"sister","zh":"姊妹"},{"en":"sun","zh":"太陽"},{"en":"sunny","zh":"晴朗的"},{"en":"surprise","zh":"驚喜、驚訝"},{"en":"surprised","zh":"感到驚訝的"}]},{"id":"L1-T01","level":1,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"我把短袖圓領衫摺好，用緞帶綁起來，再用膠帶把價格牌貼在桌子上。攤位看起來很整齊。","en":"I folded the T-shirts and tied them with ribbon, and then I used tape to stick the price tag on the table. The stand looked very tidy.","words":[{"en":"T-shirt","zh":"T恤"},{"en":"table","zh":"桌子、餐桌"},{"en":"tape","zh":"膠帶"},{"en":"tidy","zh":"整齊的"},{"en":"tie","zh":"領帶；綁"}]},{"id":"L1-T02","level":1,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"架子頂端有一隻玩具老虎，尾巴上積了厚厚的灰塵。我輕輕碰了一下尾巴，手指就黑了。","en":"There is a toy tiger on top of the shelf, and there is thick dust on its tail. I touched the tail lightly, and my finger turned black.","words":[{"en":"tail","zh":"尾巴"},{"en":"thick","zh":"厚的"},{"en":"tiger","zh":"老虎"},{"en":"toe","zh":"腳趾"},{"en":"top","zh":"頂部、頂端"},{"en":"touch","zh":"觸摸"},{"en":"toy","zh":"玩具"},{"en":"turn","zh":"轉；輪到"}]},{"id":"L1-T03","level":1,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"請帶上相機，跟我們去鎮上那間廟。外公會搭計程車到廟門口等我們。","en":"Please take your camera and come with us to the temple in town. Grandpa will take a taxi and wait for us at the temple gate.","words":[{"en":"take","zh":"拿；帶；花（時間）"},{"en":"taxicab/taxi/cab","zh":"計程車"},{"en":"temple","zh":"廟宇"},{"en":"town","zh":"城鎮"}]},{"id":"L1-T04","level":1,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"今天訪問的話題是學校生活。我們和一位老師聊天，她教十幾歲的孩子用電腦打字。","en":"The topic of today's interview is school life. We talked with a teacher. She teaches teenagers to type on a computer.","words":[{"en":"talk","zh":"說話、談話"},{"en":"teach","zh":"教"},{"en":"teacher","zh":"教師、老師"},{"en":"teenager","zh":"青少年"},{"en":"today","zh":"今天"},{"en":"topic","zh":"主題"},{"en":"type","zh":"類型；打字"}]},{"id":"L1-T05","level":1,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"網球隊來了一位新隊員。他比我高，人很瘦，發球卻很有力。","en":"A new player joined the tennis team. He is taller than I am and very thin, but his serve is strong.","words":[{"en":"tall","zh":"高的"},{"en":"team","zh":"隊伍、團隊"},{"en":"tennis","zh":"網球"},{"en":"thin","zh":"薄的、細的"}]},{"id":"L1-T06","level":1,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"我喉嚨乾，想喝一口茶。我先嚐了一小口，茶太燙了，就把杯子放下。","en":"My throat was dry, and I wanted some tea. I tasted a little first. The tea was too hot, so I put the cup down.","words":[{"en":"taste","zh":"味道；嚐"},{"en":"tea","zh":"茶"},{"en":"throat","zh":"喉嚨"}]},{"id":"L1-T07","level":1,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"我打電話給哥哥，告訴他：「比賽改到今晚了。我們先吃晚餐，再一起看電視轉播吧。」","en":"I called my brother on the telephone and told him, \\"The game was moved to tonight. Let's have dinner first and then watch it on TV together.\\"","words":[{"en":"telephone/phone","zh":"電話"},{"en":"television/TV","zh":"電視"},{"en":"tell","zh":"告訴"},{"en":"together","zh":"一起、共同"},{"en":"tonight","zh":"今晚"}]},{"id":"L1-T08","level":1,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"雖然雨停了，交通狀況還是很糟。一輛卡車卡在路口，後面的車都過不去。","en":"Though the rain stopped, the traffic was still terrible. A truck was stuck at the crossing, and the cars behind it could not get through.","words":[{"en":"terrible","zh":"糟糕的、可怕的"},{"en":"though","zh":"雖然、縱然"},{"en":"through","zh":"經過、穿過"},{"en":"traffic","zh":"交通"},{"en":"truck","zh":"卡車"}]},{"id":"L1-T09","level":1,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"他們剛考完試，看起來都很累。我想他們現在只想回家睡覺。","en":"They just finished the test, and they all look tired. I think that they just want to go home and sleep now.","words":[{"en":"test","zh":"測驗、考試"},{"en":"think","zh":"想、認為"},{"en":"tired","zh":"疲倦的"}]},{"id":"L1-T10","level":1,"letter":"T","n":10,"zh":"那個男孩在戲院門口撿到一張票。票的主人還在那裡找，他把票還給她，她連忙向他道謝。","en":"The boy found a ticket at the door of the theater. The owner of the ticket was still looking for it there. He gave it back to her, and she thanked him at once.","words":[{"en":"thank","zh":"感謝"},{"en":"theater","zh":"戲院、電影院"},{"en":"ticket","zh":"票；罰單"}]},{"id":"L1-T11","level":1,"letter":"T","n":11,"zh":"我帶這些東西來交換。你可以拿走這個杯子，那些盤子要留給奶奶。","en":"I brought these things to trade. You can take this cup, but those plates are for Grandma.","words":[{"en":"take","zh":"拿；帶；花（時間）"},{"en":"thing","zh":"東西、事情"}]},{"id":"L1-T12","level":1,"letter":"T","n":12,"zh":"輪到我丟球了。我連丟兩次都沒進，第三次才把球丟進籃子裡。","en":"It was my turn to throw the ball. I missed twice, and the third time I finally threw the ball into the basket.","words":[{"en":"third","zh":"第三"},{"en":"throw","zh":"丟、投"},{"en":"time","zh":"時間；次"},{"en":"turn","zh":"轉；輪到"},{"en":"twice","zh":"兩次"}]},{"id":"L1-T13","level":1,"letter":"T","n":13,"zh":"晚餐的總額是九百元。我們拿出一千元，打算把剩下的一百元留給服務生當小費。","en":"The total for dinner was nine hundred dollars. We took out one thousand dollars and planned to leave the other one hundred as a tip for the waiter.","words":[{"en":"take","zh":"拿；帶；花（時間）"},{"en":"thousand","zh":"一千"},{"en":"tip","zh":"小費；訣竅；尖端"},{"en":"total","zh":"總共的、全部的"}]},{"id":"L1-T14","level":1,"letter":"T","n":14,"zh":"我們搭火車去旅行。我穿過車廂時，腳趾撞到一個硬硬的箱子。","en":"We took a trip by train. When I walked through the train car, my toe hit a hard box.","words":[{"en":"take","zh":"拿；帶；花（時間）"},{"en":"through","zh":"經過、穿過"},{"en":"toe","zh":"腳趾"},{"en":"train","zh":"火車；訓練"},{"en":"trip","zh":"旅行"}]},{"id":"L1-T15","level":1,"letter":"T","n":15,"zh":"今天我和媽媽一起摘番茄。我們留了兩顆，明天野餐時要坐在樹下吃。","en":"Today Mom and I picked tomatoes together. We kept two, and tomorrow we will eat them under a tree at our picnic.","words":[{"en":"today","zh":"今天"},{"en":"together","zh":"一起、共同"},{"en":"tomato","zh":"番茄"},{"en":"tomorrow","zh":"明天"},{"en":"tree","zh":"樹"}]},{"id":"L1-T16","level":1,"letter":"T","n":16,"zh":"家裡的馬桶一直流水，給我們添了不少麻煩。爸爸拿著工具走進來，想試著把它修好。","en":"The toilet at home keeps running, and it has given us a lot of trouble. Dad came in with his tools to try to fix it.","words":[{"en":"toilet","zh":"馬桶、廁所"},{"en":"tool","zh":"工具"},{"en":"trouble","zh":"煩惱、麻煩"},{"en":"try","zh":"嘗試"}]},{"id":"L1-T17","level":1,"letter":"T","n":17,"zh":"妹妹掉了一顆牙，哭得滿臉都是淚。我拿毛巾替她擦臉，牙醫也很溫柔地對待她。","en":"My sister lost a tooth and cried until her face was covered in tears. I wiped her face with a towel, and the dentist treated her gently, too.","words":[{"en":"tooth","zh":"牙齒"},{"en":"towel","zh":"毛巾"},{"en":"treat(ment)","zh":"對待；治療"}]},{"id":"L1-U01","level":1,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"叔叔平常都把鑰匙放在制服口袋裡。今天他一直找到中午，才在椅子下面找到鑰匙。","en":"My uncle usually keeps his keys in the pocket of his uniform. Today he looked for them until noon and finally found them under a chair.","words":[{"en":"uncle","zh":"叔叔、伯伯、舅舅"},{"en":"under","zh":"在……下方"},{"en":"uniform","zh":"制服"},{"en":"until","zh":"直到"},{"en":"usually","zh":"通常"}]},{"id":"L1-U02","level":1,"letter":"U","n":2,"zh":"山路分成兩條，一條往上，一條往下。我用手機看地圖，這才看懂路牌。這張地圖真有用。","en":"The mountain road divides into two, one going up and one going down. I used the map on my phone, and then I could understand the road sign. This map is really useful.","words":[{"en":"understand","zh":"了解、明白"},{"en":"use","zh":"使用"},{"en":"useful","zh":"有用的"}]},{"id":"L1-V01","level":1,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"今天有幾位訪客來參觀我們的學校。菜園裡的蔬菜長得非常好，老師摘了一些送給他們。","en":"Today several visitors came to visit our school. The vegetables in the garden are growing very well, so the teacher picked some for them.","words":[{"en":"vegetable","zh":"蔬菜"},{"en":"visit","zh":"拜訪、參觀"},{"en":"visitor","zh":"訪客、遊客"}]},{"id":"L1-V02","level":1,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"影片裡的女孩正在拉小提琴。旁邊有人輕聲數拍子，我認出了外公的聲音。","en":"The girl in the video is playing the violin. Someone beside her is counting the beat in a low voice, and I knew it was my grandfather's voice.","words":[{"en":"video","zh":"影片"},{"en":"violin","zh":"小提琴"},{"en":"voice","zh":"聲音、嗓音"}]},{"id":"L1-W01","level":1,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"我想走路去海邊看日出，就先叫醒弟弟。爸爸已經在門口等我們了。","en":"I wanted to walk to the beach to watch the sunrise, so I woke my brother first. Dad was already waiting for us at the door.","words":[{"en":"wait","zh":"等"},{"en":"wake","zh":"醒來；叫醒"},{"en":"walk","zh":"走路、步行"},{"en":"want","zh":"想要"},{"en":"watch","zh":"看；手錶"}]},{"id":"L1-W02","level":1,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"風從窗戶吹進來，牆上的畫開始晃動。我看著那幅畫。畫裡的小孩好像在向我揮手。","en":"The wind blew in through the window, and the picture on the wall started to move. I watched the picture. The child in it seemed to wave at me.","words":[{"en":"wall","zh":"牆"},{"en":"watch","zh":"看；手錶"},{"en":"wave","zh":"波浪；揮手"},{"en":"win","zh":"贏"},{"en":"wind","zh":"風"},{"en":"window","zh":"窗戶、窗子"}]},{"id":"L1-W03","level":1,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"小狗昨天很虛弱，我給牠水喝，讓牠睡在溫暖的房間。今天牠看起來已經很健康了。","en":"The puppy was weak yesterday, so I gave it water and let it sleep in a warm room. Today it already looks well.","words":[{"en":"warm","zh":"溫暖的"},{"en":"water","zh":"水"},{"en":"weak","zh":"弱的、虛弱的"},{"en":"well","zh":"很好地；（身體）健康的"}]},{"id":"L1-W04","level":1,"letter":"W","n":4,"zh":"我們在西門歡迎新同學。去教室的路上有一條很寬的走廊，我們可以並肩走。","en":"We welcomed our new classmates at the west gate. On the way to the classroom there is a wide hallway, and we can walk side by side.","words":[{"en":"walk","zh":"走路、步行"},{"en":"way","zh":"路；方法"},{"en":"welcome","zh":"歡迎"},{"en":"west","zh":"西方"},{"en":"wide","zh":"寬的"}]},{"id":"L1-W05","level":1,"letter":"W","n":5,"zh":"這個星期天氣多變，我連穿了三天雨鞋。到了週末，操場還是濕的。","en":"The weather kept changing this week, and I wore rain boots for three days in a row. By the weekend, the playground was still wet.","words":[{"en":"wear","zh":"穿、戴"},{"en":"weather","zh":"天氣"},{"en":"week","zh":"星期、週"},{"en":"weekend","zh":"週末"},{"en":"wet","zh":"濕的"}]},{"id":"L1-W06","level":1,"letter":"W","n":6,"zh":"我們要帶什麼？什麼時候出發，在哪裡集合？我還不知道妹妹是否會來。哪一個便當盒是她的？","en":"What should we bring? When do we leave, and where do we meet? I don't know whether my sister will come yet. Which lunch box is hers?","words":[{"en":"whether","zh":"是否、不論"}]},{"id":"L1-W07","level":1,"letter":"W","n":7,"zh":"我在收書包的時候，發現門口有雙白鞋。這是誰的鞋？誰放在這裡的？為什麼只有一隻有鞋帶？","en":"While I was packing my schoolbag, I saw a pair of white shoes at the door. Whose shoes are these? Who put them here? Why does only one have a shoelace?","words":[{"en":"while","zh":"當……的時候、雖然"},{"en":"white","zh":"白色的"},{"en":"whose","zh":"誰的"}]},{"id":"L1-W08","level":1,"letter":"W","n":8,"zh":"明天舅舅將和他的妻子一起參加划船比賽。他們很想贏，我祝他們好運。","en":"Tomorrow my uncle will take part in a boat race with his wife. They really want to win, and I wish them good luck.","words":[{"en":"want","zh":"想要"},{"en":"wife","zh":"妻子、太太"},{"en":"win","zh":"贏"},{"en":"wish","zh":"希望、願望"}]},{"id":"L1-W09","level":1,"letter":"W","n":9,"zh":"故事裡有個有智慧的女人，她帶孩子們去看世界。他們一起看了許多很棒的地方。現在孩子們也能自己旅行，不用她陪。","en":"In the story there is a wise woman, and she takes the children to see the world. Together they see many wonderful places. Now the children can travel by themselves without her.","words":[{"en":"wise","zh":"明智的"},{"en":"without","zh":"沒有"},{"en":"woman","zh":"女人"},{"en":"wonderful","zh":"很棒的、美好的"},{"en":"world","zh":"世界"}]},{"id":"L1-W10","level":1,"letter":"W","n":10,"zh":"爸爸和其他工人還在橋上工作。爸爸這麼晚還沒回家，媽媽很擔心。她留了一盞燈給他。","en":"Dad and the other workers are still working on the bridge. Dad is not home yet at this late hour, and Mom is worried. She left a light on for him.","words":[{"en":"work","zh":"工作"},{"en":"worker","zh":"工人、員工"},{"en":"worry","zh":"擔心"}]},{"id":"L1-W11","level":1,"letter":"W","n":11,"zh":"我想當作家，每晚都寫一小段故事。妹妹發現我用錯一個字，還幫我圈起來。","en":"I want to be a writer, so I write a short part of a story every night. My sister found that I used a wrong word and circled it for me.","words":[{"en":"want","zh":"想要"},{"en":"word","zh":"字、詞"},{"en":"write","zh":"寫"},{"en":"writer","zh":"作家"},{"en":"wrong","zh":"錯的"}]},{"id":"L1-Y01","level":1,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"我年輕時，每年都和爺爺在庭院裡種花。他最喜歡黃色的花，我就把它們種在門口。","en":"When I was young, I planted flowers in the yard with my grandfather every year. He liked yellow flowers best, so I planted them by the door.","words":[{"en":"yard","zh":"院子；碼"},{"en":"year","zh":"年"},{"en":"yellow","zh":"黃色的"},{"en":"young","zh":"年輕的"}]},{"id":"L1-Y02","level":1,"letter":"Y","n":2,"zh":"你昨天去圖書館了嗎？是的，我借了一本書，但還沒看完。","en":"Did you go to the library yesterday? Yes, I borrowed a book, but I have not finished it yet.","words":[{"en":"yes/yeah","zh":"是"},{"en":"yesterday","zh":"昨天"},{"en":"yet","zh":"還（沒）；已經（問句）"}]},{"id":"L1-Z01","level":1,"letter":"Z","n":1,"zh":"我們在動物園記錄企鵝的數量。我數水裡的，弟弟數岸上的。他那一欄的數字是零。","en":"We recorded the number of penguins at the zoo. I counted the ones in the water, and my brother counted the ones on land. The number in his column was zero.","words":[{"en":"zero","zh":"零"},{"en":"zoo","zh":"動物園"}]},{"id":"L2-A01","level":2,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"老師問小青昨天為什麼缺席。聽完她對那場事故的描述，我才承認自己把她缺席的原因說錯了。","en":"The teacher asked Xiao-Qing why she was absent yesterday. After listening to her description of the accident, I admitted that I had given the wrong reason for her absence.","words":[{"en":"absence","zh":"缺席、缺乏"},{"en":"absent","zh":"缺席的、不在的"},{"en":"accident","zh":"意外、事故"},{"en":"admit","zh":"承認；讓……住院"}]},{"id":"L2-A02","level":2,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"阿姨是社區裡很活躍的一員。這次她接受我們的邀請，來參加一場讓小孩和成年人一起玩的活動。","en":"My aunt is a very active member of the community. This time she accepted our invitation to join an activity where children and adults play together.","words":[{"en":"accept","zh":"接受、承認"},{"en":"active","zh":"活躍的、起作用的"},{"en":"activity","zh":"活動、行動"},{"en":"adult","zh":"成人"}]},{"id":"L2-A03","level":2,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"小安用加法算出我們總共有三十元。等大家把錢放在桌上，我們才發現實際的金額是四十元，平均每人有八元。","en":"Xiao-An used addition and found that we had thirty dollars in total. When everyone put their money on the table, we found that the actual amount was forty dollars, so the average was eight dollars for each person.","words":[{"en":"actual","zh":"真實的、實際的"},{"en":"addition","zh":"加法；增加"},{"en":"amount","zh":"總數、總額"},{"en":"average","zh":"平均的、中等的"}]},{"id":"L2-A04","level":2,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"為了安排客人抵達後的行程，我們提前走了一遍預定的路線。出門前，我把旅館地址寫在每張地圖上。","en":"To arrange the schedule for our guests after their arrival, we walked the planned route in advance. Before we left, I wrote the hotel's address on every map.","words":[{"en":"address","zh":"地址；演說、處理"},{"en":"advance","zh":"前進、進展"},{"en":"arrange(ment)","zh":"安排、排列"},{"en":"arrival","zh":"到達、抵達"}]},{"id":"L2-A05","level":2,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"我們的目標是讓整隊在天黑前抵達營地。隊長聽了嚮導的忠告，決定在他的幫助下沿著河岸前進。","en":"Our aim was to get the whole team to the camp before dark. The captain listened to the guide's advice and decided to go along the riverbank with his assistance.","words":[{"en":"advice","zh":"忠告、勸告"},{"en":"aim","zh":"目標；瞄準"}]},{"id":"L2-A06","level":2,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"砍樹的事件影響了全校。兩名同學對這件事有不同看法，爭論了起來。反對砍樹的同學努力壓住怒氣，讓對方先說完。","en":"The tree-cutting affected the whole school. Two students had different opinions about it and started to argue. The student against cutting the trees tried hard to control his anger and let the other student finish first.","words":[{"en":"affect","zh":"影響"},{"en":"against","zh":"反對、對著"},{"en":"anger","zh":"憤怒"},{"en":"argue(argument)","zh":"爭論、主張"}]},{"id":"L2-A07","level":2,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"警報響起後，一架搜救用的航空器飛進山區。獨自在山上過夜的登山客還活著，他試著揮動紅外套，讓飛行員看見他。","en":"After the alarm went off, a rescue aircraft flew into the mountains. The hiker who had spent the night alone on the mountain was still alive, and he tried to wave his red jacket so the pilot could see him.","words":[{"en":"aircraft","zh":"航空器、飛機"},{"en":"alarm","zh":"警報、鬧鐘；驚慌"},{"en":"alive","zh":"活著的、活潑的"},{"en":"alone","zh":"獨自地"}]},{"id":"L2-A08","level":2,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"在相簿裡所有的照片之中，我最喜歡外公和他哥哥那張。他們年輕時外貌很相似，連媽媽都分不出來。","en":"Among all the photos in the album, I like the one of my grandfather and his brother best. They looked so alike when they were young that even my mother cannot tell them apart.","words":[{"en":"album","zh":"相簿、專輯"},{"en":"alike","zh":"相像的、同樣地"},{"en":"among","zh":"在……之中"}]},{"id":"L2-A09","level":2,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"老師請我大聲朗讀一篇介紹本地藝術家的文章。讀到一半，作者的一個問題吸引了全班的注意：「如果畫裡的人會說話，他想告訴你什麼？」","en":"The teacher asked me to read aloud an article about a local artist. Halfway through, a question from the author caught the attention of the whole class: \\"If the person in the painting could talk, what would he want to tell you?\\"","words":[{"en":"aloud","zh":"出聲地、大聲地"},{"en":"article","zh":"文章；冠詞"},{"en":"artist","zh":"藝術家、畫家"},{"en":"attention","zh":"注意、注意力"},{"en":"author","zh":"作者、作家"}]},{"id":"L2-A10","level":2,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"博物館展出一支古代軍隊留下的箭。從側面看過去，才能看清楚它射進木板時的角度。","en":"The museum shows an arrow left by an ancient army. Only from the side can you clearly see the angle at which it hit the wooden board.","words":[{"en":"ancient","zh":"古代的、古老的"},{"en":"angle","zh":"角、角度"},{"en":"army","zh":"軍隊、陸軍"},{"en":"arrow","zh":"箭、箭頭"}]},{"id":"L2-A11","level":2,"letter":"A","n":11,"zh":"妹妹擦傷腳踝，教練幫她塗上藥膏。她很感謝教練的幫忙，也答應今天會避免再跑跳。","en":"My sister scraped her ankle, and the coach put some ointment on it. She appreciated the coach's help and promised to avoid running and jumping today.","words":[{"en":"ankle","zh":"腳踝"},{"en":"appreciate","zh":"感謝；欣賞"},{"en":"avoid","zh":"避免、防止"}]},{"id":"L2-A12","level":2,"letter":"A","n":12,"zh":"哥哥說這台相機現在沒人用，我隨時都能借，也能帶去任何地方。不管怎樣，我都得在星期五之前還給他。","en":"My brother said nobody uses this camera now, so I can borrow it anytime and take it anywhere. Anyhow, I have to give it back to him before Friday.","words":[{"en":"anytime","zh":"任何時候"},{"en":"anywhere/anyplace","zh":"無論何處"}]},{"id":"L2-A13","level":2,"letter":"A","n":13,"zh":"飼育員靠近時，那隻小猿還睡著。牠醒來後胃口很好，一下就吃完了午餐。","en":"The little ape was still asleep when the keeper came near. When it woke up, it had a good appetite and finished its lunch quickly.","words":[{"en":"ape","zh":"猿"},{"en":"appetite","zh":"食慾、慾望"},{"en":"asleep","zh":"睡著的"}]},{"id":"L2-B01","level":2,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"打羽毛球時，我向後跨了一步，踩到場邊的背包。那一步讓我整個人往後倒，好不容易才恢復平衡。","en":"While playing badminton, I took a step backward and stepped on a backpack by the court. That step made me fall backward, and I finally got my balance back.","words":[{"en":"backpack","zh":"背包"},{"en":"backward","zh":"向後地、相反地"},{"en":"backward/backwards","zh":"向後地、相反地"},{"en":"badminton","zh":"羽毛球"},{"en":"balance","zh":"平衡；餘額"}]},{"id":"L2-B02","level":2,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"叔叔的麵包店每天早上烤兩種麵包。我挑了一個美式比司吉，妹妹拿了一個小圓麵包，抹上一點點奶油。","en":"My uncle's bakery bakes two kinds of bread every morning. I picked an American biscuit, and my sister took a small bun and put a little butter on it.","words":[{"en":"bake","zh":"烘焙、烤"},{"en":"bakery","zh":"麵包店"},{"en":"biscuit","zh":"餅乾"},{"en":"bun","zh":"小麵包"}]},{"id":"L2-B03","level":2,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"妹妹在陽台上放開了氣球。它飄到樹枝旁，一碰到尖刺就爆開了。","en":"My sister let go of the balloon on the balcony. It floated next to a branch and burst as soon as it touched a sharp thorn.","words":[{"en":"balcony","zh":"陽臺"},{"en":"balloon","zh":"氣球"},{"en":"branch","zh":"樹枝；分店"},{"en":"burst","zh":"破裂、突發"}]},{"id":"L2-B04","level":2,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"在河邊烤肉時，爸爸到岸邊的酒吧買飲料。回來一看，帳單上多了一杯他沒點的啤酒，他就拿著單子回去問店員。","en":"At a barbecue by the river, Dad went to the bar on the bank to buy drinks. When he came back, he saw a beer on the bill that he did not order, so he took the bill back to ask the clerk.","words":[{"en":"bar","zh":"酒吧；條、棒"},{"en":"barbecue","zh":"烤肉"},{"en":"beer","zh":"啤酒"},{"en":"bill","zh":"帳單；鈔票"}]},{"id":"L2-B05","level":2,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"老家的牆上掛著兩張照片。一張是外公年輕時當理髮師，正替客人修鬍子的樣子。另一張是外婆的婚紗照，外公說她的美貌讓他一見難忘。","en":"Two photos hang on the wall of our old house. One shows my grandfather as a young barber, trimming a customer's beard. The other is my grandmother's wedding photo. Grandpa says her beauty made him unable to forget her at first sight.","words":[{"en":"barber","zh":"理髮師"},{"en":"beard","zh":"鬍鬚"},{"en":"beauty","zh":"美、美人"}]},{"id":"L2-B06","level":2,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"我正要幫小狗洗澡，牠就對著水管叫。我拜託哥哥過來幫忙，他一到，小狗就乖乖守規矩了。","en":"I was about to give the puppy a bath when it started barking at the hose. I begged my brother to come and help, and as soon as he arrived, the puppy began to behave.","words":[{"en":"bark","zh":"（狗）吠；樹皮"},{"en":"beg","zh":"乞求、乞討"},{"en":"behave","zh":"表現、行為舉止"}]},{"id":"L2-B07","level":2,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"初學者要先學製陶的基礎。老師說，最基本的一步是把杯子的底部壓平，這也是做好整個杯子的基礎。","en":"Beginners must first learn the basics of making pottery. The teacher said the most basic step is to press the bottom of the cup flat, and this is also the basis for making the whole cup well.","words":[{"en":"basic","zh":"基本的"},{"en":"basics","zh":"基礎、基本原理"},{"en":"basis","zh":"基礎、根據"},{"en":"beginner","zh":"初學者"}]},{"id":"L2-B08","level":2,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"爺爺說，以前有一場戰役就發生在國境附近。沿著河走，過了第一個轉彎處，就能看到橋那一邊的舊城牆。","en":"Grandpa said a battle once happened near the border. If you walk along the river past the first bend, you can see the old city wall on the other side of the bridge.","words":[{"en":"battle","zh":"戰役"},{"en":"bend","zh":"彎曲、彎腰"},{"en":"border","zh":"邊緣、邊境"}]},{"id":"L2-B09","level":2,"letter":"B","n":9,"zh":"老師在黑板上畫了四個空白方格，每一格代表一個拍子。我指著方格，跟著拍手唱歌，這次比上次唱得更好了。","en":"The teacher drew four blank boxes on the blackboard, and each box stood for one beat. I pointed at the boxes, clapped, and sang along. This time I sang better than last time.","words":[{"en":"beat","zh":"打、拍打"},{"en":"better","zh":"較好的"},{"en":"blackboard","zh":"黑板"},{"en":"blank","zh":"空白的、空虛的"}]},{"id":"L2-B10","level":2,"letter":"B","n":10,"zh":"姊姊始終相信地球以外也有生命。她望著星空問我：「如果那裡有十億顆行星，上面會住著什麼樣的生物呢？」","en":"My sister has always believed there is life beyond the earth. Looking at the starry sky, she asked me, \\"If there are a billion planets out there, what kind of beings live on them?\\"","words":[{"en":"being","zh":"存在；生物"},{"en":"beyond","zh":"超過、在那一邊"},{"en":"billion","zh":"十億"}]},{"id":"L2-B11","level":2,"letter":"B","n":11,"zh":"弟弟出生後沒多久，爸爸就第一次抱了他。他的小毯子上沾了一點血，護理師替他換了一條乾淨的。爸爸到現在還留著記錄弟弟出生時間的卡片。","en":"Soon after my brother's birth, Dad held him for the first time. There was a little blood on his small blanket, so the nurse gave him a clean one. Dad still keeps the card that recorded the time of my brother's birth.","words":[{"en":"birth","zh":"出生、起源"},{"en":"blanket","zh":"毛毯、毯子"},{"en":"blood","zh":"血、血液"}]},{"id":"L2-B12","level":2,"letter":"B","n":12,"zh":"弟弟上車後才發現球袋還在球場。他責怪自己，又不想打擾隊長。隊長說：「別一個人扛這個重擔。我陪你回去找。」","en":"My brother got on the bus and then found that his ball bag was still at the court. He blamed himself and did not want to bother the captain. The captain said, \\"Don't carry this burden alone. I will go back and look for it with you.\\"","words":[{"en":"blame","zh":"責備、歸咎於"},{"en":"bother","zh":"打擾、煩擾"},{"en":"burden","zh":"負擔"}]},{"id":"L2-B13","level":2,"letter":"B","n":13,"zh":"媽媽把骨頭放進鍋裡熬湯。等水滾了，她讓我把火轉小，並提醒我別讓蒸氣燙傷手。","en":"Mom put some bones in a pot to boil soup. When the water was boiling, she let me turn down the heat and reminded me not to let the steam burn my hand.","words":[{"en":"boil","zh":"煮沸、沸騰"},{"en":"bone","zh":"骨頭、骨"},{"en":"burn","zh":"燃燒；燒傷"}]},{"id":"L2-B14","level":2,"letter":"B","n":14,"zh":"一位商人帶著自己設計的筆記本來到我們的書店。媽媽認得封底的商標，原來這是她小時候最喜歡的牌子。","en":"A businessman came to our bookstore with notebooks he had designed himself. Mom recognized the brand on the back cover. It turned out to be her favorite brand when she was a child.","words":[{"en":"bookstore","zh":"書店"},{"en":"brand","zh":"品牌"},{"en":"businessman","zh":"商人"}]},{"id":"L2-B15","level":2,"letter":"B","n":15,"zh":"一位才華出眾的老師來學校做了一場簡短的演講。她讓我們閉上眼睛想像回家的路，再解釋大腦怎麼記住那些街道。","en":"A brilliant teacher came to our school and gave a brief speech. She asked us to close our eyes and imagine the way home, and then she explained how the brain remembers those streets.","words":[{"en":"brain","zh":"腦"},{"en":"brief","zh":"簡短的、短暫的"},{"en":"brilliant","zh":"出色的；明亮的"}]},{"id":"L2-B16","level":2,"letter":"B","n":16,"zh":"那棟建築物有一面很寬的牆。美術老師拿起一把大刷子，只刷了幾下，白牆上就出現了一片藍色的海。","en":"That building has a very broad wall. The art teacher picked up a big brush, and with only a few strokes, a blue sea appeared on the white wall.","words":[{"en":"broad","zh":"寬廣的、遼闊的"},{"en":"brush","zh":"刷子；刷"},{"en":"building","zh":"建築物、建築"}]},{"id":"L2-C01","level":2,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"鄉間有家咖啡館，每天中午都賣高麗菜玉米湯。那天我們只帶了現金，剛好夠買兩碗。","en":"There is a cafe in the countryside that sells cabbage and corn soup every day at noon. That day we only brought cash, and it was just enough for two bowls.","words":[{"en":"cabbage","zh":"高麗菜"},{"en":"café/cafe","zh":"咖啡館"},{"en":"cash","zh":"現金"},{"en":"corn","zh":"玉米"},{"en":"countryside","zh":"鄉下、鄉間"}]},{"id":"L2-C02","level":2,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"我們在獸醫院看見一隻駱駝，牠一聽到隔壁籠子的鏈條聲就站了起來。飼育員陪在旁邊，等牠平靜下來才離開。","en":"At the animal hospital we saw a camel. It stood up as soon as it heard the sound of a chain from the next cage. The keeper stayed beside it and did not leave until it calmed down.","words":[{"en":"cage","zh":"籠子"},{"en":"calm","zh":"冷靜的；使平靜"},{"en":"camel","zh":"駱駝"},{"en":"chain","zh":"鏈子；連鎖"}]},{"id":"L2-C03","level":2,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"我看了行事曆，發現班遊和校慶的日期有衝突。老師請我聯絡遊覽車公司，看看能不能改期，這樣就不用取消班遊了。","en":"I looked at the calendar and found that the date of our class trip and the school anniversary were in conflict. The teacher asked me to contact the bus company to see if we could change the date, so we would not have to cancel the trip.","words":[{"en":"calendar","zh":"日曆、日程表"},{"en":"cancel","zh":"取消、刪去"},{"en":"company","zh":"公司；陪伴"},{"en":"conflict","zh":"衝突"},{"en":"contact","zh":"聯絡；接觸"}]},{"id":"L2-C04","level":2,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"阿姨結束癌症治療後回來繼續教書。我們點起蛋糕上的蠟燭，向她道賀。她讀著卡片說，很謝謝大家這段時間的關心。","en":"My aunt came back to teach after she finished her cancer treatment. We lit the candles on the cake to congratulate her. Reading the card, she said she was very thankful for everyone's care during this time.","words":[{"en":"cancer","zh":"癌症"},{"en":"candle","zh":"蠟燭"},{"en":"chopstick(s)","zh":"筷子"},{"en":"comic(s)","zh":"漫畫；滑稽的"},{"en":"congratulation(s)","zh":"祝賀、恭喜"}]},{"id":"L2-C05","level":2,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"首都的中央廣場旁有一座古堡。導遊說，這座城堡是在五個多世紀前蓋好的。","en":"There is an old castle beside the central square of the capital. The guide said the castle was finished more than five centuries ago.","words":[{"en":"capital","zh":"首都；大寫字母；資本"},{"en":"castle","zh":"城堡"},{"en":"central","zh":"中央的、主要的"},{"en":"century","zh":"世紀"}]},{"id":"L2-C06","level":2,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"我轉到卡通頻道，剛好看到一隻貓追著一隻老鼠跑。看到最緊張的地方，電視卻開始播可樂的廣告。","en":"I changed to the cartoon channel and saw a cat chasing a mouse. At the most exciting moment, the TV started to show a commercial for cola.","words":[{"en":"cartoon","zh":"卡通、漫畫"},{"en":"channel","zh":"頻道；海峽"},{"en":"chase","zh":"追逐、追求"},{"en":"cola/Coke","zh":"可樂"},{"en":"commercial","zh":"商業的；（電視）廣告"}]},{"id":"L2-C07","level":2,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"大雨過後，老師來看教室的狀況。天花板上有一道長十公分的裂縫，原來這就是漏水的原因。","en":"After the heavy rain, the teacher came to check the classroom. There was a crack ten centimeters long in the ceiling. That was the cause of the leak.","words":[{"en":"cause","zh":"原因；造成"},{"en":"ceiling","zh":"天花板"},{"en":"centimeter","zh":"公分"}]},{"id":"L2-C08","level":2,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"老師用粉筆在黑板上畫了一張圖表，讓我們記錄看到的細胞數量。我們用一種化學藥品把細胞染色，再輪流透過顯微鏡觀察。","en":"The teacher drew a chart on the blackboard with chalk so we could record the number of cells we saw. We dyed the cells with a chemical and took turns looking at them through a microscope.","words":[{"en":"cell","zh":"細胞；小牢房"},{"en":"chalk","zh":"粉筆"},{"en":"chart","zh":"圖表；病歷"},{"en":"chemical","zh":"化學的；化學物質"}]},{"id":"L2-C09","level":2,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"我打開櫃子，看到一隻蟑螂從架子上爬過。還好裝麥片的盒子有蓋緊，標籤上寫著裡面含有可可粉。","en":"I opened the cabinet and saw a cockroach crawling across the shelf. Luckily, the box of cereal was closed tightly. The label said it contained cocoa powder.","words":[{"en":"cereal","zh":"麥片、穀類食品"},{"en":"cockroach/roach","zh":"蟑螂"},{"en":"cocoa","zh":"可可"},{"en":"contain","zh":"包含、容納"}]},{"id":"L2-C10","level":2,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"小明很有信心，聲稱沒人下西洋棋贏得了他。妹妹接受他的挑戰，先約好誰都不能偷看手機作弊。","en":"Xiao-Ming was confident and claimed that nobody could beat him at chess. My sister accepted his challenge, and they first agreed that no one could cheat by looking at a phone.","words":[{"en":"challenge","zh":"挑戰"},{"en":"cheat","zh":"欺騙、作弊"},{"en":"chess","zh":"西洋棋"},{"en":"claim","zh":"聲稱；要求"},{"en":"confident","zh":"有信心的、有把握的"}]},{"id":"L2-C11","level":2,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"我讀的那本經典名著，第一章就出現了我最喜歡的角色。部落首領命令他留在村裡，他卻趁夜出去找人。","en":"In the classic novel I am reading, my favorite character appears in the first chapter. The chief of the tribe commanded him to stay in the village, but he went out at night to look for someone.","words":[{"en":"chapter","zh":"章"},{"en":"character","zh":"個性；角色；文字"},{"en":"chief","zh":"主要的；首領"},{"en":"classic","zh":"經典的；經典作品"},{"en":"command","zh":"命令、指揮"}]},{"id":"L2-C12","level":2,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"這台小火車每次收費十元。我投了一枚硬幣，聽到開關扣上的輕響，就轉動車上的旋鈕控制車速。","en":"This little train charges ten dollars each time. I put in a coin, heard the soft click of the switch, and turned the control knob to change the speed.","words":[{"en":"charge","zh":"收費；充電；指控"},{"en":"click","zh":"點擊；喀噠聲"},{"en":"coin","zh":"硬幣"},{"en":"control","zh":"控制、管理"}]},{"id":"L2-C13","level":2,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"同班同學在台上第一次演奏古典音樂。一曲結束，我們一起拍手，還有人站起來為她歡呼。","en":"My classmate played classical music on stage for the first time. When the piece ended, we all clapped, and some people stood up to cheer for her.","words":[{"en":"cheer","zh":"歡呼、喝彩"},{"en":"clap","zh":"拍手、鼓掌"},{"en":"classic","zh":"經典的；經典作品"},{"en":"classical","zh":"古典的"},{"en":"classmate","zh":"同班同學"}]},{"id":"L2-C14","level":2,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"翻到童年畫的漫畫，我忍不住笑了。那時我覺得梳頭髮很幼稚，所以把每個大人的梳子都畫成一條魚。","en":"I couldn't help laughing when I found the comics I drew in my childhood. Back then I thought combing my hair was childish, so I drew every adult's comb as a fish.","words":[{"en":"childhood","zh":"孩童時期"},{"en":"childish","zh":"幼稚的、孩子氣的"},{"en":"chopstick(s)","zh":"筷子"},{"en":"comb","zh":"梳子；梳"},{"en":"comic(s)","zh":"漫畫；滑稽的"},{"en":"congratulation(s)","zh":"祝賀、恭喜"}]},{"id":"L2-C15","level":2,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"姑姑從中國旅行回來，帶回一套瓷器和一雙筷子。包著瓷器的那塊藍布很漂亮，妹妹想拿來做娃娃的衣服。","en":"My aunt came back from a trip to China with a set of china and a pair of chopsticks. The blue cloth around the china was so pretty that my sister wanted to use it to make clothes for her doll.","words":[{"en":"china","zh":"瓷器"},{"en":"chopstick(s)","zh":"筷子"},{"en":"cloth","zh":"布料、織品"}]},{"id":"L2-C16","level":2,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"念大學的哥哥想出一個聰明的辦法，把兩個實驗結合起來。原本很複雜的作業，他一個下午就完成了。","en":"My brother in college came up with a clever way to combine two experiments. He finished a very complex assignment in one afternoon.","words":[{"en":"clever","zh":"聰明的、精明的"},{"en":"college","zh":"學院、大學"},{"en":"combine","zh":"結合、聯合"},{"en":"complex","zh":"複雜的"}]},{"id":"L2-C17","level":2,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"老師讓我們比較海岸和山區的氣候。我挑了兩地同一天的照片，山區是陰天，海邊卻一片晴朗。老師提醒我還得看看多年的紀錄。","en":"The teacher asked us to compare the climate of the coast and the mountains. I chose photos of both places on the same day. It was cloudy in the mountains, but it was clear by the sea. The teacher reminded me to check the records of many years, too.","words":[{"en":"climate","zh":"氣候"},{"en":"cloudy","zh":"多雲的"},{"en":"coast","zh":"海岸"},{"en":"compare","zh":"比較"}]},{"id":"L2-C18","level":2,"letter":"C","n":18,"zh":"我看到一張舊照片，裡面的小黑山旁停著好幾輛貨車。我讀到那家公司以前專門運煤，才推斷出黑山其實是一堆煤。","en":"I saw an old photo with several trucks parked beside a small black hill. I read that the company used to carry coal, so I concluded that the black hill was really a pile of coal.","words":[{"en":"coal","zh":"煤"},{"en":"company","zh":"公司；陪伴"},{"en":"conclude","zh":"下結論；結束"}]},{"id":"L2-C19","level":2,"letter":"C","n":19,"zh":"我們和客服談話時，爸爸說家裡的網路連線一直中斷。對方請我們考慮新的合約，爸爸說他還得把費用列入考量。","en":"While we were talking with customer service, Dad said the internet connection at home kept stopping. They asked us to consider a new contract, and Dad said he still had to take the cost into consideration.","words":[{"en":"connection","zh":"連接、關係"},{"en":"consider","zh":"考慮、思考"},{"en":"consideration","zh":"考慮；體貼"},{"en":"contract","zh":"合約"},{"en":"custom","zh":"習俗；海關（customs）"},{"en":"customer","zh":"顧客"}]},{"id":"L2-C20","level":2,"letter":"C","n":20,"zh":"一對夫妻親眼看見那起犯罪。妻子害怕在法庭上開口，丈夫陪她走進去，她才鼓起勇氣說出經過。","en":"A married couple saw the crime with their own eyes. The wife was afraid to speak in court. Her husband walked in with her, and then she found the courage to tell what happened.","words":[{"en":"couple","zh":"一對；夫婦、情侶"},{"en":"courage","zh":"勇氣、膽量"},{"en":"court","zh":"法院、庭院"},{"en":"crime","zh":"犯罪、罪行"}]},{"id":"L2-C21","level":2,"letter":"C","n":21,"zh":"弟弟用蠟筆創造了一個西部小鎮。他畫了一個牛仔站在窗前拉開窗簾，外頭有隻烏鴉正叼著他的帽子。","en":"My brother created a western town with crayons. He drew a cowboy standing at the window and opening the curtain. Outside, a crow was holding his hat in its mouth.","words":[{"en":"cowboy","zh":"牛仔"},{"en":"crayon","zh":"蠟筆"},{"en":"create","zh":"創造"},{"en":"crow","zh":"烏鴉；（公雞）啼"},{"en":"curtain","zh":"窗簾、布幕"}]},{"id":"L2-C22","level":2,"letter":"C","n":22,"zh":"一位顧客看見一排小鳥形狀的麵包，很好奇裡面包了什麼餡。店主切開一個，給她看裡頭的鮮奶油。在他的家鄉，春天烤這種麵包是一項習俗。","en":"A customer saw a row of bird-shaped buns and was curious about what was inside. The owner cut one open and showed her the cream inside. In his hometown, baking these buns in spring is a custom.","words":[{"en":"cream","zh":"奶油、乳霜"},{"en":"curious","zh":"好奇的"},{"en":"custom","zh":"習俗；海關（customs）"},{"en":"customer","zh":"顧客"}]},{"id":"L2-C23","level":2,"letter":"C","n":23,"zh":"人群跟著鼓聲走到廣場，參加週末的文化交流活動。奶奶說，小時候她就是透過這些歌認識家鄉的文化。","en":"The crowd followed the drums to the square to join the weekend cultural exchange. Grandma said she learned about the culture of her hometown through these songs when she was little.","words":[{"en":"crow","zh":"烏鴉；（公雞）啼"},{"en":"crowd","zh":"人群"},{"en":"cultural","zh":"文化的"},{"en":"culture","zh":"文化"}]},{"id":"L2-C24","level":2,"letter":"C","n":24,"zh":"在我們的故事裡，河水的水流帶走了最後幾顆花種，村子陷入危機。這種花能治癒怪病，而且開花週期長達一年，主角得趁種子漂進大海前找回來。","en":"In our story, the current of the river carried away the last few flower seeds, and the village was in crisis. This flower can cure a strange disease, and its cycle of blooming lasts a whole year, so the main character has to get the seeds back before they float into the sea.","words":[{"en":"character","zh":"個性；角色；文字"},{"en":"crisis","zh":"危機"},{"en":"cure","zh":"治癒、治療"},{"en":"current","zh":"現在的；水流、電流"},{"en":"cycle","zh":"週期、循環；騎腳踏車"}]},{"id":"L2-D01","level":2,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"颱風過後，我們每天記錄老樹掉了幾根樹枝。老師把數據交給園丁，請他評估老樹受損的程度。","en":"After the typhoon, we recorded how many branches the old tree lost every day. The teacher gave the data to the gardener and asked him to judge how much damage the tree had.","words":[{"en":"damage","zh":"損害、傷害"},{"en":"data","zh":"資料、數據"}]},{"id":"L2-D02","level":2,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"導演請一位聾人舞者參與學校的戲劇演出。兩人一起改了最後幾句對話，讓主角能用手語道別。","en":"The director asked a deaf dancer to take part in the school play. Together they changed the last few lines of dialogue so the main character could say goodbye in sign language.","words":[{"en":"dancer","zh":"舞者"},{"en":"deaf","zh":"聾的"},{"en":"dialogue","zh":"對話"},{"en":"director","zh":"導演；主管"}]},{"id":"L2-D03","level":2,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"爸爸先看見遠方山坡上的鹿，我只看得到幾個小點。等鹿走到路邊，他叫我保持距離，靠得太近會有危險。","en":"Dad saw the deer on the distant hill first, but I could only see a few small dots. When the deer came to the side of the road, he told me to keep my distance because getting too close was dangerous.","words":[{"en":"deer","zh":"鹿"},{"en":"distance","zh":"距離、遠方"},{"en":"distant","zh":"遙遠的"},{"en":"dot","zh":"點、圓點"}]},{"id":"L2-D04","level":2,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"班上為了校外教學的地點舉行辯論。兩組意見不合，於是先討論各地的車程。討論結束後，大家才投票做決定。","en":"Our class held a debate about where to go for the field trip. The two groups did not agree, so we first discussed the travel time to each place. After the discussion, we voted to make a decision.","words":[{"en":"debate","zh":"辯論、討論"},{"en":"decision","zh":"決定"},{"en":"discuss","zh":"討論、論述"},{"en":"discussion","zh":"討論"}]},{"id":"L2-D05","level":2,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"我上個月為了買自行車借了錢，今天第一筆款項到期了。如果我每週還的錢加倍，就能早點還清這筆債。","en":"Last month I borrowed money to buy a bicycle, and the first payment is due today. If I double the money I pay back each week, I can pay off this debt sooner.","words":[{"en":"debt","zh":"債務"},{"en":"double","zh":"兩倍的、雙重的"},{"en":"due","zh":"到期的；應得的"}]},{"id":"L2-D06","level":2,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"店家本來要在中午前把餐盒送到我們的部門，但大雨耽擱了司機的行程。這次外送晚了半小時，好在打開餐盒時，飯菜還熱著，吃起來也很美味。","en":"The shop was supposed to deliver the lunch boxes to our department before noon, but the heavy rain caused a delay for the driver. The delivery was half an hour late this time. Luckily, the food was still hot when we opened the boxes, and it was delicious.","words":[{"en":"delay","zh":"延遲、耽擱"},{"en":"delicious","zh":"美味的"},{"en":"deliver","zh":"遞送；發表（演說）"},{"en":"delivery","zh":"遞送、交付"},{"en":"department","zh":"部門、科系"}]},{"id":"L2-D07","level":2,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"牙醫問起我的飲食習慣，我否認自己每天吃糖。回家翻開日記，我才發現這星期每天都寫了自己吃哪一種糖。","en":"The dentist asked about my diet, and I denied eating candy every day. When I got home and opened my diary, I found that I had written down which kind of candy I ate every day this week.","words":[{"en":"dentist","zh":"牙醫"},{"en":"deny","zh":"否認、拒絕"},{"en":"diary","zh":"日記"},{"en":"diet","zh":"飲食；節食"}]},{"id":"L2-D08","level":2,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"沙漠裡的人仰賴一口老井取水。工人量井的深度時，發現井壁上有古老的圖畫。他們把這項發現告訴村長。","en":"People in the desert depend on an old well for water. When the workers measured the depth of the well, they discovered ancient pictures on the wall of the well. They told the village head about this discovery.","words":[{"en":"depend","zh":"依靠、取決於"},{"en":"depth","zh":"深度、深處"},{"en":"desert","zh":"沙漠；拋棄"},{"en":"discover","zh":"發現、找到"},{"en":"discovery","zh":"發現"}]},{"id":"L2-D09","level":2,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"我向櫃檯人員描述遺失的戒指，還提到一個細節。戒指內側有一顆星。我的描述剛好符合工作人員撿到的那枚鑽石戒指。","en":"I described my lost ring to the person at the counter and mentioned one detail. There is a star on the inside of the ring. My description matched the diamond ring that a worker had found.","words":[{"en":"describe","zh":"描述、描繪"},{"en":"description","zh":"描述、說明"},{"en":"detail","zh":"細節、詳情"},{"en":"diamond","zh":"鑽石"}]},{"id":"L2-D10","level":2,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"老師要我們設計一把椅子，我先畫了一張鉛筆素描。展覽當天，我把第一張草圖和成品一起展出，讓大家看看這個點子如何一步步發展。","en":"The teacher asked us to design a chair, and I drew a pencil sketch first. On the day of the show, I displayed my first draft with the finished chair so everyone could see how the idea developed step by step.","words":[{"en":"design","zh":"設計、圖樣"},{"en":"develop(ment)","zh":"發展、使發達"},{"en":"display","zh":"展示、顯示"}]},{"id":"L2-D11","level":2,"letter":"D","n":11,"zh":"爺爺從抽屜裡拿出兩支舊電話，問我看得出它們的差別嗎。我用按鍵電話撥號很順利，換成轉盤電話就遇到了困難。","en":"Grandpa took two old phones out of the drawer and asked me if I could see the difference between them. I had no problem dialing with the push-button phone, but I had difficulty with the rotary phone.","words":[{"en":"dial","zh":"撥（電話）；刻度盤"},{"en":"difference","zh":"不同、差異"},{"en":"difficulty","zh":"困難、難點"},{"en":"drawer","zh":"抽屜"}]},{"id":"L2-D12","level":2,"letter":"D","n":12,"zh":"地圖上的藍色小圓點代表國內線航廈。阿姨指引我們走到月台，還提醒我們上車前先看清列車行駛的方向。","en":"The small blue dot on the map stands for the domestic terminal. My aunt directed us to the platform and reminded us to check which direction the train was going before we got on.","words":[{"en":"direct","zh":"直接的；指導"},{"en":"direction","zh":"方向；指示"},{"en":"domestic","zh":"家庭的、國內的"},{"en":"dot","zh":"點、圓點"}]},{"id":"L2-D13","level":2,"letter":"D","n":13,"zh":"魔術師把一隻白鴿放進盒子。盒蓋再打開時，鴿子消失了。我不相信牠真的不見了，就跑到樓下，果然看見助手捧著那隻鳥。","en":"The magician put a white dove into a box. When the lid was opened again, the dove had disappeared. I didn't believe it was really gone, so I ran downstairs and saw the assistant holding the bird.","words":[{"en":"disappear","zh":"消失、不見"},{"en":"dove","zh":"鴿子"},{"en":"downstairs","zh":"在樓下"}]},{"id":"L2-D14","level":2,"letter":"D","n":14,"zh":"我下載了一個練習除法的遊戲。要過第一關，得把二十四塊餅乾平均分給六個小孩。","en":"I downloaded a game for practicing division. To pass the first level, I had to divide twenty-four cookies equally among six children.","words":[{"en":"divide","zh":"分開；除"},{"en":"division","zh":"分開；部門；除法"},{"en":"download","zh":"下載"}]},{"id":"L2-D15","level":2,"letter":"D","n":15,"zh":"學校的戲劇演出剛開始，一條龍就從煙裡探出頭來。牠的鱗片本來黯淡無光，燈一照下去，竟然變成了金色。","en":"The school play had just started when a dragon put its head out of the smoke. Its scales were dull at first, but when the light shone on them, they turned gold.","words":[{"en":"dragon","zh":"龍"},{"en":"dull","zh":"無聊的；鈍的"}]},{"id":"L2-D16","level":2,"letter":"D","n":16,"zh":"故事裡，全村的人都得了一種奇怪的疾病。年輕藥師認為找出能對付這種病的藥是自己的責任，便帶著老師的筆記上山找藥材。","en":"In the story, everyone in the village got a strange disease. The young pharmacist thought it was his duty to find a drug for this disease, so he took his teacher's notes and went up the mountain to look for herbs.","words":[{"en":"disease","zh":"疾病"},{"en":"drug","zh":"藥物；毒品"},{"en":"duty","zh":"責任、義務；關稅"}]},{"id":"L2-D17","level":2,"letter":"D","n":17,"zh":"球衣到晚上還沒乾，我拿去樓下放進烘衣機。幸好及時烘乾，第二天大家穿好球衣出發，沒有耽擱。","en":"The team shirts were still wet in the evening, so I took them downstairs and put them in the dryer. Luckily, they were dry in time. The next day everyone put on the shirts and left without delay.","words":[{"en":"delay","zh":"延遲、耽擱"},{"en":"downstairs","zh":"在樓下"},{"en":"dryer","zh":"烘乾機、吹風機"}]},{"id":"L2-E01","level":2,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"島的東部有座很高的山，山崖邊緣有個老鷹的巢。我特別喜歡清晨來這裡，看親鳥展翅飛出去。","en":"There is a high mountain in the eastern part of the island, and there is an eagle's nest at the edge of the cliff. I especially like coming here early in the morning to watch the parent birds spread their wings and fly out.","words":[{"en":"eagle","zh":"老鷹"},{"en":"earring(s)","zh":"耳環"},{"en":"eastern","zh":"東方的"},{"en":"edge","zh":"邊緣；刀刃"},{"en":"especially","zh":"尤其、特別"}]},{"id":"L2-E02","level":2,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"我靠週末打工賺到了第一份薪水，想替家裡一位長輩挑份禮物。奶奶愛戴耳環，我就選了一對她最喜歡的藍色耳環。","en":"I earned my first pay from a weekend job, and I wanted to choose a gift for an elder in my family. Grandma loves to wear earrings, so I chose a pair of blue earrings, her favorite color.","words":[{"en":"earn","zh":"賺（錢）、贏得"},{"en":"earring(s)","zh":"耳環"},{"en":"elder","zh":"年長的；長輩"}]},{"id":"L2-E03","level":2,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"地震過後，老師請我們用畫來表達自己的情緒。妹妹畫了兩道皺起的眉毛，那是她害怕時的表情。說起自己的畫，她心裡的恐懼也減輕了。","en":"After the earthquake, the teacher asked us to express our emotions with drawings. My sister drew two frowning eyebrows, which was her face when she was scared. As she talked about her drawing, her fear became smaller.","words":[{"en":"earthquake","zh":"地震"},{"en":"emotion","zh":"情緒、情感"},{"en":"express","zh":"表達、表示"},{"en":"eyebrow/brow","zh":"眉毛"}]},{"id":"L2-E04","level":2,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"新版課本寫了山裡的孩子怎麼爭取上學的機會。作者在書末強調，每個孩子都該有平等的受教育機會。","en":"The new edition of the textbook describes how children in the mountains fight for the chance to go to school. At the end of the book, the author stresses that every child should have an equal chance at education.","words":[{"en":"edition","zh":"版本、版"},{"en":"education","zh":"教育"},{"en":"equal","zh":"相等的、平等的"}]},{"id":"L2-E05","level":2,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"我快要停下來時，哥哥在跑道邊鼓勵我。他的話對我很有作用，我決定再努力一下。比起一開始就衝刺，慢慢起跑對我更有效。","en":"When I was about to stop, my brother encouraged me from the side of the track. His words had a strong effect on me, and I decided to try a little harder. Starting slowly is more effective for me than running fast from the start.","words":[{"en":"effect","zh":"效果、影響"},{"en":"effective","zh":"有效的"},{"en":"encourage(ment)","zh":"鼓勵"}]},{"id":"L2-E06","level":2,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"電動車從電池取得能量。爸爸的舊車則靠汽油驅動引擎。在修車廠，師傅指給我們看電動車裡的電路和其他電氣設備。","en":"An electric car gets its energy from a battery. Dad's old car uses gas to power its engine. At the garage, the mechanic showed us the electric circuits and other electrical equipment in the electric car.","words":[{"en":"earring(s)","zh":"耳環"},{"en":"electric","zh":"電的、電動的"},{"en":"electrical","zh":"電的、有關電的"},{"en":"energy","zh":"能量、精力"},{"en":"engine","zh":"引擎、發動機"}]},{"id":"L2-E07","level":2,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"巷口的麵包店剛僱用了我，現在我是店裡最年輕的員工。雇主說，如果我去別家分店幫忙，搭車的費用由店裡出。","en":"The bakery at the end of the lane just hired me, and now I am the youngest employee in the shop. My employer said the shop will pay for my bus fare if I go to help at another branch.","words":[{"en":"employ(ment)","zh":"僱用"},{"en":"employee","zh":"職員、員工"},{"en":"employer","zh":"僱主、老闆"}]},{"id":"L2-E08","level":2,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"閉館前，我從入口走到出口，找遍了整間展覽館。最後一間展覽室已經空了，妹妹原來早就在外面等我。","en":"Before the museum closed, I walked from the entrance to the exit and searched the entire hall. The last room was already empty. My sister had been waiting for me outside all along.","words":[{"en":"empty","zh":"空的"},{"en":"entire","zh":"整個的、全部的"},{"en":"entrance","zh":"入口；入學"},{"en":"exit","zh":"出口；離開"}]},{"id":"L2-E09","level":2,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"邪惡的國王把王子和公主鎖在塔裡。兩人原本是敵人，卻決定一起逃出去。我最喜歡這個結局，他們回來打開城門，讓所有人重獲自由。","en":"The evil king locked the prince and princess in a tower. The two had been enemies, but they decided to escape together. I like the ending best: they come back and open the city gate, and everyone is free again.","words":[{"en":"ending","zh":"結局、結尾"},{"en":"enemy","zh":"敵人"},{"en":"escape","zh":"逃脫、避開"},{"en":"evil","zh":"邪惡的；邪惡"}]},{"id":"L2-E10","level":2,"letter":"E","n":10,"zh":"我為了寫一篇談環境問題的短文，到河邊訪問一位專家。我們一起撿起水裡的塑膠袋，她讓我看見垃圾如何改變魚生活的環境。","en":"To write a short essay about environmental problems, I went to the river to interview an expert. We picked plastic bags out of the water together, and she showed me how trash changes the environment where fish live.","words":[{"en":"environment","zh":"環境"},{"en":"environmental","zh":"環境的"},{"en":"essay","zh":"短文、論說文"},{"en":"expert","zh":"專家"}]},{"id":"L2-E11","level":2,"letter":"E","n":11,"zh":"運動會是我們學校今年的一件大事。比賽前夕，老師公布接力賽開始的確切時間，這個消息讓我們全隊興奮不已。","en":"The sports day is a big event at our school this year. The night before the races, the teacher announced the exact time the relay would start, and the news made our whole team very excited.","words":[{"en":"event","zh":"事件、活動"},{"en":"exact","zh":"精確的"},{"en":"excite(ment)","zh":"使興奮"}]},{"id":"L2-E12","level":2,"letter":"E","n":12,"zh":"考試結束後，我還在檢查最後一道題，想跟老師多要一分鐘。她指了指時鐘，我只好交卷，沒再找藉口要求額外的時間。","en":"When the exam ended, I was still checking the last question and wanted to ask the teacher for one more minute. She pointed at the clock, so I handed in my paper and did not make any more excuses for extra time.","words":[{"en":"examination/exam","zh":"考試；檢查"},{"en":"excuse","zh":"藉口；原諒"},{"en":"extra","zh":"額外的"}]},{"id":"L2-E13","level":2,"letter":"E","n":13,"zh":"弟弟相信湖裡真的存在一隻水怪。他拿一張模糊的照片給專家看，她說光憑這張照片，還無法證明水怪的存在。","en":"My brother believes a monster really exists in the lake. He showed an expert a blurry photo, and she said this photo alone could not prove the monster's existence.","words":[{"en":"earring(s)","zh":"耳環"},{"en":"exist","zh":"存在、生存"},{"en":"existence","zh":"存在、生存"},{"en":"expert","zh":"專家"}]},{"id":"L2-F01","level":2,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"我們訪問了一位剛在決賽落敗的女跑者。她說，疲勞是影響成績的一個因素。這次失敗讓她學會下次要更妥善安排休息時間。","en":"We interviewed a female runner who had just lost in the final. She said that being tired was one factor that affected her result. This failure taught her to plan her rest time better next time.","words":[{"en":"factor","zh":"因素"},{"en":"failure","zh":"失敗"},{"en":"female","zh":"女性的；女性"},{"en":"final","zh":"最後的；決賽、期末考"}]},{"id":"L2-F02","level":2,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"裁判是我叔叔，但他沒有偏袒我們，而是讓兩隊重賽。隊長承認剛才偷跑是他的過錯，請對手原諒。我覺得這個決定很公平。","en":"The referee was my uncle, but he did not favor us. Instead, he made the two teams play again. Our captain admitted that starting early was his fault and asked the other team to forgive him. I think the decision was fair.","words":[{"en":"fair","zh":"公平的；展覽會"},{"en":"fault","zh":"過錯；缺點"},{"en":"favor","zh":"幫忙；偏愛"},{"en":"forgive","zh":"原諒、寬恕"}]},{"id":"L2-F03","level":2,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"表姐最喜愛的時尚雜誌介紹了一件外套，大口袋裡還有個小口袋。我在市場試穿了一件外觀一樣、又很合身的外套。標籤說它有暗袋，但這個說法是假的。","en":"My cousin's favorite fashion magazine showed a coat with a small pocket inside its big pocket. At the market I tried on a coat that looked the same and fit me well. The label said it had a secret pocket, but that was false.","words":[{"en":"false","zh":"錯誤的、假的"},{"en":"fashion","zh":"流行、時尚"},{"en":"favorite","zh":"最喜愛的"},{"en":"fit","zh":"適合；健康的"}]},{"id":"L2-F04","level":2,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"書裡兩個孩子都畏懼國王，卻因為彼此的友誼而有勇氣逃走。他們終於能決定自己的命運。讀到他們重獲自由那一頁，我也有種鬆了一口氣的感覺。","en":"In the book, both children fear the king, but their friendship gives them the courage to escape. At last they can decide their own fate. When I read the page where they are free again, I felt a sense of relief, too.","words":[{"en":"fate","zh":"命運"},{"en":"fear","zh":"恐懼、害怕"},{"en":"friendship","zh":"友誼"}]},{"id":"L2-F05","level":2,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"我們想創立一個球社，老師請我們先填申請表。收到學校正式的批准通知後，大家才開始討論每個人要繳多少會費。","en":"We wanted to form a ball club, and the teacher asked us to fill out an application form first. Only after we got formal approval from the school did we start to discuss how much each member should pay.","words":[{"en":"form","zh":"形式；表格；形成"},{"en":"formal","zh":"正式的"}]},{"id":"L2-F06","level":2,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"營長帶來一個我不認識的小伙子，讓我們兩人住同一間小屋。第二天他發燒，得了流感，只好回家休息。接下來的星期一，他才回到營隊。","en":"The camp leader brought a young fellow I did not know and let the two of us share a cabin. The next day he had a fever and caught the flu, so he had to go home and rest. He did not come back to the camp until the following Monday.","words":[{"en":"fellow","zh":"傢伙；同伴"},{"en":"fever","zh":"發燒"},{"en":"flu","zh":"流感"},{"en":"following","zh":"接下來的、下列的"}]},{"id":"L2-F07","level":2,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"田野裡起火時，村裡的人急著去搶救農具。強風迫使他們後退，一位女消防員帶大家走到安全的地方。","en":"When a fire started in the field, the villagers hurried to save their farm tools. The strong wind forced them back, and a female firefighter led everyone to a safe place.","words":[{"en":"female","zh":"女性的；女性"},{"en":"field","zh":"田野；領域"},{"en":"force","zh":"力量；強迫"}]},{"id":"L2-F08","level":2,"letter":"F","n":8,"zh":"森林裡起了霧，我在樹後看見一個瘦小的身影。直到牠走近，我才看清那是一隻叼著果子的狐狸。","en":"Fog came into the forest, and I saw a small, thin figure behind a tree. Not until it came closer did I see that it was a fox with a fruit in its mouth.","words":[{"en":"figure","zh":"數字；人物；身材"},{"en":"fog","zh":"霧"},{"en":"forest","zh":"森林"},{"en":"fox","zh":"狐狸"}]},{"id":"L2-F09","level":2,"letter":"F","n":9,"zh":"漁夫發現河水流得比昨天快，但碼頭的木樁鬆了。他先修好木樁，確定它夠牢固，才把船繫上去。","en":"The fisherman noticed that the river was flowing faster than yesterday, and the wooden post at the dock was loose. He fixed the post first and made sure it was firm before he tied his boat to it.","words":[{"en":"firm","zh":"公司；堅固的、堅定的"},{"en":"fisherman","zh":"漁夫"},{"en":"fix","zh":"修理；固定"},{"en":"flow","zh":"流動"}]},{"id":"L2-F10","level":2,"letter":"F","n":10,"zh":"我們在一塊平坦的草地上試飛模型飛機，用一面紅旗標出終點。這是它第一次飛行，我把注意力集中在機翼上，怕飛機在半路翻覆。","en":"We tested our model airplane on a flat field and used a red flag to mark the finish line. It was its first flight, so I focused my attention on the wings, afraid that the plane would flip over halfway.","words":[{"en":"field","zh":"田野；領域"},{"en":"flag","zh":"旗子"},{"en":"flat","zh":"平坦的"},{"en":"flight","zh":"班機；飛行"},{"en":"focus","zh":"焦點；專注"}]},{"id":"L2-F11","level":2,"letter":"F","n":11,"zh":"美式足球練習前，隊長把教練寄來的影片轉寄給我。練習時，我和隊友像影片裡一樣來回傳球。後來我閉著眼睛往前跑，這個愚蠢的決定害我一頭撞上軟墊。","en":"Before football practice, the captain forwarded me a video from the coach. During practice, my teammates and I passed the ball back and forth like in the video. Later I ran forward with my eyes closed, and this foolish decision made me crash into a soft mat.","words":[{"en":"foolish","zh":"愚蠢的"},{"en":"football","zh":"美式足球、足球"},{"en":"forth","zh":"向前"},{"en":"forward","zh":"向前地"},{"en":"forward/forwards","zh":"向前地"}]},{"id":"L2-F12","level":2,"letter":"F","n":12,"zh":"我們可以帶炸薯條，也可以帶烤馬鈴薯。弟弟喜歡前一個選項，還自告奮勇要幫忙。我把馬鈴薯切成條，再交給爸爸油炸。","en":"We can bring French fries or baked potatoes. My brother liked the former choice and offered to help. I cut the potatoes into strips and handed them to Dad to fry.","words":[{"en":"form","zh":"形式；表格；形成"},{"en":"former","zh":"以前的；前者"},{"en":"fries","zh":"炸薯條（French fries）"},{"en":"fry","zh":"油炸、煎"}]},{"id":"L2-F13","level":2,"letter":"F","n":13,"zh":"家具店裡有張小桌子，還有收納玩具的功能。看到桌面可以掀開，我想進一步了解它的設計，就請店員再示範一次。","en":"There was a small table at the furniture store that could also store toys. When I saw that the top could open, I wanted to learn more about its design, so I asked the clerk to show me again.","words":[{"en":"furniture","zh":"家具"}]},{"id":"L2-G01","level":2,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"我們在菜圃集合，跟園丁學種大蒜。第一天先清理垃圾，這學期的目標是種出足夠全班吃的蒜頭。我也想累積一些種菜的經驗。","en":"We met at the vegetable garden to learn how to grow garlic from the gardener. On the first day we cleared away the garbage. Our goal this term is to grow enough garlic for the whole class. I also want to gain some experience in growing vegetables.","words":[{"en":"gain","zh":"獲得、增加"},{"en":"garbage","zh":"垃圾"},{"en":"gardener","zh":"園丁"},{"en":"garlic","zh":"大蒜"},{"en":"goal","zh":"目標；球門、得分"}]},{"id":"L2-G02","level":2,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"鄰居說，那位退休將軍是個慷慨的紳士。下雨時他把自己的傘送給迷路的小孩，還用溫柔的聲音告訴她回家的路。","en":"The neighbors say the retired general is a generous gentleman. When it rained, he gave his own umbrella to a lost child and told her the way home in a gentle voice.","words":[{"en":"general","zh":"一般的；將軍"},{"en":"generous","zh":"慷慨的、大方的"},{"en":"gentle","zh":"溫和的、溫柔的"},{"en":"gentleman","zh":"紳士、先生"}]},{"id":"L2-G03","level":2,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"妹妹用紙捲做了一隻長頸鹿，脖子卻一直歪下來。她今天的目標是讓長頸鹿自己站好，所以拿了膠水來，把兩層厚紙黏在一起當底座。","en":"My sister made a giraffe out of paper rolls, but its neck kept falling to one side. Her goal today was to make the giraffe stand by itself, so she got some glue and stuck two layers of thick paper together as a base.","words":[{"en":"giraffe","zh":"長頸鹿"},{"en":"glue","zh":"膠水；黏"},{"en":"goal","zh":"目標；球門、得分"}]},{"id":"L2-G04","level":2,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"我每天秤五十公克的穀物餵鵝，再帶小山羊去吃草。為了記錄小山羊的成長，我每週幫牠量一次身高。","en":"Every day I weigh fifty grams of grain to feed the geese, and then I take the young goat out to eat grass. To record the goat's growth, I measure its height once a week.","words":[{"en":"goat","zh":"山羊"},{"en":"grain","zh":"穀物；顆粒"},{"en":"gram","zh":"公克"},{"en":"growth","zh":"成長、增加"}]},{"id":"L2-G05","level":2,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"雄偉的王宮有一扇金色的大門，門上的小鳥是用黃金做的。門口的警衛背著槍，提醒我們在門外等。","en":"The grand palace has a big golden gate, and the little birds on the gate are made of gold. The guards at the gate carry guns and reminded us to wait outside.","words":[{"en":"gold","zh":"黃金；金色的"},{"en":"golden","zh":"金色的、金製的"},{"en":"grand","zh":"盛大的、雄偉的"},{"en":"guard","zh":"警衛；守衛"},{"en":"gun","zh":"槍"}]},{"id":"L2-G06","level":2,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"以前一位女王統治這座島，現在島上的事務由當地政府管理。島上的改變是逐步的，學校等了好幾年才有自己的體育館。","en":"A queen used to rule this island. Now the local government manages the island's affairs. The changes on the island were gradual, and the school waited several years before it had its own gym.","words":[{"en":"govern","zh":"統治、治理"},{"en":"government","zh":"政府"},{"en":"gradual","zh":"逐漸的"},{"en":"gymnasium/gym","zh":"體育館、健身房"}]},{"id":"L2-G07","level":2,"letter":"G","n":7,"zh":"嚮導在果園門口向每位客人打招呼。他帶我們摘葡萄，又切了一顆芭樂讓大家分著吃。","en":"The guide greeted every guest at the gate of the orchard. He took us to pick grapes and cut a guava for everyone to share.","words":[{"en":"grape","zh":"葡萄"},{"en":"greet","zh":"問候、迎接"},{"en":"guava","zh":"芭樂"},{"en":"guest","zh":"客人、來賓"},{"en":"guide","zh":"導遊；指南；引導"}]},{"id":"L2-H01","level":2,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"哥哥去理髮後，約我在飯店大廳見面。他剪短頭髮後看起來好英俊，我幾乎認不出他。","en":"After my brother got a haircut, he asked me to meet him in the hotel hall. With short hair he looked so handsome that I almost did not recognize him.","words":[{"en":"haircut","zh":"理髮、髮型"},{"en":"hall","zh":"大廳；走廊"},{"en":"handsome","zh":"英俊的"}]},{"id":"L2-H02","level":2,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"第一位客人轉動門把時，女主人還在廚房準備漢堡。她請我趕快去開門，再帶客人到桌邊坐。","en":"The hostess was still making hamburgers in the kitchen when the first guest turned the door handle. She asked me to open the door quickly and then take the guest to the table.","words":[{"en":"hamburger/burger","zh":"漢堡"},{"en":"handle","zh":"處理；把手"},{"en":"host/hostess","zh":"主人；主持人"}]},{"id":"L2-H03","level":2,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"這部歷史電影裡的女英雄是一位謙虛的隊長。受過她幫助的人都對她評價很高。故事結尾，小女孩抬起頭，希望在天國的隊長能聽見她說謝謝。","en":"The heroine of this historical movie is a humble captain. The people she helped all speak highly of her. At the end of the story, a little girl looks up and hopes the captain in heaven can hear her say thank you.","words":[{"en":"heaven","zh":"天堂"},{"en":"hero/heroine","zh":"英雄；男主角、女主角"},{"en":"highly","zh":"非常、高度地"},{"en":"historical","zh":"歷史的"},{"en":"hop","zh":"單腳跳、跳躍"},{"en":"humble","zh":"謙虛的；卑微的"}]},{"id":"L2-H04","level":2,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"我們離開公路，沿著山路健行。弟弟單腳跳過一個洞時跌倒，髖部撞在地上。我陪他坐在路邊休息了一會兒。","en":"We left the highway and hiked along the mountain road. My brother fell when he hopped over a hole on one foot, and his hip hit the ground. I sat with him at the side of the road and rested for a while.","words":[{"en":"highway","zh":"公路"},{"en":"hike","zh":"健行、遠足"},{"en":"hip","zh":"臀部"},{"en":"hole","zh":"洞"},{"en":"hop","zh":"單腳跳、跳躍"}]},{"id":"L2-H05","level":2,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"獵人原本想去河邊獵野鴨，卻看見泥地上有巨大的腳印。那些腳印是河馬留下的，比人類的腳印寬得多。","en":"The hunter wanted to hunt wild ducks by the river, but he saw huge footprints in the mud. The footprints were left by a hippo, and they were much wider than human footprints.","words":[{"en":"hippopotamus/hippo","zh":"河馬"},{"en":"huge","zh":"巨大的"},{"en":"human","zh":"人類的；人"},{"en":"hunt","zh":"打獵；尋找"},{"en":"hunter","zh":"獵人"}]},{"id":"L2-I01","level":2,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"我生病時還硬要練球。教練說，這可不是練球的理想時機。他提醒我別忽視休息的重要性，等體力改善了再回球場。","en":"I insisted on practicing even though I was ill. The coach said this was not an ideal time to practice. He reminded me not to ignore the importance of rest and to come back to the court when my strength improved.","words":[{"en":"ideal","zh":"理想的、完美的"},{"en":"ignore","zh":"忽視、不理"},{"en":"ill","zh":"生病的"},{"en":"importance","zh":"重要性"},{"en":"improve(ment)","zh":"改善、進步"},{"en":"insist","zh":"堅持"}]},{"id":"L2-I02","level":2,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"相機拍下了選手跳過水坑的影像，我們卻不知道他的身分。很難想像他穿著拖鞋還能跳那麼遠，這一跳真讓人印象深刻。","en":"The camera caught an image of a player jumping over a puddle, but we did not know his identity. It is hard to imagine that he could jump so far in slippers. That jump was really impressive.","words":[{"en":"identity","zh":"身分"},{"en":"image","zh":"影像；形象"},{"en":"imagine","zh":"想像、設想"},{"en":"impressive","zh":"令人印象深刻的"}]},{"id":"L2-I03","level":2,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"展覽裡有一本漁夫的帳簿，裡面的數字顯示他哪幾個月收入增加。從這本帳簿，我們看見漁業有淡季也有旺季。","en":"There is a fisherman's account book in the exhibition. The numbers in it show the months when his income increased. From this book, we can see that fishing has slow seasons and busy seasons.","words":[{"en":"income","zh":"收入"},{"en":"increase","zh":"增加"}]},{"id":"L2-I04","level":2,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"搬出去住後，姊姊變得更獨立了。對她而言，自主就是能自己安排每一天。她說，這份自由確實會影響一個人看待自己的方式。","en":"After moving out, my sister became more independent. For her, being independent means planning each day by herself. She says this freedom does influence the way a person sees herself.","words":[{"en":"independent","zh":"獨立的"},{"en":"influence","zh":"影響"}]},{"id":"L2-I05","level":2,"letter":"I","n":5,"zh":"祖父有些習慣從來沒變。比如說，他堅持用藍色墨水寫信。有一次我勸他改傳簡訊，他卻拿出信紙，還用熨斗把折痕燙平。","en":"Some of my grandfather's habits have never changed. For instance, he insists on writing letters in blue ink. Once I tried to get him to send text messages instead, but he took out his writing paper and even used an iron to press the folds flat.","words":[{"en":"ink","zh":"墨水"},{"en":"insist","zh":"堅持"},{"en":"instance","zh":"例子、實例"},{"en":"instead","zh":"代替、反而"},{"en":"iron","zh":"鐵；熨斗"}]},{"id":"L2-I06","level":2,"letter":"I","n":6,"zh":"上課前，老師先給了我們這臺儀器的使用說明。儀器能偵測木盒內部的震動。盒裡的小球一碰到盒壁，螢幕就有即時反應。","en":"Before class, the teacher gave us the instructions for using this instrument. It can detect shaking inside a wooden box. As soon as the small ball in the box touches the side, the screen reacts right away.","words":[{"en":"instruction","zh":"指示、說明；教學"},{"en":"instrument","zh":"樂器；儀器"}]},{"id":"L2-I07","level":2,"letter":"I","n":7,"zh":"這場國際讀書會透過網際網路舉行。主持人做了簡短的開場介紹後，請我們各自介紹一本喜歡的書。","en":"This international book club meets on the internet. After a short introduction, the host asked each of us to introduce a book we like.","words":[{"en":"international","zh":"國際的"},{"en":"Internet/internet","zh":"網際網路"},{"en":"introduce","zh":"介紹、引入"},{"en":"introduction","zh":"介紹；引言"}]},{"id":"L2-J01","level":2,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"爸爸每天早上慢跑，回家後邊吃抹果醬的吐司，邊寫日誌。今天他只寫了一行，說膝關節不舒服，所以提早回家。","en":"Dad jogs every morning. When he gets home, he eats toast with jam and writes in his journal. Today he only wrote one line, saying his knee joint did not feel well, so he came home early.","words":[{"en":"jam","zh":"果醬；堵塞"},{"en":"jog","zh":"慢跑"},{"en":"joint","zh":"關節；共同的"},{"en":"journal","zh":"期刊；日記"}]},{"id":"L2-J02","level":2,"letter":"J","n":2,"zh":"法官讓最後一位證人把話說完，才做出判決。一名旁聽的學生問老師：「如果只聽一方的說法，怎麼能維護正義？」","en":"The judge let the last witness finish speaking before making a decision. A student watching asked the teacher, \\"How can we protect justice if we only listen to one side?\\"","words":[{"en":"judge","zh":"法官；判斷"},{"en":"justice","zh":"正義；司法"}]},{"id":"L2-K01","level":2,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"園遊會上，學校的器材室管理員搬來一公斤番茄醬，交給賣薯條的同學。他在清單上記下重量，才去搬下一箱。","en":"At the school fair, the man in charge of the equipment room brought a kilogram of ketchup to the students selling fries. He wrote down the weight on his list before he went to get the next box.","words":[{"en":"ketchup","zh":"番茄醬"},{"en":"kilogram","zh":"公斤"}]},{"id":"L2-L01","level":2,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"班上的最新消息是小榆要競選班長。她雖然缺乏經驗，卻是很好的傾聽者。上次她讓吵架的兩組坐下來談，大家都看見她的領導才能。","en":"The latest news in our class is that Xiao-Yu will run for class leader. Although she lacks experience, she is a good listener. Last time she got two arguing groups to sit down and talk, and everyone saw her leadership.","words":[{"en":"lack","zh":"缺乏"},{"en":"latest","zh":"最新的"},{"en":"leadership","zh":"領導、領導能力"},{"en":"listener","zh":"聽眾"}]},{"id":"L2-L02","level":2,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"那位戴帽子的女士把毛巾放在膝上，再把小羊抱上來。小羊靠著她，很快就睡著了。","en":"The lady in the hat put a towel on her lap and then picked up the lamb. The lamb leaned against her and soon fell asleep.","words":[{"en":"lady","zh":"女士、淑女"},{"en":"lamb","zh":"小羊；羊肉"},{"en":"lap","zh":"大腿上；（跑道的）一圈"}]},{"id":"L2-L03","level":2,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"我把放大鏡借給同桌，讓她透過鏡片觀察樹葉上的瓢蟲。她把尺放在葉子旁，量出瓢蟲身體的長度。","en":"I lent my magnifying glass to the classmate next to me so she could look at the ladybug on the leaf through the lens. She put a ruler beside the leaf and measured the length of the ladybug's body.","words":[{"en":"ladybug","zh":"瓢蟲"},{"en":"leaf","zh":"葉子"},{"en":"lend","zh":"借出"},{"en":"length","zh":"長度"},{"en":"lens","zh":"鏡片、鏡頭"}]},{"id":"L2-L04","level":2,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"當地居民沿著小巷掛了一整排燈籠。夜深人散後，巷口只剩一名獨自收燈的老人。","en":"The local people hung a long row of lanterns along the lane. Late at night, after the crowd left, only an old man was left alone at the end of the lane, taking down the lanterns.","words":[{"en":"lane","zh":"巷子；車道"},{"en":"lantern","zh":"燈籠"},{"en":"local","zh":"當地的"}]},{"id":"L2-L05","level":2,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"兩位作家在報上討論街頭表演，一人主張禁止，另一人主張開放。後者的立場較自由開放，他希望修改法律，讓街頭表演成為合法的工作。","en":"Two writers discussed street performers in the newspaper. One wanted to ban them, and the other wanted to allow them. The latter was more liberal. He hoped to change the law so that street performing could become a legal job.","words":[{"en":"latter","zh":"後者的"},{"en":"law","zh":"法律"},{"en":"legal","zh":"合法的、法律的"},{"en":"liberal","zh":"自由的、開明的"}]},{"id":"L2-L06","level":2,"letter":"L","n":6,"zh":"老師掀起盒蓋，讓大家看裡面的肝臟模型。模型有一條透明的管子，按一下旁邊的按鈕，紅色液體就會流進去。","en":"The teacher lifted the lid of the box and showed us a model of a liver. The model has a clear tube, and when you press the button beside it, red liquid flows in.","words":[{"en":"lid","zh":"蓋子"},{"en":"lift","zh":"舉起、抬起"},{"en":"liquid","zh":"液體"},{"en":"liver","zh":"肝臟"}]},{"id":"L2-L07","level":2,"letter":"L","n":7,"zh":"我們正要把最後兩箱裝上小貨車，司機提醒我們，前面的橋有重量限制。如果再裝兩箱，車子就很容易超重，所以我們減輕了車上的重量，把這兩箱留在原地。","en":"We were about to load the last two boxes onto the small truck when the driver reminded us that the bridge ahead had a weight limit. If we loaded two more boxes, the truck could easily be too heavy, so we made the load lighter and left these two boxes where they were.","words":[{"en":"limit","zh":"限制、界限"},{"en":"load","zh":"裝載；負擔"}]},{"id":"L2-L08","level":2,"letter":"L","n":8,"zh":"這張老照片是奶奶和故鄉之間唯一的聯繫。弄丟照片讓她覺得失去了很重要的東西。幸好有人撿到照片，拿去派出所。奶奶拿回照片，笑著說：「我今天的運氣真好！」","en":"This old photo is Grandma's only link to her hometown. Losing it made her feel she had lost something very important. Luckily, someone found the photo and took it to the police station. When Grandma got it back, she smiled and said, \\"I am so lucky today!\\"","words":[{"en":"link","zh":"連結；關聯"},{"en":"luck","zh":"運氣、幸運"}]},{"id":"L2-M01","level":2,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"這本運動雜誌的主要報導都在介紹男性選手，受訪選手中女性只佔少數。新編輯覺得這不是個小問題，下期要讓女選手上封面。","en":"The main stories in this sports magazine are about male players, and women are only a minority of the players interviewed. The new editor feels this is not a minor problem, and she will put a female player on the next cover.","words":[{"en":"magazine","zh":"雜誌"},{"en":"male","zh":"男性的；男性"},{"en":"minor","zh":"較小的、次要的"},{"en":"minority","zh":"少數；少數民族"}]},{"id":"L2-M02","level":2,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"阿姨是租車店的經理，負責管理十幾輛機車。為了把車保養好，她每週都安排時間讓師傅檢查。","en":"My aunt is the manager of a scooter rental shop, and she manages more than ten scooters. To keep them in good condition, she makes time every week for a mechanic to check them.","words":[{"en":"manage(ment)","zh":"管理；設法做到"},{"en":"manager","zh":"經理"}]},{"id":"L2-M03","level":2,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"我把芒果和牛奶混合，再把混合好的飲料倒進我的馬克杯。弟弟伸手拿杯子時打翻了它，我們只好一起拖地。","en":"I mixed mango and milk and poured the mixture into my mug. My brother knocked it over when he reached for the cup, so we had to mop the floor together.","words":[{"en":"mango","zh":"芒果"},{"en":"mix","zh":"混合"},{"en":"mixture","zh":"混合物"},{"en":"mop","zh":"拖把；拖地"},{"en":"mug","zh":"馬克杯"}]},{"id":"L2-M04","level":2,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"阿公很年輕就和阿嬤結婚了。阿嬤說，那時最打動她的是他待人的溫柔態度。多年後，他們都比以前成熟，也更懂得照顧這段婚姻。","en":"Grandpa married Grandma when he was very young. Grandma says what moved her most then was the gentle way he treated people. Years later, they are both more mature and know better how to take care of their marriage.","words":[{"en":"marriage","zh":"婚姻、結婚"},{"en":"marry","zh":"與……結婚、娶"},{"en":"mature","zh":"成熟的"}]},{"id":"L2-M05","level":2,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"我把做狐狸面具的材料擺在桌上，其中有一大團紙漿。等紙漿在狐狸頭的模型上乾了，我就戴上面具照鏡子，看耳朵有沒有歪掉。","en":"I put the materials for my fox mask on the table, including a big mass of paper pulp. When the pulp dried on the fox head model, I put on the mask and looked in the mirror to see if the ears were crooked.","words":[{"en":"mask","zh":"面具、口罩"},{"en":"mass","zh":"大量；質量；大眾的"},{"en":"material","zh":"材料、資料"},{"en":"mirror","zh":"鏡子"},{"en":"model","zh":"模型；模特兒；榜樣"}]},{"id":"L2-M06","level":2,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"為了精通柔道的摔法，我每天放學後都和柔道社的一位朋友在墊子上練習。到了比賽那天，他一把將我摔倒，我照著練過的動作安全落地。","en":"To master judo throws, I practiced on the mat with a friend from the judo club every day after school. On the day of the match, he threw me down, and I landed safely, just like we had practiced.","words":[{"en":"master","zh":"主人；大師；精通"},{"en":"mat","zh":"墊子"},{"en":"match","zh":"比賽；火柴；相配"}]},{"id":"L2-M07","level":2,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"對這位音樂家來說，奶奶唱過的旋律有特別的意義。音樂是他保存童年記憶的一種方法，每次彈起這首曲子，他的心情就會好起來。","en":"For this musician, the melody his grandmother sang has a special meaning. Music is one method he uses to keep his childhood memories, and his mood gets better every time he plays this song.","words":[{"en":"meaning","zh":"意思、意義"},{"en":"melody","zh":"旋律"},{"en":"memory","zh":"記憶、記憶力"},{"en":"method","zh":"方法"},{"en":"mood","zh":"心情、氣氛"},{"en":"musician","zh":"音樂家"}]},{"id":"L2-M08","level":2,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"老師要我們測量一根金屬管的長度，可是手邊的捲尺只有一公尺長。我們換了一個方法，每量完一段就做個記號，最後把各段長度加起來。","en":"The teacher asked us to measure the length of a metal pipe, but our tape measure was only one meter long. We used another method. We made a mark after each part and added up the lengths at the end.","words":[{"en":"measure(ment)","zh":"測量"},{"en":"metal","zh":"金屬"},{"en":"meter","zh":"公尺"},{"en":"method","zh":"方法"}]},{"id":"L2-M09","level":2,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"午夜時，軍方收到一則求援訊息。訊息中提到，一英里外的村莊需要醫療用品，於是士兵連夜把物資送去。","en":"At midnight, the army got a message asking for help. It said a village one mile away needed medical supplies, so the soldiers took the supplies there that night.","words":[{"en":"medical","zh":"醫學的、醫療的"},{"en":"message","zh":"訊息、留言"},{"en":"midnight","zh":"午夜"},{"en":"mile","zh":"英里"}]},{"id":"L2-M10","level":2,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"我剛取得劇團的會員資格，劇團就開始為新歌舞劇招募演員。試演時我忘了舞步，只好跟著前面的舞者做動作。","en":"I had just become a member of the theater group when it started looking for actors for a new musical. During the audition I forgot the dance steps, so I had to copy the dancer in front of me.","words":[{"en":"musical","zh":"音樂的；音樂劇"}]},{"id":"L2-N01","level":2,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"我和朋友騎單車穿過一條狹窄的巷子時，我的輪胎扎到釘子，氣幾乎漏光了。還好附近就有一家修車店，我把車牽了過去。","en":"When my friend and I rode our bikes through a narrow lane, a nail went into my tire, and almost all the air came out. Luckily, there was a bike shop nearby, so I walked my bike there.","words":[{"en":"nail","zh":"釘子、指甲"},{"en":"narrow","zh":"狹窄的"},{"en":"nearby","zh":"附近的"}]},{"id":"L2-N02","level":2,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"這個國家的北部有一座天然的深水港。以前村民從這裡乘船出海，現在遊客也能搭船看沿岸的村落。","en":"There is a natural deep-water harbor in the north of this nation. Villagers used to go out to sea by boat from here. Now visitors can also take a boat to see the villages along the coast.","words":[{"en":"nation","zh":"國家、民族"},{"en":"natural","zh":"自然的、天然的"}]},{"id":"L2-N03","level":2,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"我那頑皮的外甥把球踢進鄰居的院子，外甥女陪他去按門鈴。鄰居問他們是不是來撿球的，兩個孩子一起點頭。","en":"My naughty nephew kicked a ball into the neighbor's yard, and my niece went with him to ring the doorbell. The neighbor asked if they had come to get the ball, and the two children nodded together.","words":[{"en":"naughty","zh":"頑皮的"},{"en":"neighbor","zh":"鄰居"},{"en":"nephew","zh":"侄子、外甥"},{"en":"niece","zh":"侄女、甥女"},{"en":"nod","zh":"點頭、打盹"}]},{"id":"L2-N04","level":2,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"我想用堅果的硬殼做一條項鍊。老師說，先在殼上鑽孔是必要的，這樣才能用針把線穿過去。","en":"I wanted to make a necklace out of hard nutshells. The teacher said it was necessary to drill holes in the shells first, so I could pass the string through them with a needle.","words":[{"en":"necessary","zh":"必要的"},{"en":"necklace","zh":"項鍊"},{"en":"needle","zh":"針"}]},{"id":"L2-N05","level":2,"letter":"N","n":5,"zh":"我們的模型用一排小燈模擬訊號沿著神經傳遞的過程，就像訊息在電腦網路裡傳遞一樣。第一位觀眾走過來時，我緊張得手心冒汗，怕他給我負面的評語。","en":"Our model uses a row of small lights to show how a signal travels along a nerve, just like a message moving through a computer network. When the first visitor came over, I was so nervous that my hands were sweating. I was afraid he would give me negative comments.","words":[{"en":"negative","zh":"負面的、否定的"},{"en":"nerve","zh":"神經；勇氣"},{"en":"nervous","zh":"緊張的"},{"en":"network","zh":"網路"}]},{"id":"L2-N06","level":2,"letter":"N","n":6,"zh":"兩個孩子既不吃蔥也不吃蒜，老闆就另外煮了一鍋麵。等其他人想再添一碗時，鍋裡一點也沒剩。","en":"The two children ate neither green onion nor garlic, so the owner cooked a separate pot of noodles. When the others wanted another bowl, there was none left in the pot.","words":[{"en":"neither","zh":"（兩者）都不"},{"en":"none","zh":"沒有一個"},{"en":"noodle","zh":"麵條"},{"en":"nor","zh":"也不、也沒有"}]},{"id":"L2-N07","level":2,"letter":"N","n":7,"zh":"姊姊一直想寫一本小說，卻每次一提筆就緊張。生日那天我送她一本空白筆記本，她就在第一頁寫下了主角的名字。","en":"My sister has always wanted to write a novel, but every time she picks up a pen, she gets nervous. On her birthday I gave her a blank notebook, and she wrote the main character's name on the first page.","words":[{"en":"nervous","zh":"緊張的"},{"en":"notebook","zh":"筆記本；筆電"},{"en":"novel","zh":"小說"}]},{"id":"L2-O01","level":2,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"校長說，大家都要遵守操場的使用規定，也歡迎我們提出自己的意見。我反對太早關門，因為放學後還有很多人想留下來運動。","en":"The principal said everyone must obey the rules for using the playground, and he welcomed us to share our opinions. I objected to closing the gate too early because many people want to stay and exercise after school.","words":[{"en":"obey","zh":"服從、遵守"},{"en":"object","zh":"物體；目標；反對"},{"en":"opinion","zh":"意見、看法"}]},{"id":"L2-O02","level":2,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"暴風雨發生在昨晚。今天，站在岸上還能看到海洋上的大浪。海灘入口的官方告示已經換成紅色，海灘關閉的原因很明顯。","en":"The storm happened last night. Today you can still see big waves on the ocean from the shore. The official sign at the beach entrance has changed to red, and the reason the beach is closed is obvious.","words":[{"en":"obvious","zh":"明顯的、明白的"},{"en":"ocean","zh":"海洋"},{"en":"official","zh":"官方的；官員"}]},{"id":"L2-O03","level":2,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"對醫院的接線生來說，這原本是個平常的夜晚。後來醫師來電，說移植用的器官已經送達，外科醫師可以開始動手術了。","en":"For the hospital operator, it was an ordinary night at first. Then a doctor called and said the organ for the transplant had arrived, and the surgeon could start the operation.","words":[{"en":"operator","zh":"操作員、接線生"},{"en":"ordinary","zh":"平常的、普通的"},{"en":"organ","zh":"器官；風琴"}]},{"id":"L2-O04","level":2,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"一個保存地方歷史的組織找到了這塊老招牌的主人。她一解釋店名的由來，我們才知道這間店最早只賣茶。","en":"An organization that keeps local history found the owner of this old sign. When she explained the origin of the shop's name, we learned that the shop only sold tea at first.","words":[{"en":"organization","zh":"組織、機構"},{"en":"origin","zh":"起源"},{"en":"owner","zh":"擁有者、主人"}]},{"id":"L2-P01","level":2,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"診間有一位臉色蒼白的病人。他說腳踝昨晚開始痛，今天每走一步都很痛。","en":"There was a pale patient in the doctor's office. He said his ankle started to hurt last night, and today every step was painful.","words":[{"en":"pain","zh":"疼痛、痛苦"},{"en":"painful","zh":"疼痛的、痛苦的"},{"en":"pale","zh":"蒼白的"},{"en":"patient","zh":"病人；有耐心的"}]},{"id":"L2-P02","level":2,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"妹妹帶了印著貓熊圖案的睡衣，還堅持自己抱著枕頭。到了外婆家，她很快就睡著了。","en":"My sister brought pajamas with a panda on them and insisted on carrying her pillow by herself. When we got to Grandma's house, she fell asleep quickly.","words":[{"en":"pajamas","zh":"睡衣"},{"en":"panda","zh":"貓熊"},{"en":"pillow","zh":"枕頭"}]},{"id":"L2-P03","level":2,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"老師請每位學生選一幅自己的水彩畫，貼在紫色的紙上。老師把畫排成一列，教室就像一座小畫廊。","en":"The teacher asked each student to choose one of their own watercolor paintings and stick it on purple paper. When she put the paintings in a row, the classroom looked like a small gallery.","words":[{"en":"painting","zh":"畫、繪畫"},{"en":"purple","zh":"紫色的"}]},{"id":"L2-P04","level":2,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"爸爸買了一磅豬肉，切成小塊放進平底鍋炒。我把炒熟的肉撒在披薩上，再把披薩送進烤箱。","en":"Dad bought a pound of pork, cut it into small pieces, and fried it in a pan. I sprinkled the cooked meat on the pizza and then put the pizza in the oven.","words":[{"en":"pan","zh":"平底鍋"},{"en":"pizza","zh":"披薩"},{"en":"pork","zh":"豬肉"},{"en":"pound","zh":"磅；英鎊"}]},{"id":"L2-P05","level":2,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"弟弟花了好久才選定要買桃子還是梨子。我比較喜歡木瓜，早就挑好一顆，在水果攤旁邊等他。","en":"My brother took a long time to decide whether to buy peaches or pears. I prefer papaya, so I had already picked one and was waiting for him beside the fruit stand.","words":[{"en":"papaya","zh":"木瓜"},{"en":"peach","zh":"桃子"},{"en":"pear","zh":"梨子"},{"en":"prefer","zh":"比較喜歡"}]},{"id":"L2-P06","level":2,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"公主到監獄探望一名囚犯。他偷了麵包給妹妹吃。公主聽完他的故事，便請國王寬恕他，免去他的處罰。","en":"The princess visited a prisoner in prison. He had stolen bread for his little sister. After hearing his story, the princess asked the king to forgive him and free him from punishment.","words":[{"en":"prince/princess","zh":"王子、公主"},{"en":"prison","zh":"監獄"},{"en":"prisoner","zh":"囚犯、犯人"},{"en":"punish(ment)","zh":"處罰、懲罰"}]},{"id":"L2-P07","level":2,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"報名這場比賽時，你心裡有特定的搭檔嗎？大家都得兩人一組參加，兩人都抵達終點才能領獎。","en":"When you signed up for this race, did you have a particular partner in mind? Everyone has to enter in pairs, and you only get the prize when both partners reach the finish line.","words":[{"en":"particular","zh":"特定的、特別的"},{"en":"partner","zh":"夥伴、搭檔"},{"en":"prize","zh":"獎、獎品"}]},{"id":"L2-P08","level":2,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"我用淺白的話向爺爺解釋，密碼是個人資料。如果他想跟行員談帳戶的事，可以請行員帶他去一間能單獨談話的房間。","en":"I explained to Grandpa in plain words that a password is private information. If he wants to talk to the bank clerk about his account, he can ask the clerk to take him to a private room.","words":[{"en":"password","zh":"密碼、口令"},{"en":"plain","zh":"樸素的；清楚的；平原"},{"en":"private","zh":"私人的"}]},{"id":"L2-P09","level":2,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"我們沿著小徑走到山頂。那裡很寧靜，只聽得見風聲。我們在山上度過了一個愉快的早晨。","en":"We walked along the path to the top of the mountain. It was so peaceful there that we could only hear the wind. We spent a pleasant morning on the mountain.","words":[{"en":"path","zh":"小路、路徑"},{"en":"peace","zh":"和平、平靜"},{"en":"peaceful","zh":"平靜的、和平的"},{"en":"pleasant","zh":"令人愉快的"}]},{"id":"L2-P10","level":2,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"大家在教堂裡為和平祈禱。神父請孩子們把自己的禱詞寫下來，放在點著蠟燭的桌上。","en":"Everyone prayed for peace in the church. The priest asked the children to write down their prayers and put them on the table with the candles.","words":[{"en":"peace","zh":"和平、平靜"},{"en":"pray","zh":"祈禱"},{"en":"prayer","zh":"禱告"},{"en":"priest","zh":"牧師、神父"}]},{"id":"L2-P11","level":2,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"南瓜布丁每杯二十元，加一匙鮮奶油要再付五元。妹妹把零錢數了兩次，剛好夠買一杯加鮮奶油的布丁。","en":"Pumpkin pudding costs twenty dollars a cup, and a spoonful of cream costs five dollars more. My sister counted her coins twice, and she had just enough for a pudding with cream.","words":[{"en":"pudding","zh":"布丁"},{"en":"pumpkin","zh":"南瓜"}]},{"id":"L2-P12","level":2,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"妹妹換了三次位置才找到完美的背景，接著對著鏡頭擺好姿勢。我把照片印成明信片，隔天寄給奶奶。","en":"My sister changed places three times before she found the perfect background, and then she posed for the camera. I printed the photo as a postcard and mailed it to Grandma the next day.","words":[{"en":"perfect","zh":"完美的、完好的"},{"en":"pose","zh":"擺姿勢；造成（問題）"},{"en":"postcard","zh":"明信片"},{"en":"print","zh":"列印、印刷"}]},{"id":"L2-P13","level":2,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"國文老師請一位詩人來談詩歌。那一堂課，我們每人選了一個喜歡的詞組，用它當開頭寫了一首短詩。","en":"Our Chinese teacher invited a poet to talk about poetry. In that class, each of us chose a favorite phrase and used it to begin a short poem.","words":[{"en":"phrase","zh":"片語"},{"en":"poem","zh":"詩"},{"en":"poet","zh":"詩人"},{"en":"poetry","zh":"詩（總稱）"}]},{"id":"L2-P14","level":2,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"隊長個性開朗，就算輸球也會給隊友正面的回應。他稱讚大家練習認真，也以全隊的進步為榮。","en":"Our captain is cheerful and gives his teammates positive feedback even when we lose. He praised everyone for practicing hard and is proud of the whole team's progress.","words":[{"en":"positive","zh":"肯定的、積極的"},{"en":"praise","zh":"讚美、稱讚"},{"en":"progress","zh":"進步、進展"}]},{"id":"L2-P15","level":2,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"從火車站的月台上就能看見港口。鎮上的人口比以前多了，每天都有好多人在這裡等火車。","en":"You can see the port from the platform of the train station. The town's population is bigger than before, and many people wait for trains here every day.","words":[{"en":"platform","zh":"月臺；平臺"},{"en":"population","zh":"人口"},{"en":"port","zh":"港口"}]},{"id":"L2-P16","level":2,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"孩子們在遊樂場發現一瓶標著「毒物」的液體。為了保護大家，一名警察請孩子們先離開，再找人來把瓶子帶走。","en":"The children found a bottle of liquid marked \\"Poison\\" at the playground. To protect everyone, a police officer asked the children to leave first and then called someone to take the bottle away.","words":[{"en":"playground","zh":"操場、遊樂場"},{"en":"poison","zh":"毒藥；下毒"},{"en":"protect","zh":"保護"}]},{"id":"L2-P17","level":2,"letter":"P","n":17,"zh":"總統向孩子們說明新的森林政策。他說這項計畫的主要目標是在山坡上重新種植原生樹木。","en":"The president explained the new forest policy to the children. He said the main goal of the plan was to plant native trees on the hillsides again.","words":[{"en":"policy","zh":"政策、方針"},{"en":"president","zh":"總統、總裁"}]},{"id":"L2-P18","level":2,"letter":"P","n":18,"zh":"我們的流行音樂表演就要開始了，我感受到上台的壓力。我按下電子琴的第一個琴鍵，鼓手也跟著打了起來，他那強而有力的節奏讓我安下心來。","en":"Our pop music show was about to start, and I felt the pressure of going on stage. I pressed the first key on the keyboard, and the drummer started playing, too. His strong, powerful beat calmed me down.","words":[{"en":"pop","zh":"流行音樂；砰的一聲"},{"en":"powerful","zh":"強大的、有力的"},{"en":"press","zh":"按、壓；新聞界"},{"en":"pressure","zh":"壓力；（血）壓"}]},{"id":"L2-P19","level":2,"letter":"P","n":19,"zh":"解最後一道謎題時，阿哲提議先看看畫框後面。藏在那裡的鑰匙證明他猜對了。現在我們有機會提早過關了。","en":"When we were solving the last puzzle, A-Zhe proposed looking behind the picture frame first. The key hidden there proved he was right. Now we have a chance to finish early.","words":[{"en":"propose","zh":"提議；求婚"},{"en":"prove","zh":"證明"},{"en":"puzzle","zh":"謎題、拼圖；使困惑"}]},{"id":"L2-P20","level":2,"letter":"P","n":20,"zh":"校長問我們辦這場活動的目的。我答應活動結束會把椅子排回原位，因為把借用的場地恢復原狀是我們社團的原則。","en":"The principal asked us about the purpose of this event. I promised to put the chairs back after the event, because putting a borrowed place back the way it was is a principle of our club.","words":[{"en":"principal","zh":"校長；主要的"},{"en":"principle","zh":"原則、原理"},{"en":"promise","zh":"承諾、答應"},{"en":"purpose","zh":"目的"}]},{"id":"L2-P21","level":2,"letter":"P","n":21,"zh":"這家工廠生產玩具，生產的最後一步是裝盒。工作人員用一台小印表機印出標籤，再貼到盒子上。","en":"This factory produces toys, and the last step of production is putting them in boxes. The workers print labels with a small printer and then stick them on the boxes.","words":[{"en":"print","zh":"列印、印刷"},{"en":"printer","zh":"印表機"},{"en":"produce","zh":"生產、製造"},{"en":"production","zh":"製造、生產"}]},{"id":"L2-P22","level":2,"letter":"P","n":22,"zh":"老師提供適當的工具和防護眼鏡，讓我們練習把木板鋸直。第二次鋸出來的邊比第一次直多了，我看得出自己有進步。","en":"The teacher provided proper tools and safety glasses so we could practice sawing wooden boards straight. The edge I cut the second time was much straighter than the first, so I could see my progress.","words":[{"en":"progress","zh":"進步、進展"},{"en":"proper","zh":"適當的"},{"en":"provide","zh":"提供、供應"}]},{"id":"L2-P23","level":2,"letter":"P","n":23,"zh":"小狗一直縮在雨棚下。我提議先用毛巾把牠擦乾。哥哥用外套裹住牠，保護牠不受冷風吹。","en":"The puppy kept hiding under the awning. I suggested drying it with a towel first. My brother wrapped it in his coat to protect it from the cold wind.","words":[{"en":"protect","zh":"保護"},{"en":"puppy","zh":"小狗"}]},{"id":"L2-Q01","level":2,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"今天的小考有一道買橘子的題目。兩箱價錢相同，一箱的橘子數量較多，另一箱的橘子品質較好。你會替班上選哪一箱？","en":"Today's quiz had a question about buying oranges. The two boxes cost the same. One box has a larger quantity of oranges, and the other has oranges of better quality. Which box would you choose for the class?","words":[{"en":"quality","zh":"品質"},{"en":"quantity","zh":"數量"},{"en":"quiz","zh":"小考"}]},{"id":"L2-R01","level":2,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"大雨過後，這個地區的鐵路停駛了。工人穿著雨衣趕到現場。多虧他們反應迅速，第一班車中午就開了。","en":"After the heavy rain, the railroad in this region stopped running. Workers in raincoats rushed to the scene. Thanks to their rapid response, the first train ran at noon.","words":[{"en":"railroad/railway","zh":"鐵路"},{"en":"raincoat","zh":"雨衣"},{"en":"rapid","zh":"快速的"},{"en":"region","zh":"地區、區域"}]},{"id":"L2-R02","level":2,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"我們在多岩石的山坡上看見一隻罕見的鳥。老師請我們記錄發現牠的位置。累積這樣的紀錄，就能幫助我們畫出這種鳥的活動範圍。","en":"We saw a rare bird on a rocky hillside. The teacher asked us to record where we found it. Collecting records like this can help us map the range where this bird lives.","words":[{"en":"range","zh":"範圍"},{"en":"rare","zh":"稀有的、罕見的"},{"en":"record","zh":"紀錄；唱片；錄音"},{"en":"rocky","zh":"多岩石的"}]},{"id":"L2-R03","level":2,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"修理冰箱前，師傅先搬開旁邊的紙箱。一隻大老鼠立刻從牆角竄出來，躲進後院。","en":"Before fixing the refrigerator, the repairman moved the boxes beside it. A big rat ran out of the corner at once and hid in the backyard.","words":[{"en":"rat","zh":"老鼠"},{"en":"refrigerator/fridge","zh":"冰箱"}]},{"id":"L2-R04","level":2,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"小國王夢見自己擁有全世界的財富。一醒來，他才明白那只是夢。現實生活中，他寧可待在家裡和妹妹一起玩。","en":"The little king dreamed that he owned all the riches in the world. When he woke up, he realized it was only a dream. In real life, he would rather stay home and play with his sister.","words":[{"en":"rather","zh":"相當；寧願"},{"en":"realize","zh":"了解、意識到；實現"},{"en":"riches","zh":"財富、財產"}]},{"id":"L2-R05","level":2,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"我收到一位賽跑選手的來信。他提到最近的一場比賽，也說自己的腳傷已經好了，現在可以跟我一起練跑了。","en":"I got a letter from a runner. He mentioned a recent race and said his foot injury had healed, so now he can practice running with me.","words":[{"en":"recent","zh":"最近的"},{"en":"runner","zh":"跑者"}]},{"id":"L2-R06","level":2,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"我的新同學因為宗教信仰而拒絕吃豬肉。我尊重他的選擇，每次幫他點餐都會先問他。我們的關係也越來越好。","en":"My new classmate refuses to eat pork because of his religion. I respect his choice, and I always ask him first when I order food for him. Our relationship is getting better and better.","words":[{"en":"refuse","zh":"拒絕、謝絕"},{"en":"relationship","zh":"關係、關聯"},{"en":"religion","zh":"宗教、信仰"},{"en":"respect","zh":"尊敬、尊重"}]},{"id":"L2-R07","level":2,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"我是這間租車店的老客人，老闆已經把我當成朋友。我寫信問他週日能不能租一輛雙人腳踏車，他很快就回覆了。","en":"I am a regular customer at this rental shop, and the owner already treats me as a friend. I wrote to ask him if I could rent a bike for two on Sunday, and he replied quickly.","words":[{"en":"regular","zh":"定期的、規律的；普通的"},{"en":"rent","zh":"租；租金"},{"en":"reply","zh":"回答、回覆"}]},{"id":"L2-R08","level":2,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"要加入球隊，有一項基本要求，就是每週都得來練球。隊長拒絕了我的申請，但他很有耐心地回答我的問題，一點也不無禮。","en":"There is one basic requirement for joining the team: you have to come to practice every week. The captain refused my application, but he answered my questions patiently and was not rude at all.","words":[{"en":"refuse","zh":"拒絕、謝絕"},{"en":"require(ment)","zh":"需要、要求"},{"en":"rude","zh":"粗魯的、無禮的"}]},{"id":"L2-R09","level":2,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"我們複習了上週的調查結果。第一張圖表和睡眠有關，第二張則顯示睡眠時數與上課專心程度之間的關係。","en":"We reviewed the results of last week's survey. The first chart was about sleep, and the second showed the relationship between hours of sleep and how well we focus in class.","words":[{"en":"relationship","zh":"關係、關聯"},{"en":"result","zh":"結果"},{"en":"review","zh":"複習；評論"}]},{"id":"L2-R10","level":2,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"弟弟在公園的廁所外撿到一串鑰匙。他拿著鑰匙到服務台請人廣播。等失主趕來，他親手把鑰匙還給她。大家都說他很負責任。","en":"My brother picked up a set of keys outside the restroom in the park. He took the keys to the service desk and asked them to make an announcement. When the owner came, he returned the keys to her himself. Everyone said he was very responsible.","words":[{"en":"responsible","zh":"有責任的、負責的"},{"en":"restroom","zh":"洗手間"},{"en":"return","zh":"返回、歸還"}]},{"id":"L2-R11","level":2,"letter":"R","n":11,"zh":"在學校的戲裡，我的角色是一隻住在王宮的公雞。每次我爬上紙做的屋頂啼叫，皇家樂隊就開始演奏。","en":"In the school play, my role was a rooster living in the royal palace. Every time I climbed onto the paper roof and crowed, the royal band began to play.","words":[{"en":"role","zh":"角色"},{"en":"roof","zh":"屋頂"},{"en":"rooster","zh":"公雞"},{"en":"royal","zh":"王室的、皇家的"}]},{"id":"L2-R12","level":2,"letter":"R","n":12,"zh":"那位賽跑選手的鞋底是橡膠做的。比賽過後，他用濕布來回擦鞋底，直到把泥巴全擦掉。","en":"The runner's shoes have rubber soles. After the race, he rubbed the soles back and forth with a wet cloth until all the mud was gone.","words":[{"en":"rub","zh":"擦、搓"},{"en":"rubber","zh":"橡膠；橡皮擦"},{"en":"runner","zh":"跑者"}]},{"id":"L2-S01","level":2,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"水手站在岸邊，用腳在沙上畫出今天要走的航線。他說為了大家的安全，要等風小一點才能出航。","en":"The sailor stood on the shore and drew today's route in the sand with his foot. He said that for everyone's safety, we had to wait until the wind was weaker before we set sail.","words":[{"en":"safety","zh":"安全"},{"en":"sail","zh":"航行、啟航"},{"en":"sailor","zh":"水手、船員"},{"en":"sand","zh":"沙、沙子"},{"en":"shore","zh":"海岸、海濱"},{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"}]},{"id":"L2-S02","level":2,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"店員請我試吃一小塊火腿三明治，但火腿太鹹了。我請他換成小黃瓜，這才滿足了我想吃點清淡食物的心願。","en":"The clerk asked me to try a small piece of a ham sandwich, but the ham was too salty. I asked him to change it to cucumber, and that satisfied my wish for something light.","words":[{"en":"salty","zh":"鹹的"},{"en":"sandwich","zh":"三明治"},{"en":"satisfy","zh":"使滿意、滿足"}]},{"id":"L2-S03","level":2,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"學校拍短片時，有一幕要用到鋸子。弟弟看到演員舉起鋸子就很害怕。導演怕道具再嚇到他，便讓他摸摸那把軟鋸子。","en":"When our school made a short film, one scene needed a saw. My little brother was scared when he saw the actor raise the saw. The director was afraid the prop would scare him again, so he let him touch the soft saw.","words":[{"en":"saw","zh":"鋸子；用鋸子鋸"},{"en":"scare","zh":"驚嚇、使恐慌"},{"en":"scared","zh":"害怕的"},{"en":"scene","zh":"場景、景象"},{"en":"soft","zh":"軟的、溫和的"}]},{"id":"L2-S04","level":2,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"我沿著人行道走到爸爸的小店，抄下門口的公車時刻表。隔壁的店主說末班車已經開走了，爸爸就騎機車載我回家。","en":"I walked along the sidewalk to Dad's small shop and copied down the bus schedule at the door. The owner of the shop next door said the last bus had already left, so Dad took me home on his scooter.","words":[{"en":"schedule","zh":"時間表、行程"},{"en":"scooter","zh":"機車、滑板車"},{"en":"sidewalk","zh":"人行道"},{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"}]},{"id":"L2-S05","level":2,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"體育館的大螢幕上顯示的比數是三十比三十。教練說輸贏是次要的，但最後一次投籃進了的時候，大家還是跳了起來。","en":"The score on the big screen in the gym was thirty to thirty. The coach said winning or losing was secondary, but when the last shot went in, everyone still jumped up.","words":[{"en":"score","zh":"分數；得分"},{"en":"screen","zh":"螢幕"},{"en":"secondary","zh":"次要的；中等（教育）的"},{"en":"shoot","zh":"射擊、射中"},{"en":"shot","zh":"射擊；打針；（照片）一張"}]},{"id":"L2-S06","level":2,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"海鮮餐廳隔壁有間小店，窗邊擺著一顆粉紅色的貝殼。我進去看了看，最後挑了一隻用銀做的小鯊魚。","en":"There is a small shop next to the seafood restaurant, and a pink shell sits by the window. I went in to look around and finally chose a little shark made of silver.","words":[{"en":"seafood","zh":"海鮮"},{"en":"shark","zh":"鯊魚"},{"en":"shell","zh":"貝殼、殼"},{"en":"silver","zh":"銀；銀色的"}]},{"id":"L2-S07","level":2,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"為了解開老相館的秘密，我仔細搜尋地方志裡介紹車站的那一節。書裡沒寫老闆的名字，我只好去圖書館向館員尋求協助。","en":"To solve the secret of the old photo studio, I carefully searched the section about the train station in the local history book. The book did not have the owner's name, so I went to the library to ask a librarian for help.","words":[{"en":"search","zh":"搜尋、尋找"},{"en":"secret","zh":"祕密；祕密的"},{"en":"section","zh":"部分、區域"},{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"},{"en":"solve","zh":"解決"}]},{"id":"L2-S08","level":2,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"新同學很害羞，很少跟別人說話。我邀她一起玩蹺蹺板，她笑著點了點頭，看起來很開心。","en":"The new classmate is shy and seldom talks to others. I invited her to play on the seesaw with me. She smiled and nodded, and she looked happy.","words":[{"en":"seesaw","zh":"蹺蹺板"},{"en":"seldom","zh":"很少、不常"},{"en":"shy","zh":"害羞的"}]},{"id":"L2-S09","level":2,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"合唱團只剩一個名額。選拔從明天開始，老師會聽錄音來挑選新團員。每段錄音只標編號，報名表上也不用填性別。","en":"There is only one place left in the choir. The selection starts tomorrow, and the teacher will listen to recordings to choose the new member. Each recording only has a number, and you do not need to write your sex on the form.","words":[{"en":"selection","zh":"選擇、選文"},{"en":"sex","zh":"性別；性"}]},{"id":"L2-S10","level":2,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"我在戲裡演一個自私的國王。他拿走弟弟的王冠，還找了個很傻的藉口。最後，國王滿心羞愧地把王冠還給弟弟。弟弟笑著說：「你又變回原來的自己了。」","en":"In the play I acted as a selfish king. He took his brother's crown and gave a silly excuse. In the end, the king gave the crown back to his brother in shame. His brother smiled and said, \\"You are your old self again.\\"","words":[{"en":"self","zh":"自己、自我"},{"en":"selfish","zh":"自私的、利己主義的"},{"en":"shame","zh":"羞恥、羞愧"},{"en":"silly","zh":"愚蠢的、傻的"},{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"}]},{"id":"L2-S11","level":2,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"老師把三種香料裝在不同的碗裡，請我們蒙上眼睛。妹妹對氣味很敏感，只靠嗅覺就認出了肉桂。","en":"The teacher put three spices in different bowls and asked us to cover our eyes. My sister is sensitive to smells, and she recognized the cinnamon by smell alone.","words":[{"en":"sensitive","zh":"敏感的"}]},{"id":"L2-S12","level":2,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"城堡裡的僕人多年來都在宴會上為客人上菜。這次兩位客人爭著坐窗邊，其中一名僕人搬來另一張桌子，就解決了爭執。","en":"The servants in the castle have served food to guests at banquets for many years. This time, two guests argued about who would sit by the window. One of the servants brought another table and settled the argument.","words":[{"en":"servant","zh":"僕人"},{"en":"serve","zh":"服務；供應（餐點）"},{"en":"settle(ment)","zh":"解決；定居"}]},{"id":"L2-S13","level":2,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"陽光從窗外照在架子上，我才看見那盒少了一片的拼圖。旁邊有張紙，紙上畫的圖形和缺口的形狀很相似。","en":"Sunlight shone through the window onto the shelf, and then I saw the puzzle box with a missing piece. Next to it was a sheet of paper with a shape on it that looked similar to the shape of the gap.","words":[{"en":"saw","zh":"鋸子；用鋸子鋸"},{"en":"sheet","zh":"床單；一張（紙）"},{"en":"shelf","zh":"架子、擱板"},{"en":"shine","zh":"發光、照耀"},{"en":"similar","zh":"相似的、類似的"}]},{"id":"L2-S14","level":2,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"我們正在一間寂靜的房間裡拍短片，門突然關上了。大家都嚇了一跳，沒有人打破沉默。原來只是攝影師伸手把門帶上了。","en":"We were making a short film in a silent room when the door suddenly shut. Everyone was startled, and nobody broke the silence. It was only the cameraman reaching out to close the door.","words":[{"en":"shut","zh":"關上、閉起"},{"en":"silence","zh":"沉默、無聲"},{"en":"silent","zh":"沉默的、安靜的"},{"en":"sudden","zh":"突然的、意外的"}]},{"id":"L2-S15","level":2,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"叔叔是位熟練的廚師。他用鋼刀把牛排切成薄片。我想學這項技能，他就先教我怎麼握刀。","en":"My uncle is a skillful cook. He cuts the steak into thin slices with a steel knife. I wanted to learn this skill, so he first taught me how to hold the knife.","words":[{"en":"skill","zh":"技術、技巧"},{"en":"steak","zh":"牛排"},{"en":"steel","zh":"鋼"}]},{"id":"L2-S16","level":2,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"妹妹用肥皂洗手，再用柔軟的毛巾輕輕擦乾。她說手背的皮膚很乾，請我幫她打開乳液瓶。","en":"My sister washed her hands with soap and dried them gently with a soft towel. She said the skin on the back of her hands was dry and asked me to help her open the bottle of lotion.","words":[{"en":"skin","zh":"皮膚"},{"en":"soap","zh":"肥皂"},{"en":"soft","zh":"軟的、溫和的"}]},{"id":"L2-S17","level":2,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"妹妹等車等得想睡了。我一打開點心盒，她就坐直了。她用湯匙吃了一口草莓優格，把最大顆的草莓留給我。","en":"My sister got sleepy waiting for the bus. As soon as I opened the snack box, she sat up straight. She ate a spoonful of strawberry yogurt and saved the biggest strawberry for me.","words":[{"en":"sleepy","zh":"想睡的"},{"en":"snack","zh":"小吃、點心"},{"en":"spoon","zh":"湯匙"},{"en":"strawberry","zh":"草莓"}]},{"id":"L2-S18","level":2,"letter":"S","n":18,"zh":"弟弟穿著拖鞋跑向鞦韆，滑了一跤，一屁股坐在地上。他想改玩溜滑梯，但我摸了摸，光滑的表面還是濕的。","en":"My brother ran to the swing in his slippers, slipped, and fell on his bottom. He wanted to play on the slide instead, but when I touched it, the smooth surface was still wet.","words":[{"en":"slide","zh":"滑；溜滑梯"},{"en":"slip","zh":"滑倒；紙條"},{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"smooth","zh":"平滑的、平穩的"},{"en":"surface","zh":"表面"},{"en":"swing","zh":"搖擺；鞦韆"}]},{"id":"L2-S19","level":2,"letter":"S","n":19,"zh":"我在潮濕的泥土上發現一隻蝸牛。妹妹在葉子底下看到一隻蜘蛛，牠背上有兩個白色斑點。","en":"I found a snail on the damp soil. My sister saw a spider under a leaf, and there were two white spots on its back.","words":[{"en":"saw","zh":"鋸子；用鋸子鋸"},{"en":"snail","zh":"蝸牛"},{"en":"soil","zh":"土壤、土地"},{"en":"spider","zh":"蜘蛛"},{"en":"spot","zh":"地點；斑點；看見"}]},{"id":"L2-S20","level":2,"letter":"S","n":20,"zh":"舅舅住的地方冬天多雪，我出發前特地帶了厚毛衣。媽媽看了我的行李，又放進三雙短襪。","en":"It snows a lot in winter where my uncle lives, so I packed a thick sweater before I left. Mom looked at my bag and put in three pairs of socks.","words":[{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"},{"en":"sweater","zh":"毛衣"}]},{"id":"L2-S21","level":2,"letter":"S","n":21,"zh":"足球是全班最愛的運動。比賽前，我們先伸展雙腿，再慢跑，逐漸加快速度。最後一位同學跑完時，大家都為他拍手，教練稱讚我們有團隊精神。","en":"Soccer is the whole class's favorite sport. Before the game, we stretched our legs first and then jogged, slowly increasing our speed. When the last classmate finished running, everyone clapped for him, and the coach praised our team spirit.","words":[{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"soccer","zh":"足球"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"},{"en":"speed","zh":"速率、速度"},{"en":"spirit","zh":"精神、心靈"},{"en":"sport","zh":"運動"},{"en":"stretch","zh":"伸展、張開"}]},{"id":"L2-S22","level":2,"letter":"S","n":22,"zh":"演講者走上舞臺，跟我們談獨居長者面對的社會問題。聽完演講，我才知道我們的社會裡有這麼多人需要有人陪他們吃頓飯。","en":"The speaker walked onto the stage and talked to us about the social problems that old people living alone face. After the speech, I learned that so many people in our society need someone to share a meal with them.","words":[{"en":"social","zh":"社會的；社交的"},{"en":"society","zh":"社會"},{"en":"speaker","zh":"演講者；喇叭"},{"en":"speech","zh":"演講、說話"},{"en":"stage","zh":"舞臺；階段"}]},{"id":"L2-S23","level":2,"letter":"S","n":23,"zh":"晚餐時，我喝了一口檸檬汽水，覺得有點酸。弟弟也想喝，可是他胃痛，就把杯子放回去了。","en":"At dinner, I took a sip of lemon soda, and it was a little sour. My brother wanted some too, but he had a stomachache, so he put the cup back.","words":[{"en":"soda","zh":"汽水、蘇打"},{"en":"sour","zh":"酸的"},{"en":"stomachache","zh":"胃痛、肚子痛"}]},{"id":"L2-S24","level":2,"letter":"S","n":24,"zh":"我們每天早上掃地，下午走廊上卻又滿是落葉。為了解決這個問題，小安建議在門口裝一道紗門。我們試了一週，覺得這個解決方法有效。","en":"We sweep the floor every morning, but the hallway is full of fallen leaves again in the afternoon. To solve this problem, Xiao-An suggested putting a screen door at the entrance. We tried it for a week and found this solution worked.","words":[{"en":"screen","zh":"螢幕"},{"en":"solution","zh":"解決辦法；溶液"},{"en":"solve","zh":"解決"},{"en":"suggest","zh":"提議、建議"},{"en":"sweep","zh":"掃"}]},{"id":"L2-S25","level":2,"letter":"S","n":25,"zh":"爺爺把郵票按國家分類，每一組都放進不同的透明袋。我幫他把寫著國名的標籤貼在袋子上。","en":"Grandpa sorts his stamps by country and puts each group in a different clear bag. I helped him stick the labels with the country names on the bags.","words":[{"en":"sort","zh":"種類、方式"},{"en":"stamp","zh":"郵票；印章"},{"en":"stick","zh":"棍子；黏貼；刺"}]},{"id":"L2-S26","level":2,"letter":"S","n":26,"zh":"外婆唱歌有自己的風格，我只聽一句就認得出她的聲音。我沒想到這樣一首簡單的歌也能打動我的靈魂。","en":"Grandma has her own style of singing, and I can recognize her voice after just one line. I never expected such a simple song to touch my soul.","words":[{"en":"soul","zh":"靈魂"},{"en":"style","zh":"風格、時尚"},{"en":"such","zh":"如此的、這樣的"}]},{"id":"L2-S27","level":2,"letter":"S","n":27,"zh":"暑假，我們到南部的一個村子，沿著小溪往上走。溪水的源頭就在兩塊大石頭中間。","en":"During the summer vacation, we went to a village in the south and walked up along a stream. The source of the stream was right between two big rocks.","words":[{"en":"source","zh":"來源"},{"en":"stream","zh":"小溪；流"}]},{"id":"L2-S28","level":2,"letter":"S","n":28,"zh":"爸爸把黃豆攤開在桌上，要我幫忙挑出壞掉的。後來我們煮了豆漿。豆漿稍微放涼時，表面就出現一層薄膜。","en":"Dad spread the soybeans on the table and asked me to help pick out the bad ones. Later we made soy milk. When it cooled a little, a thin layer appeared on the surface.","words":[{"en":"soybean","zh":"黃豆、大豆"},{"en":"spread","zh":"散播；塗、鋪開"},{"en":"surface","zh":"表面"}]},{"id":"L2-S29","level":2,"letter":"S","n":29,"zh":"拼字比賽開始前，老師先說明評分標準。她對拼法要求很嚴格，就算只少一個字母，這一題也拿不到分數。","en":"Before the spelling contest began, the teacher explained the standards for scoring. She is strict about spelling, so even if one letter is missing, you get no points for that word.","words":[{"en":"score","zh":"分數；得分"},{"en":"spelling","zh":"拼、拼字"},{"en":"standard","zh":"標準；標準的"},{"en":"strict","zh":"嚴格的"}]},{"id":"L2-S30","level":2,"letter":"S","n":30,"zh":"我抱著一箱補給品走出地鐵站。走到最後幾級臺階時，箱底破了。一位陌生人停下來，幫我把箱子抬到路邊。","en":"I walked out of the subway station carrying a box of supplies. On the last few steps, the bottom of the box broke. A stranger stopped and helped me carry the box to the side of the road.","words":[{"en":"step","zh":"腳步；步驟；臺階"},{"en":"stranger","zh":"陌生人"},{"en":"subway/underground/metro","zh":"地鐵、捷運"},{"en":"supply","zh":"供應、補給"}]},{"id":"L2-S31","level":2,"letter":"S","n":31,"zh":"一場突如其來的暴風雨吹倒了島上的大樹。我們回去時，發現幾隻幼鳥活了下來。牠們能生存，全靠一塊替牠們擋風的大石頭。","en":"A sudden storm blew down the big tree on the island. When we went back, we found that a few baby birds had survived. They survived only because a big rock had blocked the wind for them.","words":[{"en":"storm","zh":"暴風雨"},{"en":"sudden","zh":"突然的、意外的"},{"en":"survive","zh":"存活、倖存"}]},{"id":"L2-S32","level":2,"letter":"S","n":32,"zh":"我練琴時一直在跟壓力搏鬥，一碰到難的地方就停下來。有了姊姊的支持，我反覆練習，終於成功把整首曲子彈完。我把這次成功記在日記裡。","en":"I kept struggling with pressure while practicing the piano, and I stopped whenever I reached a hard part. With my sister's support, I practiced again and again and finally succeeded in playing the whole piece. I wrote about this success in my diary.","words":[{"en":"slipper(s)","zh":"拖鞋"},{"en":"sock(s)","zh":"襪子"},{"en":"struggle","zh":"掙扎、奮鬥"},{"en":"succeed","zh":"成功；繼承"},{"en":"success","zh":"成功、成就"},{"en":"support","zh":"支持、支撐"}]},{"id":"L2-S33","level":2,"letter":"S","n":33,"zh":"禮堂的鐘敲了九下，哥哥才換好西裝。他問我這套衣服適不適合穿去頒獎典禮。我說很合適，而且他看起來超級帥。","en":"The clock in the hall struck nine before my brother finished putting on his suit. He asked me if the suit was suitable for the award ceremony. I said it was perfect, and he looked super handsome.","words":[{"en":"strike","zh":"打擊；罷工"},{"en":"suit","zh":"西裝、套裝；適合"},{"en":"suitable","zh":"合適的"},{"en":"super","zh":"超級的、極好的"}]},{"id":"L2-S34","level":2,"letter":"S","n":34,"zh":"表哥看見我穿著泳衣，說：「我猜你是來游泳的吧？」我說：「我是來學衝浪的。你看，教練已經拿著板子在等我了。」","en":"When my cousin saw me in my swimsuit, he said, \\"I suppose you came to swim?\\" I said, \\"I came to learn to surf. Look, the coach is already waiting for me with a board.\\"","words":[{"en":"saw","zh":"鋸子；用鋸子鋸"},{"en":"suppose","zh":"猜想、假設"},{"en":"surf","zh":"衝浪；上網瀏覽"},{"en":"swim","zh":"游泳"},{"en":"swimsuit","zh":"泳衣"}]},{"id":"L2-S35","level":2,"letter":"S","n":35,"zh":"展場的廣播系統突然沒了聲音，我緊張得吞了口口水。幸好我認得開關旁邊的電源符號。我按下開關，喇叭又有聲音了。","en":"The speaker system at the exhibition suddenly went silent, and I swallowed nervously. Luckily, I recognized the power symbol beside the switch. I pressed the switch, and the speakers came back on.","words":[{"en":"silent","zh":"沉默的、安靜的"},{"en":"speaker","zh":"演講者；喇叭"},{"en":"sudden","zh":"突然的、意外的"},{"en":"swallow","zh":"吞嚥"},{"en":"switch","zh":"開關；切換"},{"en":"symbol","zh":"符號、象徵"},{"en":"system","zh":"系統、體系"}]},{"id":"L2-T01","level":2,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"外婆邊泡茶邊講一個老故事，說一個女孩用一只茶壺換回了家裡的財寶。講到女孩終於回家時，外婆眼裡閃著淚水。","en":"While making tea, Grandma told an old story about a girl who traded a teapot for her family's treasure. When she got to the part where the girl finally went home, there were tears in Grandma's eyes.","words":[{"en":"teapot","zh":"茶壺"},{"en":"tear","zh":"眼淚；撕"},{"en":"trade","zh":"貿易；交換"},{"en":"treasure","zh":"寶藏；珍惜"}]},{"id":"L2-T02","level":2,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"在青少年科技營裡，我們的任務是做一盞不用插電的燈。我們這組的目標是讓燈亮一整晚。","en":"At the teen technology camp, our task was to make a lamp that does not need to be plugged in. Our group's goal was to keep the lamp on all night.","words":[{"en":"task","zh":"工作、任務"},{"en":"technology","zh":"科技、技術"}]},{"id":"L2-T03","level":2,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"老街上的茶商跟外地商人做買賣，每年都得繳稅。他用傳統的方法烘茶。把手藝傳給下一代，是他們家的傳統。","en":"The tea dealer on the old street trades with merchants from other places and has to pay tax every year. He roasts his tea in the traditional way. Passing the skill on to the next generation is his family's tradition.","words":[{"en":"tax","zh":"稅、稅款"},{"en":"trade","zh":"貿易；交換"},{"en":"tradition","zh":"傳統"},{"en":"traditional","zh":"傳統的"}]},{"id":"L2-T04","level":2,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"午後氣溫升高，大家跑得很口渴。遠處傳來雷聲時，教練說颱風正接近，要我們留在室內，直到爸媽來接。","en":"The temperature rose in the afternoon, and everyone got thirsty from running. When we heard thunder in the distance, the coach said a typhoon was coming and told us to stay inside until our parents picked us up.","words":[{"en":"temperature","zh":"溫度；體溫"},{"en":"thirsty","zh":"口渴的"},{"en":"thunder","zh":"雷、雷聲"},{"en":"typhoon","zh":"颱風"}]},{"id":"L2-T05","level":2,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"這學期第一堂課，老師把教科書裡一篇文章的標題遮起來。我們得先讀正文，再替文章取一個名字。","en":"In the first class of the term, the teacher covered the title of an article in the textbook. We had to read the text first and then give the article a name.","words":[{"en":"term","zh":"學期；術語；期限"},{"en":"text","zh":"文字；簡訊、傳訊息"},{"en":"textbook","zh":"教科書"},{"en":"title","zh":"標題；頭銜"}]},{"id":"L2-T06","level":2,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"新聞說全國各地都將舉行反對恐怖主義的活動。一位曾在恐怖攻擊中受傷的記者會來我們學校演講，因此老師請我們先準備幾個問題。","en":"The news said that events against terrorism will be held all over the country. A reporter who was hurt in a terrorist attack will give a speech at our school, so the teacher asked us to prepare some questions first.","words":[{"en":"terrorism","zh":"恐怖主義"},{"en":"terrorist","zh":"恐怖分子"}]},{"id":"L2-T07","level":2,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"小偷帶著失竊的畫去見買家，掉進了警方設下的圈套。在審判中，一位證人認出了畫背面的簽名，說出了這幅畫失竊的真相。","en":"The thief took the stolen painting to meet a buyer and fell into a trap set by the police. At the trial, a witness recognized the signature on the back of the painting and told the truth about how it was stolen.","words":[{"en":"thief","zh":"小偷、賊"},{"en":"trap","zh":"陷阱；困住"},{"en":"trial","zh":"審判；試驗"},{"en":"truth","zh":"事實、真相"}]},{"id":"L2-T08","level":2,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"弟弟說他摔壞了我的模型，語氣很認真。我告訴他：「我相信你說的是真的，也很高興你信任我，願意告訴我心裡的想法。」","en":"My brother told me he had broken my model, and he said it seriously. I told him, \\"I believe you are telling the truth, and I am glad you trust me enough to tell me what you think.\\"","words":[{"en":"trust","zh":"信賴、信任"},{"en":"truth","zh":"事實、真相"}]},{"id":"L2-T09","level":2,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"叔叔把腳踏車輪胎裡的內胎放進水盆，水面立刻冒出細小的氣泡。他就這樣找到了漏氣的地方。","en":"My uncle put the inner tube from the bike tire into a basin of water, and tiny bubbles came up at once. That was how he found the place where the air was leaking.","words":[{"en":"tiny","zh":"極小的"},{"en":"tire","zh":"輪胎；使疲倦"},{"en":"tube","zh":"管子"}]},{"id":"L2-T10","level":2,"letter":"T","n":10,"zh":"阿姨把煎豆腐夾在兩片烤吐司中間，請我嚐一口。豆腐燙到我的舌頭，我趕緊放下吐司，拿面紙擦掉下巴上的醬汁。","en":"My aunt put fried tofu between two slices of toast and asked me to try a bite. The tofu burned my tongue, so I quickly put down the toast and wiped the sauce off my chin with a tissue.","words":[{"en":"tissue","zh":"面紙；（身體）組織"},{"en":"toast","zh":"吐司、烤麵包"},{"en":"tofu","zh":"豆腐"},{"en":"tongue","zh":"舌頭；語言"}]},{"id":"L2-T11","level":2,"letter":"T","n":11,"zh":"出門旅行前，我因為牙痛去看牙醫。回家打包時，我把牙刷放進隨身包，這樣一到旅館就找得到。","en":"Before my trip, I went to the dentist because of a toothache. When I packed at home, I put my toothbrush in my small bag so I could find it as soon as I got to the hotel.","words":[{"en":"toothache","zh":"牙痛"},{"en":"toothbrush","zh":"牙刷"}]},{"id":"L2-T12","level":2,"letter":"T","n":12,"zh":"在這趟徒步導覽中，我們沿著廢棄的鐵軌朝車站走。導遊指著站長的老宿舍說，這就是當地典型的木造房屋。","en":"On this walking tour, we walked toward the station along the old railroad tracks. The guide pointed at the stationmaster's old house and said it was a typical local wooden house.","words":[{"en":"tour","zh":"旅遊、參觀"},{"en":"toward/towards","zh":"朝、向"},{"en":"track","zh":"軌道；跑道；追蹤"},{"en":"typical","zh":"典型的"}]},{"id":"L2-T13","level":2,"letter":"T","n":13,"zh":"魔術師拿起一張我正要丟進垃圾桶的舊報紙，把它摺成三角形。他變了個戲法，紙下竟然出現了一隻小烏龜。","en":"The magician picked up an old newspaper that I was about to throw in the trash can and folded it into a triangle. He did a trick, and a little turtle appeared under the paper.","words":[{"en":"trash","zh":"垃圾"},{"en":"triangle","zh":"三角形"},{"en":"trick","zh":"把戲、詭計；欺騙"},{"en":"turtle","zh":"烏龜、海龜"}]},{"id":"L2-U01","level":2,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"我的雨傘被風吹壞了，我正為這件事心煩，阿姨就借我一把二手傘。它雖然有點醜，卻連一滴雨都沒漏進來。","en":"I was upset because the wind broke my umbrella, and then my aunt lent me a used one. It was a little ugly, but not a single drop of rain came through.","words":[{"en":"ugly","zh":"醜的"},{"en":"umbrella","zh":"雨傘"},{"en":"upset","zh":"難過的、心煩的；使心煩"},{"en":"used","zh":"使用過的、二手的"}]},{"id":"L2-U02","level":2,"letter":"U","n":2,"zh":"大學老師來教天文單元，帶來一張太空人的老照片。一看見照片裡的太空人站在月球上，我就開始好奇宇宙有多大。","en":"A university teacher came to teach the astronomy unit and brought an old photo of an astronaut. As soon as I saw the astronaut standing on the moon, I began to wonder how big the universe is.","words":[{"en":"unit","zh":"單位；單元"},{"en":"universe","zh":"宇宙"},{"en":"university","zh":"大學"}]},{"id":"L2-U03","level":2,"letter":"U","n":3,"zh":"依照我們平時的規定，每個使用者都可以上傳自己拍的照片。除非照片裡的人同意公開，否則請把照片設成只有自己能看。","en":"Under our usual rules, every user can upload photos they took themselves. Unless the people in the photo agree to share it, please set the photo so only you can see it.","words":[{"en":"unless","zh":"除非"},{"en":"upload","zh":"上傳"},{"en":"user","zh":"使用者"},{"en":"usual","zh":"通常的、平常的"}]},{"id":"L2-U04","level":2,"letter":"U","n":4,"zh":"我跑上樓，想從書架上層拿一本書。那裡放的都是二手書，每本的第一頁都留著前一位主人的名字。","en":"I ran upstairs to get a book from the upper shelf. All the books there are used, and each one still has the name of its last owner on the first page.","words":[{"en":"upper","zh":"上面的、較高的"},{"en":"upstairs","zh":"在樓上、向樓上"},{"en":"used","zh":"使用過的、二手的"}]},{"id":"L2-V01","level":2,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"放假時，我們住在山谷裡的一座小村落。房間看出去的景色真美，窗外就是一片金黃色的稻田。","en":"During the vacation, we stayed in a small village in a valley. The view from our room was beautiful. Outside the window was a golden rice field.","words":[{"en":"vacation","zh":"假期、休假"},{"en":"valley","zh":"山谷"},{"en":"view","zh":"景色；看法"},{"en":"village","zh":"村莊"}]},{"id":"L2-V02","level":2,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"鎮民投票決定要不要保留老戲院，支持保留的一方以三票之差獲得勝利。對他們來說，這棟建築很珍貴。它的價值就在那些一起看電影的回憶裡。","en":"The people of the town voted on whether to keep the old theater, and the side that wanted to keep it won by three votes. To them, the building is valuable. Its value lies in the memories of watching movies together.","words":[{"en":"valuable","zh":"有價值的、貴重的"},{"en":"value","zh":"價值、價格"},{"en":"vote","zh":"投票、選舉"}]},{"id":"L2-W01","level":2,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"男服務生在桌下撿到一個皮夾。兩位女服務生跑了過來，其中一位腰上繫著綠色圍裙。他低聲問她們：「這是你們的嗎？」","en":"A waiter found a wallet under the table. Two waitresses ran over, and one of them wore a green apron around her waist. He asked them quietly, \\"Is this yours?\\"","words":[{"en":"waist","zh":"腰部、腰"},{"en":"waiter/waitress","zh":"服務生"},{"en":"wallet","zh":"皮夾、錢包"}]},{"id":"L2-W02","level":2,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"戰爭結束時，曾祖父全部的財富就是一小塊地和一批木材。他用這些木材蓋了一間西式小屋，還用剩下的料做了一張木桌。","en":"When the war ended, all my great-grandfather's wealth was a small piece of land and some wood. He used the wood to build a small Western-style house and made a wooden table with what was left.","words":[{"en":"war","zh":"戰爭"},{"en":"wealth","zh":"財富"},{"en":"western","zh":"西方的"},{"en":"wood(s)","zh":"木頭；樹林"},{"en":"wooden","zh":"木製的"}]},{"id":"L2-W03","level":2,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"水果攤的阿姨先秤西瓜，再把重量寫在紙袋上。她把兩顆熟透的西瓜洗乾淨、切開來，分給幫忙的人吃，一點也沒浪費。","en":"The lady at the fruit stand weighed the watermelons first and wrote the weight on a paper bag. She washed two very ripe watermelons, cut them open, and shared them with the helpers. Nothing went to waste.","words":[{"en":"wash","zh":"洗"},{"en":"waste","zh":"浪費；廢棄物"},{"en":"watermelon","zh":"西瓜"},{"en":"weigh","zh":"秤重；重達"},{"en":"weight","zh":"體重、重量"}]},{"id":"L2-W04","level":2,"letter":"W","n":4,"zh":"表姊的婚禮辦在平日，叔叔願意請假幫忙接送客人。晚餐時，大家舉起葡萄酒向新人道賀，叔叔因為還要開車，就舉起了茶杯。","en":"My cousin's wedding was on a weekday, and my uncle was willing to take a day off to drive the guests. At dinner, everyone raised their glasses of wine to congratulate the couple. My uncle had to drive, so he raised his cup of tea.","words":[{"en":"wedding","zh":"婚禮"},{"en":"weekday","zh":"平日（週一到週五）"},{"en":"willing","zh":"願意的"},{"en":"wine","zh":"葡萄酒、酒"},{"en":"wood(s)","zh":"木頭；樹林"}]},{"id":"L2-W05","level":2,"letter":"W","n":5,"zh":"每當我們看見野生鯨魚浮出水面，全船的人都會安靜下來。船長說，無論牠游到哪裡，我們都得保持距離。","en":"Whenever we see a wild whale come up out of the water, everyone on the boat becomes quiet. The captain said that wherever it swims, we must keep our distance.","words":[{"en":"whale","zh":"鯨魚"},{"en":"whenever","zh":"每當"},{"en":"wherever","zh":"無論哪裡"},{"en":"wild","zh":"野生的；狂野的"}]},{"id":"L2-W06","level":2,"letter":"W","n":6,"zh":"無論誰來參加這場料理比賽，都得在三十分鐘內做完一道菜。廚房裡的食材可以任選，但每組只能用一顆完整的南瓜。","en":"Whoever joins this cooking contest must finish a dish within thirty minutes. You can choose any ingredients in the kitchen, but each group can only use one whole pumpkin.","words":[{"en":"whoever","zh":"無論是誰"},{"en":"whole","zh":"整個的、全部的"},{"en":"within","zh":"在……之內"}]},{"id":"L2-W07","level":2,"letter":"W","n":7,"zh":"爸爸用金屬線把鬆掉的輪子固定好，推車卻還是進不了門。我量了門口的寬度，才發現得先把推車轉個方向，側著進去。","en":"Dad fixed the loose wheel with wire, but the cart still could not get through the door. I measured the width of the doorway and found that we had to turn the cart and take it in sideways.","words":[{"en":"wheel","zh":"輪子；方向盤"},{"en":"width","zh":"寬度"},{"en":"wire","zh":"電線、金屬線"}]},{"id":"L2-W08","level":2,"letter":"W","n":8,"zh":"那天下午風很大，我看見一隻小鳥躲在圍牆邊。我正納悶牠為什麼不飛。走近一看，才發現牠的翅膀上有一道傷口。","en":"The wind was strong that afternoon, and I saw a little bird hiding by the wall. I wondered why it did not fly. When I got closer, I saw a wound on its wing.","words":[{"en":"wing","zh":"翅膀"},{"en":"wonder","zh":"想知道；驚奇"},{"en":"wound","zh":"傷口"}]},{"id":"L2-W09","level":2,"letter":"W","n":9,"zh":"弟弟在美術作業簿上畫了一隻狼，再把灰色羊毛黏在牠背上。我指著狼腳邊那條細細的線問：「那是牠的尾巴，還是一條蚯蚓？」","en":"My brother drew a wolf in his art workbook and stuck gray wool on its back. I pointed at the thin line by the wolf's foot and asked, \\"Is that its tail or a worm?\\"","words":[{"en":"wolf","zh":"狼"},{"en":"wood(s)","zh":"木頭；樹林"},{"en":"wool","zh":"羊毛"},{"en":"workbook","zh":"作業簿、習作"},{"en":"worm","zh":"蟲"}]},{"id":"L2-W10","level":2,"letter":"W","n":10,"zh":"今天的天氣比昨天更糟，山頂的霧也是這一週最濃的。弟弟說最糟的是爬了山卻看不到日出。直到雲縫間露出一道金光，他才說這一趟值得。","en":"The weather today was worse than yesterday, and the fog on the mountain top was the worst of the week. My brother said the worst part was climbing the mountain without seeing the sunrise. It was not until a golden light came through the clouds that he said the trip was worth it.","words":[{"en":"worse","zh":"更糟的"},{"en":"worst","zh":"最糟的"},{"en":"worth","zh":"值得的；價值"}]},{"id":"L2-Y01","level":2,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"爺爺說，他年輕時常和兄弟一起上山挖山藥。今天他煮了一鍋山藥湯，說這就是他年少時最愛的點心。","en":"Grandpa says that when he was young, he often went up the mountain with his brothers to dig yams. Today he cooked a pot of yam soup and said it was his favorite snack in his youth.","words":[{"en":"yam","zh":"番薯、山藥"},{"en":"youth","zh":"年輕時期；年輕人"}]},{"id":"L2-Z01","level":2,"letter":"Z","n":1,"zh":"弟弟第一次在草原上看見斑馬，舉起相機想拍牠身上的條紋。那隻斑馬正好轉過頭來，也看了他一眼。","en":"My brother saw a zebra on the grassland for the first time and raised his camera to take a picture of its stripes. Just then the zebra turned its head and looked at him, too.","words":[{"en":"zebra","zh":"斑馬"}]},{"id":"L3-A01","level":3,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"航空公司剛宣布我們換了登機口。等大家都上了飛機，我才發現剛才讓到一旁讓我通過的乘客就坐在我隔壁。","en":"The airline just announced that our gate had changed. After everyone was aboard, I found that the passenger who had stepped aside to let me pass was sitting right next to me.","words":[{"en":"aboard","zh":"在（船、飛機、車）上"},{"en":"airline","zh":"航空公司"},{"en":"announce(ment)","zh":"宣布"},{"en":"aside","zh":"在旁邊、到一邊"}]},{"id":"L3-A02","level":3,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"這支比較先進的溫度計有什麼優點？如果兩支都夠準確，而且價差在我可以接受的範圍內，我願意為較大的螢幕支付額外的費用。","en":"What is the advantage of this more advanced thermometer? If both are accurate and the difference in price is acceptable to me, I am willing to pay an additional amount for the bigger screen.","words":[{"en":"acceptable","zh":"可接受的、合意的"},{"en":"accurate","zh":"準確的、精確的"},{"en":"additional","zh":"附加的、另外的"},{"en":"advanced","zh":"先進的、進階的"},{"en":"advantage","zh":"優點、優勢"}]},{"id":"L3-A03","level":3,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"昨晚我膝蓋痠痛，一直到半夜十二點才睡著。一位曾在比賽中受傷的運動員勸我先告訴教練。","en":"Last night my knee ached, and I did not fall asleep until midnight. An athlete who once got hurt in a game advised me to tell my coach first.","words":[{"en":"ache","zh":"疼痛"},{"en":"advise","zh":"建議、勸告"},{"en":"athlete","zh":"運動員"}]},{"id":"L3-A04","level":3,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"姊姊的志向是拍一部連小朋友都看得懂的紀錄片。她已經實現了這個目標，還得了一個獎。我最佩服她的是，她花了一年聽孩子們說故事。","en":"My sister's ambition was to make a documentary that even children can understand. She has achieved this goal and won an award. What I admire most is that she spent a year listening to children's stories.","words":[{"en":"achieve(ment)","zh":"達成；成就"},{"en":"admire","zh":"讚美、欽佩"},{"en":"ambition","zh":"野心、志向"},{"en":"award","zh":"獎、獎項；頒發"}]},{"id":"L3-A05","level":3,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"我把第一次在老街尋寶當成一場冒險。地圖上的兩口井只相隔二十公尺。我們先找到廟旁邊那口，之後才在小巷的盡頭看見另一口。","en":"I treated my first treasure hunt on the old street as an adventure. The two wells on the map were only twenty meters apart. We found the one beside the temple first, and afterward we saw the other one at the end of the alley.","words":[{"en":"adventure","zh":"冒險、冒險經歷"},{"en":"afterward/afterwards","zh":"然後、後來"},{"en":"alley","zh":"巷子"},{"en":"apart","zh":"分開、相隔"}]},{"id":"L3-A06","level":3,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"河邊有張單車店的廣告。上面那張漂亮的照片已經吸引了不少遊客，但最吸引我的是連學生都付得起的租車價格。","en":"There was an advertisement for a bike shop by the river. The beautiful photo on it had already attracted many visitors, but what attracted me most was a rental price that even students could afford.","words":[{"en":"advertise(ment)/ad","zh":"登廣告；廣告"},{"en":"afford","zh":"買得起、負擔得起"},{"en":"attract","zh":"吸引"}]},{"id":"L3-A07","level":3,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"來參觀學校菜園的大使以前學過農業。他的顧問協助我們把問題翻成英文，好讓我們問他家鄉的農民怎麼種菜。","en":"The ambassador who visited our school garden had studied agriculture. His adviser assisted us in turning our questions into English so we could ask how farmers in his country grow vegetables.","words":[{"en":"advise","zh":"建議、勸告"},{"en":"adviser/advisor","zh":"顧問"},{"en":"agriculture","zh":"農業"},{"en":"ambassador","zh":"大使"},{"en":"assist","zh":"協助"}]},{"id":"L3-A08","level":3,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"烘焙老師請助手把圍裙拿給前排的孩子。老師把烤過的杏仁倒進碗裡時，觀眾席裡有個孩子舉手問能不能改用花生。","en":"The baking teacher asked her assistant to give aprons to the children in the front row. When the teacher poured the roasted almonds into a bowl, a child in the audience raised a hand and asked if he could use peanuts instead.","words":[{"en":"almond","zh":"杏仁"},{"en":"apron","zh":"圍裙"},{"en":"assistant","zh":"助手、助理"},{"en":"audience","zh":"聽眾、觀眾"}]},{"id":"L3-A09","level":3,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"弟弟還在學英文字母，卻已經會拼出「天使」這個字了。他在卡片上寫下這個字，又把第一個字母畫成一雙翅膀。這個點子讓我很驚奇。","en":"My little brother is still learning the alphabet, but he can already spell the word \\"angel.\\" He wrote the word on a card and drew the first letter as a pair of wings. This idea amazed me.","words":[{"en":"alphabet","zh":"字母（表）"},{"en":"amaze(ment)","zh":"使驚訝"},{"en":"angel","zh":"天使"}]},{"id":"L3-A10","level":3,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"目睹那場可怕的車禍後，我打電話叫了救護車。爸爸在車上等消息時一直很焦慮，直到我告訴他我很安全。","en":"After seeing that awful car accident, I called an ambulance. Dad was anxious while he waited in the car for news, until I told him I was safe.","words":[{"en":"ambulance","zh":"救護車"},{"en":"anxious","zh":"焦慮的、擔心的"},{"en":"awful","zh":"糟糕的、可怕的"}]},{"id":"L3-A11","level":3,"letter":"A","n":11,"zh":"主持人把新同學的名字叫錯了，台上一陣尷尬的沉默。他的朋友說沒人注意到，但他還是親自去道歉。新同學很欣賞他願意認錯的態度。","en":"The host called the new student by the wrong name, and there was an awkward silence on the stage. His friend said no one noticed, but he still went to apologize in person. The new student admired his attitude of admitting his mistake.","words":[{"en":"admire","zh":"讚美、欽佩"},{"en":"apologize","zh":"道歉"},{"en":"attitude","zh":"態度、看法"},{"en":"awkward","zh":"尷尬的；笨拙的"}]},{"id":"L3-A12","level":3,"letter":"A","n":12,"zh":"在我們的短片裡，一名武裝劫匪在銀行外被逮捕。我們原以為校長會同意我們在校門口拍這一幕，今天才知道還要先交劇本。","en":"In our short film, an armed robber is arrested outside a bank. We assumed the principal would approve of filming this scene at the school gate, but today we learned we had to hand in the script first.","words":[{"en":"approve","zh":"贊成、批准"},{"en":"armed","zh":"武裝的"},{"en":"arrest","zh":"逮捕"},{"en":"assume","zh":"假定、以為；承擔"}]},{"id":"L3-A13","level":3,"letter":"A","n":13,"zh":"是自動火警警報器把我從睡夢中喚醒的。我推開廚房門才察覺裡面有煙，烤盤上的吐司已經燒成了灰。","en":"The automatic fire alarm awakened me from my sleep. When I pushed open the kitchen door, I became aware of the smoke inside. The toast on the baking pan had turned to ash.","words":[{"en":"ash","zh":"灰、灰燼"},{"en":"automatic","zh":"自動的"},{"en":"awaken","zh":"喚醒、喚起"},{"en":"aware","zh":"知道的、意識到的"}]},{"id":"L3-A14","level":3,"letter":"A","n":14,"zh":"外公找出一張老照片，指給我看當年駛過這條大道的第一輛汽車。後來，人們在大道兩旁蓋了房子，照片裡的稻田也消失了。","en":"Grandpa found an old photo and showed me the first automobile that drove down this avenue. Later, people built houses on both sides of the avenue, and the rice fields in the photo disappeared.","words":[{"en":"automobile/auto","zh":"汽車"},{"en":"avenue","zh":"大道"}]},{"id":"L3-B01","level":3,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"一位有教學背景的銀行家提出一個大膽的點子，要把歇業的戲院變成免費教室。他已編好第一年的預算，現在正在找願意來教課的人。","en":"A banker with a teaching background came up with a bold idea to turn a closed theater into a free classroom. He has already planned the budget for the first year and is now looking for people willing to teach.","words":[{"en":"background","zh":"背景"},{"en":"banker","zh":"銀行家"},{"en":"bold","zh":"大膽的"},{"en":"budget","zh":"預算"}]},{"id":"L3-B02","level":3,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"我們到的時候，早午餐自助餐快結束了。弟弟想拿培根，但廚師請他等新的一盤。廚師解釋，食物在室溫下放太久，細菌就會繁殖。","en":"When we arrived, the brunch buffet was almost over. My brother wanted some bacon, but the cook asked him to wait for a new plate. The cook explained that bacteria grow when food is left at room temperature for too long.","words":[{"en":"bacon","zh":"培根"},{"en":"bacteria","zh":"細菌"},{"en":"brunch","zh":"早午餐"},{"en":"buffet","zh":"自助餐、小賣部"}]},{"id":"L3-B03","level":3,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"哥哥說看別人打保齡球讓他覺得無聊，還跟我打賭他第一球就能打倒所有球瓶。結果他第一球打得很差，連一個瓶子都沒碰到。","en":"My brother said watching others go bowling bored him, and he bet me he could knock down all the pins with his first ball. In the end, he played his first ball so badly that he did not hit a single pin.","words":[{"en":"badly","zh":"嚴重地；很差地"},{"en":"bet","zh":"打賭"},{"en":"bore","zh":"使無聊"},{"en":"bowling","zh":"保齡球"}]},{"id":"L3-B04","level":3,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"放下行李後，我們幫民宿主人把書架搬進地下室。樓梯太窄，我們得把書架轉個角度才剛好能通過轉角。","en":"After putting down our baggage, we helped the owner of the guesthouse move a bookcase into the basement. The stairs were so narrow that we had to turn the bookcase at an angle to barely get it around the corner.","words":[{"en":"baggage","zh":"行李"},{"en":"bare","zh":"赤裸的、光禿的"},{"en":"barely","zh":"幾乎不"},{"en":"basement","zh":"地下室"},{"en":"bookcase","zh":"書架、書櫃"}]},{"id":"L3-B05","level":3,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"一陣微風吹過海灣，外公把他用竹子做的釣竿交給我。他說如果魚吃掉了餌卻沒有上鉤，我就得在鉤上放新的餌。","en":"A breeze blew across the bay, and Grandpa handed me the fishing rod he made from bamboo. He said if a fish ate the bait but did not get caught, I had to put new bait on the hook.","words":[{"en":"bait","zh":"餌"},{"en":"bamboo","zh":"竹子"},{"en":"bay","zh":"海灣"},{"en":"breeze","zh":"微風"}]},{"id":"L3-B06","level":3,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"我們在穀倉外聽見有人用力敲門。叔叔從裡面喊，說一根橫樑倒下來抵住了門，所以他沒辦法把那桶水搬出來。","en":"Outside the barn, we heard someone banging on the door. My uncle shouted from inside that a beam had fallen against the door, so he could not carry the barrel of water out.","words":[{"en":"bang","zh":"砰的一聲；猛擊"},{"en":"barn","zh":"穀倉"},{"en":"barrel","zh":"桶"},{"en":"beam","zh":"光束；橫樑"}]},{"id":"L3-B07","level":3,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"有隻亮綠色的甲蟲躲在我的雨靴底下。弟弟光著腳走過來，蹲在一旁看牠慢慢爬回草地。","en":"A bright green beetle was hiding under my rain boot. My brother came over in bare feet and squatted beside it to watch it crawl slowly back to the grass.","words":[{"en":"bare","zh":"赤裸的、光禿的"},{"en":"beetle","zh":"甲蟲"},{"en":"boot","zh":"靴子"}]},{"id":"L3-B08","level":3,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"妹妹指著田裡的水牛，問農夫這麼大的野獸會不會攻擊人。農夫解釋，這頭水牛是他養的，但還是請我們站在圍欄外，因為隔壁那頭公牛不喜歡陌生人靠近。","en":"My sister pointed at the buffalo in the field and asked the farmer if such a big beast would attack people. The farmer explained that he raised this buffalo, but he still asked us to stand outside the fence because the bull next door did not like strangers coming close.","words":[{"en":"beast","zh":"野獸"},{"en":"buffalo","zh":"水牛"},{"en":"bull","zh":"公牛"}]},{"id":"L3-B09","level":3,"letter":"B","n":9,"zh":"除了莓果，農夫還請我們吃一種帶點苦味的葉子。他說種不同的植物對果園有好處，因為這樣會吸引更多昆蟲。","en":"Besides berries, the farmer let us try a leaf with a slightly bitter taste. He said planting different plants benefits the orchard because it attracts more insects.","words":[{"en":"benefit","zh":"好處、利益；福利"},{"en":"berry","zh":"漿果"},{"en":"besides","zh":"而且、此外"},{"en":"bitter","zh":"苦的、痛苦的"}]},{"id":"L3-B10","level":3,"letter":"B","n":10,"zh":"新娘把一顆藍色的小珠子穿在細繩上，再用繩子把一束花綁好。她把花送給妹妹，奶奶站在兩人身邊，輕聲祝福她們。","en":"The bride put a small blue bead on a thin string and used the string to tie up a bunch of flowers. She gave the flowers to my sister, and Grandma stood beside them and quietly blessed them.","words":[{"en":"bead","zh":"珠子"},{"en":"bless","zh":"祝福、保佑"},{"en":"bride","zh":"新娘"},{"en":"bunch","zh":"一串、一束、一群"}]},{"id":"L3-B11","level":3,"letter":"B","n":11,"zh":"我搬椅子時手肘撞到門把，傷口開始流血。姊姊拿了一條乾淨的毛巾給我，我才發現身上那件女襯衫的袖子已經沾滿了血。","en":"I bumped my elbow on the door handle while I was moving a chair, and the cut started to bleed. My sister brought me a clean towel, and then I noticed that the sleeve of my blouse was covered in blood.","words":[{"en":"bleed","zh":"流血"},{"en":"blouse","zh":"女用襯衫"},{"en":"bump","zh":"碰撞；腫塊"}]},{"id":"L3-B12","level":3,"letter":"B","n":12,"zh":"那面紅磚牆上的洞是一顆子彈留下的。居民在整修老屋時還找到一枚未爆炸彈和一支黃銅軍號。軍號現在就陳列在牆邊。","en":"The hole in that red brick wall was made by a bullet. While fixing the old house, the people living there also found an unexploded bomb and a brass bugle. The bugle is now displayed beside the wall.","words":[{"en":"bomb","zh":"炸彈"},{"en":"brass","zh":"黃銅"},{"en":"brick","zh":"磚塊"},{"en":"bullet","zh":"子彈"}]},{"id":"L3-B13","level":3,"letter":"B","n":13,"zh":"阿姨上週在廣播節目裡談她接受乳房手術的經歷。訪問後，有位聽眾寫信謝謝她，說他很佩服她願意公開談這段經歷的勇氣。","en":"Last week my aunt talked on a radio broadcast about her breast surgery. After the interview, a listener wrote to thank her and said he admired her bravery in talking about this experience in public.","words":[{"en":"bravery","zh":"勇敢"},{"en":"breast","zh":"胸部、乳房"},{"en":"broadcast","zh":"廣播、播出"}]},{"id":"L3-B14","level":3,"letter":"B","n":14,"zh":"教練請我站在淺水區，先深吸一口氣。我把臉埋進水裡，用鼻子慢慢吐氣，吐出一串氣泡，這才明白游泳時要怎麼呼吸。","en":"The coach asked me to stand in the shallow water and take a deep breath first. I put my face in the water and breathed out slowly through my nose, making a stream of bubbles. Then I understood how to breathe while swimming.","words":[{"en":"breath","zh":"呼吸、氣息"},{"en":"breathe","zh":"呼吸"},{"en":"bubble","zh":"泡泡"}]},{"id":"L3-B15","level":3,"letter":"B","n":15,"zh":"清晨院子裡的燈泡還亮著，媽媽已經提著水桶在外面了。灌木上的幾個花苞開了，蜜蜂正在花朵四周飛舞，振翅作響。","en":"Early in the morning, the light bulb in the yard was still on, and Mom was already outside with a bucket. A few buds on the bush had opened, and bees were buzzing around the flowers.","words":[{"en":"bucket","zh":"水桶"},{"en":"bud","zh":"芽、花蕾"},{"en":"bulb","zh":"電燈泡；球莖"},{"en":"bush","zh":"矮樹叢"},{"en":"buzz","zh":"嗡嗡聲"}]},{"id":"L3-B16","level":3,"letter":"B","n":16,"zh":"送報員看見前方的路被泥沙掩埋，連忙踩下煞車。後座那一捆報紙滑到了地上，幸好外層的塑膠袋沒有破。","en":"The newspaper boy saw that the road ahead was buried under mud and quickly hit the brakes. The bundle of newspapers on the back seat slid to the ground. Luckily, the plastic bag around it did not break.","words":[{"en":"brake","zh":"煞車"},{"en":"bundle","zh":"一捆、一束"},{"en":"bury","zh":"埋葬、埋藏"}]},{"id":"L3-C01","level":3,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"機長請大家往左邊的窗戶看，客艙裡一下子安靜下來。我從座位上看見一座橫跨峽谷的吊橋，陽光正照在支撐橋面的纜索上。","en":"The captain asked everyone to look out of the windows on the left, and the cabin suddenly went quiet. From my seat I saw a bridge hanging across the canyon, and the sun was shining on the cables that held it up.","words":[{"en":"cabin","zh":"小屋；機艙、船艙"},{"en":"cable","zh":"電纜；有線電視"},{"en":"canyon","zh":"峽谷"},{"en":"captain","zh":"隊長；船長、機長"}]},{"id":"L3-C02","level":3,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"到了新學校，我第一個敢走進去的地方是校園裡的自助餐廳。跟我同桌的女孩很開朗，我們才聊了一會兒，我就沒那麼緊張了。","en":"At my new school, the first place I dared to walk into was the cafeteria on campus. The girl at my table was cheerful, and after we chatted for a while, I was not so nervous.","words":[{"en":"cafeteria","zh":"自助餐廳"},{"en":"campus","zh":"校園"},{"en":"chat","zh":"聊天"},{"en":"cheerful","zh":"開朗的、快樂的"}]},{"id":"L3-C03","level":3,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"爸爸做木匠已經二十年了。他職業生涯中第一次遇到坐輪椅的客戶。他相信自己有能力為這位客戶做出一張高度剛好的書桌。","en":"Dad has been a carpenter for twenty years. For the first time in his career, he has a client who uses a wheelchair. He believes he is capable of making a desk at just the right height for this client.","words":[{"en":"capable","zh":"有能力的"},{"en":"career","zh":"職業、生涯"},{"en":"carpenter","zh":"木匠"},{"en":"client","zh":"客戶、顧客"}]},{"id":"L3-C04","level":3,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"農夫正在山腳下數牛，忽然聽見洞穴裡傳來公雞的叫聲。我們在洞口撒了一把米，終於捉到了昨天逃走的那隻公雞。","en":"The farmer was counting his cattle at the foot of the mountain when he heard a rooster crowing in a cave. We threw a handful of rice at the entrance of the cave and finally captured the cock that ran away yesterday.","words":[{"en":"capture","zh":"捕捉、俘虜"},{"en":"cattle","zh":"牛（總稱）"},{"en":"cave","zh":"洞穴"},{"en":"cock","zh":"公雞"}]},{"id":"L3-C05","level":3,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"我們在博物館看到一輛馬車，車廂地板上竟然鋪著地毯。導覽員說這輛馬車當年造價昂貴，旁邊那輛木製手推車才是農夫用來載菜的。","en":"At the museum we saw a carriage with a carpet on its floor. The guide said this carriage was costly back then, and the wooden cart next to it was what farmers used to carry vegetables.","words":[{"en":"carpet","zh":"地毯"},{"en":"carriage","zh":"馬車；（火車）車廂"},{"en":"cart","zh":"手推車；馬車"},{"en":"costly","zh":"昂貴的"}]},{"id":"L3-C06","level":3,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"這是一場非正式的試鏡，大家都穿著自己的衣服來。導演選了平時很安靜的學姊演馬戲團的小丑。她一走上台，她的魅力就把我們全都吸引住了。","en":"It was a casual audition, so everyone came in their own clothes. The director chose a usually quiet older student to play the circus clown. As soon as she walked on stage, her charm won all of us over.","words":[{"en":"casual","zh":"休閒的、隨意的"},{"en":"charm","zh":"魅力；護身符"},{"en":"circus","zh":"馬戲團"},{"en":"clothe","zh":"給……穿衣"},{"en":"clown","zh":"小丑"}]},{"id":"L3-C07","level":3,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"去年拿下冠軍的學長今天代表我們學校，和來自台南的選手競爭。比賽後，教練坐到他身邊安慰他，說第二名也是他努力得來的。","en":"Last year's champion represented our school today and competed against players from Tainan. After the match, the coach sat beside him to comfort him and said second place was something he had earned with hard work.","words":[{"en":"champion","zh":"冠軍"},{"en":"coach","zh":"教練；長途巴士"},{"en":"comfort","zh":"舒適、安慰"},{"en":"compete","zh":"競爭、對抗"}]},{"id":"L3-C08","level":3,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"妹妹用黏土做了一個下巴尖尖的老人，還用指尖在他的臉頰上壓出酒窩。老師說妹妹很有創造力，因為大家一看就認得出那是我們的校長。","en":"My sister made an old man with a pointed chin out of clay and pressed dimples into his cheeks with her fingertip. The teacher said she was very creative because everyone could tell right away that it was our principal.","words":[{"en":"cheek","zh":"臉頰"},{"en":"chin","zh":"下巴"},{"en":"clay","zh":"黏土"},{"en":"creative","zh":"有創意的"}]},{"id":"L3-C09","level":3,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"媽媽點了一杯用椰子汁調的雞尾酒，杯沿上還放了一顆櫻桃。妹妹想吃那顆櫻桃，服務生就從廚房另外拿了一顆給她。","en":"Mom ordered a cocktail made with coconut water, with a cherry on the edge of the glass. My sister wanted to eat the cherry, so the waiter brought her another one from the kitchen.","words":[{"en":"cherry","zh":"櫻桃"},{"en":"cocktail","zh":"雞尾酒"},{"en":"coconut","zh":"椰子"}]},{"id":"L3-C10","level":3,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"山上那天冷颼颼的，門一打開，我就感到一股寒意。我從木箱裡拿出毯子時，正好看見隔壁的煙囪冒起了白煙。","en":"It was chilly on the mountain that day, and when the door opened, I felt a chill. As I took a blanket out of the wooden box, I saw white smoke rising from the chimney next door.","words":[{"en":"chill","zh":"寒冷；冷卻；放鬆"},{"en":"chilly","zh":"寒冷的"},{"en":"chimney","zh":"煙囪"}]},{"id":"L3-C11","level":3,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"我們只帶了一個小電鍋，哥哥負責把蔬菜切碎。飯還在煮的時候，我們分著吃了最後一包洋芋片。","en":"We only brought a small rice cooker, and my brother was in charge of chopping the vegetables. While the rice was still cooking, we shared the last bag of chips.","words":[{"en":"chip","zh":"洋芋片；晶片；碎片"},{"en":"chop","zh":"切、砍；排骨"},{"en":"cooker","zh":"爐具、鍋具"}]},{"id":"L3-C12","level":3,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"我們還沒走進電影院，弟弟就因為門口有人抽香菸而開始咳嗽。爸爸帶他到街角的診所，我則把電影票換成下星期的。","en":"Before we even walked into the cinema, my brother started to cough because someone was smoking a cigarette at the door. Dad took him to the clinic on the corner, and I changed our movie tickets to next week.","words":[{"en":"cigarette","zh":"香菸"},{"en":"cinema","zh":"電影院"},{"en":"clinic","zh":"診所；門診"},{"en":"cough","zh":"咳嗽"}]},{"id":"L3-C13","level":3,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"幾位市民成立了委員會，討論身心障礙者的公民權利。他們請我把大家的意見傳達給市長，特別是對投票所樓梯的疑慮。","en":"Some citizens formed a committee to discuss the civil rights of people with disabilities. They asked me to communicate everyone's opinions to the mayor, especially their worries about the stairs at the voting places.","words":[{"en":"citizen","zh":"公民、市民"},{"en":"civil","zh":"公民的；民事的"},{"en":"committee","zh":"委員會"},{"en":"communicate","zh":"溝通、傳達"}]},{"id":"L3-C14","level":3,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"清潔工在衣櫥裡找到一件外套，口袋裡有張收據，夾在一張名片上。那張名片是她找到失主的第一條線索。","en":"The cleaner found a coat in the closet. In its pocket was a receipt clipped to a business card. That card was her first clue to finding the owner.","words":[{"en":"cleaner","zh":"清潔工；清潔劑"},{"en":"clip","zh":"夾子；剪；短片"},{"en":"closet","zh":"衣櫥"},{"en":"clue","zh":"線索、暗示"}]},{"id":"L3-C15","level":3,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"妹妹想用自己做的衣服給搖籃裡的娃娃穿。她拿出一塊棉布做小襯衫，連衣領都是自己縫的。","en":"My sister wanted to clothe the doll in the cradle with clothes she made herself. She took out a piece of cotton cloth to make a little shirt, and she even sewed the collar herself.","words":[{"en":"clothe","zh":"給……穿衣"},{"en":"collar","zh":"衣領；項圈"},{"en":"cotton","zh":"棉花"},{"en":"cradle","zh":"搖籃"}]},{"id":"L3-C16","level":3,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"外公有一批珍藏的彩色郵票，他把這批收藏按大洲分類。其中有一張來自昔日的英國殖民地，票上的地名跟現在地圖上的不同。","en":"Grandpa has a treasured collection of colorful stamps, and he sorts the collection by continent. One of them comes from a former British colony, and the place name on it is different from the one on today's maps.","words":[{"en":"collection","zh":"收集、收藏品"},{"en":"colony","zh":"殖民地"},{"en":"colorful","zh":"色彩鮮豔的"},{"en":"continent","zh":"大陸、洲"}]},{"id":"L3-C17","level":3,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"我替校報的專欄校稿時，發現最後一句少了一個逗號。少了這個停頓，整段話就會讓讀者困惑，甚至使人得出相反的結論。","en":"When I was checking a column for the school newspaper, I found that the last sentence was missing a comma. Without this pause, the whole paragraph would confuse readers and might even lead them to the opposite conclusion.","words":[{"en":"column","zh":"專欄；圓柱；欄"},{"en":"comma","zh":"逗號"},{"en":"conclusion","zh":"結論"},{"en":"confuse","zh":"使困惑、搞混"}]},{"id":"L3-C18","level":3,"letter":"C","n":18,"zh":"音樂會結束後，後排的同學抱怨說他們聽不清楚。他們的抱怨讓我們去比較前後排的錄音。這一比，我們才發現後面的喇叭從頭到尾都沒出聲。","en":"After the concert, the students in the back rows complained that they could not hear clearly. Their complaint made us compare the recordings from the front and back rows. This comparison showed that the speakers at the back had not made a sound the whole time.","words":[{"en":"comparison","zh":"比較、對照"},{"en":"complain","zh":"抱怨、抗議"},{"en":"complaint","zh":"抱怨、投訴"},{"en":"concert","zh":"音樂會、演唱會"}]},{"id":"L3-C19","level":3,"letter":"C","n":19,"zh":"我用圓錐體當機器人的帽子，再把馬達接到控制器上。如果兩條線接對了，帽子就會跟著音樂轉動。","en":"I used a cone as the robot's hat and then connected the motor to the controller. If the two wires are connected correctly, the hat will turn with the music.","words":[{"en":"cone","zh":"圓錐體；甜筒"},{"en":"connect","zh":"連接、連結"},{"en":"controller","zh":"控制器；管理者"}]},{"id":"L3-C20","level":3,"letter":"C","n":20,"zh":"我看見一輛小貨車撞上停在工地門口的起重機。碰撞後司機仍然神志清醒。他向我確認車裡只有他一個人，我便把這件事告訴接線員。","en":"I saw a small truck crash into a crane parked at the gate of a construction site. After the crash, the driver was still conscious. He confirmed with me that he was the only one in the truck, and I told the operator.","words":[{"en":"confirm","zh":"證實、確定"},{"en":"conscious","zh":"有意識的、清醒的"},{"en":"crane","zh":"鶴、起重機"},{"en":"crash","zh":"撞擊、墜毀；當機"}]},{"id":"L3-C21","level":3,"letter":"C","n":21,"zh":"這兩個村子雖然在同一個縣，今天的雨量卻有相當大的差距。其中一村整個下午雨勢都維持不變，另一村卻只下了十分鐘。","en":"Although these two villages are in the same county, there was a considerable difference in rainfall today. In one village the rain stayed constant all afternoon, but in the other it only rained for ten minutes.","words":[{"en":"considerable","zh":"相當的、可觀的"},{"en":"constant","zh":"不變的、一定的"},{"en":"county","zh":"郡、縣"}]},{"id":"L3-C22","level":3,"letter":"C","n":22,"zh":"英文老師指著一隻正往海裡爬的螃蟹，請我們說出眼前看到的兩個名詞。接著她問我們，英文裡「螃蟹」和「沙」哪一個是可數名詞。","en":"The English teacher pointed at a crab crawling toward the sea and asked us to name two nouns we could see. Then she asked us which word in English is countable, \\"crab\\" or \\"sand.\\"","words":[{"en":"countable","zh":"可數的"},{"en":"crab","zh":"螃蟹"},{"en":"crawl","zh":"爬行"}]},{"id":"L3-C23","level":3,"letter":"C","n":23,"zh":"這本漫畫的創作者把每種生物都畫得比實物大。弟弟看了半天，才認出戴眼鏡的主角是一隻蟋蟀。","en":"The creator of this comic book draws every creature bigger than it really is. My brother looked for a long time before he realized that the main character in glasses was a cricket.","words":[{"en":"creator","zh":"創造者、創作者"},{"en":"creature","zh":"生物"},{"en":"cricket","zh":"蟋蟀、板球"}]},{"id":"L3-C24","level":3,"letter":"C","n":24,"zh":"我們的戲裡，一名罪犯偷走王冠，躲到一艘正要出港的船上。殘酷的國王下令把全體船員關起來，直到有人說出小偷藏在哪裡。","en":"In our play, a criminal steals the crown and hides on a ship that is about to leave the harbor. The cruel king orders the whole crew to be locked up until someone tells where the thief is hiding.","words":[{"en":"crew","zh":"全體機組（船員）、工作人員"},{"en":"criminal","zh":"罪犯；犯罪的"},{"en":"crown","zh":"皇冠"},{"en":"cruel","zh":"殘忍的"}]},{"id":"L3-C25","level":3,"letter":"C","n":25,"zh":"地瓜是外婆家農場的主要作物。她把賣剩的地瓜烤成酥脆的薄片，收在店裡的碗櫃。她認識多年的客人可以賒帳買這些地瓜片。","en":"Sweet potatoes are the main crop on Grandma's farm. She bakes the unsold sweet potatoes into crispy slices and keeps them in the cupboard in her shop. Customers she has known for years can buy these chips on credit.","words":[{"en":"chip","zh":"洋芋片；晶片；碎片"},{"en":"credit","zh":"信用；功勞；學分"},{"en":"crispy","zh":"酥脆的"},{"en":"crop","zh":"農作物"},{"en":"cupboard","zh":"櫥櫃"}]},{"id":"L3-D01","level":3,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"過去十年，小鎮上的牛奶店已從五家減少到一家。剩下的那家在黎明就開門，趕早班車的人也買得到鮮奶。","en":"In the past decade, the dairy shops in the town have decreased from five to one. The last one opens at dawn, so people catching the early train can still buy fresh milk.","words":[{"en":"dairy","zh":"乳製品；乳品的"},{"en":"dawn","zh":"破曉、黎明"},{"en":"decade","zh":"十年"},{"en":"decrease","zh":"減少"}]},{"id":"L3-D02","level":3,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"水壩下方有一條水溝，把田裡多餘的水排出去。雨停了，水還從葉尖滴下來，一隻蜻蜓就停在其中一片葉子上。","en":"There is a ditch below the dam that drains extra water from the fields. The rain had stopped, but water was still dripping from the tips of the leaves, and a dragonfly was resting on one of them.","words":[{"en":"dam","zh":"水壩"},{"en":"ditch","zh":"溝渠"},{"en":"dragonfly","zh":"蜻蜓"},{"en":"drain","zh":"排水；排水管"},{"en":"drip","zh":"滴下；水滴"}]},{"id":"L3-D03","level":3,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"我不喜歡高處，從跳水台往下看就頭暈。弟弟問我敢不敢跳。我還在搖頭，他就沿著跳板飛奔，跳進了水裡。","en":"I dislike high places, and looking down from the diving board makes me dizzy. My brother asked if I dared to jump. I was still shaking my head when he dashed along the board and dived into the water.","words":[{"en":"dare","zh":"敢；挑戰"},{"en":"dash","zh":"衝；破折號"},{"en":"dislike","zh":"討厭、不喜歡"},{"en":"dive","zh":"潛水、跳水"},{"en":"dizzy","zh":"頭暈的"}]},{"id":"L3-D04","level":3,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"爸在卡片上寫著：「親愛的，今晚跟我一起在陽台用餐好嗎？」他已經用媽媽喜歡的花把陽台布置好了，冰箱裡還藏著她最愛的甜點。","en":"Dad wrote on the card, \\"Darling, will you dine with me on the balcony tonight?\\" He had already decorated the balcony with the flowers Mom likes, and her favorite dessert was hidden in the fridge.","words":[{"en":"darling","zh":"親愛的、可愛的人"},{"en":"decorate","zh":"裝飾"},{"en":"dessert","zh":"甜點"},{"en":"dine","zh":"用餐"}]},{"id":"L3-D05","level":3,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"老師拿出一張舊磁碟，裡面存著我們學校第一份方言資料庫。新程式偵測到兩筆拼法相同的詞條。我們讀了定義才明白，這是兩個不同的詞。","en":"The teacher took out an old disk that holds our school's first database of local dialects. The new program detected two entries with the same spelling. After reading the definitions, we understood that they were two different words.","words":[{"en":"database","zh":"資料庫"},{"en":"definition","zh":"定義"},{"en":"detect","zh":"偵測、發現"},{"en":"disk/disc","zh":"光碟、磁碟；圓盤"}]},{"id":"L3-D06","level":3,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"一名不誠實的古董商聲稱自己擁有鎮上最老的房子。叔叔先查了房屋契據才決定要不要付訂金，結果發現屋主另有其人。","en":"A dishonest antique dealer claimed he owned the oldest house in town. My uncle checked the deed of the house before deciding whether to pay the deposit and found that someone else owned it.","words":[{"en":"dealer","zh":"經銷商、商人"},{"en":"deed","zh":"行為"},{"en":"deposit","zh":"存款；訂金；存入"},{"en":"dishonest","zh":"不誠實的"}]},{"id":"L3-D07","level":3,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"班導讓我們自己決定班費如何運用。每個人都能提出想法並投票。這次民主的決策過程加深了我對民主的了解。","en":"Our homeroom teacher let us determine how to use our class money. Everyone could share ideas and vote. This democratic way of deciding deepened my understanding of democracy.","words":[{"en":"deepen","zh":"深化"},{"en":"democracy","zh":"民主、民主國家"},{"en":"democratic","zh":"民主的"},{"en":"determine","zh":"決定；下定決心"}]},{"id":"L3-D08","level":3,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"姊姊從小就渴望成為服裝設計師。她覺得市中心那家店是最理想的工作地點，因為新人也能在櫥窗展示自己的作品。","en":"Since she was little, my sister has had a strong desire to become a fashion designer. She thinks the downtown shop is the most desirable place to work because even new designers can show their work in the window.","words":[{"en":"designer","zh":"設計師"},{"en":"desirable","zh":"值得擁有的、理想的"},{"en":"desire","zh":"渴望、慾望"},{"en":"downtown","zh":"市中心（的）"}]},{"id":"L3-D09","level":3,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"微暗的燈光下，一個長角的惡魔在舞台上追著紙做的恐龍和驢子跑。演到一半，有人打翻一杯水，毀了惡魔的紙翅膀。","en":"Under the dim light, a devil with horns chased a paper dinosaur and a donkey around the stage. Halfway through, someone knocked over a glass of water and destroyed the devil's paper wings.","words":[{"en":"destroy","zh":"破壞、毀壞"},{"en":"devil","zh":"魔鬼"},{"en":"dim","zh":"暗淡的、模糊的"},{"en":"dinosaur","zh":"恐龍"},{"en":"donkey","zh":"驢子"}]},{"id":"L3-D10","level":3,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"船靠近碼頭時，大家都以為今天看不到海豚了。就在我走上甲板時，一隻海豚躍出海面，又一頭潛入水裡。","en":"As the boat came near the dock, everyone thought we would not see any dolphins today. Just as I stepped onto the deck, a dolphin jumped out of the sea and dived back into the water.","words":[{"en":"deck","zh":"甲板"},{"en":"dive","zh":"潛水、跳水"},{"en":"dock","zh":"碼頭、船塢"},{"en":"dolphin","zh":"海豚"}]},{"id":"L3-D11","level":3,"letter":"D","n":11,"zh":"在美國旅行時，妹妹買一個甜甜圈還差十美分。她很懷疑店主肯給她折扣，沒想到一位客人把一枚十美分硬幣放在她手上。","en":"While traveling in the US, my sister was ten cents short for a doughnut. She was doubtful the owner would give her a discount, but a customer put a dime in her hand.","words":[{"en":"dime","zh":"十分錢硬幣"},{"en":"discount","zh":"折扣"},{"en":"doubtful","zh":"懷疑的、不確定的"},{"en":"doughnut","zh":"甜甜圈"}]},{"id":"L3-D12","level":3,"letter":"D","n":12,"zh":"我把舊木箱拖到院子裡，先撣去蓋子上的灰塵。把手旁的汙垢很難清，我只好把布浸在水裡，再慢慢擦掉汙垢。","en":"I dragged the old wooden box into the yard and dusted the lid first. The dirt by the handle was hard to clean, so I dipped a cloth in water and slowly wiped it off.","words":[{"en":"dip","zh":"沾、浸；下降"},{"en":"dirt","zh":"泥土；汙垢"},{"en":"drag","zh":"拖、拉"},{"en":"dust","zh":"灰塵"}]},{"id":"L3-D13","level":3,"letter":"D","n":13,"zh":"我去藥房替爸爸領藥。藥師正在說明每一劑該吃幾顆，一名喝醉的男子走錯門，進來問公車站在哪裡。","en":"I went to the drugstore to get Dad's medicine. While the pharmacist was explaining how many pills to take for each dose, a drunk man came in through the wrong door and asked where the bus stop was.","words":[{"en":"dose","zh":"（藥的）一劑、劑量"},{"en":"drugstore","zh":"藥妝店、藥局"},{"en":"drunk","zh":"喝醉了的"}]},{"id":"L3-D14","level":3,"letter":"D","n":14,"zh":"有人把廢土倒進排水溝，雨水流不出去，菜苗全淹死了。農夫清好水溝、重新播種。幾週後，菜園的變化十分顯著，原本光禿禿的地方長滿了青菜。","en":"Someone dumped dirt into the drain, so the rainwater could not flow out and all the young vegetables drowned. The farmer cleaned the ditch and planted the seeds again. A few weeks later, the change in the garden was dramatic. The bare spots were full of green vegetables.","words":[{"en":"dirt","zh":"泥土；汙垢"},{"en":"ditch","zh":"溝渠"},{"en":"drain","zh":"排水；排水管"},{"en":"dramatic","zh":"戲劇性的；戲劇的"},{"en":"drown","zh":"淹死、溺水"},{"en":"dump","zh":"傾倒；垃圾場"}]},{"id":"L3-D15","level":3,"letter":"D","n":15,"zh":"童話裡，其他動物笑驢子笨，連一顆餃子也包不好。等客人愈來愈多，牠們才發現只有驢子記得每一桌點了什麼。","en":"In the fairy tale, the other animals laughed at the donkey for being dumb because it could not even wrap a dumpling. When more and more guests came, they found that only the donkey remembered what each table ordered.","words":[{"en":"donkey","zh":"驢子"},{"en":"dumb","zh":"啞的；笨的"},{"en":"dumpling","zh":"水餃、餃子"}]},{"id":"L3-E01","level":3,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"校刊編輯急著看球賽報導，但我還在等隊長回覆。她教我先編輯其他段落，這個做法比坐著等更有效率。","en":"The editor of the school magazine was eager to see the report on the game, but I was still waiting for the captain's reply. She taught me to edit the other parts first. This way was more efficient than sitting and waiting.","words":[{"en":"eager","zh":"渴望的、熱切的"},{"en":"edit","zh":"編輯"},{"en":"editor","zh":"編輯（人員）"},{"en":"efficient","zh":"有效率的"}]},{"id":"L3-E02","level":3,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"學校設計了一個遊戲，教孩子認識水資源短缺的問題。這個遊戲既有教育意義又好玩。我最喜歡的環節，是自己決定如何把一桶水分給三戶人家。","en":"The school designed a game to educate children about the shortage of water. The game is both educational and enjoyable. My favorite part was deciding how to share a bucket of water among three families.","words":[{"en":"educate","zh":"教育、培養"},{"en":"educational","zh":"教育的、教育性的"},{"en":"enjoyable","zh":"令人愉快的"}]},{"id":"L3-E03","level":3,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"一位年長的乘客在電梯裡跌倒，撞到了手肘。遇到這種緊急情況時，可以按牆上的通話鈕，讓管理員知道你在哪裡。","en":"An elderly passenger fell in the elevator and hit her elbow. In an emergency like this, you can press the call button on the wall to let the manager know where you are.","words":[{"en":"elbow","zh":"手肘"},{"en":"elderly","zh":"年長的"},{"en":"elevator","zh":"電梯"},{"en":"emergency","zh":"緊急情況；急診"}]},{"id":"L3-E04","level":3,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"學校原本打算用電子設備舉行選舉，可是當天早上停了電。大家改用紙票，還是在午休前選出了新會長。","en":"The school planned to hold the election with electronic equipment, but the electricity went out that morning. Everyone used paper votes instead, and they still elected a new president before lunch break.","words":[{"en":"elect","zh":"選出、選舉"},{"en":"election","zh":"選舉"},{"en":"electricity","zh":"電、電力"},{"en":"electronic","zh":"電子的"}]},{"id":"L3-E05","level":3,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"我很羨慕演皇帝的同學。他那張表情豐富的臉讓全場都看得出皇帝有多生氣。謝幕時他看見爸爸站起來鼓掌，激動得掉了眼淚。","en":"I envy my classmate who played the emperor. His expressive face showed everyone how angry the emperor was. At the curtain call, he saw his father stand up and clap, and he became so emotional that he cried.","words":[{"en":"emotional","zh":"情緒的、情感的"},{"en":"emperor","zh":"皇帝"},{"en":"envy","zh":"羨慕、嫉妒"},{"en":"expressive","zh":"富有表現力的"}]},{"id":"L3-E06","level":3,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"表姊的訂婚派對在二樓舉行。入口旁新裝的升降椅讓外婆能自己上樓。她那天精神特別好，還拉著我去跳了第一支舞。","en":"My cousin's engagement party was held on the second floor. The new stair lift beside the entry enabled Grandma to go upstairs by herself. She was especially energetic that day and even pulled me to the first dance.","words":[{"en":"enable","zh":"使能夠"},{"en":"energetic","zh":"精力充沛的"},{"en":"engage(ment)","zh":"從事、參與；訂婚"},{"en":"entry","zh":"進入；參賽作品；條目"}]},{"id":"L3-E07","level":3,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"在學生美術展覽開幕前，我把海報上一條多餘的鉛筆線擦掉了。老師說我對自己的期待很高，但追求卓越也要學會在畫完時放下筆。","en":"Before the student art exhibition opened, I erased an extra pencil line on my poster. The teacher said I had high expectations of myself, but pursuing excellence also means learning to put the pen down when the painting is done.","words":[{"en":"erase","zh":"抹去、擦掉"},{"en":"excellence","zh":"優秀、卓越"},{"en":"exhibition","zh":"展覽"},{"en":"expectation","zh":"期待、期望"}]},{"id":"L3-E08","level":3,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"我們和國外的學生交換禮物時，送的是阿姨家出口的茶葉。對方回信說，他們那裡的冬天極其寒冷，放學後很喜歡把我們送的茶葉泡成熱茶來喝。","en":"When we exchanged gifts with students abroad, we gave them tea that my aunt's family exports. They wrote back that winters there are extremely cold, and they love making hot tea with our gift after school.","words":[{"en":"exchange","zh":"交換；兌換"},{"en":"export","zh":"出口；出口品"},{"en":"extreme","zh":"極端的"}]},{"id":"L3-E09","level":3,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"我們和老師一起探索一條舊隧道，還做了一個關於回聲的實驗。老師把氣球吹到爆裂，我們用手機錄下聲音，查看過了多久才聽到回聲。","en":"We explored an old tunnel with our teacher and did an experiment on echoes. The teacher blew up a balloon until it exploded, and we recorded the sound with our phones to see how long it took to hear the echo.","words":[{"en":"echo","zh":"回音"},{"en":"experiment","zh":"實驗、試驗"},{"en":"explode","zh":"爆炸、爆發"},{"en":"explore","zh":"探索、探險"}]},{"id":"L3-F01","level":3,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"戲服間裡有件花俏的外套，是去年演仙女的同學穿過的。雖然袖口已經褪色，加上一條窄皮帶後，這件外套看起來又很時尚。","en":"In the costume room there is a fancy jacket that a classmate wore to play a fairy last year. Although the cuffs have faded, with a narrow belt the jacket looks fashionable again.","words":[{"en":"fade","zh":"褪色、消失"},{"en":"fairy","zh":"仙子、精靈"},{"en":"fancy","zh":"花俏的、高級的；想像"},{"en":"fashionable","zh":"時髦的、流行的"}]},{"id":"L3-F02","level":3,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"浴室的水龍頭把手突然掉下來，妹妹嚇得幾乎暈倒。受了這場驚嚇後，她一直害怕獨自走進浴室，直到爸爸把水龍頭修好。","en":"The handle of the bathroom faucet suddenly fell off, and my sister almost fainted from fear. After this fright, she was fearful of going into the bathroom alone until Dad fixed the faucet.","words":[{"en":"faint","zh":"昏倒；微弱的"},{"en":"faucet","zh":"水龍頭"},{"en":"fearful","zh":"害怕的；可怕的"},{"en":"fright","zh":"驚嚇"}]},{"id":"L3-F03","level":3,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"兩位鬥士在上場前握起拳頭，輕輕碰了碰對方的拳套。他們都信任這位裁判，因為她總是公平地對待每個人。","en":"Before the match, the two fighters made fists and lightly touched each other's gloves. They both had faith in the referee because she always treats everyone fairly.","words":[{"en":"fairly","zh":"相當地；公平地"},{"en":"faith","zh":"信心、信仰"},{"en":"fighter","zh":"戰士；戰鬥機"},{"en":"fist","zh":"拳頭"}]},{"id":"L3-F04","level":3,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"叔叔原以為這只錶值一大筆錢，就拿去給一位熟悉老錶的師傅看。師傅很坦白，當場指出它是仿造品，還讓我們比較真錶和這只錶上的刻字。","en":"My uncle thought this watch was worth a fortune, so he took it to a repairman familiar with old watches. The repairman was frank and told him right away that it was a fake. He even let us compare the words on a real watch and this one.","words":[{"en":"fake","zh":"假的"},{"en":"familiar","zh":"熟悉的、常見的"},{"en":"fortune","zh":"財富、運氣"},{"en":"frank","zh":"坦白的"}]},{"id":"L3-F05","level":3,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"在多霧的山區，這兩個村子之間的公車班次不多。站牌上寫得很清楚，想再往山裡搭遠一點的人要付多少車資。","en":"In the foggy mountains, there are not many buses between these two villages. The sign at the bus stop clearly shows how much the fare is for people who want to go farther into the mountains.","words":[{"en":"fare","zh":"車資、票價"},{"en":"farther","zh":"更遠的"},{"en":"foggy","zh":"有霧的"}]},{"id":"L3-F06","level":3,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"一群白鳥越過田邊的柵欄時，我看見一根羽毛慢慢落下來。它輕輕落在灌溉溝裡，浮在水面上。","en":"When a flock of white birds flew over the fence by the field, I saw a feather slowly falling. It landed gently in the ditch and floated on the water.","words":[{"en":"feather","zh":"羽毛"},{"en":"fence","zh":"籬笆、圍欄"},{"en":"float","zh":"漂浮"},{"en":"flock","zh":"（鳥、羊）群"}]},{"id":"L3-F07","level":3,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"操場上突然閃過一道光，我以為有人提早放了煙火。原來是警衛打開了手電筒。他看到球門旁有一小團火焰，想看清楚是什麼東西著火了。","en":"A light suddenly flashed across the playground, and I thought someone had set off fireworks early. It was the guard turning on his flashlight. He saw a small flame beside the goal and wanted to see clearly what was burning.","words":[{"en":"firework","zh":"煙火"},{"en":"flame","zh":"火焰"},{"en":"flash","zh":"閃光；閃爍"},{"en":"flashlight","zh":"手電筒"}]},{"id":"L3-F08","level":3,"letter":"F","n":8,"zh":"我把芒果從冷凍庫取出，等它稍微變軟，再把果肉壓成泥。妹妹把果泥拌進麵粉裡，烤出來的餅乾有淡淡的芒果味。","en":"I took the mango out of the freezer, waited for it to soften a little, and then mashed the flesh. My sister mixed the mashed mango into the flour, and the cookies she baked had a light mango flavor.","words":[{"en":"flavor","zh":"味道、口味"},{"en":"flesh","zh":"肉、肉體"},{"en":"flour","zh":"麵粉"},{"en":"freeze","zh":"凍結、冷凍"},{"en":"freezer","zh":"冷凍庫"}]},{"id":"L3-F09","level":3,"letter":"F","n":9,"zh":"我喜歡聽阿公在河堤吹長笛，他甚至有一小群每週都來聽他演奏的聽眾。等我搬走後，我想我會永遠記得那段隨風飄進窗戶的旋律。","en":"I love listening to Grandpa play the flute on the riverbank, and he even has a small group of followers who come to hear him every week. After I move away, I think I will remember that melody drifting through my window forever.","words":[{"en":"flute","zh":"長笛"},{"en":"follower","zh":"追隨者、粉絲"},{"en":"forever","zh":"永遠"}]},{"id":"L3-F10","level":3,"letter":"F","n":10,"zh":"洪水退去後，我們把借來的毛毯摺好，讓卡車司機載到下一個村子。居民還成立了基金，替載送物資的司機支付燃料費。","en":"After the flood went down, we folded the borrowed blankets so a truck driver could take them to the next village. The villagers also set up a fund to pay for fuel for the drivers who carried supplies.","words":[{"en":"flood","zh":"洪水；淹沒"},{"en":"fold","zh":"摺疊"},{"en":"fuel","zh":"燃料"},{"en":"fund","zh":"基金、資金"}]},{"id":"L3-F11","level":3,"letter":"F","n":11,"zh":"那年冬天我住在國外，看見公園的噴泉整座結冰了。一塊掉下來的冰嚇到了旁邊的小狗，牠鑽進主人懷裡，只露出一小撮灰色的軟毛。","en":"I lived abroad that winter and saw the whole fountain in the park freeze. A falling piece of ice frightened a small dog nearby. It jumped into its owner's arms, and only a little gray fur showed.","words":[{"en":"fountain","zh":"噴泉"},{"en":"freeze","zh":"凍結、冷凍"},{"en":"frighten","zh":"使驚嚇"},{"en":"fur","zh":"毛皮"}]},{"id":"L3-G01","level":3,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"住在美國的叔叔讓我看車庫裡的一本舊帳本。我只瞥了一眼，就發現他當年買一加侖汽油付的錢比現在少得多。","en":"My uncle in the US showed me an old account book in his garage. With just one glance, I saw that he paid much less for a gallon of gasoline back then than now.","words":[{"en":"gallon","zh":"加侖"},{"en":"garage","zh":"車庫；修車廠"},{"en":"gasoline/gas","zh":"汽油"},{"en":"glance","zh":"一瞥、看一眼"}]},{"id":"L3-G02","level":3,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"小說裡，一幫人常躲在圍牆的缺口後面賭博。最貪心的那個人想把贏來的錢翻倍，結果連最後一枚硬幣都輸掉了。","en":"In the novel, a gang often gambles behind a gap in the wall. The greediest man wanted to double the money he had won, but in the end he lost even his last coin.","words":[{"en":"gamble","zh":"賭博"},{"en":"gang","zh":"幫派；一群"},{"en":"gap","zh":"縫隙；差距"},{"en":"greedy","zh":"貪心的"}]},{"id":"L3-G03","level":3,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"我們在地理老師的指導下，寫信問美國一位州長，當地農民如何因應全球氣候變遷。州長回信時附了一張地圖，上面標出了最缺水的農場。","en":"With guidance from our geography teacher, we wrote to a US governor to ask how local farmers deal with global climate change. The governor wrote back with a map showing the farms that need water most.","words":[{"en":"geography","zh":"地理"},{"en":"global","zh":"全球的"},{"en":"governor","zh":"州長"},{"en":"guidance","zh":"指導、輔導"}]},{"id":"L3-G04","level":3,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"日落的餘暉照在高爾夫球場上，教練做了個手勢，請觀眾安靜。這位為學校贏得榮耀的選手，去年還只是個幫大家撿球的新生。","en":"The glow of the sunset shone on the golf course, and the coach made a gesture asking the audience to be quiet. The player who has brought glory to our school was only a new student who picked up balls for everyone last year.","words":[{"en":"gesture","zh":"手勢；姿態"},{"en":"glory","zh":"光榮、榮耀"},{"en":"glow","zh":"發光；光輝"},{"en":"golf","zh":"高爾夫球"}]},{"id":"L3-G05","level":3,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"聽到有人說班長畢業後要當歌手，我沒有把這段流言傳出去。拍班級合照時我親口問了她，她露齒一笑，說自己已經考上音樂系了。","en":"When I heard someone say our class leader would become a singer after she graduates, I did not spread the gossip. When we took the class photo, I asked her myself. She grinned and said she had already been accepted by a music department.","words":[{"en":"gossip","zh":"八卦、閒話"},{"en":"graduate","zh":"畢業；畢業生"},{"en":"grin","zh":"露齒笑"}]},{"id":"L3-G06","level":3,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"弟弟在雜貨店買完口香糖，裝著零錢的袋子就從櫃檯滑了下來。他一把抓住提帶，我握緊袋口，硬幣一枚都沒掉出來。","en":"After my brother bought gum at the grocery store, the bag with his change slid off the counter. He grabbed the handle, and I grasped the top of the bag, so not a single coin fell out.","words":[{"en":"grab","zh":"抓取"},{"en":"grasp","zh":"抓住；理解"},{"en":"grocery","zh":"食品雜貨（店）"},{"en":"gum","zh":"口香糖；牙齦"}]},{"id":"L3-G07","level":3,"letter":"G","n":7,"zh":"溫室旁有一片長滿草的斜坡，是美術老師最喜歡帶我們寫生的地方。今天一隻蚱蜢跳到同學的畫上，顏色和他畫的草一模一樣。","en":"There is a grassy slope beside the greenhouse, and it is the art teacher's favorite place to take us to draw. Today a grasshopper jumped onto a classmate's painting, and it was exactly the same color as the grass he painted.","words":[{"en":"grasshopper","zh":"蚱蜢"},{"en":"grassy","zh":"長滿草的"},{"en":"greenhouse","zh":"溫室"}]},{"id":"L3-H01","level":3,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"我到店裡時，美髮師正用一條手帕幫淋了雨的小客人擦臉。我從走廊盡頭拿來一個衣架，讓這個孩子把濕外套掛起來。","en":"When I got to the shop, the hairdresser was using a handkerchief to dry the face of a little customer who had been caught in the rain. I brought a hanger from the end of the hallway so the child could hang up his wet jacket.","words":[{"en":"hairdresser","zh":"美髮師、理髮師"},{"en":"hallway","zh":"走廊"},{"en":"handkerchief","zh":"手帕"},{"en":"hanger","zh":"衣架"}]},{"id":"L3-H02","level":3,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"一堆舊木板旁只剩一小把釘子，正好夠我們修好一張凳子。老師借給我一支小鐵鎚，比家裡的那支輕。要在凳腳之間敲釘子時，這支鐵鎚特別好用。","en":"Only a handful of nails were left beside a heap of old boards, just enough for us to fix a stool. The teacher lent me a small hammer that was lighter than the one at home. It was especially handy for hitting nails between the stool's legs.","words":[{"en":"hammer","zh":"鐵鎚"},{"en":"handful","zh":"一把；少數"},{"en":"handy","zh":"方便的、便利的；手巧的"},{"en":"heap","zh":"一堆"}]},{"id":"L3-H03","level":3,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"地方報紙的頭條報導了港口的漏油事件。油會傷害海鳥，這次已經有兩隻幼鳥受害。居民想知道怎麼做才能保護鳥群，避免漏油造成更嚴重的危害。","en":"The headline of the local newspaper was about an oil spill in the harbor. Oil can harm seabirds, and two young birds have already been hurt. The people living nearby want to know how to protect the birds and keep the oil spill from causing more harm.","words":[{"en":"harbor","zh":"港口"},{"en":"harm","zh":"傷害、害處"},{"en":"headline","zh":"（新聞）標題"}]},{"id":"L3-H04","level":3,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"我們在農場幫忙收割牧草。草曬乾後，我們把乾草搬進穀倉，卻有一隻剛孵出來的小雞擋在門口。我猶豫了一下，決定等牠自己跟上母雞。","en":"We helped with the hay harvest on the farm. After the grass dried, we carried the hay into the barn, but a chick that had just hatched was standing in the doorway. I hesitated and decided to wait until it followed the mother hen by itself.","words":[{"en":"harvest","zh":"收穫、收成"},{"en":"hatch","zh":"孵化"},{"en":"hay","zh":"乾草"},{"en":"hesitate","zh":"猶豫、遲疑"}]},{"id":"L3-H05","level":3,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"有人暗示球隊總部把比賽獎金全拿走了，網路上很快就出現充滿恨意的留言。隊長請我們先看看隊員自己公布的帳目，以免倉促下結論。","en":"Someone hinted that the team's headquarters had taken all the prize money, and hateful comments soon appeared online. The captain asked us to look at the accounts the players had made public first, so we would not make a hasty conclusion.","words":[{"en":"hasty","zh":"匆忙的、草率的"},{"en":"hateful","zh":"憎恨的、可恨的"},{"en":"headquarters","zh":"總部、司令部"},{"en":"hint","zh":"暗示、提示"}]},{"id":"L3-H06","level":3,"letter":"H","n":6,"zh":"上次爬山時腳後跟磨出的水泡已經癒合，我終於能再出發了。這次我們雇用了一位當地嚮導，她在落石區入口叫大家戴好安全帽。","en":"The blister on my heel from the last hike has healed, so I can finally go again. This time we hired a local guide, and at the start of the area with falling rocks, she told everyone to put on their helmets.","words":[{"en":"heal","zh":"癒合、痊癒"},{"en":"heel","zh":"腳跟；鞋跟"},{"en":"helmet","zh":"安全帽、頭盔"},{"en":"hire","zh":"僱用；租用"}]},{"id":"L3-H07","level":3,"letter":"H","n":7,"zh":"我們排的是一齣描寫地獄的戲，舞台上有一堆畫成火焰的紙板。排練室的暖氣機也開到了最強，才念完第一句臺詞，大家就熱得脫下外套。","en":"We were rehearsing a play about hell, and there was a heap of cardboard painted like flames on the stage. The heater in the rehearsal room was also turned all the way up. After the first line, everyone was so hot that they took off their jackets.","words":[{"en":"heap","zh":"一堆"},{"en":"heater","zh":"暖氣機、加熱器"},{"en":"hell","zh":"地獄"}]},{"id":"L3-H08","level":3,"letter":"H","n":8,"zh":"每位持票人都可以跟歷史學家走進這座有歷史意義的古城。我們進入當地人視為神聖的殿堂前，先脫了鞋。","en":"Every ticket holder can walk into this historic old city with a historian. Before we entered the hall that local people consider holy, we took off our shoes.","words":[{"en":"historian","zh":"歷史學家"},{"en":"historic","zh":"歷史上重要的"},{"en":"holder","zh":"持有人；支架"},{"en":"holy","zh":"神聖的"}]},{"id":"L3-H09","level":3,"letter":"H","n":9,"zh":"室友聽見我閉著嘴輕聲唱著故鄉的小調，就知道我想家了。她給了我一個擁抱。我告訴她，我希望今年能回家過年。","en":"When my roommate heard me humming a song from my hometown, she knew I was homesick. She gave me a hug. I told her I was hopeful that I could go home for the New Year this year.","words":[{"en":"homesick","zh":"想家的"},{"en":"hometown","zh":"故鄉、家鄉"},{"en":"hopeful","zh":"有希望的、抱著希望的"},{"en":"hug","zh":"擁抱"},{"en":"hum","zh":"哼歌；嗡嗡聲"}]},{"id":"L3-H10","level":3,"letter":"H","n":10,"zh":"阿哲說，得到校刊寫作獎是份榮譽。他在致詞時唸了自己寫得最糟的一句，還解釋那句話好笑在哪裡。那段幽默的致詞讓我們欣賞他的誠實和幽默感。","en":"A-Zhe said winning the school magazine's writing award was an honor. In his speech, he read the worst sentence he had ever written and explained why it was funny. That humorous speech made us admire his honesty and his sense of humor.","words":[{"en":"honesty","zh":"誠實"},{"en":"honor","zh":"榮譽；尊敬"},{"en":"humor","zh":"幽默"},{"en":"humorous","zh":"幽默的"}]},{"id":"L3-H11","level":3,"letter":"H","n":11,"zh":"在那部恐怖片裡，男主角聽到一聲可怕的尖叫。我們到片尾才發現，那是一個孩子對著中空的牛角吹出來的聲音。","en":"In that horror movie, the hero hears a horrible scream. Not until the end did we learn that it was the sound of a child blowing into a hollow horn.","words":[{"en":"hollow","zh":"空心的"},{"en":"horn","zh":"角；喇叭"},{"en":"horrible","zh":"可怕的、糟透的"},{"en":"horror","zh":"恐怖"}]},{"id":"L3-H12","level":3,"letter":"H","n":12,"zh":"夏天，山上的度假小屋很潮濕，管家每天都來開窗。她按鐘點領薪水，也常把一部分收入捐給幫助村民對抗飢餓的團體。","en":"In summer, the vacation cabin in the mountains is very humid, so the housekeeper comes to open the windows every day. She is paid hourly and often gives part of her pay to a group that helps villagers fight hunger.","words":[{"en":"hourly","zh":"每小時的"},{"en":"housekeeper","zh":"管家"},{"en":"humid","zh":"潮溼的"},{"en":"hunger","zh":"飢餓"}]},{"id":"L3-I01","level":3,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"阿姨在小旅館外結冰的臺階上滑倒，傷了腳踝。我跑去通知旅館老闆，說她需要立即就醫。","en":"My aunt slipped on the icy steps outside the small inn and hurt her ankle. I ran to inform the owner of the inn that she needed immediate medical care.","words":[{"en":"icy","zh":"結冰的、冰冷的"},{"en":"immediate","zh":"立即的"},{"en":"inform","zh":"通知、告知"},{"en":"inn","zh":"小旅館"}]},{"id":"L3-I02","level":3,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"雨下了一整天，我們只好待在室內。老師為室內活動準備的材料只有紙箱，但同學用想像力搭出了一座有捷運的城市，讓來參觀的家長印象深刻。","en":"It rained all day, so we had to stay indoors. The only materials the teacher prepared for the indoor activity were boxes, but my classmates used their imagination to build a city with an MRT, and it impressed the visiting parents.","words":[{"en":"imagination","zh":"想像力"},{"en":"impress","zh":"使印象深刻"},{"en":"indoor","zh":"室內的"},{"en":"indoors","zh":"在室內"}]},{"id":"L3-I03","level":3,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"這家公司以前從海外進口工業用零件。檢查員逐件檢查後，發現其中一批的品質比臺灣製的零件差。","en":"This company used to import industrial parts from overseas. The inspector inspected them one by one and found that the quality of one batch was inferior to parts made in Taiwan.","words":[{"en":"import","zh":"進口；進口品"},{"en":"industrial","zh":"工業的"},{"en":"inferior","zh":"次等的、較差的"},{"en":"inspect","zh":"檢查、檢閱"},{"en":"inspector","zh":"檢查員；督察"}]},{"id":"L3-I04","level":3,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"班費少了一百元，班長先蒐集資訊，調查那筆錢是誰拿去買東西的。後來他在自己的背包內袋找到收據，才想起買粉筆的是自己。被大家懷疑的值日生是清白的。","en":"One hundred dollars was missing from the class money, so the class leader gathered information to investigate who had taken it to buy something. Later he found the receipt in the inner pocket of his own backpack and remembered that he was the one who bought the chalk. The student on duty, whom everyone suspected, was innocent.","words":[{"en":"inform","zh":"通知、告知"},{"en":"information","zh":"資訊、消息"},{"en":"inn","zh":"小旅館"},{"en":"inner","zh":"內部的、內心的"},{"en":"innocent","zh":"無辜的；天真的"},{"en":"investigate","zh":"調查"}]},{"id":"L3-I05","level":3,"letter":"I","n":5,"zh":"那位聰明的年輕發明家收到科展邀請後，帶來一雙她發明的乳白色手套。弟弟想知道她怎麼用手套控制玩具車，卻不想打斷她的示範，就等到最後才問。","en":"After receiving the invitation to the science fair, the young intelligent inventor brought a pair of ivory gloves she had invented. My brother wanted to know how she controlled a toy car with the gloves, but he did not want to interrupt her show, so he waited until the end to ask.","words":[{"en":"intelligent","zh":"聰明的"},{"en":"interrupt","zh":"打斷、中斷"},{"en":"invent","zh":"發明"},{"en":"inventor","zh":"發明家"},{"en":"invitation","zh":"邀請、邀請函"},{"en":"ivory","zh":"象牙"}]},{"id":"L3-J01","level":3,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"在這本推理小說裡，一名珠寶商從監獄寄了封信給女兒。信裡附了一張失竊寶石的素描。女兒一看到圖，就認出那是母親首飾盒裡的那顆寶石。","en":"In this mystery novel, a jeweler sends a letter to his daughter from jail. The letter includes a sketch of a stolen jewel. As soon as the daughter sees the picture, she recognizes the stone from her mother's jewelry box.","words":[{"en":"jail","zh":"監獄"},{"en":"jewel","zh":"寶石"},{"en":"jewelry","zh":"珠寶、首飾"}]},{"id":"L3-J02","level":3,"letter":"J","n":2,"zh":"姊姊的下顎剛開完刀，咬不動她最愛的多汁水蜜桃。我用桃汁做了果凍，裝進小玻璃罐，讓她也能吃到生日甜點。","en":"My sister just had surgery on her jaw, so she cannot bite her favorite juicy peaches. I made jelly with peach juice and put it in small glass jars, so she could have a birthday dessert, too.","words":[{"en":"jar","zh":"罐子"},{"en":"jaw","zh":"下巴、顎"},{"en":"jelly","zh":"果凍、果醬"},{"en":"juicy","zh":"多汁的"}]},{"id":"L3-J03","level":3,"letter":"J","n":3,"zh":"這趟旅行的第一站是叢林邊的小鎮。我們搭噴射機到最近的城市，再轉乘吉普車，趕在天黑前抵達小鎮。","en":"The first stop on this journey was a small town at the edge of the jungle. We took a jet to the nearest city and then took a jeep, arriving at the town before dark.","words":[{"en":"jeep","zh":"吉普車"},{"en":"jet","zh":"噴射機"},{"en":"journey","zh":"旅程、旅行"},{"en":"jungle","zh":"叢林"}]},{"id":"L3-J04","level":3,"letter":"J","n":4,"zh":"學校爵士樂團裡，一名資淺的團員用一堆廢棄舊物做了一面鼓。她被選為獨奏者時，我有點嫉妒，但當她敲出那段歡快的節奏，我也跟著拍起手來。","en":"In the school jazz band, a junior member made a drum out of a pile of junk. When she was chosen to play a solo, I was a little jealous, but when she played that joyful beat, I started clapping along.","words":[{"en":"jazz","zh":"爵士樂"},{"en":"jealous","zh":"嫉妒的、羨慕的"},{"en":"joyful","zh":"喜悅的"},{"en":"junior","zh":"資淺的；年紀較輕的"},{"en":"junk","zh":"垃圾、廢物"}]},{"id":"L3-K01","level":3,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"幼兒園的孩子走了一公里才到無尾熊館，卻只看到一隻無尾熊抱著樹睡覺。回程經過袋鼠區時，剛好有隻小袋鼠從媽媽的育兒袋裡探出頭來。","en":"The kindergarten children walked one kilometer to the koala house but only saw one koala sleeping in a tree. On the way back, as they passed the kangaroo area, a baby kangaroo was just looking out of its mother's pouch.","words":[{"en":"kangaroo","zh":"袋鼠"},{"en":"kilometer","zh":"公里"},{"en":"kindergarten","zh":"幼稚園"},{"en":"koala","zh":"無尾熊"}]},{"id":"L3-K02","level":3,"letter":"K","n":2,"zh":"在妹妹寫的故事裡，王國中最勇敢的騎士很怕冷。奶奶替他織了一條紅圍巾，他出發前還請她把圍巾的兩端打成一個結。","en":"In my sister's story, the bravest knight in the kingdom hates the cold. Grandma knitted him a red scarf, and before he left, he asked her to tie the two ends of the scarf in a knot.","words":[{"en":"kingdom","zh":"王國"},{"en":"knight","zh":"騎士、爵士"},{"en":"knit","zh":"編織"},{"en":"knot","zh":"結"}]},{"id":"L3-K03","level":3,"letter":"K","n":3,"zh":"自然老師帶來一套人體模型組裝材料。我的工作是裝上兩顆腎臟。同組同學坐在鍵盤前，把我做的每個步驟都打進電腦。","en":"The science teacher brought a kit for building a model of the human body. My job was to put in the two kidneys. My partner sat at the keyboard and typed every step I did into the computer.","words":[{"en":"keyboard","zh":"鍵盤"},{"en":"kidney","zh":"腎臟"},{"en":"kit","zh":"成套工具、工具箱"}]},{"id":"L3-L01","level":3,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"我正要把皮外套和有蕾絲花邊的洋裝放進洗衣籃。媽媽看了外套的標籤，提醒我這件只能乾洗。","en":"I was about to put my leather jacket and a dress with lace into the laundry basket. Mom looked at the label on the jacket and reminded me that it could only be dry-cleaned.","words":[{"en":"label","zh":"標籤；貼標籤"},{"en":"lace","zh":"蕾絲；鞋帶"},{"en":"laundry","zh":"待洗（洗好）的衣物；洗衣店"},{"en":"leather","zh":"皮革"}]},{"id":"L3-L02","level":3,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"最近，每次澆陽臺上的花，水都會從鬆動的接頭漏到下面的草坪上。今天爸爸扶著梯子，我爬上去把接頭轉緊了。","en":"Lately, every time I water the flowers on the balcony, water leaks from a loose joint onto the lawn below. Today Dad held the ladder while I climbed up and tightened the joint.","words":[{"en":"ladder","zh":"梯子"},{"en":"lately","zh":"最近"},{"en":"lawn","zh":"草坪"},{"en":"leak","zh":"漏；漏洞"},{"en":"loose","zh":"寬鬆的、鬆的"}]},{"id":"L3-L03","level":3,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"爺爺喜歡在閒暇時到公園下棋。每局的輸家都要教贏家一句家鄉話。爺爺說這種學語言的方式很活潑，棋桌旁也總是充滿笑聲。","en":"Grandpa likes to play chess in the park in his leisure time. The loser of each game has to teach the winner a sentence in his hometown dialect. Grandpa says this way of learning a language is lively, and the chess table is always full of laughter.","words":[{"en":"laughter","zh":"笑聲"},{"en":"learning","zh":"學習、學問"},{"en":"leisure","zh":"休閒、空閒"},{"en":"lively","zh":"活潑的、有活力的"},{"en":"loser","zh":"輸家、失敗者"}]},{"id":"L3-L04","level":3,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"紀錄片裡那隻豹傷了一條後肢，每次走到倒下的原木前就停下來。幾週後，同一臺相機拍到牠一躍而過。","en":"In the documentary, a leopard hurt one of its back limbs and stopped every time it came to a fallen log. A few weeks later, the same camera filmed it leaping over the log.","words":[{"en":"leap","zh":"跳躍"},{"en":"leopard","zh":"豹"},{"en":"limb","zh":"四肢；樹枝"},{"en":"log","zh":"圓木；日誌、登入"}]},{"id":"L3-L05","level":3,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"我帶了一條麵包、生菜和一壺檸檬水去野餐。弟弟忙著舔棒棒糖，沒注意到有隻鴿子已經跳上麵包袋了。","en":"I brought a loaf of bread, some lettuce, and a jug of lemonade to the picnic. My brother was busy licking a lollipop and did not notice that a pigeon had already jumped onto the bread bag.","words":[{"en":"lemonade","zh":"檸檬汁"},{"en":"lettuce","zh":"萵苣、生菜"},{"en":"lick","zh":"舔"},{"en":"loaf","zh":"一條（麵包）"},{"en":"lollipop","zh":"棒棒糖"}]},{"id":"L3-L06","level":3,"letter":"L","n":6,"zh":"劇裡的領主把一名水手關了起來。水手在獄中寫信給戀人，說他願意用一輩子的財富換回自由。","en":"In the play, the lord locked up a sailor. In prison, the sailor wrote to his lover, saying he would trade a lifetime of wealth for his liberty.","words":[{"en":"liberty","zh":"自由"},{"en":"lifetime","zh":"一生"},{"en":"lock","zh":"鎖；鎖上"},{"en":"lord","zh":"君主、主人；上帝"},{"en":"lover","zh":"情人；愛好者"}]},{"id":"L3-L07","level":3,"letter":"L","n":7,"zh":"救援隊知道船的確切位置嗎？一道閃電照亮海面，燈塔管理員這才找到那艘船，並用無線電告訴救援隊它在哪裡。","en":"Did the rescue team know the exact location of the boat? A flash of lightning lit up the sea, and then the lighthouse keeper located the boat and told the rescue team by radio where it was.","words":[{"en":"lighthouse","zh":"燈塔"},{"en":"lightning","zh":"閃電"},{"en":"locate","zh":"找出位置；位於"},{"en":"location","zh":"位置、地點"}]},{"id":"L3-L08","level":3,"letter":"L","n":8,"zh":"肺部手術後，爸爸第一次出門過夜。到了旅館，他把行李鎖進櫃子，就到花園去畫百合花。他的畫現在掛在大廳，旁邊還貼著他寫的告示，請遊客別在花園亂丟垃圾。","en":"After his lung surgery, Dad stayed away from home overnight for the first time. At the hotel, he locked his luggage in a cabinet and went to the garden to paint the lilies. His painting now hangs in the lobby, with a sign he wrote beside it asking visitors not to litter in the garden.","words":[{"en":"lily","zh":"百合花"},{"en":"litter","zh":"垃圾；亂丟垃圾"},{"en":"lobby","zh":"大廳"},{"en":"lock","zh":"鎖；鎖上"},{"en":"luggage","zh":"行李"},{"en":"lung","zh":"肺"}]},{"id":"L3-M01","level":3,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"魔術師的湯匙彷彿有股魔力，竟能自己在桌面上移動。弟弟後來發現桌子底下藏著一塊磁鐵，卻還是說這是場絕妙的表演。","en":"The magician's spoon seemed to have magical power because it could move across the table by itself. My brother later found a magnet hidden under the table, but he still said it was a marvelous show.","words":[{"en":"magical","zh":"有魔力的、神奇的"},{"en":"magician","zh":"魔術師"},{"en":"magnet","zh":"磁鐵"},{"en":"marvelous","zh":"了不起的、很棒的"}]},{"id":"L3-M02","level":3,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"士兵們列隊走過城堡，泥靴把大理石地板弄得一團亂。女僕看著自己剛拖好的地，請隊長留下來一起打掃。","en":"The soldiers marched through the castle, and their muddy boots made a mess of the marble floor. The maid looked at the floor she had just mopped and asked the captain to stay and help clean it.","words":[{"en":"maid","zh":"女傭"},{"en":"marble","zh":"大理石；彈珠"},{"en":"march","zh":"行進；遊行"},{"en":"mess","zh":"凌亂、一團亂"}]},{"id":"L3-M03","level":3,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"市長宣布了鎮民投票的結果。多數人希望保留小溪旁的牧草地，把購物中心蓋在舊車站附近。當地新聞媒體隔天公布了得票數。","en":"The mayor announced the result of the town vote. The majority wanted to keep the meadow beside the stream and build the mall near the old station. The local news media reported the number of votes the next day.","words":[{"en":"majority","zh":"多數"},{"en":"mall","zh":"購物中心"},{"en":"mayor","zh":"市長"},{"en":"meadow","zh":"草地"},{"en":"medium/media","zh":"媒體；媒介；中等的"}]},{"id":"L3-M04","level":3,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"和平展裡，一個孩子寫道：「一枚威力強大的飛彈摧毀了我的學校，一群暴民又闖進我家。我希望全人類都記得戰爭帶來的痛苦。」","en":"At the peace exhibition, a child wrote, \\"A mighty missile destroyed my school, and a mob broke into my home. I hope all mankind remembers the misery that war brings.\\"","words":[{"en":"mankind/humankind","zh":"人類"},{"en":"mighty","zh":"強大的"},{"en":"misery","zh":"痛苦、悲慘"},{"en":"missile","zh":"飛彈"},{"en":"mob","zh":"暴民、人群"}]},{"id":"L3-M05","level":3,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"老師在白板上寫下一道數學算式，請我們找錯。弟弟拿起白板筆，把減號改成乘號，解釋這裡為什麼要把兩個數字相乘。","en":"The teacher wrote a mathematical problem on the whiteboard and asked us to find the mistake. My brother picked up a marker, changed the minus sign to a times sign, and explained why we had to multiply the two numbers here.","words":[{"en":"marker","zh":"麥克筆；標記"},{"en":"mathematical","zh":"數學的"},{"en":"minus","zh":"減；負的"},{"en":"multiply","zh":"乘；增加、繁殖"}]},{"id":"L3-M06","level":3,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"哥哥說，受傷後再度跑過終點，比得到獎牌更有意義。朋友稱這是奇蹟，但哥哥還記得自己怎麼鍛鍊肌肉，也記得復健期間承受的心理壓力。","en":"My brother said crossing the finish line again after his injury was more meaningful than winning a medal. His friends called it a miracle, but my brother still remembers how he built up his muscles and the mental stress he went through during recovery.","words":[{"en":"meaningful","zh":"有意義的"},{"en":"medal","zh":"獎牌、勳章"},{"en":"mental","zh":"心理的、精神的"},{"en":"miracle","zh":"奇蹟"},{"en":"muscle","zh":"肌肉"}]},{"id":"L3-M07","level":3,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"我把蘑菇湯放進微波爐加熱。這段時間，姊姊把甜瓜切成小塊。突然停電了，我們便決定先吃冰淇淋，免得它融化。","en":"I heated the mushroom soup in the microwave. Meanwhile, my sister cut the melon into small pieces. Suddenly the power went out, so we decided to eat the ice cream first before it melted.","words":[{"en":"meanwhile","zh":"同時"},{"en":"melon","zh":"甜瓜、瓜"},{"en":"melt","zh":"融化"},{"en":"microwave","zh":"微波爐；微波"},{"en":"mushroom","zh":"蘑菇、香菇"}]},{"id":"L3-M08","level":3,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"里民每月的聚會才剛開始，麥克風就沒了聲音。林伯伯修好接在麥克風上的電線，大家就又唱起歡快的歌。","en":"The neighborhood's monthly meeting had just started when the microphone went silent. Uncle Lin mended the wire connected to the microphone, and everyone sang merry songs again.","words":[{"en":"mend","zh":"修補"},{"en":"merry","zh":"快樂的、愉快的"},{"en":"microphone/mike","zh":"麥克風"},{"en":"monthly","zh":"每月的"}]},{"id":"L3-M09","level":3,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"搜救隊的任務是找到一名失蹤的登山客。霧太濃了，隊員就把移動式指揮站設在河邊。等霧散了，他們才發動船上的馬達，沿河搜索。","en":"The rescue team's mission was to find a missing hiker. The mist was so thick that the team set up a mobile command station by the river. When the mist cleared, they started the boat's motor and searched along the river.","words":[{"en":"missing","zh":"失蹤的、缺少的"},{"en":"mission","zh":"任務"},{"en":"mist","zh":"薄霧"},{"en":"mobile","zh":"行動的、可移動的"},{"en":"motor","zh":"馬達"}]},{"id":"L3-M10","level":3,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"我們住的汽車旅館就在池塘旁。房間的窗戶上凝著水氣，連床單摸起來都是潮的。夜裡聚在燈下的昆蟲多半是蛾，但鑽進蚊帳咬我的是一隻蚊子。","en":"Our motel was right beside a pond. There was moisture on the windows of our room, and even the sheets felt moist. Most of the insects gathered under the light at night were moths, but the one that got into my net and bit me was a mosquito.","words":[{"en":"moist","zh":"溼潤的"},{"en":"moisture","zh":"溼氣、水分"},{"en":"mosquito","zh":"蚊子"},{"en":"motel","zh":"汽車旅館"},{"en":"moth","zh":"蛾"}]},{"id":"L3-M11","level":3,"letter":"M","n":11,"zh":"村民以為怪物謀殺了守門人，一名僧侶卻決心解開謎團。劇終前，他得決定是否揭發那位曾經救過他的人。散場後，我們還在討論這個道德問題。","en":"The villagers thought a monster had murdered the gatekeeper, but a monk was determined to solve the mystery. Before the end of the play, he has to decide whether to expose the person who once saved him. After the show, we were still talking about this moral question.","words":[{"en":"monk","zh":"和尚、修道士"},{"en":"monster","zh":"怪物"},{"en":"moral","zh":"道德的；寓意"},{"en":"murder","zh":"謀殺"},{"en":"mystery","zh":"謎；神祕"}]},{"id":"L3-N01","level":3,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"媽媽找出一張我還是嬰兒時的照片。我洗完澡，正光著身子打盹。哥哥躺在我旁邊，把一張餐巾摺成整齊的小方塊，給他的玩具熊當枕頭。","en":"Mom found a photo of me as a baby. I had just had a bath and was taking a nap naked. My brother was lying beside me, folding a napkin into a neat little square as a pillow for his teddy bear.","words":[{"en":"naked","zh":"裸體的"},{"en":"nap","zh":"小睡、午睡"},{"en":"napkin","zh":"餐巾"},{"en":"neat","zh":"整齊的"}]},{"id":"L3-N02","level":3,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"我們社區有棵老樹，每年都有臺灣原生的鳥回來築巢。妹妹放學經過時，會站在對街靜靜地看牠們一會兒。","en":"There is an old tree in our neighborhood, and every year birds native to Taiwan come back to build a nest in it. When my sister passes by after school, she stands across the street and quietly watches them for a while.","words":[{"en":"native","zh":"本地的；母語的；本地人"},{"en":"neighborhood","zh":"社區、鄰近地區"},{"en":"nest","zh":"鳥巢"}]},{"id":"L3-N03","level":3,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"爸爸在海軍服役時，有張我很喜歡的照片。那天船班剛恢復正常，他鬆開制服上的領帶，幫忙把生活必需品搬上島。","en":"There is a photo of Dad from when he served in the navy that I really like. That day, the boats had just gone back to normal. He loosened the necktie of his uniform and helped carry daily necessities onto the island.","words":[{"en":"navy","zh":"海軍"},{"en":"necessity","zh":"必需品；必要性"},{"en":"necktie","zh":"領帶"},{"en":"normal","zh":"正常的"}]},{"id":"L3-N04","level":3,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"那位小說家的筆名來自她小時候的綽號。替她取這個綽號的修女至今仍留著她寫的第一篇故事。","en":"The novelist's pen name comes from her childhood nickname. The nun who gave her this nickname still keeps the first story she wrote.","words":[{"en":"nickname","zh":"綽號、暱稱"},{"en":"novelist","zh":"小說家"},{"en":"nun","zh":"修女、尼姑"}]},{"id":"L3-O01","level":3,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"這項仍在進行的調查記錄老橡樹裡一家貓頭鷹的生活。我們躲在遠處的矮牆後面，輪流用望遠鏡觀察親鳥帶了什麼回巢。","en":"This ongoing study records the life of an owl family in an old oak tree. We hid behind a low wall far away and took turns observing with binoculars what the parent birds brought back to the nest.","words":[{"en":"oak","zh":"橡樹"},{"en":"observe","zh":"觀察；遵守"},{"en":"ongoing","zh":"進行中的"},{"en":"owl","zh":"貓頭鷹"}]},{"id":"L3-O02","level":3,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"這是我第一次在這麼正式的場合做口頭報告。時間不夠，我只好略過兩個例子，概述居民在訪談裡提到的三個問題。","en":"This was my first oral report on such a formal occasion. There was not enough time, so I had to omit two examples and outline the three problems the residents mentioned in the interviews.","words":[{"en":"occasion","zh":"場合、時機"},{"en":"omit","zh":"省略"},{"en":"oral","zh":"口頭的；口腔的"},{"en":"outline","zh":"大綱；輪廓"}]},{"id":"L3-O03","level":3,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"農場寄來幾顆形狀古怪的有機洋蔥。我把洋蔥切片，放到烤盤上，再把烤盤送進烤箱。晚餐就這樣多了一道菜。","en":"The farm sent us some odd-shaped organic onions. I sliced the onions, put them onto a baking tray, and then put the tray in the oven. That gave us one more dish for dinner.","words":[{"en":"odd","zh":"奇怪的；奇數的"},{"en":"onion","zh":"洋蔥"},{"en":"onto","zh":"到……之上"},{"en":"organic","zh":"有機的"},{"en":"oven","zh":"烤箱"}]},{"id":"L3-O04","level":3,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"手術後，阿嘉常望著醫院對面的籃球場。他對復原很樂觀，還告訴我們，出院後他想先到那裡投一球。","en":"After his operation, A-Jia often looked at the basketball court opposite the hospital. He was optimistic about his recovery and told us that the first thing he wanted to do after leaving the hospital was shoot a ball there.","words":[{"en":"operation","zh":"手術；操作"},{"en":"opposite","zh":"相對的、相反的"},{"en":"optimistic","zh":"樂觀的"}]},{"id":"L3-O05","level":3,"letter":"O","n":5,"zh":"美術社原本的計畫是在教室辦展。後來社員在學校圍牆外側辦了場戶外畫展。籌辦展覽的同學說，明年他想再到戶外展出，讓路過的居民也能留下自己的畫。","en":"The art club's original plan was to hold the show in a classroom. Later the members held an outdoor art show on the outer side of the school wall. The student who organized it said he wants to show the art outdoors again next year so the people walking by can leave their own drawings, too.","words":[{"en":"organize","zh":"組織、安排、整理"},{"en":"original","zh":"原本的；原創的"},{"en":"outdoor","zh":"戶外的"},{"en":"outdoors","zh":"在戶外"},{"en":"outer","zh":"外部的、外面的"}]},{"id":"L3-O06","level":3,"letter":"O","n":6,"zh":"阿姨陪我練口試，讓我得到出國讀書的機會。到宿舍的第一晚，我就寫信告訴她，我欠她一聲謝謝。","en":"My aunt helped me practice for my oral exam, and I got the opportunity to study overseas. On my first night in the dorm, I wrote to tell her that I owed her a thank-you.","words":[{"en":"opportunity","zh":"機會、時機"},{"en":"oral","zh":"口頭的；口腔的"},{"en":"overseas","zh":"在國外、海外的"},{"en":"owe","zh":"欠"}]},{"id":"L3-O07","level":3,"letter":"O","n":7,"zh":"一頭平時幫忙拉車的役牛走進了隔壁的牧場，兩邊的農夫都說牛是自己的。獸醫用耳牌號碼查了登記資料，才釐清這頭牛的所有權。","en":"An ox that usually helps pull a cart walked into the field next door, and the farmers on both sides said the ox was theirs. The vet checked the records with the number on its ear tag and cleared up the question of ownership.","words":[{"en":"ownership","zh":"所有權"},{"en":"ox","zh":"公牛"}]},{"id":"L3-P01","level":3,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"爺爺把一個小木偶放在我的手掌上，教我輕拍它背上的軟墊，讓它點頭。我練了一個下午才抓到力道，這才知道演木偶戲需要多少耐心。","en":"Grandpa put a small wooden puppet on the palm of my hand and taught me to pat the pad on its back to make it nod. I practiced all afternoon before I got the right strength, and then I learned how much patience a puppet show needs.","words":[{"en":"pad","zh":"墊子；便條本"},{"en":"palm","zh":"手掌；棕櫚樹"},{"en":"pat","zh":"輕拍"},{"en":"patience","zh":"耐心"},{"en":"puppet","zh":"木偶、傀儡"}]},{"id":"L3-P02","level":3,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"這位畫家受邀到宮殿裡替女王畫肖像。女王請他把珍珠耳環也畫進去，因為那是母親留給她的。","en":"The painter was invited to the palace to paint a portrait of the queen. The queen asked him to include her pearl earrings because her mother had left them to her.","words":[{"en":"painter","zh":"畫家；油漆工"},{"en":"palace","zh":"宮殿"},{"en":"pearl","zh":"珍珠"},{"en":"portrait","zh":"肖像、畫像"}]},{"id":"L3-P03","level":3,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"我最要好的朋友第一次來我家過夜。隔天早上，我做了花生薄煎餅，她則用新鮮鳳梨榨了一品脫的果汁。","en":"My best pal stayed at my house for the first time. The next morning, I made peanut pancakes, and she made a pint of juice from fresh pineapple.","words":[{"en":"pal","zh":"朋友、夥伴"},{"en":"pancake","zh":"鬆餅、煎餅"},{"en":"peanut","zh":"花生"},{"en":"pineapple","zh":"鳳梨"},{"en":"pint","zh":"品脫（容量單位）"}]},{"id":"L3-P04","level":3,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"一位乘客發現護照不見了，開始驚慌起來。一名正要登機的飛行員在通往飛機的狹窄通道裡撿到了護照，交給了地勤人員。","en":"A passenger found that her passport was missing and started to panic. A pilot about to board the plane found the passport in the narrow passage leading to the plane and gave it to the ground staff.","words":[{"en":"panic","zh":"恐慌、驚慌"},{"en":"passage","zh":"（文章）段落；通道"},{"en":"passenger","zh":"乘客"},{"en":"passport","zh":"護照"},{"en":"pilot","zh":"飛行員"}]},{"id":"L3-P05","level":3,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"為了拍到整支遊行隊伍，攝影師爬上我家的屋頂。一隻從鏡頭前飛過的鴿子也入了鏡，後來這張照片被印成了明年的活動海報。","en":"To get the whole parade in the picture, the photographer climbed onto our roof. A pigeon that flew in front of the camera was also in the shot, and later the photo was printed as the poster for next year's event.","words":[{"en":"parade","zh":"遊行"},{"en":"photographer","zh":"攝影師"},{"en":"pigeon","zh":"鴿子"},{"en":"poster","zh":"海報"}]},{"id":"L3-P06","level":3,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"對喜歡畫動物的外公來說，動物園簡直是樂園。他最愛畫那隻愛玩耍的鸚鵡，也畫過站在水池邊不肯跳下去的企鵝。","en":"For Grandpa, who loves drawing animals, the zoo is simply a paradise. He loves drawing the playful parrot most, and he has also drawn the penguin that stood by the pool and refused to jump in.","words":[{"en":"paradise","zh":"天堂、樂園"},{"en":"parrot","zh":"鸚鵡"},{"en":"penguin","zh":"企鵝"},{"en":"playful","zh":"愛玩的、頑皮的"}]},{"id":"L3-P07","level":3,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"我在門口的一堆包裹裡找到我訂的塑膠澡盆。倒水進去時，我才發現底部的塞子掉了，只好蹲下來找。","en":"I found the plastic tub I ordered in a pile of parcels at the door. When I poured water in, I found that the plug at the bottom had fallen out, so I had to squat down to look for it.","words":[{"en":"parcel","zh":"包裹"},{"en":"pile","zh":"一堆；堆疊"},{"en":"plastic","zh":"塑膠；塑膠的"},{"en":"plug","zh":"插頭；塞子"},{"en":"pour","zh":"倒；下大雨"}]},{"id":"L3-P08","level":3,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"阿美從小就對小提琴充滿熱情，今年終於有機會在鄰居面前演奏。雖然那場演出因雨延期了一週，巷子裡的座位還是全坐滿了。","en":"A-Mei has had a passion for the violin since she was little, and this year she finally had a chance to perform for her neighbors. Although the performance was postponed for a week because of rain, all the seats in the lane were still full.","words":[{"en":"passion","zh":"熱情"},{"en":"perform","zh":"表演；執行"},{"en":"performance","zh":"表演；表現"},{"en":"postpone(ment)","zh":"延期"}]},{"id":"L3-P09","level":3,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"主持人看到我的姓氏時停頓了一下，我就教他怎麼發音。後來有人說他在台上念錯了，幸好我們有當天的錄音，可以證明他念對了。","en":"The host paused when he saw my family name, so I taught him how to pronounce it. Later someone said he had said it wrong on stage, but luckily we had a recording from that day as proof that he said it right.","words":[{"en":"pause","zh":"暫停"},{"en":"pronounce","zh":"發音"},{"en":"proof","zh":"證據、證明"}]},{"id":"L3-P10","level":3,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"里長先取得地主的同意，再說服居民一起出錢鋪路。工程許可證核發後，工人用石板鋪好了那條一下雨就全是泥巴的小路。","en":"The neighborhood chief first got permission from the landowner and then persuaded the residents to pay together to pave the road. After the work permit was issued, workers paved the path, which used to be full of mud whenever it rained, with stone.","words":[{"en":"pave(ment)","zh":"鋪（路）；人行道"},{"en":"permission","zh":"許可、允許"},{"en":"permit","zh":"允許、容許"},{"en":"persuade","zh":"說服"}]},{"id":"L3-P11","level":3,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"奶奶要我先把馬鈴薯削皮，再和豌豆一起煮湯。湯煮好以後，我把它倒進兩個碗裡，只在自己的那碗撒了胡椒。","en":"Grandma asked me to peel the potatoes first and then cook them in soup with peas. When the soup was ready, I poured it into two bowls and only put pepper in my own.","words":[{"en":"pea","zh":"豌豆"},{"en":"peel","zh":"剝皮、削皮；果皮"},{"en":"pepper","zh":"胡椒；甜椒"},{"en":"pour","zh":"倒；下大雨"}]},{"id":"L3-P12","level":3,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"我在外婆的小錢包裡找到一枚英國的一便士硬幣。它只值一便士，對我卻比新買的紀念品更寶貴。","en":"I found a British penny in Grandma's little purse. It is only worth one penny, but to me it is more precious than any new souvenir.","words":[{"en":"penny","zh":"一分錢、便士"},{"en":"precious","zh":"珍貴的"},{"en":"purse","zh":"（女用）錢包、手提包"}]},{"id":"L3-P13","level":3,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"爸爸每天都要帶幾顆藥丸去上班，我送了他一個分格的小藥盒。裡面有充足的空間放一天的藥，他說這比帶著一整袋藥實用多了。","en":"Dad has to take a few pills to work every day, so I gave him a small pill box with sections. There is plenty of room for one day's medicine, and he says it is much more practical than carrying a whole bag of medicine.","words":[{"en":"pill","zh":"藥丸、藥片"},{"en":"plenty","zh":"大量、很多"},{"en":"practical","zh":"實際的、實用的"}]},{"id":"L3-P14","level":3,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"我們本想在松樹下搭帳篷，卻看見樹根旁有個被落葉蓋住的坑。我們改到平地，把最長的那根營柱立在帳篷中央。","en":"We wanted to put up our tent under a pine tree, but we saw a pit covered with fallen leaves beside the roots. We moved to flat ground and stood the longest pole in the middle of the tent.","words":[{"en":"pine","zh":"松樹"},{"en":"pit","zh":"坑、洞"},{"en":"pole","zh":"桿、柱；（南北）極"}]},{"id":"L3-P15","level":3,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"小時候我還能在這條溪游泳，現在污染嚴重，真可惜。今年村民在上游設了廢油收集站，防止廢油再污染溪水。","en":"When I was little, I could still swim in this stream. It is a pity that the pollution is serious now. This year the villagers set up a waste oil collection point upstream to prevent oil from polluting the stream again.","words":[{"en":"pit","zh":"坑、洞"},{"en":"pity","zh":"可惜；同情"},{"en":"pollute","zh":"汙染"},{"en":"pollution","zh":"汙染"},{"en":"prevent","zh":"預防、防止"}]},{"id":"L3-P16","level":3,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"以前我對政治沒興趣，直到一位政治人物到學校跟我們談公車票價。班上做了一次民意調查，才發現政治立場不同的人也會支持同一項方案。","en":"I used to have no interest in politics, until a politician came to our school to talk about bus fares. Our class did a poll and found that people with different political views could support the same plan.","words":[{"en":"political","zh":"政治的"},{"en":"politician","zh":"政治人物"},{"en":"politics","zh":"政治"},{"en":"poll","zh":"民意調查；投票"}]},{"id":"L3-P17","level":3,"letter":"P","n":17,"zh":"教我們做陶器的教授帶來了一隻瓷碗，薄得對著光就能看見手指的影子。他讓我們各做一隻厚碗，親自體驗泥土變成陶器的過程。","en":"The professor who taught us pottery brought a porcelain bowl so thin that you could see the shadow of your finger through it in the light. He let each of us make a thick bowl so we could experience the process of clay becoming pottery ourselves.","words":[{"en":"porcelain","zh":"瓷器"},{"en":"pottery","zh":"陶器"},{"en":"process","zh":"過程；處理"},{"en":"professor","zh":"教授"}]},{"id":"L3-P18","level":3,"letter":"P","n":18,"zh":"為了幫助生活在貧窮中的家庭，我們在市場推銷自己種的米。扣掉成本後，我們把一部分利潤捐給了社區廚房。","en":"To help families living in poverty, we promoted the rice we grew at the market. After taking out the costs, we gave part of the profit to the community kitchen.","words":[{"en":"poverty","zh":"貧窮"},{"en":"profit","zh":"利潤"},{"en":"promote","zh":"升遷；促進；宣傳"}]},{"id":"L3-P19","level":3,"letter":"P","n":19,"zh":"這位茶葉生產者把茶葉磨成粉，做成了一項新產品。我問他茶香從哪裡來，他說裡面只有純茶葉，沒有加香料。","en":"This tea producer ground tea leaves into powder to make a new product. I asked him where the tea smell came from, and he said it was only pure tea leaves with no added flavors.","words":[{"en":"powder","zh":"粉末"},{"en":"producer","zh":"製作人；生產者"},{"en":"product","zh":"產品"},{"en":"pure","zh":"純的、純淨的"}]},{"id":"L3-P20","level":3,"letter":"P","n":20,"zh":"消防員說，上一次火災最可能的原因是電線過熱。在消防演習的準備過程中，我們學了該如何通報走廊出現煙霧。演習當天，老師請我們假裝聞到了煙味。","en":"The firefighter said the probable cause of the previous fire was an overheated wire. During the preparation for the fire drill, we learned how to report smoke in the hallway. On the day of the drill, the teacher asked us to pretend we smelled smoke.","words":[{"en":"preparation","zh":"準備"},{"en":"pretend","zh":"假裝"},{"en":"previous","zh":"先前的"},{"en":"probable","zh":"很可能的"}]},{"id":"L3-P21","level":3,"letter":"P","n":21,"zh":"有人在叔叔的酒吧裡打了一架，一拳打壞了吧檯上的老啤酒幫浦。為了讓店裡的財產多一層保障，叔叔決定買保險。","en":"Someone got into a fight in my uncle's pub, and a punch broke the old beer pump on the bar. To give the shop's property more protection, my uncle decided to buy insurance.","words":[{"en":"property","zh":"財產、房地產；特性"},{"en":"protection","zh":"保護"},{"en":"pub","zh":"酒吧"},{"en":"pump","zh":"幫浦；打氣"},{"en":"punch","zh":"用拳頭打；打孔"}]},{"id":"L3-Q01","level":3,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"校刊引用了教練的一句話，但標題讀起來很古怪，好像他要辭職了。我問了他才知道，他說的是他要戒掉喝汽水的習慣。","en":"The school magazine quoted a line from the coach, but the headline read queerly, as if he was going to quit his job. When I asked him, I learned that he meant he was going to quit drinking soda.","words":[{"en":"queer","zh":"奇怪的"},{"en":"quit","zh":"戒掉、放棄；辭職"},{"en":"quote","zh":"引用；報價"}]},{"id":"L3-R01","level":3,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"看台上有人喊出種族歧視的話，我不知道隊友會怎麼反應。他立刻去告訴裁判。我問他為什麼反應這麼快，他的答覆是：「因為上次沒有人站出來。」","en":"Someone in the stands shouted something racist, and I did not know how my teammate would react. He went to tell the referee right away. When I asked him why his reaction was so quick, his response was, \\"Because last time nobody stood up.\\"","words":[{"en":"react","zh":"反應"},{"en":"reaction","zh":"反應"},{"en":"response","zh":"回應、反應"}]},{"id":"L3-R02","level":3,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"擦工具是祖父每天的例行工作，他總留一塊抹布在抽屜裡。今天我幫他擦老剃刀，發現刀柄上已經長了鐵鏽。","en":"Wiping his tools is part of Grandpa's daily routine, and he always keeps a rag in the drawer. Today I helped him clean his old razor and found rust on the handle.","words":[{"en":"rag","zh":"破布、抹布"},{"en":"razor","zh":"刮鬍刀"},{"en":"routine","zh":"例行公事、日常慣例"},{"en":"rust","zh":"鐵鏽；生鏽"}]},{"id":"L3-R03","level":3,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"教練按過去五場比賽的接棒成功率替各組排名。排名第一的那組將代表學校參加地區接力賽。","en":"The coach ranked each group by its success rate in passing the baton over the last five races. The group ranked first will represent our school in the regional relay.","words":[{"en":"rank","zh":"等級、排名"},{"en":"rate","zh":"比率、速度；費率"},{"en":"regional","zh":"地區的"},{"en":"represent","zh":"代表"}]},{"id":"L3-R04","level":3,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"姐姐把生雞肉放進烤箱，準備烤給大家吃。我在旁邊整理水果，挑出一顆爛掉的梨子，再把成熟的梨子放進冰箱，免得它們也開始腐爛。","en":"My sister put the raw chicken in the oven to roast it for everyone. Next to her, I sorted the fruit, picked out a rotten pear, and put the ripe pears in the fridge so they would not start to rot too.","words":[{"en":"raw","zh":"生的、未加工的"},{"en":"ripe","zh":"成熟的"},{"en":"roast","zh":"烤；烤的"},{"en":"rot","zh":"腐爛"},{"en":"rotten","zh":"腐爛的"}]},{"id":"L3-R05","level":3,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"一束陽光穿過窗戶，在桌上照出一個長方形。那片光裡有個繫著紅緞帶的紙盒，裝的全是爸爸以前寫給媽媽的信。媽媽說這是她收過最浪漫的禮物。","en":"A ray of sunlight came through the window and made a rectangle on the table. In that light was a paper box tied with a red ribbon, full of letters Dad wrote to Mom long ago. Mom said it was the most romantic gift she had ever received.","words":[{"en":"ray","zh":"光線"},{"en":"rectangle","zh":"長方形"},{"en":"ribbon","zh":"緞帶"},{"en":"romantic","zh":"浪漫的"}]},{"id":"L3-R06","level":3,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"店員拿起電話聽筒時，我手裡正拿著那束花的收據。我說花送錯了樓層，請她派人來取。她說我的請求很合理，立刻聯絡了外送員。","en":"When the clerk picked up the receiver, I was holding the receipt for the flowers. I said the flowers had been sent to the wrong floor and asked her to send someone to pick them up. She said my request was reasonable and contacted the delivery person right away.","words":[{"en":"reasonable","zh":"合理的"},{"en":"receipt","zh":"收據"},{"en":"receiver","zh":"聽筒；接收者"},{"en":"request","zh":"請求"}]},{"id":"L3-R07","level":3,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"外公年輕時曾在一場宗教慶典上用錄音機錄下自己的歌聲。今年廟方發行了那段錄音，我一聽就認出了他的聲音。","en":"When Grandpa was young, he recorded his own singing on a tape recorder at a religious festival. This year the temple released the recording, and I recognized his voice as soon as I heard it.","words":[{"en":"recognize","zh":"認出；承認"},{"en":"recorder","zh":"錄音機；直笛"},{"en":"release","zh":"釋放；發行"},{"en":"religious","zh":"宗教的；虔誠的"}]},{"id":"L3-R08","level":3,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"爸爸每天晚上都提醒我把手機留在客廳，好減少睡前看螢幕的時間。不用再急著回訊息，我鬆了一口氣，終於可以在睡前放鬆了。","en":"Dad reminds me every night to leave my phone in the living room to reduce my screen time before bed. Not having to rush to answer messages was a relief, and I could finally relax before sleep.","words":[{"en":"reduce","zh":"減少"},{"en":"relax","zh":"放鬆"},{"en":"relief","zh":"鬆一口氣；減輕；救濟"},{"en":"remind","zh":"提醒"},{"en":"rush","zh":"匆忙、趕"}]},{"id":"L3-R09","level":3,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"體育館裡傳出一聲吼叫，接著就有猛獸逃跑的謠言。我後悔自己沒問清楚就衝去找老師，原來是戲劇社在排練。","en":"A roar came from the gym, and then there was a rumor that a wild animal had escaped. I regret that I rushed to find the teacher without asking first. It was just the drama club rehearsing.","words":[{"en":"regret","zh":"後悔、遺憾"},{"en":"roar","zh":"吼叫"},{"en":"rumor","zh":"謠言"},{"en":"rush","zh":"匆忙、趕"}]},{"id":"L3-R10","level":3,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"住在偏遠山村的奶奶得依靠每週來一次的送貨車。自從店主用一輛更可靠的新車取代舊車，她再也沒等過一整天。","en":"Grandma, who lives in a remote mountain village, has to rely on a delivery truck that comes once a week. Since the owner replaced the old truck with a more reliable new one, she has never had to wait a whole day again.","words":[{"en":"reliable","zh":"可靠的"},{"en":"rely","zh":"依賴、信賴"},{"en":"remote","zh":"遙遠的、偏遠的；遙控的"},{"en":"replace(ment)","zh":"取代、更換"}]},{"id":"L3-R11","level":3,"letter":"R","n":11,"zh":"山屋裡只剩兩桶水，管理員決定保留一桶給隔天要上山的人。水是這裡最珍貴的資源，如果再不下雨，管理員明天就會限制大家的用水量。","en":"There were only two barrels of water left in the mountain hut, and the manager decided to reserve one for the people coming up the next day. Water is the most precious resource here. If it does not rain soon, the manager will restrict everyone's water use tomorrow.","words":[{"en":"reserve","zh":"預約；保留"},{"en":"resource","zh":"資源"},{"en":"restrict","zh":"限制"}]},{"id":"L3-R12","level":3,"letter":"R","n":12,"zh":"在班上演的戲裡，我們成立了一個共和國，旗子上的火箭象徵探索的精神。演議員的同學用舊床單做長袍，演太空人的同學用雨衣做太空衣。","en":"In our class play, we formed a republic, and the rocket on our flag represented the spirit of exploration. The classmate who played a representative made a robe from an old sheet, and the one who played an astronaut made a space suit from a raincoat.","words":[{"en":"represent","zh":"代表"},{"en":"representative","zh":"代表；有代表性的"},{"en":"republic","zh":"共和國"},{"en":"robe","zh":"長袍、浴袍"},{"en":"rocket","zh":"火箭"}]},{"id":"L3-R13","level":3,"letter":"R","n":13,"zh":"超商發生搶劫案時，店員克制住追出去的衝動，記下了搶劫超商的男子長什麼樣子。他說自己有責任告訴警察實情，卻沒向記者透露證人的姓名。","en":"When the convenience store was robbed, the clerk resisted the urge to chase the man and remembered what the robber looked like. He said it was his responsibility to tell the police the truth, but he did not reveal the witness's name to the reporters.","words":[{"en":"resist","zh":"抵抗；忍住"},{"en":"responsibility","zh":"責任"},{"en":"reveal","zh":"揭露、顯示"},{"en":"rob","zh":"搶劫"}]},{"id":"L3-R14","level":3,"letter":"R","n":14,"zh":"那張小地毯的背面原本很粗糙，用了大約三年後卻磨平了。為了消除滑倒的風險，我們在地毯下加了一塊防滑墊。","en":"The back of the small rug was rough at first, but after roughly three years it wore smooth. To get rid of the risk of slipping, we put a non-slip pad under the rug.","words":[{"en":"rid","zh":"擺脫（get rid of）"},{"en":"risk","zh":"風險；冒險"},{"en":"rough","zh":"粗糙的；粗略的；粗暴的"},{"en":"roughly","zh":"大約；粗暴地"},{"en":"rug","zh":"小地毯"}]},{"id":"L3-S01","level":3,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"我把一袋米抬上磅秤時，袋底裂開，米粒撒了一地。這裡的糧食本來就不足，大家趕緊用乾淨的盆子接住袋裡剩下的米。","en":"When I lifted a sack of rice onto the scale, the bottom split open, and the rice scattered all over the floor. Food is already scarce here, so everyone quickly caught the rest of the rice in clean basins.","words":[{"en":"sack","zh":"大袋子"},{"en":"scale(s)","zh":"秤；規模；刻度；魚鱗"},{"en":"scarce","zh":"稀少的"},{"en":"scatter","zh":"撒；散開"}]},{"id":"L3-S02","level":3,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"為了全家人，媽媽每月都從薪水裡撥一筆錢存起來。今年修屋頂的成果讓她很滿意，而且付完工錢後還剩下一些積蓄。","en":"For the sake of the family, Mom saves part of her salary every month. She is satisfied with this year's roof repair, and she still had some savings left after paying the workers.","words":[{"en":"sake","zh":"緣故（for the sake of）"},{"en":"salary","zh":"薪水"},{"en":"saving(s)","zh":"存款、儲蓄"},{"en":"scale(s)","zh":"秤；規模；刻度；魚鱗"}]},{"id":"L3-S03","level":3,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"我在店裡喝茶時，店主端來一小碟切好的香腸讓我試吃。我沾了一點醬汁，辣得趕緊喝了一小口水，他就替我換了不辣的醬汁。","en":"While I was having tea in the shop, the owner brought a small saucer of sliced sausage for me to try. I dipped it in a little sauce and it was so spicy that I quickly took a sip of water, so he gave me a sauce that was not spicy.","words":[{"en":"sauce","zh":"醬汁、醬料"},{"en":"saucer","zh":"茶碟"},{"en":"sausage","zh":"香腸"},{"en":"sip","zh":"小口喝"},{"en":"slice","zh":"一片；切片"},{"en":"spice","zh":"香料"}]},{"id":"L3-S04","level":3,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"我拿起剪刀剪開包裝，裡面是姐姐送的絲綢圍巾。她叮嚀我用冷水洗，因為她去年用熱水洗自己的那條，結果圍巾縮水了。","en":"I cut open the package with scissors, and inside was a silk scarf from my sister. She told me to wash it in cold water because last year she washed hers in hot water, and the scarf shrank.","words":[{"en":"scarf","zh":"圍巾"},{"en":"scissors","zh":"剪刀"},{"en":"silk","zh":"絲、絲綢"}]},{"id":"L3-S05","level":3,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"童軍夜間尋寶時，牆上突然出現一個嚇人的影子，隊伍後面有人尖叫起來。我們把手電筒往下一照，才發現那是一隻正要跳上圍牆的貓。","en":"During the scouts' night treasure hunt, a scary shadow suddenly appeared on the wall, and someone at the back of the line screamed. When we pointed our flashlights down, we saw it was a cat about to jump onto the wall.","words":[{"en":"scary","zh":"嚇人的、可怕的"},{"en":"scout","zh":"童子軍；偵察"},{"en":"scream","zh":"尖叫"},{"en":"shadow","zh":"影子、陰影"}]},{"id":"L3-S06","level":3,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"這學期，一位大學四年級的學長得到了研究地方歷史的獎學金。他寫信向那位陪他讀老報紙的學者道謝，還把研究報告寄給了她。","en":"This semester, a senior student won a scholarship to study local history. He wrote to thank the scholar who read old newspapers with him and sent her his research report.","words":[{"en":"scholar","zh":"學者"},{"en":"scholarship","zh":"獎學金"},{"en":"semester","zh":"學期"},{"en":"senior","zh":"年長的；資深的；長者"}]},{"id":"L3-S07","level":3,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"一位科學家帶我們到溪邊，用科學方法比較兩種蝦子的花紋。我們在淺水區畫下每隻蝦子的模樣，再比對圖畫，找出花紋的相似之處。","en":"A scientist took us to a stream and compared the patterns of two kinds of shrimp in a scientific way. We drew every shrimp in the shallow water and then compared the drawings to find the similarities in their patterns.","words":[{"en":"scientific","zh":"科學的"},{"en":"scientist","zh":"科學家"},{"en":"shallow","zh":"淺的"},{"en":"shrimp","zh":"蝦子"},{"en":"similarity","zh":"相似（處）"}]},{"id":"L3-S08","level":3,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"我用力擦洗廚房的水槽，直到金屬表面變得亮晶晶的。爸爸把新的置物架裝在水槽旁，最後還特地檢查每一根螺絲釘。","en":"I scrubbed the kitchen sink hard until the metal was shiny. Dad put the new shelf up beside the sink and finally checked every screw.","words":[{"en":"screw","zh":"螺絲；旋緊"},{"en":"scrub","zh":"用力刷洗"},{"en":"shiny","zh":"發亮的"},{"en":"sink","zh":"水槽；下沉"}]},{"id":"L3-S09","level":3,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"為了展品的安全，館員把盒子密封後才放進櫃子裡。他發出關門的信號後不久，我們就聽見最後一道門鎖上的聲音。","en":"For the security of the objects, the staff member sealed the box before putting it in the cabinet. Shortly after he gave the signal to close up, we heard the last door lock.","words":[{"en":"seal","zh":"海豹；封條；密封"},{"en":"security","zh":"安全；保全"},{"en":"shortly","zh":"不久、很快"},{"en":"signal","zh":"信號"},{"en":"staff","zh":"（全體）工作人員"}]},{"id":"L3-S10","level":3,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"兩群羊分開了一個冬天，今天牧羊人終於帶牠們回到同一片草地。看到兩隻小羊又靠在一起，他鬆了一口氣，說今後讓牠們待在一起才明智。","en":"The two flocks of sheep had been apart for a whole winter, and today the shepherd finally brought them back to the same field. Seeing two lambs leaning against each other again, he sighed with relief and said it would be sensible to keep them together from now on.","words":[{"en":"sensible","zh":"明智的、合理的"},{"en":"shepherd","zh":"牧羊人"},{"en":"sigh","zh":"嘆息"}]},{"id":"L3-S11","level":3,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"課堂上討論性騷擾時，老師請我們想想一位模特兒的處境。攝影師要她擺出性感的姿勢，她拒絕了。對她而言，這是重要的一步，因為她第一次在工作時說出了自己的界線。","en":"When we discussed sexual harassment in class, the teacher asked us to think about a model's situation. A photographer asked her to strike a sexy pose, but she refused. For her, it was a significant step because it was the first time she stated her limits at work.","words":[{"en":"saving(s)","zh":"存款、儲蓄"},{"en":"scale(s)","zh":"秤；規模；刻度；魚鱗"},{"en":"sexual","zh":"性的"},{"en":"sexy","zh":"性感的"},{"en":"significant","zh":"重要的、顯著的"},{"en":"situation","zh":"情況、處境"}]},{"id":"L3-S12","level":3,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"妹妹用鏟子在沙灘上挖水道，我們發現把水道縮短，海水就更容易流到沙堡旁邊。回家時她連頭髮裡都是沙，只好用我的洗髮精洗頭。","en":"My sister dug a channel in the sand with a shovel, and we found that if we shortened the channel, seawater reached the sandcastle more easily. When we went home, she even had sand in her hair, so she had to wash it with my shampoo.","words":[{"en":"shampoo","zh":"洗髮精；洗頭"},{"en":"shorten","zh":"縮短"},{"en":"shovel","zh":"鏟子"}]},{"id":"L3-S13","level":3,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"外婆從小就教我，在她的信仰裡，說謊是一種罪。今天我承認是我打破了她最喜歡的杯子，也向她道歉。外婆握著我的手說，她知道我的道歉是真誠的。","en":"Since I was little, Grandma has taught me that in her faith, lying is a sin. Today I admitted that I broke her favorite cup and said sorry. Grandma held my hand and said she knew my apology was sincere.","words":[{"en":"sin","zh":"罪"},{"en":"sincere","zh":"真誠的"}]},{"id":"L3-S14","level":3,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"我已經會溜冰，所以學滑雪時想跳過第一堂課。那位技術熟練的教練請我示範怎麼停下來，我才明白自己還需要那堂課。","en":"I can already skate, so I wanted to skip the first lesson when I learned to ski. The skillful coach asked me to show how to stop, and then I realized I still needed that lesson.","words":[{"en":"skate","zh":"溜冰"},{"en":"ski","zh":"滑雪"},{"en":"skillful","zh":"熟練的"},{"en":"skip","zh":"跳過；蹦跳"}]},{"id":"L3-S15","level":3,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"演王子的男孩很瘦，戲服的袖子蓋住了他纖細的手腕。開演前，服裝老師在每邊袖口各縫了三針，把袖子改短。","en":"The boy playing the prince was skinny, and the sleeves of his costume covered his slender wrists. Before the show, the costume teacher sewed three stitches in each cuff to shorten the sleeves.","words":[{"en":"shorten","zh":"縮短"},{"en":"skinny","zh":"很瘦的"},{"en":"sleeve","zh":"袖子"},{"en":"slender","zh":"苗條的、細長的"},{"en":"stitch","zh":"（縫的）一針；縫"}]},{"id":"L3-S16","level":3,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"港邊立著一座雕像，紀念曾在這裡被賣為奴隸的人。讀完其中一人寫給家人的信，我才明白雕刻家為什麼讓雕像的臉上帶著悲傷。","en":"There is a statue by the harbor in memory of the people who were once sold here as slaves. After reading a letter one of them wrote to his family, I understood why the artist gave the statue a sad face.","words":[{"en":"slave","zh":"奴隸"},{"en":"statue","zh":"雕像"}]},{"id":"L3-S17","level":3,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"媽媽教我把蘑菇切片，和菠菜一起放進鍋裡。我一邊攪拌醬汁一邊加香料，最後才放進煮好的義大利細麵。","en":"Mom taught me to slice mushrooms and put them in the pot with spinach. I stirred the sauce while adding spices, and at the end I put in the cooked spaghetti.","words":[{"en":"sauce","zh":"醬汁、醬料"},{"en":"slice","zh":"一片；切片"},{"en":"spaghetti","zh":"義大利麵"},{"en":"spice","zh":"香料"},{"en":"spinach","zh":"菠菜"},{"en":"stir","zh":"攪拌"}]},{"id":"L3-S18","level":3,"letter":"S","n":18,"zh":"雨後的斜坡比我記得的更滑。等我們爬完最陡的那一段，汗水已經浸透了衣領。","en":"After the rain, the slope was more slippery than I remembered. By the time we finished climbing the steepest part, sweat had soaked my collar.","words":[{"en":"slippery","zh":"滑的"},{"en":"slope","zh":"斜坡"},{"en":"steep","zh":"陡峭的"},{"en":"sweat","zh":"汗；流汗"}]},{"id":"L3-S19","level":3,"letter":"S","n":19,"zh":"舊腳架有一條腿突然折斷，相機險些落地。新腳架的底座很堅固，即使地面不平也很穩定，我終於能拍出平穩的畫面。","en":"One leg of the old tripod suddenly snapped, and the camera almost hit the ground. The base of the new tripod is solid and stays stable even on uneven ground, so I can finally take steady pictures.","words":[{"en":"snap","zh":"啪地折斷；拍照；彈指"},{"en":"solid","zh":"固體的；堅固的"},{"en":"stable","zh":"穩定的"},{"en":"steady","zh":"穩定的"}]},{"id":"L3-S20","level":3,"letter":"S","n":20,"zh":"我希望將來有一天能有自己的畫室。不知怎麼的，一位路過的女士認出了我的畫，還約我下週找個時間去看她要出租的工作室。","en":"I hope to have my own studio someday. Somehow, a lady passing by recognized my paintings and invited me to see a studio she wants to rent out sometime next week.","words":[{"en":"someday","zh":"有一天"},{"en":"somehow","zh":"不知何故"},{"en":"sometime","zh":"（將來或過去的）某個時候"},{"en":"studio","zh":"工作室、攝影棚"}]},{"id":"L3-S21","level":3,"letter":"S","n":21,"zh":"弟弟堅持用某一支特定的吸管試喝果汁。他才透過吸管吸了一小口，就把果汁吐回杯裡，說自己胃痛。","en":"My brother insisted on trying the juice with one specific straw. He had only sucked a little through the straw when he spit the juice back into the cup and said he had a stomachache.","words":[{"en":"specific","zh":"特定的、明確的"},{"en":"spit","zh":"吐（口水）"},{"en":"straw","zh":"吸管；稻草"},{"en":"suck","zh":"吸、吮"}]},{"id":"L3-S22","level":3,"letter":"S","n":22,"zh":"我不小心把水桶裡的水灑出來，水濺到弟弟的短褲上。他拿起噴水用的瓶子，對準我的腳，握緊把手一噴，算是回敬我。","en":"I spilled some water from the bucket by accident, and it splashed on my brother's shorts. He picked up a spray bottle, aimed at my feet, and squeezed the handle to spray me back.","words":[{"en":"saving(s)","zh":"存款、儲蓄"},{"en":"scale(s)","zh":"秤；規模；刻度；魚鱗"},{"en":"spill","zh":"打翻、灑出"},{"en":"splash","zh":"濺、潑"},{"en":"spray","zh":"噴；噴霧"},{"en":"squeeze","zh":"擠、捏"}]},{"id":"L3-S23","level":3,"letter":"S","n":23,"zh":"我想把矮凳轉過來修理，才發現一隻腳被黏黏的膠黏在地板上。我用一把硬刷子把膠刷掉，現在連弟弟都能單手把凳子轉得飛快。","en":"I wanted to turn the stool over to fix it, and then I found that one leg was stuck to the floor with sticky glue. I brushed the glue off with a stiff brush, and now even my little brother can spin the stool fast with one hand.","words":[{"en":"spin","zh":"旋轉"},{"en":"sticky","zh":"黏的"},{"en":"stiff","zh":"僵硬的"},{"en":"stool","zh":"凳子；糞便"}]},{"id":"L3-S24","level":3,"letter":"S","n":24,"zh":"錢不見後，哥哥懷疑我偷了錢，還開始暗中監視我。我發誓沒拿，他卻說媽媽太寵我。我能理解他的猜疑，但他出於惡意撕掉我的畫，還是讓我很難過。","en":"After the money went missing, my brother suspected that I stole it and started to spy on me. I swore I did not take it, but he said Mom spoils me. I can understand his suspicion, but it still hurt when he tore up my drawing out of spite.","words":[{"en":"spite","zh":"惡意；儘管（in spite of）"},{"en":"spoil","zh":"寵壞；（食物）壞掉；破壞"},{"en":"spy","zh":"間諜"},{"en":"steal","zh":"偷"},{"en":"suspect","zh":"懷疑；嫌疑犯"},{"en":"suspicion","zh":"懷疑"},{"en":"swear","zh":"發誓；罵髒話"}]},{"id":"L3-S25","level":3,"letter":"S","n":25,"zh":"弟弟盯著湖邊的天鵝，擔心牠會餓死，便拿出已經不新鮮的麵包。爸爸叫他把麵包收好時，一隻松鼠正爬上我們的野餐桌。","en":"My brother stared at the swan by the lake, worried it would starve, so he took out some stale bread. When Dad told him to put the bread away, a squirrel was climbing onto our picnic table.","words":[{"en":"squirrel","zh":"松鼠"},{"en":"stale","zh":"不新鮮的"},{"en":"stare","zh":"盯著看"},{"en":"starve","zh":"挨餓、餓死"},{"en":"swan","zh":"天鵝"}]},{"id":"L3-S26","level":3,"letter":"S","n":26,"zh":"傍晚風雨交加，體育場外還有一群孩子在等簽名。工作人員反應迅速，在孩子們淋濕前把他們帶進室內。","en":"The evening was stormy, and a group of children were still waiting outside the stadium for autographs. The staff reacted quickly and took the children inside before they got wet.","words":[{"en":"stadium","zh":"體育場"},{"en":"staff","zh":"（全體）工作人員"},{"en":"stormy","zh":"暴風雨的"}]},{"id":"L3-S27","level":3,"letter":"S","n":27,"zh":"停電後，外婆用瓦斯爐和竹籠蒸地瓜。她先確認鍋裡有足夠的水，再坐下來跟我們聊天。","en":"After the power went out, Grandma steamed sweet potatoes in a bamboo basket on the gas stove. She made sure there was sufficient water in the pot and then sat down to chat with us.","words":[{"en":"steam","zh":"蒸氣；蒸"},{"en":"stove","zh":"爐子"},{"en":"sufficient","zh":"足夠的"}]},{"id":"L3-S28","level":3,"letter":"S","n":28,"zh":"我們到達山頂時，雲霧正圍繞著附近的山峰。姊姊一打開便當就被蜜蜂螫了，手背很快腫起來。","en":"When we reached the summit, clouds were surrounding the nearby peaks. As soon as my sister opened her lunch box, a bee stung her, and the back of her hand soon swelled up.","words":[{"en":"sting","zh":"叮、刺痛"},{"en":"summit","zh":"山頂；高峰會"},{"en":"surround","zh":"包圍、環繞"},{"en":"swell","zh":"腫脹"}]},{"id":"L3-S29","level":3,"letter":"S","n":29,"zh":"剛進擊劍社時，我以為光靠力氣就能把劍用好。教練要我改變策略，可是我太固執，連輸了三場才肯換個打法。","en":"When I first joined the fencing club, I thought strength alone was enough to use a sword well. The coach asked me to change my strategy, but I was so stubborn that I lost three matches before I was willing to try a different way.","words":[{"en":"strategy","zh":"策略"},{"en":"strength","zh":"力量、力氣；長處"},{"en":"stubborn","zh":"固執的"},{"en":"sword","zh":"劍"}]},{"id":"L3-S30","level":3,"letter":"S","n":30,"zh":"我們把紙撕成長條，再將捲緊的廢紙塞進模型橋的橋墩。老師請我們說明橋的結構，也問黏合紙張的透明物質是什麼。","en":"We tore paper into strips and stuffed tightly rolled waste paper into the base of our model bridge. The teacher asked us to explain the bridge's structure and also asked what the clear substance holding the paper together was.","words":[{"en":"saving(s)","zh":"存款、儲蓄"},{"en":"scale(s)","zh":"秤；規模；刻度；魚鱗"},{"en":"strip","zh":"長條；脫去"},{"en":"structure","zh":"結構、構造"},{"en":"stuff","zh":"東西、物品；塞滿"},{"en":"substance","zh":"物質"}]},{"id":"L3-S31","level":3,"letter":"S","n":31,"zh":"結帳前，我得算出所有收據金額的總和，再減去租攤的費用。這是我第一次獨自做帳，我的直屬上司在一旁等我報出數字。","en":"Before closing the accounts, I had to find the sum of all the receipts and subtract the cost of renting the stand. It was my first time doing the accounts alone, and my direct supervisor was waiting for me to report the number.","words":[{"en":"subtract","zh":"減去"},{"en":"sum","zh":"總和、金額"}]},{"id":"L3-S32","level":3,"letter":"S","n":32,"zh":"住在郊區的阿姨是地震生還者，她參加了一項災後生活調查。讀了調查摘要，我才知道有些居民多年來深受失眠之苦，也有人曾向社工說出自殺的念頭。","en":"My aunt, who lives in the suburbs, is an earthquake survivor, and she took part in a survey about life after the disaster. After reading the summary of the survey, I learned that some residents have suffered from sleeplessness for years, and some have told social workers about thoughts of suicide.","words":[{"en":"suburb","zh":"郊區"},{"en":"suffer","zh":"受苦、遭受"},{"en":"suicide","zh":"自殺"},{"en":"summary","zh":"摘要、概要"},{"en":"survey","zh":"調查、問卷"},{"en":"survivor","zh":"倖存者"}]},{"id":"L3-T01","level":3,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"那位裁縫師用平板電腦記錄客人的尺寸，再替每件外套掛上標籤。我幫他穿針時，不小心刺到了拇指。","en":"The tailor records his customers' sizes on a tablet and puts a tag on every jacket. When I helped him thread a needle, I pricked my thumb by accident.","words":[{"en":"tablet","zh":"藥錠；平板電腦"},{"en":"tag","zh":"標籤"},{"en":"tailor","zh":"裁縫師"},{"en":"thread","zh":"線"},{"en":"thumb","zh":"拇指"}]},{"id":"L3-T02","level":3,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"我十幾歲的弟弟很健談，也有模仿老師的天分。以前同學取笑他的聲音時，他總會發脾氣，如今他敢自己站上台說笑話了。","en":"My teenage brother is talkative and has a talent for copying teachers. He used to lose his temper when classmates teased him about his voice, but now he dares to go on stage alone and tell jokes.","words":[{"en":"talent","zh":"天分、才能"},{"en":"talkative","zh":"愛說話的"},{"en":"tease","zh":"取笑、逗弄"},{"en":"teenage","zh":"青少年的"},{"en":"temper","zh":"脾氣"}]},{"id":"L3-T03","level":3,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"我幫舅舅照料一隻已經馴服的小羊。我們輕聲溫柔地喚牠，牠就會走過來。別隻羊走進牠的地盤時，牠卻會低下頭把對方頂出去。","en":"I help my uncle look after a tame little goat. When we call it softly and tenderly, it comes over. But when another goat walks into its territory, it lowers its head and pushes the other one out.","words":[{"en":"tame","zh":"溫馴的；馴服"},{"en":"tender","zh":"柔軟的、嫩的；溫柔的"},{"en":"territory","zh":"領土"}]},{"id":"L3-T04","level":3,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"休息時間，爸爸端來一盤橘子。冰水解了我的渴，比賽後吃到的第一片橘子也特別美味。","en":"During the break, Dad brought a tray of tangerines. The ice water ended my thirst, and the first tangerine after the game tasted especially good.","words":[{"en":"tangerine","zh":"橘子"},{"en":"thirst","zh":"口渴、渴望"},{"en":"tray","zh":"托盤"}]},{"id":"L3-T05","level":3,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"浴缸已經滿了，水龍頭卻還在滴水。爸爸叫我去關儲水槽旁的閥門，我雙手握住把手，用力扭轉了半圈。","en":"The tub was already full, but the tap was still dripping. Dad told me to turn off the valve beside the water tank, so I held the handle with both hands and twisted it half a turn.","words":[{"en":"tank","zh":"（水、油）箱；坦克"},{"en":"tap","zh":"輕拍；水龍頭"},{"en":"tub","zh":"浴缸；盆"},{"en":"twist","zh":"扭轉、扭傷"}]},{"id":"L3-T06","level":3,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"姊姊吹小喇叭的技巧比去年更好了。聽完那段美妙的曲調，我問她是怎麼練的，她便用我聽得懂的話解釋了幾個技術上的細節。","en":"My sister's technique on the trumpet is better than last year. After listening to that terrific tune, I asked her how she practiced, and she explained a few technical details in words I could understand.","words":[{"en":"technical","zh":"技術的、專業的"},{"en":"technique","zh":"技巧、技術"},{"en":"terrific","zh":"很棒的"},{"en":"trumpet","zh":"小號、喇叭"},{"en":"tune","zh":"曲調；調音"}]},{"id":"L3-T07","level":3,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"強風吹得臨時帳篷搖搖晃晃，鬆動的柱子威脅著裡面的人。一位攤商察覺了危險，及時帶我們出去，我很感激她。","en":"The strong wind made the temporary tent shake, and the loose poles threatened the people inside. A trader noticed the danger and led us out in time. I am thankful to her.","words":[{"en":"temporary","zh":"暫時的、臨時的"},{"en":"tent","zh":"帳篷"},{"en":"thankful","zh":"感謝的"},{"en":"threaten","zh":"威脅"},{"en":"trader","zh":"商人、交易員"}]},{"id":"L3-T08","level":3,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"海邊那根樹幹每天早上都在不同的地方。哥哥提出一個理論，說是潮汐帶著它移動。我們決定連續三天在地圖上追蹤它的路線。","en":"The tree trunk on the beach is in a different place every morning. My brother had a theory that the tide moves it. We decided to trace its path on a map for three days in a row.","words":[{"en":"theory","zh":"理論"},{"en":"tide","zh":"潮汐"},{"en":"trace","zh":"痕跡；追蹤"},{"en":"trunk","zh":"樹幹；後車廂；象鼻"}]},{"id":"L3-T09","level":3,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"拔河用的繩子必須夠堅韌，才能承受十二個人同時用力拉。我正要把鞋帶拉得更緊一點，隊友提醒我，綁得太緊會讓腳痛。","en":"The rope for the tug-of-war must be tough enough to hold twelve people pulling at the same time. I was about to tighten my shoelaces, but my teammate reminded me that tying them too tight would hurt my feet.","words":[{"en":"tight","zh":"緊的"},{"en":"tighten","zh":"弄緊"},{"en":"tough","zh":"困難的；強悍的；（肉）硬的"},{"en":"tug","zh":"用力拉"}]},{"id":"L3-T10","level":3,"letter":"T","n":10,"zh":"曾祖父是位商人，曾從這個碼頭把木材運送到南方。他的帳本裡還記著另一批貨，那是一噸曬乾的菸葉。","en":"My great-grandfather was a trader who once transported timber south from this dock. His account book also recorded another load: a ton of dried tobacco leaves.","words":[{"en":"timber","zh":"木材"},{"en":"tobacco","zh":"菸草"},{"en":"ton","zh":"噸"},{"en":"trader","zh":"商人、交易員"},{"en":"transport","zh":"運輸"}]},{"id":"L3-T11","level":3,"letter":"T","n":11,"zh":"老師拋硬幣決定誰先挑隊友。一個孩子等硬幣落地才喊正面，讓老師碰上了棘手的問題。幸好有位同學看清楚了經過，向老師如實說明。","en":"The teacher tossed a coin to decide who would choose teammates first. A child did not call heads until the coin landed, which gave the teacher a tricky problem. Luckily, a classmate saw clearly what happened and gave the teacher a truthful account.","words":[{"en":"toss","zh":"丟、拋"},{"en":"tricky","zh":"棘手的；狡猾的"},{"en":"truthful","zh":"誠實的"}]},{"id":"L3-T12","level":3,"letter":"T","n":12,"zh":"觀光業帶來了許多工作，也讓這個部落的小路變得擁擠。我當導覽員的阿姨會帶觀光客爬上舊水塔，從高處看看部落的孩子每天要走多遠才能到學校。","en":"Tourism has brought many jobs, but it has also made the paths of this tribe crowded. My aunt, a tour guide, takes tourists up the old water tower so they can see from above how far the tribe's children walk to school every day.","words":[{"en":"tourism","zh":"觀光業"},{"en":"tourist","zh":"觀光客"},{"en":"tow","zh":"拖（車）"},{"en":"tower","zh":"塔"},{"en":"tribe","zh":"部落"}]},{"id":"L3-T13","level":3,"letter":"T","n":13,"zh":"遊覽車剛開出隧道就壞了，旅客只好下車等待。救援車把它拖走時，一條鬆脫的電線拖在車尾，我趕快叫司機停下。","en":"The tour bus broke down just after it came out of the tunnel, so the travelers had to get off and wait. When the tow truck pulled it away, a loose wire was dragging behind the bus, so I quickly told the driver to stop.","words":[{"en":"tow","zh":"拖（車）"},{"en":"traveler","zh":"旅客"},{"en":"tunnel","zh":"隧道"}]},{"id":"L3-T14","level":3,"letter":"T","n":14,"zh":"那對雙胞胎想研究熱帶城市的雨量變化。他們的家教請兩人各挑一座城市，再比較兩地近十年的趨勢。","en":"The twins want to study changes in rainfall in tropical cities. Their tutor asked each of them to choose a city and then compare the trends in the two places over the last ten years.","words":[{"en":"trend","zh":"趨勢、傾向"},{"en":"tropical","zh":"熱帶的"},{"en":"tutor","zh":"家教"},{"en":"twin","zh":"雙胞胎之一"}]},{"id":"L3-T15","level":3,"letter":"T","n":15,"zh":"戲劇社要演一群士兵在山上過冬的故事，我們用回收木材搭了小屋。弟弟有一套理論，認為把門做得窄一點，台上的小屋看起來就會比較高。","en":"The drama club was going to perform a story about a troop of soldiers spending the winter on a mountain, so we built a hut with recycled timber. My brother had a theory that if the door was narrower, the hut would look taller on stage.","words":[{"en":"theory","zh":"理論"},{"en":"timber","zh":"木材"},{"en":"troop","zh":"軍隊；一群"}]},{"id":"L3-U01","level":3,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"我們訪問了市區公車司機，才明白誤點背後有個問題：司機人數太少。工會把不同路線的司機團結起來，一起爭取合理的班表。","en":"After we interviewed city bus drivers, we understood the underlying problem behind the delays: there are too few drivers. The union united drivers from different routes to fight together for reasonable schedules.","words":[{"en":"underlying","zh":"潛在的、根本的"},{"en":"union","zh":"工會；聯盟"},{"en":"unite","zh":"聯合、接合"}]},{"id":"L3-U02","level":3,"letter":"U","n":2,"zh":"姊姊替每個旅行收納袋設計了獨特的花紋。裝內衣的袋子上是藍色的魚，其他袋子也用同一種藍色，讓整套設計有了整體感。","en":"My sister designed a unique pattern for each travel bag. The bag for underwear has blue fish on it, and the other bags use the same blue, which gives the whole set a sense of unity.","words":[{"en":"underwear","zh":"內衣"},{"en":"unique","zh":"獨一無二的、獨特的"},{"en":"unite","zh":"聯合、接合"},{"en":"unity","zh":"一致、聯合"}]},{"id":"L3-V01","level":3,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"派出所門前原本空著的車位，現在停了一輛廂型車。霧越來越濃，其他車輛的輪廓都消失了，我還能看見那輛車的尾燈。","en":"The parking space in front of the police station that used to be vacant now has a van in it. The fog got thicker and the shapes of other vehicles vanished, but I could still see that van's taillights.","words":[{"en":"vacant","zh":"空著的"},{"en":"van","zh":"廂型車"},{"en":"vanish","zh":"消失、不見"},{"en":"vehicle","zh":"交通工具、車輛"}]},{"id":"L3-V02","level":3,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"桌上放著各式各樣的工具，老師卻讓我們先用雙手捏一只花瓶。大家做的花瓶在高度和顏色上各有差異，這份多樣性讓展覽格外有趣。","en":"There were various tools on the table, but the teacher asked us to shape a vase with our hands first. Everyone's vases varied in height and color, and this variety made the exhibition especially interesting.","words":[{"en":"variety","zh":"多樣性；種類"},{"en":"various","zh":"各式各樣的"},{"en":"vary","zh":"不同、變化"},{"en":"vase","zh":"花瓶"}]},{"id":"L3-V03","level":3,"letter":"V","n":3,"zh":"我原本想借詩集的第二冊，回家才發現拿了第一冊。其中一首詩的最後一節把雨後的紫羅蘭寫得好鮮明，還讓我學到了幾個新詞。","en":"I wanted to borrow the second volume of the poetry book, but when I got home I found I had taken the first. The last verse of one poem described violets after the rain so vividly, and it also taught me some new vocabulary.","words":[{"en":"verse","zh":"詩；（歌的）一段"},{"en":"violet","zh":"紫羅蘭；紫色的"},{"en":"vivid","zh":"生動的、鮮明的"},{"en":"vocabulary","zh":"詞彙、單字"},{"en":"volume","zh":"音量；體積；冊"}]},{"id":"L3-V04","level":3,"letter":"V","n":4,"zh":"弟弟的視力不好，天一暗就很難認出排球隊友。教練讓兩隊穿上不同顏色的背心，亮黃色的背心隔著半座球場都清晰可見。","en":"My brother's vision is poor, and it is hard for him to recognize his volleyball teammates when it gets dark. The coach had the two teams wear vests of different colors, and the bright yellow vests were visible from half a court away.","words":[{"en":"vest","zh":"背心"},{"en":"visible","zh":"看得見的、明顯的"},{"en":"vision","zh":"視力；願景"},{"en":"volleyball","zh":"排球"}]},{"id":"L3-V05","level":3,"letter":"V","n":5,"zh":"一名選民離開投票所時，成了暴力行為的受害者。班會上，我們讀到他事前收到的暴力威脅，也討論了意見不同的人該怎麼和平表達立場。","en":"A voter became the victim of violence as he left the voting place. At our class meeting, we read about the violent threats he had received before, and we discussed how people with different opinions can express their views peacefully.","words":[{"en":"victim","zh":"受害者"},{"en":"violence","zh":"暴力"},{"en":"violent","zh":"暴力的、猛烈的"},{"en":"voter","zh":"選民、投票人"}]},{"id":"L3-V06","level":3,"letter":"V","n":6,"zh":"排球比賽那天，爸爸幫我準備了一份色彩繽紛的便當。他放進各種蔬果，好讓我能吃到不同的維生素。","en":"On the day of the volleyball game, Dad packed me a colorful lunch box. He put in a variety of fruits and vegetables so I could get different vitamins.","words":[{"en":"variety","zh":"多樣性；種類"},{"en":"vitamin","zh":"維他命"},{"en":"volleyball","zh":"排球"}]},{"id":"L3-W01","level":3,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"電影裡的女孩把第一週的工資都留給妹妹，自己決定嫁給一個富裕的商人。看到兩姊妹在車站哭著道別，外婆說她年輕時看過這部電影。","en":"The girl in the movie left all her first week's wages to her sister and decided to wed a wealthy merchant. Seeing the two sisters weeping as they said goodbye at the station, Grandma said she had seen this movie when she was young.","words":[{"en":"wage(s)","zh":"工資、薪水"},{"en":"wealthy","zh":"有錢的"},{"en":"wed","zh":"結婚"},{"en":"weep","zh":"哭泣"}]},{"id":"L3-W02","level":3,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"故事裡那名邪惡的守衛拿起鞭子，正要抽打拉貨的馬。妹妹演的車伕搶走他的武器，跳上運貨馬車，趕在城門關閉前逃走了。","en":"In the story, the wicked guard picked up a whip and was about to hit the horse pulling the goods. The driver, played by my sister, grabbed his weapon, jumped onto the wagon, and escaped before the city gate closed.","words":[{"en":"wagon","zh":"四輪馬車"},{"en":"weapon","zh":"武器"},{"en":"whip","zh":"鞭子；鞭打"},{"en":"wicked","zh":"邪惡的"}]},{"id":"L3-W03","level":3,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"我和阿公每週都約好沿著山路閒逛到瀑布旁。回程時他總把外套披在我身上，我到現在都記得那份溫暖。","en":"Grandpa and I had a weekly plan to wander along the mountain path to the waterfall. On the way back, he always put his jacket over my shoulders, and I still remember that warmth.","words":[{"en":"wander","zh":"閒逛、漫遊"},{"en":"warmth","zh":"溫暖、溫情"},{"en":"waterfall","zh":"瀑布"},{"en":"weekly","zh":"每週的"}]},{"id":"L3-W04","level":3,"letter":"W","n":4,"zh":"工程師在河邊的步道加寬前檢查了堤岸，發現連日大雨已經讓堤岸變得脆弱。他們在工地入口立了牌子，警告行人遠離鬆動的土坡。","en":"Before the path by the river was widened, the engineers checked the bank and found that days of heavy rain had weakened it. They put up a sign at the entrance of the site to warn people walking by to stay away from the loose slope.","words":[{"en":"warn","zh":"警告、提醒"},{"en":"weaken","zh":"削弱、減弱"},{"en":"widen","zh":"加寬"}]},{"id":"L3-W05","level":3,"letter":"W","n":5,"zh":"木手環做好後，我先用布擦去木屑，再替它上蠟。我本想用彩紙把它包起來，妹妹卻等不及，直接戴到了手腕上。","en":"After the wooden bracelet was finished, I wiped off the wood dust with a cloth and then waxed it. I wanted to wrap it in colored paper, but my sister could not wait and put it on her wrist right away.","words":[{"en":"wax","zh":"蠟"},{"en":"wipe","zh":"擦"},{"en":"wrap","zh":"包、裹"},{"en":"wrist","zh":"手腕"}]},{"id":"L3-W06","level":3,"letter":"W","n":6,"zh":"我在小麥田邊拔草時，發現了一張沾著露水的蜘蛛網。蜘蛛還在兩根麥稈間織網，我便留下那片草，繞到另一端繼續工作。","en":"While I was pulling weeds by the wheat field, I found a spider web covered in dew. The spider was still weaving its web between two stalks, so I left that patch of grass and went to work at the other end.","words":[{"en":"weave","zh":"編織"},{"en":"web","zh":"網；網路"},{"en":"weed","zh":"雜草"},{"en":"wheat","zh":"小麥"}]},{"id":"L3-W07","level":3,"letter":"W","n":7,"zh":"阿公走到看不清楚的彎道前，會先吹口哨警告迎面來的人。他說這麼做的智慧，是他在山上送了四十年信才學來的。","en":"Before Grandpa reaches a bend where he cannot see clearly, he blows a whistle to warn people coming the other way. He says he learned the wisdom of doing this after forty years of delivering mail in the mountains.","words":[{"en":"warn","zh":"警告、提醒"},{"en":"whistle","zh":"哨子；吹口哨"},{"en":"wisdom","zh":"智慧"}]},{"id":"L3-Y01","level":3,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"今年，社區的年輕人首度能參加一年一度蛋糕展上的比賽。我一緊張就把蛋黃倒進蛋白裡，弟弟從台下大喊，叫我換個碗重來。","en":"This year, youngsters in the community could join the contest at the yearly cake show for the first time. I got nervous and poured a yolk into the egg whites, and my brother yelled from the audience that I should use another bowl and start again.","words":[{"en":"yearly","zh":"每年的"},{"en":"yell","zh":"大叫"},{"en":"yolk","zh":"蛋黃"},{"en":"youngster","zh":"年輕人、小孩"}]},{"id":"L3-Z01","level":3,"letter":"Z","n":1,"zh":"營區裡有一塊專供孩子觀察昆蟲的區域，就在我們的帳篷旁。回來時記得拉上帳門的拉鍊，免得昆蟲也跟著進來過夜。","en":"At the camp there is a zone just for children to watch insects, right next to our tent. Remember to close the zipper on the tent door when you come back so the insects don't come in and spend the night too.","words":[{"en":"zipper","zh":"拉鍊"},{"en":"zone","zh":"地區、地帶"}]},{"id":"L4-A01","level":4,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"那篇學術論文的開頭太抽象，連作者的同學都看不懂。雖然他一度想放棄，最後還是拿家鄉的老橋當例子。他最有成就感的，是終於把自己的想法說清楚了。","en":"The opening of that academic paper was so abstract that even the author's classmates could not understand it. Although he once wanted to abandon it, in the end he used an old bridge in his hometown as an example. His greatest sense of accomplishment came from finally making his ideas clear.","words":[{"en":"abandon","zh":"放棄、拋棄"},{"en":"abstract","zh":"抽象的；摘要"},{"en":"academic","zh":"學術的"},{"en":"accomplish(ment)","zh":"完成、達到"}]},{"id":"L4-A02","level":4,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"老師問這塊布能吸收多少水，以及它能不能給底下的木桌足夠的保護。她提醒我們，一次清水實驗無法提供絕對的保證，尤其下一次要用的是酸。","en":"The teacher asked how much water this cloth could absorb and whether it could give adequate protection to the wooden table below. She reminded us that one test with clean water could not give absolute assurance, especially since we would use acid next time.","words":[{"en":"absolute","zh":"絕對的、完全的"},{"en":"absorb","zh":"吸收"},{"en":"acid","zh":"酸；酸性的"},{"en":"adequate","zh":"足夠的、適當的"},{"en":"assurance","zh":"保證、把握"}]},{"id":"L4-A03","level":4,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"剛搬到臺南時，我擔心自己的口音會被取笑。班上輕鬆的氣氛和同學對我的接納，讓我很快就適應了新學校。","en":"When I first moved to Tainan, I was worried that people would laugh at my accent. The relaxed atmosphere in class and my classmates' acceptance helped me adapt to my new school quickly.","words":[{"en":"accent","zh":"重音、口音"},{"en":"acceptance","zh":"接受、接納"},{"en":"adapt","zh":"使適應、改編"},{"en":"atmosphere","zh":"氣氛；大氣"}]},{"id":"L4-A04","level":4,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"在指控任何人之前，會計師先查核了金額的正確性。她調閱舊檔案後才發現，那一頁是掃描時無意間漏掉的。","en":"Before accusing anyone, the accountant checked the accuracy of the amounts. After looking at the old files, she found that the page had been accidentally left out when it was scanned.","words":[{"en":"accidental","zh":"意外的、偶然的"},{"en":"accountant","zh":"會計人員、會計師"},{"en":"accuracy","zh":"精確、正確"},{"en":"accuse","zh":"指責、控告"}]},{"id":"L4-A05","level":4,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"爸爸陪一位認識多年的熟人去看老藥局特展。他們最想知道的是，館方如何取得那張照片，以及櫃子裡那瓶阿斯匹靈為什麼會出現在照片中。","en":"Dad accompanied an acquaintance he had known for years to an exhibition about an old pharmacy. What they wanted to know most was how the museum acquired that photo and why a bottle of aspirin in the cabinet appeared in it.","words":[{"en":"accompany","zh":"陪伴、伴隨"},{"en":"acquaintance","zh":"認識的人、泛泛之交"},{"en":"acquire","zh":"獲得、學到"},{"en":"aspirin","zh":"阿斯匹林"}]},{"id":"L4-A06","level":4,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"哥哥自稱電玩成癮者，每個月第一週就把零用錢花光。等他調整預算，才發現自己還能去圖書館參加週五的免費桌遊之夜，多了一個選擇。","en":"My brother calls himself a video game addict and spends all his allowance in the first week of every month. After he adjusted his budget, he found that he could also go to the library's free board game night on Fridays, which gave him another alternative.","words":[{"en":"addict","zh":"上癮者"},{"en":"adjust(ment)","zh":"調整、使適應於"},{"en":"allowance","zh":"津貼、零用錢"},{"en":"alternative","zh":"替代的；替代方案"}]},{"id":"L4-A07","level":4,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"那名好鬥的對手步步逼近時，隊長仍然保持警覺，在衝突爆發前把兩邊的球員帶開。她願意站出來的勇氣值得讚揚，也贏得了新隊員的欽佩。","en":"When the aggressive opponent came closer and closer, the captain stayed alert and led the players on both sides apart before a fight broke out. Her courage to step forward was admirable, and it won the admiration of the new players.","words":[{"en":"admirable","zh":"可欽佩的、極好的"},{"en":"admiration","zh":"讚賞、欽佩"},{"en":"aggressive","zh":"有攻擊性的；積極進取的"},{"en":"alert","zh":"警覺的、靈敏的"}]},{"id":"L4-A08","level":4,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"學生會提議把週三的入場費減半，館長也願意試試這個做法。董事會正式批准後，館方就採納這項建議，學生會也把消息公布在校網上。","en":"The student council proposed cutting the Wednesday admission fee in half, and the director was willing to try it. After the board gave its formal approval, the museum adopted the idea, and the student council posted the news on the school website.","words":[{"en":"admission","zh":"入場（費）、入學許可；承認"},{"en":"adopt","zh":"採用；領養"},{"en":"approval","zh":"贊成、批准"}]},{"id":"L4-A09","level":4,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"旅行社派來的訂房專員讀完訂房信，才發現日期寫得含糊不清。他向已經抵達旅館的一家人致上歉意，隨即替他們找到當晚的空房。","en":"After reading the booking letter, the agent sent by the travel agency found that the dates were ambiguous. He made an apology to the family who had already arrived at the hotel and found them an empty room for the night right away.","words":[{"en":"agency","zh":"代理機構、政府機關"},{"en":"agent","zh":"代理人、經紀人；探員"},{"en":"ambiguous","zh":"不明確的、模稜兩可的"},{"en":"apology","zh":"道歉"}]},{"id":"L4-A10","level":4,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"社團把兩瓶發酵果汁送去分析，想知道各自含有多少酒精。等同學分析完兩張圖表後，兩瓶之間的差異就很明顯了。","en":"The club sent two bottles of fermented juice for analysis to find out how much alcohol each one contained. After the students analyzed the two charts, the difference between the bottles was apparent.","words":[{"en":"alcohol","zh":"酒精、酒"},{"en":"analysis","zh":"分析"},{"en":"analyze","zh":"分析、細察"},{"en":"apparent","zh":"明顯的；表面上的"}]},{"id":"L4-A11","level":4,"letter":"A","n":11,"zh":"這位雄心勃勃的業餘演員打算用一人短劇逗樂整條街的孩子。由於前一天試音時喇叭惹惱了鄰居，他把正式演出搬到有隔音設備的活動中心。","en":"This ambitious amateur actor planned to amuse the children on the whole street with a one-man show. Because the speakers annoyed the neighbors during a sound test the day before, he moved the real show to a community center with soundproofing.","words":[{"en":"amateur","zh":"業餘的；業餘愛好者"},{"en":"ambitious","zh":"有野心的、抱負不凡的"},{"en":"amuse(ment)","zh":"逗樂、娛樂"},{"en":"annoy","zh":"使惱怒、騷擾"}]},{"id":"L4-A12","level":4,"letter":"A","n":12,"zh":"我們家每年都辦一場聚餐，今年正好遇上老屋落成一百週年的紀念日。姑姑說，她一聞到廚房飄來的米香，就會把這間屋子和當年親手蓋它的祖先聯想在一起。","en":"My family has an annual dinner, and this year it fell on the hundredth anniversary of our old house. My aunt said whenever she smells rice from the kitchen, she associates the house with the ancestors who built it with their own hands.","words":[{"en":"ancestor","zh":"祖先、祖宗"},{"en":"anniversary","zh":"週年紀念"},{"en":"annual","zh":"每年的、一年一次的"},{"en":"associate","zh":"聯想、使有關聯；同事"}]},{"id":"L4-A13","level":4,"letter":"A","n":13,"zh":"送出申請後，這位申請人一直在等博物館的回信。直到館方確認她與館長面談的預約排在下週一，她心裡的焦慮才慢慢消退。","en":"After sending her application, the applicant kept waiting for the museum to reply. Her anxiety did not fade until the museum confirmed that her appointment with the director was next Monday.","words":[{"en":"anxiety","zh":"焦慮、憂慮"},{"en":"applicant","zh":"申請者"},{"en":"application","zh":"申請（書）；應用（程式）"},{"en":"appoint(ment)","zh":"任命；預約、約診"}]},{"id":"L4-A14","level":4,"letter":"A","n":14,"zh":"籌備學生畫展時，我們先討論了有哪些藝術層面會受到燈光影響。等到色溫調整到適當的程度，我才更能欣賞畫家筆下那片灰藍色的大海。","en":"While preparing the student art show, we first discussed which artistic aspects would be affected by the lighting. When the color of the light was adjusted to an appropriate level, I could better appreciate the gray-blue sea in the painting.","words":[{"en":"adjust(ment)","zh":"調整、使適應於"},{"en":"appropriate","zh":"適當的"},{"en":"artistic","zh":"藝術的、藝術家的"},{"en":"aspect","zh":"方面、層面"}]},{"id":"L4-A15","level":4,"letter":"A","n":15,"zh":"水族館最吸引遊客的地方，是一道由人工珊瑚圍成的拱門。我們正要走過去，人群中突然起了一陣歡呼聲，原來一隻小海龜剛游過拱門。","en":"The aquarium's biggest attraction is an arch made of artificial coral. We were about to walk through it when cheers arose from the crowd. A little sea turtle had just swum through the arch.","words":[{"en":"aquarium","zh":"水族館、魚缸"},{"en":"arch","zh":"拱門、拱形"},{"en":"arise","zh":"發生、出現"},{"en":"artificial","zh":"人造的、假的"},{"en":"attraction","zh":"吸引力；景點"}]},{"id":"L4-A16","level":4,"letter":"A","n":16,"zh":"我原先向同學保證展出的那些武器是真品，後來才知道，只有館長有權認定它們的真偽。我對自己隨口下結論感到羞愧，便回班上更正。","en":"I had assured my classmates that the arms on display were authentic, but later I learned that only the museum director had the authority to decide whether they were real. I was ashamed of my careless conclusion, so I went back to class to correct it.","words":[{"en":"arms","zh":"武器"},{"en":"ashamed","zh":"慚愧的、羞恥的"},{"en":"assure","zh":"保證、使確信"},{"en":"authentic","zh":"真實的、道地的"},{"en":"authority","zh":"權威、當局"}]},{"id":"L4-A17","level":4,"letter":"A","n":17,"zh":"全校集會前，老師請負責引導的學生到側門集合，再把各班的工作分派下去。老師說，需要協助的人只要舉手，就會有人帶他到座位。","en":"Before the school assembly, the teacher asked the student helpers to gather at the side door and then gave each class its assignment. She said anyone who needed assistance only had to raise a hand, and someone would take them to their seat.","words":[{"en":"assemble","zh":"集合；組裝"},{"en":"assembly","zh":"集會；組裝"},{"en":"assign(ment)","zh":"指派、分配；作業"},{"en":"assistance","zh":"協助、援助"}]},{"id":"L4-A18","level":4,"letter":"A","n":18,"zh":"地方體育協會答應出借運動器材，但教練還想得到一項保證。直到會長親自向他保證新跑道會在比賽前完工，他才替孩子們報名。","en":"The local sports association agreed to lend us equipment, but the coach wanted one more assurance. Only after the head of the association personally assured him that the new track would be finished before the game did he sign the children up.","words":[{"en":"association","zh":"協會"},{"en":"assurance","zh":"保證、把握"},{"en":"assure","zh":"保證、使確信"}]},{"id":"L4-A19","level":4,"letter":"A","n":19,"zh":"我們把語音說明的播放器固定在模型旁的架子上，讓看不清楚標籤的人也能聽懂。錄音先解釋什麼是原子，再介紹模型所呈現的原子結構。","en":"We attached the audio player to the stand beside the model so that people who could not read the labels clearly could still understand. The recording first explains what an atom is and then describes the atomic structure that the model shows.","words":[{"en":"atom","zh":"原子"},{"en":"atomic","zh":"原子的"},{"en":"attach(ment)","zh":"附上；附件"},{"en":"audio","zh":"音訊的、聲音的"}]},{"id":"L4-A20","level":4,"letter":"A","n":20,"zh":"我買了一本舊自傳，翻開後才發現作者的親筆簽名。原書主還把簽書會當天的入場券貼在簽名旁邊。","en":"I bought an old autobiography and found the author's autograph when I opened it. The previous owner had even stuck the admission ticket from the book signing next to the autograph.","words":[{"en":"admission","zh":"入場（費）、入學許可；承認"},{"en":"autobiography","zh":"自傳"},{"en":"autograph","zh":"親筆簽名"}]},{"id":"L4-B01","level":4,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"讀到那位芭蕾舞者的傳記時，我才知道照片裡那位禿頭男子是他的老師。在舞者第一次演出前，這位老師曾蹲下來替他包紮磨破的腳。","en":"When I read the biography of that ballet dancer, I learned that the bald man in the photo was his teacher. Before the dancer's first performance, this teacher had knelt down to put a bandage on his blistered foot.","words":[{"en":"bald","zh":"禿頭的"},{"en":"ballet","zh":"芭蕾舞"},{"en":"bandage","zh":"繃帶"},{"en":"biography","zh":"傳記"}]},{"id":"L4-B02","level":4,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"阿姨的店破產以後，她一度身無分文，只好把銀手鐲賣掉。多年後她在老街又看到那只手鐲，這回她連價都沒討，就把它買回來了。","en":"After my aunt's shop went bankrupt, she was broke for a while and had to sell her silver bracelet. Years later she saw the bracelet again on the old street, and this time she bought it back without even trying to bargain.","words":[{"en":"bankrupt","zh":"破產的"},{"en":"bargain","zh":"討價還價；便宜貨"},{"en":"bracelet","zh":"手鐲"},{"en":"broke","zh":"沒錢的、破產的"}]},{"id":"L4-B03","level":4,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"鎮公所的公告說，上游流域連夜下雨，河邊已架起路障。巡守員去換警示燈的電池時，發現夜釣的人都已經上岸了。","en":"The town office's bulletin said that it had rained all night in the upper river basin, and barriers had been put up along the river. When the guard went to change the batteries in the warning lights, he found that the night fishermen had already come ashore.","words":[{"en":"barrier","zh":"障礙"},{"en":"basin","zh":"臉盆、盆地"},{"en":"battery","zh":"電池"},{"en":"bulletin","zh":"公告、布告"}]},{"id":"L4-B04","level":4,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"排戲時，扮演夜賊的學生把借來的外套披在扮乞丐的同學身上。雖然導演原先要求夜賊舉止殘暴，這個溫柔的舉動卻打動了她，她決定保留這一幕。","en":"During rehearsal, the student playing a burglar put a borrowed coat over the classmate playing a beggar. Although the director had asked for brutal behavior from the burglar, this gentle act moved her, and she decided to keep the scene.","words":[{"en":"beggar","zh":"乞丐"},{"en":"behavior","zh":"行為、舉止"},{"en":"brutal","zh":"殘忍的、野蠻的"},{"en":"burglar","zh":"竊賊"}]},{"id":"L4-B05","level":4,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"爸爸從貯藏箱拿出一組新的果汁機刀片，換好後才把香蕉和牛奶攪打在一起。我拿掃帚掃掉拆包裝時落在地上的碎塑膠，等他把第一杯香蕉牛奶倒給我。","en":"Dad took a new set of blades out of the storage bin, and after changing them, he blended the bananas and milk together. I swept up the plastic pieces from the packaging with a broom while I waited for him to pour me the first glass of banana milk.","words":[{"en":"bin","zh":"垃圾桶、箱子"},{"en":"blade","zh":"刀片、葉片"},{"en":"blend","zh":"混合"},{"en":"broom","zh":"掃把"}]},{"id":"L4-B06","level":4,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"生物學老師帶我們到山上觀察一種罕見品種的綿羊。雖然牧場裡的野花還沒開，入口那棵桃樹的枝頭卻已經開滿粉紅色的花。","en":"Our biology teacher took us up the mountain to observe a rare breed of sheep. Although the wildflowers in the field had not bloomed yet, the peach tree at the entrance was already full of pink blossoms.","words":[{"en":"biology","zh":"生物學"},{"en":"bloom","zh":"開花；花"},{"en":"blossom","zh":"花；開花"},{"en":"breed","zh":"品種；繁殖、飼養"}]},{"id":"L4-B07","level":4,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"新郎讀到弟弟寫的祝福時，眨了幾下眼睛才把最後一句念完。雖然兄弟倆多年來住在不同城市，他們之間的感情一直很深。","en":"When the groom read his brother's blessing, he had to blink a few times before he could finish the last line. Although the two brothers had lived in different cities for years, the bond between them was still strong.","words":[{"en":"blessing","zh":"祝福"},{"en":"blink","zh":"眨眼"},{"en":"bond","zh":"關係、連結；債券"},{"en":"bridegroom/groom","zh":"新郎"}]},{"id":"L4-B08","level":4,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"哥哥誇口說，他能把球往地上一砸，讓它彈過工具房的屋頂。結果球沒飛過屋頂，卻撞上裝在屋頂上的小風車葉片，落回他的腳邊。","en":"My brother boasted that he could slam the ball on the ground and make it bounce over the roof of the tool shed. Instead of flying over the roof, the ball hit a blade of the small windmill on top and fell back at his feet.","words":[{"en":"blade","zh":"刀片、葉片"},{"en":"boast","zh":"吹牛、自誇"},{"en":"bounce","zh":"彈跳"}]},{"id":"L4-C01","level":4,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"我從櫥櫃拿出裝餅乾的容器，照標籤計算自己剛吃了多少卡路里。妹妹看了一眼就發現，我的計算只算了一份，漏掉了我吃的第二份。","en":"I took the cookie container out of the cabinet and used the label to calculate how many calories I had just eaten. My sister glanced at it and saw that my calculation only counted one serving, not the second one I ate.","words":[{"en":"cabinet","zh":"櫥櫃、內閣"},{"en":"calculate","zh":"計算、預測"},{"en":"calculation","zh":"計算、考慮"},{"en":"calorie","zh":"卡路里（熱量單位）"},{"en":"container","zh":"容器；貨櫃"}]},{"id":"L4-C02","level":4,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"里長候選人在競選活動中公布了改善社區照明的計畫。他請居民在公開信下方留言評論，並指出自己家附近有哪些路燈需要維修。","en":"During his campaign, the candidate for neighborhood chief announced a plan to improve the community's lighting. He asked residents to comment below his open letter and point out which streetlights near their homes needed repair.","words":[{"en":"campaign","zh":"（宣傳、競選）活動；戰役"},{"en":"candidate","zh":"候選人、應徵者"},{"en":"comment","zh":"評論、留言"},{"en":"community","zh":"社區、社群"}]},{"id":"L4-C03","level":4,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"外公把我們撿回來的粗糙木頭磨平，在上面雕了一隻小鳥。直到現在，他出門仍帶著這根手杖，因為他珍愛我們一起做它的那段時光。","en":"Grandpa sanded smooth the coarse piece of wood we had picked up and carved a little bird on it. He still takes this cane with him when he goes out, because he cherishes the time we spent making it together.","words":[{"en":"cane","zh":"手杖、藤條"},{"en":"carve","zh":"雕刻、切開"},{"en":"cherish","zh":"珍惜"},{"en":"coarse","zh":"粗糙的"}]},{"id":"L4-C04","level":4,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"湖邊那家貨運業者只剩一艘獨木舟可以出航。船夫秤了這趟要運的貨物，再問我有沒有超過這艘船的載重量上限。","en":"The carrier by the lake had only one canoe left that could go out. The boatman weighed the cargo for this trip and asked me whether it was over the boat's capacity.","words":[{"en":"canoe","zh":"獨木舟"},{"en":"capacity","zh":"容量、能力"},{"en":"cargo","zh":"貨物"},{"en":"carrier","zh":"運輸公司；帶原者"}]},{"id":"L4-C05","level":4,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"商業課上，我們追蹤一件衣服在資本主義制度下如何被製造和販售。扮演資本家的同學介紹工廠生產一件衣服會消耗多少水，扮演消費者的人則追問價格裡包含了哪些成本。","en":"In business class, we followed how a piece of clothing is made and sold under capitalism. The student playing a capitalist explained how much water a factory consumes to make one shirt, and the ones playing consumers asked which costs were included in the price.","words":[{"en":"capitalist","zh":"資本家"},{"en":"consume","zh":"消耗、消費"},{"en":"consumer","zh":"消費者"}]},{"id":"L4-C06","level":4,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"舊圖書目錄把一本登山日記列在食譜類別，因為書名提到了炒飯。館員請我們先讀前兩頁，再決定怎麼將它分類，並說明採用這個分類的理由。","en":"The old library catalogue listed a hiking diary in the cookbook category because its title mentioned fried rice. The librarian asked us to read the first two pages before deciding how to classify it and to explain the reason for our classification.","words":[{"en":"catalogue","zh":"目錄"},{"en":"category","zh":"類別"},{"en":"classification","zh":"分類"},{"en":"classify","zh":"分類、歸類"}]},{"id":"L4-C07","level":4,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"校隊奪得冠軍後，慶祝活動一直持續到傍晚。等歡呼聲停止，合唱團才開始唱那首由隊員投票選出的歌。","en":"After the school team won the championship, the celebration went on until evening. When the cheering ceased, the chorus began to sing the song the players had voted for.","words":[{"en":"cease","zh":"停止"},{"en":"celebration","zh":"慶祝、慶典"},{"en":"championship","zh":"冠軍賽；冠軍地位"},{"en":"chorus","zh":"合唱團；副歌"}]},{"id":"L4-C08","level":4,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"導覽員帶我們進入懸崖下的一間石室，指著牆上煮飯留下的煙痕。他說，這些痕跡記錄了當地平民的生活，讓我們看見課本很少描寫的古代文明面貌。","en":"The guide took us into a stone chamber under the cliff and pointed at smoke marks on the wall left by cooking. He said these marks recorded the lives of ordinary civilians and showed us a side of ancient civilization that textbooks seldom describe.","words":[{"en":"chamber","zh":"房間、室"},{"en":"civilian","zh":"平民；平民的"},{"en":"civilization","zh":"文明"},{"en":"cliff","zh":"懸崖"}]},{"id":"L4-C09","level":4,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"在化學課上，我們把兩種材料塗在一張圓形紙卡上。當紙卡照到陽光、兩種材料一起變紫時，我們看到了這種組合最特別的性質。","en":"In chemistry class, we painted two materials onto a circular paper card. When the card was in the sun and both materials turned purple together, we saw the most special characteristic of this combination.","words":[{"en":"characteristic","zh":"特性、特徵"},{"en":"chemistry","zh":"化學"},{"en":"circular","zh":"圓形的；循環的"},{"en":"combination","zh":"組合、合併"}]},{"id":"L4-C10","level":4,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"慈善午餐會招待了許多處境困難的居民。當一位長者因為還沒嚼碎就吞下食物而噎住時，隔桌的人立刻叫來活動的救護員。","en":"The charity lunch served many residents in difficult circumstances. When an old man choked because he swallowed his food before chewing it well, someone at the next table immediately called the event's first-aid worker.","words":[{"en":"charity","zh":"慈善（機構）"},{"en":"chew","zh":"咀嚼"},{"en":"choke","zh":"噎住、窒息"},{"en":"circumstance","zh":"情況、環境"}]},{"id":"L4-C11","level":4,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"關於校刊發行量的傳言在家長群組流傳了兩天。為了澄清各班究竟收到幾份，編輯把印刷廠的收據和各班實際領到的份數都貼了出來。","en":"A rumor about the circulation of the school magazine circulated in the parents' group for two days. To clarify how many copies each class actually received, the editor posted the printer's receipt and the number of copies each class picked up.","words":[{"en":"circulate","zh":"循環、流通"},{"en":"circulation","zh":"循環；發行量"},{"en":"clarify","zh":"澄清、闡明"}]},{"id":"L4-C12","level":4,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"第一次演布偶戲時，我笨拙的動作讓老鷹的爪子勾住一面銅鑼，把它撞向另一面。同伴聽見銅鑼的碰撞聲，立刻替老鷹加了一句台詞，觀眾還以為那是安排好的。","en":"The first time I did a puppet show, my clumsy movement caught the eagle's claw on one gong and knocked it against another. When my partner heard the gongs clash, he quickly added a line for the eagle, and the audience thought it was planned.","words":[{"en":"clash","zh":"衝突"},{"en":"claw","zh":"爪子"},{"en":"clumsy","zh":"笨拙的"}]},{"id":"L4-C13","level":4,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"演習假設唯一的橋已經倒塌，兩岸的通訊也中斷了。指揮官請大家用旗子以暗碼傳遞訊息，把對岸需要的物資記下來。","en":"The drill assumed that the only bridge had collapsed and communication between the two banks had been cut off. The commander asked everyone to send messages in code with flags and write down the supplies the other side needed.","words":[{"en":"code","zh":"密碼、代碼、程式碼"},{"en":"collapse","zh":"崩潰、倒塌"},{"en":"commander","zh":"司令官、指揮官"},{"en":"communication","zh":"溝通、通訊"}]},{"id":"L4-C14","level":4,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"我和同事一起排演一齣由三個場景組成的喜劇。導演臨時加進了第二把鑰匙，和原本那把長得一模一樣，讓劇中原本單純的誤會變得更複雜。","en":"My colleague and I rehearsed a comedy made up of three scenes. The director added a second key at the last minute that looked exactly like the first, which complicated the simple misunderstanding in the play.","words":[{"en":"colleague","zh":"同事"},{"en":"comedy","zh":"喜劇"},{"en":"complicate","zh":"使複雜"}]},{"id":"L4-C15","level":4,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"沒有人看見我在畫展上破壞作品，但每次經過那幅被我塗掉署名的畫，我的良心就過意不去。最後我向老師坦白，並表示願意承擔後果。","en":"No one saw me damage a painting at the art show, but every time I passed the picture whose signature I had covered, my conscience bothered me. In the end I confessed to the teacher and said I was willing to accept the consequences.","words":[{"en":"confess","zh":"承認、坦白"},{"en":"conscience","zh":"良心"},{"en":"consequence","zh":"後果、結果"}]},{"id":"L4-C16","level":4,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"報名參加長跑比賽的選手個個好勝，直到最後一圈才分出勝負。比賽一結束，我就走過去祝賀那位在最後一圈超越我的對手。","en":"All the runners in the long-distance race were competitive, and the winner was not decided until the last lap. As soon as the race ended, I walked over to congratulate the competitor who passed me on the last lap.","words":[{"en":"competitive","zh":"競爭的"},{"en":"competitor","zh":"競爭者"},{"en":"congratulate","zh":"祝賀、慶賀"}]},{"id":"L4-C17","level":4,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"學校請那位年輕的作曲家寫一首曲子。他寫曲子時，還把末班車的煞車聲寫了進去。指揮第一次聽到這首作品時，還以為排練室外真的有車停下來。","en":"The school asked a young composer to write a piece of music. While composing, he even included the sound of the last bus braking. When the conductor first heard the composition, he thought a bus had really stopped outside the rehearsal room.","words":[{"en":"compose","zh":"作曲、寫作；組成"},{"en":"composer","zh":"作曲家"},{"en":"composition","zh":"作文；作曲；組成"},{"en":"conductor","zh":"指揮；列車長；導體"}]},{"id":"L4-C18","level":4,"letter":"C","n":18,"zh":"為了克服上臺朗讀的恐懼，我每天都把注意力集中在一小段文字上。直到弟弟走進來跟我說話，我才發現自己的專注力和信心都比第一天進步了。","en":"To conquer my fear of reading on stage, I concentrated on one short passage every day. When my brother came in to talk to me, I realized that my concentration and confidence had both improved since the first day.","words":[{"en":"concentrate","zh":"集中、專心"},{"en":"concentration","zh":"集中、專心"},{"en":"confidence","zh":"信心"},{"en":"conquer","zh":"征服、克服"}]},{"id":"L4-C19","level":4,"letter":"C","n":19,"zh":"在社區會議上，設計師提出了讓雨水留在校園裡的概念。聽眾臉上露出困惑的神情，直到他以操場旁的凹地為具體的例子，大家才聽懂。","en":"At the community meeting, the designer presented the concept of keeping rainwater on campus. The listeners looked confused until he used the low ground beside the playground as a concrete example, and then everyone understood.","words":[{"en":"community","zh":"社區、社群"},{"en":"concept","zh":"觀念、概念"},{"en":"concrete","zh":"具體的；混凝土"}]},{"id":"L4-C20","level":4,"letter":"C","n":20,"zh":"公民課的模擬國會正在討論一項提案。幾位立場保守的代表問，這項提案所要求的改動是否構成修憲。主席請大家先讀憲法條文，再決定是否支持提案。","en":"The mock congress in civics class was discussing a proposal. Several conservative representatives asked whether the changes in the proposal would constitute a change to the constitution. The chair asked everyone to read the articles of the constitution before deciding whether to support it.","words":[{"en":"congress","zh":"國會、會議"},{"en":"conservative","zh":"保守的"},{"en":"constitute","zh":"構成、組成"},{"en":"constitution","zh":"憲法；體質"}]},{"id":"L4-C21","level":4,"letter":"C","n":21,"zh":"鎮上準備在車站旁建造一座天橋。為了處理施工和隨之而來的塞車問題，鎮公所聘了一位交通顧問。公所先和他商量，才公布公車改道的日期。","en":"The town plans to construct a bridge over the road beside the station. To deal with the construction and the traffic jams that would follow, the town office hired a traffic consultant. The office consulted him before announcing the dates of the bus route changes.","words":[{"en":"construct","zh":"建造"},{"en":"construction","zh":"建造、工程"},{"en":"consult","zh":"請教、諮詢"},{"en":"consultant","zh":"顧問"}]},{"id":"L4-C22","level":4,"letter":"C","n":22,"zh":"第一次試講後，同學留下的評論很有建設性，連哪些投影片從後排看不清楚都寫了。第二次試講時，我特別確認圖表的顏色前後一致，讓後排的人也能一路看懂。","en":"After my first practice talk, my classmates' comments were very constructive. They even noted which slides could not be seen clearly from the back row. For my second practice, I made sure the colors of the charts were consistent, so people in the back could follow all the way through.","words":[{"en":"comment","zh":"評論、留言"},{"en":"consistent","zh":"一致的、始終如一的"},{"en":"construct","zh":"建造"},{"en":"constructive","zh":"有建設性的"}]},{"id":"L4-C23","level":4,"letter":"C","n":23,"zh":"演講比賽結束後，校刊把冠軍演說的完整內容和網路短片中的片段作了對照。讀過那段話的上下文後，我們才發現，短片傳達的意思跟她的原意相反。","en":"After the speech contest, the school magazine compared the full content of the winning speech with a clip from an online video. After reading the context of that passage, we found that the video conveyed the opposite of what she meant.","words":[{"en":"content","zh":"內容；滿足的"},{"en":"content(ment)","zh":"滿足的；滿足"},{"en":"contest","zh":"比賽"},{"en":"context","zh":"上下文、情境"},{"en":"convey","zh":"傳達；運送"}]},{"id":"L4-C24","level":4,"letter":"C","n":24,"zh":"搬進山上的小屋後，爺爺終於擺脫了以前在城裡接個不停的推銷電話。他說，現在只要坐在屋簷下，聽著綿延一整個鐘頭的雨聲，心裡就有一股滿足感。","en":"After moving into the cottage on the mountain, Grandpa finally escaped the endless sales calls he used to get in the city. He says now, sitting under the roof and listening to an hour of continuous rain, he feels a deep contentment.","words":[{"en":"content","zh":"內容；滿足的"},{"en":"content(ment)","zh":"滿足的；滿足"},{"en":"continuous","zh":"連續不斷的"},{"en":"cottage","zh":"小屋"}]},{"id":"L4-C25","level":4,"letter":"C","n":25,"zh":"為了因應芭樂價格暴跌，農民決定和學校餐廳合作。農業合作社捐助紙箱，美術班則設計了方便手提的包裝。校刊報導這次合作的經過時，也特別提到了學生的貢獻。","en":"To cope with the sudden drop in guava prices, the farmers decided to cooperate with the school cafeteria. The farm cooperative contributed boxes, and the art class designed easy-to-carry packaging. When the school magazine reported on this cooperation, it also mentioned the students' contributions.","words":[{"en":"contribute","zh":"貢獻、捐獻；促成"},{"en":"contribution","zh":"貢獻、捐款"},{"en":"cooperate","zh":"合作、協力"},{"en":"cooperation","zh":"合作、協力"},{"en":"cooperative","zh":"合作的"},{"en":"cope","zh":"應付、處理（cope with）"}]},{"id":"L4-C26","level":4,"letter":"C","n":26,"zh":"青年作家大會往年都採用傳統的劇院式座位。今年主辦人考量與會者交談的便利性，改請大家圍著圓桌坐。一位剛投出第一篇作品的高中生就這樣和小說家聊了起來。","en":"The young writers' convention used to use conventional theater seating. This year, for the convenience of people talking with each other, the organizer asked everyone to sit around round tables. That is how a high school student who had just sent in her first story ended up conversing with a novelist.","words":[{"en":"convenience","zh":"方便"},{"en":"convention","zh":"大會；慣例"},{"en":"conventional","zh":"傳統的、慣例的"},{"en":"converse","zh":"交談"}]},{"id":"L4-C27","level":4,"letter":"C","n":27,"zh":"同學到市議會的服務櫃檯遞交連署書，想傳達居民對路口安全的擔憂。出於禮貌，他等議員說完才拿出現場照片，最後說服議員放學時來路口看看。","en":"A classmate handed in a petition at the city council's service counter to convey residents' worries about safety at an intersection. Out of courtesy, he waited until the council member finished speaking before showing the photos, and in the end he convinced the council member to come and look at the intersection after school.","words":[{"en":"convey","zh":"傳達；運送"},{"en":"convince","zh":"說服、使相信"},{"en":"council","zh":"議會、委員會"},{"en":"counter","zh":"櫃檯；計數器"},{"en":"courtesy","zh":"禮貌、謙恭"}]},{"id":"L4-C28","level":4,"letter":"C","n":28,"zh":"工藝課上，老師給每個人一小片銅和一條細繩，請我們做一件能掛在書包上的作品。阿榮的創作是一尾尾巴會擺動的魚。看到阿榮如何利用繩結讓魚尾活動，老師稱讚他很有創造力。","en":"In craft class, the teacher gave each of us a small piece of copper and a thin cord and asked us to make something we could hang on our schoolbags. A-Rong's creation was a fish whose tail could swing. Seeing how A-Rong used knots to make the tail move, the teacher praised his creativity.","words":[{"en":"copper","zh":"銅"},{"en":"cord","zh":"繩子、電線"},{"en":"craft","zh":"工藝、手藝"},{"en":"creation","zh":"創造、創作物"},{"en":"creativity","zh":"創造力"}]},{"id":"L4-C29","level":4,"letter":"C","n":29,"zh":"彩排時，造型師把我的頭髮捲起來，好讓我的女巫造型跟戲服草圖上的模樣相符。等燈光轉暗，我才看到輪到我的信號，舉手對偷走種子的人下了詛咒。","en":"At the dress rehearsal, the stylist curled my hair so my witch look would correspond to the costume sketch. When the lights dimmed, I saw my cue, raised my hand, and put a curse on the person who stole the seeds.","words":[{"en":"correspond","zh":"符合；通信"},{"en":"costume","zh":"（特定場合的）服裝、戲服"},{"en":"cue","zh":"提示、暗示"},{"en":"curl","zh":"捲曲；捲髮"},{"en":"curse","zh":"咒罵、詛咒"}]},{"id":"L4-C30","level":4,"letter":"C","n":30,"zh":"兩個男生躡手躡腳地走到圍牆後，拍下有人拿石頭丟小狗的畫面。其中一人堅持要去找大人幫忙，同伴卻叫他懦夫。後來同伴才懂得，為了制止這種殘忍行為而站出來求助，其實很勇敢。","en":"Two boys crept behind the wall and filmed someone throwing stones at a puppy. One of them insisted on getting help from an adult, but his friend called him a coward. Later the friend understood that standing up to ask for help to stop such cruelty is actually courageous.","words":[{"en":"courageous","zh":"勇敢的"},{"en":"coward","zh":"懦夫、膽小鬼"},{"en":"creep","zh":"爬行、躡手躡腳地走"},{"en":"cruelty","zh":"殘忍"}]},{"id":"L4-C31","level":4,"letter":"C","n":31,"zh":"影評人在專欄裡批評我們的短片，說他看不出主角為何在最後一刻折返。這句批評讓剪接師找回一個被剪掉的關鍵鏡頭，裡頭的女孩正從窗邊向主角求救。","en":"In his column, a film critic criticized our short film, saying he could not see why the main character turned back at the last moment. This criticism made our editor find a critical scene that had been cut, in which a girl calls for help from a window.","words":[{"en":"critic","zh":"評論家"},{"en":"critical","zh":"批評的；關鍵的；病危的"},{"en":"criticism","zh":"批評、評論"},{"en":"criticize","zh":"批評"}]},{"id":"L4-C32","level":4,"letter":"C","n":32,"zh":"妹妹把蘋果切成小方塊，我則用杯底把花生壓碎。我們先把蘋果拌進優格裡，等優格冰透了，要上桌前才撒上花生，這樣花生吃起來才香脆。","en":"My sister cut the apples into small cubes, and I crushed the peanuts with the bottom of a cup. We mixed the apples into the yogurt first, and when the yogurt was cold, we sprinkled the peanuts on just before serving so they would stay crunchy.","words":[{"en":"crunchy","zh":"酥脆的"},{"en":"crush","zh":"壓碎；迷戀"},{"en":"cube","zh":"立方體；方塊"}]},{"id":"L4-C33","level":4,"letter":"C","n":33,"zh":"出於好奇，我掀開坐墊，發現椅面上畫著一道曲線，末端指向牆上的裂縫。原來設計密室的那位狡猾店主，早把鑰匙藏在縫裡了。","en":"Out of curiosity, I lifted the cushion and found a curve drawn on the seat, with its end pointing at a crack in the wall. It turned out that the cunning owner who designed the escape room had hidden the key in the crack.","words":[{"en":"crack","zh":"裂縫；裂開"},{"en":"cunning","zh":"狡猾的"},{"en":"curiosity","zh":"好奇心"},{"en":"curve","zh":"曲線、彎曲"},{"en":"cushion","zh":"墊子、靠墊"}]},{"id":"L4-D01","level":4,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"校慶前一晚，才掛上去的紙花就被潮濕的海風吹軟了。班長宣布，更換入口裝飾的最後期限是隔天早上七點，住得近的同學便答應提早到校。","en":"The night before the school anniversary, the damp sea wind softened the paper flowers we had just hung up. The class leader declared that the deadline for replacing the decorations at the entrance was seven the next morning, and the students living nearby promised to come early.","words":[{"en":"damp","zh":"潮溼的"},{"en":"deadline","zh":"截止期限"},{"en":"declare","zh":"宣布、聲明；申報"},{"en":"decoration","zh":"裝飾、裝飾品"}]},{"id":"L4-D02","level":4,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"為了守住一分的領先，我們決定防守籃下，兩名後衛也退回防守位置。對方球員雖然閃過第一個人，我們的防守還是逼得他倉促出手，他投失後，我們就以一分之差擊敗了對方。","en":"To defend our one-point lead, we decided to guard the basket, and our two guards moved back into defensive positions. Although the other player dodged the first defender, our defense forced him to shoot in a hurry. He missed, and we defeated them by one point.","words":[{"en":"defeat","zh":"擊敗；失敗"},{"en":"defend","zh":"防禦、辯護"},{"en":"defense","zh":"防禦、辯護"},{"en":"defensive","zh":"防禦的"},{"en":"dodge","zh":"避開、躲避"}]},{"id":"L4-D03","level":4,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"兩位同學為照片的署名起了爭執，都要求社長給一個明確的答覆。社長起草新的署名規則時，也請雙方提供底片。她說，關於這張照片該署誰的名，她得做出有證據支持、站得住腳的決定。","en":"Two students got into a dispute over the credit for a photo, and both demanded a definite answer from the club president. While she drafted new rules for credit, she asked both sides for the original files. She said her decision about whose name should go on the photo had to be defensible and supported by evidence.","words":[{"en":"defensible","zh":"可防禦的、可辯護的"},{"en":"definite","zh":"明確的、確定的"},{"en":"demand","zh":"要求、需求"},{"en":"dispute","zh":"爭論、糾紛"},{"en":"draft","zh":"草稿；徵兵"}]},{"id":"L4-D04","level":4,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"師傅先示範如何把糖拉成纖細易碎的花瓣，又讓我們靠近看第二次示範。讓阿嬤欣喜的是，她第一次做的糖花就完整地立在盤子上。她說那是當天最愉快的一刻。","en":"The master first demonstrated how to pull sugar into delicate, thin petals, and then let us come closer for a second demonstration. To Grandma's delight, her first sugar flower stood complete on the plate. She said it was the most delightful moment of the day.","words":[{"en":"delicate","zh":"精緻的；脆弱的；微妙的"},{"en":"delight","zh":"高興、愉快"},{"en":"delightful","zh":"令人愉快的、可愛的"},{"en":"demonstrate","zh":"示範、證明"},{"en":"demonstration","zh":"示範；示威遊行"}]},{"id":"L4-D05","level":4,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"草葉上還掛著露水，我們就已經站在站牌前等車了。昏昏欲睡的弟弟問司機幾點出發，司機指著前方的濃霧，說出發時間已經延後。","en":"There was still dew on the grass, and we were already standing at the bus stop. My drowsy brother asked the driver what time we would depart, and the driver pointed at the dense fog ahead and said the departure had been delayed.","words":[{"en":"dense","zh":"密集的、濃密的"},{"en":"depart","zh":"離開、出發"},{"en":"departure","zh":"離開、出發"},{"en":"dew","zh":"露水"},{"en":"drowsy","zh":"昏昏欲睡的"}]},{"id":"L4-D06","level":4,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"有視覺障礙的阿文說，走道堆滿紙箱讓他處於不利地位，每回去書架找書都得依賴別人。他希望走道能清出來，這樣他就能有尊嚴地自己挑書，也不用打擾正在讀書的同學。","en":"A-Wen, who has a visual disability, said the boxes piled in the aisle put him at a disadvantage, and every time he went to the shelves for a book he had to be dependent on others. He hoped the aisle could be cleared so he could choose books by himself with dignity and not disturb classmates who were reading.","words":[{"en":"dependent","zh":"依賴的"},{"en":"dignity","zh":"尊嚴"},{"en":"disability","zh":"身心障礙、殘疾"},{"en":"disadvantage","zh":"缺點、不利"},{"en":"disturb","zh":"打擾、擾亂"}]},{"id":"L4-D07","level":4,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"沒入選校隊讓小希很失望。她決定探討運動員面對的憂鬱症問題，為校刊寫篇報導。她自己非常渴望再比一次，教練也告訴她，他看得出她的決心，希望她別讓一次落選就把她嚇退。半年後，她用成績證明自己值得擁有先發位置。","en":"Xiao-Xi was disappointed that she did not make the school team. She decided to write an article for the school magazine about depression among athletes. She was desperate to compete again, and her coach told her he could see her determination and hoped one failure would not discourage her. Half a year later, she proved with her results that she deserved a starting position.","words":[{"en":"depression","zh":"憂鬱（症）；不景氣"},{"en":"deserve","zh":"該得到、值得"},{"en":"desperate","zh":"絕望的、不顧一切的"},{"en":"determination","zh":"決心"},{"en":"disappoint(ment)","zh":"使失望"},{"en":"discourage(ment)","zh":"使氣餒、阻礙"}]},{"id":"L4-D08","level":4,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"儘管颱風已經離開，這場災害對山區道路造成的破壞仍清楚可見。志工先把熱食送到受災最重的地區，再請熟悉巷弄的居民分發餐盒。他們也逐戶做記號，以便追蹤物資的分配情形。","en":"Despite the typhoon having left, the destruction it caused to the mountain roads was still clear. Volunteers first delivered hot food to the district hit hardest by the disaster and then asked residents who knew the lanes to distribute the lunch boxes. They also marked each house to track the distribution of supplies.","words":[{"en":"despite","zh":"儘管"},{"en":"destruction","zh":"破壞、毀滅"},{"en":"disaster","zh":"災難"},{"en":"distribute","zh":"分發、分配"},{"en":"distribution","zh":"分配"},{"en":"district","zh":"地區、行政區"}]},{"id":"L4-D09","level":4,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"校慶推理劇裡，失物招領處一片混亂，偵探便假扮成工讀生調查。她發現主管偷走皮夾，還解雇了代客保管皮夾的員工。想到主管竟然栽贓給別人，她就感到厭惡。","en":"In the school mystery play, the lost-and-found office was in disorder, so the detective went in disguised as a part-time worker. She discovered that the manager had stolen a wallet and dismissed the worker who had been keeping it for a customer. The thought that the manager had blamed someone else filled her with disgust.","words":[{"en":"detective","zh":"偵探"},{"en":"disguise","zh":"偽裝"},{"en":"disgust","zh":"厭惡、嫌惡"},{"en":"dismiss","zh":"解散；解僱；不予理會"},{"en":"disorder","zh":"混亂；（身心）失調、疾病"}]},{"id":"L4-D10","level":4,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"兩組學生各自設計了一套自動澆水裝置，並畫了圖解說明水如何流進花盆。兩套設計的不同之處在於，一組靠數位計時器定時澆水，另一組則在泥土乾了才放水。","en":"Two groups of students each devised an automatic watering device and drew a diagram showing how water flows into the pot. The two designs differ in that one waters on a schedule with a digital timer, while the other lets water out only when the soil is dry.","words":[{"en":"device","zh":"裝置、設備"},{"en":"devise","zh":"設計、想出"},{"en":"diagram","zh":"圖表、圖解"},{"en":"differ","zh":"不同"},{"en":"digital","zh":"數位的"}]},{"id":"L4-D11","level":4,"letter":"D","n":11,"zh":"那位退休外交官把每個週末都奉獻給夜校，幫勤奮的學生練習寫作。畢業時，小玲捧著文憑向他道謝，他卻告訴她，那張文憑是她自己多年勤勉的成果。","en":"The retired diplomat devotes every weekend to a night school, helping diligent students practice writing. At graduation, Xiao-Ling held up her diploma and thanked him, but he told her the diploma was the result of her own years of diligence.","words":[{"en":"devote","zh":"奉獻、致力於"},{"en":"diligence","zh":"勤奮"},{"en":"diligent","zh":"勤勉的、用功的"},{"en":"diploma","zh":"文憑、畢業證書"},{"en":"diplomat","zh":"外交官"}]},{"id":"L4-D12","level":4,"letter":"D","n":12,"zh":"一位傑出的生物學家帶我們觀察兩種水生昆蟲，兩種各有鮮明的花紋。教會我們如何區分牠們後，他播放一段影片，解釋其中一種如何把消化液注入獵物體內，在自己的體外消化食物，再吸進液化的食物。","en":"A distinguished biologist showed us two kinds of water insects, each with distinct patterns. After teaching us how to distinguish them, he played a video explaining how one kind puts digestive juices into its prey, digests the food outside its own body, and then sucks up the liquid food.","words":[{"en":"digest","zh":"消化；摘要"},{"en":"distinct","zh":"明顯的、不同的"},{"en":"distinguish","zh":"區別、辨別"},{"en":"distinguished","zh":"傑出的"}]},{"id":"L4-D13","level":4,"letter":"D","n":13,"zh":"樂團成員的背景很多元，指揮也希望曲目能反映這份多樣性。她提醒大家，排練時要有紀律。即使鼓在這一段擔任主導角色，鼓手也不能讓鼓聲支配整首曲子。","en":"The members of the band come from diverse backgrounds, and the conductor wants the music to reflect this diversity. She reminded everyone to have discipline during rehearsal. Even though the drums play a dominant role in this part, the drummer must not let them dominate the whole piece.","words":[{"en":"discipline","zh":"紀律；訓練；學科"},{"en":"diverse","zh":"多樣的、不同的"},{"en":"diversity","zh":"多樣性"},{"en":"dominant","zh":"佔優勢的、主要的"},{"en":"dominate","zh":"支配、主導"}]},{"id":"L4-D14","level":4,"letter":"D","n":14,"zh":"歷史老師讓我們操作一張動態地圖，看看每個朝代的疆界如何改變。有同學想知道古代的君王為什麼宣稱自己享有神授的統治權，老師便請他讀讀地圖旁的登基詔書。","en":"Our history teacher let us use a dynamic map to see how the borders of each dynasty changed. A classmate wanted to know why ancient rulers claimed a divine right to rule, so the teacher asked him to read the announcement of the new emperor beside the map.","words":[{"en":"divine","zh":"神的、神聖的"},{"en":"dynamic","zh":"動態的、有活力的"},{"en":"dynasty","zh":"朝代、王朝"}]},{"id":"L4-D15","level":4,"letter":"D","n":15,"zh":"爸媽離婚後，我一直害怕別人問我週末要住哪裡。有天爸爸帶我去河邊，我們一起看著一片葉子順水漂去。他等到我自己開口問，才告訴我下個月的安排。","en":"After my parents' divorce, I always dreaded being asked where I would stay on weekends. One day Dad took me to the river, and we watched a leaf drift away with the water. He waited until I asked him myself before telling me the plan for next month.","words":[{"en":"divorce","zh":"離婚"},{"en":"dread","zh":"害怕、恐懼"},{"en":"drift","zh":"漂流"}]},{"id":"L4-D16","level":4,"letter":"D","n":16,"zh":"我們把閣樓上滿是灰塵的舊帆布洗乾淨，用剩下的染料把它染成深藍色。爺爺在兩根木把手上各鑽了幾個孔，好讓我把耐用的帆布縫在把手上，做成工具袋。","en":"We washed the dusty old canvas from the attic and dyed it dark blue with leftover dye. Grandpa drilled holes in two wooden handles so I could sew the durable canvas onto them and make a tool bag.","words":[{"en":"drill","zh":"鑽頭；演練；鑽孔"},{"en":"durable","zh":"持久的、耐用的"},{"en":"dusty","zh":"滿是灰塵的"},{"en":"dye","zh":"染料；染"}]},{"id":"L4-E01","level":4,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"外公帶著壞掉的單耳耳機來找我，神情誠懇地請我教他修理。我才上過一門初級電子學的課，便先和他一起照著課本查線路，直到找到斷線的地方才動手修。","en":"Grandpa came to me with a broken earphone and earnestly asked me to teach him how to fix it. I had only taken an elementary electronics course, so I first checked the wires with him using the textbook. We did not start fixing it until we found the broken wire.","words":[{"en":"earnest","zh":"認真的"},{"en":"earphone","zh":"耳機"},{"en":"electronics","zh":"電子學"},{"en":"elementary","zh":"基本的、初級的"}]},{"id":"L4-E02","level":4,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"經濟學課請來一位經濟學者，帶我們討論物價上漲給家庭造成的經濟壓力。她問我們哪種午餐最省錢，又請我們試試集中備料能否提高廚房效率。最後，我們討論了這些家庭消費習慣的改變對整體經濟有什麼影響。","en":"Our economics class invited an economist to discuss the economic pressure that rising prices put on families. She asked us which lunch was the most economical and asked us to see whether preparing ingredients at the same time could improve efficiency in the kitchen. Finally, we discussed how these changes in family spending affect the whole economy.","words":[{"en":"economic","zh":"經濟的"},{"en":"economical","zh":"節約的、省錢的"},{"en":"economics","zh":"經濟學"},{"en":"economist","zh":"經濟學家"},{"en":"economy","zh":"經濟"},{"en":"efficiency","zh":"效率、效能"}]},{"id":"L4-E03","level":4,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"為了消除舞鞋容易滑落的問題，舞者拆下有彈性的帶子，把它改縫在鞋子別處。她試著轉了個身，發現帶子既能固定舞鞋，也不會妨礙她優雅的動作。","en":"To eliminate the problem of her dance shoes slipping off, the dancer removed the elastic strap and sewed it elsewhere on the shoe. She tried a turn and found that the strap held the shoe in place without getting in the way of her elegant movements.","words":[{"en":"elastic","zh":"有彈性的；鬆緊帶"},{"en":"elegant","zh":"優雅的、端莊的"},{"en":"eliminate","zh":"消除、淘汰"},{"en":"elsewhere","zh":"在別處"}]},{"id":"L4-E04","level":4,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"我們在國外旅行遇到難題時，哥哥陪我到大使館求助。承認自己把護照忘在車上讓我很難堪，但我還是跟他一起忍受漫長的等候，直到櫃檯叫到我們的號碼。","en":"When we encountered a problem while traveling abroad, my brother went with me to the embassy for help. Admitting that I had left my passport in the car was an embarrassment, but I still endured the long wait with him until the counter called our number.","words":[{"en":"embarrass(ment)","zh":"使尷尬、使難堪"},{"en":"embassy","zh":"大使館"},{"en":"encounter","zh":"遇到、遭遇"},{"en":"endure","zh":"忍受、忍耐"}]},{"id":"L4-E05","level":4,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"暑假工人開挖水管溝時，一段石板路從泥土下浮現。考古隊在工地四周圍起柵欄，說這條路建於羅馬帝國時代，路面上還看得到車輪留下的痕跡。","en":"When workers dug a trench for water pipes during the summer, part of a stone road emerged from the dirt. The archaeologists enclosed the site with a fence and said the road was built in the time of the Roman Empire. You can still see marks left by wheels on its surface.","words":[{"en":"emerge","zh":"浮現、出現"},{"en":"empire","zh":"帝國"},{"en":"enclose","zh":"隨信附上；圍住"}]},{"id":"L4-E06","level":4,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"校門口的機車一度把人行道堵住，危及步行上學的孩子。家長會把重點放在交通規則的執行上，要求定期巡查，確保走路或使用輪椅的人都能順利通過。","en":"Scooters at the school gate once blocked the sidewalk and endangered children walking to school. The parents' association put the emphasis on the enforcement of traffic rules and asked for regular checks to ensure that people walking or using wheelchairs could get through.","words":[{"en":"emphasis","zh":"強調、重點"},{"en":"endanger","zh":"危害"},{"en":"enforce(ment)","zh":"執行（法律）、強制"},{"en":"ensure","zh":"確保"}]},{"id":"L4-E07","level":4,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"念土木工程的學姊把橋墩照片放大後，我們才看見一道原本看不清楚的裂痕。她請我們估計修補費用，再解釋為什麼換掉整座橋墩要花一筆巨款。","en":"After my senior who studies civil engineering enlarged a photo of the bridge's support, we saw a crack that had not been clear before. She asked us to estimate the cost of repair and then explained why replacing the whole support would cost an enormous amount of money.","words":[{"en":"engineering","zh":"工程（學）"},{"en":"enlarge(ment)","zh":"擴大、放大"},{"en":"enormous","zh":"巨大的、龐大的"},{"en":"estimate","zh":"估計"}]},{"id":"L4-E08","level":4,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"來自不同族群的同學用家鄉菜招待交換生，介紹拿手菜時的熱情讓走廊擠滿了圍觀的人。主辦人說，為了表達對各族群平等的重視，每組都有五分鐘介紹自己的菜。","en":"Classmates from different ethnic groups entertained the exchange students with dishes from home, and their enthusiasm in introducing their best dishes filled the hallway with people watching. The organizer said that to show the importance of equality among all ethnic groups, every group had five minutes to introduce its dish.","words":[{"en":"entertain(ment)","zh":"娛樂；招待"},{"en":"enthusiasm","zh":"熱情、熱忱"},{"en":"equality","zh":"平等"},{"en":"ethnic","zh":"種族的、民族的"}]},{"id":"L4-E09","level":4,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"學校成立女子壘球隊時，只借得到一支球棒。隊長列出練球必備的裝備，等到每位隊員都有了合身的手套和頭盔，才安排第一次打擊練習。","en":"When the school established a girls' softball team, it could only borrow one bat. The captain listed the essential equipment for practice and did not plan the first batting practice until every player had gloves and a helmet that fit.","words":[{"en":"equip(ment)","zh":"裝備、配備"},{"en":"essential","zh":"必要的、基本的"},{"en":"establish(ment)","zh":"建立、確立"}]},{"id":"L4-E10","level":4,"letter":"E","n":10,"zh":"一開始，哪塊布最能阻擋陽光帶來的熱並不明顯，因此我們用溫度計評估每種布料的隔熱效果。最後勝出的白布看起來最薄，但連續七天的讀數為這次評估提供了充分的證據。","en":"At first it was not evident which cloth blocked the sun's heat best, so we used a thermometer to evaluate each fabric. The white cloth that won looked the thinnest, but the readings from seven days in a row gave strong evidence for this evaluation.","words":[{"en":"evaluate","zh":"評估、評價"},{"en":"evaluation","zh":"評估、估價"},{"en":"evidence","zh":"證據"},{"en":"evident","zh":"顯然的、明顯的"}]},{"id":"L4-E11","level":4,"letter":"E","n":11,"zh":"攝影師說，為了拍到足以展出的照片，除了颱風天這個例外，他每天都扛著器材爬山。我原以為他誇大了那段路的難走程度，直到自己走了一趟，才知道長長的石階足以讓人精疲力盡。","en":"The photographer said that to take photos good enough to exhibit, he carried his gear up the mountain every day, with the exception of typhoon days. I thought he was exaggerating how hard the path was, until I walked it myself and learned that the long stone steps can exhaust anyone.","words":[{"en":"exaggerate","zh":"誇大"},{"en":"exception","zh":"例外"},{"en":"exhaust","zh":"使筋疲力盡；耗盡；廢氣"},{"en":"exhibit","zh":"展示；展覽品"}]},{"id":"L4-E12","level":4,"letter":"E","n":12,"zh":"木工社展示一張實驗性的桌子，把桌面展開就能多坐兩個人。聽完設計者的解說，我才明白，為什麼設計者把擴展桌面的機構裝在正中央，這樣連坐在桌腳旁的人也不會撞到膝蓋。","en":"The woodworking club showed an experimental table that seats two more people when the top is pulled out. After the designer's explanation, I understood why the part that expands the table was put in the middle, so even people sitting by the table legs would not hit their knees.","words":[{"en":"expand","zh":"擴大、擴張"},{"en":"experimental","zh":"實驗的"},{"en":"explanation","zh":"解釋、說明"}]},{"id":"L4-E13","level":4,"letter":"E","n":13,"zh":"我們到煙火倉庫採訪時，管理員說，讓爆炸物暴露在高溫下會增加爆炸的風險。他指著卸貨時間表，解釋他們如何安排貨車在清晨到達，縮短貨物在烈日下曝曬的時間。","en":"When we interviewed people at a fireworks warehouse, the manager said exposing explosives to high heat increases the risk of an explosion. He pointed at the unloading schedule and explained how they arrange for trucks to arrive early in the morning to shorten the goods' exposure to the hot sun.","words":[{"en":"explosion","zh":"爆炸"},{"en":"explosive","zh":"爆炸性的；炸藥"},{"en":"expose","zh":"暴露、揭露"},{"en":"exposure","zh":"暴露、揭發"}]},{"id":"L4-E14","level":4,"letter":"E","n":14,"zh":"雨終於停了，巡山員先估計落石波及的範圍。園方原本打算當天重開步道，等巡查報告送到後，才決定把步道封閉的時間延長一週。","en":"When the rain finally stopped, the rangers first estimated the extent of the falling rocks. The park had planned to reopen the trail that day, but after the report came in, they decided to extend the closure by a week.","words":[{"en":"estimate","zh":"估計"},{"en":"extend","zh":"延伸、延長"},{"en":"extent","zh":"範圍、程度"}]},{"id":"L4-F01","level":4,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"這位作家以奇幻小說打響名聲，我也是他的忠實讀者之一。朗讀會上，他只用臉部表情就演出了書中的兩個角色。我最喜歡的精靈和石像竟然就在眼前吵架，感覺真奇妙。","en":"This writer won fame with his fantasy novels, and I am one of his faithful readers. At the reading, he acted out two characters from the book using only his facial expressions. Seeing my favorite elf and stone statue arguing right in front of me felt fantastic.","words":[{"en":"facial","zh":"臉部的"},{"en":"faithful","zh":"忠實的"},{"en":"fame","zh":"名望、名聲"},{"en":"fantastic","zh":"極好的、很棒的"},{"en":"fantasy","zh":"幻想"}]},{"id":"L4-F02","level":4,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"天氣終於轉為適合航行，大家到碼頭向即將離開小島的教練告別。他上渡輪前又教我一次怎麼繫緊救生衣，提醒我在海上一次疏忽就足以致命。","en":"When the weather finally became favorable for sailing, everyone went to the dock to say farewell to the coach who was leaving the island. Before boarding the ferry, he taught me again how to fasten my life jacket and reminded me that one careless moment at sea could be fatal.","words":[{"en":"farewell","zh":"告別、再見"},{"en":"fasten","zh":"拴緊、使固定"},{"en":"fatal","zh":"致命的"},{"en":"favorable","zh":"有利的、贊同的"},{"en":"ferry","zh":"渡輪"}]},{"id":"L4-F03","level":4,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"學校的運動設施需要維修，其中一座球場連燈都不亮了。教練把估價單傳真給校友會，希望他們能資助維修工程。校友會看過晚自習後來練球的學生所寫的回饋，決定先換掉籃架旁那兩盞燈。","en":"The school's sports facilities needed repairs, and the lights on one court did not even work. The coach faxed the price estimate to the alumni association, hoping they would help finance the repairs. After reading feedback from students who practiced after evening study, the association decided to replace the two lights beside the basketball hoop first.","words":[{"en":"facility","zh":"設施"},{"en":"fax","zh":"傳真"},{"en":"feedback","zh":"回饋、意見"},{"en":"finance","zh":"財務、金融；資助"}]},{"id":"L4-F04","level":4,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"一場猛烈的風暴過後，阿姨帶我們去看那塊肥沃的田裡還有哪些蔬菜可以收成。她叫我回家拿個大籃子來，說今晚要用這些菜辦一桌盛宴，款待幫忙清理農田的鄰居。","en":"After a fierce storm, my aunt took us to see which vegetables in her fertile field could still be picked. She asked me to go home and fetch a big basket, saying she would make a feast with these vegetables tonight for the neighbors who helped clean up the field.","words":[{"en":"feast","zh":"盛宴"},{"en":"fertile","zh":"肥沃的"},{"en":"fetch","zh":"去拿來"},{"en":"fierce","zh":"兇猛的、猛烈的"}]},{"id":"L4-F05","level":4,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"基金會的創辦人曾答應開設夜間閱讀班，讓輪夜班的工人也能參加。儘管財務吃緊，她仍履行承諾，讓工人依自己的班表彈性選擇上課時間。","en":"The founder of the foundation once promised to start evening reading classes so that workers on night shifts could join. Despite tight finances, she fulfilled her promise and let the workers choose their class times flexibly according to their schedules.","words":[{"en":"finance","zh":"財務、金融；資助"},{"en":"flexible","zh":"有彈性的、靈活的"},{"en":"foundation","zh":"基礎；基金會；粉底"},{"en":"founder","zh":"創辦人"},{"en":"fulfill(ment)","zh":"實現、履行"}]},{"id":"L4-F06","level":4,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"葬禮前，我們把爺爺年輕時的照片裝框，放在壁爐上方。當年是他親自替這間客廳添置家具的，如今家人仍愛坐在他的舊椅子上說故事。","en":"Before the funeral, we framed a photo of Grandpa when he was young and put it above the fireplace. He had furnished this living room himself, and the family still loves to sit in his old chair and tell stories.","words":[{"en":"fireplace","zh":"壁爐"},{"en":"frame","zh":"框架、相框"},{"en":"funeral","zh":"葬禮"},{"en":"furnish","zh":"布置（家具）；提供"}]},{"id":"L4-F07","level":4,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"外賓說我日語講得很流利，我臉都紅了。帶隊老師見我皺眉，就跟我說，那位客人是真心感謝我幫忙，沒打算奉承我。","en":"When the foreign guest said my Japanese was fluent, my face flushed. When the teacher in charge saw me frown, she told me the guest was truly thankful for my help and was not trying to flatter me.","words":[{"en":"flatter","zh":"奉承、討好"},{"en":"fluent","zh":"流利的"},{"en":"flush","zh":"沖（馬桶）；臉紅"},{"en":"frown","zh":"皺眉"}]},{"id":"L4-F08","level":4,"letter":"F","n":8,"zh":"我正要把小狗身上有跳蚤的地方洗乾淨，牠卻頂著一頭泡沫逃出浴室。媽媽早就禁止牠上沙發，所以牠正要跳上去時，我一把抱住了牠。","en":"I was about to wash the spot where the puppy had fleas, but it fled the bathroom covered in foam. Mom had long forbidden it to get on the sofa, so just as it was about to jump up, I grabbed it.","words":[{"en":"flea","zh":"跳蚤"},{"en":"flee","zh":"逃跑"},{"en":"foam","zh":"泡沫"},{"en":"forbid","zh":"禁止"}]},{"id":"L4-F09","level":4,"letter":"F","n":9,"zh":"天氣預報說夜裡會變冷，清晨堡壘外的石階果然覆了一層霜。我們很幸運，守門人早在第一批遊客抵達前就鋪好了防滑墊。","en":"The weather forecast said it would get cold at night, and sure enough, there was frost on the stone steps outside the fort early in the morning. We were fortunate that the gatekeeper had put down non-slip mats before the first visitors arrived.","words":[{"en":"forecast","zh":"預報、預測"},{"en":"fort","zh":"堡壘、要塞"},{"en":"fortunate","zh":"幸運的"},{"en":"frost","zh":"霜"}]},{"id":"L4-F10","level":4,"letter":"F","n":10,"zh":"老師先講解化石形成的基本原理，再讓我們看一片保存在石頭裡的葉子。那塊標本脆弱到不能拿起來，我們只能隔著玻璃看它的葉脈。","en":"The teacher first explained the fundamental idea of how fossils form and then showed us a leaf kept in stone. The specimen was too fragile to pick up, so we could only look at its veins through glass.","words":[{"en":"fossil","zh":"化石"},{"en":"fragile","zh":"易碎的、脆弱的"},{"en":"fundamental","zh":"基本的、根本的"}]},{"id":"L4-F11","level":4,"letter":"F","n":11,"zh":"那位大一新生照著公式算出廣播頻率，天線偏偏在家鄉電台開播前壞了，讓他十分懊惱。他壓下心中的挫折感，向隔壁寢室借來一支天線，總算在節目結束前聽到熟悉的聲音。","en":"The freshman used a formula to work out the radio frequency, but the antenna broke just before his hometown radio station started its show, which frustrated him. He held back his frustration, borrowed an antenna from the room next door, and finally heard the familiar voice before the show ended.","words":[{"en":"formula","zh":"公式；配方"},{"en":"frequency","zh":"頻率"},{"en":"freshman","zh":"新生、大一學生"},{"en":"frustrate","zh":"使挫折、使沮喪"},{"en":"frustration","zh":"挫折感"}]},{"id":"L4-F12","level":4,"letter":"F","n":12,"zh":"領隊發現兩支手電筒的電池都被人拿走了，氣得不得了。她在報告中寫道，隊上必須配備兩支能正常使用的手電筒。此外，每次出發前都要有人把兩支手電筒打開測試。","en":"The leader was furious to find that the batteries in both flashlights had been taken. In her report, she wrote that the team must be equipped with two functional flashlights. Furthermore, someone must turn on and test both of them before every trip.","words":[{"en":"functional","zh":"功能的"},{"en":"furious","zh":"狂怒的"},{"en":"furthermore","zh":"此外、而且"}]},{"id":"L4-G01","level":4,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"我在畫廊門口瞥見畫裡有艘歪向一邊的小船，便走進去凝視那幅畫。我問這是不是畫家的真跡，館員才拿出畫家當年的草稿給我看。","en":"At the door of the gallery I caught a glimpse of a small boat leaning to one side in a painting, so I went in and gazed at it. When I asked if it was a genuine work by the painter, the staff member took out the painter's original sketch to show me.","words":[{"en":"gallery","zh":"畫廊、美術館"},{"en":"gaze","zh":"注視、凝視"},{"en":"genuine","zh":"真正的、真誠的"},{"en":"glimpse","zh":"一瞥"},{"en":"greeting(s)","zh":"問候、招呼"}]},{"id":"L4-G02","level":4,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"科展上有一座巨大的地球儀，底下裝了三個互相咬合的齒輪。原本圍著看的一群孩子見我妹妹轉動手把，地球竟往相反方向轉，都忍不住偷笑。","en":"There was a gigantic globe at the science fair with three gears fitting together underneath. When my sister turned the handle and the earth turned the opposite way, the group of children watching could not help giggling.","words":[{"en":"gear","zh":"裝備；排檔、齒輪"},{"en":"gigantic","zh":"巨大的"},{"en":"giggle","zh":"咯咯笑、傻笑"},{"en":"globe","zh":"地球；地球儀；球體"}]},{"id":"L4-G03","level":4,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"我們把家中三個世代的資料按性別整理成圖表，畫出各組有多少人笑起來有酒窩。表弟想知道，只看這張圖能不能判斷他承襲了哪些基因。","en":"We organized the information about three generations of our family by gender into a graph showing how many people in each group have dimples when they smile. My cousin wanted to know if this graph alone could tell him which genes he had inherited.","words":[{"en":"gender","zh":"性別"},{"en":"gene","zh":"基因"},{"en":"generation","zh":"世代"},{"en":"graph","zh":"圖表"}]},{"id":"L4-G04","level":4,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"大家都叫小澄音樂天才，老師卻記得這個有天分的孩子當初連琴都得借。小澄一直很感激當年借琴給她的店主，便在獨奏會上演奏他最愛的曲子，向他表達對這份慷慨的謝意。","en":"Everyone calls Xiao-Cheng a musical genius, but the teacher remembers that this gifted child once had to borrow a piano. Xiao-Cheng has always been grateful to the shop owner who lent her the piano, so at her recital she played his favorite piece to thank him for his generosity.","words":[{"en":"generosity","zh":"慷慨"},{"en":"genius","zh":"天才、天賦"},{"en":"gifted","zh":"有天分的"},{"en":"grateful","zh":"感激的"}]},{"id":"L4-G05","level":4,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"阿婆先教我洗手，免得把病菌帶到食材上。等我把生薑磨成泥，她才教我用它調醬，讓油膩的煎肉吃起來更清爽。","en":"Grandma first taught me to wash my hands so I would not get germs on the food. After I had ground the fresh ginger, she taught me to use it in a sauce so the greasy fried meat would taste lighter.","words":[{"en":"germ","zh":"細菌、病菌"},{"en":"ginger","zh":"薑"},{"en":"greasy","zh":"油膩的"},{"en":"grind","zh":"磨、研磨"}]},{"id":"L4-G06","level":4,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"販賣手工商品的攤販天還沒亮就沿著海灣搭好了棚子。等到第一道陽光照上船帆，他們都放下手邊的工作，一起欣賞這壯麗的景色。","en":"The sellers of handmade goods set up their stalls along the gulf before dawn. When the first rays of sunlight hit the sails, they all stopped working to enjoy the glorious view together.","words":[{"en":"glorious","zh":"光榮的"},{"en":"goods","zh":"貨物"},{"en":"gulf","zh":"海灣"}]},{"id":"L4-G07","level":4,"letter":"G","n":7,"zh":"畢業典禮那天，我的長袍被椅腳勾住，一位親切的同學蹲下來幫我解開。看她起身時的動作那麼優美，我也試著帶著同樣的優雅走上台。","en":"On graduation day, my gown got caught on a chair leg, and a gracious classmate knelt down to free it for me. Seeing how graceful she was when she stood up, I tried to walk onto the stage with the same grace.","words":[{"en":"gown","zh":"禮服、長袍"},{"en":"grace","zh":"優雅；恩典"},{"en":"graceful","zh":"優雅的"},{"en":"gracious","zh":"親切的、和藹的"},{"en":"graduation","zh":"畢業"}]},{"id":"L4-G08","level":4,"letter":"G","n":8,"zh":"為了替交換生寫一句自然的問候語，我把整本文法書翻了一遍。姐姐讀過後說，那句話雖然合乎文法，朋友之間卻很少這麼客氣。","en":"To write a natural greeting for the exchange student, I went through my whole grammar book. After reading it, my sister said the sentence was grammatical, but friends are rarely that polite with each other.","words":[{"en":"grammar","zh":"文法"},{"en":"grammatical","zh":"文法的"},{"en":"greeting(s)","zh":"問候、招呼"}]},{"id":"L4-G09","level":4,"letter":"G","n":9,"zh":"清明那天，從小擔任我監護人的姑姑帶我去看父親的墓。她知道我還沉浸在悲痛之中，就陪我種下一棵桂花樹，靜靜等我開口。","en":"On Tomb-Sweeping Day, my aunt, who has been my guardian since I was little, took me to my father's grave. She knew I was still deep in grief, so she planted a sweet osmanthus tree with me and quietly waited for me to speak.","words":[{"en":"grave","zh":"墳墓；嚴重的"},{"en":"greeting(s)","zh":"問候、招呼"},{"en":"grief","zh":"悲傷"},{"en":"guardian","zh":"監護人、守護者"}]},{"id":"L4-G10","level":4,"letter":"G","n":10,"zh":"店員原本敢保證被指認的人有罪，因為錄影畫面裡的人和他穿著同色外套。直到第二段影片被播放出來，店員才明白，光憑外套顏色無法證明一個人有罪。","en":"The clerk was ready to guarantee that the man pointed out was guilty because the person in the video wore a jacket of the same color. Not until a second video was played did the clerk understand that the color of a jacket alone could not prove someone's guilt.","words":[{"en":"greeting(s)","zh":"問候、招呼"},{"en":"guarantee","zh":"保證、擔保"},{"en":"guilt","zh":"罪惡感；有罪"},{"en":"guilty","zh":"有罪的；內疚的"}]},{"id":"L4-H01","level":4,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"我認得外婆的筆跡，也熟悉她信末習慣性畫下的那片小葉子。即使剛離開家鄉時歷經困苦，她在寫給家人的信裡也從未提起那些挨餓的日子。","en":"I recognize my grandmother's handwriting and the little leaf she habitually drew at the end of her letters. Even though she suffered hardship when she first left her homeland, she never mentioned those hungry days in her letters to her family.","words":[{"en":"habitual","zh":"習慣的、慣常的"},{"en":"handwriting","zh":"筆跡"},{"en":"hardship","zh":"艱難、辛苦"},{"en":"homeland","zh":"祖國"}]},{"id":"L4-H02","level":4,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"爸爸匆忙之中忘了帶便當，我便趕緊走向行人穿越道，想把便當拿給他。看見一輛車正要轉彎，我毫不猶豫地退回人行道，等車完全停住才過街。","en":"In his haste, Dad forgot his lunch box, so I hurried toward the crosswalk to take it to him. When I saw a car about to turn, I stepped back onto the sidewalk without hesitation and waited until the car came to a complete halt before crossing.","words":[{"en":"halt","zh":"停止"},{"en":"haste","zh":"匆忙、急忙"},{"en":"hesitation","zh":"猶豫、躊躇"}]},{"id":"L4-H03","level":4,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"老師帶來一盒五金零件，請我們想想，花園裡那條老是絆倒人的澆水軟管可以收在哪裡。我把兩個掛鉤鎖在牆上，讓學弟用完軟管後能把它掛起來。","en":"The teacher brought a box of hardware and asked us where we could store the garden hose that kept tripping people. I screwed two hooks onto the wall so the younger students could hang up the hose after using it.","words":[{"en":"hardware","zh":"硬體；五金"},{"en":"hook","zh":"鉤子、掛鉤"},{"en":"hose","zh":"水管"}]},{"id":"L4-H04","level":4,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"戲裡兩個村子彼此仇恨多年，孩子們連隔著河說句話都會受到嚴厲的責罵。一場洪水過後，村民把毛毯分給對岸的人，孩子們從中看見人性善良的一面，也第一次懂得和諧相處是什麼意思。","en":"In the play, the two villages have felt hatred for each other for years, and the children receive harsh scolding even for talking across the river. After a flood, the villagers share blankets with the people on the other side. The children see the kind side of humanity and understand for the first time what living in harmony means.","words":[{"en":"harmony","zh":"和諧"},{"en":"harsh","zh":"嚴厲的、惡劣的"},{"en":"hatred","zh":"憎恨、仇恨"},{"en":"humanity","zh":"人類；人性"}]},{"id":"L4-H05","level":4,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"地平線上那個黑點愈飛愈近，我原以為是巡山的直升機。直到牠展翅飛過牛群上方，我才看清楚那是一隻鷹。","en":"The black dot on the horizon flew closer and closer, and I thought it was a ranger's helicopter. Not until it spread its wings over the herd of cattle did I see clearly that it was a hawk.","words":[{"en":"hawk","zh":"老鷹"},{"en":"helicopter","zh":"直升機"},{"en":"herd","zh":"（牛、羊）群"},{"en":"horizon","zh":"地平線"}]},{"id":"L4-H06","level":4,"letter":"H","n":6,"zh":"度蜜月的第一晚，新婚夫妻想打開山屋的窗戶吹吹風。窗框外竟掛著一個比籃球還大的蜂巢，把兩人嚇壞了。他們趕緊關上窗，跑去櫃檯問能不能換房間。","en":"On the first night of their honeymoon, the newly married couple wanted to open the cabin window for some air. To their horror, there was a hive bigger than a basketball hanging outside the window frame. They quickly closed the window and ran to the front desk to ask if they could change rooms.","words":[{"en":"hive","zh":"蜂巢"},{"en":"honeymoon","zh":"蜜月"}]},{"id":"L4-H07","level":4,"letter":"H","n":7,"zh":"最近濕度很高，曬出去的衣服到了晚上仍是濕的。我們家每一個人都得分擔家務，所以弟弟提議，誰輪到收衣服，誰就順便把除濕機打開。","en":"The humidity has been high lately, and the clothes we hang outside are still wet at night. Everyone in our household has to share the housework, so my brother suggested that whoever brings in the clothes should also turn on the dehumidifier.","words":[{"en":"household","zh":"一家人、家庭；家用的"},{"en":"housework","zh":"家事"},{"en":"humidity","zh":"溼度"}]},{"id":"L4-H08","level":4,"letter":"H","n":8,"zh":"新聞剛播報颶風登陸，學校實驗室就停了電。討論著該怎麼收集氫氣的學生一下子全安靜了，四周一片寂靜，只聽得見雨聲。","en":"The news had just reported that the hurricane had made landfall when the power went out in the school lab. The students who had been discussing how to collect hydrogen fell silent at once. A hush fell over the room, and only the sound of the rain could be heard.","words":[{"en":"hurricane","zh":"颶風"},{"en":"hush","zh":"安靜"},{"en":"hydrogen","zh":"氫"}]},{"id":"L4-I01","level":4,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"為了釐清昨天拿錯雨傘的事件，老師請我們辨認哪一把是自己的。兩把傘看起來完全相同，直到有人發現傘柄上的刻痕，辨識工作才變得容易。","en":"To clear up yesterday's incident of someone taking the wrong umbrella, the teacher asked us to identify which one was ours. The two umbrellas looked identical, and identification only became easy when someone noticed a mark on one handle.","words":[{"en":"identical","zh":"完全相同的"},{"en":"identification","zh":"身分證明；辨認"},{"en":"identify","zh":"辨認、識別"},{"en":"incident","zh":"事件"}]},{"id":"L4-I02","level":4,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"我們在車站閒著沒事，小宇就模仿起他的偶像。他連那位演員說錯成語時的表情都學得一模一樣，這段模仿把等車的人全逗笑了。","en":"We were idle at the station, so Xiao-Yu started to imitate his idol. He even copied the actor's face when he used an idiom wrong, and this imitation made everyone waiting for the train laugh.","words":[{"en":"idiom","zh":"慣用語、成語"},{"en":"idle","zh":"閒置的、懶散的"},{"en":"idol","zh":"偶像"},{"en":"imitate","zh":"模仿、效法"},{"en":"imitation","zh":"模仿；仿製品"}]},{"id":"L4-I03","level":4,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"我對回收流程一無所知，還以為油膩的紙盒也能丟進紙類回收桶。志工用一小桶變色的紙漿說明油脂會造成什麼影響，我才看懂講義上的插圖。這堂內容充實的課讓我意識到自己的無知。","en":"I was ignorant of the recycling process and thought greasy paper boxes could go in the paper recycling bin. Only after a volunteer used a small bucket of discolored paper pulp to show the impact of grease did I understand the illustration on the handout. This informative class made me aware of my own ignorance.","words":[{"en":"ignorance","zh":"無知"},{"en":"ignorant","zh":"無知的"},{"en":"illustration","zh":"插圖；例證"},{"en":"impact","zh":"影響、衝擊"},{"en":"informative","zh":"資訊豐富的"}]},{"id":"L4-I04","level":4,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"妹妹憑著孩子的天真，問我魚上學時要把腳踏車停在哪裡。這句話成了我畫一座虛構海底城市的靈感，也啟發我替魚設計腳踏車架。老師說停滿魚用腳踏車的街景很有想像力。","en":"With a child's innocence, my sister asked me where fish park their bikes when they go to school. This question became the inspiration for my painting of an imaginary underwater city, and it also inspired me to design bike racks for fish. The teacher said the street full of fish bikes was very imaginative.","words":[{"en":"imaginary","zh":"想像中的、虛構的"},{"en":"imaginative","zh":"富有想像力的"},{"en":"innocence","zh":"無罪、無知"},{"en":"inspiration","zh":"靈感；鼓舞"},{"en":"inspire","zh":"啟發、鼓舞"}]},{"id":"L4-I05","level":4,"letter":"I","n":5,"zh":"外公年輕時移居加拿大，沒想到新移民要花那麼久才能適應當地的冬天。我替學校做移民專題時，他給我看一只當年從台灣帶去、裝滿夏衣的行李箱，讓我印象特別深。","en":"Grandpa immigrated to Canada when he was young and did not expect it would take new immigrants so long to get used to the winters there. When I did a school project on immigration, he showed me a suitcase full of summer clothes that he had brought from Taiwan, and it left a deep impression on me.","words":[{"en":"immigrant","zh":"移民"},{"en":"immigrate","zh":"移居入境"},{"en":"immigration","zh":"移民；入境審查"},{"en":"impression","zh":"印象"}]},{"id":"L4-I06","level":4,"letter":"I","n":6,"zh":"通貨膨脹對巷口的豆花店造成衝擊，連最基本的原料黃豆也漲價了。老闆擔心突然漲價會加重熟客的負擔，所以先把進貨單貼在牆上，讓大家看看他的成本漲了多少。","en":"Inflation has had an impact on the tofu pudding shop at the end of the lane, and even soybeans, the most basic ingredient, have gone up in price. The owner worried that a sudden price rise would impose a burden on his regular customers, so he first put his purchase list on the wall to show how much his costs had increased.","words":[{"en":"impact","zh":"影響、衝擊"},{"en":"impose","zh":"強加；徵（稅）"},{"en":"inflation","zh":"通貨膨脹"},{"en":"ingredient","zh":"材料、成分"}]},{"id":"L4-I07","level":4,"letter":"I","n":7,"zh":"新人原本擔心沒人來看比賽，隊長卻向他暗示，那兩位受傷的學長已經在號召隊友來觀賽。包括兩名受傷學長在內，全隊都到場加油，新人直說令人難以置信。這也清楚顯示，那兩位學長在隊上有多大的影響力。","en":"The new player was worried that no one would come to watch the game, but the captain implied that the two injured seniors were already calling on teammates to come. The whole team, including the two injured seniors, came to cheer, and the new player said it was incredible. It was also a clear indication of how influential those two seniors are on the team.","words":[{"en":"imply","zh":"暗示、意味"},{"en":"including","zh":"包含、包括"},{"en":"incredible","zh":"難以置信的"},{"en":"indication","zh":"跡象、指示"},{"en":"influential","zh":"有影響力的"},{"en":"injure","zh":"使受傷"}]},{"id":"L4-I08","level":4,"letter":"I","n":8,"zh":"嬰兒感染後，醫院暫時把他和其他孩子隔離開來。在隔離期間，哥哥每天都帶著一張新畫來，請護理師貼在弟弟看得見的地方。","en":"After the infant got an infection, the hospital isolated him from the other children for a while. During his isolation, his brother brought a new drawing every day and asked the nurse to put it where the baby could see it.","words":[{"en":"infant","zh":"嬰兒"},{"en":"infection","zh":"感染"},{"en":"isolate","zh":"使隔離、使孤立"},{"en":"isolation","zh":"隔絕、孤立"}]},{"id":"L4-I09","level":4,"letter":"I","n":9,"zh":"工程師裝好自助借書機後，請我在初次檢查時照螢幕上的指示操作。我插入借書證、輸入密碼，才發現螢幕上列出的書名全是上一位讀者借的。","en":"After the engineer installed the self-service book machine, he asked me to follow the instructions on the screen during the initial inspection. I inserted my library card and input my password, and then I found that all the book titles on the screen had been borrowed by the last reader.","words":[{"en":"initial","zh":"開始的、最初的"},{"en":"input","zh":"輸入；意見"},{"en":"insert","zh":"插入"},{"en":"inspection","zh":"檢驗、檢查"},{"en":"install","zh":"安裝、安置"}]},{"id":"L4-I10","level":4,"letter":"I","n":10,"zh":"我們正在地面練習繩結時，攀岩教練過來檢查我們的進度。她指示我們拉緊繩子，並告訴我們，第一次站上高處時，人的第一個本能反應常是抓緊繩子。下課前我問清楚了，如果有人在練習中受傷，課程的保險會給付哪些費用。","en":"While we were practicing knots on the ground, the climbing instructor came to check our progress. She instructed us to pull the rope tight and told us that the first instinct of people standing up high for the first time is often to grab the rope. Before the class ended, I asked what the course's insurance would pay if someone was injured during practice.","words":[{"en":"injure","zh":"使受傷"},{"en":"instinct","zh":"本能、直覺"},{"en":"instruct","zh":"指示；教導"},{"en":"instructor","zh":"教練、講師"},{"en":"insurance","zh":"保險"}]},{"id":"L4-I11","level":4,"letter":"I","n":11,"zh":"阿傑在眾人面前提起只有親密朋友才知道的小名，我聽了覺得受到侮辱。他原本打算逗我開心，並無讓我難堪的意圖。知道我很難受後，他就親自來道歉。","en":"When A-Jie mentioned in front of everyone a nickname that only intimate friends knew, I felt insulted. He had intended to make me laugh and had no intention of embarrassing me. When he learned how upset I was, he came to apologize in person.","words":[{"en":"insult","zh":"侮辱"},{"en":"intend","zh":"計劃、打算"},{"en":"intention","zh":"意圖、目的"},{"en":"intimate","zh":"親密的、私人的"}]},{"id":"L4-I12","level":4,"letter":"I","n":12,"zh":"我們在科展上讓孩子跟人工智慧互動，觀察它如何回答他們的問題。大家都覺得設計這項活動是個智力上的挑戰，但最讓我們費心的，其實是怎麼讓每一次互動都充滿樂趣。","en":"At the science fair we let children interact with artificial intelligence and watched how it answered their questions. Everyone thought designing this activity was an intellectual challenge, but what took the most effort was making every interaction fun.","words":[{"en":"intellectual","zh":"智力的；知識分子"},{"en":"intelligence","zh":"智力、情報"},{"en":"interact","zh":"互動"},{"en":"interaction","zh":"互動"}]},{"id":"L4-I13","level":4,"letter":"I","n":13,"zh":"中級班的選手參加三天的密集訓練，第一天就感受到強烈的競爭壓力。教練發現原本跑在前頭的幾個人已經快跟不上了，便在第二天調低練習強度。","en":"The intermediate players joined three days of intensive training and felt the intense pressure of competition on the first day. The coach noticed that a few runners who had been in front could hardly keep up, so he lowered the intensity of practice on the second day.","words":[{"en":"intense","zh":"強烈的"},{"en":"intensity","zh":"強度"},{"en":"intensive","zh":"密集的"},{"en":"intermediate","zh":"中間的、中級的"}]},{"id":"L4-I14","level":4,"letter":"I","n":14,"zh":"我替來訪的作家口譯時，正跟她說故事的阿嬤忽然停了下來。直覺告訴我，這次中斷跟語言無關，所以我請家人先別干涉，讓阿嬤自己決定還要不要說下去。","en":"While I was interpreting for a visiting writer, Grandma, who was telling her a story, suddenly stopped. My intuition told me this interruption had nothing to do with language, so I asked my family not to interfere and let Grandma decide whether to go on.","words":[{"en":"interfere","zh":"干涉、妨礙"},{"en":"interpret","zh":"解釋；口譯"},{"en":"interruption","zh":"打擾、中斷"},{"en":"intuition","zh":"直覺、直覺的知識"}]},{"id":"L4-I15","level":4,"letter":"I","n":15,"zh":"外來的螞蟻入侵菜園後，阿姨才發現這場入侵已經波及整排育苗盆。鄰居給她看了一項新發明，可用來防止螞蟻爬上盆架。她決定先投資一組，等看過效果再買。","en":"After foreign ants invaded the vegetable garden, my aunt found that the invasion had spread to a whole row of seedling pots. A neighbor showed her a new invention that keeps ants from climbing onto the pot stands. She decided to invest in one set first and buy more after seeing how well it worked.","words":[{"en":"invade","zh":"入侵"},{"en":"invasion","zh":"入侵"},{"en":"invention","zh":"發明"},{"en":"invest(ment)","zh":"投資"}]},{"id":"L4-I16","level":4,"letter":"I","n":16,"zh":"最新一期校刊有一頁空白，編輯展開調查，才知道這件事牽涉到兩篇誤用舊版本的稿件。原作者主動參與核對之後，編輯部當天就發行了更正版。","en":"There was a blank page in the latest school magazine, so the editors started an investigation and found that the problem involved two articles that had used old versions by mistake. After the original writers offered to get involved in checking, the editors issued a corrected edition that same day.","words":[{"en":"investigation","zh":"調查"},{"en":"involve(ment)","zh":"牽涉、參與"},{"en":"issue","zh":"議題、問題；發行"}]},{"id":"L4-J01","level":4,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"同桌拿到最後一張演唱會門票時，我心裡一陣嫉妒。後來我才知道，她多排了兩個小時，是為了替坐輪椅的妹妹找到合適的位子。","en":"I felt a stab of jealousy when the classmate next to me got the last concert ticket. Later I learned that she had waited in line two extra hours to find a suitable seat for her sister, who uses a wheelchair.","words":[{"en":"jealousy","zh":"嫉妒"}]},{"id":"L4-K01","level":4,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"弟弟的觀察力很敏銳，一眼就發現放水壺的櫃子掉了顆螺絲。他跪下來，一手扶住櫃門上的圓形把手，一手把螺絲鎖回去。","en":"My brother has keen eyes and saw at a glance that a screw was missing from the cabinet where the kettle is kept. He knelt down, held the round knob on the cabinet door with one hand, and screwed the screw back in with the other.","words":[{"en":"keen","zh":"熱衷的；敏銳的"},{"en":"kettle","zh":"水壺"},{"en":"kneel","zh":"跪下"},{"en":"knob","zh":"（門、抽屜的）球形把手；旋鈕"}]},{"id":"L4-L01","level":4,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"我們發起校園菜園計畫後，整地的進度始終落後。這主要是因為我們原本低估了搬土需要多少體力勞動，後來連老師也加入了週末的工作行列。","en":"After we launched the campus garden project, our progress in clearing the land kept lagging behind. This was largely because we had underestimated how much physical labor moving soil would take, and later even the teacher joined the weekend work.","words":[{"en":"labor","zh":"勞動、勞工；分娩"},{"en":"lag","zh":"落後、延遲"},{"en":"largely","zh":"主要地、大部分"},{"en":"launch","zh":"發射；推出、發起"}]},{"id":"L4-L02","level":4,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"那位學識淵博的講師到學校演講時，帶來幾塊在紫外光下會發亮的礦石。演講一結束，我們就跟著她走進實驗室，看她如何在關燈之後辨認石頭。","en":"When the learned lecturer gave a lecture at our school, she brought some minerals that glow under ultraviolet light. As soon as the lecture ended, we followed her into the laboratory to see how she identified stones with the lights off.","words":[{"en":"laboratory/lab","zh":"實驗室"},{"en":"learned","zh":"有學問的"},{"en":"lecture","zh":"講課、演講；訓話"},{"en":"lecturer","zh":"講師"}]},{"id":"L4-L03","level":4,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"沿著河岸悠閒地散步時，我們看見一棵靠在石牆上的老榕樹。它是當地的地標，許多畫家畫這一帶的風景時都畫過它。阿公還說了一段與它有關的傳說。","en":"While taking a leisurely walk along the river, we saw an old banyan tree leaning against a stone wall. It is a local landmark, and many painters have included it in their landscapes of this area. Grandpa also told us a legend about it.","words":[{"en":"landmark","zh":"地標；里程碑"},{"en":"landscape","zh":"風景、景觀"},{"en":"lean","zh":"倚靠；傾斜；瘦的"},{"en":"legend","zh":"傳說；傳奇人物"},{"en":"leisurely","zh":"悠閒的、從容的"}]},{"id":"L4-L04","level":4,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"實習救生員先向主管確認，自己的執照有哪些限制。他把海灘地圖攤開來問，在哪些區域單獨執勤才合法，主管便把那些區域圈給他看。","en":"The trainee lifeguard first checked with his supervisor what limitations his license had. He spread out a map of the beach and asked in which areas it was lawful for him to work alone, and the supervisor circled those areas for him.","words":[{"en":"lawful","zh":"合法的"},{"en":"license","zh":"執照、許可證"},{"en":"lifeguard","zh":"救生員"},{"en":"limitation","zh":"限制、局限"}]},{"id":"L4-L05","level":4,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"圖書館員打算延長週五的開放時間，讓讀書會能讀完這部台灣文學作品。即使裡頭有些文學用語很難懂，大家還是捨不得跳過他們最喜歡的那一章。","en":"The librarian plans to lengthen the library's Friday hours so the book club can finish this work of Taiwanese literature. Even though some of the literary language is hard to understand, everyone was unwilling to skip their favorite chapter.","words":[{"en":"lengthen","zh":"加長"},{"en":"librarian","zh":"圖書館員"},{"en":"literary","zh":"文學的"},{"en":"literature","zh":"文學；文獻"}]},{"id":"L4-L06","level":4,"letter":"L","n":6,"zh":"姐姐把口紅掉在借來的亞麻桌巾上，一開始卻說那個紅印本來就在。她不願被朋友當成騙子，最後還是帶著洗好的桌巾去跟朋友說明經過。","en":"My sister dropped her lipstick on a borrowed linen tablecloth, but at first she said the red mark had been there before. She did not want her friend to see her as a liar, so in the end she brought the washed tablecloth back and explained what happened.","words":[{"en":"liar","zh":"說謊的人"},{"en":"linen","zh":"亞麻布；床單桌巾類"},{"en":"lipstick","zh":"口紅"}]},{"id":"L4-L07","level":4,"letter":"L","n":7,"zh":"阿姨用第一筆貸款買了水槽，讓客人自己挑活龍蝦。她還把叔叔釀的烈酒加進醬汁裡，客人吃完都想知道那股香氣是從哪裡來的。","en":"My aunt used her first loan to buy a water tank so customers could choose live lobsters themselves. She also added the liquor my uncle made to the sauce, and every customer wanted to know where that smell came from.","words":[{"en":"liquor","zh":"烈酒"},{"en":"loan","zh":"貸款；借出"},{"en":"lobster","zh":"龍蝦"}]},{"id":"L4-L08","level":4,"letter":"L","n":8,"zh":"偵探故事裡的管家雖然對主人很忠心，我還是請妹妹解釋她推論的邏輯：為什麼他的忠誠就能證明他是清白的？她重新讀了一遍管家的證詞，找到一個更合理的解釋。","en":"Although the butler in the detective story is very loyal to his master, I asked my sister to explain the logic of her reasoning: why does his loyalty prove he is innocent? She read the butler's statement again and found a more logical explanation.","words":[{"en":"logic","zh":"邏輯"},{"en":"logical","zh":"合乎邏輯的、合理的"},{"en":"loyal","zh":"忠誠的、忠實的"},{"en":"loyalty","zh":"忠貞、忠誠"}]},{"id":"L4-L09","level":4,"letter":"L","n":9,"zh":"我們擠在糟透了的旅館房間裡住了三晚，最後一天才搬進一家豪華飯店。我一鬆開鞋帶、躺上床，就發現光是能把雙腿伸直，竟然也是一種奢侈。","en":"We were squeezed into a lousy hotel room for three nights and only moved into a luxurious hotel on the last day. As soon as I loosened my shoelaces and lay on the bed, I found that even being able to stretch out my legs was a luxury.","words":[{"en":"loosen","zh":"鬆開"},{"en":"lousy","zh":"很糟的、差勁的"},{"en":"luxurious","zh":"豪華的"},{"en":"luxury","zh":"奢侈（品）"}]},{"id":"L4-M01","level":4,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"這家製造商用老機械製造自行車零件。修理機械的師傅指著操作手冊裡的圖，教我怎麼用有磁性的工具把掉進縫裡的螺絲吸出來。","en":"This manufacturer uses old machinery to manufacture bicycle parts. The mechanic who repairs the machines pointed at a picture in the manual and taught me how to use a magnetic tool to pull out a screw that had fallen into a gap.","words":[{"en":"machinery","zh":"機械"},{"en":"magnetic","zh":"有磁性的"},{"en":"manual","zh":"手冊；手動的"},{"en":"manufacture","zh":"製造"},{"en":"manufacturer","zh":"製造商"},{"en":"mechanic","zh":"技工、修車師傅"}]},{"id":"L4-M02","level":4,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"梳妝台亂成一團，她借我一面小鏡子，讓我在開演前把臉上的妝補好。當布幕升起，眼前那座壯麗的宮殿布景讓我忘了緊張，那也成了我最難忘的一次演出。","en":"The dressing table was messy, so she lent me a small mirror so I could fix my makeup before the show. When the curtain rose, the magnificent palace set in front of me made me forget my nerves, and it became my most memorable performance.","words":[{"en":"magnificent","zh":"壯麗的、極好的"},{"en":"makeup","zh":"化妝（品）；組成"},{"en":"memorable","zh":"難忘的"},{"en":"messy","zh":"凌亂的、髒亂的"}]},{"id":"L4-M03","level":4,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"爸爸報名馬拉松後，教練要他先用適中的速度跑，並用手錶監測自己的心跳。我問她每週里程增加的上限是多少，以及練了一個月，會有哪些能測量的進步。","en":"After Dad signed up for a marathon, the coach asked him to run at a moderate pace first and monitor his heart rate with his watch. I asked her what the maximum increase in weekly distance was and what measurable progress he would make after a month of training.","words":[{"en":"marathon","zh":"馬拉松"},{"en":"maximum","zh":"最大的；最大值"},{"en":"measurable","zh":"可測量的"},{"en":"moderate","zh":"適度的、中等的"},{"en":"monitor","zh":"監測；監視器"}]},{"id":"L4-M04","level":4,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"那位賣布的商人說，扣掉成本後，他賣布的利潤率只有百分之五。我問他到夜市擺攤有什麼好處，他說，客人可以當場摸摸布料再決定要不要買。","en":"The cloth merchant said that after costs, his profit margin was only five percent. When I asked him about the merit of setting up a stall at the night market, he said customers could feel the cloth on the spot before deciding whether to buy.","words":[{"en":"margin","zh":"頁邊空白；差距；利潤"},{"en":"merchant","zh":"商人"},{"en":"merit","zh":"優點"}]},{"id":"L4-M05","level":4,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"弟弟承認路牌是他調換的，原本只想出於淘氣逗同學玩，卻誤導了第一次來的客人。我原以為他想嫁禍給我，聽他向每個人解釋才知道自己誤會了他。願意回頭把客人帶到正確的地方，讓我看見了他的成熟。","en":"My brother admitted that he had switched the road signs. He only meant to play a trick on his classmates out of mischief, but he misled guests who were coming for the first time. I thought he was trying to blame me, but when I heard him explain to everyone, I realized I had misunderstood him. His willingness to go back and lead the guests to the right place showed me his maturity.","words":[{"en":"maturity","zh":"成熟"},{"en":"mischief","zh":"惡作劇、頑皮"},{"en":"mislead","zh":"誤導"}]},{"id":"L4-M06","level":4,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"公車技工在檢查煞車時發現了機械故障，立刻把車留在車庫。他告訴新同事，安全措施列的是最低要求，即使有人在等車，每一項也都得做到。","en":"While checking the brakes, the bus mechanic found a mechanical problem and kept the bus in the garage at once. He told his new colleague that the safety measures list only the minimum requirements, and every one must be done even if people are waiting for the bus.","words":[{"en":"measure(s)","zh":"測量；措施"},{"en":"mechanic","zh":"技工、修車師傅"},{"en":"mechanical","zh":"機械的"},{"en":"minimum","zh":"最小的；最低限度"}]},{"id":"L4-M07","level":4,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"山腳下的紀念碑上刻著當年罹難礦工的名字。紀念儀式開始時，弟弟早已把曾祖父的名字和那一行的位置背熟了，因為他想親自指給奶奶看。","en":"The names of the miners who died long ago are carved on the memorial at the foot of the mountain. When the memorial service began, my brother had already memorized our great-grandfather's name and where it was on the stone, because he wanted to point it out to Grandma himself.","words":[{"en":"measure(s)","zh":"測量；措施"},{"en":"memorial","zh":"紀念的；紀念碑"},{"en":"memorize","zh":"背起來、記住"},{"en":"miner","zh":"礦工"}]},{"id":"L4-M08","level":4,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"戲裡的送信人在途中遭遇不幸，過河時連行李都被沖走了。他渾身溼透，模樣十分淒慘，守城的士兵動了惻隱之心，讓他進來烘乾那封信。","en":"In the play, the messenger meets with misfortune on the way, and even his bag is washed away while he crosses the river. Soaking wet, he looked so miserable that the soldiers guarding the city showed mercy and let him in to dry the letter.","words":[{"en":"mercy","zh":"仁慈、憐憫"},{"en":"messenger","zh":"信差、使者"},{"en":"miserable","zh":"悲慘的、痛苦的"},{"en":"misfortune","zh":"不幸"}]},{"id":"L4-M09","level":4,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"老師以溫和的口氣問我，有沒有看見那塊礦物裡細細的裂紋。直到她把薄片放在顯微鏡下，我才發現裂紋從邊緣一路伸到了中央。","en":"In a mild voice, the teacher asked me if I could see the thin cracks in the mineral. Not until she put a thin slice under the microscope did I find that the cracks ran from the edge all the way to the center.","words":[{"en":"microscope","zh":"顯微鏡"},{"en":"mild","zh":"溫和的、輕微的"},{"en":"miner","zh":"礦工"},{"en":"mineral","zh":"礦物；礦物質"}]},{"id":"L4-M10","level":4,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"村裡有位百萬富翁出錢修復了河畔的磨坊，卻只請人掛上一塊樸素的小木牌。開幕那天，他把功勞全給了木工，連一向很少稱讚別人的爺爺都佩服他的謙遜。","en":"A millionaire in the village paid to restore the mill by the river but only asked for a modest little wooden sign. On the opening day, he gave all the credit to the carpenters, and even Grandpa, who seldom praises others, admired his modesty.","words":[{"en":"mill","zh":"磨坊、工廠"},{"en":"millionaire","zh":"百萬富翁"},{"en":"modest","zh":"謙虛的；不多的"},{"en":"modesty","zh":"謙虛"}]},{"id":"L4-M11","level":4,"letter":"M","n":11,"zh":"交通部收到多份陳情書後，部長親自搭上了那班即將停駛的公車。學生告訴他，這是放學後唯一能回家的車，此外，也有上晚班的人得靠它去工作。","en":"After the Ministry of Transportation received many letters, the minister himself rode the bus that was about to stop running. The students told him it was the only bus home after school. Moreover, people working night shifts depend on it to get to work.","words":[{"en":"minister","zh":"部長；牧師"},{"en":"ministry","zh":"（政府的）部"},{"en":"moreover","zh":"而且、此外"}]},{"id":"L4-M12","level":4,"letter":"M","n":12,"zh":"在那個多山的地區，只有騾子能馱著書走過雨後泥濘的小路。我問送書人，是什麼激勵他一次又一次上山，他說孩子在門前等他的模樣，就是他繼續走下去的動力。","en":"In that mountainous area, only mules can carry books along the muddy paths after rain. I asked the man who delivers the books what motivated him to go up the mountain again and again. He said the sight of the children waiting at their doors was his motivation to keep going.","words":[{"en":"motivate","zh":"激勵、給予動機"},{"en":"motivation","zh":"動機"},{"en":"mountainous","zh":"多山的"},{"en":"muddy","zh":"泥濘的"},{"en":"mule","zh":"騾子"}]},{"id":"L4-M13","level":4,"letter":"M","n":13,"zh":"小說裡的兩位偵探收到一封神祕的信，才發現他們正在追查同一名謀殺犯。雖然兩人仍對分工低聲抱怨，他們知道，只有相互信任才能查清寄信人的身分。","en":"The two detectives in the novel received a mysterious letter and found that they were chasing the same murderer. Although the two still murmured complaints about how they divided the work, they knew that only mutual trust could help them find out who sent the letter.","words":[{"en":"murderer","zh":"兇手"},{"en":"murmur","zh":"低聲說"},{"en":"mutual","zh":"互相的、共同的"},{"en":"mysterious","zh":"神祕的"}]},{"id":"L4-N01","level":4,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"這項補助開放給兩類有需要的人，也就是家裡付不起午餐費的學生和失去工作的家長。志工提醒我，若只憑國籍決定誰能申請，就會忽略一些真正貧困的家庭。","en":"This aid is open to two groups of needy people, namely students whose families cannot pay for lunch and parents who have lost their jobs. A volunteer reminded me that deciding who can apply by nationality alone would neglect some truly poor families.","words":[{"en":"namely","zh":"也就是"},{"en":"nationality","zh":"國籍"},{"en":"needy","zh":"貧困的"},{"en":"neglect","zh":"忽略、疏忽"}]},{"id":"L4-N02","level":4,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"有人提議把社區球場免費借給孩子練球，店主卻說這想法是胡說八道。大家都知道目標雖然崇高，租金仍得有人付。儘管如此，隊長還是去找店主協商，最後談成了只在週末借場地。","en":"Someone suggested lending the community court to the children for free, but the shop owner said the idea was nonsense. Everyone knew that although the goal was noble, someone still had to pay the rent. Nevertheless, the captain went to negotiate with the owner and finally got the court on weekends only.","words":[{"en":"negotiate","zh":"談判、協商"},{"en":"nevertheless","zh":"然而、儘管如此"},{"en":"noble","zh":"高貴的、高尚的"},{"en":"nonsense","zh":"胡說、無意義的話"}]},{"id":"L4-N03","level":4,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"阿姨說，她小時候讀到核能電廠事故的新聞後，連做了好幾夜惡夢。如今她拿出當年收藏的眾多剪報，讓我們看不同報紙怎麼記錄同一天的事。","en":"My aunt said that after reading news about an accident at a nuclear power plant when she was little, she had nightmares for several nights. Nowadays she takes out the numerous newspaper clippings she kept back then and shows us how different papers recorded the same day.","words":[{"en":"nightmare","zh":"惡夢"},{"en":"nowadays","zh":"現在、現今"},{"en":"nuclear","zh":"核能的、核子的"},{"en":"numerous","zh":"許多的"}]},{"id":"L4-N04","level":4,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"托兒所的孩子輪流幫忙洗菜，廚師再把洗好的菜煮進湯裡。我的妹妹原先挑食，現在卻會指著自己的碗，告訴我今天吃了哪些有營養的食物。","en":"The children at the nursery take turns helping wash the vegetables, and then the cook puts them in the soup. My little sister used to be a picky eater, but now she points at her bowl and tells me which nutritious foods she ate today.","words":[{"en":"nursery","zh":"托兒所；苗圃"},{"en":"nutritious","zh":"有營養的"}]},{"id":"L4-O01","level":4,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"訓練員問我們，如果一隻聽話的狗在路口拒絕前進，我們會不會提出異議。當她指向迎面轉彎的貨車，我才明白訓練的目標是讓人安全抵達，光靠服從還不夠。","en":"The trainer asked us whether we would raise an objection if an obedient dog refused to go forward at an intersection. When she pointed at a truck turning toward us, I understood that the objective of the training was to get people there safely, and obedience alone was not enough.","words":[{"en":"obedience","zh":"服從、順從"},{"en":"obedient","zh":"服從的、順從的"},{"en":"objection","zh":"反對"},{"en":"objective","zh":"目標；客觀的"}]},{"id":"L4-O02","level":4,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"我們獲得進入保護區的許可後，便開始記錄夜間的觀察結果。最大的障礙是樹叢太密，得靠偶爾傳來的叫聲，才能辨認躲在裡頭的鳥。","en":"After we obtained permission to enter the nature reserve, we began recording our night observations. The biggest obstacle was that the bushes were so thick that we had to rely on occasional calls to identify the birds hiding inside.","words":[{"en":"observation","zh":"觀察"},{"en":"obstacle","zh":"障礙"},{"en":"obtain","zh":"獲得"},{"en":"occasional","zh":"偶爾的"}]},{"id":"L4-O03","level":4,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"以前每逢表格上問到職業，外婆總是填「裁縫師」。她的縫紉機至今還占著閣樓裡最靠窗的位置，從那扇窗可以俯瞰市場。她以前一看見攤販收傘，就知道該下樓煮飯了。","en":"Whenever a form asked for her occupation, Grandma always wrote \\"tailor.\\" Her sewing machine still occupies the spot nearest the window in the attic, and from that window you can overlook the market. Whenever she saw the sellers closing their umbrellas, she knew it was time to go downstairs and cook.","words":[{"en":"occupation","zh":"職業；佔領"},{"en":"occupy","zh":"佔用、佔領"},{"en":"overlook","zh":"忽略；俯瞰"}]},{"id":"L4-O04","level":4,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"我擔心那句拿口音開玩笑的話會冒犯新同學，就在班刊送印前把它刪了。他後來說，自己當時並未覺得受冒犯，但也很高興我們願意思考，什麼樣的玩笑會讓人覺得無禮。","en":"I was worried that a joke about accents would offend the new student, so I deleted it before the class newsletter was printed. He later said he had not taken offense, but he was glad we were willing to think about what kinds of jokes people find offensive.","words":[{"en":"offend","zh":"冒犯；犯法"},{"en":"offense","zh":"犯罪；冒犯；進攻"},{"en":"offensive","zh":"冒犯人的；進攻的"}]},{"id":"L4-O05","level":4,"letter":"O","n":5,"zh":"新生訓練那天，我坐在管弦樂團後方，聽大家為下個月的歌劇排練。學姊告訴我，除了報名演奏，我還有另一個選擇，就是坐在台下替聽不清楚的歌詞做記號。","en":"On the day of orientation, I sat behind the orchestra and listened to them rehearse for next month's opera. A senior told me that besides signing up to play, I had another option: sitting in the audience and marking lyrics that were hard to hear.","words":[{"en":"opera","zh":"歌劇"},{"en":"option","zh":"選擇、選項"},{"en":"orchestra","zh":"管弦樂團"},{"en":"orientation","zh":"方向；新生訓練"}]},{"id":"L4-O06","level":4,"letter":"O","n":6,"zh":"劇中那位成了孤兒的小裁縫，原本只想找回父親的剪刀。當他得知國王下令禁止窮人進城，他才站出來反對，並和城裡的人一同推翻了國王的統治。","en":"In the play, the little tailor who became an orphan only wanted to get his father's scissors back. When he learned that the king had banned poor people from the city, he stood up to oppose him and joined the people of the city in overthrowing the king.","words":[{"en":"oppose","zh":"反對"},{"en":"orphan","zh":"孤兒"},{"en":"overthrow","zh":"推翻"}]},{"id":"L4-O07","level":4,"letter":"O","n":7,"zh":"弟弟把鐵絲彎成橢圓形，再讓一顆藍色珠子沿著它繞太陽運行。我提醒他接頭一定要夾緊，否則評審轉動模型時，珠子就會掉到地上。","en":"My brother bent a wire into an oval and made a blue bead orbit the sun along it. I reminded him that the joint must be clamped tight; otherwise, the bead would fall to the ground when the judges turned the model.","words":[{"en":"orbit","zh":"軌道"},{"en":"otherwise","zh":"否則；除此之外"},{"en":"oval","zh":"橢圓形的"}]},{"id":"L4-O08","level":4,"letter":"O","n":8,"zh":"比賽結果公布前，我摸到大衣口袋裡那張寫滿鼓勵的紙條。即使我當天未能克服上台的緊張，評審仍說我的劇本很傑出，希望明年能再看到我的作品。","en":"Before the results were announced, I felt the note full of encouragement in my overcoat pocket. Even though I did not overcome my nerves on stage that day, the judges said my script was outstanding and hoped to see my work again next year.","words":[{"en":"outstanding","zh":"傑出的"},{"en":"overcoat","zh":"大衣"},{"en":"overcome","zh":"克服"}]},{"id":"L4-O09","level":4,"letter":"O","n":9,"zh":"園丁讓幫浦運轉了一整夜，好讓空氣持續打進魚池裡。隔天早上我們測量水裡的氧氣含量時，他問我，這次的讀數跟他前一晚測得的數字相比有什麼變化。","en":"The gardener ran the pump overnight to keep pumping air into the fish pond. When we measured the oxygen level in the water the next morning, he asked me how the reading compared with the number he got the night before.","words":[{"en":"overnight","zh":"過夜的；一夜之間"},{"en":"oxygen","zh":"氧"}]},{"id":"L4-P01","level":4,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"降落傘一打開，我便看見岸邊的醫師正在等我們。著陸後，他先問我身體上有沒有不舒服，才放慢步伐，陪我走回休息區。","en":"As soon as my parachute opened, I saw the physician waiting for us on the shore. After we landed, he first asked if I felt any physical discomfort and then slowed his pace to walk with me back to the rest area.","words":[{"en":"pace","zh":"步調、速度"},{"en":"parachute","zh":"降落傘"},{"en":"physical","zh":"身體的；物理的"},{"en":"physician","zh":"醫師、內科醫師"}]},{"id":"L4-P02","level":4,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"我向專家小組做口頭簡報時，才發現投影幕上只顯示了地圖的一部分。幸好報告最後一段寫得很清楚，即使資訊不完整，聽眾也能知道洪水從哪裡流進村子。","en":"While giving my presentation to the panel of experts, I found that the screen only showed part of the map. Luckily, the last paragraph of my report was clear, so even with partial information, the audience could tell where the flood entered the village.","words":[{"en":"panel","zh":"面板；專家小組"},{"en":"paragraph","zh":"段落"},{"en":"partial","zh":"部分的；偏袒的"},{"en":"presentation","zh":"簡報、報告；呈現"}]},{"id":"L4-P03","level":4,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"以前我在同儕之間總是很被動，連討論校外教學都等別人先開口。直到我們班和隔壁班建立合作關係，我被推舉為主持人，才明白每個人的參與都能影響最後選定的路線。","en":"I used to be passive among my peers and always waited for others to speak first, even when we discussed field trips. When our class formed a partnership with the class next door and I was chosen as the host, I finally understood that everyone's participation could affect the route we chose.","words":[{"en":"participation","zh":"參與"},{"en":"partnership","zh":"合夥、夥伴關係"},{"en":"passive","zh":"被動的"},{"en":"peer","zh":"同儕、同輩；凝視"}]},{"id":"L4-P04","level":4,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"夏天正值產季，市場上的李子多得很，阿姨便切了一盤給來家裡吃飯的交換生。他也做了自己的拿手菜，把醃黃瓜切碎，拌進煮熟放涼的義大利麵裡。","en":"Summer is plum season, and plums were plentiful at the market, so my aunt cut up a plate for the exchange student who came to dinner. He also made his best dish, chopping pickles and mixing them into cooked, cooled pasta.","words":[{"en":"pasta","zh":"義大利麵"},{"en":"pickle","zh":"醃黃瓜、泡菜；醃"},{"en":"plentiful","zh":"豐富的"},{"en":"plum","zh":"李子"}]},{"id":"L4-P05","level":4,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"貓把一隻爪子伸進半掩的門，把地板上的瓶蓋撥到另一邊。我從門縫偷看，才知道那股奇特的氣味是從妹妹打翻的香水瓶裡飄出來的。","en":"The cat put one paw through the half-open door and pushed a bottle cap on the floor to the other side. When I peeped through the gap, I learned that the peculiar smell came from the bottle of perfume my sister had knocked over.","words":[{"en":"paw","zh":"（動物的）腳掌"},{"en":"peculiar","zh":"奇怪的、特有的"},{"en":"peep","zh":"偷看"},{"en":"perfume","zh":"香水"}]},{"id":"L4-P06","level":4,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"在已填答問卷的居民中，百分之六十贊成對無證占用無障礙車位的人提高罰款。記者問，參加抗議的人占全體居民的百分比是多少，里長說他還在等最後兩條街的回覆。","en":"Among the residents who answered the survey, sixty percent supported a higher penalty for people who park in disabled parking spaces without a permit. A reporter asked what percentage of all residents took part in the protest, and the neighborhood chief said he was still waiting for replies from the last two streets.","words":[{"en":"penalty","zh":"處罰、罰款"},{"en":"percent","zh":"百分之……"},{"en":"percentage","zh":"百分比"},{"en":"protest","zh":"抗議、反對"}]},{"id":"L4-P07","level":4,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"提琴師把琴身擦亮後，用可攜式燈具照著琴面，直到最細的刮痕也看得清楚。我以為他在追求完美，他卻指著一道淺痕說，那是祖父練琴留下的，應當保留。","en":"After polishing the violin, the violin maker shone a portable lamp on it until even the finest scratch could be seen. I thought he was pursuing perfection, but he pointed at a light scratch and said it was left by his grandfather's practice and should be kept.","words":[{"en":"perfection","zh":"完美"},{"en":"polish","zh":"擦亮；亮光劑"},{"en":"portable","zh":"可攜帶的"},{"en":"pursue","zh":"追求、追趕"}]},{"id":"L4-P08","level":4,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"原本我很悲觀，以為臨時雨棚一拆，等公車的人又得淋雨了。居民再三勸說，還提出一份很有說服力的乘車人數調查，公所這才同意興建永久的候車亭。","en":"At first I was pessimistic and thought that once the temporary rain shelter was taken down, people waiting for the bus would get wet again. After residents' repeated persuasion and a persuasive survey of the number of riders, the town office agreed to build a permanent bus shelter.","words":[{"en":"permanent","zh":"永久的"},{"en":"persuasion","zh":"說服"},{"en":"persuasive","zh":"有說服力的"},{"en":"pessimistic","zh":"悲觀的"}]},{"id":"L4-P09","level":4,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"菜園裡的葉子一夜之間多了好多小洞，老師問我們怎麼解釋這個現象。我翻過葉片找到害蟲後，她才帶我們架起防蟲網，說預防蟲害可以從這裡做起，毋須在校園裡使用有毒的藥劑。","en":"Overnight, the leaves in the vegetable garden got many small holes, and the teacher asked us how to explain this phenomenon. After I turned over a leaf and found the pests, she helped us put up insect nets and said pest prevention could start here, without using poisonous chemicals on campus.","words":[{"en":"pest","zh":"害蟲；討厭的人"},{"en":"phenomenon","zh":"現象"},{"en":"poisonous","zh":"有毒的、惡毒的"},{"en":"prevention","zh":"預防"}]},{"id":"L4-P10","level":4,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"讀書會上，一位研究哲學的學姊講起古代哲學家提出的問題。當她問我們人數不同的兩桌該怎麼分一塊蛋糕，原本抽象的哲學問題突然變得很切身。","en":"At the book club, a senior who studies philosophy talked about questions raised by ancient philosophers. When she asked us how two tables with different numbers of people should share one cake, the abstract philosophical question suddenly felt very personal.","words":[{"en":"philosopher","zh":"哲學家"},{"en":"philosophical","zh":"哲學的"},{"en":"philosophy","zh":"哲學"}]},{"id":"L4-P11","level":4,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"物理課結束後，那位來訪的物理學家留下來陪我們看幾張早期照片。她說，這些攝影術的先驅得先弄清楚每張照片要曝光多久，才能拍下如今掛在牆上的街景。","en":"After physics class, the visiting physicist stayed to look at some early photos with us. She said these pioneers of photography first had to work out how long each photo needed to be exposed before they could capture the street scenes now hanging on the wall.","words":[{"en":"photography","zh":"攝影"},{"en":"physicist","zh":"物理學家"},{"en":"physics","zh":"物理學"},{"en":"pioneer","zh":"先驅、拓荒者"}]},{"id":"L4-P12","level":4,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"社區劇團請附近的水管工來飾演一位密謀偷走珠寶的守衛。我原先擔心他會忘詞，直到他用一個眼神刻畫出守衛的貪心，才發現他很有演戲的潛力。","en":"The community theater asked a plumber nearby to play a guard who plots to steal jewels. I was worried he would forget his lines, until he portrayed the guard's greed with a single look, and I saw that he had real potential as an actor.","words":[{"en":"plot","zh":"情節；陰謀；小塊地"},{"en":"plumber","zh":"水管工人"},{"en":"portray","zh":"描繪"},{"en":"potential","zh":"潛在的；潛力"}]},{"id":"L4-P13","level":4,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"這套漫畫越來越受歡迎，朋友聽說我擁有第一冊，便寫信向我借。他說願意負擔來回郵資，因為他知道，那是我最珍惜的一件私人物品。","en":"This comic series is getting more and more popular. When my friend heard that I possess the first volume, he wrote to ask if he could borrow it. He said he was willing to pay the postage both ways because he knew it was my most treasured possession.","words":[{"en":"possess","zh":"擁有"},{"en":"possession","zh":"擁有；所有物"},{"en":"postage","zh":"郵資"}]},{"id":"L4-P14","level":4,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"球賽開始前，姐姐要我預測第一滴雨會在幾點落下。我的預測離實際時間差了十分鐘，她卻笑著說，只憑遠方的一朵雲，很難說出精確的時間。","en":"Before the game, my sister asked me to predict what time the first drop of rain would fall. My prediction was ten minutes off, but she laughed and said it was hard to give a precise time based only on a distant cloud.","words":[{"en":"precise","zh":"精確的"},{"en":"predict","zh":"預測"},{"en":"prediction","zh":"預測"}]},{"id":"L4-P15","level":4,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"懷孕的姊姊回家吃飯時，媽媽準備了她喜歡的豆腐和蛋。姊姊告訴我，這兩樣食物都含有蛋白質，還翻開手冊給我看她在懷孕期間寫下的飲食紀錄。","en":"When my pregnant sister came home for dinner, Mom made the tofu and eggs she likes. My sister told me both foods contain protein and opened her notebook to show me the food records she kept during her pregnancy.","words":[{"en":"pregnancy","zh":"懷孕"},{"en":"pregnant","zh":"懷孕的"},{"en":"protein","zh":"蛋白質"}]},{"id":"L4-P16","level":4,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"導覽員指著幾件原始的石器，說這間展室最重要的任務，是讓這些工具能被完整保存。我問他文物保存還有哪些工作，他便打開櫃門，讓我們看見記錄濕度的小儀器。","en":"The guide pointed at some primitive stone tools and said the main job of this room was to make sure these tools could be preserved whole. When I asked what other work preservation involved, he opened a cabinet to show us a small device that records humidity.","words":[{"en":"preservation","zh":"保存、保護"},{"en":"preserve","zh":"保存、保護"},{"en":"primitive","zh":"原始的"}]},{"id":"L4-P17","level":4,"letter":"P","n":17,"zh":"我到診所實習的第一天，護理長先教我報到的程序。她說病人的隱私要擺在優先位置，穿上制服也沒有自由進出診間的特權。等病人同意後，我才開始記錄。","en":"On my first day of training at the clinic, the head nurse taught me the check-in procedure. She said patients' privacy must be a priority, and wearing a uniform did not give me the privilege of going in and out of exam rooms freely. Only after the patient agreed did I proceed to take notes.","words":[{"en":"priority","zh":"優先（事項）"},{"en":"privacy","zh":"隱私"},{"en":"privilege","zh":"特權；榮幸"},{"en":"procedure","zh":"程序、步驟"},{"en":"proceed","zh":"繼續進行"}]},{"id":"L4-P18","level":4,"letter":"P","n":18,"zh":"烘焙是叔叔選擇的職業，成為專業烘焙師之後，他仍每天和學徒一起揉麵。他重新安排烤爐的使用順序，讓早班的生產效率提高，也讓原本虧本的店有利可圖。他因此獲得了升遷。","en":"Baking is the profession my uncle chose, and after becoming a professional baker, he still kneads dough with his apprentices every day. He rearranged the order of using the ovens, which made the morning shift more productive and turned the shop, which had been losing money, profitable. As a result, he got a promotion.","words":[{"en":"productive","zh":"有生產力的、多產的"},{"en":"profession","zh":"（專門）職業"},{"en":"professional","zh":"專業的、職業的"},{"en":"profitable","zh":"有利潤的、賺錢的"},{"en":"promotion","zh":"升遷；促銷"}]},{"id":"L4-P19","level":4,"letter":"P","n":19,"zh":"來訪的知名主播請那位很有前途的學生念一段新聞稿。每當他卡在一個地名的發音，她就把第一個音寫在板子上提示他，讓他自己把句子念完。","en":"The famous news anchor visiting our school asked a promising student to read a news report. Whenever he got stuck on the pronunciation of a place name, she wrote the first sound on a board as a prompt and let him finish the sentence by himself.","words":[{"en":"promising","zh":"有前途的"},{"en":"prompt","zh":"迅速的；促使"},{"en":"pronunciation","zh":"發音"}]},{"id":"L4-P20","level":4,"letter":"P","n":20,"zh":"從前這是個繁榮的港口，魚市場的興旺養活了整條街。幾個回鄉青年提出讓閒置攤位成為共用廚房的計畫，希望市場能再次繁榮起來。","en":"This used to be a prosperous port, and the prosperity of the fish market supported the whole street. Some young people who came back home made a proposal to turn the empty stalls into a shared kitchen, hoping the market would prosper again.","words":[{"en":"proposal","zh":"提議、提案；求婚"},{"en":"prosper","zh":"繁榮"},{"en":"prosperity","zh":"繁榮"},{"en":"prosperous","zh":"繁榮的"}]},{"id":"L4-P21","level":4,"letter":"P","n":21,"zh":"來學校演講的心理學家問隊長，當全場都等他投最後一球時，他會感受到什麼心理壓力。那天我才發現，研究心理學也能從籃球場上一個短短的瞬間開始。","en":"The psychologist who came to give a talk asked our captain what psychological pressure he felt when everyone was waiting for him to take the last shot. That day I realized that studying psychology can start from one short moment on a basketball court.","words":[{"en":"psychological","zh":"心理的"},{"en":"psychologist","zh":"心理學家"},{"en":"psychology","zh":"心理學"}]},{"id":"L4-P22","level":4,"letter":"P","n":22,"zh":"地方誌快要出版時，編輯請我們核對受訪者的姓名。等我們把每個名字都核對過，出版商才答應出書。我們沒有經費做宣傳，只好到書裡寫到的每一家店，親手貼上海報。","en":"When the local history book was about to be published, the editor asked us to check the names of the people interviewed. Only after we had checked every name did the publisher agree to publish it. We had no money for publicity, so we went to every shop mentioned in the book and put up posters ourselves.","words":[{"en":"publicity","zh":"宣傳、知名度"},{"en":"publish","zh":"出版、發表"},{"en":"publisher","zh":"出版社、出版商"}]},{"id":"L4-P23","level":4,"letter":"P","n":23,"zh":"電影裡，警察騎上腳踏車追趕那個抱走畫框的男人。這場追逐在三條街外結束，這時警察才知道，畫框裡夾著一封他急著送回去給家人的信。","en":"In the movie, a police officer jumped on a bike to pursue the man who ran off with a picture frame. The pursuit ended three streets away, and only then did the officer learn that there was a letter in the frame that the man was hurrying to take back to his family.","words":[{"en":"pursue","zh":"追求、追趕"},{"en":"pursuit","zh":"追求"}]},{"id":"L4-Q01","level":4,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"姊姊和我為了誰能帶走外婆縫的被子吵了一架。後來我們讀到媽媽抄在卡片上的一段引文，出自外婆的日記，才知道外婆早就決定把被子留給快出生的小表妹。","en":"My sister and I had a quarrel over who could take the quilt Grandma had sewn. Later we read a quotation from Grandma's diary that Mom had copied onto a card, and we learned that Grandma had long ago decided to leave the quilt to our little cousin who was about to be born.","words":[{"en":"quarrel","zh":"吵架"},{"en":"quilt","zh":"棉被"},{"en":"quotation","zh":"引文；報價"}]},{"id":"L4-R01","level":4,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"暴風雨在山區肆虐，管理員看了雷達圖，說得等降雨量減少以後才能下山。我們把僅剩的燕麥煮成一鍋粥，再把口袋裡那包葡萄乾分給大家。","en":"The storm was raging in the mountains. The ranger looked at the radar map and said we could not go down until the rainfall decreased. We cooked the last of the oats into a pot of porridge and shared the bag of raisins from my pocket with everyone.","words":[{"en":"radar","zh":"雷達"},{"en":"rage","zh":"盛怒"},{"en":"rainfall","zh":"降雨量"},{"en":"raisin","zh":"葡萄乾"}]},{"id":"L4-R02","level":4,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"我想把外婆得過獎的食譜換算成一人份。她起初不情願，嚐過成品之後才改變心意。她評論說，對獨居的人來說，做一人份更切合實際，而且味道好得出奇。","en":"I wanted to change Grandma's prize-winning recipe into one serving. She was reluctant at first but changed her mind after tasting it. She remarked that cooking for one is more realistic for people who live alone, and it tasted remarkably good.","words":[{"en":"realistic","zh":"實際的；逼真的"},{"en":"recipe","zh":"食譜"},{"en":"reluctant","zh":"不情願的"},{"en":"remark","zh":"評論、言論"},{"en":"remarkable","zh":"出色的、值得注意的"}]},{"id":"L4-R03","level":4,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"歷史劇裡，年輕的農夫為了反抗國王而加入革命。飾演革命者的同學讀過農夫的信才明白，當初為什麼連最溫和的土地改革都遭到貴族的抵制。","en":"In the history play, a young farmer joins the revolution to rebel against the king. After reading the farmer's letters, the classmate playing the revolutionary understood why even the mildest land reform met with resistance from the nobles.","words":[{"en":"rebel","zh":"反抗者；反抗"},{"en":"reform","zh":"改革"},{"en":"resistance","zh":"抵抗（力）"},{"en":"revolution","zh":"革命"},{"en":"revolutionary","zh":"革命的、革命性的"}]},{"id":"L4-R04","level":4,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"在同學會的接待處，一位老同學拿畢業照給我看。他指著照片裡並肩站著的我們，我才想起他的名字。我叫出他的名字，他一看我認出他了，就笑了。","en":"At the reception desk of the class reunion, an old classmate showed me our graduation photo. He pointed at the two of us standing side by side, and then I recalled his name. When I said his name, he smiled at the recognition.","words":[{"en":"recall","zh":"回想；召回"},{"en":"reception","zh":"接待（處）；歡迎會；收訊"},{"en":"recognition","zh":"認出；認可、表揚"},{"en":"reunion","zh":"團聚、同學會"}]},{"id":"L4-R05","level":4,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"哥哥養傷期間最愛的消遣，是坐在門口跟鄰居下棋。醫師說，短程散步有助於減輕哥哥的煩悶，於是我們開始到公園散步放鬆心情。","en":"While my brother was recovering from his injury, his favorite recreation was playing chess with the neighbors at the door. The doctor said short walks would help relieve his boredom and aid his recovery, so we started walking in the park for relaxation.","words":[{"en":"recovery","zh":"恢復、復原"},{"en":"recreation","zh":"娛樂、休閒"},{"en":"relaxation","zh":"放鬆"},{"en":"relieve","zh":"減輕、緩解"}]},{"id":"L4-R06","level":4,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"為了規範攤販使用一次性杯子的方式，主辦單位訂了一條新規定，要求攤販回收自己發出去的杯子。活動結束後，清潔隊統計了垃圾量的減少幅度，才決定明年要準備多少垃圾車。","en":"To regulate how vendors use disposable cups, the organizers made a new regulation requiring vendors to recycle the cups they hand out. After the event, the cleaning team measured the reduction in trash before deciding how many garbage trucks to prepare next year.","words":[{"en":"recycle","zh":"回收"},{"en":"reduction","zh":"減少"},{"en":"regulate","zh":"管理、調節"},{"en":"regulation","zh":"規定；管理"}]},{"id":"L4-R07","level":4,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"一位研究員到班上談他對河床的研究，請我們參考他拍的照片。我的報告原本列了十篇參考文獻，聽完他解釋石頭如何移動之後，我只留下與問題有關的三篇。","en":"A researcher came to our class to talk about his research on riverbeds and asked us to refer to the photos he had taken. My report originally listed ten references, but after he explained how stones move, I only kept the three that were relevant to my question.","words":[{"en":"refer","zh":"提到；參考；轉介"},{"en":"reference","zh":"參考；提及"},{"en":"relevant","zh":"相關的"},{"en":"research","zh":"研究"},{"en":"researcher","zh":"研究人員"}]},{"id":"L4-R08","level":4,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"傍晚的水面映照著生鏽的水塔，水中的倒影長得很像一座古堡。妹妹一直問對岸為什麼沒有城門，我便帶她繞過橋，看看塔底的水管。","en":"In the evening, the water reflected the rusty water tower, and the reflection resembled an old castle. My sister kept asking why there was no gate on the other side, so I took her across the bridge to look at the pipes at the bottom of the tower.","words":[{"en":"reflect","zh":"反射、反映"},{"en":"reflection","zh":"反映、沉思"},{"en":"resemble","zh":"像、類似"},{"en":"rusty","zh":"生鏽的；生疏的"}]},{"id":"L4-R09","level":4,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"訪談前，我們先討論難民家庭在展覽中是否有足夠的代表發聲。一位長年從事新聞工作、深受敬重的長者告訴我們，無論有多想知道別人如何離開家鄉，都要用尊重的口氣詢問，讓對方決定要說多少。","en":"Before the interviews, we discussed whether refugee families had enough representation in the exhibition. A respectable elder who had worked in news for many years told us that no matter how much we wanted to know how people left their homes, we must ask in a respectful way and let them decide how much to say.","words":[{"en":"refugee","zh":"難民"},{"en":"representation","zh":"代表；表現"},{"en":"respectable","zh":"值得尊敬的、體面的"},{"en":"respectful","zh":"恭敬的"}]},{"id":"L4-R10","level":4,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"我在網路上報名路跑時被扣了兩次款，便寫信給主辦單位詢問退費的事。起初他們拒絕退款，直到我提出只有一筆報名紀錄的證明，他們才退還多收的費用。","en":"When I registered for a road race online, I was charged twice, so I wrote to the organizers about a refund. At first they refused, but after I showed proof that there was only one registration, they returned the extra money.","words":[{"en":"refund","zh":"退款"},{"en":"register","zh":"註冊、登記"},{"en":"registration","zh":"註冊、登記"}]},{"id":"L4-R11","level":4,"letter":"R","n":11,"zh":"我向館員詢問借書申請被退回的原因，他說是因為我的借書證過期了。只要我今天辦理續證，系統就會解除借書限制，還能保留我排了兩個月的預約順位。","en":"I asked the librarian the reason for the rejection of my request to borrow a book, and he said it was because my library card had expired. If I renew it today, the system will lift the restriction and I can retain the reservation I had waited two months for.","words":[{"en":"rejection","zh":"拒絕"},{"en":"renew","zh":"更新、續期"},{"en":"reservation","zh":"預約、訂位；保留"},{"en":"restriction","zh":"限制"},{"en":"retain","zh":"保留、保持"}]},{"id":"L4-R12","level":4,"letter":"R","n":12,"zh":"我們試聽完廣播劇，才發現同一句台詞的重複讓人分不清誰在說話。為了補救這個問題，我修改了劇本，這次修訂也讓兩個角色各有自己的說話方式。","en":"After listening to a test recording of our radio play, we found that the repetition of the same line made it hard to tell who was speaking. To remedy this problem, I revised the script, and this revision also gave the two characters their own ways of speaking.","words":[{"en":"remedy","zh":"療法、補救辦法"},{"en":"repetition","zh":"重複"},{"en":"revise","zh":"修改、修訂"},{"en":"revision","zh":"修改、修訂"}]},{"id":"L4-R13","level":4,"letter":"R","n":13,"zh":"隊長宣布要辭職時，大家都以為是因為球隊的名聲受了影響。讀完他的辭職信，我們才知道他的新年決心是多花點時間陪爸爸，副隊長也答應幫忙解決交接的問題。","en":"When the captain announced that he would resign, everyone thought it was because the team's reputation had been hurt. After reading his resignation letter, we learned that his New Year's resolution was to spend more time with his father, and the vice captain promised to help resolve the problems of handing over his duties.","words":[{"en":"reputation","zh":"名聲"},{"en":"resign","zh":"辭職"},{"en":"resignation","zh":"辭職（信）"},{"en":"resolution","zh":"決心、決議；解析度"},{"en":"resolve","zh":"解決；下定決心"}]},{"id":"L4-R14","level":4,"letter":"R","n":14,"zh":"通往山村的唯一道路被水淹沒後，救援隊改走一條穿過果園的路線進村。溪水上漲時，隊長下令撤退，交代大家等無線電通訊恢復後再出發。","en":"After the only road to the mountain village flooded, the rescue team took a route through an orchard into the village. When the stream rose, the leader ordered a retreat and told everyone to wait until radio contact was restored before setting off again.","words":[{"en":"rescue","zh":"救援"},{"en":"restore","zh":"恢復、修復"},{"en":"retreat","zh":"撤退"},{"en":"route","zh":"路線"}]},{"id":"L4-R15","level":4,"letter":"R","n":15,"zh":"老師退休那天，我們在她最喜歡的餐廳訂了位。她說，看著以前連菜都不敢點的學生替全班張羅晚餐，是她教書多年最好的回報。","en":"On the day our teacher retired, we made a reservation at her favorite restaurant. She said seeing a student who used to be too shy to order food plan dinner for the whole class was the best reward of her many years of teaching.","words":[{"en":"reservation","zh":"預約、訂位；保留"},{"en":"retire(ment)","zh":"退休"},{"en":"reward","zh":"獎賞、報酬"}]},{"id":"L4-R16","level":4,"letter":"R","n":16,"zh":"妹妹想借愛情小說，我卻替她拿了一本講述強盜如何向宿敵報仇的故事。我原以為這個失誤毀了她的假期，沒想到她一口氣讀完，還搶在我前面借了續集。","en":"My sister wanted to borrow a romance novel, but I got her a story about how a robber takes revenge on his old enemy. I thought my mistake had ruined her vacation, but she finished it in one go and even borrowed the sequel before I could.","words":[{"en":"revenge","zh":"報仇、復仇"},{"en":"robber","zh":"強盜、搶匪"},{"en":"romance","zh":"戀情、浪漫"},{"en":"ruin","zh":"毀壞；廢墟"}]},{"id":"L4-R17","level":4,"letter":"R","n":17,"zh":"校慶時，學姐把謎語唱了出來，讓我們跟著鼓的節奏拍手。聽到最後兩句押韻，我才猜出她故意藏起來的那個字。","en":"At the school fair, a senior sang a riddle and had us clap along to the rhythm of the drum. When I heard the last two lines rhyme, I finally guessed the word she had hidden.","words":[{"en":"rhyme","zh":"押韻"},{"en":"rhythm","zh":"節奏"},{"en":"riddle","zh":"謎語"}]},{"id":"L4-S01","level":4,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"為了看一顆衛星劃過天空，我們犧牲了幾個小時的睡眠，看完才出發觀光。山路上幾乎看不清風景，直到太陽升起，整片山坡的茶樹才出現在我們眼前。","en":"To watch a satellite cross the sky, we sacrificed a few hours of sleep before going sightseeing. We could scarcely see the scenery on the mountain road until the sun rose and the tea bushes on the whole hillside appeared in front of us.","words":[{"en":"sacrifice","zh":"犧牲"},{"en":"satellite","zh":"人造衛星"},{"en":"scarcely","zh":"幾乎不"},{"en":"scenery","zh":"風景、景色"},{"en":"sightseeing","zh":"觀光"}]},{"id":"L4-S02","level":4,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"弟弟用勺子挖出最後一球冰淇淋時，不小心用勺柄在木桌上留下一道刮痕。爸爸沒有責罵他，只遞給他桌墊；看著弟弟自己收拾好餐桌，爸爸也露出了滿足的笑容。","en":"When my brother scooped out the last ball of ice cream, he accidentally made a scratch on the wooden table with the handle of the scoop. Dad did not scold him but handed him a table mat. Watching my brother clean the table himself, Dad smiled with satisfaction.","words":[{"en":"satisfaction","zh":"滿意、滿足"},{"en":"scold","zh":"責罵"},{"en":"scoop","zh":"勺子；舀"},{"en":"scratch","zh":"抓、刮；抓痕"}]},{"id":"L4-S03","level":4,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"展場裡的木雕一開始搖晃，我就抓住底座，請旁邊的工作人員扶住另一頭。等底座被牢牢固定之後，大家才鬆手。","en":"As soon as the wooden sculpture at the exhibition began to shake, I seized the base and asked a staff member nearby to hold the other end. Everyone let go only after the base was firmly secured.","words":[{"en":"sculpture","zh":"雕塑（品）"},{"en":"secure","zh":"安全的；獲得；固定"},{"en":"seize","zh":"抓住、奪取"}]},{"id":"L4-S04","level":4,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"村史展標出了第一批開拓者挖井的地點。嚮導領我們走到樹蔭下，說當年暴風雨最嚴重的那一晚，井旁的小屋成了十多個人的避難所。","en":"The village history exhibition marked the site where the first settlers dug a well. The guide led us into the shade and said that on the night of the most severe storm, the hut beside the well became a shelter for more than ten people.","words":[{"en":"settler","zh":"移民、開拓者"},{"en":"severe","zh":"嚴重的；嚴厲的"},{"en":"shade","zh":"陰涼處；色調"},{"en":"shelter","zh":"避難所；遮蔽"},{"en":"site","zh":"地點；網站"}]},{"id":"L4-S05","level":4,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"哥哥答應飾演海盜船長之後，整整兩個星期沒有刮鬍子。我替他在一雙長筒襪上縫了紅色條紋，他穿上之後，連來送便當的爸爸都認不出他。","en":"After my brother agreed to play a pirate captain, he did not shave for two whole weeks. I sewed red stripes on a pair of long stockings for him, and when he put them on, even Dad, who came to bring him lunch, did not recognize him.","words":[{"en":"sew","zh":"縫"},{"en":"shave","zh":"刮（鬍子）"},{"en":"stocking(s)","zh":"長襪"},{"en":"stripe","zh":"斑紋、條紋"}]},{"id":"L4-S06","level":4,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"看到自己的簽名被印在海報上，插畫家開始懷疑那位名聲不好的經紀人。她拿出當初的合約，說擅自用別人的名字賣畫很可恥，並決定提告。","en":"When the illustrator saw her signature printed on a poster, she became suspicious of the agent with a bad reputation. She took out the original contract and said it was shameful to sell paintings using someone else's name without permission, and she decided to sue.","words":[{"en":"shameful","zh":"可恥的、丟臉的"},{"en":"signature","zh":"簽名"},{"en":"statistic(s)","zh":"統計數據；統計學"},{"en":"stocking(s)","zh":"長襪"},{"en":"sue","zh":"控告、起訴"},{"en":"suspicious","zh":"可疑的；多疑的"}]},{"id":"L4-S07","level":4,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"老師請我把畫板往左移，好讓兩棟摩天大樓之間的窄巷出現在畫面裡。我才在素描上添了一筆，就明白她為什麼要我換個位置了。","en":"The teacher asked me to move my drawing board to the left so the narrow alley between the two skyscrapers would be in the picture. As soon as I added one line to my sketch, I understood why she wanted me to change my position.","words":[{"en":"sketch","zh":"素描、草圖"},{"en":"skyscraper","zh":"摩天大樓"}]},{"id":"L4-S08","level":4,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"校隊把「慢一點也能跑完全程」選為今年的口號。隊長剛從輕傷中康復，他說這句話對他有精神上的意義，因為它讓他想起每場比賽前都會做的禱告。","en":"The school team chose \\"Slower is fine as long as you finish\\" as this year's slogan. The captain had just recovered from a slight injury, and he said the slogan had spiritual significance for him because it reminded him of the prayer he says before every race.","words":[{"en":"significance","zh":"重要性、意義"},{"en":"slight","zh":"輕微的"},{"en":"slogan","zh":"口號、標語"},{"en":"spiritual","zh":"心靈的、精神的"},{"en":"statistic(s)","zh":"統計數據；統計學"},{"en":"stocking(s)","zh":"長襪"}]},{"id":"L4-S09","level":4,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"隊友心愛的狗過世了。我想寫信表達同情，卻怕自己的話聽起來只是客套。一位體貼的學姐建議我，當面告訴他那隻狗曾經怎麼陪我度過難關。我照著她的建議做，希望他能感受到我的誠意。","en":"My teammate's beloved dog died. I wanted to write to express my sympathy, but I was afraid my words would sound like mere politeness. A sympathetic senior suggested that I tell him in person how the dog had helped me through hard times. I followed her suggestion, hoping he could feel my sincerity.","words":[{"en":"sincerity","zh":"真誠"},{"en":"statistic(s)","zh":"統計數據；統計學"},{"en":"stocking(s)","zh":"長襪"},{"en":"suggestion","zh":"建議"},{"en":"sympathetic","zh":"有同情心的"},{"en":"sympathy","zh":"同情"}]},{"id":"L4-S10","level":4,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"英文老師教我們用有系統的方法整理字卡。我們先按音節數分類，再從名詞裡挑出單數形式。下課前，每組都要用一句話概述自己發現的規律。","en":"Our English teacher taught us a systematic way to organize word cards. We first sorted them by the number of syllables and then picked out the singular forms of the nouns. Before class ended, each group had to summarize the pattern it had found in one sentence.","words":[{"en":"singular","zh":"單數的；非凡的"},{"en":"summarize","zh":"概述、總結"},{"en":"syllable","zh":"音節"},{"en":"systematic","zh":"有系統的"}]},{"id":"L4-S11","level":4,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"科展開始前，牆上的插座突然冒出火花，老師請我們先切斷電源。我們改用太陽能充電板替電腦供電，才得以向評審展示自己寫的軟體。","en":"Before the science fair began, sparks suddenly came out of the socket on the wall, and the teacher asked us to cut the power first. We used solar charging panels to power the computer instead, so we could still show the judges the software we wrote.","words":[{"en":"socket","zh":"插座"},{"en":"software","zh":"軟體"},{"en":"solar","zh":"太陽的"},{"en":"spark","zh":"火花、火星"}]},{"id":"L4-S12","level":4,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"阿公遞給我一把備用的鏟子，讓我把菜苗移到比較深的箱子裡。他提醒我，土要撒在根部四周，免得把柔軟的莖壓彎。","en":"Grandpa handed me a spare spade so I could move the young plants into a deeper box. He reminded me to sprinkle the soil around the roots so I would not bend the soft stems.","words":[{"en":"spade","zh":"鏟子"},{"en":"spare","zh":"多餘的、備用的"},{"en":"sprinkle","zh":"灑、撒"},{"en":"stem","zh":"莖；起源於（stem from）"}]},{"id":"L4-S13","level":4,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"我們從潛艇的窗口看見一條細長的魚，弟弟問我牠會不會用矛一般的長嘴刺獵物。上岸後，我們翻開圖鑑才知道，原來附近海域有這麼多外形相似的魚種。","en":"From the window of the submarine we saw a long, thin fish, and my brother asked me if it would stab its prey with its spear-like beak. After we came ashore, we opened a field guide and learned that there are so many species of similar-looking fish in these waters.","words":[{"en":"spear","zh":"矛"},{"en":"species","zh":"物種"},{"en":"stab","zh":"刺、戳"},{"en":"submarine","zh":"潛水艇"}]},{"id":"L4-S14","level":4,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"為了讓孩子欣賞一場精彩的演出，店家們決定分攤租場地的費用。平時被說小氣的老闆，這次竟把自己的立體音響借給了劇團，連運費都自己出。","en":"To let the children enjoy a splendid show, the shop owners decided to split the cost of renting the hall. The owner who is usually called stingy even lent his stereo to the theater group this time and paid for the delivery himself.","words":[{"en":"splendid","zh":"極好的、壯麗的"},{"en":"split","zh":"分開、分裂"},{"en":"stereo","zh":"立體音響"},{"en":"stingy","zh":"小氣的、吝嗇的"}]},{"id":"L4-S15","level":4,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"雖然我一直努力爭取校隊資格，卻總在最後一圈被其他選手超過。教練看過每圈的統計數據，又問起我腳踝舊傷的狀況，才和我商量怎麼加強腿部力量。","en":"Although I had been striving for a place on the school team, other runners always passed me on the last lap. After looking at the statistics for each lap and asking about my old ankle injury, the coach discussed with me how to strengthen my legs.","words":[{"en":"statistic(s)","zh":"統計數據；統計學"},{"en":"strengthen","zh":"加強、變堅固"},{"en":"strive","zh":"努力、奮鬥"}]},{"id":"L4-S16","level":4,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"手術結束後，外科醫師到等候室找我們，說明爸爸醒來後會在哪裡休息。護理師接著帶我們看看病房，好讓我們能幫爸爸熟悉新的環境。","en":"After the surgery, the surgeon came to find us in the waiting room and explained where Dad would rest after he woke up. Then a nurse showed us the ward so we could help Dad get used to his new surroundings.","words":[{"en":"surgeon","zh":"外科醫師"},{"en":"surgery","zh":"手術；外科"},{"en":"surroundings","zh":"環境、周圍的事物"}]},{"id":"L4-S17","level":4,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"排練法庭劇時，我演的店主對那位陌生客人起了疑心，揚言要控告他。直到真正的竊賊向警方自首，店主才了解自己冤枉了誰。","en":"While rehearsing a courtroom play, the shop owner I played became suspicious of a strange customer and threatened to sue him. Not until the real thief surrendered to the police did the shop owner understand whom he had wrongly blamed.","words":[{"en":"sue","zh":"控告、起訴"},{"en":"surrender","zh":"投降"},{"en":"suspicious","zh":"可疑的；多疑的"}]},{"id":"L4-T01","level":4,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"在通信展開幕前，技師替那臺老電報機做了徹底的檢查，還試著用它發了一則訊息。看著紙帶移動，我才明白這項技術上的突破，當年如何縮短兩座城市傳遞消息的時間。","en":"Before the communications exhibition opened, the technician gave the old telegraph a thorough check and tried sending a message with it. Watching the paper tape move, I understood how this technological breakthrough had shortened the time it took for news to travel between two cities.","words":[{"en":"technician","zh":"技師"},{"en":"technological","zh":"科技的"},{"en":"telegraph","zh":"電報"},{"en":"thorough","zh":"徹底的"}]},{"id":"L4-T02","level":4,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"考慮周到的社長除了帶望遠鏡，還印了公車時刻表，好讓大家安心觀星，不用怕錯過末班車。原本害羞的學弟看見土星環之後，竟主動問大家，明晚有誰還想再來。","en":"Besides bringing a telescope, the thoughtful club president printed the bus timetable so everyone could enjoy the stars without worrying about missing the last bus. After seeing Saturn's rings, the timid younger student even asked everyone who wanted to come again tomorrow night.","words":[{"en":"telescope","zh":"望遠鏡"},{"en":"thoughtful","zh":"體貼的；深思的"},{"en":"timetable","zh":"時間表"},{"en":"timid","zh":"膽小的"}]},{"id":"L4-T03","level":4,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"我一上臺就有把肩膀縮起來的傾向，手臂的肌肉會緊繃，連琴弓都跟著發抖。老師叫我先放下琴，再慢慢吐氣，直到肩頸的緊張感消失才重新開始。","en":"As soon as I go on stage, I have a tendency to hunch my shoulders. The muscles in my arms get tense, and even my bow trembles. My teacher told me to put down the violin first and breathe out slowly, and not to start again until the tension in my shoulders and neck was gone.","words":[{"en":"tendency","zh":"趨向、傾向"},{"en":"tense","zh":"緊張的；時態"},{"en":"tension","zh":"緊張；張力"},{"en":"tremble","zh":"發抖"}]},{"id":"L4-T04","level":4,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"這部電影以戰爭為主題，描寫一名少年如何在目睹家人遭到拷打的驚恐中長大。導演沒有演出那場悲劇的每個細節，而是讓一封始終沒寄出的信說明家人悲慘的結局。","en":"This movie's theme is war, and it shows how a boy grows up in the terror of watching his family being tortured. The director does not show every detail of the tragedy. Instead, a letter that was never sent tells of the family's tragic end.","words":[{"en":"terror","zh":"恐怖"},{"en":"theme","zh":"主題"},{"en":"torture","zh":"折磨、拷打"},{"en":"tragedy","zh":"悲劇"},{"en":"tragic","zh":"悲慘的、悲劇的"}]},{"id":"L4-T05","level":4,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"我們蹲下來看陸龜跨過一根細枝，誰也不敢伸手幫忙。身邊的草葉搔得我的腳踝發癢，我還是等牠走遠了才站起來。","en":"We squatted down to watch the tortoise climb over a twig, and nobody dared to reach out and help. The grass tickled my ankles, but I did not stand up until it had walked far away.","words":[{"en":"tickle","zh":"搔癢"},{"en":"tortoise","zh":"陸龜"},{"en":"twig","zh":"小樹枝"}]},{"id":"L4-T06","level":4,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"鄰居對孩子練鼓一向很寬容，但連續幾晚被吵醒後，他坦白說自己已經無法忍受。為了感謝他的包容，我們一起試了幾種隔音墊，直到樓下聽見的音量降到他能忍受的程度。","en":"Our neighbor has always been tolerant of the children practicing the drums, but after being woken up several nights in a row, he admitted he could no longer tolerate it. To thank him for his tolerance, we tried several kinds of soundproof mats together until the volume downstairs was tolerable to him.","words":[{"en":"tolerable","zh":"可忍受的"},{"en":"tolerance","zh":"容忍、寬容"},{"en":"tolerant","zh":"寬容的"},{"en":"tolerate","zh":"容忍"}]},{"id":"L4-T07","level":4,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"部落的長者帶著譯者來到一位祖先的墓前，逐句解釋石碑上記下的往事。譯者先將故事翻成中文，再把譯文讀給長者聽，請他確認人名的順序。","en":"A tribal elder brought a translator to the tomb of an ancestor and explained, line by line, the history recorded on the stone. The translator first translated the story into Chinese and then read the translation to the elder, asking him to check the order of the names.","words":[{"en":"tomb","zh":"墳墓"},{"en":"translate","zh":"翻譯"},{"en":"translation","zh":"翻譯、譯文"},{"en":"translator","zh":"譯者"},{"en":"tribal","zh":"部落的、宗族的"}]},{"id":"L4-T08","level":4,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"縣府將舊車站的管理權移交社區後，居民把候車室改造成一座小型展館。牆上的老照片讓我看見，鐵路運輸曾對這座小鎮產生多麼巨大的影響。","en":"After the county government transferred the management of the old station to the community, the residents transformed the waiting room into a small exhibition hall. The old photos on the wall showed me what a tremendous effect railroad transportation once had on this small town.","words":[{"en":"transfer","zh":"轉移；轉學、調職；轉乘"},{"en":"transform","zh":"轉變"},{"en":"transportation","zh":"交通運輸（工具）"},{"en":"tremendous","zh":"巨大的、非常的"}]},{"id":"L4-T09","level":4,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"賽道最後有一個棘手的下坡彎，前面的車手在那裡摔倒，滾下了草坡。我停下來確認他能站起來才繼續騎，沒想到他後來趕上我，還在終點取得了勝利。","en":"At the end of the course there was a troublesome downhill bend, and the rider in front tumbled there and rolled down the grassy slope. I stopped to make sure he could stand up before I went on, but he later caught up with me and celebrated his triumph at the finish line.","words":[{"en":"triumph","zh":"勝利"},{"en":"troublesome","zh":"麻煩的、令人討厭的"},{"en":"tumble","zh":"跌倒、滾落"}]},{"id":"L4-U01","level":4,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"我們原以為箭頭是全世界通用的出口標示，直到演習時有人把它當成入口。消防員力勸我們在學生手冊裡用圖例說明這個符號的正確用法，因為情況緊急、必須撤離時，新生沒時間停下來猜。","en":"We thought an arrow was a universal sign for an exit, until someone took it for an entrance during a drill. The firefighter urged us to explain the correct usage of this sign with a picture in the student handbook, because in an urgent situation when we must leave, new students have no time to stop and guess.","words":[{"en":"universal","zh":"普遍的、全世界的"},{"en":"urge","zh":"催促；衝動"},{"en":"urgent","zh":"緊急的、急迫的"},{"en":"usage","zh":"用法"}]},{"id":"L4-V01","level":4,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"出海航行的前一晚，我們沿著廣闊的港區找空房，找了一個鐘頭仍然徒勞無功。天色漸暗，一艘剛靠岸的船上有人探出頭，告訴我們車站後面還有一家旅館。","en":"The night before our sea voyage, we spent an hour searching the vast harbor area for a vacancy, but it was in vain. As it got dark, someone on a vessel that had just docked looked out and told us there was another hotel behind the station.","words":[{"en":"vacancy","zh":"空缺、空房"},{"en":"vain","zh":"徒勞的；自負的"},{"en":"vast","zh":"廣大的、巨大的"},{"en":"vessel","zh":"船；容器；血管"},{"en":"voyage","zh":"航行"}]},{"id":"L4-V02","level":4,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"社區廚房的服務採自願參加，我第一次當志工時，才知道來吃飯的長輩中有好幾位素食者。負責備餐的阿姨說，體貼是一種美德，便把兩鍋湯的成分一項一項寫下來。","en":"Service at the community kitchen is voluntary. The first time I worked as a volunteer, I learned that several of the elderly people who came to eat were vegetarians. The lady in charge of the meals said being thoughtful is a virtue, so she wrote down the ingredients of the two pots of soup one by one.","words":[{"en":"vegetarian","zh":"素食者"},{"en":"virtue","zh":"美德"},{"en":"voluntary","zh":"自願的"},{"en":"volunteer","zh":"志工；自願"}]},{"id":"L4-V03","level":4,"letter":"V","n":3,"zh":"校刊記者到盲人棒球隊採訪，投手向他解釋，當球員沒有視覺線索時，聲音對他們接球有多重要。記者想向一位剛感染病毒的隊員問候。教練答應代為轉達，因為把隊員的聯絡方式交給訪客會違反隊規，每次違規都要記錄。","en":"When a school magazine reporter interviewed a baseball team for blind players, the pitcher explained how vital sound is for catching the ball when players have no visual cues. The reporter wanted to send his regards to a player who had just caught a virus. The coach agreed to pass on the message, because giving a player's contact information to visitors would violate the team's rules, and every violation must be recorded.","words":[{"en":"violate","zh":"違反"},{"en":"violation","zh":"違反、違背"},{"en":"virus","zh":"病毒"},{"en":"visual","zh":"視覺的"},{"en":"vital","zh":"極重要的；生命的（vital signs 生命徵象）"}]},{"id":"L4-W01","level":4,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"在社會福利中心任職的爸爸，喜歡提早到工作場所做十分鐘的體能訓練。今天他比平常早半小時叫醒我，因為他在中心網站上看到通知，說今天借場地運動的人得先把週末活動的桌椅搬開。","en":"Dad, who works at a social welfare center, likes to get to his workplace early for a ten-minute workout. Today he wakened me half an hour earlier than usual because he saw a notice on the center's website saying that people using the room for exercise had to move the tables and chairs from the weekend event first.","words":[{"en":"waken","zh":"醒來、喚醒"},{"en":"website","zh":"網站"},{"en":"welfare","zh":"福利"},{"en":"workout","zh":"運動、健身"},{"en":"workplace","zh":"工作場所"}]},{"id":"L4-W02","level":4,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"校慶劇裡，演女巫的妹妹突然忘詞，演男巫的哥哥便向她眨了眨眼。他靠自己的機智，把忘詞演成咒語失效，連老師都沒發現他們改過台詞。","en":"In the school play, my sister, who played a witch, suddenly forgot her line, so my brother, who played a wizard, winked at her. With his quick wit, he turned the forgotten line into a failed spell, and not even the teacher noticed that they had changed the script.","words":[{"en":"wink","zh":"眨眼、使眼色"},{"en":"wit","zh":"機智"},{"en":"witch/wizard","zh":"女巫／巫師"}]},{"id":"L4-W03","level":4,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"記者找到一位目擊撞船事故的漁民，向他詢問兩艘船相撞前的位置。漁民指出，搜救隊在風浪增強後才撤離，當時沉船還有一半露在水面上。","en":"The reporter found a fisherman who had witnessed the boat crash and asked him where the two boats were before they hit each other. The fisherman pointed out that the rescue team withdrew only after the wind and waves grew stronger, and at that time half of the wreck was still above the water.","words":[{"en":"withdraw","zh":"提款；撤回"},{"en":"witness","zh":"目擊者、證人"},{"en":"wreck","zh":"殘骸；毀壞"}]},{"id":"L4-Y01","level":4,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"青春洋溢的團員們一聽見前奏就跳了起來，連坐在角落打呵欠的我都跟著站了起來。等到老師提醒大家校門快關了，我們才發現已經排練了兩個小時。","en":"The youthful members jumped up as soon as they heard the intro, and even I, who had been yawning in the corner, stood up too. Not until the teacher reminded us that the school gate was about to close did we realize we had been rehearsing for two hours.","words":[{"en":"yawn","zh":"哈欠"},{"en":"youthful","zh":"年輕的"}]},{"id":"L5-A01","level":5,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"手錶已顯示我的心率異常，我卻還想加快腳步。腳踝猛然一陣劇痛，我急停下來，嚇到了後面的跑者。","en":"My watch already showed an abnormal heart rate, but I still wanted to accelerate. An acute pain suddenly shot through my ankle, and I made an abrupt stop that frightened the runner behind me.","words":[{"en":"abnormal","zh":"不正常的、異常的"},{"en":"abrupt","zh":"突然的、唐突的"},{"en":"accelerate","zh":"加速、促進"},{"en":"acute","zh":"急性的；嚴重的；敏銳的"}]},{"id":"L5-A02","level":5,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"有些學生主張廢除進教室前得登記帽子顏色的規定。學生會認為這條規定荒謬，已正式提案修改校規。","en":"Some students argue for abolishing the rule that we must register the color of our hats before entering the classroom. The student council thinks the rule is absurd and has formally proposed amending the school rules.","words":[{"en":"abolish","zh":"廢除"},{"en":"absurd","zh":"荒謬的、不合理的"},{"en":"amend","zh":"修正"}]},{"id":"L5-A03","level":5,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"論壇原本只邀了成人來談墮胎議題。一名倡議人士問在場有誰能代表青少年發言，主持人這才改了議程，把第一段時間留給學生。","en":"The forum had only invited adults to talk about abortion. An activist asked who in the room could speak for adolescents, and only then did the host change the agenda and give the first part of the time to students.","words":[{"en":"abortion","zh":"墮胎、流產"},{"en":"activist","zh":"行動主義者、社運人士"},{"en":"adolescent","zh":"青少年；青春期的"},{"en":"agenda","zh":"議程"}]},{"id":"L5-A04","level":5,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"沿河走就能看見早年農業活動留下的水渠。從前這裡水源充足，如今農民得設法減輕連年乾旱對收成的不利影響。","en":"Walking along the river, you can see the water channels left by early agricultural activity. Water used to be abundant here, but now farmers must find ways to reduce the adverse effects of years of drought on their harvests.","words":[{"en":"abundant","zh":"豐富的、充分的"},{"en":"adverse","zh":"不利的、有害的"},{"en":"agricultural","zh":"農業的"}]},{"id":"L5-A05","level":5,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"我們預料連假時住宿會很難找，便先打電話到山莊。老闆說大房間能容納八人，但只有一樓的房間方便輪椅使用者進出。","en":"We anticipated that accommodation would be hard to find during the long weekend, so we called the mountain lodge first. The owner said the big room could accommodate eight people, but only the rooms on the first floor were accessible to wheelchair users.","words":[{"en":"accessible","zh":"容易到達的、可使用的"},{"en":"accommodate","zh":"容納；提供住宿；配合"},{"en":"accommodation","zh":"住宿、住處"},{"en":"anticipate","zh":"預期、期待"}]},{"id":"L5-A06","level":5,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"姐姐學過會計，收購書店前先核對了帳本。店主承認，帳上列的收入與實際收到的款項不符。","en":"My sister had studied accounting, so she checked the books before the acquisition of the bookstore. The owner acknowledged that the income listed in the books was not in accord with the money actually received.","words":[{"en":"accord","zh":"一致；協議"},{"en":"accounting","zh":"會計（學）"},{"en":"acknowledge(ment)","zh":"承認；致謝"},{"en":"acquisition","zh":"獲得；收購"}]},{"id":"L5-A07","level":5,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"新來的行政主管帶我熟悉日常的行政程序。他說，儘管學校行政部門就在隔壁，借教室的申請還是得經由我們辦公室送出。","en":"The new administrator helped me get acquainted with our daily administrative procedures. He said that although the school administration office is right next door, requests to borrow classrooms still have to go through our office.","words":[{"en":"acquaint","zh":"使認識、使熟悉"},{"en":"administration","zh":"管理、行政；政府"},{"en":"administrative","zh":"管理的、行政的"},{"en":"administrator","zh":"管理人員、行政人員"}]},{"id":"L5-A08","level":5,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"律師請我描述當晚在球場外目睹的攻擊事件。我記得隊長當時越來越有攻擊性，最後動手打了人，事後還濫用職權要求隊友保密。","en":"The attorney asked me to describe the assault I witnessed outside the stadium that night. I remember the captain showing more and more aggression until he hit someone, and afterward he abused his power to make his teammates keep quiet.","words":[{"en":"abuse","zh":"虐待；濫用"},{"en":"aggression","zh":"侵略、攻擊性"},{"en":"assault","zh":"攻擊、襲擊"},{"en":"attorney","zh":"律師"}]},{"id":"L5-A09","level":5,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"妹妹從小就愛讀一則古老的寓言。故事裡，一個農夫發現自己的驢受了傷，痛苦萬分。妹妹心疼那頭驢，親手畫了一幅牠康復後的樣子，夾在書的最後一頁。","en":"Since she was little, my sister has adored an old fable. In the story, a farmer finds that his donkey is hurt and in agony. Full of affection for the donkey, my sister drew a picture of it after it got well and kept it in the last page of the book.","words":[{"en":"adore","zh":"崇拜、愛慕"},{"en":"affection","zh":"喜愛、感情"},{"en":"agony","zh":"極度痛苦"}]},{"id":"L5-A10","level":5,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"阿哲站在超市飲料區的走道上，想起朋友對花生過敏，也不喝含酒精的飲料。他找出朋友傳來的食物過敏清單，重新檢查購物車裡的東西。","en":"Standing in the drinks aisle at the supermarket, A-Zhe remembered that his friend is allergic to peanuts and does not drink alcoholic drinks. He found the list of food allergies his friend had sent and checked the things in his cart again.","words":[{"en":"aisle","zh":"走道"},{"en":"alcoholic","zh":"含酒精的；酗酒者"},{"en":"allergic","zh":"過敏的"},{"en":"allergy","zh":"過敏"}]},{"id":"L5-A11","level":5,"letter":"A","n":11,"zh":"三個村子組成聯盟，一起監測水質。要不是上游的工廠成了盟友，願意撥出充裕的經費，村民就買不起監測器材。","en":"Three villages formed an alliance to monitor water quality. If the factory upstream had not become their ally and allocated ample funds, the villagers could not have afforded the equipment.","words":[{"en":"alliance","zh":"聯盟"},{"en":"allocate","zh":"分配"},{"en":"ally","zh":"盟友、同盟國"},{"en":"ample","zh":"充足的"}]},{"id":"L5-A12","level":5,"letter":"A","n":12,"zh":"田徑社根據每次練習的出席人數調整了訓練計畫。長跑組跟短跑組現在輪流使用內側跑道，再也沒有人得在場邊乾等。","en":"The athletics club altered its training plan according to the attendance at each practice. The long-distance group and the sprint group now alternate in using the inside lane, and no one has to wait on the side anymore.","words":[{"en":"accord","zh":"一致；協議"},{"en":"alter","zh":"改變"},{"en":"alternate","zh":"交替的、輪流的；交替"},{"en":"athletics","zh":"體育運動"},{"en":"attendance","zh":"出席（人數）"}]},{"id":"L5-A13","level":5,"letter":"A","n":13,"zh":"一位匿名讀者斷言，老街上所有原本空著的店面都租出去了。分析師看了照片，指出這個說法有個前提：照片必須拍到每一間原本空著的店面。","en":"An anonymous reader asserted that every empty shop on the old street had been rented out. After looking at the photos, an analyst pointed out that this claim rests on an assumption: the photos must show every shop that used to be empty.","words":[{"en":"analyst","zh":"分析師"},{"en":"anonymous","zh":"匿名的"},{"en":"assert","zh":"主張、斷言"},{"en":"assumption","zh":"假設"}]},{"id":"L5-A14","level":5,"letter":"A","n":14,"zh":"我們整理閣樓時找到一座古董時鐘。直到拍賣行派人上門估價，我才知道那是外公留下來最值錢的一項資產。","en":"While cleaning the attic, we found an antique clock. Not until the auction house sent someone to assess it did I learn that it was the most valuable asset my grandfather left.","words":[{"en":"antique","zh":"古董；古董的"},{"en":"assess(ment)","zh":"評估"},{"en":"asset","zh":"資產；有用的人或物"},{"en":"attic","zh":"閣樓"},{"en":"auction","zh":"拍賣"}]},{"id":"L5-A15","level":5,"letter":"A","n":15,"zh":"最後一位選手從高台翻身而下，競技場裡頓時安靜下來。讓我驚訝的是，她入水時幾乎沒濺起水花。觀眾看得入神，滿懷敬佩地望著她上岸，接著才響起掌聲。","en":"The arena fell silent as the last diver flipped off the high platform. To my astonishment, she made almost no splash. The audience watched her come out of the water in awe, and then the applause began.","words":[{"en":"applause","zh":"鼓掌、喝彩"},{"en":"arena","zh":"競技場、場館"},{"en":"astonish(ment)","zh":"使驚訝"},{"en":"awe","zh":"敬畏"}]},{"id":"L5-A16","level":5,"letter":"A","n":16,"zh":"爸爸擺出一系列修理家電的工具，問我會挑哪一支拆開咖啡機。他這一問，喚起了我對機器內部的好奇心。他說拆機器像讀書，我覺得這個比喻很貼切。","en":"Dad laid out an array of tools for repairing appliances and asked me which one I would choose to take apart the coffee machine. His question aroused my curiosity about the inside of machines. He said taking machines apart is like reading, and I thought the comparison was apt.","words":[{"en":"appliance","zh":"家電、器具"},{"en":"apt","zh":"易於……的；恰當的"},{"en":"arouse","zh":"引起、喚起"},{"en":"array","zh":"一系列、大量"}]},{"id":"L5-A17","level":5,"letter":"A","n":17,"zh":"一位研究建築的同學設計了一棟給外星人住的房子。擔任評審的建築師請他說清楚理由，原先嫌他傲慢的同學這才明白他為什麼堅持拿掉樓梯。","en":"A classmate studying architecture designed a house for aliens. The architect on the judging panel asked him to articulate his reasons, and then the classmates who had found him arrogant understood why he insisted on removing the stairs.","words":[{"en":"alien","zh":"外星人；外國的"},{"en":"architect","zh":"建築師"},{"en":"architecture","zh":"建築（學）"},{"en":"arrogant","zh":"傲慢的"},{"en":"articulate","zh":"清楚表達；口齒清晰的"}]},{"id":"L5-A18","level":5,"letter":"A","n":18,"zh":"校長授權學生會自行決定園遊會的攤位配置。學生把今年排隊時間縮短歸功於這份自治權，因為他們能依現場情況立刻調動人手。","en":"The principal authorized the student council to decide the layout of the stalls at the school fair. The students attributed this year's shorter lines to this autonomy because they could move workers right away depending on the situation.","words":[{"en":"attribute","zh":"歸因於；特質"},{"en":"authorize","zh":"授權、批准"},{"en":"autonomy","zh":"自主（權）、自治"}]},{"id":"L5-B01","level":5,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"我們把第一批堆肥拌進後院那塊貧瘠的土裡。要等到雨季過後，才看得出這麼做是否對菜苗的生長有益。","en":"We mixed the first batch of compost into the barren soil in the backyard. We will not know whether it is beneficial to the young plants until after the rainy season.","words":[{"en":"backyard","zh":"後院"},{"en":"barren","zh":"貧瘠的"},{"en":"batch","zh":"一批"},{"en":"beneficial","zh":"有益的"}]},{"id":"L5-B02","level":5,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"我代表衝浪社到會場時，支持禁用一次性塑膠杯的橫幅已經掛好了。大家領了選票，要決定下次海灘活動是否實施這項禁令。","en":"When I arrived on behalf of the surfing club, the banner supporting a ban on disposable plastic cups was already up. Everyone got a ballot to decide whether to put the ban in place at the next beach event.","words":[{"en":"ballot","zh":"選票；投票"},{"en":"ban","zh":"禁止；禁令"},{"en":"banner","zh":"橫幅、旗幟"},{"en":"behalf","zh":"代表（on behalf of）"}]},{"id":"L5-B03","level":5,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"廣播提醒旅客提防扒手，隨時留意隨身物品。我這才發現心愛的公事包還放在售票機旁，趕緊循原路跑回去。","en":"The announcement reminded travelers to beware of pickpockets and watch their belongings. Only then did I notice that my beloved briefcase was still next to the ticket machine, so I quickly ran back the way I came.","words":[{"en":"belongings","zh":"隨身物品、財物"},{"en":"beloved","zh":"心愛的"},{"en":"beware","zh":"小心、謹防"},{"en":"briefcase","zh":"公事包"}]},{"id":"L5-B04","level":5,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"班上那個惡霸逼我交出朋友的私訊，我不肯背叛朋友。以前我對不敢出面作證的人有偏見，直到自己被他堵在走廊上，才知道他們在怕什麼。","en":"The class bully tried to make me hand over my friend's private messages, but I refused to betray my friend. I used to have a bias against people who were afraid to be witnesses, until he trapped me in the hallway and I learned what they were afraid of.","words":[{"en":"betray","zh":"出賣、背叛"},{"en":"bias","zh":"偏見"},{"en":"bully","zh":"霸凌；霸凌者"}]},{"id":"L5-B05","level":5,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"我在舊貨市集的一個攤位翻閱拍賣目錄，相中一匹青銅小馬。我終於舉手出價時，才發現隔壁攤的老闆也看上了它。","en":"I was browsing an auction catalogue at a booth at the flea market and fell for a small bronze horse. When I finally raised my hand to bid, I found that the owner of the next booth wanted it too.","words":[{"en":"bid","zh":"出價；投標"},{"en":"booth","zh":"攤位；亭子"},{"en":"bronze","zh":"青銅；銅牌"},{"en":"browse","zh":"瀏覽"}]},{"id":"L5-B06","level":5,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"混濁的溪水讓水下攝影機拍到的影像變得模糊。老師請我們等看清那個形狀奇異的東西怎麼動，再判斷這是生物現象還是光線造成的錯覺。","en":"The muddy stream blurred the images from the underwater camera. The teacher asked us to wait until we could see clearly how the bizarre object moved before deciding whether it was a biological phenomenon or a trick of the light.","words":[{"en":"biological","zh":"生物（學）的"},{"en":"bizarre","zh":"怪異的"},{"en":"blur","zh":"使模糊；模糊的東西"}]},{"id":"L5-B07","level":5,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"舞台前方傳來爆炸巨響，保鏢立刻把後台側門閂上。直到工作人員解釋那是預演時安排的爆破效果，他才讓等在外面的攝影師進來。","en":"When a loud blast came from the front of the stage, the bodyguard bolted the side door backstage at once. He did not let the photographers waiting outside come in until the staff explained that it was an effect planned for the rehearsal.","words":[{"en":"blast","zh":"爆炸；一陣（風）"},{"en":"bodyguard","zh":"保鏢、護衛"},{"en":"bolt","zh":"螺栓；門閂"}]},{"id":"L5-B08","level":5,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"這位拳擊手第一次打進全國決賽，終於在職業生涯中有了突破。記者問起他臉上的瘀青時，他神色自若，提到一直替他加油的阿嬤，他倒臉紅了。","en":"This boxer reached the national final for the first time and finally made a breakthrough in his career. When reporters asked about the bruise on his face, he stayed calm, but he blushed when he talked about his grandma, who always cheers for him.","words":[{"en":"blush","zh":"臉紅"},{"en":"boxer","zh":"拳擊手"},{"en":"breakthrough","zh":"突破"},{"en":"bruise","zh":"瘀青"}]},{"id":"L5-B09","level":5,"letter":"B","n":9,"zh":"這名肉販開始送貨後，生意很快就興旺起來。他想把銷售量再往上推，便答應員工，業績達標就發獎金。","en":"After this butcher began making deliveries, his business quickly boomed. To boost sales even more, he promised his workers a bonus if they reached the goal.","words":[{"en":"bonus","zh":"獎金、紅利"},{"en":"boom","zh":"繁榮；隆隆聲"},{"en":"boost","zh":"提升、促進"},{"en":"butcher","zh":"肉販、屠夫"}]},{"id":"L5-B10","level":5,"letter":"B","n":10,"zh":"為了排遣暑假的無聊，我每天陪阿公沿著兩塊田的分界線散步。今天我們經過時，一隻野兔從腳邊跳出去，才跳了幾下就不見了。","en":"To fight the boredom of summer vacation, I walked with Grandpa along the boundary between two fields every day. As we passed today, a wild rabbit bounded out from near our feet and disappeared after a few jumps.","words":[{"en":"boredom","zh":"無聊"},{"en":"bound","zh":"一定會（be bound to）；受約束的"},{"en":"boundary","zh":"邊界、界線"}]},{"id":"L5-B11","level":5,"letter":"B","n":11,"zh":"外公過世後，舅舅帶著文件去負責核發埋葬許可的事務局。申請資料大半是以前交過的文件影本，他這才明白家人為什麼老抱怨這套官僚體制。","en":"After Grandpa died, my uncle took the papers to the bureau that issues burial permits. Most of the application was copies of papers he had handed in before, and then he understood why the family always complained about the bureaucracy.","words":[{"en":"bureau","zh":"局、處"},{"en":"bureaucracy","zh":"官僚制度"},{"en":"burial","zh":"埋葬、葬禮"}]},{"id":"L5-C01","level":5,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"老師在黑板上寫下碳酸鈣，要我們從名稱推斷這種化合物含有哪些元素。我答出鈣和碳，坐在後面的同學補上了氧。","en":"The teacher wrote calcium carbonate on the blackboard and asked us to work out from the name which elements this compound contains. I answered calcium and carbon, and a classmate in the back added oxygen.","words":[{"en":"calcium","zh":"鈣"},{"en":"carbon","zh":"碳"},{"en":"compound","zh":"化合物；複合的"}]},{"id":"L5-C02","level":5,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"地方博物館委託一位畫家描繪運河在殖民時期的樣貌。為了在畫布上畫對倉庫的位置，她把老地圖和現在的街景照片疊在一起比對。","en":"The local museum commissioned a painter to show what the canal looked like in colonial times. To get the warehouses in the right places on her canvas, she compared old maps with photos of today's streets.","words":[{"en":"canal","zh":"運河"},{"en":"canvas","zh":"帆布、畫布"},{"en":"colonial","zh":"殖民（地）的"},{"en":"commission","zh":"委員會；佣金；委託"}]},{"id":"L5-C03","level":5,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"舊收音機的電路還完整，問題出在一個已停產的零件。要是買來的替代品跟原來的電路相容，我們當時就能測試這台收音機接收遠方電臺的能力了。","en":"The old radio's circuit was complete, and the problem was a part that was no longer made. If the replacement we bought had been compatible with the original circuit, we could have tested the radio's capability to receive distant stations then.","words":[{"en":"capability","zh":"能力"},{"en":"circuit","zh":"電路；巡迴"},{"en":"compatible","zh":"相容的、合得來的"}]},{"id":"L5-C04","level":5,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"嘉年華會請一位當地名人領隊，隊伍本來要在大教堂左轉。領隊卻拐向舊賭場，引起一陣混亂，連扛大鼓的人都得倒退走。","en":"The carnival invited a local celebrity to lead the parade, which was supposed to turn left at the cathedral. But the leader turned toward the old casino, causing chaos, and even the people carrying the big drums had to walk backward.","words":[{"en":"carnival","zh":"嘉年華"},{"en":"casino","zh":"賭場"},{"en":"cathedral","zh":"大教堂"},{"en":"celebrity","zh":"名人"},{"en":"chaos","zh":"混亂"}]},{"id":"L5-C05","level":5,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"帶隊老師警告我們，潮水一漲，眼前這條路就會消失。最謹慎的那位同學攤開潮汐表，說連他都無法確切判斷我們還能停留多久。","en":"The teacher leading us cautioned us that when the tide came in, the path in front of us would disappear. The most cautious classmate opened the tide table and said even he could not say with certainty how long we could stay.","words":[{"en":"caution","zh":"謹慎；警告"},{"en":"cautious","zh":"謹慎的、小心的"},{"en":"certainty","zh":"確定（的事）"}]},{"id":"L5-C06","level":5,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"儀式結束後，家人抬著棺木走出小禮拜堂。奶奶生前已選好公墓裡那棵樹旁的位置，說那裡離海最近，她想在那裡聽風。","en":"After the ceremony, the family carried the coffin out of the small chapel. Before she died, Grandma had chosen a spot by the tree in the cemetery. She said it was closest to the sea, and she wanted to listen to the wind there.","words":[{"en":"cemetery","zh":"墓園"},{"en":"ceremony","zh":"典禮、儀式"},{"en":"chapel","zh":"小教堂"},{"en":"coffin","zh":"棺材"}]},{"id":"L5-C07","level":5,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"我們合唱團的特色是低沉的和弦和悠長的尾音。那天彩排時，一群孩子聚在門口，直到最後一個和弦消失才走。","en":"Our choir is characterized by low chords and long endings. During rehearsal that day, a cluster of children gathered at the door and did not leave until the last chord faded.","words":[{"en":"characterize","zh":"以……為特色；描述"},{"en":"choir","zh":"合唱團、唱詩班"},{"en":"chord","zh":"和弦"},{"en":"cluster","zh":"一群、一串、一簇"}]},{"id":"L5-C08","level":5,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"爸爸平日忙著做家事，週末請了一位主廚教我們切菜。弟弟伸出胖嘟嘟的手指，指著砧板上一大塊南瓜，問自己得長到幾歲才能拿那把刀。","en":"Dad is busy with chores on weekdays, so on the weekend he invited a chef to teach us to cut vegetables. My brother pointed his chubby finger at a big chunk of pumpkin on the cutting board and asked how old he had to be to hold that knife.","words":[{"en":"chef","zh":"廚師"},{"en":"chore","zh":"家事、雜務"},{"en":"chubby","zh":"圓圓胖胖的"},{"en":"chunk","zh":"一大塊"}]},{"id":"L5-C09","level":5,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"這組學生想弄清楚長期失眠會怎麼影響人的認知能力。老師請他們先讀現有的臨床研究，再決定如何進行自己的調查。","en":"This group of students wants to find out how chronic sleeplessness affects people's cognitive abilities. The teacher asked them to read the existing clinical studies first before deciding how to conduct their own survey.","words":[{"en":"chronic","zh":"慢性的、長期的"},{"en":"clinical","zh":"臨床的"},{"en":"cognitive","zh":"認知的"},{"en":"conduct","zh":"進行、實施；指揮；行為"}]},{"id":"L5-C10","level":5,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"討論公民參與時，同學引用了模擬市議會章程裡的一項條款。條文規定，即使還沒取得公民身分，在城裡住滿一年的人也有權在會議上發言。","en":"When discussing civic participation, a classmate cited a clause from the rules of the mock city council. It says that even without citizenship, people who have lived in the city for a year have the right to speak at meetings.","words":[{"en":"cite","zh":"引用"},{"en":"citizenship","zh":"公民身分、國籍"},{"en":"civic","zh":"公民的、市民的"},{"en":"clause","zh":"子句、條款"}]},{"id":"L5-C11","level":5,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"老師要我們寫一段條理連貫的文字，指出小說最後那封信裡哪一句話最難理解，並說明原因。她說這次看的是閱讀理解力和表達是否清楚，篇幅長短不計分。","en":"The teacher asked us to write a coherent paragraph pointing out which sentence in the letter at the end of the novel was hardest to comprehend and why. She said this time she was looking at reading comprehension and clarity, and length would not be scored.","words":[{"en":"clarity","zh":"清楚、清晰"},{"en":"coherent","zh":"條理清楚的、連貫的"},{"en":"comprehend","zh":"理解"},{"en":"comprehension","zh":"理解（力）"}]},{"id":"L5-C12","level":5,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"一位收藏家翻開舊詩集，發現一朵乾花黏在最後一頁，旁邊還寫著採花的日期。巧合的是，我從另一家店買來的散文集裡也有一朵乾花，採花日期竟是同一天。","en":"A collector opened an old book of poems and found a dried flower stuck to the last page, with the date it was picked written beside it. By coincidence, the book of essays I bought from another shop also had a dried flower, and it was picked on the same day.","words":[{"en":"coincidence","zh":"巧合"},{"en":"collector","zh":"收藏家；收款員"}]},{"id":"L5-C13","level":5,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"報社的專欄作家寫了一篇評論，談這座小鎮如何打擊古柯鹼交易。他訪問居民長達三個月，直到最後才決定以第一位願意具名的店主所說的話開頭。","en":"A newspaper columnist wrote a commentary on how this small town combats the cocaine trade. He interviewed residents for three months and only decided at the end to open with the words of the first shop owner who was willing to give his name.","words":[{"en":"cocaine","zh":"古柯鹼"},{"en":"columnist","zh":"專欄作家"},{"en":"combat","zh":"戰鬥；對抗"},{"en":"commentary","zh":"評論；實況報導"}]},{"id":"L5-C14","level":5,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"雨傘租借站是商家和學校合作的成果。當初大家只承諾用完就還。傘雖是隨處可買的商品，雨天要讓每個站點都有傘，卻得靠集體努力。","en":"The umbrella lending stations are the result of a collaboration between shops and the school. At first, everyone only made a commitment to return umbrellas after using them. Although umbrellas are a common commodity, keeping umbrellas at every station on rainy days takes collective effort.","words":[{"en":"collaboration","zh":"合作"},{"en":"collective","zh":"集體的、共同的"},{"en":"commitment","zh":"承諾；投入"},{"en":"commodity","zh":"商品"}]},{"id":"L5-C15","level":5,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"一位喜劇演員在決賽時擔任客座球評。資深評論員原先擔心他只會說笑，賽後卻稱讚他把一次複雜的換人解釋得連新球迷都能聽懂。","en":"A comedian worked as a guest commentator for the final. The senior commentator worried at first that he would only tell jokes, but after the game he praised him for explaining a complicated substitution in a way even new fans could understand.","words":[{"en":"comedian","zh":"喜劇演員"},{"en":"commentator","zh":"評論員、播報員"}]},{"id":"L5-C16","level":5,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"整理祖父留下的書時，我找到他和一位共產主義者的往來書信。兩人對共產主義的理解相差甚遠，這讓我重新思考自己對那個年代的看法。","en":"While sorting the books my grandfather left, I found letters between him and a communist. The two understood communism very differently, and this made me think again about my own view of that time.","words":[{"en":"communism","zh":"共產主義"},{"en":"communist","zh":"共產主義者、共產黨員"}]},{"id":"L5-C17","level":5,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"小型折疊單車上市後，有些通勤者開始騎車到車站，再搭火車通勤。若把等車時間也算進去，這樣走一趟花的時間竟與全程騎單車相當。","en":"After small folding bikes came on the market, some commuters began riding to the station and then commuting by train. If you count the waiting time, the trip takes a time comparable to riding a bike the whole way.","words":[{"en":"commute","zh":"通勤"},{"en":"commuter","zh":"通勤者"},{"en":"comparable","zh":"可相比的、類似的"}]},{"id":"L5-C18","level":5,"letter":"C","n":18,"zh":"店主原打算自己賠償客人，因為他不願強迫剛上工的外送員掏錢。那位客人很體諒人，只收下部分賠償金。後來他見新人還是手足無措，便坐下來陪他，這份同情讓新人安心了些。","en":"The shop owner planned to compensate the customer himself because he did not want to compel the new delivery worker to pay. The customer was considerate and only took part of the compensation. Later, seeing the new worker was still at a loss, he sat down with him, and this compassion helped calm him.","words":[{"en":"compassion","zh":"同情、憐憫"},{"en":"compel","zh":"強迫、迫使"},{"en":"compensate","zh":"償還、補償"},{"en":"compensation","zh":"補償、賠償金"},{"en":"considerate","zh":"體貼的"}]},{"id":"L5-C19","level":5,"letter":"C","n":19,"zh":"要拿到證書，學員得證明自己具備帶隊的能力。考官臨時加了一道難題，讓傷者和迷路的隊員分處兩地。考官想看的是，面對比原先更複雜的情況，誰還能當個稱職的嚮導。","en":"To get the certificate, trainees have to prove their competence in leading a group. The examiner added a hard problem at the last minute, putting the injured person and the lost member in different places. The examiner wanted to see who could still be a competent guide in a situation more complex than before.","words":[{"en":"certificate","zh":"證書、證明"},{"en":"competence","zh":"能力、勝任"},{"en":"competent","zh":"能幹的、勝任的"}]},{"id":"L5-C20","level":5,"letter":"C","n":20,"zh":"必修的水上安全課由三個單元組成，每個單元用的器材都得符合學校的安全標準。教練先解釋大家為何得遵守每項規定，再到各組檢查執行情況。","en":"The compulsory water safety course comprises three units, and the equipment used in each unit must comply with the school's safety standards. The coach first explained why everyone must follow every rule and then went to each group to check their compliance.","words":[{"en":"compliance","zh":"遵守、服從"},{"en":"comply","zh":"遵守"},{"en":"comprise","zh":"包含、由……組成"},{"en":"compulsory","zh":"強制的、義務的"}]},{"id":"L5-C21","level":5,"letter":"C","n":21,"zh":"劇團原先構想的戲臺橫跨整條河。找過幾家贊助商後，導演才承認經費不夠。他和舞台設計師達成妥協，把演出範圍限在近岸處，但保留了讓小船從台下穿過的設計。","en":"The theater group first conceived of a stage that crossed the whole river. After talking to several sponsors, the director conceded that there was not enough money. He reached a compromise with the stage designer, limiting the show to the area near the shore but keeping the design that lets small boats pass under the stage.","words":[{"en":"compromise","zh":"妥協"},{"en":"concede","zh":"承認；讓步"},{"en":"conceive","zh":"構想；懷孕"}]},{"id":"L5-C22","level":5,"letter":"C","n":22,"zh":"有人把獎學金申請資料中的機密推薦信拍下來傳閱，全班都譴責這種行為。拍照的人本想隱瞞經過，得知申請人因此考慮撤件，才寫下自白，親手交給老師。","en":"Someone took photos of the confidential letters of recommendation in the scholarship applications and passed them around, and the whole class condemned this conduct. The person who took the photos had wanted to conceal what happened, but after learning that the applicant was thinking of withdrawing, he wrote a confession and handed it to the teacher himself.","words":[{"en":"conceal","zh":"隱藏、掩蓋"},{"en":"condemn","zh":"譴責；判刑"},{"en":"conduct","zh":"進行、實施；指揮；行為"},{"en":"confession","zh":"承認、坦白"},{"en":"confidential","zh":"機密的"}]},{"id":"L5-C23","level":5,"letter":"C","n":23,"zh":"連續三個週末，攝影社都得面對同一個問題。田埂太窄，只要有人架起腳架，農民就過不去。為了避免跟農民起衝突，社員終於達成共識，以後拍攝前都要先取得地主同意。","en":"For three weekends in a row, the photography club had to confront the same problem. The paths between the fields were so narrow that whenever someone set up a tripod, the farmers could not get through. To avoid a confrontation with the farmers, the members finally reached a consensus: from now on, they would get the landowner's consent before shooting.","words":[{"en":"confront","zh":"面對、對抗"},{"en":"confrontation","zh":"對抗、衝突"},{"en":"consensus","zh":"共識"},{"en":"consent","zh":"同意、許可"}]},{"id":"L5-C24","level":5,"letter":"C","n":24,"zh":"沿著小溪往上走，我們才發現灌溉水把肥料沖進溪裡，污染了水源。農民說，經費有限，無法一次換掉整套設備。我們就在一小塊田試用滴灌，每週記錄用水量，看看這樣做對節約用水有多少幫助。","en":"Walking up the creek, we found that irrigation water had washed fertilizer into the creek and contaminated the water source. The farmers said that with limited money, they could not replace the whole system at once. So we tried drip irrigation on a small field and recorded water consumption every week to see how much it helped with water conservation.","words":[{"en":"conservation","zh":"保育、保護"},{"en":"consumption","zh":"消費、消費量"},{"en":"contaminate","zh":"汙染"},{"en":"creek","zh":"小溪"}]},{"id":"L5-C25","level":5,"letter":"C","n":25,"zh":"選組前，我一直在想要不要讀設計。那位輔導老師說話很客氣，知道我怕同學聽見，還體貼地把諮詢地點改到小辦公室。她給我的忠告是先找一天跟著設計師工作。","en":"Before choosing my track, I kept contemplating whether to study design. The counselor spoke very courteously, and knowing I was afraid my classmates would hear, she considerately moved our consultation to a small office. Her counsel was to spend a day following a designer at work first.","words":[{"en":"considerate","zh":"體貼的"},{"en":"consultation","zh":"諮詢；會診"},{"en":"contemplate","zh":"沉思、考慮"},{"en":"counsel","zh":"建議；法律顧問"},{"en":"counselor","zh":"輔導員、諮商師"},{"en":"courteous","zh":"有禮貌的"}]},{"id":"L5-C26","level":5,"letter":"C","n":26,"zh":"校刊登了一篇有爭議的社論。作者主張，討論令人不舒服的言論時，也該考慮憲法保障的言論自由。後來引起最大爭議的卻是標題，因為「膽小鬼」這三個字流露出作者對反對者的輕蔑。","en":"The school magazine published a controversial editorial. The writer contended that when discussing uncomfortable speech, we should also consider the constitutional right to free speech. But what caused the most controversy was the title, because the word \\"cowards\\" showed the writer's contempt for those who disagreed.","words":[{"en":"constitutional","zh":"憲法的"},{"en":"contempt","zh":"輕視、輕蔑"},{"en":"contend","zh":"競爭；主張"},{"en":"controversial","zh":"有爭議的"},{"en":"controversy","zh":"爭議"}]},{"id":"L5-C27","level":5,"letter":"C","n":27,"zh":"當代舞社排了一支新舞。舞者的喜悅很有感染力，連我顧著燈光都忍不住跳了起來。雖然即興是這支舞的核心，我們要把表演放上網，仍得先取得樂曲著作權人的授權。","en":"The contemporary dance club made a new dance. The dancers' joy was so contagious that even I started dancing while running the lights. Although improvisation is at the core of the dance, we still had to get permission from the copyright holder of the music before putting the show online.","words":[{"en":"contagious","zh":"有傳染性的"},{"en":"contemporary","zh":"當代的；同時代的"},{"en":"copyright","zh":"版權、著作權"},{"en":"core","zh":"核心"}]},{"id":"L5-C28","level":5,"letter":"C","n":28,"zh":"地理社想知道離海距離和日夜溫差有沒有關聯，於是拿海島上的測站跟大陸內陸的測站做比較。挑選測站的第一項標準是海拔要接近，因為高度對這項比較至關重要。","en":"The geography club wanted to know whether there is a correlation between distance from the sea and the difference between day and night temperatures, so they compared stations on islands with stations deep in the continent. The first criterion for choosing stations was similar height above sea level, because height is crucial to this comparison.","words":[{"en":"correlation","zh":"相關性、關聯"},{"en":"criterion/criteria","zh":"標準、準則"},{"en":"crucial","zh":"關鍵的、極重要的"}]},{"id":"L5-C29","level":5,"letter":"C","n":29,"zh":"承包商打算把倉庫改成琴房。他明明說施工期間誰都不能進去，卻把樂團的排練排在完工前三天。要不是團長指出這個矛盾，親自協調工班和樂手的時間，改建工程就沒辦法準時完成。","en":"The contractor planned to convert a warehouse into a music room. Although he had said no one could enter during construction, he scheduled the band's rehearsals three days before the work was done. If the band leader had not pointed out this contradiction and coordinated the times of the workers and the musicians himself, the conversion could not have been finished on time.","words":[{"en":"contractor","zh":"承包商"},{"en":"contradiction","zh":"矛盾"},{"en":"conversion","zh":"轉變、轉換"},{"en":"convert","zh":"轉換；改變信仰"},{"en":"coordinate","zh":"協調"}]},{"id":"L5-C30","level":5,"letter":"C","n":30,"zh":"那名官員因收賄被判有罪後，報紙稱他是「貪污的官員」。後來，銀行保管的一張收據改變了案情。法院重新檢視這起貪腐案的證據，撤銷了原先的定罪。","en":"After the official was convicted of taking bribes, the newspaper called him \\"the corrupt official.\\" Later, a receipt kept by a bank changed the case. The court looked at the evidence in this corruption case again and overturned the conviction.","words":[{"en":"convict","zh":"判……有罪；囚犯"},{"en":"conviction","zh":"定罪；堅定的信念"},{"en":"corrupt","zh":"腐敗的、貪汙的"},{"en":"corruption","zh":"貪腐、腐敗"}]},{"id":"L5-C31","level":5,"letter":"C","n":31,"zh":"駐外記者在走廊上攔到那家跨國公司的發言人，問他企業捐款是否影響了當地的新聞報導。為了維護自己報導的可信度，她也列出了每筆捐款的金額和匯款日期。","en":"A foreign correspondent stopped the spokesman of the multinational corporation in the corridor and asked whether corporate donations had affected local news coverage. To protect the credibility of her report, she also listed the amount and date of every donation.","words":[{"en":"corporate","zh":"公司的、企業的"},{"en":"corporation","zh":"公司、企業"},{"en":"correspondent","zh":"通訊記者"},{"en":"corridor","zh":"走廊"},{"en":"coverage","zh":"報導；保險範圍；覆蓋範圍"},{"en":"credibility","zh":"可信度"}]},{"id":"L5-C32","level":5,"letter":"C","n":32,"zh":"一場事故使老師的右手失去活動能力，他仍把琢磨寶石的技術編進學校課程。第一堂課，他用左手拿起一件簡陋的工具，示範怎麼在一塊水晶上慢慢磨出平面。","en":"An accident crippled the teacher's right hand, but he still added the craft of polishing gems to the school curriculum. In the first class, he picked up a crude tool with his left hand and showed how to slowly grind a flat face onto a crystal.","words":[{"en":"cripple","zh":"使殘廢；嚴重損害"},{"en":"crude","zh":"粗糙的、未加工的；粗魯的"},{"en":"crystal","zh":"水晶"},{"en":"curriculum","zh":"課程"}]},{"id":"L5-C33","level":5,"letter":"C","n":33,"zh":"出發前，我們預訂了沿海岸航行的遊輪行程，最期待的是上岸品嚐當地菜餚。船長提醒大家，下船後得先過海關，港邊的小店也只收當地貨幣。","en":"Before we left, we booked a cruise along the coast, and what we looked forward to most was trying the local cuisine on shore. The captain reminded everyone that after getting off the ship, we had to go through customs first, and the small shops by the harbor only took local currency.","words":[{"en":"cruise","zh":"乘船遊覽、郵輪之旅；巡航"},{"en":"cuisine","zh":"料理、菜餚"},{"en":"currency","zh":"貨幣"},{"en":"customs","zh":"海關"}]},{"id":"L5-D01","level":5,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"風暴過後，一棵倒下的樹堵住了我家的車道。直到清走殘枝，我們才看見樹幹內部早已腐朽。這場風暴的破壞力讓我心驚，光是一根從高處掉下來的粗枝就足以致命。","en":"After the storm, a fallen tree blocked our driveway. Not until the debris was cleared did we see that the trunk had long been rotten inside. The destructive power of the storm shocked me. Just one thick branch falling from high up could be deadly.","words":[{"en":"deadly","zh":"致命的、致死的"},{"en":"debris","zh":"殘骸、碎片"},{"en":"destructive","zh":"毀滅性的、破壞的"},{"en":"driveway","zh":"車道"}]},{"id":"L5-D02","level":5,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"第一次試唱落選讓我很沮喪，我甚至對自己的前途感到絕望。多年後初次登臺，我把最後一首歌獻給外婆。要不是她多年來全心投入音樂教育，我的命運就會很不一樣。","en":"Failing my first audition depressed me so much that I even felt despair about my future. Years later, at my debut, I dedicated the last song to my grandmother. If not for her years of devotion to music education, my destiny would have been very different.","words":[{"en":"debut","zh":"首次亮相、出道"},{"en":"dedicate","zh":"奉獻、致力於"},{"en":"depress","zh":"使沮喪"},{"en":"despair","zh":"絕望"},{"en":"destiny","zh":"命運"},{"en":"devotion","zh":"奉獻、摯愛"}]},{"id":"L5-D03","level":5,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"被告一再否認曾欺騙買家。後來，助手透露兩個花瓶的底款都是事後才加印的，讓陪審員對被告的否認起了疑心。法官請他們判斷被告隱瞞花瓶年代的行為是否出於蓄意。","en":"The defendant kept denying that he had deceived the buyers. Later, his assistant disclosed that the marks on the bottoms of both vases had been added afterward, which made the jurors doubt the defendant's denial. The judge asked them to decide whether hiding the age of the vases had been deliberate.","words":[{"en":"deceive","zh":"欺騙、行騙"},{"en":"defendant","zh":"被告"},{"en":"deliberate","zh":"故意的；深思熟慮的"},{"en":"denial","zh":"否認"},{"en":"disclose","zh":"揭露、公開"}]},{"id":"L5-D04","level":5,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"票房收入下降後，劇團連一間像樣的排練室都租不起，帳上還有赤字。一名匿名捐贈者捐出半年的租金。要是少了這筆捐款，孩子們就得停排了。","en":"After ticket sales declined, the theater group could not even rent a decent rehearsal room and had a deficit on its books. An anonymous donor gave half a year's rent. Without this donation, the children would have had to stop rehearsing.","words":[{"en":"decent","zh":"像樣的、得體的"},{"en":"decline","zh":"下降、衰退；婉拒"},{"en":"deficit","zh":"赤字、不足"},{"en":"donation","zh":"捐贈物、捐款"},{"en":"donor","zh":"捐贈人"}]},{"id":"L5-D05","level":5,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"模擬峰會開始前，我們的代表團選我宣讀一份聲明，要求恢復小國的投票權。主席禁止大家討論這件事，另一團的代表卻站起來公然違抗禁令，說自己堅決擁護民主。我試著用更有外交手腕的方式，請主席先聽聽小國代表的意見。","en":"Before the mock summit began, our delegation chose me to read a declaration demanding that small countries get their votes back. The chair banned discussion of the issue, but a delegate from another group stood up to defy the ban, saying she was a firm democrat. I tried a more diplomatic way and asked the chair to hear the small countries' delegates first.","words":[{"en":"declaration","zh":"宣言、聲明；申報"},{"en":"defy","zh":"違抗、反抗"},{"en":"delegate","zh":"代表"},{"en":"delegation","zh":"代表團、派遣代表團"},{"en":"democrat","zh":"民主主義者；（美國）民主黨人"},{"en":"diplomatic","zh":"外交的；圓滑的"}]},{"id":"L5-D06","level":5,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"那張手繪地圖用深淺不同的紅色描繪車站附近的人口密度。隊長不在的那天，他的副手就根據這張圖，趕在最擁擠的出口開始排隊前，把志工部署到位。","en":"The hand-drawn map used different shades of red to depict the population density near the station. On the day the leader was away, his deputy used this map to deploy volunteers before lines began to form at the most crowded exit.","words":[{"en":"density","zh":"密度"},{"en":"depict","zh":"描繪"},{"en":"deploy","zh":"部署"},{"en":"deputy","zh":"副手、代理人"}]},{"id":"L5-D07","level":5,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"阿公用家鄉方言說了兩個形容雨聲的詞，我起初聽不出兩者的區別。他說其中一個詞源自雨滴打在竹葉上的聲音。我在方言手冊裡寫了一小段描寫雨聲的文字，再附上錄音，讓讀者也能聽見那個獨特的尾音。","en":"Grandpa used two words from his hometown dialect to describe the sound of rain, and at first I could not hear the distinction between them. He said one word was derived from the sound of raindrops on bamboo leaves. I wrote a short descriptive paragraph about the sound of rain in our dialect handbook and added a recording so readers could hear that distinctive ending.","words":[{"en":"derive","zh":"源自、得到"},{"en":"descriptive","zh":"描述性的"},{"en":"dialect","zh":"方言"},{"en":"distinction","zh":"區別；卓越"},{"en":"distinctive","zh":"獨特的"}]},{"id":"L5-D08","level":5,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"沿著階梯走下山坡，我們終於到了當天的目的地，一座有圓頂的舊天文臺。為了做出比例正確的模型，我量了圓頂的直徑，朋友則記下每扇窗戶的尺寸。","en":"Descending the steps down the hill, we finally reached that day's destination, an old observatory with a dome. To make a model with the right proportions, I measured the diameter of the dome, and my friend wrote down the dimensions of every window.","words":[{"en":"descend","zh":"下降；是……的後代"},{"en":"destination","zh":"目的地"},{"en":"diameter","zh":"直徑"},{"en":"dimension","zh":"尺寸；維度；層面"},{"en":"dome","zh":"圓頂"}]},{"id":"L5-D09","level":5,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"帶弟弟回診時，媽媽除了帶備用尿布，還帶了筆記，上面記著弟弟的消化問題是在什麼時候開始的。醫師問過病史、完成檢查後，診斷出弟弟對牛奶過敏，並把診斷寫進病歷。","en":"When Mom took my little brother back to the doctor, she brought spare diapers and her notes on when his digestion problems began. After asking about his history and finishing the exam, the doctor diagnosed him with a milk allergy and wrote the diagnosis in his record.","words":[{"en":"diagnose","zh":"診斷"},{"en":"diagnosis","zh":"診斷"},{"en":"diaper","zh":"尿布"},{"en":"digestion","zh":"消化"}]},{"id":"L5-D10","level":5,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"教練依口音挑選球員，我很不贊成他這樣歧視新生。我想向校方反映，又怕學弟遭到報復，一時陷入兩難。直到我在校內通訊錄裡找到受理歧視申訴的單位，才決定先匿名詢問。","en":"The coach chose players by their accents, and I strongly disapproved of him discriminating against new students. I wanted to report it to the school but was afraid the younger students would be punished, so I was caught in a dilemma. Not until I found the office that handles discrimination complaints in the school directory did I decide to ask anonymously first.","words":[{"en":"dilemma","zh":"兩難、困境"},{"en":"directory","zh":"名錄、目錄"},{"en":"disapprove","zh":"不贊成"},{"en":"discriminate","zh":"歧視；區別"},{"en":"discrimination","zh":"歧視"}]},{"id":"L5-D11","level":5,"letter":"D","n":11,"zh":"直播時，聊天室裡一直跳出新訊息，讓正在讀提詞稿的我分心。排練時好不容易建立的信心一點一滴地消退。更糟的是，有人拔掉麥克風的電源，打斷了直播。","en":"During the livestream, new messages kept popping up in the chat and distracted me while I was reading from the script. The confidence I had built up in rehearsal diminished bit by bit. Worse, someone unplugged the microphone, disconnected it, and disrupted the stream.","words":[{"en":"diminish","zh":"減少、縮小"},{"en":"disconnect","zh":"切斷、中斷連線"},{"en":"disrupt","zh":"擾亂、中斷"},{"en":"distract","zh":"使分心"}]},{"id":"L5-D12","level":5,"letter":"D","n":12,"zh":"這部紀錄片從一份泛黃的文件談起，說明某個宗教的教義如何影響村民的日常生活。映後座談時，一位村民指出，關於這段歷史的公共討論早已超出宗教領域，連村裡的土地分配也成了話題。","en":"This documentary begins with a yellowed document and explains how the doctrine of a religion shaped the daily lives of villagers. At the talk after the film, a villager pointed out that public discourse about this history had long gone beyond the domain of religion and even included how land in the village was divided.","words":[{"en":"discourse","zh":"論述、談話"},{"en":"doctrine","zh":"教義、主義"},{"en":"document","zh":"文件；記錄"},{"en":"documentary","zh":"紀錄片"},{"en":"domain","zh":"領域；網域"}]},{"id":"L5-D13","level":5,"letter":"D","n":13,"zh":"嚴重旱災期間，麵包店門口每天都有人排隊領水。老闆說，手邊那點水連鹽都溶解不了，更別說揉出麵糰了。生意已經夠慘了，偏偏那天他只烤出六條吐司。","en":"During the severe drought, people lined up for water at the bakery every day. The owner said the little water he had could not even dissolve salt, let alone make dough. Business was already dreadful, and that day he only baked six loaves of bread.","words":[{"en":"dissolve","zh":"溶解、解散"},{"en":"dough","zh":"麵團"},{"en":"dreadful","zh":"可怕的"},{"en":"drought","zh":"乾旱"}]},{"id":"L5-E01","level":5,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"學了生態學後，我才知道校園池塘也是一個生態系。老師要我們評估填平池塘的生態影響，有位同學就先去查，那種已經好幾年沒人見過的青蛙究竟是不是已經絕種了。","en":"After studying ecology, I learned that the school pond is also an ecosystem. The teacher asked us to assess the ecological effects of filling in the pond, so one classmate first checked whether a frog nobody had seen for years was already extinct.","words":[{"en":"ecological","zh":"生態的"},{"en":"ecology","zh":"生態（學）"},{"en":"ecosystem","zh":"生態系"},{"en":"extinct","zh":"絕種的"}]},{"id":"L5-E02","level":5,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"看著口才出眾的學妹拿到演講冠軍，我承認自己很羨慕她。直到我問她能不能多談談準備的過程，才知道隊友幫她練習了多久。這才讓我放下自尊，開口請別人指點。","en":"Watching my eloquent junior win the speech contest, I admit I was envious of her. Not until I asked her to tell me more about how she prepared did I learn how long her teammates had practiced with her. That finally made me put aside my ego and ask others for advice.","words":[{"en":"ego","zh":"自我"},{"en":"eloquent","zh":"口才好的、有說服力的"},{"en":"envious","zh":"羨慕的、嫉妒的"}]},{"id":"L5-E03","level":5,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"依現行規定，只有設籍本鎮的高中生才有資格申請免費乘車證。領到證的學生就有權免費搭車。一群熱心的家長認為，為了教育公平，規定得改。住在鄰村的學生每天也走同一條山路上學，把他們排除在外並不公平。","en":"Under the current rules, only high school students registered in this town are eligible to apply for a free bus pass, and students with a pass are entitled to ride for free. A group of enthusiastic parents think the rule must change for the sake of equity in education. Students from the next village walk the same mountain road to school every day, and excluding them is not fair.","words":[{"en":"eligible","zh":"有資格的"},{"en":"enthusiastic","zh":"熱情的、熱衷的"},{"en":"entitle","zh":"給予權利（資格）；定名為"},{"en":"equity","zh":"公平；股權"},{"en":"exclude","zh":"排除"}]},{"id":"L5-E04","level":5,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"退休後，教練欣然接受創業的挑戰，成為一名企業家。她設想的社會企業會雇用退役選手。取得選手協會的公開支持後，她把新公司登記為獨立的法律實體。","en":"After retiring, the coach embraced the challenge of starting a business and became an entrepreneur. The social enterprise she envisions will hire retired athletes. After getting a public endorsement from the athletes' association, she registered her new company as an independent legal entity.","words":[{"en":"embrace","zh":"擁抱；欣然接受"},{"en":"endorse(ment)","zh":"支持、背書、代言"},{"en":"enterprise","zh":"企業、事業"},{"en":"entity","zh":"實體"},{"en":"entrepreneur","zh":"創業家、企業家"},{"en":"envision","zh":"想像、展望"}]},{"id":"L5-E05","level":5,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"社團把行車距離代入方程式，算出一趟校車的碳排放量，相當於幾輛小客車走同一段路的排放量。大家才發現，若空車繞路太遠，過度的油耗就會讓排放量超過原先的估計。","en":"The club put the driving distance into an equation and calculated that the carbon emissions of one school bus trip were equivalent to those of several cars traveling the same route. Only then did everyone realize that if an empty bus took too long a detour, excessive fuel use would make the emissions exceed the original estimate.","words":[{"en":"emission","zh":"排放（物）"},{"en":"equation","zh":"方程式、等式"},{"en":"equivalent","zh":"相等的；相等物"},{"en":"exceed","zh":"超過、超越"},{"en":"excessive","zh":"過度的、過多的"}]},{"id":"L5-E06","level":5,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"這一集節目用三段老錄音回顧地方廣播的演變。當年一場流行病讓居民不敢外出，原本只播點歌的電台，逐漸發展成大家交換消息的地方。","en":"This episode of the show uses three old recordings to look back at the evolution of local radio. When an epidemic once kept residents from going out, a station that only played song requests gradually evolved into a place where everyone exchanged news.","words":[{"en":"epidemic","zh":"流行病、（疾病）流行"},{"en":"episode","zh":"（影集的）一集；一段經歷"},{"en":"evolution","zh":"演化、發展"},{"en":"evolve","zh":"演化、逐漸發展"}]},{"id":"L5-E07","level":5,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"我到車站替爸爸跑腿，正要踏上電扶梯，樓下便爆出一陣歡呼。妹妹指著大廳驚呼：「快看那棵樹！」原來志工剛在那裡豎起一棵有兩層樓高的聖誕樹。","en":"I was running an errand for Dad at the station and was about to step onto the escalator when cheers erupted downstairs. My sister pointed at the hall and exclaimed, \\"Look at that tree!\\" Volunteers had just erected a two-story Christmas tree there.","words":[{"en":"erect","zh":"豎立、建造；直立的"},{"en":"errand","zh":"差事、跑腿"},{"en":"erupt","zh":"爆發"},{"en":"escalator","zh":"手扶梯"},{"en":"exclaim","zh":"驚叫、大聲說"}]},{"id":"L5-E08","level":5,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"那位作家被迫流亡時，家族的地產也被沒收了。他在給女兒的信裡寫道，家的本質在於彼此照顧。有一天房子會倒，而他相信，家人之間的愛是永恆的。","en":"When the writer was forced into exile, his family's estate was taken away. In a letter to his daughter, he wrote that the essence of a home is taking care of each other. One day the house would fall, but he believed the love between family members was eternal.","words":[{"en":"essence","zh":"本質、精華"},{"en":"estate","zh":"房地產；遺產"},{"en":"eternal","zh":"永恆的、永遠的"},{"en":"ethic(s)","zh":"倫理、道德規範"},{"en":"exile","zh":"流亡、放逐"}]},{"id":"L5-E09","level":5,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"校刊爭取到獨家專訪，受訪者卻要求事先刪掉所有負面提問。編輯翻開新聞倫理守則，指出裡頭有條明文規定，受訪者無權決定問題的去留。她請大家想想，接受這個條件會引起哪些倫理問題。","en":"The school magazine won an exclusive interview, but the person being interviewed demanded that all negative questions be removed in advance. The editor opened the code of journalism ethics and pointed out an explicit rule that people being interviewed have no right to decide which questions stay. She asked everyone to think about what ethical problems accepting this condition would raise.","words":[{"en":"ethic(s)","zh":"倫理、道德規範"},{"en":"ethical","zh":"倫理的、道德的"},{"en":"exclusive","zh":"獨家的、專用的"},{"en":"explicit","zh":"明確的、清楚的"}]},{"id":"L5-E10","level":5,"letter":"E","n":10,"zh":"攝影師說，那隻鳥隔了兩年還認得他。我原以為這是誇張的說法。直到看見那隻鳥在好幾個盒子裡挑出他拿過的那個，我才開始好奇，牠這番非凡的表現究竟是靠出眾的記憶力，還是另有線索。","en":"The photographer said the bird still recognized him after two years. I thought it was an exaggeration. Not until I saw the bird pick out, from several boxes, the one he had touched did I begin to wonder whether this extraordinary act came from an exceptional memory or some other clue.","words":[{"en":"exaggeration","zh":"誇大"},{"en":"exceptional","zh":"傑出的；例外的"},{"en":"extraordinary","zh":"非凡的、特別的"}]},{"id":"L5-E11","level":5,"letter":"E","n":11,"zh":"活動主管批准路線圖後，原定由我執行改道計畫。偏偏施工單位申請延長工期，打亂了計畫的執行。我只好先派人到舊路口等候跑者。","en":"After the event's executive approved the route map, I was supposed to execute the detour plan. But the construction team asked for an extension of their work period, which disrupted the execution of the plan. I had to send someone to wait for the runners at the old crossing first.","words":[{"en":"ethic(s)","zh":"倫理、道德規範"},{"en":"execute","zh":"執行；處決"},{"en":"execution","zh":"執行；處決"},{"en":"executive","zh":"主管；行政的"},{"en":"extension","zh":"延長、擴展；分機"}]},{"id":"L5-E12","level":5,"letter":"E","n":12,"zh":"植物園借給我們一本雨林探險的筆記，裡頭記錄了隊員勘查一片廣闊濕地的經過。要不是當地嚮導對植物有專門知識，隊員就認不出那幾種從海外傳入的外來植物。","en":"The botanical garden lent us a notebook from a rainforest expedition, recording how the team explored a vast wetland. Without the local guide's expertise in plants, the team members could not have recognized several exotic plants brought in from overseas.","words":[{"en":"ethic(s)","zh":"倫理、道德規範"},{"en":"exotic","zh":"異國風情的"},{"en":"expedition","zh":"遠征、探險隊"},{"en":"expertise","zh":"專業知識（技能）"}]},{"id":"L5-E13","level":5,"letter":"E","n":13,"zh":"為了開採山裡的銅礦，當年的公司沿著山壁建了一座機房。如今機房外牆還看得到以前的標語，館方正在尋求外部資金，希望能趕在字跡消失之前修好那面牆。","en":"To exploit the copper in the mountains, the company built a machine house against the mountainside. You can still see old slogans on the exterior wall, and the museum is looking for external funding, hoping to repair the wall before the words disappear.","words":[{"en":"exploit","zh":"利用、剝削；開發"},{"en":"exterior","zh":"外部；外部的"},{"en":"external","zh":"外部的"}]},{"id":"L5-F01","level":5,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"服裝師拿出一塊在燈下會變色的布料，解釋織入其中的纖維是怎麼反光的。這個巧思讓我著迷。等到演員一轉身、整件斗篷由藍轉金，我才看見那舞臺效果有多精彩。","en":"The costume designer took out a fabric that changes color under the lights and explained how the fibers woven into it reflect light. This clever idea fascinated me. When the actor turned around and the whole cape changed from blue to gold, I saw how fabulous the stage effect was.","words":[{"en":"fabric","zh":"布料；結構"},{"en":"fabulous","zh":"極好的、很棒的"},{"en":"fascinate","zh":"使著迷"},{"en":"fiber","zh":"纖維"}]},{"id":"L5-F02","level":5,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"為了讓本地生和交換生有更多交談的機會，全校教師同意讓午休座位安排更有彈性。半個學期下來，這些談話不但讓我說英語更流利，也幫我和隔壁班的同學培養出友誼。","en":"To give local students and exchange students more chances to talk, the school's faculty agreed to give more flexibility to lunch seating. Half a term later, these talks not only improved my fluency in English but also helped me foster friendships with students from the class next door.","words":[{"en":"faculty","zh":"（大學）教職員；能力"},{"en":"flexibility","zh":"彈性、靈活性"},{"en":"fluency","zh":"流利"},{"en":"foster","zh":"培養、促進；寄養的"}]},{"id":"L5-F03","level":5,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"聯邦政府公布新會計年度的預算後，負責港口運輸的車隊才有錢多請兩名司機運送貨物。以前，司機連值兩班累積的疲勞，曾讓好幾批貨延遲抵達。","en":"After the federal government announced the budget for the new fiscal year, the fleet that carries goods at the port finally had money to hire two more drivers to move freight. Before, the fatigue from drivers working two shifts in a row had delayed several shipments.","words":[{"en":"fatigue","zh":"疲勞"},{"en":"federal","zh":"聯邦的"},{"en":"fiscal","zh":"財政的"},{"en":"fleet","zh":"艦隊、車隊"},{"en":"freight","zh":"貨物、貨運"}]},{"id":"L5-F04","level":5,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"地下室角落積了一灘有惡臭的液體，旁邊還散落著玻璃碎片。水電師傅拆開幫浦，才發現原本用來過濾雜質的濾網早就破了。","en":"There was a pool of foul-smelling fluid in the corner of the basement, with fragments of glass scattered beside it. When the plumber took apart the pump, he found that the filter meant to remove dirt had long been broken.","words":[{"en":"filter","zh":"過濾器；過濾"},{"en":"fluid","zh":"液體；流動的"},{"en":"foul","zh":"難聞的、骯髒的；犯規"},{"en":"fragment","zh":"碎片、片段"}]},{"id":"L5-F05","level":5,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"這場青年論壇改採訪談形式。主持人只訂出討論的架構，把提問留給聽眾。由於兩位來賓都堅持請對方先說，主持人最後只好擲硬幣決定順序。","en":"This youth forum changed to an interview format. The host only set the framework for the discussion and left the questions to the audience. Since both guests insisted that the other speak first, the host finally had to flip a coin to decide the order.","words":[{"en":"flip","zh":"翻轉、輕拋"},{"en":"format","zh":"格式、形式"},{"en":"forum","zh":"論壇"},{"en":"framework","zh":"架構、框架"}]},{"id":"L5-F06","level":5,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"對方說只收市價的一小部分，就能讓我取得這家咖啡店的加盟經營權。要不是我先打電話給總公司，就不會知道有人偽造了證書，也會來不及識破這場詐騙。","en":"The man said that for only a fraction of the market price, I could get the franchise for this coffee shop. If I had not called the head office first, I would not have learned that someone had forged the certificate, and I would have been too late to see through the fraud.","words":[{"en":"forge","zh":"偽造；鍛造"},{"en":"fraction","zh":"小部分；分數"},{"en":"franchise","zh":"加盟經營權、連鎖店"},{"en":"fraud","zh":"詐欺、騙局"}]},{"id":"L5-F07","level":5,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"老師攤開十八世紀的海圖，要我們指出當時歐洲探險家眼中的未知邊疆。我圈了一座小島，同桌卻提醒我，島上的居民早已替每一處海灣取了名字。","en":"The teacher spread out an eighteenth-century sea chart and asked us to point out the unknown frontier in the eyes of European explorers at that time. I circled a small island, but my deskmate reminded me that the people living there had long ago named every bay.","words":[{"en":"frontier","zh":"邊境；最前線"}]},{"id":"L5-G01","level":5,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"投影一亮，整個星系就在頭頂旋轉，第一次來天文館的妹妹倒抽了一口氣。導覽員請她想想，引力是怎麼把這麼多恆星聚在一起的。","en":"When the projector came on and the whole galaxy turned above our heads, my sister, visiting the planetarium for the first time, gasped. The guide asked her to think about how gravity holds so many stars together.","words":[{"en":"galaxy","zh":"星系、銀河"},{"en":"gasp","zh":"喘氣"},{"en":"gravity","zh":"重力、地心引力"}]},{"id":"L5-G02","level":5,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"社區聚會辦到一半突然停電，管理員推出一台腳踏發電機，踩出足夠的電力讓燈再度亮起。正對著燈泡的人都伸手遮住刺眼的強光。","en":"The power went out in the middle of the community gathering, so the manager brought out a bicycle generator and pedaled to generate enough electricity to turn the lights back on. People facing the bulb raised their hands to block the glare.","words":[{"en":"gathering","zh":"聚會、集會"},{"en":"generate","zh":"產生"},{"en":"generator","zh":"發電機"},{"en":"glare","zh":"怒視；刺眼的光"}]},{"id":"L5-G03","level":5,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"一筆助學金讓我得以參加暑期遺傳學課程。阿公問我豌豆的花色怎麼遺傳，我就做了一張圖，畫出這項遺傳特徵如何從親代傳給子代。","en":"A grant enabled me to take a summer course in genetics. When Grandpa asked me how the flower color of peas is passed on, I made a graphic showing how this genetic trait passes from parents to offspring.","words":[{"en":"genetic","zh":"基因的、遺傳的"},{"en":"genetics","zh":"遺傳學"},{"en":"grant","zh":"補助金；授予、同意"},{"en":"graphic","zh":"圖像的；生動的"}]},{"id":"L5-G04","level":5,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"這位導演以往只拍喜劇，這次第一次嘗試悲劇這種類型。女主角還在為母親的離世悲傷。她走進陰暗的房間，看見母親為她縫的華麗戲服，一句話也說不出來。","en":"This director used to make only comedies, and this is his first try at the genre of tragedy. The heroine is still grieving for her mother. She walks into a gloomy room, sees the gorgeous costume her mother sewed for her, and cannot say a word.","words":[{"en":"genre","zh":"類型、體裁"},{"en":"gloomy","zh":"陰暗的、憂鬱的"},{"en":"gorgeous","zh":"極美的、非常漂亮的"},{"en":"grieve","zh":"悲傷"}]},{"id":"L5-G05","level":5,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"帳本上記的是拍賣總收入，扣掉油錢後，船員能分到的錢少得可憐。船長終於肯面對嚴峻的現實。要不是他一時貪心，堅持再往外海追一群魚，這趟出海就不至於幾乎白忙一場。","en":"The account book recorded the gross income from the auction, and after paying for fuel, the crew's share was pitifully small. The captain finally faced the grim reality. If not for his greed in insisting on chasing another school of fish farther out to sea, the trip would not have been almost a waste.","words":[{"en":"greed","zh":"貪婪"},{"en":"grim","zh":"嚴肅的、令人沮喪的"},{"en":"gross","zh":"總的、毛額的；噁心的"}]},{"id":"L5-G06","level":5,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"外公要我先讀營隊的備餐指南，再握牢刀柄，替剛買回來的魚去除內臟。等炭火穩了，他才教我怎麼在烤架上烤魚。","en":"Grandpa asked me to read the camp's cooking guidelines first and then get a firm grip on the knife to gut the fish we had just bought. When the charcoal fire was steady, he taught me how to grill the fish.","words":[{"en":"grill","zh":"烤架；燒烤"},{"en":"grip","zh":"緊握、抓牢"},{"en":"guideline","zh":"指導方針、準則"},{"en":"gut","zh":"腸道、內臟；勇氣（guts）"}]},{"id":"L5-H01","level":5,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"新建住宅旁的排水溝直通青蛙的棲地。我們正要把一個廢輪胎拖上岸，一名志工叫大家先戴上厚手套。他說，藏在泥裡的碎玻璃才是最難察覺的危險。","en":"The drain beside the new housing leads straight to the frogs' habitat. We were about to haul an old tire onto the bank when a volunteer told everyone to put on thick gloves first. He said broken glass hidden in the mud was the hardest hazard to notice.","words":[{"en":"habitat","zh":"棲息地"},{"en":"haul","zh":"拖、拉、搬運"},{"en":"hazard","zh":"危險、危害"},{"en":"housing","zh":"住宅、住房"}]},{"id":"L5-H02","level":5,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"阿姨是這間老藥鋪唯一的繼承人，她本來可以把房子賣掉。不過，辨認藥草的本事也是家族代代相傳的文化遺產。這也就是她決定保留藥櫃、在週末開門教鄰居認藥草的原因。","en":"My aunt is the only heir to this old herbal medicine shop, and she could have sold it. However, the skill of recognizing herbs is also a family heritage passed down for generations. Hence, she decided to keep the medicine cabinets and open the shop on weekends to teach neighbors about herbs.","words":[{"en":"heir","zh":"繼承人"},{"en":"hence","zh":"因此"},{"en":"herb","zh":"香草、藥草"},{"en":"heritage","zh":"遺產、傳統"}]},{"id":"L5-H03","level":5,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"曲棍球決賽中，隊長在場邊等候判決，球桿橫放在膝上，與地面平行。裁判把球權判給我們，他卻主動說是自己把球碰出界。這個光明磊落的舉動，成了整場比賽最精彩的一幕。","en":"In the hockey final, the captain waited on the side for the decision, holding his stick across his knees in a horizontal line. The referee gave us the puck, but he admitted that he was the one who knocked it out. This honorable act became the highlight of the whole game.","words":[{"en":"highlight","zh":"強調；最精彩的部分"},{"en":"hockey","zh":"冰上曲棍球、曲棍球"},{"en":"honorable","zh":"可敬的、光榮的"},{"en":"horizontal","zh":"水平的"}]},{"id":"L5-H04","level":5,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"聽見狼群夜裡嗥叫，實習生提出一個假說，認為狼嗥叫的次數和體內某種壓力荷爾蒙的濃度有關。指導員請他規劃該記錄哪些資料，才能檢驗這個想法。","en":"Hearing wolves howl at night, the intern came up with a hypothesis that the number of howls is related to the level of a stress hormone in their bodies. The instructor asked him to plan what data to record to test this idea.","words":[{"en":"hormone","zh":"荷爾蒙"},{"en":"howl","zh":"嚎叫"},{"en":"hypothesis","zh":"假設"}]},{"id":"L5-H05","level":5,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"排演時，人質已經獲釋，扮演守衛的同學卻依舊用充滿敵意的眼神看著他。導演喊停，問他能否從劇本裡找出一句話，解釋守衛的敵意從何而來。","en":"During rehearsal, the hostage had already been released, but the classmate playing the guard still looked at him with hostile eyes. The director stopped the scene and asked if he could find a line in the script that explained where the guard's hostility came from.","words":[{"en":"hostage","zh":"人質"},{"en":"hostile","zh":"有敵意的"},{"en":"hostility","zh":"敵意、敵對"}]},{"id":"L5-I01","level":5,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"點一下星球圖示，螢幕上就會展開一片廣大的星空。設計師重複使用同一組星圖，營造出太空無限延伸的錯覺。","en":"When you tap the planet icon, an immense starry sky opens on the screen. The designer used the same set of star maps again and again to create the illusion that space goes on forever.","words":[{"en":"icon","zh":"圖示；偶像"},{"en":"illusion","zh":"錯覺、幻想"},{"en":"immense","zh":"巨大的"}]},{"id":"L5-I02","level":5,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"有人在投書裡罵持不同意識形態的人是笨蛋。編輯說，如果我們對這種辱罵漠不關心，保持沉默，就會讓讀者以為我們也贊同這句話。","en":"Someone in a letter to the editor called people with a different ideology idiots. The editor said that if we stayed indifferent to such insults and kept silent, readers would think we agreed.","words":[{"en":"ideology","zh":"意識形態"},{"en":"idiot","zh":"白痴、笨蛋"},{"en":"indifferent","zh":"漠不關心的"}]},{"id":"L5-I03","level":5,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"孩子問，這種病毒會感染哪些動物，哪些動物對它有免疫力。獸醫拿出模型示範如何注射疫苗，也讓孩子看清楚每次注射前得做哪些準備。","en":"A child asked which animals this virus can infect and which animals are immune to it. The vet took out a model to show how to inject the vaccine and let the children see clearly what preparation is needed before each injection.","words":[{"en":"immune","zh":"免疫的"},{"en":"infect","zh":"傳染、感染"},{"en":"inject","zh":"注射、注入"},{"en":"injection","zh":"注射、打針"}]},{"id":"L5-I04","level":5,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"學生發起一項倡議，希望改善通學路線上的公共建設。他們希望市府下學期就實施新計畫。對附近店家而言，計畫裡的送貨車專屬停靠區才是支持它的誘因。","en":"Students started an initiative to improve the infrastructure along their route to school. They hope the city will implement the new plan next term. For nearby shops, the special stopping area for delivery trucks in the plan is the real incentive to support it.","words":[{"en":"implement","zh":"實施、執行"},{"en":"incentive","zh":"獎勵、誘因"},{"en":"infrastructure","zh":"基礎建設"},{"en":"initiative","zh":"主動性；倡議"}]},{"id":"L5-I05","level":5,"letter":"I","n":5,"zh":"半夜看到限量球鞋，我一時衝動就按下購買。要是我每次都縱容自己的購物慾，月底缺錢就會成為無法避免的結果。","en":"When I saw limited-edition sneakers late at night, I bought them on impulse. If I indulge my shopping urges every time, running out of money at the end of the month will be inevitable.","words":[{"en":"impulse","zh":"衝動、驅使"},{"en":"indulge","zh":"沉溺、放縱"},{"en":"inevitable","zh":"不可避免的、必然的"}]},{"id":"L5-I06","level":5,"letter":"I","n":6,"zh":"編圖鑑時，我們把部落嚮導提供的本地原生植物俗名收進書裡。上山後我才明白書末那份索引有多不可或缺。少了它，我根本沒辦法用俗名查到沿途看見的植物。","en":"While making a field guide, we included the common names of indigenous plants given by guides from the tribe. Only after we went up the mountain did I understand how indispensable the index at the back of the book was. Without it, I could not have looked up the plants I saw along the way by their common names.","words":[{"en":"index","zh":"索引；指數"},{"en":"indigenous","zh":"原住民的、本土的"},{"en":"indispensable","zh":"不可或缺的"}]},{"id":"L5-I07","level":5,"letter":"I","n":7,"zh":"姊姊繼承茶園後，便展開一項訪談計畫。老茶農讓她深入了解在山區種茶固有的缺水風險，她因此重新考慮原先的種植方式。","en":"After my sister inherited the tea garden, she initiated an interview project. The old tea farmers gave her insight into the risk of water shortages inherent in growing tea in the mountains, so she reconsidered her original way of planting.","words":[{"en":"inherent","zh":"固有的、與生俱來的"},{"en":"inherit","zh":"繼承、遺傳"},{"en":"initiate","zh":"開始、發起"},{"en":"insight","zh":"洞察力、深刻的見解"}]},{"id":"L5-I08","level":5,"letter":"I","n":8,"zh":"第九局滿壘時，教練竟要強打者短打，看台上的我覺得這個決定太瘋狂。賽後捕手提出另一種解讀，說教練的意圖是趁守備員退得太深時搶下一分。","en":"With the bases loaded in the ninth inning, the coach told a power hitter to bunt, and from the stands I thought the decision was insane. After the game, the catcher offered a different interpretation. He said the coach's intent was to steal a run while the fielders were standing too far back.","words":[{"en":"inning","zh":"（棒球的）一局"},{"en":"insane","zh":"瘋狂的"},{"en":"intent","zh":"意圖；專注的"},{"en":"interpretation","zh":"解釋、詮釋"}]},{"id":"L5-I09","level":5,"letter":"I","n":9,"zh":"這套聲音導覽系統是一間聲學研究所的創新成果，已有三家文化機構借用這套設備。等揚聲器安裝完成，觀眾就能循著叫賣聲逛百年前的市場，用這種創新的方式體驗歷史。","en":"This audio tour system is an innovation from an acoustics institute, and three cultural institutions have already borrowed it. Once the speaker installation is finished, visitors can follow the calls of street sellers through a market from a hundred years ago, experiencing history in an innovative way.","words":[{"en":"innovation","zh":"創新"},{"en":"innovative","zh":"創新的"},{"en":"installation","zh":"安裝；裝置"},{"en":"institute","zh":"學院、研究所"},{"en":"institution","zh":"機構；制度"}]},{"id":"L5-I10","level":5,"letter":"I","n":10,"zh":"建築師希望把閱覽室融入老車站，同時保留候車室完整的內部格局。為了讓新舊空間順利整合，她留下原來的長椅，沿著窗邊加設書架。","en":"The architect hopes to incorporate a reading room into the old station while keeping the interior of the waiting room intact. To integrate the old and new spaces smoothly, she kept the original benches and added shelves along the windows.","words":[{"en":"incorporate","zh":"納入、合併"},{"en":"intact","zh":"完整無缺的"},{"en":"integrate","zh":"整合、融入"},{"en":"interior","zh":"內部（的）、室內"}]},{"id":"L5-I11","level":5,"letter":"I","n":11,"zh":"收到市民的書面詢問後，調查員公布了訪查紀錄。承包商先前曾請她的主管介入，要求她刪去對他不利的內容。她拒絕改動紀錄，展現了應有的正直。","en":"After receiving a written inquiry from a citizen, the investigator made her records public. The contractor had asked her boss to make an intervention and get her to delete content that was bad for him. She refused to change her records, showing the integrity she should have.","words":[{"en":"inquiry","zh":"詢問、調查"},{"en":"integrity","zh":"正直、誠信；完整"},{"en":"intervention","zh":"介入、干預"},{"en":"investigator","zh":"調查員"}]},{"id":"L5-I12","level":5,"letter":"I","n":12,"zh":"每隔十分鐘，直播訊號受到的干擾就會加劇。最諷刺的是，技師查到最後，發現干擾源竟是原本為了改善收訊而新裝的設備。","en":"Every ten minutes, the interference with the live signal grew more intense. The greatest irony was that when the technician finally traced it, the source turned out to be new equipment installed to improve reception.","words":[{"en":"interference","zh":"干擾、干涉"},{"en":"irony","zh":"諷刺、反諷"}]},{"id":"L5-J01","level":5,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"主修新聞學的姊姊跟著一位記者，去聽一場介紹少年司法程序的講座。回家後，她重寫了一篇少年案件的報導，刪去讀者能用來認出當事人的細節。","en":"My sister, who majors in journalism, went with a journalist to a lecture on the judicial process for juvenile cases. When she got home, she rewrote a news story about a juvenile case and removed the details readers could use to identify the people involved.","words":[{"en":"journalism","zh":"新聞業、新聞學"},{"en":"journalist","zh":"記者"},{"en":"judicial","zh":"司法的"},{"en":"juvenile","zh":"青少年的"}]},{"id":"L5-J02","level":5,"letter":"J","n":2,"zh":"模擬法庭上，證人說他把水壺摔在地上，是為了叫醒熟睡的住客。陪審團得判斷，這個理由是否足以證明他的行為正當。","en":"In the mock trial, the witness said he threw the jug on the floor to wake up a guest who was sound asleep. The jury had to decide whether this reason was enough to justify what he did.","words":[{"en":"jug","zh":"水壺、罐"},{"en":"jury","zh":"陪審團；評審團"},{"en":"justify","zh":"證明……是正當的"}]},{"id":"L5-K01","level":5,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"劇本裡的歹徒打算綁架主角的哥哥，卻在散場的人群裡抓錯了人。我建議編劇加一幕，讓弟弟先借走哥哥那件顯眼的紅外套，這樣觀眾就看得懂歹徒為什麼會認錯。","en":"The villain in the script planned to kidnap the main character's brother but grabbed the wrong person in the crowd leaving the theater. I suggested that the writer add a scene where the younger brother borrows his brother's eye-catching red jacket first, so the audience would understand why the villain got the wrong person.","words":[{"en":"kidnap","zh":"綁架"}]},{"id":"L5-L01","level":5,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"房東堅稱扣下押金有正當理由，房客於是提起民事訴訟。她保留了入住前就拍下的漏水照片，希望釐清雙方各自該負多少賠償責任。","en":"The landlord insisted he had a legitimate reason to keep the deposit, so the tenant filed a lawsuit. She had kept photos of the leak taken before she moved in, hoping to make clear how much liability each side should bear.","words":[{"en":"landlord","zh":"房東、地主"},{"en":"lawsuit","zh":"訴訟、官司"},{"en":"legitimate","zh":"合法的、正當的"},{"en":"liability","zh":"（法律）責任；負債"}]},{"id":"L5-L02","level":5,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"修復師用雷射清除壁畫上的一層污垢。她把雷射能量調低，唯恐連下方脆弱的顏料也一起去掉。","en":"The restorer used a laser to remove a layer of dirt from the mural. She turned the laser's power down lest the fragile paint underneath come off too.","words":[{"en":"laser","zh":"雷射"},{"en":"layer","zh":"層"},{"en":"lest","zh":"以免、唯恐"}]},{"id":"L5-L03","level":5,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"一位立法委員用圖表解釋立法程序，並說明擬議中的法規會怎麼影響夜市攤商。聽完攤商的證詞後，他認為草案在這個會期通過的機會已經降低。","en":"A lawmaker used a chart to explain the legislative process and how the proposed legislation would affect night market vendors. After hearing the vendors speak, he thought the likelihood of the bill passing this session had dropped.","words":[{"en":"lawmaker","zh":"立法者"},{"en":"legislation","zh":"立法、法規"},{"en":"legislative","zh":"立法的"},{"en":"likelihood","zh":"可能性"}]},{"id":"L5-L04","level":5,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"聯盟為傳奇投手舉辦了球衣退休儀式。對他帶過的球員而言，他留下最珍貴的遺產，是他總肯留下來陪新人加練。如今他們當了教練，也同樣留下來陪新人。","en":"The league held a ceremony to retire the legendary pitcher's jersey. For the players he coached, his most precious legacy was that he always stayed to give new players extra practice. Now that they are coaches, they likewise stay with new players.","words":[{"en":"league","zh":"聯盟"},{"en":"legacy","zh":"遺產、遺留下來的東西"},{"en":"legendary","zh":"傳奇的"},{"en":"likewise","zh":"同樣地、也"}]},{"id":"L5-L05","level":5,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"航班延誤時，有人在候機室教孩子捏陶。等我趕到，妹妹已經把一小團黏土搓成長條，正要把兩端接起來做成一個圈。","en":"While our flight was delayed, someone in the lounge taught children to make pottery. By the time I got there, my sister had already rolled a lump of clay into a long strip and was about to join the two ends to make a loop.","words":[{"en":"loop","zh":"環、圈"},{"en":"lounge","zh":"休息室、交誼廳"},{"en":"lump","zh":"腫塊；塊"}]},{"id":"L5-M01","level":5,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"當時，穿粉紅色戲服的男英雄仍很少出現在主流戲劇裡。有人嘲弄男舞者，說他那樣穿不夠有男子氣概，服裝師就翻開畫冊，給大家看古代神話裡英雄的裝扮。","en":"Back then, male heroes in pink costumes still seldom appeared in mainstream plays. When someone mocked the male dancer, saying he was not masculine enough dressed like that, the costume designer opened an art book and showed everyone how heroes in ancient myths were dressed.","words":[{"en":"mainstream","zh":"主流"},{"en":"masculine","zh":"男性的、陽性的"},{"en":"mock","zh":"嘲笑；模擬的"},{"en":"myth","zh":"神話；迷思"}]},{"id":"L5-M02","level":5,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"市議會通過一項正式命令，要求山頂豪宅暫停開放，直到陽台修好為止。負責這項工程的市政團隊也公開了過去十年的維修保養紀錄。","en":"The city council passed a formal mandate requiring the mansion on the hilltop to close until its balcony was repaired. The municipal team in charge of the project also made public its maintenance records for the past ten years.","words":[{"en":"maintenance","zh":"維修、保養"},{"en":"mandate","zh":"命令；授權"},{"en":"mansion","zh":"豪宅"},{"en":"municipal","zh":"市政的"}]},{"id":"L5-M03","level":5,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"正值鯨群遷徙途中，我們意外在繁忙的航道拍到一頭母鯨帶著小鯨。研究員把照片中的尾鰭和往年的紀錄比對，想弄清楚這些海洋哺乳動物每年走哪條路線。","en":"In the midst of the whales' migration, we unexpectedly filmed a mother whale with her calf in a busy shipping lane. Researchers compared the tails in our photos with records from past years to learn which routes these marine mammals take each year.","words":[{"en":"mammal","zh":"哺乳動物"},{"en":"marine","zh":"海洋的"},{"en":"midst","zh":"中間"},{"en":"migration","zh":"遷移、移居"}]},{"id":"L5-M04","level":5,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"唯一的售票平台曾被質疑利用壟斷地位操縱票價。經理的真正動機在內部信件中表露無遺。他想藉這場演唱會測試歌迷肯付多少錢。","en":"The only ticket platform was once accused of using its monopoly to manipulate ticket prices. The manager's real motive was clearly manifest in his internal emails. He wanted to use this concert to test how much fans would pay.","words":[{"en":"manifest","zh":"顯示；明顯的"},{"en":"manipulate","zh":"操縱、操作"},{"en":"monopoly","zh":"壟斷"},{"en":"motive","zh":"動機"}]},{"id":"L5-M05","level":5,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"那位身材健壯的拳手才從床墊上站起來，就因肩膀痠痛而呻吟。隊友見他連拳套都戴不上，便收起拳套，坐到他身後替他按摩肩膀。","en":"As soon as the muscular boxer got up from the mattress, he moaned because his shoulder was sore. Seeing that he could not even put on his gloves, his teammate put the gloves away and sat behind him to give his shoulder a massage.","words":[{"en":"massage","zh":"按摩"},{"en":"mattress","zh":"床墊"},{"en":"moan","zh":"呻吟；抱怨"},{"en":"muscular","zh":"肌肉的；強壯的"}]},{"id":"L5-M06","level":5,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"要把一座巨大的吊橋做成微型模型，最難的是把纜線固定在橋塔上。直到爺爺把模型安裝到底座、罩上玻璃，他才宣布這件傑作正式完工。","en":"The hardest part of making a miniature model of a massive suspension bridge was fixing the cables to the towers. Not until Grandpa mounted the model on its base and covered it with glass did he announce that the masterpiece was finished.","words":[{"en":"massive","zh":"巨大的、大量的"},{"en":"masterpiece","zh":"傑作"},{"en":"miniature","zh":"迷你的、小型的"},{"en":"mount","zh":"登上；安裝；增加"}]},{"id":"L5-M07","level":5,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"老師拆開雨棚，尋找伸縮裝置究竟卡在哪裡。在這段時間裡，我修改了控制程式，讓使用者能切換到手動模式。","en":"The teacher took the awning apart to find where the folding mechanism was stuck. In the meantime, I modified the control program so users could switch to manual mode.","words":[{"en":"meantime","zh":"同時、在這期間"},{"en":"mechanism","zh":"機制；機械裝置"},{"en":"mode","zh":"模式"},{"en":"modify","zh":"修改"}]},{"id":"L5-M08","level":5,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"在地方史館，我讀到一名傳教士的日記，裡面記著診所缺少哪些藥物。我原想根據日記算出當年這家診所病人的死亡率，卻發現他只記了死了幾人，沒有記下總共看過多少病人。","en":"At the local history museum, I read a missionary's diary that recorded which medications the clinic was short of. I wanted to use the diary to work out the clinic's mortality rate back then, but I found he only wrote how many people died, not how many patients he saw in total.","words":[{"en":"medication","zh":"藥物、藥品"},{"en":"missionary","zh":"傳教士"},{"en":"mortality","zh":"死亡率；必死性"}]},{"id":"L5-M09","level":5,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"朗讀到把月台比作傷口的那個隱喻時，我緊張得含糊地說了幾個字。寫作導師聽完告訴我，光是願意站上台讀自己的作品，就已是重要的里程碑。","en":"When I came to the metaphor comparing the platform to a wound, I was so nervous that I mumbled a few words. After listening, my writing mentor told me that just being willing to stand up and read my own work was an important milestone.","words":[{"en":"mentor","zh":"導師"},{"en":"metaphor","zh":"隱喻"},{"en":"milestone","zh":"里程碑"},{"en":"mumble","zh":"含糊地說"}]},{"id":"L5-M10","level":5,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"都會區的兩條公車路線即將合併。規劃師原以為影響極小，後來才發現夜班員工下班時會趕不上末班接駁車。他把車班延後半小時，讓轉乘的不便減到最低。","en":"Two bus routes in the metropolitan area are about to merge. The planner thought the effect would be minimal, but later he found that night-shift workers would miss the last shuttle after work. He moved the bus half an hour later to minimize the trouble of transferring.","words":[{"en":"merge","zh":"合併"},{"en":"metropolitan","zh":"大都會的"},{"en":"minimal","zh":"極小的、最低限度的"},{"en":"minimize","zh":"將……減到最少"}]},{"id":"L5-M11","level":5,"letter":"M","n":11,"zh":"科展攤位上擺著薄荷葉和一小碟芥末，我們輪流閉上眼睛聞。學姊拿出幾個氣味分子的模型，要我們判斷每個分子對應到剛才聞過的哪一種氣味。","en":"At the science fair booth there were mint leaves and a small dish of mustard, and we took turns smelling them with our eyes closed. A senior took out models of a few smell molecules and asked us to match each molecule to one of the smells we had just smelled.","words":[{"en":"mint","zh":"薄荷"},{"en":"molecule","zh":"分子"},{"en":"mustard","zh":"芥末"}]},{"id":"L5-M12","level":5,"letter":"M","n":12,"zh":"爸爸說，祖屋的房屋抵押貸款快繳不出來了。姑姑提議賣屋還錢，他卻質疑她的動機，也質疑這樣做是否合乎道德，因為他們連住在那裡的祖母都還沒問過。","en":"Dad said they could hardly keep paying the mortgage on the family house. My aunt suggested selling the house to pay the debt, but he questioned her motive and the morality of doing so, because they had not even asked Grandma, who lives there.","words":[{"en":"morality","zh":"道德"},{"en":"mortgage","zh":"房貸、抵押貸款"},{"en":"motive","zh":"動機"}]},{"id":"L5-N01","level":5,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"我小時候太天真，總抱著壞人一定長得兇的想法。直到重讀那篇以孩子口吻寫的敘事作品，我才發現故事裡最卑鄙的人一直笑臉迎人。","en":"When I was little, I was naive and held the notion that bad people always look mean. Not until I reread a narrative written in a child's voice did I see that the nastiest person in the story smiled at everyone all along.","words":[{"en":"naive","zh":"天真的"},{"en":"narrative","zh":"敘述、故事"},{"en":"nasty","zh":"令人不快的、惡劣的"},{"en":"notion","zh":"概念、觀念"}]},{"id":"L5-N02","level":5,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"一位保持中立的老師主持協商，請兩班訂出共用教室時該遵守的規範。代表答應在週五前通知所有同學，再留兩天讓大家提出異議。","en":"A neutral teacher led the negotiation and asked the two classes to set the norms for sharing a classroom. The representatives promised to notify all their classmates by Friday and give everyone two more days to object.","words":[{"en":"negotiation","zh":"談判、磋商"},{"en":"neutral","zh":"中立的、中性的"},{"en":"norm","zh":"規範、標準"},{"en":"notify","zh":"通知"}]},{"id":"L5-N03","level":5,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"那家非營利組織請居民提名一位長年照顧社區的人。修車師傅不敢相信自己獲得提名，直到看見牆上每位被提名人的照片，其中一張正是他自己。","en":"That nonprofit asked residents to nominate someone who has cared for the community for many years. The mechanic could not believe he had received a nomination until he saw the photos of every nominee on the wall, and one of them was him.","words":[{"en":"nominate","zh":"提名"},{"en":"nomination","zh":"提名"},{"en":"nominee","zh":"被提名人"},{"en":"nonprofit","zh":"非營利的"}]},{"id":"L5-N04","level":5,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"我為了做營養報告翻遍整份菜單，卻找不到任何地方寫著每餐含多少不同的營養素。新菜單把數據印在餐點旁，最明顯的改變是同學終於能自己比較兩款便當。","en":"For my nutrition report I searched the whole menu, but nowhere did it say how many different nutrients each meal contained. The new menu prints the numbers next to each meal, and the most noticeable change is that students can finally compare two lunch boxes themselves.","words":[{"en":"noticeable","zh":"明顯的"},{"en":"nowhere","zh":"任何地方都沒有"},{"en":"nutrient","zh":"營養素"},{"en":"nutrition","zh":"營養、營養學"}]},{"id":"L5-O01","level":5,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"受邀監督選拔過程的觀察員，有義務把看到的事寫清楚。即使教練希望他用含糊的措辭掩蓋爭議，他仍記下了當時的原話。","en":"The observer invited to oversee the selection process had an obligation to write clearly what he saw. Even though the coach wanted him to use obscure words to hide the dispute, he still wrote down the exact words that were said.","words":[{"en":"obligation","zh":"義務、責任"},{"en":"obscure","zh":"不出名的；難懂的"},{"en":"observer","zh":"觀察者"},{"en":"oversee","zh":"監督"}]},{"id":"L5-O02","level":5,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"即使對手曾在全國賽拿牌，姊姊談起自己的勝算時，語氣裡還是透著樂觀。進入最後一個彎道時，她從外側超越對方，第一次贏得決賽。","en":"Even though her opponent had won a medal at the national games, my sister spoke about her odds with optimism. Going into the last bend, she overtook her opponent on the outside and won a final for the first time.","words":[{"en":"odds","zh":"可能性、機率"},{"en":"opponent","zh":"對手"},{"en":"optimism","zh":"樂觀"}]},{"id":"L5-O03","level":5,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"橄欖果園今年新開了幾門課，我選了採收體驗。下午的醃漬課可自由選修，所以只想走走的人也能沿原路下山。","en":"The olive orchard offered several new classes this year, and I chose the harvest experience. The pickling class in the afternoon is optional, so people who only want to walk around can go back down the way they came.","words":[{"en":"olive","zh":"橄欖"},{"en":"optional","zh":"可選擇的、非必要的"},{"en":"orchard","zh":"果園"}]},{"id":"L5-O04","level":5,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"身為服裝設計的門外漢，我還是照著潮間帶生物的外形，設計出一整套服裝。評審說，雖然剪裁還有進步空間，這件作品的獨創性已足以讓人記住它。","en":"As an outsider to fashion design, I still designed a whole outfit based on the shapes of organisms that live between the tides. The judges said that although the cutting could be better, the originality of the work made it memorable.","words":[{"en":"organism","zh":"生物、有機體"},{"en":"originality","zh":"原創性、創意"},{"en":"outfit","zh":"（整套）服裝；裝備"},{"en":"outsider","zh":"外人、局外人"}]},{"id":"L5-O05","level":5,"letter":"O","n":5,"zh":"麵包工廠開了自己的直營門市。營運上最大的改變，是店員現在每天都能直接告訴師傅顧客想買哪些口味。整體而言，每日產量雖然沒變，打烊時剩下的麵包卻少了許多。","en":"The bread factory opened its own store. The biggest operational change is that the clerks can now tell the bakers directly every day which flavors customers want. Overall, daily output has not changed, but much less bread is left when the store closes.","words":[{"en":"operational","zh":"運作的、營運的"},{"en":"output","zh":"產量；輸出"},{"en":"overall","zh":"整體的、全面的"}]},{"id":"L5-O06","level":5,"letter":"O","n":6,"zh":"看到頭頂上的樹屋搖晃，主任決定立刻拆除。他幾乎招架不住學生的反對聲浪，但直到看完結構技師的報告，他才推翻原來的決定，改成先補強支柱。","en":"Seeing the tree house overhead shaking, the director decided to tear it down at once. He was almost overwhelmed by the students' opposition, but only after reading the structural engineer's report did he overturn his decision and choose to strengthen the posts first.","words":[{"en":"opposition","zh":"反對、敵對"},{"en":"overhead","zh":"在頭頂上的；經常性開銷"},{"en":"overturn","zh":"推翻；翻倒"},{"en":"overwhelm","zh":"使不知所措、壓倒"}]},{"id":"L5-P01","level":5,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"河邊兩條平行的小徑，一條留給行人，一條供人騎車。沿岸巡邏的員警提醒我，踩踏板加速之前，得先看清楚自己在哪條路上。","en":"There are two parallel paths by the river, one for pedestrians and one for cyclists. A police officer on patrol along the bank reminded me to make sure which path I was on before pedaling faster.","words":[{"en":"parallel","zh":"平行的；相似處"},{"en":"patrol","zh":"巡邏"},{"en":"pedal","zh":"踏板"},{"en":"pedestrian","zh":"行人"}]},{"id":"L5-P02","level":5,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"每位參與者都把兩層布固定在玻璃管口，觀察哪些微粒能穿透布料。各組測得的數量不同，部分原因是布料厚薄不一。","en":"Each participant fixed two layers of cloth over the mouth of a glass tube to see which particles could penetrate the fabric. The numbers each group measured were different, partly because the cloth varied in thickness.","words":[{"en":"participant","zh":"參與者"},{"en":"particle","zh":"粒子、微粒"},{"en":"partly","zh":"部分地"},{"en":"penetrate","zh":"穿透、滲入"}]},{"id":"L5-P03","level":5,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"退休後，林先生每月從退休金裡留一點錢，到他光顧了四十年的麵包店買酥皮點心。店主談起烘焙依然那麼熱情，他一聽就捨不得走。","en":"After retiring, Mr. Lin saves a little from his pension every month to buy pastries at the bakery he has been a patron of for forty years. The owner still talks about baking so passionately that he never wants to leave.","words":[{"en":"passionate","zh":"熱情的"},{"en":"pastry","zh":"酥皮點心、糕點"},{"en":"patron","zh":"贊助者；老主顧"},{"en":"pension","zh":"退休金"}]},{"id":"L5-P04","level":5,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"姊姊設計了一種可以補雨衣破洞的補片，目標是讓補片淋濕了也不會脫落。第一批補片全都沒黏牢，但她仍堅持改良設計，兩年後終於取得專利。","en":"My sister designed a patch for fixing holes in raincoats, and her goal was a patch that would not come off when wet. The first batch did not stick at all, but she persisted in improving the design and got a patent two years later.","words":[{"en":"patch","zh":"補丁；一小塊"},{"en":"patent","zh":"專利"},{"en":"persist","zh":"堅持；持續"}]},{"id":"L5-P05","level":5,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"那位表演者扮演一個收成被地主奪走的農民。他伸手想護住最後一袋米，那可憐的模樣給我留下深刻的印象。","en":"The performer played a peasant whose harvest was taken by a landlord. The pathetic sight of him reaching out to protect his last bag of rice left a deep impression on me.","words":[{"en":"pathetic","zh":"可憐的；差勁的"},{"en":"peasant","zh":"農民"},{"en":"performer","zh":"表演者"}]},{"id":"L5-P06","level":5,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"看過攝影展裡的兩張照片，我才察覺自己一直把這個街角當成停車的地方。從推嬰兒車的家長的角度看，同一排機車卻擋住了去路。這兩張照片改變了我對街道的看法。","en":"After seeing two photos at the photography exhibition, I realized I had always perceived this corner as a place to park. From the perspective of parents pushing strollers, the same row of scooters blocked the way. These two photos changed my perception of the street.","words":[{"en":"perceive","zh":"察覺；認為"},{"en":"perception","zh":"看法；感知"},{"en":"perspective","zh":"觀點、角度"}]},{"id":"L5-P07","level":5,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"校慶籌備進入最後階段時，負責人重新檢查了工作人員的配置。有引導人潮經驗的人被安排在入口，新人則跟著他們熟悉動線。","en":"When preparations for the school anniversary entered the final phase, the person in charge checked the placement of personnel again. People with experience guiding crowds were placed at the entrance, and new helpers followed them to learn the route.","words":[{"en":"personnel","zh":"人員、人事"},{"en":"phase","zh":"階段"},{"en":"placement","zh":"安置、配置；實習職位"}]},{"id":"L5-P08","level":5,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"夜間閱覽室即將關閉，社區裡瀰漫著悲觀情緒。兩位曾為瑣事吵架的鄰居合寫了請願書，在會上懇求校長留下閱覽室，還承諾輪流值班。校長聽了他們的請求，答應再開放一學期。","en":"The evening reading room was about to close, and pessimism spread through the community. Two neighbors who had once argued over petty matters wrote a petition together and pleaded with the principal at the meeting to keep the room open, pledging to take turns on duty. The principal listened to their plea and agreed to keep it open for one more term.","words":[{"en":"pessimism","zh":"悲觀"},{"en":"petition","zh":"請願（書）"},{"en":"petty","zh":"瑣碎的、小氣的"},{"en":"plea","zh":"懇求；（法庭上的）答辯"},{"en":"plead","zh":"懇求；辯護"},{"en":"pledge","zh":"誓言、保證"}]},{"id":"L5-P09","level":5,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"工人把工具箱抬上小貨卡，沿著海岸開到碼頭。第三根柱子旁有一段輸油管已經生鏽，他們得趕在船靠岸前換掉。","en":"The workers lifted the toolbox onto a pickup and drove along the coast to the pier. A section of pipeline beside the third pillar had rusted, and they had to replace it before the ship docked.","words":[{"en":"pickup","zh":"小貨車；接送"},{"en":"pier","zh":"碼頭"},{"en":"pillar","zh":"柱子；支柱"},{"en":"pipeline","zh":"管線"}]},{"id":"L5-P10","level":5,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"劇本裡，先知用富有詩意的語言預告一名海盜將從海上歸來。老師把「海盜」改成複數，請我們想像，一艘船上若有十名海盜都聲稱自己是船長，故事會怎麼發展。","en":"In the script, a prophet uses poetic language to say a pirate will return from the sea. The teacher changed \\"pirate\\" to the plural and asked us to imagine how the story would go if ten pirates on one ship all claimed to be the captain.","words":[{"en":"pirate","zh":"海盜；盜版"},{"en":"plural","zh":"複數（的）"},{"en":"poetic","zh":"詩的、有詩意的"},{"en":"prophet","zh":"先知"}]},{"id":"L5-P11","level":5,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"九局上半，客隊連得三分，主隊球迷的信心驟降。教練換我上場當投手時，我緊張得能感覺到脈搏在太陽穴跳動。幸好對方打者第一球就擊出雙殺打，結束了這半局。","en":"In the top of the ninth inning, the visiting team scored three runs in a row, and the home fans' confidence plunged. When the coach sent me in as pitcher, I was so nervous that I could feel my pulse beating in my temples. Luckily, the batter hit into a double play on the first pitch and ended the half inning.","words":[{"en":"pitcher","zh":"投手；水壺"},{"en":"plunge","zh":"跳入；暴跌"},{"en":"pulse","zh":"脈搏"}]},{"id":"L5-P12","level":5,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"弟弟坐在門廊上，正要用樹枝戳一片葉子，才發現上面停著一隻螳螂。他趕快縮手，看著這隻小小的捕食者抓住獵物。","en":"My little brother was sitting on the porch and was about to poke a leaf with a stick when he noticed a praying mantis on it. He quickly pulled his hand back and watched the tiny predator catch its prey.","words":[{"en":"poke","zh":"戳"},{"en":"porch","zh":"門廊"},{"en":"predator","zh":"掠食者"},{"en":"prey","zh":"獵物"}]},{"id":"L5-P13","level":5,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"領到第一筆薪水後，我先繳了保險費，才考慮購買基金。理財課要求我們依照自己的風險偏好設計投資組合，我這才發現自己有多在意手頭是否留有現金。","en":"After I got my first paycheck, I paid my insurance premium before thinking about buying funds. Our money class asked us to design a portfolio based on our own risk preferences, and only then did I realize how much I cared about keeping cash on hand.","words":[{"en":"portfolio","zh":"作品集；投資組合"},{"en":"preference","zh":"偏好"},{"en":"premium","zh":"保險費；高級的"}]},{"id":"L5-P14","level":5,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"在巷口看診的家庭醫師替外婆開了藥，我陪她拿著處方箋去藥局。因為外頭下著雨，我們出發前先把處方箋放進透明袋裡，以防淋濕。","en":"The family doctor practicing at the end of the lane prescribed medicine for Grandma, and I went with her to take the prescription to the pharmacy. Because it was raining, we put the prescription in a clear bag before leaving as a precaution.","words":[{"en":"precaution","zh":"預防措施"},{"en":"prescribe","zh":"開（藥方）；規定"},{"en":"prescription","zh":"處方"}]},{"id":"L5-P15","level":5,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"初步訪談中只有三人表示願意搬家，這時就認定整條街都同意拆遷，未免太早。若討論的前提是每戶都能自由表態，我們就得放下對租客的偏見，也聽聽他們的意見。","en":"In the preliminary interviews, only three people said they were willing to move, so it would be premature to say the whole street agreed. If the premise of the discussion is that every household can speak freely, we must put aside our prejudice against renters and listen to them too.","words":[{"en":"prejudice","zh":"偏見"},{"en":"preliminary","zh":"初步的"},{"en":"premature","zh":"過早的；早產的"},{"en":"premise","zh":"前提；（premises）場所"}]},{"id":"L5-P16","level":5,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"交換生把同一個省的兩則新聞抄進筆記。總統選舉期間，該國總理曾到這個省視察災情。昨天，當時陪他探訪災民的大學校長公開宣布，自己將辭去校長一職，留在當地協助重建。","en":"The exchange student copied two news items about the same province into his notes. During the presidential election, the country's premier visited the province to see the damage. Yesterday, the university president who went with him to visit the victims proclaimed that he would give up his presidency and stay to help rebuild.","words":[{"en":"premier","zh":"首要的；總理"},{"en":"presidency","zh":"總統職位、任期"},{"en":"presidential","zh":"總統的"},{"en":"proclaim","zh":"宣告"},{"en":"province","zh":"省"}]},{"id":"L5-P17","level":5,"letter":"P","n":17,"zh":"選前流傳著一段剪輯過的訪談。剪輯者特地留下最刺耳的一句，想來是為了激怒選民。班上本來有人要轉貼這段政治宣傳，最後還是主張先看完整訪談的同學占了上風。","en":"An edited interview spread before the election. The editor kept the harshest line, presumably to provoke voters. Someone in our class was about to repost this propaganda, but in the end the classmates who argued for watching the whole interview first prevailed.","words":[{"en":"presumably","zh":"大概、據推測"},{"en":"prevail","zh":"盛行；獲勝"},{"en":"propaganda","zh":"（政治）宣傳"},{"en":"provoke","zh":"激怒；引起"}]},{"id":"L5-P18","level":5,"letter":"P","n":18,"zh":"折線圖顯示，隨著設備逐步改善，每名員工每小時完成的件數也增加了。廠長根據生產力的增幅預測明年的產量，又在圓餅圖上標出了外銷訂單占總訂單的比例。","en":"The line graph shows that as the equipment gradually improved, the number of items each worker finished per hour also increased. The factory manager made a projection of next year's output based on the rise in productivity and marked the proportion of export orders on the pie chart.","words":[{"en":"productivity","zh":"生產力"},{"en":"projection","zh":"預測；投影"},{"en":"proportion","zh":"比例；部分"}]},{"id":"L5-P19","level":5,"letter":"P","n":19,"zh":"我替畢業紀念刊寫一篇校友的人物簡介，本來只打算問他如何看待這一行的就業前景。他拿出第一張遭人退回的設計圖後，我又多問了好些問題，讓訪談延長了半小時。","en":"I was writing a profile of a graduate for the yearbook and only planned to ask how he saw the prospects in his field. After he took out his first rejected design, I asked many more questions and prolonged the interview by half an hour.","words":[{"en":"profile","zh":"簡介、個人檔案；側面"},{"en":"prolong","zh":"延長"},{"en":"prospect","zh":"前景、可能性"}]},{"id":"L5-P20","level":5,"letter":"P","n":20,"zh":"金字塔旁的通道容易落石，園方已禁止遊客進入，擅闖者將面臨起訴。由於通往另一處出口的路很長，新規也有一項條款要求園方沿途供應飲水。","en":"The path beside the pyramid is prone to falling rocks, so the park has prohibited visitors from entering, and anyone who goes in will face prosecution. Because the way to the other exit is long, the new rules also include a provision requiring the park to provide water along the route.","words":[{"en":"prohibit","zh":"禁止"},{"en":"prone","zh":"易於……的；趴著的"},{"en":"prosecution","zh":"起訴；檢方"},{"en":"provision","zh":"供應；條款"},{"en":"pyramid","zh":"金字塔"}]},{"id":"L5-Q01","level":5,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"為了探索老街名字的由來，我報名參加口述歷史營。每所學校都有名額限制，只有交回問卷並完成試訪的人才有資格入選。輪到我訪問第一位攤商時，我的聲音還在發抖。","en":"In my quest to find out where the old street's name came from, I signed up for an oral history camp. Each school had a quota, and only people who returned the questionnaire and finished a practice interview qualified. When it was my turn to interview the first stall owner, my voice was still quivering.","words":[{"en":"qualify","zh":"有資格、使合格"},{"en":"quest","zh":"追求、探索"},{"en":"questionnaire","zh":"問卷"},{"en":"quiver","zh":"顫抖"},{"en":"quota","zh":"配額"}]},{"id":"L5-R01","level":5,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"學生在反對種族歧視的集會上，要求校方徹底改變招生制度。一名學生拿出三年的錄取資料，指出光靠動聽的辭令，回答不了這些數字引出的問題。","en":"At a rally against racism, students demanded that the school make radical changes to its admission system. One student took out three years of admission data and pointed out that fine rhetoric alone could not answer the questions these numbers raised.","words":[{"en":"racism","zh":"種族歧視"},{"en":"radical","zh":"激進的；根本的"},{"en":"rally","zh":"集會；重振"},{"en":"rhetoric","zh":"修辭；空話"}]},{"id":"L5-R02","level":5,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"末班公車後方的行李架隨著路面的顛簸喀啦作響。一名背著破舊布袋的乘客扶著欄杆站起身，才發現布袋的扣環卡進了架子。","en":"The luggage rack at the back of the last bus rattled as the road got bumpy. A passenger with a ragged cloth bag held the rail and stood up, and then he found that the buckle of his bag was stuck in the rack.","words":[{"en":"rack","zh":"架子"},{"en":"ragged","zh":"破爛的"},{"en":"rail","zh":"欄杆；鐵軌"},{"en":"rattle","zh":"嘎嘎作響"}]},{"id":"L5-R03","level":5,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"做輻射測量實驗時，各組隨機抽出一個房間，算出室內讀數與門外讀數的比值。隔壁組的比值特別高，老師請我們先找出合理的解釋，再決定是否重測。","en":"In our radiation measurement experiment, each group picked a random room and calculated the ratio of the reading inside to the reading outside the door. The group next to us had an especially high ratio, and the teacher asked us to find a rational explanation before deciding whether to measure again.","words":[{"en":"radiation","zh":"輻射"},{"en":"random","zh":"隨機的"},{"en":"ratio","zh":"比例、比率"},{"en":"rational","zh":"理性的"}]},{"id":"L5-R04","level":5,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"在祖父寫的小說裡，幾個手持步槍的人趁夜突襲牧場，帶走了兩匹馬。主角明知獨自追趕十分冒險，還是沿著蹄印走進了樹林。","en":"In the novel Grandpa wrote, several men with rifles raided a ranch at night and took two horses. The main character knew it was risky to chase them alone, but he still followed the hoof prints into the woods.","words":[{"en":"raid","zh":"突襲"},{"en":"ranch","zh":"大牧場"},{"en":"rifle","zh":"來復槍、步槍"},{"en":"risky","zh":"危險的"}]},{"id":"L5-R05","level":5,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"這部小說以一個虛構的王國為背景，描寫人民如何反抗殘暴的政權。作者雖然支持共和政體，卻把整整一章留給了一對分屬敵對陣營的兄弟。他筆下的反叛寫得如此真實，比慶祝勝利的場面更令我難忘。","en":"This novel is set in an imaginary realm and describes how the people resist a cruel regime. Although the author supports a republican government, he gives a whole chapter to two brothers on rival sides. His realism in writing about the rebellion makes it more unforgettable to me than the victory scenes.","words":[{"en":"realism","zh":"現實主義；寫實"},{"en":"realm","zh":"領域；王國"},{"en":"rebellion","zh":"叛亂、反抗"},{"en":"regime","zh":"政權；制度"},{"en":"republican","zh":"共和黨人；共和（黨）的"},{"en":"rival","zh":"對手、競爭者"}]},{"id":"L5-R06","level":5,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"獎學金得主在頒獎典禮的排練中，背到一半突然忘了感謝詞。她想起老師替她寫的推薦信，索性放下稿子，對著臺下的老師說出自己第一次讀到那封信的心情。","en":"During the rehearsal for the awards ceremony, the scholarship recipient forgot her thank-you speech halfway through reciting it. She remembered the recommendation letter her teacher had written for her, so she put down her notes and told the teacher in the audience how she felt when she first read that letter.","words":[{"en":"recipient","zh":"接受者、收件人"},{"en":"recite","zh":"背誦、朗誦"},{"en":"recommend","zh":"推薦、建議"},{"en":"recommendation","zh":"推薦、建議"},{"en":"rehearsal","zh":"排練、彩排"}]},{"id":"L5-R07","level":5,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"經濟衰退期間，鎮上的零售業受到重創，地方政府的稅收也跟著減少。直到舊市場重新開張，稅收連續四季下滑的趨勢才終於逆轉。","en":"During the recession, retail in the town was hit hard, and the local government's tax revenue fell too. Only after the old market reopened did the trend of four straight quarters of falling revenue finally reverse.","words":[{"en":"recession","zh":"經濟衰退"},{"en":"retail","zh":"零售"},{"en":"revenue","zh":"收入、營收"},{"en":"reverse","zh":"反轉、倒車；相反的"}]},{"id":"L5-R08","level":5,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"供附近居民避難的中心恢復供餐後，便開始招募能搬運物資的志工。無論有沒有救災經驗都能報名，所以我推薦了隔壁那位熟悉山路的送貨員。","en":"After the refuge for nearby residents started serving meals again, it began to recruit volunteers who could carry supplies. Anyone could sign up regardless of disaster experience, so I recommended the delivery man next door who knows the mountain roads.","words":[{"en":"recommend","zh":"推薦、建議"},{"en":"recruit","zh":"招募；新成員"},{"en":"refuge","zh":"避難所"},{"en":"regardless","zh":"不管、無論如何"},{"en":"resident","zh":"居民；住院醫師"}]},{"id":"L5-R09","level":5,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"工程隊用鋼板補強圍牆後，在人行道兩端貼了告示，提醒行人改道。告示上說，散落的石塊已使這段人行道無法通行，必須等碎石清除完畢才能重新開放。","en":"After the work team reinforced the wall with steel plates, they put up notices at both ends of the sidewalk as a reminder for people to take another way. The notice said the scattered rocks had rendered this part of the sidewalk unusable, and it would not reopen until the removal of the debris was complete.","words":[{"en":"reinforce","zh":"加強"},{"en":"reminder","zh":"提醒（的事物）"},{"en":"removal","zh":"移除"},{"en":"render","zh":"使成為；提供"}]},{"id":"L5-R10","level":5,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"暑假我在海邊的度假村工作，櫃檯旁就是腳踏車出租處。為了償還出發前向姊姊借的錢，我每天走路上班，把省下的租車費存起來。","en":"During summer vacation I worked at a beach resort, and the bike rental shop was right beside the front desk. To repay the money I borrowed from my sister before I left, I walked to work every day and saved the rental fee.","words":[{"en":"rental","zh":"出租；租金"},{"en":"repay","zh":"償還；報答"},{"en":"resort","zh":"度假勝地；訴諸"}]},{"id":"L5-R11","level":5,"letter":"R","n":11,"zh":"水庫興建前，這片土地曾是一處住宅區。我們訪問了幾位當年的居民，其中一位受訪者畫出了他以前的住所。畫中的房子跟舊照片裡的木屋相似得驚人。","en":"Before the reservoir was built, this land was a residential area. We interviewed several former residents, and one respondent drew the residence he used to live in. The house in his drawing bore a striking resemblance to the wooden house in an old photo.","words":[{"en":"resemblance","zh":"相似（處）"},{"en":"reservoir","zh":"水庫"},{"en":"residence","zh":"住所；居住"},{"en":"resident","zh":"居民；住院醫師"},{"en":"residential","zh":"住宅的"},{"en":"respondent","zh":"受訪者、作答者"}]},{"id":"L5-R12","level":5,"letter":"R","n":12,"zh":"我們沿山稜走到山屋時，天已快黑了。嚮導把排骨放進鍋裡燉，我用金屬桿把吊燈鉤近一點，這才看見湯快滿到鍋緣了。","en":"By the time we walked along the ridge to the mountain hut, it was almost dark. The guide put ribs in a pot to stew, and when I pulled the hanging lamp closer with a metal rod, I saw that the soup was almost up to the rim.","words":[{"en":"rib","zh":"肋骨"},{"en":"ridge","zh":"山脊"},{"en":"rim","zh":"邊緣"},{"en":"rod","zh":"桿、棒"}]},{"id":"L5-R13","level":5,"letter":"R","n":13,"zh":"我們的對手每次比賽前都有一套固定不變的儀式，連隊員綁鞋帶的先後順序都規定好了。起初我覺得很荒謬，直到決賽前我自己緊張得把球衣都穿反了。","en":"Our rivals have a rigid ritual before every game, and even the order in which players tie their shoes is fixed. At first I thought it was ridiculous, until I was so nervous before the final that I put my jersey on backward.","words":[{"en":"ridiculous","zh":"荒謬的、可笑的"},{"en":"rigid","zh":"僵硬的；嚴格的"},{"en":"ritual","zh":"儀式、典禮"},{"en":"rival","zh":"對手、競爭者"}]},{"id":"L5-R14","level":5,"letter":"R","n":14,"zh":"街頭騷亂平息後，爺爺在舊報紙刊的一張照片裡認出了自家店面的招牌。照片中間雖有一道裂口，他還是看得見店門，也認出了站在門前的鄰居，這才放下心來。","en":"After the riot in the street calmed down, Grandpa recognized the sign of our family shop in a photo in an old newspaper. Although there was a rip down the middle of the photo, he could still see the shop door and the neighbors standing in front of it, which reassured him.","words":[{"en":"reassure","zh":"使安心"},{"en":"riot","zh":"暴動"},{"en":"rip","zh":"撕裂"}]},{"id":"L5-S01","level":5,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"壁畫裡，一位穿著涼鞋的聖徒正扶老人坐上馬鞍。導覽員說，畫中那處不起眼的泉水至今仍被村民視為聖泉。","en":"In the mural, a saint in sandals is helping an old man onto a saddle. The guide said the humble spring in the painting is still seen as sacred by the villagers today.","words":[{"en":"sacred","zh":"神聖的"},{"en":"saddle","zh":"馬鞍；坐墊"},{"en":"saint","zh":"聖人"},{"en":"sandal","zh":"涼鞋"}]},{"id":"L5-S02","level":5,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"我才把鮭魚端下桌，貓就聞到香味，偷偷溜進廚房。牠先嗅了嗅盤子，接著叼走一塊魚，我連盤子都還沒來得及收。","en":"As soon as I took the salmon off the table, the cat smelled it and sneaked into the kitchen. It sniffed the plate first and then snatched a piece of fish before I even had time to put the plate away.","words":[{"en":"salmon","zh":"鮭魚"},{"en":"snatch","zh":"搶奪"},{"en":"sneak","zh":"偷偷地走、偷溜"},{"en":"sniff","zh":"聞、嗅"}]},{"id":"L5-S03","level":5,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"在美髮沙龍裡，我對著鏡子仔細打量自己的臉，發現新髮型露出了從小藏在瀏海下的疤。頭髮第一次沒有遮住額頭，微風吹過的感覺竟這麼陌生。","en":"In the hair salon, I looked closely at my face in the mirror and noticed that my new haircut showed a scar that had been hidden under my bangs since I was little. It was the first time my hair did not cover my forehead, and the feeling of a breeze on it was so strange.","words":[{"en":"salon","zh":"美髮（美容）沙龍"},{"en":"scar","zh":"疤痕"}]},{"id":"L5-S04","level":5,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"公司爆出隱瞞虧損的醜聞後，小股東們發現，那是公司長年掩飾債務的一項計謀。為了釐清調查範圍，他們在信中逐筆列出想核對的支出。","en":"After the scandal broke that the company had hidden its losses, the small shareholders found it was a long-running scheme to cover up debt. To make clear the scope of the investigation, they listed in their letter every expense they wanted to check.","words":[{"en":"scandal","zh":"醜聞"},{"en":"scheme","zh":"計畫、方案；陰謀"},{"en":"scope","zh":"範圍"},{"en":"shareholder","zh":"股東"}]},{"id":"L5-S05","level":5,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"導演把劇本的背景從冬天的校園改成停電的夜市，又調換了事件發生的順序。他請我們設想另一種情境：如果主角在熄燈前就認出了父親，我們會寫出什麼樣的結局？","en":"The director changed the setting of the script from a school in winter to a night market during a blackout, and he also changed the sequence of events. He asked us to imagine a different scenario: if the main character recognized her father before the lights went out, what ending would we write?","words":[{"en":"scenario","zh":"可能發生的情況、情境；劇本"},{"en":"script","zh":"劇本、腳本"},{"en":"sequence","zh":"順序、連續"},{"en":"setting","zh":"環境、背景；設定"}]},{"id":"L5-S06","level":5,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"山雨逼近時，兩個孩子手腳並用地爬上山坡，繞過一面近乎垂直的岩壁，躲進果農的工具小屋。等父親找到他們時，他們的衣服已經濕透，兩人都冷得發抖。","en":"As the mountain rain approached, the two children scrambled up the slope, went around a sheer rock wall, and hid in a fruit farmer's tool shed. By the time their father found them, their clothes were soaked through, and both were shivering with cold.","words":[{"en":"scramble","zh":"爭搶；攀爬；炒（蛋）"},{"en":"shed","zh":"流（淚）、脫落；棚子"},{"en":"sheer","zh":"純粹的、完全的"},{"en":"shiver","zh":"發抖"},{"en":"soak","zh":"浸泡、溼透"}]},{"id":"L5-S07","level":5,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"拆屋工人先用木板遮護窗下的盆栽，才揮起鐵鎚砸爛窗框。玻璃碎了一地，孩子把撿來的廢木料交給工人，請他們釘一道臨時圍欄。","en":"The demolition workers first shielded the plants under the window with boards, then swung their hammers to smash the window frame. Glass shattered all over the ground, and the children handed the workers scrap wood they had collected and asked them to nail up a temporary fence.","words":[{"en":"scrap","zh":"碎片、廢料"},{"en":"shatter","zh":"粉碎"},{"en":"shield","zh":"盾牌；保護"},{"en":"smash","zh":"打碎、猛撞"}]},{"id":"L5-S08","level":5,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"我把一場探討漁業的專題研討會錄了下來。回家重聽時，我特別保留了一個片段，裡頭有位參議員解釋為何小漁港買不起新冷凍庫。","en":"I recorded a seminar on fishing. When I listened to it again at home, I especially kept one segment in which a senator explained why small fishing ports cannot afford new freezers.","words":[{"en":"segment","zh":"部分、片段"},{"en":"seminar","zh":"研討會"},{"en":"senator","zh":"參議員"}]},{"id":"L5-S09","level":5,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"還書箱投入口的感測器太靈敏，連飄進去的落葉都會讓伺服器多記一筆。館員調低靈敏度後，我們把同一本書投入十次，再確認紀錄剛好增加十筆。","en":"The sensor at the slot of the book return box was so sensitive that even a falling leaf made the server record one more book. After the librarian lowered the sensitivity, we put the same book in ten times and checked that the records increased by exactly ten.","words":[{"en":"sensitivity","zh":"敏感（度）"},{"en":"sensor","zh":"感測器"},{"en":"server","zh":"伺服器；服務生"},{"en":"slot","zh":"投幣口、狹縫；時段"}]},{"id":"L5-S10","level":5,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"哥哥是我們幾個手足裡最念舊的。全家搬離老屋那天，他在照片背後寫著：「走到哪裡，我都會想念這個家。」那也是我的心聲，只是我當時還不知道，他已偷偷把照片留給了我。","en":"My brother is the most sentimental of us siblings. On the day our family left the old house, he wrote on the back of a photo, \\"Wherever I go, I will miss this home.\\" That was my sentiment too, but I did not know then that he had secretly left the photo for me.","words":[{"en":"sentiment","zh":"情緒、看法；感情"},{"en":"sentimental","zh":"多愁善感的"},{"en":"sibling","zh":"兄弟姊妹"}]},{"id":"L5-S11","level":5,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"博物館開了一系列化石講習課程，我參加的那一堂專門教人辨認頭骨。講師把兩具骨骼標本並排擺好，讓我們從牙齒推敲這兩隻動物生前吃什麼。","en":"The museum started a series of fossil workshops, and the session I joined specialized in identifying skulls. The instructor put two skeletons side by side and let us guess from their teeth what the two animals ate when they were alive.","words":[{"en":"series","zh":"系列；影集"},{"en":"session","zh":"（一段）時間、一節；會期"},{"en":"skeleton","zh":"骨骼、骨架"},{"en":"skull","zh":"頭骨"},{"en":"specialize","zh":"專攻、專門從事"}]},{"id":"L5-S12","level":5,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"舞臺劇裡，一名警長把一個逃離奴役的孩子藏在鎮公所。鎮子遭到圍攻時，孩子靠一張故鄉的老地圖找到了通往河邊的小路。要是沒留下那張地圖，他就找不到那條路了。","en":"In the play, a sheriff hides a child who has escaped from slavery in the town hall. When the town is under siege, the child uses an old map of his hometown to find a path to the river. If he had not kept that map, he would never have found the path.","words":[{"en":"sheriff","zh":"警長"},{"en":"siege","zh":"圍攻"},{"en":"slavery","zh":"奴隸制度"}]},{"id":"L5-S13","level":5,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"市區的煙霧嗆得人直咳，大家都想早點上接駁車，偏偏司機短缺，班次又少。後面的人一直推擠，我問站務員能不能讓孩子先上車，他聳了聳肩，轉身去找司機。","en":"The smog in the city was so thick it made people cough, and everyone wanted to get on the shuttle early, but there was a shortage of drivers and few buses. The people behind kept shoving, and when I asked the station worker if children could get on first, he shrugged and turned to look for a driver.","words":[{"en":"shortage","zh":"短缺、不足"},{"en":"shove","zh":"推擠"},{"en":"shrug","zh":"聳肩"},{"en":"shuttle","zh":"接駁車；太空梭；往返"},{"en":"smog","zh":"霧霾、煙霧"}]},{"id":"L5-S14","level":5,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"劇本原本寫著姊姊打了弟弟一記耳光，再用力甩上房門。排戲時兩人錯開站位，觀眾雖然看得見姊姊揮手，弟弟的臉頰卻根本沒被碰到。","en":"The script said the sister slaps her brother and then slams the bedroom door. During rehearsal, the two stood apart, so although the audience could see the sister swing her hand, it never touched her brother's cheek.","words":[{"en":"script","zh":"劇本、腳本"},{"en":"slam","zh":"砰地關上、猛摔"},{"en":"slap","zh":"打耳光、拍打"}]},{"id":"L5-S15","level":5,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"圍裙上的油漬已經乾了，奶奶叫我先把圍裙泡在溫水裡。等黏在布上的飯粒變軟，我才用海綿輕輕擦洗。","en":"The stain on the apron had dried, so Grandma told me to soak the apron in warm water first. When the rice stuck to the cloth softened, I scrubbed it gently with a sponge.","words":[{"en":"soak","zh":"浸泡、溼透"},{"en":"soften","zh":"使變軟"},{"en":"sponge","zh":"海綿"},{"en":"stain","zh":"汙漬；弄髒"}]},{"id":"L5-S16","level":5,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"蔬菜價格暴漲後，在市場擺攤的爸爸開始在自家菜園播種。幾個月後，他把自己種的南瓜切塊，煮成微辣的燉菜，端到攤位上賣。","en":"After vegetable prices soared, Dad, who runs a stall at the market, began to sow seeds in our garden. A few months later, he cut the pumpkins he grew into chunks, made a slightly spicy stew, and sold it at his stall.","words":[{"en":"soar","zh":"高飛；暴漲"},{"en":"sow","zh":"播種"},{"en":"spicy","zh":"辣的"},{"en":"stall","zh":"攤位；（引擎）熄火；拖延"},{"en":"stew","zh":"燉菜；燉"}]},{"id":"L5-S17","level":5,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"一名高二學生拉完小提琴獨奏曲時，第一排有位觀眾悄悄啜泣。她神情嚴肅地告訴我們，她上一次聽到這首曲子是在父親的告別式上。","en":"When a sophomore finished a violin solo, someone in the front row quietly sobbed. With a sober face she told us that the last time she heard this piece was at her father's funeral.","words":[{"en":"sob","zh":"啜泣"},{"en":"sober","zh":"沒喝醉的、清醒的"},{"en":"solo","zh":"獨奏、獨唱；單獨的"},{"en":"sophomore","zh":"大二學生"}]},{"id":"L5-S18","level":5,"letter":"S","n":18,"zh":"我們登上合歡山時，朝陽照亮雲海，景色十分壯觀。我和配偶都沒拍照。這趟旅行唯一的紀念品是我們在山腳下買的那枚銅戒指，至今在陽光下仍閃閃發亮。","en":"When we climbed Hehuan Mountain, the morning sun lit up the sea of clouds, and the view was spectacular. Neither my spouse nor I took photos. Our only souvenir of the trip is the copper ring we bought at the foot of the mountain, which still sparkles in the sunlight.","words":[{"en":"souvenir","zh":"紀念品"},{"en":"sparkle","zh":"閃耀"},{"en":"spectacular","zh":"壯觀的、驚人的"},{"en":"spouse","zh":"配偶"}]},{"id":"L5-S19","level":5,"letter":"S","n":19,"zh":"地質課上，每組分到一顆磨成球體的礦石樣品。我們用精密儀器測量透過礦石的光譜，老師提醒我們要在報告裡指明樣品編號，好讓別組拿同一顆來驗證結果。","en":"In geology class, each group got a mineral specimen ground into a sphere. We used a sophisticated instrument to measure the spectrum of light passing through it, and the teacher reminded us to specify the specimen number in our report so other groups could test our results with the same one.","words":[{"en":"sophisticated","zh":"精密的；世故的、有品味的"},{"en":"specify","zh":"明確指出"},{"en":"specimen","zh":"樣本、檢體、標本"},{"en":"spectrum","zh":"光譜；範圍"},{"en":"sphere","zh":"球體；範圍、領域"}]},{"id":"L5-S20","level":5,"letter":"S","n":20,"zh":"圖書館請來一位古籍修復專家，她專攻受潮的手抄本。她的專長是修補書脊，經她修復後，那本已有八十年歷史的日記終於能夠安全翻閱了。","en":"The library invited a specialist in restoring old books who specializes in damp handwritten books. Her specialty is repairing spines, and after she fixed it, the eighty-year-old diary could finally be opened safely.","words":[{"en":"specialist","zh":"專家；專科醫師"},{"en":"specialize","zh":"專攻、專門從事"},{"en":"specialty","zh":"專長；招牌菜、特產"},{"en":"spine","zh":"脊椎"}]},{"id":"L5-S21","level":5,"letter":"S","n":21,"zh":"在模擬談判中，雙方就小島主權所持的立場相去甚遠，因為兩方都看重島上港口的戰略價值。不過，雙方都同意，在這片海域救助遇難船員是件極為重要的事。","en":"In the mock negotiation, the two sides took very different stances on the sovereignty of the small island, because both valued the strategic importance of its port. However, both agreed that rescuing sailors in danger in these waters was of supreme importance.","words":[{"en":"sovereignty","zh":"主權"},{"en":"stance","zh":"立場；站姿"},{"en":"strategic","zh":"策略的、戰略的"},{"en":"supreme","zh":"最高的、至上的"}]},{"id":"L5-S22","level":5,"letter":"S","n":22,"zh":"船長教救援小隊掌舵，把小艇開向受困於沙洲的旅客。當初只願贊助這次演練的商家，看過救援過程後，決定為整期課程提供贊助。","en":"The captain taught the rescue squad to steer the small boat toward travelers stuck on a sandbar. The shop that had only agreed to sponsor this drill decided to provide sponsorship for the whole course after watching the rescue.","words":[{"en":"sponsor","zh":"贊助者；贊助"},{"en":"sponsorship","zh":"贊助"},{"en":"squad","zh":"小隊、小組"},{"en":"steer","zh":"駕駛、引導"}]},{"id":"L5-S23","level":5,"letter":"S","n":23,"zh":"我正蹲下來檢查木架是否穩固，弟弟就被電線絆了一下，撞翻一疊紙盒，嚇了我一跳。要是擺陶器的架子沒那麼結實，恐怕連碗都會摔破。","en":"I was squatting to check the stability of the wooden shelf when my brother stumbled over a wire and knocked over a stack of boxes, startling me. If the shelf holding the pottery had not been so sturdy, even the bowls might have broken.","words":[{"en":"squat","zh":"蹲、深蹲"},{"en":"stability","zh":"穩定（性）"},{"en":"stack","zh":"一疊；堆疊"},{"en":"startle","zh":"使嚇一跳"},{"en":"stumble","zh":"絆倒；結結巴巴"},{"en":"sturdy","zh":"堅固的、結實的"}]},{"id":"L5-S24","level":5,"letter":"S","n":24,"zh":"我們的小組受「男生比較愛冒險」這個刻板印象影響，推測男生玩遊戲時押的籌碼會是女生的兩倍。分析完全班的統計資料後，我們卻找不到這種差異。","en":"Influenced by the stereotype that boys like taking risks more, our group guessed that boys would put twice as many chips at stake as girls in the game. After analyzing the whole class's statistical data, we found no such difference.","words":[{"en":"stake","zh":"賭注；利害關係；樁"},{"en":"statistical","zh":"統計的"},{"en":"stereotype","zh":"刻板印象"}]},{"id":"L5-S25","level":5,"letter":"S","n":25,"zh":"我們想知道，從側面照過來的光是不是一種能促使幼苗朝光源生長的刺激。直到第三天，兩組幼苗傾斜的角度才出現細微的差異。","en":"We wanted to know whether light coming from the side is a stimulus that makes seedlings grow toward the light. Only on the third day did a subtle difference appear in the angles of the two groups of seedlings.","words":[{"en":"stimulus","zh":"刺激（物）"},{"en":"subtle","zh":"細微的、微妙的"}]},{"id":"L5-S26","level":5,"letter":"S","n":26,"zh":"市集收攤後，店長清點存貨，把多出來的六塊乳酪送進冷藏庫。休店期間一直沒人發現停了電。等我們再打開冷藏庫時，那股惡臭逼得大家趕緊退開。","en":"After the market closed, the store manager counted the stock and put six extra pieces of cheese in cold storage. No one noticed that the power was off while the store was closed. When we opened the cold storage again, the stink made everyone step back quickly.","words":[{"en":"stink","zh":"發臭；臭味"},{"en":"stock","zh":"存貨；股票"},{"en":"storage","zh":"儲存（空間）"}]},{"id":"L5-S27","level":5,"letter":"S","n":27,"zh":"教練教了我一個簡單易懂的方法，可以減輕背包對肩膀造成的負擔。我得先把扭成一團的肩帶拉直，才能把腰帶扣在正確的位置。","en":"The coach taught me a straightforward way to reduce the strain a backpack puts on my shoulders. I had to straighten the twisted shoulder straps first before I could buckle the hip belt in the right place.","words":[{"en":"straighten","zh":"弄直、整理"},{"en":"straightforward","zh":"簡單明瞭的；坦率的"},{"en":"strain","zh":"拉傷；壓力、負擔"},{"en":"strap","zh":"帶子；用帶子綁"}]},{"id":"L5-S28","level":5,"letter":"S","n":28,"zh":"屋主提交修繕補助申請時，附上了樑柱受損的照片。審查人員後來到場勘查，才發現牆面裂縫的寬度增加了整整一指。這個驚人的變化讓他們決定核准一筆可觀的補助，用來修復房屋的結構性損傷。","en":"When the owner submitted her application for a repair subsidy, she attached photos of the damaged beams. Later, when inspectors visited the site, they found that the crack in the wall had widened by a whole finger. This striking change made them decide to approve a substantial subsidy to repair the structural damage.","words":[{"en":"striking","zh":"顯著的、引人注目的"},{"en":"structural","zh":"結構的"},{"en":"submit","zh":"提交；屈服"},{"en":"subsidy","zh":"補助金"},{"en":"substantial","zh":"大量的、相當多的"}]},{"id":"L5-S29","level":5,"letter":"S","n":29,"zh":"我們訂的小木屋漏水，郊區旅館的老闆便拿一間寬敞的套房替代原本的小木屋。陽台望出去的山景好極了，同行的外婆為了再欣賞一次，決定多住一晚。","en":"Our cabin leaked, so the owner of the suburban hotel gave us a spacious suite as a substitute. The mountain view from the balcony was superb, and Grandma, who was traveling with us, decided to stay another night to enjoy it again.","words":[{"en":"spacious","zh":"寬敞的"},{"en":"substitute","zh":"代替品、替補；代替"},{"en":"suburban","zh":"郊區的"},{"en":"suite","zh":"套房；一套"},{"en":"superb","zh":"極好的"}]},{"id":"L5-S30","level":5,"letter":"S","n":30,"zh":"據說，鼓隊出發時若有人回頭看就會下雨。即將卸任的隊長笑說那是迷信，但他仍把紅傘交給繼任者，用這個象徵性的動作完成交接。","en":"Supposedly, if anyone looks back when the drum team sets off, it will rain. The leaving captain laughed and said it was a superstition, but he still handed the red umbrella to his successor in a symbolic act of handing over the job.","words":[{"en":"successor","zh":"繼任者"},{"en":"superstition","zh":"迷信"},{"en":"supposedly","zh":"據說、照理說"},{"en":"symbolic","zh":"象徵性的"}]},{"id":"L5-S31","level":5,"letter":"S","n":31,"zh":"實習主管平日都親自監督收銀員交班。昨晚監視系統故障後，她先暫停夜間收款，後來才准許新人在她的監督下清點現金。","en":"The training supervisor usually supervises the cashiers changing shifts herself. After the surveillance system broke down last night, she first suspended evening collections and later let the new workers count the cash under her supervision.","words":[{"en":"supervise","zh":"監督、指導"},{"en":"supervision","zh":"監督"},{"en":"supervisor","zh":"主管、督導"},{"en":"surveillance","zh":"監視、監控"},{"en":"suspend","zh":"暫停；停學、停職；懸掛"}]},{"id":"L5-S32","level":5,"letter":"S","n":32,"zh":"為了維持山村的共餐服務，幾戶人家開始交換班次，讓種菜和煮飯的工作都有人做。假如還是只有一戶得負擔全部的食材費，這種做法就無法長久持續。","en":"To sustain shared meals in the mountain village, several families began to swap shifts so that someone would always grow vegetables and cook. If one family still had to pay for all the food, this way of doing things would not be sustainable.","words":[{"en":"sustain","zh":"維持；承受"},{"en":"sustainable","zh":"永續的、可持續的"},{"en":"swap","zh":"交換"}]},{"id":"L5-S33","level":5,"letter":"S","n":33,"zh":"編劇寫了一場戲，讓醫師聽到角色說頭暈，就說出某種症候群的名稱。老師要他改寫這一場，讓觀眾明白，除了頭暈這個症狀，還有什麼線索讓醫師作出這項判斷。","en":"The writer wrote a scene in which a doctor names a syndrome as soon as a character says she feels dizzy. The teacher asked him to rewrite the scene so the audience would understand what clues besides the symptom of dizziness led the doctor to this judgment.","words":[{"en":"symptom","zh":"症狀"},{"en":"syndrome","zh":"症候群"}]},{"id":"L5-T01","level":5,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"為了處理球網上那團亂結，隊長改變策略，要大家先把整張網攤開。她等到最後一個死結都解開了，才修剪垂到地上的繩頭。","en":"To tackle the tangle of knots in the net, the captain changed tactics and asked everyone to spread the whole net out first. She waited until the last knot was undone before trimming the rope ends hanging on the ground.","words":[{"en":"tackle","zh":"處理、應付；擒抱"},{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"tangle","zh":"糾結、纏在一起"},{"en":"trim","zh":"修剪"}]},{"id":"L5-T02","level":5,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"網頁上的限時優惠引誘我買下一整箱鮪魚罐頭。要不是想起家裡還有十二罐，我早就抵擋不住半價的誘惑，把交易完成了。","en":"The limited-time offer on the website tempted me to buy a whole box of canned tuna. If I had not remembered the twelve tins at home, I would have given in to the temptation of half price and completed the transaction.","words":[{"en":"tempt","zh":"誘惑、引誘"},{"en":"temptation","zh":"誘惑"},{"en":"tin","zh":"錫；罐頭"},{"en":"transaction","zh":"交易"},{"en":"tuna","zh":"鮪魚"}]},{"id":"L5-T03","level":5,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"車站櫃員隔著透明隔板，看見有人從售票終端機旁拿走旅客的錢包。等到這起竊盜案開庭，她出庭作證，說明從她坐的位置能看見哪些地方。","en":"Through the transparent panel, the station clerk saw someone take a traveler's wallet from beside the ticket terminal. When the theft case went to court, she testified about what she could see from where she sat.","words":[{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"terminal","zh":"航廈、總站；末期的；終端機"},{"en":"testify","zh":"作證"},{"en":"theft","zh":"偷竊"},{"en":"transparent","zh":"透明的"}]},{"id":"L5-T04","level":5,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"那部驚悚片最令我害怕的一幕，是主角躲在桌下，整間房裡只聽得見時鐘的滴答聲。弟弟卻說，坐在黑暗裡等著看下一秒會發生什麼，正是他看電影追求的刺激感。","en":"The scene in that thriller that terrified me most was when the main character hid under a table and all you could hear was the ticking of the clock. But my brother said sitting in the dark waiting to see what happens next is exactly the thrill he looks for in movies.","words":[{"en":"terrify","zh":"使害怕"},{"en":"thrill","zh":"興奮、刺激；使興奮"},{"en":"thriller","zh":"驚悚片（小說）"},{"en":"tick","zh":"滴答聲；打勾；蜱蟲"}]},{"id":"L5-T05","level":5,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"老屋裡的地磚看起來和新磚很像，摸起來質地卻粗得多。得知舊地磚的塗層含有毒物質後，我們把打磨工作交給了專業人員。","en":"The tiles in the old house looked much like new ones, but their texture was much rougher. After learning that the coating on the old tiles contained toxic substances, we left the sanding to professionals.","words":[{"en":"texture","zh":"質地、口感"},{"en":"tile","zh":"磁磚、瓦片"},{"en":"toxic","zh":"有毒的"}]},{"id":"L5-T06","level":5,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"姊姊靠獎學金付清學費，繼續攻讀神學。在學位論文裡，她藉由訪問居民如何在喪禮中安慰彼此，探討一個她原先以為純屬理論的問題。","en":"My sister paid her tuition with a scholarship and went on to study theology. In her thesis, she explored a question she had thought was purely theoretical by interviewing residents about how they comfort each other at funerals.","words":[{"en":"theology","zh":"神學"},{"en":"theoretical","zh":"理論的"},{"en":"thesis","zh":"論文；論點"},{"en":"tuition","zh":"學費"}]},{"id":"L5-T07","level":5,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"舅舅切除大腿的腫瘤後，開始接受物理治療。治療師用木條仿造他家的門檻，連高度都做得一樣，讓他每天練習跨過去，藉此幫他找回獨自進家門的信心。","en":"After my uncle had a tumor removed from his thigh, he started physical therapy. The therapist made a copy of his doorway's threshold out of wood, even at the same height, and had him practice stepping over it every day, thereby helping him regain the confidence to walk into his home alone.","words":[{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"therapist","zh":"治療師"},{"en":"therapy","zh":"治療"},{"en":"thereby","zh":"因此、藉此"},{"en":"thigh","zh":"大腿"},{"en":"threshold","zh":"門檻；臨界值"},{"en":"tumor","zh":"腫瘤"}]},{"id":"L5-T08","level":5,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"劇中，那名被視為叛徒的將軍走到王座前，一把將密信塞進國王手裡便走了。國王生性多疑，這項性格特徵讓他多年來都不敢拆信。等他終於讀到真相，誤會好友的愧疚又日日折磨著他。","en":"In the play, the general seen as a traitor walks up to the throne, thrusts a secret letter into the king's hand, and leaves. The king is suspicious by nature, and this trait keeps him from opening the letter for years. When he finally reads the truth, the guilt of misjudging his good friend torments him every day.","words":[{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"throne","zh":"王位、寶座"},{"en":"thrust","zh":"猛推、刺"},{"en":"torment","zh":"折磨"},{"en":"trait","zh":"特徵、特質"},{"en":"traitor","zh":"叛徒"}]},{"id":"L5-T09","level":5,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"校際錦標賽開幕時，禮堂的鐘敲了三下，選手接力把火炬傳到司令台。決賽後，隊長舉起獎盃，向多年來義務修整球場的工友致敬。","en":"At the opening of the inter-school tournament, the hall clock struck three, and the players passed the torch to the stage. After the final, the captain raised the trophy in tribute to the janitor who had cared for the court for years without pay.","words":[{"en":"torch","zh":"火把；手電筒"},{"en":"tournament","zh":"錦標賽"},{"en":"tribute","zh":"致敬；貢品"},{"en":"trophy","zh":"獎盃"}]},{"id":"L5-T10","level":5,"letter":"T","n":10,"zh":"新的大眾運輸路線開通後，舊站附近的商家逐漸興旺，週末客流量增為原來的三倍。早餐店老闆的照片既記錄了社區的轉變，也留下了施工過渡期那些無人上門的早晨。","en":"After the new transit line opened, shops near the old station began to thrive, and weekend customers tripled. The breakfast shop owner's photos recorded the community's transformation, as well as the empty mornings during the transition period of construction.","words":[{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"thrive","zh":"茁壯成長、興盛"},{"en":"transformation","zh":"轉變、改造"},{"en":"transit","zh":"運輸、轉運；過境"},{"en":"transition","zh":"過渡、轉變"},{"en":"triple","zh":"三倍的"}]},{"id":"L5-T11","level":5,"letter":"T","n":11,"zh":"和平條約簽訂多年後，電台重播了當年的新聞。原本的訊號傳輸中斷前響過一聲警報，那聲警報勾起外公對戰時創傷的記憶。聽過他的故事，我才明白，對我來說微不足道的一秒鐘，對他有多重要。","en":"Many years after the peace treaty was signed, the radio station replayed the news from that time. An alarm sounded before the original transmission was cut off, and that alarm triggered Grandpa's memories of wartime trauma. After hearing his story, I understood how important a second that seemed trivial to me was to him.","words":[{"en":"tactic(s)","zh":"戰術、策略"},{"en":"transmission","zh":"傳送、傳播、傳染"},{"en":"trauma","zh":"創傷"},{"en":"treaty","zh":"條約"},{"en":"trigger","zh":"觸發；扳機"},{"en":"trivial","zh":"瑣碎的、不重要的"}]},{"id":"L5-U01","level":5,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"幾名大學生著手調查租屋廣告，最終目標是揭露廣告對收費所作的不實說明。受訪者在合約上畫線標出與廣告不符的條文，並說明這些落差如何逐漸破壞他們對房東的信任。","en":"Several undergraduates undertook a study of rental ads, with the ultimate goal of uncovering false descriptions of fees. The people they interviewed underlined the parts of their contracts that did not match the ads and explained how these gaps slowly undermined their trust in their landlords.","words":[{"en":"ultimate","zh":"最終的、極致的"},{"en":"uncover","zh":"揭露、揭開"},{"en":"undergraduate","zh":"大學生"},{"en":"underline","zh":"在……下面畫線；強調"},{"en":"undermine","zh":"逐漸削弱、破壞"}]},{"id":"L5-U02","level":5,"letter":"U","n":2,"zh":"工廠經歷了一場前所未有的危機，訂單銳減，最後還是關門了。對第一次面臨失業的爸爸來說，這無疑是他工作二十年來最難熬的冬天。","en":"The factory underwent an unprecedented crisis as orders dropped sharply, and in the end it closed. For Dad, who faced unemployment for the first time, it was undoubtedly the hardest winter in his twenty years of work.","words":[{"en":"undergo","zh":"經歷、接受（治療、手術）"},{"en":"undoubtedly","zh":"無疑地"},{"en":"unemployment","zh":"失業（率）"},{"en":"unprecedented","zh":"空前的"}]},{"id":"L5-U03","level":5,"letter":"U","n":3,"zh":"我用外婆給的鑰匙打開上鎖的工具箱，解開綁著舊紙卷的細繩。我一直到把紙展開，才認出那是我兒時住過的房子的平面圖。","en":"I used the key Grandma gave me to unlock the toolbox and undid the string tied around an old roll of paper. Only when the paper unfolded did I recognize it as the floor plan of the house I lived in as a child.","words":[{"en":"unfold","zh":"展開、打開"},{"en":"unlock","zh":"開鎖、解鎖"}]},{"id":"L5-U04","level":5,"letter":"U","n":4,"zh":"這家自來水公司決定利用現有的管線圖，為抄表系統升級。它也請抄表員每週更新巷弄資料，以免新搬來的住戶收不到帳單。","en":"This water utility decided to utilize its existing pipe maps to upgrade the meter-reading system. It also asked its meter readers to update information on the lanes every week so new residents would not miss their bills.","words":[{"en":"update","zh":"更新"},{"en":"upgrade","zh":"使升級、提升"},{"en":"utility","zh":"公用事業（水電等）；實用"},{"en":"utilize","zh":"利用"}]},{"id":"L5-V01","level":5,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"我拿吸塵器去送修時，店員沒見過我帶去的那個版本的保固單。由於更換馬達的條文寫得很含糊，他打電話請總公司確認我的保固是否仍然有效。","en":"When I took my vacuum cleaner in for repair, the clerk had never seen the version of the warranty I brought. Because the part about replacing the motor was vague, he called the head office to check whether my warranty was still valid.","words":[{"en":"vacuum","zh":"真空；吸塵器"},{"en":"vague","zh":"模糊的、不明確的"},{"en":"valid","zh":"有效的；有根據的"},{"en":"version","zh":"版本"}]},{"id":"L5-V02","level":5,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"生物課上，我們把日照時間設為唯一的變因，再觀察葉脈顏色的變化。為了對齊每天拍的照片，每組都在背景紙的正中央畫了一條垂直線。","en":"In biology class, we made hours of sunlight the only variable and watched for variations in the color of the leaf veins. To line up the photos we took every day, each group drew a vertical line down the middle of the background paper.","words":[{"en":"variable","zh":"變數；多變的"},{"en":"variation","zh":"變化、差異"},{"en":"vein","zh":"靜脈、血管"},{"en":"vertical","zh":"垂直的"}]},{"id":"L5-V03","level":5,"letter":"V","n":3,"zh":"八位攤販合資試辦夜市，選了河畔停車場當場地。他們想知道發餐券對這項新事業是否可行，於是先請二十位居民用餐券買晚餐。","en":"Eight vendors started a trial night market together and chose the riverside parking lot as the venue. They wanted to know whether giving out meal vouchers was viable for this new venture, so they first asked twenty residents to buy dinner with vouchers.","words":[{"en":"vendor","zh":"攤販、供應商"},{"en":"venture","zh":"冒險事業；冒險"},{"en":"venue","zh":"場地、會場"},{"en":"viable","zh":"可行的"},{"en":"voucher","zh":"票券、兌換券"}]},{"id":"L5-V04","level":5,"letter":"V","n":4,"zh":"今天模擬法庭審理的是藍隊對紅隊的案件，起因是一名球員在場外遭到惡毒的言語攻擊。陪審團聽完雙方陳述後才退庭討論，直到晚間才作出裁決。","en":"Today's mock trial was Blue Team versus Red Team, a case that began with a vicious verbal attack on a player off the field. The jury left to discuss only after hearing both sides and did not reach a verdict until evening.","words":[{"en":"verbal","zh":"言語的、口頭的"},{"en":"verdict","zh":"裁決、判決"},{"en":"versus","zh":"對、相對於"},{"en":"vicious","zh":"兇惡的、惡意的"}]},{"id":"L5-V05","level":5,"letter":"V","n":5,"zh":"觀眾戴上頭戴裝置後，可以走進虛擬的老街，聽一位退伍軍人講述他年輕時住過的地方。同一條巷子裡的另一段錄音，則讓觀眾從當地孩童的觀點認識那段歷史。","en":"After putting on headsets, viewers can walk into a virtual old street and hear a veteran talk about the place where he lived when he was young. Another recording in the same lane lets viewers learn that history from the viewpoint of local children.","words":[{"en":"veteran","zh":"退伍軍人；老手"},{"en":"viewer","zh":"觀眾"},{"en":"viewpoint","zh":"觀點"},{"en":"virtual","zh":"虛擬的；實質上的"}]},{"id":"L5-V06","level":5,"letter":"V","n":6,"zh":"取得簽證後，我們經由馬尼拉前往一座火山腳下的港口。弟弟在最後一段船程暈船，還沒靠岸就吐了，所以上岸後直接去了旅店休息。","en":"After getting our visas, we traveled via Manila to a port at the foot of a volcano. My brother got seasick on the last part of the boat ride and vomited before we reached shore, so he went straight to the inn to rest after we landed.","words":[{"en":"via","zh":"經由、經過"},{"en":"visa","zh":"簽證"},{"en":"volcano","zh":"火山"},{"en":"vomit","zh":"嘔吐"}]},{"id":"L5-V07","level":5,"letter":"V","n":7,"zh":"一名賣醋的店主在公聽會上直言反對漲租，並誓言替市場內最容易受影響的小攤販發聲。有了她這位公開表態的支持者，原先不敢出席的人也來簽名了。","en":"At the public hearing, a vinegar shop owner spoke out against the rent increase and vowed to speak for the small vendors in the market who were most vulnerable to it. With her as a vocal supporter, people who had been afraid to attend came to sign too.","words":[{"en":"vendor","zh":"攤販、供應商"},{"en":"vinegar","zh":"醋"},{"en":"vocal","zh":"聲音的；主唱"},{"en":"vow","zh":"誓言；發誓"},{"en":"vulnerable","zh":"脆弱的、易受傷害的"}]},{"id":"L5-W01","level":5,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"我們在劇團倉庫找到一頂紫色假髮，戴在扮演武士的同學頭上，造型十分怪異。他卻用一句機智的臺詞解釋這頭紫髮的來歷，導演便把假髮留在正式演出裡。","en":"We found a purple wig in the theater group's warehouse and put it on the classmate playing a warrior, and he looked weird. But he explained the purple hair with a witty line, so the director kept the wig for the real show.","words":[{"en":"warehouse","zh":"倉庫"},{"en":"warrior","zh":"戰士"},{"en":"weird","zh":"奇怪的"},{"en":"wig","zh":"假髮"},{"en":"witty","zh":"機智的、風趣的"}]},{"id":"L5-W02","level":5,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"大雨打在擋風玻璃上，擋住了視線。我們下車找了兩條巷子，對老狗的下落仍毫無線索。直到聽見車底傳來細細的哀鳴，我才找到牠。牠對陌生人十分戒備，怎樣都不肯走出來。","en":"Heavy rain hit the windshield and blocked our view. We got out and searched two lanes but had no clue whatsoever about the old dog's whereabouts. Not until I heard a soft whine from under the car did I find him. He was very wary of strangers and would not come out no matter what.","words":[{"en":"wary","zh":"謹慎的、小心的"},{"en":"whatsoever","zh":"無論什麼"},{"en":"whereabouts","zh":"下落、所在之處"},{"en":"whine","zh":"抱怨、哀鳴"},{"en":"windshield","zh":"擋風玻璃"}]},{"id":"L5-W03","level":5,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"漫長的乾季在這片荒野造成廣泛的影響。山坡上的草已經枯萎，而溪邊的草仍綠油油的，吸引許多野生動物前來覓食。","en":"The long dry season had widespread effects on this wilderness. The grass on the hillside has withered, whereas the grass by the stream is still green and attracts a lot of wildlife looking for food.","words":[{"en":"whereas","zh":"然而、鑑於"},{"en":"widespread","zh":"普遍的、廣泛的"},{"en":"wilderness","zh":"荒野"},{"en":"wildlife","zh":"野生動物"},{"en":"wither","zh":"枯萎"}]},{"id":"L5-W04","level":5,"letter":"W","n":4,"zh":"在廟口的木工工作坊裡，我們請使用輪椅的居民測試新坡道，好讓他們也能進廟參拜。光是重新調整坡度就花了一下午，但看見大家都能進門，我們覺得這份努力很值得。最先指出問題的居民尤其值得我們感謝。","en":"At the woodworking workshop by the temple, we asked residents who use wheelchairs to test the new ramp so they could also go into the temple to worship. Just readjusting the slope took all afternoon, but seeing everyone get through the door, we felt the effort was worthwhile. The resident who first pointed out the problem is especially worthy of our thanks.","words":[{"en":"wheelchair","zh":"輪椅"},{"en":"workshop","zh":"工作坊、研習會；工作室"},{"en":"worship","zh":"崇拜、禮拜"},{"en":"worthwhile","zh":"值得的"},{"en":"worthy","zh":"值得的、可敬的"}]},{"id":"L5-Y01","level":5,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"我們租的遊艇剛要出港，一艘載客的渡輪就從彎道出現。叔叔若沒放慢速度讓路，兩艘船就會在港口最窄的地方相遇。","en":"Our rented yacht was just leaving the harbor when a passenger ferry appeared around the bend. If my uncle had not slowed down to yield, the two boats would have met at the narrowest part of the harbor.","words":[{"en":"yacht","zh":"遊艇"},{"en":"yield","zh":"產生（收益）；讓步；產量"}]},{"id":"L6-A01","level":6,"letter":"A","n":1,"zh":"地方檔案館的索引把兩個原住民族的名稱縮寫成同樣的兩個字母。館員直到讀了部落耆老的信，才察覺這樣寫有歧義。","en":"The index at the local archive abbreviated the names of two aboriginal peoples to the same two letters. Not until the archivist read a letter from a tribal elder did she notice the ambiguity this caused.","words":[{"en":"abbreviate","zh":"縮寫"},{"en":"aboriginal","zh":"原住民的；原住民"},{"en":"ambiguity","zh":"模稜兩可、歧義"},{"en":"archive","zh":"檔案（館）；存檔"}]},{"id":"L6-A02","level":6,"letter":"A","n":2,"zh":"外公那塊兩英畝的田裡到處都是陶片。考古系學生說，正是如此豐富的遺物，讓他們想查出從前有哪些人住在那裡。","en":"Pieces of pottery abound in Grandpa's two-acre field. The archaeology students said it was this abundance of objects that made them want to find out who lived there long ago.","words":[{"en":"abound","zh":"大量存在"},{"en":"abundance","zh":"豐富、充足"},{"en":"acre","zh":"英畝"},{"en":"archaeology","zh":"考古學"}]},{"id":"L6-A03","level":6,"letter":"A","n":3,"zh":"在設計學院的展覽上，一名金工學徒請我試戴她做的胸針。直到看見它隨我的肩膀起伏，我才懂這件配件美在哪裡。","en":"At the design academy's exhibition, a metalwork apprentice asked me to try on a brooch she had made. Not until I saw it rise and fall with my shoulder did I understand the aesthetic beauty of this accessory.","words":[{"en":"academy","zh":"學院、學會"},{"en":"accessory","zh":"配件、飾品"},{"en":"aesthetic","zh":"美學的、審美的"},{"en":"apprentice","zh":"學徒"}]},{"id":"L6-A04","level":6,"letter":"A","n":4,"zh":"這齣舞台改編作品贏得評論界的讚賞，卻也讓許多老讀者離它而去。我姊說她受不了的是新結局，兩位主角到最後竟然連面都沒見過。","en":"This stage adaptation won the acclaim of critics but also alienated many longtime readers. My sister said what she could not stand was the new ending, in which the two main characters never even meet.","words":[{"en":"acclaim","zh":"稱讚、喝采"},{"en":"adaptation","zh":"適應、改編"},{"en":"alienate","zh":"使疏遠、離間"}]},{"id":"L6-A05","level":6,"letter":"A","n":5,"zh":"依照社團章程，誰管理社費，誰就要為每筆支出負責。本週查帳時發現同一張收據被登記了兩次，財務長因此修正了帳目。","en":"In accordance with the club's rules, whoever manages the club money is accountable for every expense. This week's audit found the same receipt recorded twice, so the treasurer corrected the accounts accordingly.","words":[{"en":"accordance","zh":"依照（in accordance with）"},{"en":"accordingly","zh":"相應地、因此"},{"en":"accountable","zh":"負有責任的"},{"en":"audit","zh":"查帳、審計"}]},{"id":"L6-A06","level":6,"letter":"A","n":6,"zh":"有人指稱社長私下累積了一筆旅費。面對這項指控，她鄭重表示，那筆錢是三年來小額捐款逐筆累積的結果，任何人都可以查看收據。","en":"Someone alleged that the club president had secretly accumulated travel money. Facing this accusation, she firmly affirmed that the money was the accumulation of small donations over three years, and anyone could look at the receipts.","words":[{"en":"accumulate","zh":"累積"},{"en":"accumulation","zh":"積聚、累積"},{"en":"accusation","zh":"控告、指控"},{"en":"affirm","zh":"確認、肯定"},{"en":"allege","zh":"（未經證實地）聲稱、指控"}]},{"id":"L6-A07","level":6,"letter":"A","n":7,"zh":"我在青春期長了青春痘，一看到鏡頭就躲。要不是姊姊每天都親暱地抱抱我，陪我錄十秒鐘的影片，我當時根本沒辦法讓自己習慣面對鏡頭。","en":"I had acne during adolescence and hid whenever I saw a camera. If my sister had not given me an affectionate hug every day and recorded a ten-second video with me, I could never have accustomed myself to facing the camera.","words":[{"en":"accustom","zh":"使習慣於"},{"en":"acne","zh":"青春痘、痤瘡"},{"en":"adolescence","zh":"青春期"},{"en":"affectionate","zh":"充滿感情的、親暱的"}]},{"id":"L6-A08","level":6,"letter":"A","n":8,"zh":"爸爸克服賭博成癮後，加入了全國互助會的台南分會。如今他在諮詢委員會當志工，立志有一天能培訓像當年幫助他那樣的陪伴員。","en":"After Dad overcame his gambling addiction, he joined the Tainan affiliate of a national support group. Now he volunteers on its advisory board and aspires to one day train helpers like the one who helped him.","words":[{"en":"addiction","zh":"上癮、成癮"},{"en":"advisory","zh":"顧問的、諮詢的"},{"en":"affiliate","zh":"附屬機構；使附屬"},{"en":"aspire","zh":"渴望、立志於"}]},{"id":"L6-A09","level":6,"letter":"A","n":9,"zh":"新聞主播問一名退休海軍上將，當年為何連夜把軍艦調走。他說，當晚有人警告他，一名槍手打算在隔天的登艦典禮上暗殺訪賓。","en":"A news anchor asked a retired admiral why he moved the warship away overnight back then. He said someone warned him that night that a gunman planned to assassinate a visiting guest at the next day's boarding ceremony.","words":[{"en":"admiral","zh":"海軍上將"},{"en":"anchor","zh":"錨"},{"en":"assassinate","zh":"暗殺"}]},{"id":"L6-A10","level":6,"letter":"A","n":10,"zh":"學生用鋁管做了教室的送風模型，在風道末端放了一條薄紙。如果昨天封接頭時做得夠密閉，現在那張紙就會在氣流中飄動了。","en":"The students made a model of the classroom's air system with aluminum tubes and put a strip of thin paper at the end of the airway. If they had made the joints airtight when sealing them yesterday, the paper would be moving in the airflow now.","words":[{"en":"airtight","zh":"密封的、不透氣的"},{"en":"airway","zh":"呼吸道；航線"},{"en":"aluminum","zh":"鋁"}]},{"id":"L6-A11","level":6,"letter":"A","n":11,"zh":"老師用天平作類比，讓代數裡「等號兩邊相等」這個抽象概念變得看得見。算術作業只要求答案，這次我們卻得解釋，分析過程中的每一步為何都能維持平衡。","en":"The teacher used a balance as an analogy to make the abstraction of \\"both sides of the equals sign are equal\\" in algebra visible. Our arithmetic homework only asked for answers, but this time we had to explain why every step in our analytical process kept the balance.","words":[{"en":"abstraction","zh":"抽象概念"},{"en":"algebra","zh":"代數"},{"en":"analogy","zh":"比喻、類比"},{"en":"analytical","zh":"分析的、善於分析的"},{"en":"arithmetic","zh":"算術"}]},{"id":"L6-A12","level":6,"letter":"A","n":12,"zh":"我們沿步道往上爬，到了海拔兩千公尺才停下來歇一會兒。要不是領隊先把地圖上的北方對準指北針，我們早就在霧中迷路了。","en":"We climbed up the trail and did not stop to rest awhile until we reached an altitude of two thousand meters. If the leader had not aligned north on the map with the compass first, we would have gone astray in the fog.","words":[{"en":"align","zh":"對齊、排成一直線"},{"en":"altitude","zh":"高度、海拔"},{"en":"astray","zh":"迷路、誤入歧途"},{"en":"awhile","zh":"片刻、一會兒"}]},{"id":"L6-A13","level":6,"letter":"A","n":13,"zh":"為了把短吻鱷畫成動畫，我們坐在池邊等牠浮出水面。正當大家滿懷期待地向前探身時，牠抬頭撞斷了一根樹枝，我這才見識到牠令人敬畏的力量。","en":"To animate the alligator, we sat by the pond and waited for it to come to the surface. Just as everyone leaned forward in anticipation, it raised its head and snapped a branch, and I saw its awesome strength.","words":[{"en":"alligator","zh":"短吻鱷"},{"en":"animate","zh":"使有生氣；製成動畫"},{"en":"anticipation","zh":"期待、預期"},{"en":"awesome","zh":"很棒的；令人敬畏的"}]},{"id":"L6-A14","level":6,"letter":"A","n":14,"zh":"在人群的交談聲中，音響師把國歌的伴奏放得太大聲，惹得場邊觀眾很惱火。直到他把音量調低，大家才聽見孩子們唱完最後一句，並為他們鼓掌。","en":"Amid the chatter of the crowd, the sound engineer amplified the music for the national anthem too much, causing annoyance among the people watching. Only after he turned it down could everyone hear the children sing the last line and applaud them.","words":[{"en":"amid/amidst","zh":"在……之中"},{"en":"amplify","zh":"增強、放大"},{"en":"annoyance","zh":"惱怒；令人討厭的事"},{"en":"anthem","zh":"國歌、頌歌"},{"en":"applaud","zh":"鼓掌；稱讚"}]},{"id":"L6-A15","level":6,"letter":"A","n":15,"zh":"登機時，空服員看見爸媽遞來的兩張醫療卡上都沒寫名字。一張寫著氣喘，另一張寫著對某種抗生素過敏。為了避免弄混，她請他們各自指出哪張是自己的。","en":"During boarding, the flight attendant saw that neither of the two medical cards my parents handed her had a name on it. One said asthma, and the other said an allergy to an antibiotic. To avoid a mix-up, she asked each of them to point out which card was theirs.","words":[{"en":"antibiotic","zh":"抗生素"},{"en":"asthma","zh":"氣喘"},{"en":"attendant","zh":"服務員、照護人員"}]},{"id":"L6-A16","level":6,"letter":"A","n":16,"zh":"初稿裡明明列的是精確的量測值，我卻誤用了反義詞，把它們寫成近似值。要是老師沒指出初步估算所適用的誤差範圍有多寬，我就會把這個錯誤留在最後的驗收報告裡。","en":"My first draft clearly listed exact measurements, but I used the wrong antonym and wrote them as approximate values. If the teacher had not pointed out how wide the range of error applicable to early estimates was, I would have left this mistake in my final report.","words":[{"en":"antonym","zh":"反義詞"},{"en":"applicable","zh":"適用的"},{"en":"approximate","zh":"大約的、接近的"}]},{"id":"L6-A17","level":6,"letter":"A","n":17,"zh":"在學校禮堂裡，一位太空人和一位天文學家談起他們年少時的夢想。前者先學航空，後者則鑽研天文學；讓我驚訝的是，他們用如此不同的方式達成了各自的目標。","en":"In the school auditorium, an astronaut and an astronomer talked about their dreams when they were young. The former studied aviation first, and the latter studied astronomy. What surprised me was how differently they attained their goals.","words":[{"en":"astronaut","zh":"太空人"},{"en":"astronomer","zh":"天文學家"},{"en":"astronomy","zh":"天文學"},{"en":"attain(ment)","zh":"達到、獲得"},{"en":"auditorium","zh":"禮堂、觀眾席"},{"en":"aviation","zh":"航空"}]},{"id":"L6-B01","level":6,"letter":"B","n":1,"zh":"在退休晚宴上，大家把紀念徽章交給隊上這位老單身漢。多年來他一直是隊上的支柱，卻說真正讓他留下來的是夥伴間的手足情誼。","en":"At the retirement banquet, everyone gave the team's old bachelor a badge. He had been the backbone of the team for years, but he said what really kept him there was the brotherhood among his teammates.","words":[{"en":"bachelor","zh":"單身漢；學士"},{"en":"backbone","zh":"脊椎；骨幹、骨氣"},{"en":"badge","zh":"徽章、標記"},{"en":"banquet","zh":"宴會"},{"en":"brotherhood","zh":"手足情誼、兄弟關係"}]},{"id":"L6-B02","level":6,"letter":"B","n":2,"zh":"畫裡一名金髮女子把孩子摟在胸前。導覽員說，畫名裡的「野蠻人」是征服者給她的稱呼。如果當年畫家記下她的名字，我們今天就知道她是誰了。","en":"In the painting, a blonde woman holds a child to her bosom. The guide said the \\"barbarian\\" in the title was the name the conquerors gave her. If the painter had written down her name back then, we would know who she was today.","words":[{"en":"barbarian","zh":"野蠻人；野蠻的"},{"en":"blond/blonde","zh":"金髮的；金髮的人"},{"en":"bosom","zh":"胸部、胸懷"}]},{"id":"L6-B03","level":6,"letter":"B","n":3,"zh":"漁夫把鱸魚切成魚片，留下魚骨熬高湯。魚片剛在上火下烤好，第一桌客人就坐下了，他趁魚還燙時端上桌，配上店裡自製的梅子飲料。","en":"The fisherman cut the bass into fillets and kept the bones to make broth. The fillets had just finished broiling when the first table of customers sat down, so he served them while they were hot, with the shop's homemade plum beverage.","words":[{"en":"bass","zh":"低音；貝斯"},{"en":"beverage","zh":"飲料"},{"en":"broil","zh":"（用火）烤"},{"en":"broth","zh":"高湯、清湯"}]},{"id":"L6-B04","level":6,"letter":"B","n":4,"zh":"夜間球賽的第四位打擊手剛上場，警報器就發出短促的電子音，看台後方已經起了大火。要是主辦人沒有事先演練疏散，觀眾就無法那麼快離開。","en":"The fourth batter of the night game had just stepped up when the alarm began to beep, and a blaze had already broken out behind the stands. If the organizers had not practiced the evacuation beforehand, the audience could not have left so quickly.","words":[{"en":"batter","zh":"麵糊；打擊手；連續猛擊"},{"en":"beep","zh":"嗶嗶聲"},{"en":"beforehand","zh":"預先"},{"en":"blaze","zh":"火焰；熊熊燃燒"}]},{"id":"L6-B05","level":6,"letter":"B","n":5,"zh":"為了美化林蔭大道，里長提議拓寬人行道。決定自行車道在哪裡得繞過樹根的，正是老樹之間可用空間的寬度。","en":"To beautify the boulevard, the neighborhood chief proposed broadening the sidewalks. It was the breadth of the usable space between the old trees that decided where the bike lane had to go around the roots.","words":[{"en":"beautify","zh":"美化、變美"},{"en":"boulevard","zh":"林蔭大道"},{"en":"breadth","zh":"寬度"},{"en":"broaden","zh":"變寬、擴大"}]},{"id":"L6-B06","level":6,"letter":"B","n":6,"zh":"兩校雙邊談判的破裂使姊妹校關係走到解體邊緣。直到學生宣布抵制交流晚會，兩位校長才願意重新坐下來談。","en":"The breakdown of the bilateral talks between the two schools brought their sister-school relationship to the brink of a breakup. Not until the students announced a boycott of the exchange party were the two principals willing to sit down and talk again.","words":[{"en":"bilateral","zh":"雙邊的"},{"en":"boycott","zh":"抵制"},{"en":"breakdown","zh":"故障；（精神）崩潰；分析明細"},{"en":"breakup","zh":"分手；解體"},{"en":"brink","zh":"邊緣"}]},{"id":"L6-B07","level":6,"letter":"B","n":7,"zh":"學姊剛從笨重的衣箱取出白戲服，就發現袖口有一塊墨漬。她先問服裝師這塊布能不能漂白，才決定要不要換掉袖口。","en":"Just as my senior took the white costume out of the bulky trunk, she found an ink blot on the cuff. She first asked the costume designer whether the cloth could be bleached before deciding whether to replace the cuff.","words":[{"en":"bleach","zh":"漂白、漂白劑"},{"en":"blot","zh":"汙漬；吸乾"},{"en":"bulky","zh":"龐大的"}]},{"id":"L6-B08","level":6,"letter":"B","n":8,"zh":"拳擊社的小冊子教新手如何挑選運動胸罩，以及如何撐穩身體迎接衝擊。至於身體疼痛，教練說得很直率，誰一覺得痛，誰就得立刻喊停。","en":"The boxing club's booklet teaches beginners how to choose a sports bra and how to brace their bodies for impact. As for bodily pain, the coach is blunt: whoever feels pain must stop right away.","words":[{"en":"blunt","zh":"鈍的；直率的"},{"en":"bodily","zh":"身體的"},{"en":"booklet","zh":"小冊子"},{"en":"boxing","zh":"拳擊"},{"en":"brace","zh":"支架；牙套（braces）；做好準備"},{"en":"brassiere/bra","zh":"胸罩"}]},{"id":"L6-B09","level":6,"letter":"B","n":9,"zh":"保育團體的小冊子附上小溪施工前後的照片，還指稱一名官僚收了包商的賄賂。記者說，就算照片能證明河道被改過，她還是得查明錢究竟進了誰的口袋。","en":"The conservation group's brochure included photos of the brook before and after construction and alleged that a bureaucrat had taken a bribe from the contractor. The reporter said even if the photos proved the stream had been redirected to bypass the site, she still had to find out whose pocket the money went into.","words":[{"en":"bribe","zh":"賄賂"},{"en":"brochure","zh":"小冊子、手冊"},{"en":"brook","zh":"小溪"},{"en":"bureaucrat","zh":"官僚"},{"en":"bypass","zh":"繞道；繞過"}]},{"id":"L6-C01","level":6,"letter":"C","n":1,"zh":"一位化學家把三盒咖啡因膠囊帶到班上，寫下每盒的顆數和每顆的含量。我用計算機乘完這些數字，才發現三盒所含的咖啡因總量相同。","en":"A chemist brought three boxes of caffeine capsules to class and wrote down the number of capsules in each box and the amount in each capsule. Only after I multiplied the numbers on my calculator did I find that the three boxes contained the same total amount of caffeine.","words":[{"en":"caffeine","zh":"咖啡因"},{"en":"calculator","zh":"計算機"},{"en":"capsule","zh":"膠囊"},{"en":"chemist","zh":"化學家；藥劑師"}]},{"id":"L6-C02","level":6,"letter":"C","n":2,"zh":"我們把爺爺的書法貼在硬紙板上，搬到老家庭院展出。若沒讀到他坐在攤車後寫字那張照片的圖說，我至今都不會知道他年輕時靠寫春聯養家。","en":"We mounted Grandpa's calligraphy on cardboard and showed it in the courtyard of our old house. If I had not read the caption of the photo of him writing behind a cart, I would still not know that he supported his family by writing New Year couplets when he was young.","words":[{"en":"calligraphy","zh":"書法"},{"en":"caption","zh":"圖片說明、字幕"},{"en":"cardboard","zh":"硬紙板"},{"en":"courtyard","zh":"庭院"}]},{"id":"L6-C03","level":6,"letter":"C","n":3,"zh":"抵達海角時，船長拿出羅盤，教我們對照地圖上的海岸線。要是多年前那兩艘船的領航員早一點看見礁石，就不會同時轉向，也就不會相撞了。","en":"When we reached the cape, the captain took out a compass and taught us to compare it with the coastline on the map. If the navigators of the two ships years ago had seen the rocks earlier, they would not have turned at the same time and would not have collided.","words":[{"en":"cape","zh":"披風；海角"},{"en":"coastline","zh":"海岸線"},{"en":"compass","zh":"指南針；圓規"}]},{"id":"L6-C04","level":6,"letter":"C","n":4,"zh":"海報上的兩隻圈養黑猩猩中，只有一隻是在圈養環境下出生的。弟弟堅稱小的那隻根本是大隻的複製品，直到我指給他看小傢伙左耳上獨有的一撮白毛。","en":"Of the two captive chimpanzees on the poster, only one was born in captivity. My brother insisted the small one was a clone of the big one, until I showed him the tuft of white hair on the little one's left ear that only it had.","words":[{"en":"captive","zh":"被俘虜的；俘虜"},{"en":"captivity","zh":"囚禁、被關"},{"en":"chimpanzee","zh":"黑猩猩"},{"en":"clone","zh":"複製（品）"}]},{"id":"L6-C05","level":6,"letter":"C","n":5,"zh":"美國姊妹校的校舍管理員錄下一隻北美紅雀在窗台鳴叫的聲音。直到他把錄音傳給我，我才發現自己有多想念交換時那些無憂無慮的早晨。","en":"The caretaker at our sister school in the US recorded a cardinal chirping on the windowsill. Not until he sent me the recording did I realize how much I missed the carefree mornings of my exchange.","words":[{"en":"cardinal","zh":"樞機主教；主要的"},{"en":"carefree","zh":"無憂無慮的"},{"en":"caretaker","zh":"照顧者；管理員"},{"en":"chirp","zh":"（鳥、蟲）吱喳叫"}]},{"id":"L6-C06","level":6,"letter":"C","n":6,"zh":"文具店清倉那天，收銀員看著我搬來的兩紙箱鉛筆，問我是否注意到折價券要到隔天才生效。要是我在家就讀過日期，就不會白跑這一趟。","en":"On the day of the stationery store's clearance sale, the cashier looked at the two cartons of pencils I had carried over and asked if I had noticed that the coupon did not take effect until the next day. If I had read the date at home, I would not have made the trip for nothing.","words":[{"en":"carton","zh":"紙盒、紙箱"},{"en":"cashier","zh":"收銀員"},{"en":"clearance","zh":"清倉；許可；淨空"},{"en":"coupon","zh":"優惠券、折價券"}]},{"id":"L6-C07","level":6,"letter":"C","n":7,"zh":"山崩過後，一名攝影師拍到一隻毛毛蟲爬過倒塌的水泥牆。單看這張照片，誰也猜不到這場大災難造成了多少傷亡。","en":"After the landslide, a photographer captured a caterpillar crawling over a collapsed cement wall. From this photo alone, no one could guess how many casualties the catastrophe had caused.","words":[{"en":"casualty","zh":"傷亡人員"},{"en":"catastrophe","zh":"大災難、大禍"},{"en":"caterpillar","zh":"毛蟲"},{"en":"cement","zh":"水泥"}]},{"id":"L6-C08","level":6,"letter":"C","n":8,"zh":"阿姨接下替廟會辦宴席的工作時，教我用芹菜和辣椒炒蛤蜊。她早就答應要照顧祖父不吃辣的習慣，於是另外留了一碗蒸栗子飯給他。","en":"When my aunt took the job of catering the temple festival, she taught me to stir-fry clams with celery and chili. She had promised long ago to respect Grandpa's habit of not eating spicy food, so she kept a separate bowl of steamed chestnut rice for him.","words":[{"en":"cater","zh":"提供餐飲；迎合"},{"en":"celery","zh":"芹菜"},{"en":"chestnut","zh":"栗子"},{"en":"chili","zh":"辣椒"},{"en":"clam","zh":"蛤蜊"}]},{"id":"L6-C09","level":6,"letter":"C","n":9,"zh":"爸爸讀到健康檢查報告上被圈起來的膽固醇數值，把雪茄擱下，請我陪他回診。我們翻到牙科那一頁才發現，牙醫也在一顆臼齒上找到蛀洞。","en":"When Dad read the circled cholesterol number on his checkup report, he put down his cigar and asked me to go back to the doctor with him. Only when we turned to the dental page did we find that the dentist had also found a cavity in one molar.","words":[{"en":"cavity","zh":"蛀洞、蛀牙；腔"},{"en":"checkup","zh":"健康檢查"},{"en":"cholesterol","zh":"膽固醇"},{"en":"cigar","zh":"雪茄"}]},{"id":"L6-C10","level":6,"letter":"C","n":10,"zh":"我們在攝氏二十五度觀察細胞活動，我把旋鈕順時針轉了半圈才對好焦。要是當時把調整前後的影像都存下來，我們現在就能比較細胞邊緣有多清楚。","en":"We observed cellular activity at 25 degrees Celsius, and I turned the knob half a turn clockwise to bring it into focus. If we had saved the images from before and after the adjustment, we could now compare how clear the edges of the cells were.","words":[{"en":"cellular","zh":"細胞的"},{"en":"Celsius","zh":"攝氏（的）"},{"en":"clockwise","zh":"順時針方向地"}]},{"id":"L6-C11","level":6,"letter":"C","n":11,"zh":"地方文史館把舊人口普查表電腦化後，學生就能計算各街區戶數的變化了。不過，直到遺漏的巷弄也被補進去，我們才有一份涵蓋全鎮的綜合報告。","en":"After the local history museum computerized the old census forms, students could compute changes in the number of households on each block. However, not until the missing lanes were added did we have a comprehensive report covering the whole town.","words":[{"en":"census","zh":"人口普查"},{"en":"comprehensive","zh":"全面的、綜合的"},{"en":"compute","zh":"計算、估算"},{"en":"computerize","zh":"用電腦處理、使電腦化"}]},{"id":"L6-C12","level":6,"letter":"C","n":12,"zh":"工坊主人拿起一枚為慈善拍賣做的陶瓷吊墜，示範如何單手扣上銀扣。他說每枚吊墜都附有一張他親筆簽名的卡片，證明作品出自當地學生之手。","en":"The owner of the workshop picked up a ceramic pendant made for a charitable auction and showed how to fasten the silver clasp with one hand. He said every pendant comes with a card he signs himself to certify that the work was made by local students.","words":[{"en":"ceramic","zh":"陶瓷（的）"},{"en":"certify","zh":"證明、保證"},{"en":"charitable","zh":"慈善的"},{"en":"clasp","zh":"緊握；扣環"}]},{"id":"L6-C13","level":6,"letter":"C","n":13,"zh":"校友會主席剛舉起香檳，台下就開始反覆呼喊隊長的名字。晚宴真正的高潮是隊長邀請多年來陪他練球的替補球員一起上台的那一刻。","en":"Just as the chairperson of the alumni association raised his champagne, the audience began to chant the captain's name. The real climax of the banquet was the moment the captain invited the substitute player who had practiced with him for years to join him on stage.","words":[{"en":"chairperson/chair/chairman/chairwoman","zh":"主席"},{"en":"champagne","zh":"香檳"},{"en":"chant","zh":"反覆呼喊（唱）；吟誦"},{"en":"climax","zh":"高潮、頂點"}]},{"id":"L6-C14","level":6,"letter":"C","n":14,"zh":"讀到關於征服那座島的章節時，我們發現殖民者聲稱要讓島民「變得文明」。老師拿出一本英國國協史，問征服者當年的說法到了今天在不同國家的課本裡是怎麼被描述的。","en":"When reading the chapter about the conquest of the island, we found that the colonists claimed they wanted to \\"civilize\\" the islanders. The teacher took out a history of the Commonwealth and asked how the conquerors' words are described in textbooks in different countries today.","words":[{"en":"civilize","zh":"使開化、使文明"},{"en":"commonwealth","zh":"聯邦；國協"},{"en":"conquest","zh":"征服"}]},{"id":"L6-C15","level":6,"letter":"C","n":15,"zh":"客運公司宣布夜間轉運站將關閉，通勤學生和攤商便組成聯盟，要求交通局召開公開會議。業者唯一願做的讓步，是每週五等末班車開走才關站。","en":"After the bus company announced the closure of its night terminal, commuting students and vendors formed a coalition and demanded that the transportation office convene a public meeting. The only concession the company was willing to make was to close the station on Fridays only after the last bus had left.","words":[{"en":"closure","zh":"關閉、結束"},{"en":"coalition","zh":"聯盟、聯合政府"},{"en":"concession","zh":"讓步；特許權"},{"en":"convene","zh":"召集、開會"}]},{"id":"L6-C16","level":6,"letter":"C","n":16,"zh":"受訪的阿婆在家很健談，一開錄音卻連一句口語的招呼都講得很慢。她說村裡人說快時省去那個子音是很平常的事，只是她怕外地人聽不懂。","en":"The old lady we interviewed was very communicative at home, but once the recording started, she spoke even a colloquial greeting slowly. She said dropping that consonant when speaking fast is commonplace in the village, but she was afraid outsiders would not understand.","words":[{"en":"colloquial","zh":"口語的"},{"en":"commonplace","zh":"平常的、普通的"},{"en":"communicative","zh":"善於溝通的、健談的"},{"en":"consonant","zh":"子音"}]},{"id":"L6-C17","level":6,"letter":"C","n":17,"zh":"我把兩位觀星者的往返信件彙編成冊，用來比較研究他們在不同城市觀察到的同一顆彗星。當時只要有一人沒註明時間，我就無法對照他們的速寫。","en":"I compiled the correspondence between two stargazers into a book for a comparative study of the same comet they observed in different cities. If either of them had not noted the time, I could not have compared their sketches.","words":[{"en":"comet","zh":"彗星"},{"en":"comparative","zh":"比較的、相對的"},{"en":"compile","zh":"彙編、編纂"},{"en":"correspondence","zh":"通信、信件；一致"}]},{"id":"L6-C18","level":6,"letter":"C","n":18,"zh":"彩妝師排開化妝用的刷具，請演員在舞台燈下試同一系列化妝品的三種色調。直到透過鏡頭看，我才看出是哪個色調最能襯托她的膚色。","en":"The makeup artist laid out her cosmetic brushes and asked the actress to try three shades from the same line of cosmetics under the stage lights. Only when I looked through the camera could I see which shade best complemented her complexion.","words":[{"en":"complement","zh":"補充；與……相配"},{"en":"complexion","zh":"膚色、氣色"},{"en":"cosmetic","zh":"化妝用的；表面的"},{"en":"cosmetics","zh":"化妝品"}]},{"id":"L6-C19","level":6,"letter":"C","n":19,"zh":"老兵坦承，直到昔日戰友來安慰他以前，他都覺得當年的撤退很懦弱。如今最讓他感到慰藉的，是當年被他背下山的孩子仍會寄信給他。","en":"The old soldier admitted that until a former comrade came to console him, he had felt the retreat back then was cowardly. Now his greatest consolation is that the child he carried down the mountain still writes to him.","words":[{"en":"comrade","zh":"同志、夥伴"},{"en":"consolation","zh":"安慰"},{"en":"console","zh":"安慰；控制臺、遊戲主機"},{"en":"cowardly","zh":"懦弱的"}]},{"id":"L6-C20","level":6,"letter":"C","n":20,"zh":"每位參賽者都得把十分鐘的故事濃縮成九十秒，還要維持動作的連貫性。評審說，正是女兒留下的那句簡潔留言，讓她明白父女為何多年不曾交談。","en":"Each contestant had to condense a ten-minute story into ninety seconds while keeping the continuity of the action. The judges said it was the daughter's concise message that made her understand why father and daughter had not spoken for years.","words":[{"en":"concise","zh":"簡潔的"},{"en":"condense","zh":"濃縮；凝結"},{"en":"contestant","zh":"參賽者"},{"en":"continuity","zh":"連續性"}]},{"id":"L6-C21","level":6,"letter":"C","n":21,"zh":"農會聯盟主張一名美國眾議員曾參與操縱糧價的陰謀。儘管她在記者會上拿出的信件與這項主張相矛盾，記者仍要求查看原始會議紀錄，好釐清當時談過什麼。","en":"A coalition of farmers' associations claimed that a US congresswoman had been part of a conspiracy to control food prices. Although the letters she showed at a press conference contradicted this contention, reporters still asked to see the original meeting records to make clear what was discussed.","words":[{"en":"coalition","zh":"聯盟、聯合政府"},{"en":"congressman/congresswoman","zh":"國會議員"},{"en":"conspiracy","zh":"陰謀"},{"en":"contention","zh":"爭論；論點"},{"en":"contradict","zh":"與……矛盾；反駁"}]},{"id":"L6-C22","level":6,"letter":"C","n":22,"zh":"這位做事認真的潛水教練和他在沖繩的同行交換照片，商量如何保護兩地的珊瑚。要不是兩人去年拍照時都放了同款標尺，現在就無從判斷珊瑚究竟長了多少。","en":"This conscientious diving instructor exchanged photos with his counterpart in Okinawa to discuss how to conserve the coral in both places. If the two had not both included the same kind of ruler in their photos last year, there would be no way to tell how much the coral had grown.","words":[{"en":"conscientious","zh":"認真負責的"},{"en":"conserve","zh":"節約；保護"},{"en":"coral","zh":"珊瑚"},{"en":"counterpart","zh":"職位（作用）相當的人或物"}]},{"id":"L6-C23","level":6,"letter":"C","n":23,"zh":"導演請我核對劇中留下的信件，以及主角發現屍體時手錶顯示的時間。要是剪輯時沒有人注意鏡頭之間的連續性，觀眾就會看見手錶突然倒退一小時。","en":"The director asked me to check the letters left in the play and the time on the main character's watch when he finds the corpse. If no one had paid attention to continuity between shots during editing, the audience would have seen the watch suddenly jump back an hour.","words":[{"en":"continuity","zh":"連續性"},{"en":"corpse","zh":"屍體"}]},{"id":"L6-C24","level":6,"letter":"C","n":24,"zh":"我們宿舍有個慣例，考前最後一晚要聚在舒適的小客廳臨時抱佛腳。這次我才剛把鹹脆餅傳了一圈，大家就開始考我動詞變化。","en":"It is customary in our dorm to gather in the cozy little lounge and cram on the last night before exams. This time I had just passed the crackers around once when everyone started quizzing me on verb forms.","words":[{"en":"cozy","zh":"舒適溫馨的"},{"en":"cracker","zh":"薄脆餅乾"},{"en":"cram","zh":"塞滿；臨時抱佛腳"},{"en":"customary","zh":"習慣上的、慣例的"}]},{"id":"L6-C25","level":6,"letter":"C","n":25,"zh":"市府取締深夜飆車已經三個月，能否遏止危險駕駛還有待觀察。我室友對這項政策冷嘲熱諷，說要是宿舍趁機提早宵禁，上晚班的人連家都回不了。","en":"The city's crackdown on late-night street racing has gone on for three months, and whether it can curb dangerous driving remains to be seen. My roommate is cynical about the policy and says if the dorm uses it as an excuse to move the curfew earlier, people working night shifts will not even be able to get home.","words":[{"en":"crackdown","zh":"取締、鎮壓"},{"en":"curb","zh":"（人行道的）路緣；抑制"},{"en":"curfew","zh":"宵禁、門禁"},{"en":"cynical","zh":"憤世嫉俗的"}]},{"id":"L6-C26","level":6,"letter":"C","n":26,"zh":"我拄著一支拐杖，還沒走到行人穿越道，另一條腿就抽筋了。要不是同學及時扶住我，我早就跌到馬路上了。","en":"I was walking on one crutch, and before I reached the crossing, I got a cramp in my other leg. If my classmate had not caught me in time, I would have fallen into the road.","words":[{"en":"cramp","zh":"抽筋、絞痛"},{"en":"crossing","zh":"穿越處、路口；橫渡"},{"en":"crutch","zh":"拐杖"}]},{"id":"L6-C27","level":6,"letter":"C","n":27,"zh":"編校刊時，我們找不到可信的來源能證實那張火山口照片是在臺灣拍的。至於另一張照片，編輯早已查出鱷魚旁的小熊是後來才加上去的。","en":"While editing the school magazine, we could not find a credible source to prove that the photo of the crater was taken in Taiwan. As for the other photo, the editor had already found that the bear cub beside the crocodile was added later.","words":[{"en":"crater","zh":"火山口；坑洞"},{"en":"credible","zh":"可信的、可靠的"},{"en":"crocodile","zh":"鱷魚"},{"en":"cub","zh":"（熊、獅等的）幼獸"}]},{"id":"L6-C28","level":6,"letter":"C","n":28,"zh":"開學以來我們一直在校園菜圃栽培小黃瓜，直到這星期，累計收成才達到二十公斤。週五吃咖哩飯時，每個人都分到了用自己種的小黃瓜做的涼拌菜。","en":"We have been cultivating cucumbers in the school garden since the start of the term, and only this week did the cumulative harvest reach twenty kilograms. When we had curry on Friday, everyone got a cucumber salad made from the cucumbers we grew ourselves.","words":[{"en":"cucumber","zh":"小黃瓜"},{"en":"cultivate","zh":"培養、耕作"},{"en":"cumulative","zh":"累積的"},{"en":"curry","zh":"咖哩"}]},{"id":"L6-D01","level":6,"letter":"D","n":1,"zh":"那晚我站在側台，燈光刺得我眼花，音箱幾乎震聾了我。直到團長在散場時感謝音控組三個月來的付出，我才知道他們為這場表演排練了多久。","en":"That night I stood at the side of the stage, dazzled by the lights and nearly deafened by the speakers. Not until the band leader thanked the sound team for their dedication over three months as the audience left did I learn how long they had rehearsed for this show.","words":[{"en":"dazzle","zh":"使目眩、使驚豔"},{"en":"deafen","zh":"震耳欲聾"},{"en":"dedication","zh":"奉獻、獻身"}]},{"id":"L6-D02","level":6,"letter":"D","n":2,"zh":"評審認定橋面的細縫是設計缺陷，卻無法光憑照片就對橋的承重能力下明確結論。真正提供決定性證據的是隔天的負重測試。","en":"The judges deemed the thin crack in the bridge deck a design defect, but they could not reach a definitive conclusion about the bridge's ability to bear weight from photos alone. The decisive evidence came from the load test the next day.","words":[{"en":"decisive","zh":"決定性的；果斷的"},{"en":"deem","zh":"認為、視為"},{"en":"defect","zh":"缺陷"},{"en":"definitive","zh":"最終的；最具權威的"}]},{"id":"L6-D03","level":6,"letter":"D","n":3,"zh":"有學生未依約繳清餐費，老師拒絕從全班的押金裡扣錢。她說，要是上學期就開始用急難基金墊餐費，基金現在早已耗盡，真正急需幫助的人也拿不到補助了。","en":"A student defaulted on paying for meals, but the teacher refused to deduct money from the whole class's deposit. She said if we had started using the emergency fund to cover meals last term, the fund would have been depleted by now, depriving those who really need help of support.","words":[{"en":"deduct","zh":"扣除、減去"},{"en":"default","zh":"預設值；不履行、違約"},{"en":"deplete","zh":"耗盡"},{"en":"deprive","zh":"剝奪、使喪失"}]},{"id":"L6-D04","level":6,"letter":"D","n":4,"zh":"在獨裁統治下，外婆因公開反抗獨裁者而遭警方扣留。她在拘留期間寫的信中說，她最鄙視的就是那些拿別人的自由換取自己升遷的人。","en":"Under the dictatorship, Grandma was detained by the police for openly defying the dictator. In letters she wrote during her detention, she said what she despised most were people who traded others' freedom for their own promotion.","words":[{"en":"despise","zh":"輕視"},{"en":"detain","zh":"扣留、扣押"},{"en":"detention","zh":"拘留；留校察看"},{"en":"dictator","zh":"獨裁者"},{"en":"dictatorship","zh":"獨裁（政權）"}]},{"id":"L6-D05","level":6,"letter":"D","n":5,"zh":"阿公到牙科診所時一直忍著嘴裡的不適，直到坐上診療椅才開口。知道他有糖尿病的櫃檯人員處事謹慎，談他的病史前先請下一位病人稍等。","en":"At the dental clinic, Grandpa put up with the discomfort in his mouth and did not speak until he sat in the chair. The discreet receptionist, who knew he had diabetes, asked the next patient to wait a moment before discussing his medical history.","words":[{"en":"dental","zh":"牙齒的"},{"en":"diabetes","zh":"糖尿病"},{"en":"discomfort","zh":"不適、不舒服"},{"en":"discreet","zh":"謹慎的"}]},{"id":"L6-D06","level":6,"letter":"D","n":6,"zh":"那輛柴油接駁車才剛開始下坡，司機就發現油壓表的指針往下移動。他把車停在平路上，記下了油壓持續下降的趨勢，以便技師查明原因。","en":"The diesel shuttle had just started its descent when the driver noticed the needle on the oil pressure gauge moving downward. He parked the bus on flat ground and recorded the continuing downward trend in pressure so the mechanic could find the cause.","words":[{"en":"descent","zh":"下降；血統"},{"en":"diesel","zh":"柴油"},{"en":"downward","zh":"向下的"},{"en":"downward/downwards","zh":"向下的"}]},{"id":"L6-D07","level":6,"letter":"D","n":7,"zh":"晉級名單公布時，我們難以置信地盯著螢幕。隊長看出我們的沮喪，提醒我們，即使是最有天分的隊伍也不是命中注定會贏，一次落敗更不必斷送整季的努力。","en":"When the list of teams going through was announced, we stared at the screen in disbelief. Seeing our dismay, the captain reminded us that even the most talented team is not destined to win, and one loss does not have to doom a whole season's effort.","words":[{"en":"destined","zh":"注定的"},{"en":"disbelief","zh":"不相信、懷疑"},{"en":"dismay","zh":"驚愕、沮喪"},{"en":"doom","zh":"厄運；使注定（失敗）"}]},{"id":"L6-D08","level":6,"letter":"D","n":8,"zh":"換洗衣機前，工友先拆下舊機器的排水管，好讓積水排進桶裡。他提醒我們別把沒用完的洗衣精丟掉，因為下一位使用者還用得著。","en":"Before replacing the washing machine, the janitor detached the old machine's drain pipe so the water inside could discharge into a bucket. He reminded us not to discard the unused detergent because the next user could still use it.","words":[{"en":"detach","zh":"拆下、分離"},{"en":"detergent","zh":"洗衣精、清潔劑"},{"en":"discard","zh":"丟棄、拋棄"},{"en":"discharge","zh":"出院；排出（分泌物）"}]},{"id":"L6-D09","level":6,"letter":"D","n":9,"zh":"依演習指令，資訊組停用了遭入侵的帳號。組長說，若他們當時只貼出警告，根本嚇阻不了攻擊者，後果也會是災難性的。","en":"Following the drill's directive, the IT team disabled the hacked account. The leader said if they had only posted a warning, it would never have deterred the attacker, and the results would have been disastrous.","words":[{"en":"deter","zh":"嚇阻、制止"},{"en":"directive","zh":"指令"},{"en":"disable","zh":"使失能、使殘障；停用"},{"en":"disastrous","zh":"災難性的"}]},{"id":"L6-D10","level":6,"letter":"D","n":10,"zh":"我帶著沙拉醬趕到河堤時已是黃昏，練完球的隊友早已把三明治吃得一個不剩。要是我再晚一點到，連最後那盆生菜他們都會直接吃掉。","en":"By the time I hurried to the riverbank with the salad dressing, it was dusk, and my teammates had already devoured every sandwich after practice. If I had arrived any later, they would have eaten the last bowl of lettuce plain.","words":[{"en":"devour","zh":"狼吞虎嚥地吃"},{"en":"dressing","zh":"沙拉醬；敷料；穿衣"},{"en":"dusk","zh":"黃昏"}]},{"id":"L6-D11","level":6,"letter":"D","n":11,"zh":"老師每週都會口述一小段車站廣播，讓我們做聽寫。直到這星期聽寫時，我才終於能分辨那兩個聽起來極像的站名。","en":"Every week the teacher dictates a short station announcement for us to take dictation. Not until this week's dictation could I finally differentiate between two station names that sound very much alike.","words":[{"en":"dictate","zh":"口述；命令、支配"},{"en":"dictation","zh":"聽寫、口述"},{"en":"differentiate","zh":"區別、區分"}]},{"id":"L6-D12","level":6,"letter":"D","n":12,"zh":"辯論社討論一項懲戒措施時，社長竟把學弟公開表示異議視為全社的恥辱。若非副社長調解有方，那位學弟連說完話的機會都沒有。","en":"When the debate club discussed a disciplinary measure, the president actually saw a junior member's open dissent as a disgrace to the whole club. If not for the vice president's diplomacy, the junior would not even have had a chance to finish speaking.","words":[{"en":"diplomacy","zh":"外交、外交手腕"},{"en":"disciplinary","zh":"紀律的、懲戒的"},{"en":"disgrace","zh":"恥辱"},{"en":"dissent","zh":"異議、不同意"}]},{"id":"L6-D13","level":6,"letter":"D","n":13,"zh":"老師傅的門徒說，當年初學刻印時，就連音樂也會讓他分心，桌上可有可無的東西一律得收起來。當年需要如此專注的手藝，如今竟是他下班後最大的消遣。","en":"The old master's disciple said that when he first learned to carve seals, even music was a distraction, and anything dispensable on the desk had to be put away. A craft that once needed such focus is now his favorite diversion after work.","words":[{"en":"disciple","zh":"弟子、門徒"},{"en":"dispensable","zh":"可有可無的"},{"en":"distraction","zh":"使人分心的事物"},{"en":"diversion","zh":"轉移；改道；消遣"}]},{"id":"L6-D14","level":6,"letter":"D","n":14,"zh":"記者擔心，公開臨時住所的位置會擾亂住戶的生活，讓剛失去家園的人更加痛苦。她只公布物資募集地點，藉此把大家的注意力從住戶的行蹤轉向他們眼前的需求。","en":"The reporter worried that disclosing the location of the temporary housing would cause a disturbance to the residents and add to the distress of people who had just lost their homes. She only published the places where supplies were being collected, thereby diverting attention from the residents' whereabouts to their immediate needs.","words":[{"en":"distress","zh":"痛苦、困境"},{"en":"disturbance","zh":"干擾、騷動"},{"en":"divert","zh":"使轉向、轉移"}]},{"id":"L6-D15","level":6,"letter":"D","n":15,"zh":"藥師正在調劑藥品，便請我先看牆上的廢棄物處理說明。看了圖我才弄清楚，用過的一次性手套究竟該怎麼處置。","en":"While the pharmacist was dispensing medicine, she asked me to read the waste disposal instructions on the wall first. Only after looking at the pictures did I understand how to dispose of used disposable gloves.","words":[{"en":"dispense","zh":"分發、配（藥）"},{"en":"disposable","zh":"用完即丟的、拋棄式的"},{"en":"disposal","zh":"丟掉、處理"},{"en":"dispose","zh":"處理、丟棄（dispose of）"}]},{"id":"L6-D16","level":6,"letter":"D","n":16,"zh":"模擬帳戶領到第一筆股息時，社員對分散投資的提議仍半信半疑。直到一檔股票大跌，大家才投票贊成大幅調整持股。","en":"When the mock account got its first dividend, the members were still dubious about the proposal to diversify. Not until one stock dropped sharply did everyone vote for a drastic change in their holdings.","words":[{"en":"diversify","zh":"使多樣化、使變化"},{"en":"dividend","zh":"股息、紅利"},{"en":"drastic","zh":"激烈的、極端的"},{"en":"dubious","zh":"可疑的、半信半疑的"}]},{"id":"L6-D17","level":6,"letter":"D","n":17,"zh":"我才剛靠著宿舍裡的五斗櫃打起瞌睡，一陣穿堂風就把講義吹得滿地都是。等室友回來時，我已經趴在床底下找最後一張了。","en":"I had just started to doze against the dresser in my dorm room when a draught blew my handouts all over the floor. By the time my roommate came back, I was lying under the bed looking for the last page.","words":[{"en":"dormitory/dorm","zh":"宿舍"},{"en":"doze","zh":"打瞌睡"},{"en":"draught","zh":"（從門窗縫隙吹進的）冷風；草稿"},{"en":"dresser","zh":"梳妝臺、衣櫃"}]},{"id":"L6-D18","level":6,"letter":"D","n":18,"zh":"這棟老房子有雙重用途，一樓修車，樓上住人。附近的新高架橋讓這間住處顯得格外矮小。直到訪問長年居住於此的師傅，我們才知道整段施工期間他回家都得繞路。","en":"This old building has a dual purpose: cars are repaired on the ground floor, and people dwell upstairs. The new overpass nearby dwarfs the dwelling. Not until we interviewed the mechanic who has lived there for years did we learn that he had to take a detour home for the whole duration of the construction.","words":[{"en":"dual","zh":"雙重的、雙的"},{"en":"duration","zh":"持續時間、持續"},{"en":"dwarf","zh":"矮人、侏儒"},{"en":"dwell","zh":"居住"},{"en":"dwelling","zh":"住處"}]},{"id":"L6-E01","level":6,"letter":"E","n":1,"zh":"從前大家都覺得那位隨身帶著百科全書的鄰居很古怪。直到那次月食，我才知道他多年來一直努力把艱深的天文知識講給孩子聽。","en":"Everyone used to think the neighbor who always carried an encyclopedia was eccentric. Not until the lunar eclipse did I learn that he had spent years endeavoring to explain difficult astronomy to children.","words":[{"en":"eccentric","zh":"古怪的"},{"en":"eclipse","zh":"日蝕、月蝕"},{"en":"encyclopedia","zh":"百科全書"},{"en":"endeavor","zh":"努力"}]},{"id":"L6-E02","level":6,"letter":"E","n":2,"zh":"帶隊老師從一種常綠樹的落葉裡萃取出染料，讓我們用它把手帕染成淡黃色。有同學想嚐嚐那些葉子，她便要我們先查明這種樹的葉子是否可食用。","en":"Our teacher extracted dye from the fallen leaves of an evergreen tree and let us use it to dye our handkerchiefs light yellow. When a classmate wanted to taste the leaves, she asked us to first find out whether the leaves of this tree were edible.","words":[{"en":"edible","zh":"可食用的"},{"en":"evergreen","zh":"常綠的"},{"en":"extract","zh":"萃取、提取；摘錄"}]},{"id":"L6-E03","level":6,"letter":"E","n":3,"zh":"校友捐贈的基金已用來購買一批地方報紙的舊社論。讀過這些文章，我才明白它們當年如何啟發讀者，又如何提升了公共議題在校園裡的地位。","en":"The endowment donated by graduates has been used to buy a collection of old editorials from local newspapers. After reading these articles, I understood how they enlightened readers back then and elevated the status of public issues on campus.","words":[{"en":"editorial","zh":"社論；編輯的"},{"en":"elevate","zh":"提升、舉起"},{"en":"endowment","zh":"捐贈（基金）；天賦"},{"en":"enlighten(ment)","zh":"啟發、開導"}]},{"id":"L6-E04","level":6,"letter":"E","n":4,"zh":"走廊的警報響起時，一位電工正在檢查配電箱。等他收好工具，多數學生都已疏散到操場，導師還在陪最後一名拄著拐杖的學生走出教室。","en":"An electrician was checking the power box when the alarm in the hallway went off. By the time he packed his tools, most students had evacuated to the playground, and the homeroom teacher was still escorting the last student on crutches out of the classroom.","words":[{"en":"electrician","zh":"電工"},{"en":"escort","zh":"護送；護衛"},{"en":"evacuate","zh":"疏散、撤出"}]},{"id":"L6-E05","level":6,"letter":"E","n":5,"zh":"展覽裡那只行李箱喚起了舅公當年移居巴西的回憶。他說，自己雖然也是那一代的移民，卻是讀了老鄰居寫的信，才明白當年村裡為何出現移民潮。","en":"The suitcase in the exhibition evoked my great-uncle's memories of emigrating to Brazil. He said that although he was one of the emigrants of that generation, only after reading letters from an old neighbor did he understand why there was a wave of emigration from the village back then.","words":[{"en":"emigrant","zh":"（移居外國的）移民"},{"en":"emigrate","zh":"移居外國"},{"en":"emigration","zh":"移居外國"},{"en":"evoke","zh":"喚起、引起"}]},{"id":"L6-E06","level":6,"letter":"E","n":6,"zh":"報名校內田徑課後，我才發現連擅長短跑的同學也有跑不完長距離的時候。這學期教練一直帶我們慢跑，希望逐步提升每個人的耐力。","en":"After enrolling in the school's track class, I found that even classmates who excel at sprinting sometimes cannot finish long runs. This term the coach has had us jog to gradually enhance everyone's endurance.","words":[{"en":"endurance","zh":"耐力、忍耐"},{"en":"enhance(ment)","zh":"提升、加強"},{"en":"enroll(ment)","zh":"註冊、入學"},{"en":"excel","zh":"擅長、勝過"}]},{"id":"L6-E07","level":6,"letter":"E","n":7,"zh":"學校設立補助，是為了讓大家參與課外活動的機會均等，讓家境拮据的同學免於被排除在外。老師提醒我們，活動固然能豐富生活，卻不能把參加的數量等同於收穫的多寡。","en":"The school set up a grant to equalize chances to join extracurricular activities so that students from families short of money are not excluded. The teacher reminded us that although activities can enrich our lives, we should not equate the number of activities with how much we gain.","words":[{"en":"enrich(ment)","zh":"使豐富"},{"en":"equalize","zh":"使相等、補償"},{"en":"equate","zh":"同等看待"},{"en":"extracurricular","zh":"課外的"}]},{"id":"L6-E08","level":6,"letter":"E","n":8,"zh":"主考官請每位應試者朗讀一段小說摘錄。輪到我時，開口前的幾秒鐘漫長得像是永恆。正因為她肯靜靜等我，我至今仍十分敬重她。","en":"The examiner asked each examinee to read an excerpt from a novel aloud. When it was my turn, the few seconds before I spoke felt like an eternity. Because she was willing to wait quietly for me, I still hold her in high esteem.","words":[{"en":"esteem","zh":"尊敬、尊重"},{"en":"eternity","zh":"永恆"},{"en":"examinee","zh":"受試人、應試者"},{"en":"examiner","zh":"檢查人、審查人"},{"en":"excerpt","zh":"摘錄"}]},{"id":"L6-E09","level":6,"letter":"E","n":9,"zh":"今年校慶的支出已經超過預算，學生代表一直向籌委會施壓，要求削減多餘的宣傳費。最後通過的方案還規定，提供免費服務的攤位可免繳場地費。","en":"This year's spending on the school anniversary has already gone over budget, and student representatives have been exerting pressure on the planning committee to cut excess publicity costs. The plan that finally passed also exempts stalls that offer free services from paying a fee.","words":[{"en":"excess","zh":"過量；過多的"},{"en":"exempt","zh":"被免除的；免除"},{"en":"exert","zh":"運用、施加（壓力、影響）"}]},{"id":"L6-E10","level":6,"letter":"E","n":10,"zh":"為了趕在護照有效期限屆滿前換照，視力不好的姊姊請我陪她去拍照。店員指出她眼皮上有根掉落的睫毛，又提醒她，手中的折價券當天就會失效。","en":"To renew her passport before its expiration, my sister, who has poor eyesight, asked me to go with her to take photos. The clerk pointed out a fallen eyelash on her eyelid and reminded her that the coupon in her hand would expire that day.","words":[{"en":"expiration","zh":"到期、期滿"},{"en":"expire","zh":"到期、過期"},{"en":"eyelash/lash","zh":"睫毛"},{"en":"eyelid","zh":"眼皮"},{"en":"eyesight","zh":"視力"}]},{"id":"L6-F01","level":6,"letter":"F","n":1,"zh":"我們一直在改編地方民間傳說，把兩個敵對的派系寫進同一則寓言。結尾時，這些世仇要是還不肯一起修船，就誰也過不了河。","en":"We have been adapting local folklore and putting two rival factions into the same fable. At the end, if these old foes still refuse to fix the boat together, none of them can cross the river.","words":[{"en":"fable","zh":"寓言"},{"en":"faction","zh":"派系"},{"en":"foe","zh":"敵人"},{"en":"folklore","zh":"民間傳說、民俗"}]},{"id":"L6-F02","level":6,"letter":"F","n":2,"zh":"交換生在派皮上鋪好薄薄的奶油片，才發現老烤箱用的是華氏溫標。若不是他熟悉那套刻度，我們先試烤一個小派、再決定整批烘烤時間的計畫就不可行了。","en":"After the exchange student laid thin flakes of butter on the pastry, he found that the old oven used the Fahrenheit scale. If he had not been familiar with that scale, our plan to bake one small pie first before deciding the time for the whole batch would not have been feasible.","words":[{"en":"Fahrenheit","zh":"華氏（的）"},{"en":"feasible","zh":"可行的"},{"en":"flake","zh":"小薄片"}]},{"id":"L6-F03","level":6,"letter":"F","n":3,"zh":"自從上學期口譯不及格，我一直在練習應付最棘手的現場提問。今天面對評審時，雖然我一度說得結結巴巴，聲音也很微弱，仍把最後一句翻完了。","en":"Since I flunked interpreting last term, I have been practicing the most formidable live questions. Today in front of the judges, although I faltered for a moment and my voice was feeble, I still translated the last sentence.","words":[{"en":"falter","zh":"動搖、結巴"},{"en":"feeble","zh":"微弱的、衰弱的"},{"en":"flunk","zh":"（考試）不及格"},{"en":"formidable","zh":"令人敬畏的、難對付的"}]},{"id":"L6-F04","level":6,"letter":"F","n":4,"zh":"朋友的未婚夫從小就著迷於服裝設計，特別喜歡帶有女性柔美氣質的剪裁。他說，就算當年全班都取笑他的作品，他也不會放棄這種風格。","en":"My friend's fiancé has had a fascination with fashion design since he was little, especially cuts with a soft feminine look. He said even when the whole class laughed at his work, he would never forsake this style.","words":[{"en":"fascination","zh":"著迷；魅力"},{"en":"feminine","zh":"女性的、陰性的"},{"en":"forsake","zh":"拋棄"}]},{"id":"L6-F05","level":6,"letter":"F","n":5,"zh":"農場主人把家禽的糞便製成肥料，以改善土壤的肥力。去年若沒有在這一畦施這種肥，這裡的青菜現在就不會長得如此茂盛。","en":"The farm owner made fertilizer from fowl droppings to improve the fertility of the soil. If this fertilizer had not been used on this bed last year, the vegetables here would not be flourishing now.","words":[{"en":"fertility","zh":"肥沃；生育能力"},{"en":"fertilizer","zh":"肥料"},{"en":"flourish","zh":"繁榮、茂盛"},{"en":"fowl","zh":"家禽"}]},{"id":"L6-F06","level":6,"letter":"F","n":6,"zh":"在漁港，一位研究員示範怎麼從魚鰭辨認魚種。她解釋說，正因為海洋資源有限，她才多年來一直和漁民合作，擬定能讓當地漁業長久經營的計畫。","en":"At the fishing port, a researcher showed how to identify fish by their fins. She explained that it is precisely because ocean resources are finite that she has worked with fishermen for years to formulate a plan that keeps the local fishery going for a long time.","words":[{"en":"fin","zh":"鰭"},{"en":"finite","zh":"有限的"},{"en":"fishery","zh":"漁業"},{"en":"formulate","zh":"制定、構想"}]},{"id":"L6-F07","level":6,"letter":"F","n":7,"zh":"為了即將到來的慶典，放鞭炮的區域已經裝上防火隔板。要不是工作人員昨天又加固底座，昨晚的強風就會把隔板吹倒。","en":"For the forthcoming festival, fireproof panels have been put up in the area for setting off firecrackers. If the staff had not fortified the bases again yesterday, last night's strong wind would have blown the panels down.","words":[{"en":"firecracker","zh":"鞭炮"},{"en":"fireproof","zh":"防火的"},{"en":"forthcoming","zh":"即將來臨的"},{"en":"fortify","zh":"加強、設防"}]},{"id":"L6-F08","level":6,"letter":"F","n":8,"zh":"這盞舊檯燈有個設計缺陷，電線和陶瓷底座不斷摩擦，外皮都磨破了。除了底座上看得見的裂縫，還有一處損壞得等到學長拆開插頭才看得見，那就是燒斷的保險絲。","en":"This old lamp has a design flaw: friction between the wire and the ceramic base wore through the cover. Besides the visible crack in the base, another fault could only be seen when my senior opened the plug: a blown fuse.","words":[{"en":"flaw","zh":"缺陷、瑕疵"},{"en":"friction","zh":"摩擦"},{"en":"fuse","zh":"保險絲；融合"}]},{"id":"L6-F09","level":6,"letter":"F","n":9,"zh":"室友嫌我一聞到煙味就小題大作。直到我們走進原本茶香四溢的店裡，他才明白我為什麼擔心，隔壁燒落葉冒出的刺鼻煙氣已經蓋過了茶葉的清香。","en":"My roommate thought I made a fuss whenever I smelled smoke. Not until we walked into a shop that used to be full of the fragrance of tea did he understand why I worried. The sharp fumes from burning leaves next door had covered the fragrant smell of the tea.","words":[{"en":"fragrance","zh":"芬芳、香味"},{"en":"fragrant","zh":"芬香的、馥郁的"},{"en":"fume","zh":"（刺鼻有害的）煙、氣；生悶氣"},{"en":"fuss","zh":"大驚小怪、小題大作"}]},{"id":"L6-F10","level":6,"letter":"F","n":10,"zh":"高速公路突降冰雹，司機為了提醒後車減速，慌亂中錯過出口。一名乘客本來因為繞路而勃然大怒，這才明白是這反常的天候讓司機分了心。","en":"When hail suddenly fell on the freeway, the driver was trying to warn the cars behind to slow down and frantically missed the exit. A passenger who had been in a fury about the detour then understood that the freak weather had distracted the driver.","words":[{"en":"frantic","zh":"發狂似的、忙亂的"},{"en":"freak","zh":"怪人；反常的"},{"en":"freeway","zh":"高速公路"},{"en":"fury","zh":"憤怒、狂暴"}]},{"id":"L6-G01","level":6,"letter":"G","n":1,"zh":"兩匹馬正在吃草，籬笆外的狗一聲低吼，其中一匹便朝馬廄疾馳而去。直到教練把狗帶離圍欄，另一匹才又低頭吃草。","en":"Two horses were grazing when a dog outside the fence growled, and one of them galloped off toward the stable. The other did not lower its head to graze again until the coach led the dog away from the fence.","words":[{"en":"gallop","zh":"（馬）飛奔"},{"en":"graze","zh":"（牛羊）吃草；擦傷"},{"en":"growl","zh":"低吼"}]},{"id":"L6-G02","level":6,"letter":"G","n":2,"zh":"觀眾被老電影裡魅力十足的女主角吸引，卻鮮少注意幫派分子身上的那件外衣。直到看見領口的手工刺繡，我才體會到那個年代戲服的魅力。","en":"The audience was drawn to the glamorous heroine of the old movie but rarely noticed the garment the gangster wore. Not until I saw the hand embroidery on the collar did I appreciate the glamour of costumes from that time.","words":[{"en":"gangster","zh":"幫派分子、歹徒"},{"en":"garment","zh":"（一件）衣服"},{"en":"glamorous","zh":"富有魅力的、迷人的"},{"en":"glamour","zh":"魅力"}]},{"id":"L6-G03","level":6,"letter":"G","n":3,"zh":"地理老師給我們同一條冰河在不同年代拍下的照片，要我們運用幾何學估算它退縮了多遠。要不是資料裡記錄了拍攝地點的地理特徵，我們就會把兩個相似的山谷搞混。","en":"Our geography teacher gave us photos of the same glacier taken in different years and asked us to use geometry to estimate how far it had pulled back. If the data had not recorded the geographical features of where the photos were taken, we would have confused two similar valleys.","words":[{"en":"geographical","zh":"地理的"},{"en":"geometry","zh":"幾何學"},{"en":"glacier","zh":"冰河"}]},{"id":"L6-G04","level":6,"letter":"G","n":4,"zh":"守門員向隊友公開自己是同性戀後，網路上的惡意留言讓更衣室籠罩著一股低迷的氣氛。別校球員寄來充滿善意的卡片，他這才知道有那麼多人支持他。","en":"After the goalkeeper told his teammates he was gay, hateful comments online cast a gloom over the locker room. When players from another school sent him cards full of goodwill, he learned how many people supported him.","words":[{"en":"gay","zh":"同性戀的；（舊）快樂的"},{"en":"gloom","zh":"陰暗；憂鬱"},{"en":"goalkeeper","zh":"守門員"},{"en":"goodwill","zh":"善意"}]},{"id":"L6-G05","level":6,"letter":"G","n":5,"zh":"天還沒亮，冰面上只映著出口指示燈的一絲微光。等場燈亮起，第一位選手已經滑過場中央，表演服上的亮片正隨著她轉身閃閃發光。","en":"Before dawn, only a faint gleam from the exit sign shone on the ice. When the arena lights came on, the first skater was already gliding across the middle, and the sequins on her costume glittered as she turned.","words":[{"en":"gleam","zh":"微光；閃爍"},{"en":"glide","zh":"滑行、滑翔"},{"en":"glitter","zh":"閃閃發光"}]},{"id":"L6-G06","level":6,"letter":"G","n":6,"zh":"阿公在舊書攤找到一本有手繪插圖的福音書，我則挑了一本介紹大猩猩的圖鑑。我們在騎樓下分吃一顆葡萄柚時，他才告訴我，他那本書裡的插圖原來是他姊姊畫的。","en":"Grandpa found a gospel book with hand-drawn pictures at a used book stall, and I chose a guide to gorillas. Only when we were sharing a grapefruit under the arcade did he tell me that the pictures in his book were drawn by his sister.","words":[{"en":"gorilla","zh":"大猩猩"},{"en":"gospel","zh":"福音"},{"en":"grapefruit","zh":"葡萄柚"}]},{"id":"L6-G07","level":6,"letter":"G","n":7,"zh":"客人一直抱怨地面太滑，老闆循著腳印才發現廚房門口積了一層油脂。他一彎腰擦地就痛得呻吟了一聲，女兒見狀接過拖把。","en":"Customers kept grumbling that the floor was slippery, and the owner followed the footprints to find a layer of grease at the kitchen door. He groaned in pain as soon as he bent down to wipe the floor, so his daughter took the mop from him.","words":[{"en":"grease","zh":"油脂、潤滑油"},{"en":"groan","zh":"呻吟"},{"en":"grumble","zh":"抱怨、發牢騷"}]},{"id":"L6-H01","level":6,"letter":"H","n":1,"zh":"昨晚的冰雹損壞了山區的線路，讓部分考生在參加線上說明會前就已面臨連線不穩這項障礙。即使線路當晚已經修好，駭客的攻擊仍會妨礙他們登入。","en":"Last night's hail damaged the lines in the mountains, so some examinees faced the handicap of an unstable connection before the online briefing. Even after the lines were fixed that night, attacks by hackers could still hamper their logins.","words":[{"en":"hacker","zh":"駭客"},{"en":"hail","zh":"冰雹；招呼、讚揚"},{"en":"hamper","zh":"妨礙"},{"en":"handicap","zh":"身心障礙；不利條件"},{"en":"headphone(s)","zh":"頭戴式耳機"}]},{"id":"L6-H02","level":6,"letter":"H","n":2,"zh":"手工藝市集的陶藝老師說，等我們吃完這頓豐盛的午餐，剛捏好的杯子就會硬到拿得起來了。她讓我們先把杯子留在桌上。","en":"The pottery teacher at the handicraft market said that after we finished this hearty lunch, the cups we had just shaped would harden enough to pick up. She had us leave the cups on the table first.","words":[{"en":"handicraft","zh":"手工藝（品）"},{"en":"harden","zh":"使變硬、使堅強"},{"en":"hearty","zh":"熱情的；豐盛的"}]},{"id":"L6-H03","level":6,"letter":"H","n":3,"zh":"異性戀與同性戀學生都曾在班級群組受到騷擾。一名學生說，帶頭用照片羞辱他的，正是那個在台上呼籲大家彼此尊重的偽君子。","en":"Both heterosexual and homosexual students have faced harassment in the class group chat. One student said the person who led the way in using photos to humiliate him was the same hypocrite who called on everyone to respect each other on stage.","words":[{"en":"harass(ment)","zh":"騷擾"},{"en":"heterosexual","zh":"異性戀的"},{"en":"homosexual","zh":"同性戀的"},{"en":"humiliate","zh":"羞辱"},{"en":"hypocrite","zh":"偽君子、偽善者"}]},{"id":"L6-H04","level":6,"letter":"H","n":4,"zh":"主唱的聲音沙啞到連副歌也唱不了。他戴上頭戴式耳機聽了伴奏，才想到可以用口琴吹出原本要唱的旋律。","en":"The lead singer was so hoarse that he could not even sing the chorus. He put on headphones to listen to the backing track and then thought of playing the melody he was supposed to sing on a harmonica.","words":[{"en":"harmonica","zh":"口琴"},{"en":"headphone(s)","zh":"頭戴式耳機"},{"en":"hoarse","zh":"沙啞的"}]},{"id":"L6-H05","level":6,"letter":"H","n":5,"zh":"救難直升機在山壁上方盤旋時，隊員又檢查了一次安全吊帶。要是記者只拍下英勇救人的那一刻，觀眾就不會看到隊員為了接近受傷的登山客而克服的種種障礙。","en":"As the rescue helicopter hovered over the cliff, the team checked their harnesses again. If the reporter had only filmed the heroic moment of the rescue, the audience would not have seen the hurdles the team overcame to reach the injured hiker.","words":[{"en":"harness","zh":"馬具、安全帶；利用"},{"en":"heroic","zh":"英勇的、英雄式的"},{"en":"hover","zh":"盤旋、徘徊"},{"en":"hurdle","zh":"障礙、跨欄"}]},{"id":"L6-H06","level":6,"letter":"H","n":6,"zh":"憑著直覺，我回到圖書館後方的樹籬旁。那裡曾是社貓最愛去的地方，要是今天早上我沒在泥裡看見腳印，根本不會想到去那裡找牠。","en":"On a hunch, I went back to the hedge behind the library. It used to be the club cat's favorite haunt, and if I had not seen paw prints in the mud this morning, I would never have thought to look for him there.","words":[{"en":"haunt","zh":"（鬼魂）出沒；縈繞心頭"},{"en":"headphone(s)","zh":"頭戴式耳機"},{"en":"hedge","zh":"樹籬"},{"en":"hunch","zh":"預感、直覺"}]},{"id":"L6-H07","level":6,"letter":"H","n":7,"zh":"那間青年旅舍以主人的熱情款待而聞名。最讓我難忘的是那位好客的廚師，他一面帶我們做有益健康的早餐，一面示範在共用廚房該如何維持衛生。","en":"That hostel is known for the owner's hospitality. What I remember most is the hospitable cook, who led us in making a healthful breakfast while showing how to keep good hygiene in a shared kitchen.","words":[{"en":"headphone(s)","zh":"頭戴式耳機"},{"en":"healthful","zh":"有益健康的"},{"en":"hospitable","zh":"好客的、招待周到的"},{"en":"hospitality","zh":"好客、款待"},{"en":"hostel","zh":"青年旅館"},{"en":"hygiene","zh":"衛生"}]},{"id":"L6-H08","level":6,"letter":"H","n":8,"zh":"一名青年使用海洛因後住院，這件事加深了居民對毒品交易的憂慮。直到查到寄件單，記者才弄清楚送貨的人在販毒組織的階層中居於何處。","en":"A young man was hospitalized after using heroin, which heightened residents' worries about the drug trade. Not until the reporter found the shipping slip did she learn where the delivery man stood in the hierarchy of the drug ring.","words":[{"en":"heighten","zh":"增高、提高"},{"en":"heroin","zh":"海洛因"},{"en":"hierarchy","zh":"階級制度、層級"},{"en":"hospitalize","zh":"使住院"}]},{"id":"L6-H09","level":6,"letter":"H","n":9,"zh":"飛機遭劫持時，那名空服員一直在安撫受驚的乘客。多年後，她回母校領取名譽學位，有學生問她當年是怎麼決定先幫誰的。","en":"When the plane was hijacked, the flight attendant kept calming the frightened passengers. Years later, when she returned to her old school to receive an honorary degree, a student asked how she decided whom to help first back then.","words":[{"en":"hijack","zh":"劫持"},{"en":"honorary","zh":"榮譽的、無報酬的"}]},{"id":"L6-H10","level":6,"letter":"H","n":10,"zh":"園藝社正在比較同一種雜交蘭花在南、北半球的開花紀錄。如果交換生沒有在照片背面註明季節，我們現在就無法分辨哪些花是在澳洲的春天開的。","en":"The gardening club is comparing flowering records of the same hybrid orchid in the Northern and Southern Hemispheres. If the exchange student had not written the season on the back of each photo, we could not tell which flowers bloomed in the Australian spring.","words":[{"en":"hemisphere","zh":"半球"},{"en":"hybrid","zh":"混合的；混種"}]},{"id":"L6-I01","level":6,"letter":"I","n":1,"zh":"探照燈一照亮冰山，船長就下令轉向。看完模擬影片，老師問我們，既然當時碰撞已迫在眉睫，為什麼立刻轉向仍然勢在必行。","en":"As soon as the searchlight illuminated the iceberg, the captain ordered the ship to turn. After watching the simulation, the teacher asked why it was still imperative to turn at once when a crash was already imminent.","words":[{"en":"iceberg","zh":"冰山"},{"en":"illuminate","zh":"照亮；闡明"},{"en":"imminent","zh":"即將來臨的、逼近的"},{"en":"imperative","zh":"必要的、緊急的；祈使的"}]},{"id":"L6-I02","level":6,"letter":"I","n":2,"zh":"歷史展入口擺著一張氣勢宏偉的帝國宮殿照片。只有走到照片背面，觀眾才能讀到批評統治者而遭監禁的人留下的信，了解他們所遭受的不公。","en":"At the entrance of the history exhibition stands an imposing photo of the imperial palace. Only by walking around to the back of the photo can visitors read letters left by people facing imprisonment for criticizing the rulers and learn about the injustice they suffered.","words":[{"en":"imperial","zh":"帝國的、皇帝的"},{"en":"imposing","zh":"壯觀的、氣勢宏偉的"},{"en":"imprison(ment)","zh":"監禁"},{"en":"injustice","zh":"不公平、不公正"}]},{"id":"L6-I03","level":6,"letter":"I","n":3,"zh":"會後，我問口譯員怎麼聽出受訪者話裡含蓄的拒絕。她說，如果只看逐字稿，她就會錯過最後幾個字的語調所提供的無價線索。","en":"After the meeting, I asked the interpreter how she heard the implicit refusal in the speaker's words. She said if she had only read the transcript, she would have missed the invaluable clue the intonation of the last few words gave.","words":[{"en":"implicit","zh":"含蓄的、不言明的"},{"en":"interpreter","zh":"口譯員"},{"en":"intonation","zh":"語調"},{"en":"invaluable","zh":"非常寶貴的、無價的"}]},{"id":"L6-I04","level":6,"letter":"I","n":4,"zh":"報名校外教學前，我去詢問旅費是否已包含接駁費，以及通往旅館的斜坡有多陡。萬一得另外租車，我想先知道我們會多出多少費用。","en":"Before signing up for the field trip, I went to inquire whether the travel fee included the shuttle and how steep the incline to the hotel was. If we had to rent another car, I wanted to know first how much extra cost we would incur.","words":[{"en":"incline","zh":"傾向；傾斜"},{"en":"incur","zh":"招致、蒙受"},{"en":"inquire","zh":"詢問"}]},{"id":"L6-I05","level":6,"letter":"I","n":5,"zh":"學長當眾威嚇新生，讓小安憤慨的卻是旁觀者的冷漠。要不是她堅持，導師就不會出面干預，也不會請在場同學說明經過。","en":"An older student intimidated new students in public, but what made Xiao-An indignant was the bystanders' indifference. If not for her insistence, the homeroom teacher would not have intervened and asked the students there to explain what happened.","words":[{"en":"indifference","zh":"冷漠、不在乎"},{"en":"indignant","zh":"憤怒的、憤慨的"},{"en":"insistence","zh":"堅持"},{"en":"intervene","zh":"介入、干預"},{"en":"intimidate","zh":"威脅、恐嚇"}]},{"id":"L6-I06","level":6,"letter":"I","n":6,"zh":"我們訪問一座內陸小鎮的老居民，想知道小鎮開始工業化時，是什麼促使人們離開農田。直到他拿出舊照片，我們才看清當年河岸遭受的破壞有多嚴重。","en":"We interviewed an old resident of an inland town to learn what induced people to leave their farms when the town began to industrialize. Not until he took out old photos did we see how serious the damage inflicted on the riverbank had been.","words":[{"en":"induce","zh":"引起、誘導"},{"en":"industrialize","zh":"使工業化"},{"en":"inflict","zh":"使遭受（痛苦、傷害）"},{"en":"inland","zh":"內陸的"}]},{"id":"L6-I07","level":6,"letter":"I","n":7,"zh":"小島上雖有無數鳥類足跡，卻沒有一隻鳥入鏡。光憑這些印子，我們能推斷出哪些鳥棲息在島上，哪些只在途中停過嗎？","en":"Although there are innumerable bird tracks on the little isle, not a single bird was caught on camera. From these prints alone, can we infer which birds inhabit the island and which only stopped on the way?","words":[{"en":"infer","zh":"推論"},{"en":"inhabit","zh":"居住於"},{"en":"innumerable","zh":"無數的、數不清的"},{"en":"isle","zh":"小島"}]},{"id":"L6-I08","level":6,"letter":"I","n":8,"zh":"聽見謎題，我本能的反應是往後躲，怕大家拿答題速度來衡量我的智力。可是第一個舉手的女孩熱情極具感染力，連我都想上台一試。","en":"When I heard the puzzle, my instinctive reaction was to hide, afraid that everyone would judge my intellect by how fast I answered. But the enthusiasm of the girl who raised her hand first was so infectious that even I wanted to go up and try.","words":[{"en":"infectious","zh":"有傳染性的、易傳染的"},{"en":"instinctive","zh":"本能的、天生的"},{"en":"intellect","zh":"智力"}]},{"id":"L6-I09","level":6,"letter":"I","n":9,"zh":"從牆角吹來的一股涼風引起了我的好奇。直到我撥開垂下的常春藤，才看見那個一直藏在葉子後面的進氣口。","en":"A cool breeze from the corner of the wall intrigued me. Not until I pushed aside the hanging ivy did I see the air vent that had been hidden behind the leaves all along.","words":[{"en":"intrigue","zh":"激起……的興趣；陰謀"},{"en":"ivy","zh":"常春藤"}]},{"id":"L6-I10","level":6,"letter":"I","n":10,"zh":"每次社團擺攤，學長總會照著存貨清單，把箱子搬到十字路口旁的集合點。諷刺的是，這次忘了帶攤位海報的，正是那個負責提醒大家別忘東西的人。","en":"Every time the club sets up a stall, a senior invariably follows the inventory list and carries the boxes to the meeting point beside the intersection. Ironically, the person who forgot the stall poster this time was the one in charge of reminding everyone not to forget things.","words":[{"en":"intersection","zh":"十字路口；交集"},{"en":"invariably","zh":"總是、一成不變地"},{"en":"inventory","zh":"存貨（清單）"},{"en":"ironic","zh":"諷刺的"}]},{"id":"L6-I11","level":6,"letter":"I","n":11,"zh":"我們想用紀錄片呈現祖母與孫子之間的親密感。攝影師提醒我們，就算拍了好幾週，只要我們未經邀請就闖入他們的私人空間，在他們眼中仍是闖入者。","en":"We wanted our documentary to show the intimacy between a grandmother and her grandson. The cameraman reminded us that even after weeks of filming, if we intruded on their private space without being invited, we would still be intruders in their eyes.","words":[{"en":"intimacy","zh":"親密（關係）"},{"en":"intrude","zh":"闖入、打擾"},{"en":"intruder","zh":"闖入者"}]},{"id":"L6-I12","level":6,"letter":"I","n":12,"zh":"每回彩排，那件戲服穿得越久，我的脖子就越癢。要不是同學注意到我比平常急躁，我根本不會開口說那件衣領有多刺激我的皮膚。","en":"At every rehearsal, the longer I wore that costume, the more my neck itched. If a classmate had not noticed that I was more irritable than usual, I would never have said how much the collar irritated my skin.","words":[{"en":"irritable","zh":"易怒的"},{"en":"irritate","zh":"激怒；刺激（皮膚等）"},{"en":"itch","zh":"癢；發癢"}]},{"id":"L6-J01","level":6,"letter":"J","n":1,"zh":"婚禮那天，一向開朗的外婆拿出玉簪，把一朵茉莉花別進姊姊的頭髮。多年後，讓姊姊落淚的仍是外婆在那個歡樂場合裡對她說的話。","en":"On the wedding day, my always jolly grandma took out a jade hairpin and pinned a jasmine flower into my sister's hair. Years later, what still makes my sister cry are the words Grandma said to her on that joyous occasion.","words":[{"en":"jade","zh":"玉"},{"en":"jasmine","zh":"茉莉"},{"en":"jolly","zh":"愉快的、高興的"},{"en":"joyous","zh":"快樂的、高興的"}]},{"id":"L6-J02","level":6,"letter":"J","n":2,"zh":"校舍管理員停在兩條走廊的交會處，腰間的鑰匙碰撞作響。直到他推開門，我們才發現那位受邀來談職涯的講者竟是個賽馬騎師。","en":"The janitor stopped at the junction of two hallways, and the keys at his waist jingled. Not until he pushed open the door did we find that the speaker invited to talk about careers was a horse-racing jockey.","words":[{"en":"janitor","zh":"工友、清潔管理員"},{"en":"jingle","zh":"叮噹聲"},{"en":"jockey","zh":"賽馬騎師"},{"en":"junction","zh":"交叉口、匯合處"}]},{"id":"L6-K01","level":6,"letter":"K","n":1,"zh":"我想知道相簿裡哪些人是祖母的親屬，就去請教對地方史很有見識的舅公。要不是他說起照片裡的渡船頭，我現在對家史的這份興趣根本不會被點燃。","en":"I wanted to know which people in the photo album were Grandma's kin, so I asked my great-uncle, who is knowledgeable about local history. If he had not talked about the ferry landing in the photo, my interest in our family history would never have been kindled.","words":[{"en":"kin","zh":"親屬"},{"en":"kindle","zh":"點燃"},{"en":"knowledgeable","zh":"知識豐富的"}]},{"id":"L6-L01","level":6,"letter":"L","n":1,"zh":"那個第一次離家念書的小伙子把租約翻到背面，問女房東水管若是自行破裂，誰得負擔修繕費。她指給他看哪一條寫明了雙方各自的責任。","en":"The lad leaving home to study for the first time turned the lease over and asked the landlady who would pay if a water pipe broke by itself. She showed him the clause that stated what each side was liable for.","words":[{"en":"lad","zh":"少年、小伙子"},{"en":"landlady","zh":"女房東"},{"en":"lease","zh":"租約、租期"},{"en":"liable","zh":"有（法律）責任的；有……傾向的"}]},{"id":"L6-L02","level":6,"letter":"L","n":2,"zh":"救援隊把山崩地點的緯度和經度寫在白板上。看到志工把兩個數字對調，隊長才明白，對看地圖的外行人而言，光憑數字很難分辨哪一個表示災區離赤道以北多遠。","en":"The rescue team wrote the latitude and longitude of the landslide on the whiteboard. When he saw a volunteer swap the two numbers, the leader realized that for a layman reading a map, it is hard to tell from the numbers alone which one shows how far north of the equator the disaster area is.","words":[{"en":"landslide","zh":"山崩、土石流；壓倒性勝利"},{"en":"latitude","zh":"緯度"},{"en":"layman","zh":"外行人"},{"en":"longitude","zh":"經度"}]},{"id":"L6-L03","level":6,"letter":"L","n":3,"zh":"校刊封面的版面設計獲得校長毫不吝惜的讚美，尤其是那個重新畫過的校隊標誌。至於那篇冗長的編輯手記，她說要是篇幅減半，讀到結尾的人就會更多。","en":"The layout of the school magazine's cover won lavish praise from the principal, especially the redrawn school team logo. As for the lengthy editor's note, she said if it were half as long, more people would read to the end.","words":[{"en":"lavish","zh":"奢華的、大方的"},{"en":"layout","zh":"版面設計、格局"},{"en":"lengthy","zh":"冗長的、漫長的"},{"en":"logo","zh":"商標、標誌"}]},{"id":"L6-L04","level":6,"letter":"L","n":4,"zh":"兩位女同性戀媽媽在座談會上把填過的學校表格拿給立法委員看。直到看見其中一位媽媽竟得在「父親」那欄簽名，委員才明白，改動欄位就能減輕這些家庭的負擔。","en":"At a forum, two lesbian mothers showed a legislator a school form they had filled out. Not until he saw that one mother had to sign in the \\"father\\" box did the legislator understand that changing the boxes could lessen the burden on these families.","words":[{"en":"legislator","zh":"立法委員、議員"},{"en":"lesbian","zh":"女同性戀者；女同性戀的"},{"en":"lessen","zh":"減少、縮小"}]},{"id":"L6-L05","level":6,"letter":"L","n":5,"zh":"那位中尉冒著致命的砲火打開營門，解放了關在裡面的平民。多年後，一名倖存者回憶說，對他而言，解放的意義在於終於能自己決定往哪裡走。","en":"The lieutenant opened the camp gate under lethal gunfire and liberated the civilians held inside. Years later, a survivor recalled that for him, liberation meant finally being able to decide for himself where to go.","words":[{"en":"lethal","zh":"致命的"},{"en":"liberate","zh":"解放、釋放"},{"en":"liberation","zh":"釋放、解放"},{"en":"lieutenant","zh":"中尉、副官"}]},{"id":"L6-L06","level":6,"letter":"L","n":6,"zh":"識字班讓阿公實現了一輩子的心願，成為能讀也能寫的人。如果他的讀寫能力沒有進步，他現在他連信都得靠我念給他聽，更沒辦法和我討論成語的字面意思。","en":"The literacy class fulfilled Grandpa's lifelong wish to become literate. If his reading and writing had not improved, he would still need me to read his letters to him, let alone discuss the literal meaning of idioms with me.","words":[{"en":"lifelong","zh":"終身的、畢生的"},{"en":"liter","zh":"公升"},{"en":"literacy","zh":"識字、讀寫能力"},{"en":"literal","zh":"字面上的"},{"en":"literate","zh":"識字的"}]},{"id":"L6-L07","level":6,"letter":"L","n":7,"zh":"我們投宿的小木屋藏在茂密的林子裡，窗外高聳的山峰遮住了朝陽。直到晨光越過山脊，原本昏暗的房間才漸漸亮了起來。","en":"The cabin we stayed in was hidden in lush woods, and the lofty peaks outside the window blocked the morning sun. Not until the light came over the ridge did the dim room slowly lighten.","words":[{"en":"lighten","zh":"減輕；變亮"},{"en":"lofty","zh":"崇高的"},{"en":"lush","zh":"茂盛的"}]},{"id":"L6-L08","level":6,"letter":"L","n":8,"zh":"小祺一跛一跛地走回更衣室，從置物櫃裡拿出擦腳用的乳液。等她把手伸進釘鞋，才發現磨破腳跟的正是內襯上那塊翹起的邊。","en":"Xiao-Qi limped back to the locker room and took out lotion for her feet from her locker. When she put her hand into her spikes, she found that the raised edge of the lining was what had rubbed her heel raw.","words":[{"en":"limp","zh":"跛行；軟弱無力的"},{"en":"lining","zh":"襯裡、內層"},{"en":"locker","zh":"置物櫃"},{"en":"lotion","zh":"乳液"}]},{"id":"L6-L09","level":6,"letter":"L","n":9,"zh":"我們才聽見郵輪上的擴音器廣播請遊客別再逗留岸上，弟弟就想起那一公升鮮奶還留在剛才那家店。他問我們是否來得及回去拿。","en":"As soon as we heard the loudspeaker on the cruise liner telling visitors not to linger on shore, my brother remembered that the liter of milk was still at the shop we had just left. He asked if we had time to go back for it.","words":[{"en":"liner","zh":"郵輪、班機"},{"en":"linger","zh":"逗留、徘徊"},{"en":"liter","zh":"公升"},{"en":"loudspeaker","zh":"擴音器、喇叭"}]},{"id":"L6-L10","level":6,"letter":"L","n":10,"zh":"農夫帶我們去看家畜時，弟弟卻留在蓮花池邊看石頭上的蜥蜴。不是農夫拿來的飼料，而是一隻掠過水面的昆蟲把蜥蜴從石頭上引了下來。","en":"When the farmer took us to see the livestock, my brother stayed by the lotus pond to watch a lizard on a rock. It was not the feed the farmer brought but an insect skimming over the water that lured the lizard off the rock.","words":[{"en":"livestock","zh":"家畜"},{"en":"lizard","zh":"蜥蜴"},{"en":"lotus","zh":"蓮花"},{"en":"lure","zh":"引誘；誘餌"}]},{"id":"L6-L11","level":6,"letter":"L","n":11,"zh":"第一次在宿舍過農曆新年，夜越深，我就越覺得孤單。直到電話裡傳來媽媽唱的那首熟悉的搖籃曲，我才知道自己最想念的是什麼。","en":"It was my first Lunar New Year in the dorm, and the later it got, the more lonesome I felt. Not until I heard Mom sing that familiar lullaby over the phone did I know what I missed most.","words":[{"en":"lonesome","zh":"寂寞的"},{"en":"lullaby","zh":"搖籃曲、催眠曲"},{"en":"lunar","zh":"月亮的；農曆的"}]},{"id":"L6-L12","level":6,"letter":"L","n":12,"zh":"校刊用抽籤決定誰能訪問那位百歲木匠，我抽中了。大家最想知道的是當年做家具賺不賺錢，我卻更想聽他親口說，長壽有什麼祕訣。","en":"The school magazine held a lottery to decide who would interview the hundred-year-old carpenter, and I won. Everyone most wanted to know whether making furniture was lucrative back then, but I wanted to hear him say himself what the secret of longevity was.","words":[{"en":"longevity","zh":"長壽"},{"en":"lottery","zh":"樂透、彩券"},{"en":"lucrative","zh":"賺錢的、有利可圖的"}]},{"id":"L6-M01","level":6,"letter":"M","n":1,"zh":"我問捐出手稿的長者：「女士，您知道是誰寫了這些頁邊註記嗎？」若非她把其中一行放大，我根本認不出那是她女兒小時候的筆跡。","en":"I asked the elderly lady who donated the manuscript, \\"Ma'am, do you know who wrote these notes in the margins?\\" If she had not magnified one of the lines, I would never have recognized it as her daughter's handwriting as a child.","words":[{"en":"magnify","zh":"放大、擴大"},{"en":"manuscript","zh":"手稿、原稿"}]},{"id":"L6-M02","level":6,"letter":"M","n":2,"zh":"渡輪從離島首航大陸那天，姊姊一直站在甲板上。船頭一轉過海角，她便看見雄偉的山脈，也終於明白畫家為何都想捕捉這片海岸的壯麗。","en":"On the day of the ferry's maiden voyage from the island to the mainland, my sister stood on the deck the whole time. As soon as the bow turned around the cape, she saw the majestic mountains and finally understood why painters all wanted to capture the majesty of this coast.","words":[{"en":"maiden","zh":"少女；首次的"},{"en":"mainland","zh":"大陸、本土"},{"en":"majestic","zh":"宏偉的、莊嚴的"},{"en":"majesty","zh":"陛下；雄偉"}]},{"id":"L6-M03","level":6,"letter":"M","n":3,"zh":"割草之前，工友先用繩子圍起操場旁種著楓樹的小土丘。要是割草機撞到任何一棵樹，樹皮上就會留下傷痕，孩子們這幾年付出的心血也會白費。","en":"Before mowing, the janitor roped off the small mound with maple trees beside the playground. If the mower hit any tree, it would mar the bark, and the children's years of hard work would be wasted.","words":[{"en":"maple","zh":"楓樹"},{"en":"mar","zh":"損毀、損傷"},{"en":"mound","zh":"土堆、小丘"},{"en":"mow","zh":"割草"}]},{"id":"L6-M04","level":6,"letter":"M","n":4,"zh":"研究中世紀武術的老師拿起木劍，示範君主的護衛如何擋下攻擊。讓我們驚嘆的是他對每個動作的精準掌握，連劍尖都能穩穩停在標線上。","en":"The teacher who studies medieval martial arts picked up a wooden sword and showed how a monarch's guards blocked attacks. What made us marvel was his mastery of every move. Even the tip of the sword stopped right on the mark.","words":[{"en":"martial","zh":"軍事的、武術的"},{"en":"marvel","zh":"驚嘆；奇蹟"},{"en":"mastery","zh":"精通、掌握"},{"en":"medieval","zh":"中世紀的"},{"en":"monarch","zh":"君主"}]},{"id":"L6-M05","level":6,"letter":"M","n":5,"zh":"那棟老宅的女主人每週都邀剛搬來的移民到家裡，讓他們和老住戶交流。後來廚房輪值引發爭執，雙方都說，若有人能出面調解，就是這位已經聽過兩邊說法的女主人。","en":"The mistress of the old house invites newly arrived migrants to her home every week to mingle with longtime residents. Later, when the kitchen schedule caused a dispute, both sides said that if anyone could mediate, it would be her, since she had already heard both sides.","words":[{"en":"mediate","zh":"調解"},{"en":"migrant","zh":"移居者、移工；候鳥"},{"en":"mingle","zh":"混合；交際"},{"en":"mistress","zh":"情婦；女主人"}]},{"id":"L6-M06","level":6,"letter":"M","n":6,"zh":"作曲家說，她曾把憂鬱當成唯一的靈感女神。直到她開始每天冥想，才發現一小段平靜的冥想也能讓旋律浮上心頭。","en":"The composer said she used to treat melancholy as her only muse. Not until she started meditating every day did she find that a short period of calm meditation could also bring melodies to mind.","words":[{"en":"meditate","zh":"冥想、沉思"},{"en":"meditation","zh":"沉思、冥想"},{"en":"melancholy","zh":"憂鬱、悲哀"},{"en":"muse","zh":"沉思；靈感來源"}]},{"id":"L6-M07","level":6,"letter":"M","n":7,"zh":"教練把「先守好下一球」當成座右銘，想改變我們光等對手失誤的心態。若不是我們接受了這個想法，報上那場「奇蹟般的逆轉」就不會從一記普通的抄球開始。","en":"The coach made \\"Defend the next point first\\" our motto to change our mentality of just waiting for opponents to make mistakes. If we had not accepted this idea, the \\"miraculous comeback\\" in the newspaper would not have started with an ordinary steal.","words":[{"en":"mentality","zh":"心態"},{"en":"miraculous","zh":"奇蹟般的"},{"en":"motto","zh":"座右銘"}]},{"id":"L6-M08","level":6,"letter":"M","n":8,"zh":"那個面目駭人的海怪布偶本來該和美人魚一起從道具箱裡拿出來。導演翻遍箱裡各式各樣的道具才發現，竟有人把它當成商品放到門口去賣了。","en":"The monstrous sea monster puppet was supposed to come out of the prop box with the mermaid. Only after the director searched through all the miscellaneous props in the box did she find that someone had put it at the door to sell as merchandise.","words":[{"en":"merchandise","zh":"商品"},{"en":"mermaid","zh":"美人魚"},{"en":"miscellaneous","zh":"各式各樣的、雜項的"},{"en":"monstrous","zh":"巨大的；駭人的"}]},{"id":"L6-M09","level":6,"letter":"M","n":9,"zh":"線上班會時，一個淘氣的同學貼上假小鬍子，模仿導師點名。他當時如果記得看看鏡頭有沒有開，就會明白光把麥克風設成靜音，有些事仍瞞不住。","en":"During our online class meeting, a mischievous classmate stuck on a fake mustache and mimicked the homeroom teacher calling the roll. If he had remembered to check whether his camera was on, he would have understood that muting the microphone does not hide everything.","words":[{"en":"mischievous","zh":"淘氣的、惡作劇的"},{"en":"mustache","zh":"八字鬍"},{"en":"mute","zh":"靜音的；沉默的"}]},{"id":"L6-M10","level":6,"letter":"M","n":10,"zh":"鎮上宣布打算花三年讓市場設備現代化，卻沒說這項現代化工程會給攤商帶來多少金錢上的負擔。直到攤商動員鄰居到公聽會發言，要求公開預算的行動才有了聲勢。","en":"The town announced that it planned to spend three years modernizing the market's equipment, but it did not say how much of a monetary burden this modernization would put on the vendors. Not until the vendors mobilized their neighbors to speak at the public hearing did the push to make the budget public gain momentum.","words":[{"en":"mobilize","zh":"動員、調動"},{"en":"modernization","zh":"現代化"},{"en":"modernize","zh":"現代化"},{"en":"momentum","zh":"動力、氣勢"},{"en":"monetary","zh":"貨幣的、金錢的"}]},{"id":"L6-M11","level":6,"letter":"M","n":11,"zh":"連日來訓練的單調乏味讓隊長變得喜怒無常，全隊的士氣也跟著下滑。有位新生提議，何不讓他們輪流帶熱身，看看換個帶隊的人會不會有幫助。","en":"The monotony of days of training made the captain moody, and the whole team's morale dropped too. A new student suggested letting them take turns leading the warm-up to see if a different leader would help.","words":[{"en":"monotony","zh":"單調"},{"en":"moody","zh":"喜怒無常的"},{"en":"morale","zh":"士氣"}]},{"id":"L6-M12","level":6,"letter":"M","n":12,"zh":"紀念音樂會上，我們以一首悲切的老歌哀悼過世的團員。她的女兒播放了一段錄音，裡頭的媽媽說，正是為人母的經歷讓她第一次想到自己終有一死，也讓她開始思考能留些什麼給孩子。","en":"At the memorial concert, we mourned a member who had died with a mournful old song. Her daughter played a recording in which her mother said motherhood was what first made her think about being mortal and made her consider what she could leave her children.","words":[{"en":"mortal","zh":"終有一死的；致命的"},{"en":"motherhood","zh":"母親的身分"},{"en":"mourn","zh":"哀悼"},{"en":"mournful","zh":"悲傷的"}]},{"id":"L6-N01","level":6,"letter":"N","n":1,"zh":"我們選了一位歷史老師擔任旁白，因為他在上一部影片中曾敘述民族主義如何影響那一代人的選擇。他說，與其一再嘮叨著要學生查證，不如讓他們聽兩段互相矛盾的訪談，再自己判斷該相信什麼。","en":"We chose a history teacher as narrator because in our last film, he narrated how nationalism shaped the choices of that generation. He said instead of nagging students to check facts again and again, it was better to let them hear two interviews that contradicted each other and judge for themselves what to believe.","words":[{"en":"nag","zh":"嘮叨"},{"en":"narrate","zh":"敘述、旁白"},{"en":"narrator","zh":"講述者、敘述者"},{"en":"nationalism","zh":"民族主義"}]},{"id":"L6-N02","level":6,"letter":"N","n":2,"zh":"我是個近視的航海新手，而這處河口的沙洲又以常讓船擱淺而惡名昭彰。老師問我，要是當時沒有電子導航，我還能不能操船安全通過。","en":"I am a nearsighted novice at sailing, and the sandbars at this river mouth are notorious for making boats run aground. The teacher asked me whether I could still navigate the boat safely through without electronic navigation.","words":[{"en":"navigate","zh":"導航、航行"},{"en":"navigation","zh":"導航、航行"},{"en":"nearsighted","zh":"近視的"},{"en":"notorious","zh":"惡名昭彰的"},{"en":"novice","zh":"新手、初學者"}]},{"id":"L6-N03","level":6,"letter":"N","n":3,"zh":"修復師從那座裸體雕像的左鼻孔取出一枚美國五分鎳幣。館員調出三十年前的舊照片，指著照片裡露出來的銀色邊緣說，從照片看來，那枚硬幣當時肯定已經卡在裡面了。","en":"The restorer took an American nickel out of the left nostril of the nude statue. The staff found an old photo from thirty years ago and pointed at the silver edge showing in it, saying that judging from the photo, the coin must have been stuck in there already.","words":[{"en":"nickel","zh":"鎳；五分錢硬幣"},{"en":"nostril","zh":"鼻孔"},{"en":"nude","zh":"裸體的"}]},{"id":"L6-N04","level":6,"letter":"N","n":4,"zh":"三名學生組成了菜園志工隊的核心，除了用堆肥滋養土壤，也耐心培育接班人。一年後，老師問我哪個改變最顯著，我指著那些已經能帶新人的國一生。","en":"Three students formed the nucleus of the garden volunteer team. Besides nourishing the soil with compost, they patiently nurtured the students who would take over after them. A year later, when the teacher asked me what the most notable change was, I pointed at the seventh graders who could already lead newcomers.","words":[{"en":"notable","zh":"值得注意的、著名的"},{"en":"nourish(ment)","zh":"滋養"},{"en":"nucleus","zh":"（原子、細胞）核；核心"},{"en":"nurture","zh":"養育、培養"}]},{"id":"L6-O01","level":6,"letter":"O","n":1,"zh":"兩名旅行者翻過最後一座沙丘才抵達綠洲，當晚分吃了一碗燕麥粥。要不是嚮導教過他們怎麼找水，他們根本到不了這裡；兩人立下誓言，平安回家後一定親口向他道謝。","en":"The two travelers did not reach the oasis until they climbed over the last sand dune, and that night they shared a bowl of oatmeal. If the guide had not taught them how to find water, they would never have made it there. The two took an oath to thank him in person when they got home safely.","words":[{"en":"oasis","zh":"綠洲"},{"en":"oath","zh":"誓約、誓言"},{"en":"oatmeal","zh":"燕麥片"}]},{"id":"L6-O02","level":6,"letter":"O","n":2,"zh":"離岸平台爆發火災，迫使公司提前撤離人員。有人問這類事故在其他平台是否常見，調查員說，她得先查明失火時有幾部消防泵還能運轉。","en":"An outbreak of fire on the offshore platform obliged the company to evacuate workers early. When someone asked whether such occurrences were common on other platforms, the investigator said she first had to find out how many fire pumps were still operative when the fire started.","words":[{"en":"oblige","zh":"使有義務；幫忙"},{"en":"occurrence","zh":"發生、事件"},{"en":"offshore","zh":"離岸的、海上的"},{"en":"operative","zh":"運作中的；有效的"},{"en":"outbreak","zh":"（疾病、戰爭）爆發"}]},{"id":"L6-O03","level":6,"letter":"O","n":3,"zh":"我們班最外向的同學最近迷上了登山，連畢業郊遊都堅持要走最陡的路。他雖然頑固，看了坡度圖還是承認，第一次帶隊就走那條路未免太過火了。","en":"The most outgoing student in our class has become obsessed with mountain climbing lately and even insisted on taking the steepest path for our graduation outing. Although he is obstinate, after looking at the slope map he admitted that taking that path the first time he led a group would be overdoing it.","words":[{"en":"obsess","zh":"使著迷、使困擾"},{"en":"obstinate","zh":"固執的"},{"en":"outgoing","zh":"外向的；即將離職的"},{"en":"outing","zh":"郊遊、遠足"},{"en":"overdo","zh":"做得過火"}]},{"id":"L6-O04","level":6,"letter":"O","n":4,"zh":"章魚從石縫裡伸出觸腕時，孩子以為是玻璃上的倒影吸引了牠。解說員說，吸引牠的其實是牡蠣的氣味。孩子接著問，牠的後代會怎麼找到食物。","en":"When the octopus stretched an arm out of a crack in the rocks, the children thought a reflection on the glass had attracted it. The guide said it was actually the odor of oysters. The children then asked how its offspring would find food.","words":[{"en":"octopus","zh":"章魚"},{"en":"odor","zh":"氣味（多指臭味）"},{"en":"offspring","zh":"子孫、後代"},{"en":"oyster","zh":"牡蠣、蚵"}]},{"id":"L6-O05","level":6,"letter":"O","n":5,"zh":"三位工人說，即使雇主扣留護照的行為已被法律明文禁止，他們仍記得工頭如何利用護照壓迫他們。其中一人說，光是開口談那段受壓迫的日子，對他就是一場折磨。","en":"Three workers said that even though employers keeping workers' passports has been clearly outlawed, they still remember how the foreman used their passports to oppress them. One said that just talking about those days of oppression was an ordeal for him.","words":[{"en":"oppress","zh":"壓迫"},{"en":"oppression","zh":"壓迫"},{"en":"ordeal","zh":"折磨、嚴酷的考驗"},{"en":"outlaw","zh":"宣布……為非法；亡命之徒"}]},{"id":"L6-O06","level":6,"letter":"O","n":6,"zh":"主辦人帶我們參觀孤兒院，讓我們熟悉環境。儲藏室比我想像的還整齊，盒上的照片讓孩子一眼就看出每件玩具該放回哪裡。","en":"The organizer showed us around the orphanage to orient us. The storeroom was more orderly than I had imagined, and the photos on the boxes let the children see at a glance where each toy belonged.","words":[{"en":"orderly","zh":"有秩序的、整齊的"},{"en":"organizer","zh":"主辦人、組織者"},{"en":"orient","zh":"使適應、定位；東方"},{"en":"orphanage","zh":"孤兒院"}]},{"id":"L6-O07","level":6,"letter":"O","n":7,"zh":"那位銀匠的東方地毯上有一個葡萄藤圖案，他用一盎司銀子打造手環，再以同一圖案裝飾它。有人問這個圖案源自哪裡，他指著地毯，笑說照傳統做法，學徒會從範本裡挑。","en":"There is a grapevine pattern on the silversmith's oriental rug, and he decorated a bracelet made from an ounce of silver with the same pattern as an ornament. When someone asked where the pattern originated, he pointed at the rug and smiled, saying that in the orthodox way, apprentices choose from a model.","words":[{"en":"orient","zh":"使適應、定位；東方"},{"en":"oriental","zh":"東方的"},{"en":"originate","zh":"起源於"},{"en":"ornament","zh":"裝飾品"},{"en":"orthodox","zh":"正統的、傳統的"},{"en":"ounce","zh":"盎司"}]},{"id":"L6-O08","level":6,"letter":"O","n":8,"zh":"談判之前，對前景樂觀的員工人數超過了悲觀的人。若有人預見公司會全盤拒絕支付夜班津貼，這項離譜的決定引發的公憤就不至於如此出人意料。","en":"Before the negotiations, the workers with an optimistic outlook outnumbered those who were pessimistic. If anyone had foreseen that the company would refuse outright to pay the night-shift allowance, the outrage this outrageous decision caused would not have been so surprising.","words":[{"en":"outlook","zh":"展望；觀點"},{"en":"outnumber","zh":"數量超過"},{"en":"outrage","zh":"憤慨；暴行"},{"en":"outrageous","zh":"離譜的、令人憤慨的"},{"en":"outright","zh":"完全的、徹底的；直率地"}]},{"id":"L6-O09","level":6,"letter":"O","n":9,"zh":"計畫一開始，我們就去市郊查看一座逢暴雨就滿溢的水池。技師指著閘門上朝外的箭頭，要我把門向外推，留意流出來的水最後積在哪裡。","en":"At the outset of the project, we went to the outskirts of the city to check a pool that overflows whenever there is heavy rain. The technician pointed at the outward arrow on the gate and asked me to push the gate outward and watch where the water flowing out finally collected.","words":[{"en":"outset","zh":"開始、開端"},{"en":"outskirts","zh":"郊區"},{"en":"outward","zh":"向外的；外表的"},{"en":"outward/outwards","zh":"向外"},{"en":"overflow","zh":"溢出、滿出來"}]},{"id":"L6-O10","level":6,"letter":"O","n":10,"zh":"我無意間聽到站長說，他已連續兩週提早上班記錄臭氧濃度。我指出早晚兩班有半小時重疊，並問，能不能在那段時間讀數，免得他繼續過度操勞。","en":"I happened to overhear the stationmaster say he had come to work early for two weeks in a row to record ozone levels. I pointed out that the morning and evening shifts overlap by half an hour and asked if the readings could be taken then so he would not keep overworking.","words":[{"en":"overhear","zh":"無意中聽到"},{"en":"overlap","zh":"重疊、重複"},{"en":"overwork","zh":"過度工作"},{"en":"ozone","zh":"臭氧"}]},{"id":"L6-P01","level":6,"letter":"P","n":1,"zh":"祖母在半島的海灘上收集小卵石，這是她最喜歡的消遣。她帶我去過一次，要不是她出門前塞給我一小包餅乾，我早就餓得顧不得找那顆她形容過的綠石頭了。","en":"Collecting pebbles on the peninsula's beaches is Grandma's favorite pastime. She took me once, and if she had not slipped me a packet of crackers before we left, I would have been too hungry to look for the green stone she described.","words":[{"en":"packet","zh":"小包"},{"en":"pastime","zh":"消遣、娛樂"},{"en":"pebble","zh":"小鵝卵石"},{"en":"peninsula","zh":"半島"}]},{"id":"L6-P02","level":6,"letter":"P","n":2,"zh":"教練說，只准在浮標圈內測試小艇原型。等我們試過兩種槳，才弄清楚哪一種最容易推動小艇，又不會讓坐在船頭的人陷入危險。","en":"The coach said the boat prototype could only be tested inside the circle of buoys. Only after we tried two kinds of paddles did we find out which one best propelled the boat without putting the person in the front in peril.","words":[{"en":"paddle","zh":"槳；划槳"},{"en":"peril","zh":"危險"},{"en":"propel","zh":"推進"},{"en":"prototype","zh":"原型"}]},{"id":"L6-P03","level":6,"letter":"P","n":3,"zh":"讀書會選了一本愛國者寫的散文平裝書。比起那些對讀者說教的篇章，我們討論最久的是那個悖論：他主張，有時公開批評自己的國家才是最愛國的舉動。","en":"Our book club chose a paperback of prose by a patriot. Rather than the essays that preach to readers, what we discussed longest was the paradox he raised: sometimes openly criticizing one's own country is the most patriotic act.","words":[{"en":"paperback","zh":"平裝書"},{"en":"paradox","zh":"矛盾的事物、悖論"},{"en":"patriot","zh":"愛國者"},{"en":"patriotic","zh":"愛國的、有愛國心的"},{"en":"preach","zh":"講道；說教"},{"en":"prose","zh":"散文"}]},{"id":"L6-P04","level":6,"letter":"P","n":4,"zh":"把公車服務民營化的法案在國會懸而未決。駕駛問，如果容許一家業者取消最後一班山區公車，會不會開創先例，最終使整個地區的交通癱瘓。","en":"A bill to privatize bus services is pending in parliament. A driver asked whether making it permissible for one company to cancel the last mountain bus would set a precedent that could eventually paralyze transportation in the whole region.","words":[{"en":"paralyze","zh":"使癱瘓"},{"en":"parliament","zh":"國會、議會"},{"en":"pending","zh":"未決定的、待處理的"},{"en":"permissible","zh":"可允許的"},{"en":"precedent","zh":"先例、前例"},{"en":"privatize","zh":"私有化"}]},{"id":"L6-P05","level":6,"letter":"P","n":5,"zh":"我剛從圍欄縫隙偷看，棲息在矮種馬棚頂上的孔雀就跳了下來。飼養員還在清點家禽，她要我關好棚門，以免這隻孔雀又走回她已數過的那一群。","en":"Just as I peeked through a gap in the fence, the peacock perched on the roof of the pony shed jumped down. The keeper was still counting the poultry, and she asked me to close the shed door so the peacock would not walk back into the group she had already counted.","words":[{"en":"peacock","zh":"孔雀"},{"en":"peek","zh":"偷看、看一眼"},{"en":"perch","zh":"棲息；棲木"},{"en":"pony","zh":"矮種馬"},{"en":"poultry","zh":"家禽"}]},{"id":"L6-P06","level":6,"letter":"P","n":6,"zh":"祖父說，要不是當年種植園遭逢蝗災，那批幼苗就不會全部枯死。如今他又開始犁那塊地，我從沒看過他這麼精準地犁出一行行田溝。","en":"Grandpa said if the plantation had not been hit by a plague of locusts back then, those young plants would not all have perished. Now he has begun to plow that land again, and I have never seen him plow rows with such precision.","words":[{"en":"perish","zh":"死亡、毀滅"},{"en":"plague","zh":"瘟疫；困擾"},{"en":"plantation","zh":"大農場、種植園"},{"en":"plow","zh":"犁"},{"en":"precision","zh":"精確、精密"}]},{"id":"L6-P07","level":6,"letter":"P","n":7,"zh":"接連遭到拒絕之後，這位年輕鋼琴家仍堅持練琴，直到她的熟練程度足以公開演出。老師說，正是那股毅力讓她得以登台，但她也該為一直沒消退的手腕疼痛看醫生了。","en":"After being rejected again and again, the young pianist persevered in practicing until her proficiency was good enough for public performance. Her teacher said it was that persistence that got her on stage, but she should also see a doctor about the persistent pain in her wrist.","words":[{"en":"persevere","zh":"堅持不懈"},{"en":"persistence","zh":"堅持、毅力"},{"en":"persistent","zh":"堅持不懈的；持續的"},{"en":"pianist","zh":"鋼琴家"},{"en":"proficiency","zh":"熟練、精通"}]},{"id":"L6-P08","level":6,"letter":"P","n":8,"zh":"班上兩組對能源政策的立場截然相反，一組主張停止進口石油，另一組連調高汽油稅都不接受。偏鄉通勤者描述了每天的車程，讓兩組都開始深思，自己的提案會讓誰付出代價。","en":"The two groups in our class took opposite positions on energy policy. One wanted to stop importing petroleum, and the other would not even accept a higher tax on petrol. A rural commuter described her daily drive, and both groups began to ponder who would pay the price for their proposals.","words":[{"en":"petrol","zh":"汽油"},{"en":"petroleum","zh":"石油"},{"en":"ponder","zh":"沉思、考慮"}]},{"id":"L6-P09","level":6,"letter":"P","n":9,"zh":"我去藥局替剛因肺炎出院的爸爸領藥，妹妹則想問臉上那顆青春痘。藥師先讓我們說清楚每個問題是替誰問的，才打開相對應的紀錄。","en":"I went to the pharmacy to get medicine for Dad, who had just left the hospital after pneumonia, and my sister wanted to ask about a pimple on her face. The pharmacist first had us make clear whom each question was for before opening the matching records.","words":[{"en":"pharmacist","zh":"藥師"},{"en":"pharmacy","zh":"藥局、藥房"},{"en":"pimple","zh":"痘痘、青春痘"},{"en":"pneumonia","zh":"肺炎"}]},{"id":"L6-P10","level":6,"letter":"P","n":10,"zh":"扒手混進香客的行列，偷走了一位老人的錢包。現場有禁止拍照的規定，沒有人拍到竊案經過。檢方是靠一名認出嫌犯的香客作證，才得以起訴他。","en":"A pickpocket slipped into the procession of pilgrims and stole an old man's wallet. Because of the prohibition on taking photos there, no one filmed the theft. The prosecutors were only able to prosecute the suspect because a pilgrim who recognized him testified.","words":[{"en":"pickpocket","zh":"扒手"},{"en":"pilgrim","zh":"朝聖者"},{"en":"procession","zh":"（遊行）隊伍"},{"en":"prohibition","zh":"禁止、禁令"},{"en":"prosecute","zh":"起訴"}]},{"id":"L6-P11","level":6,"letter":"P","n":11,"zh":"搬運工比一向準時的主廚還早到，放下麵粉時還特別留意自己的姿勢。第一盤奶油泡芙剛出爐，主廚就請他試吃，問他餡裡是否還要加一小撮鹽。","en":"The porter arrived even earlier than the always punctual chef and paid attention to his posture when he put down the flour. As soon as the first tray of cream puffs came out of the oven, the chef asked him to try one and asked if the filling needed another pinch of salt.","words":[{"en":"pinch","zh":"捏、擰"},{"en":"porter","zh":"（搬行李的）服務員；門房"},{"en":"posture","zh":"姿勢"},{"en":"puff","zh":"吹、噴（一口氣、煙）；泡芙"},{"en":"punctual","zh":"準時的、守時的"}]},{"id":"L6-P12","level":6,"letter":"P","n":12,"zh":"新戲首演前有一場給有意買票的觀眾看的預演。劇作家原以為最後一幕最能打動他們，聽完觀眾的回應才發現，讓他們決定買票的其實是開場那段對話。","en":"Before the new play's premiere, there was a preview for prospective buyers. The playwright thought the last scene would move them most, but after hearing their feedback, he found that what made them decide to buy tickets was the dialogue at the beginning.","words":[{"en":"playwright","zh":"劇作家"},{"en":"premiere","zh":"首映、首演"},{"en":"preview","zh":"預覽、預告"},{"en":"prospective","zh":"未來的、可能的"}]},{"id":"L6-P13","level":6,"letter":"P","n":13,"zh":"省政府的檔案裡有一本無價的田野筆記。要是沒有它，我們今天就無從知道，在史前時代居住於這片河谷的人，是在哪一段河岸建造房屋的。","en":"In the provincial government's archive there is a priceless field notebook. Without it, we would have no way of knowing on which part of the riverbank the people who lived in this valley in prehistoric times built their houses.","words":[{"en":"prehistoric","zh":"史前的"},{"en":"priceless","zh":"無價的"},{"en":"provincial","zh":"省的；地方性的"}]},{"id":"L6-P14","level":6,"letter":"P","n":14,"zh":"新任主席原以為，必須有前任那樣的聲望，才能主持這場爭議不斷的會議。真正幫上忙的，是她事先寄出的暫定議程，因為代表們已標出哪些議題得多留時間。","en":"The new chairwoman thought she needed her predecessor's prestige to preside over this controversial meeting. What really helped was the provisional agenda she had sent out beforehand, because the delegates had already marked which issues needed more time.","words":[{"en":"predecessor","zh":"前任"},{"en":"preside","zh":"主持"},{"en":"prestige","zh":"聲望、威望"},{"en":"provisional","zh":"臨時的"}]},{"id":"L6-P15","level":6,"letter":"P","n":15,"zh":"我們用同一支探針測量水樣的導電度，比較兩種濾材淨化水的效果。每換一個樣本，我們就先洗淨探針。要是少了這項預防措施，我們現在就無法判斷，讀數的差異究竟反映水樣純度不同，還是探針上留有上一個樣本的殘液。","en":"We used the same probe to measure the conductivity of water samples to compare how well two filter materials purified water. We washed the probe before each new sample. Without this preventive step, we could not tell whether differences in the readings reflected differences in the purity of the samples or leftover liquid from the last sample.","words":[{"en":"preventive","zh":"預防的"},{"en":"probe","zh":"探查、調查；探針"},{"en":"purify","zh":"淨化"},{"en":"purity","zh":"純淨、純正"}]},{"id":"L6-P16","level":6,"letter":"P","n":16,"zh":"有人想用一句諺語宣傳精神醫學講座，聲稱一句話比任何藥物都更有力量。主講人問，能不能改用她做心理治療的實例，並請我們刪去那張暗示她有通靈能力的插畫。","en":"Someone wanted to publicize a psychiatry lecture with a proverb claiming that one sentence is more potent than any medicine. The speaker asked whether we could use real examples from her psychotherapy work instead and asked us to remove the picture suggesting she had psychic powers.","words":[{"en":"potent","zh":"強效的、有力的"},{"en":"proverb","zh":"諺語、格言"},{"en":"psychiatry","zh":"精神醫學"},{"en":"psychic","zh":"通靈的；靈媒"},{"en":"psychotherapy","zh":"心理治療"},{"en":"publicize","zh":"宣傳"}]},{"id":"L6-Q01","level":6,"letter":"Q","n":1,"zh":"地震過後，我去登記幫忙整理物資。負責人讀到我填的倉儲訓練經歷，問我，具備這項資格的人要教新志工點貨，最好的方式是什麼。","en":"After the quake, I signed up to help sort supplies. When the person in charge read about my training in warehouse work, she asked me what the best way was for someone with this qualification to teach new volunteers to count goods.","words":[{"en":"quake","zh":"顫抖、地震"},{"en":"qualification","zh":"資格、條件"}]},{"id":"L6-R01","level":6,"letter":"R","n":1,"zh":"館員在地上畫了一個半徑兩公尺的圓，讓我們站在圓周上感受聚光燈散發的熱。有人問牆上那座光彩奪目的鐘是否塗過放射性塗料，她便把鐘轉過來，讓我們看見使鐘面發亮的小燈。","en":"The staff member drew a circle with a radius of two meters on the floor and had us stand on the edge to feel the heat radiating from the spotlight. When someone asked whether the radiant clock on the wall had been painted with radioactive paint, she turned it around and showed us the small light that made its face glow.","words":[{"en":"radiant","zh":"容光煥發的；發光的"},{"en":"radiate","zh":"放射、散發"},{"en":"radioactive","zh":"有放射性的"},{"en":"radius","zh":"半徑"}]},{"id":"L6-R02","level":6,"letter":"R","n":2,"zh":"小蘿蔔採收後，鄰居分到三分之一，其餘由我們拿去市場賣。看著那些從沒來幫忙的人也享受了我們勞動的成果，我才領悟到，分配方式早在播種前就該談好。","en":"After the radishes were harvested, the neighbors got a third, and we took the remainder to the market to sell. Seeing people who never came to help also reap the rewards of our work, I came to the realization that how to share should have been agreed on before planting.","words":[{"en":"radish","zh":"櫻桃蘿蔔、小蘿蔔"},{"en":"realization","zh":"實現、領悟"},{"en":"reap","zh":"收割、收穫"},{"en":"remainder","zh":"剩餘部分；餘數"}]},{"id":"L6-R03","level":6,"letter":"R","n":3,"zh":"樂團在跑道旁為接力賽排練一段饒舌表演。教練發現，穿著反光背心的歌手比站在彎道的工作人員還顯眼，便讓工作人員也穿上同款背心，好讓跑者看得見他們。","en":"The band rehearsed a rap beside the track for the relay. The coach noticed that the singers in reflective vests were easier to see than the staff standing at the bends, so he had the staff wear the same vests so the runners could see them.","words":[{"en":"rap","zh":"饒舌音樂；敲擊"},{"en":"reflective","zh":"反光的；深思的"},{"en":"rehearse","zh":"排練"},{"en":"relay","zh":"接力賽；轉達、轉播"}]},{"id":"L6-R04","level":6,"letter":"R","n":4,"zh":"裁判看完重播後認為，自己在沒看清楚前就判人犯規太輕率了。他向兩位隊長解釋，究竟是哪個動作魯莽，又給他們時間，讓他們把各自對那場碰撞的說法核對清楚，釐清出入。","en":"After watching the replay, the referee thought he had been rash to call a foul before seeing clearly. He explained to the two captains which move was reckless and gave them time to reconcile their respective accounts of the collision and settle the differences.","words":[{"en":"rash","zh":"皮疹"},{"en":"reckless","zh":"魯莽的"},{"en":"reconcile","zh":"使和解、調停"},{"en":"referee","zh":"裁判"},{"en":"respective","zh":"分別的、各自的"}]},{"id":"L6-R05","level":6,"letter":"R","n":5,"zh":"在模擬國會裡，代表們認為，只有舉行公民投票，才能嚴謹地檢驗支持者的主張。票數揭曉後，「多數人贊成正式批准條約」的說法就被推翻了。","en":"In the mock parliament, the representatives reckoned that only a referendum could rigorously test the supporters' claims. When the votes were counted, the claim that the majority supported formally ratifying the treaty was refuted.","words":[{"en":"ratify","zh":"批准"},{"en":"reckon","zh":"認為、估計"},{"en":"referendum","zh":"公民投票"},{"en":"refute","zh":"反駁、駁斥"},{"en":"rigorous","zh":"嚴格的、嚴謹的"}]},{"id":"L6-R06","level":6,"letter":"R","n":6,"zh":"最後一艘船走後，漣漪逐漸平息，潛水員才看清珊瑚礁受損的範圍。地方議會決定，在這片礁區修復前，該處的休閒潛水活動都得暫停。","en":"After the last boat left and the ripples calmed down, the divers could see the extent of the damage to the reef. The local council decided that recreational diving there must stop until the reef was restored.","words":[{"en":"recreational","zh":"休閒娛樂的"},{"en":"reef","zh":"礁、暗礁"},{"en":"ripple","zh":"漣漪"}]},{"id":"L6-R07","level":6,"letter":"R","n":7,"zh":"編輯讓我們刪掉一段文字裡不必要的重複，再比較修改前後的版本。我這才明白，改進文章有時得靠刪字。休息時我出門走了一圈，好讓自己恢復精神，回來才發現茶點已被收走了。","en":"The editor had us cut a passage's unnecessary redundancy and compare the versions before and after. Only then did I understand that refining writing sometimes means cutting words. During the break I took a walk to refresh myself, and when I came back, the refreshments had already been cleared away.","words":[{"en":"redundancy","zh":"多餘；裁員"},{"en":"refine(ment)","zh":"精煉；改進"},{"en":"refresh(ment)","zh":"使恢復精神；重新整理"},{"en":"refreshment(s)","zh":"茶點、飲料"}]},{"id":"L6-R08","level":6,"letter":"R","n":8,"zh":"這頂王冠是那個王朝留下的遺物，只有王室成員才有資格佩戴。負責修復的工匠以金工技藝聞名，他讓我們看冠緣幾乎磨平的刻字，問我們能否從中辨認它製於哪位國王在位期間。","en":"This crown is a relic of that dynasty, and only royalty may wear it. The craftsman in charge of its restoration is renowned for his metalwork. He showed us the almost worn-away words on the edge of the crown and asked if we could tell from them during which king's reign it was made.","words":[{"en":"refreshment(s)","zh":"茶點、飲料"},{"en":"reign","zh":"統治（時期）"},{"en":"relic","zh":"遺物、遺蹟"},{"en":"renowned","zh":"著名的"},{"en":"restoration","zh":"修復、恢復"},{"en":"royalty","zh":"王室成員；版稅"}]},{"id":"L6-R09","level":6,"letter":"R","n":9,"zh":"戲院的招牌亮起，令人想起從前排隊買票的夜晚，街坊都為它的復興而欣喜。若非居民多年來一直抵禦無情的風雨，修好一次又一次漏水的屋頂，今天哪還有戲院能讓人重振？","en":"When the theater's sign lit up, reminiscent of the nights when people lined up for tickets, the neighbors rejoiced at its revival. If residents had not resisted relentless wind and rain for years and fixed the leaking roof again and again, would there be any theater left to revive today?","words":[{"en":"refreshment(s)","zh":"茶點、飲料"},{"en":"rejoice","zh":"欣喜"},{"en":"relentless","zh":"不間斷的；無情的"},{"en":"reminiscent","zh":"令人想起……的"},{"en":"revival","zh":"復興、復活"},{"en":"revive","zh":"甦醒；復興"}]},{"id":"L6-R10","level":6,"letter":"R","n":10,"zh":"住在山上的家庭多年來一直仰賴同一條水管。為減少對舊管線的依賴，他們另鋪一條備用管，選的材料既比舊管的材料堅固，也更能抵抗腐蝕。","en":"The families living on the mountain have been reliant on the same water pipe for years. To reduce their reliance on the old pipe, they laid a backup pipe made of a material that is both more robust than the old one and more resistant to rust.","words":[{"en":"reliance","zh":"依賴"},{"en":"reliant","zh":"依賴的"},{"en":"resistant","zh":"有抵抗力的、耐……的"},{"en":"robust","zh":"強健的、穩固的"}]},{"id":"L6-R11","level":6,"letter":"R","n":11,"zh":"老師說，要是任由我們在崎嶇的溪谷裡到處走，就會驚擾巢穴。她於是架起長鏡頭，好讓我們留在步道上也能觀察這種爬蟲類如何繁殖。","en":"The teacher said if she let us roam the rugged valley, we would disturb the nests. So she set up a long lens so we could stay on the trail and still watch how these reptiles reproduce.","words":[{"en":"reproduce","zh":"繁殖；複製"},{"en":"reptile","zh":"爬蟲類"},{"en":"roam","zh":"漫遊"},{"en":"rugged","zh":"崎嶇的；粗獷的"}]},{"id":"L6-R12","level":6,"letter":"R","n":12,"zh":"兩位作者發現各自負責的段落遭到替換，都心生怨氣。其中一人原想尖銳地回嘴，卻忍住了。另一人後來說，要是換作自己先開口，絕不會表現出同樣的克制。","en":"Both writers resented finding that the parts they were each in charge of had been replaced. One wanted to retort sharply but restrained himself. The other later said that if he had been the first to speak, he would never have shown the same restraint.","words":[{"en":"resent(ment)","zh":"憤恨、不滿"},{"en":"restrain","zh":"抑制、阻止"},{"en":"restraint","zh":"克制、限制"},{"en":"retort","zh":"反駁、頂嘴"}]},{"id":"L6-R13","level":6,"letter":"R","n":13,"zh":"我陪爸爸到檔案室取回祖父寄給家人的信。最讓我們意外的是信裡揭露的一件事：當年帶頭起義、反抗那位殘酷統治者的，竟是一向沉默的曾祖母。","en":"I went with Dad to the archive to retrieve the letters my grandfather sent the family. What surprised us most was a revelation in the letters: the person who led the revolt against that ruthless ruler back then was my always quiet great-grandmother.","words":[{"en":"retrieve","zh":"取回；擷取"},{"en":"revelation","zh":"揭露；啟示"},{"en":"revolt","zh":"叛亂、反抗"},{"en":"ruthless","zh":"無情的、殘忍的"}]},{"id":"L6-R14","level":6,"letter":"R","n":14,"zh":"兩隊的競爭圍繞著一個問題：誰能讓滾筒轉得最久，同時把混在垃圾裡的瓶子分出來？等兩隊各自在滾筒上畫了一條白線後，裁判才有辦法量出每次旋轉要多久。","en":"The rivalry between the two teams centered on one question: who could keep the drum rotating longest while separating the bottles mixed in the rubbish? Only after each team drew a white line on its drum could the referee measure how long each rotation took.","words":[{"en":"referee","zh":"裁判"},{"en":"rivalry","zh":"競爭、對抗"},{"en":"rotate","zh":"旋轉；輪流"},{"en":"rotation","zh":"旋轉；輪流"},{"en":"rubbish","zh":"廢物、垃圾"}]},{"id":"L6-S01","level":6,"letter":"S","n":1,"zh":"要不是工人打撈起猛烈風暴中沉入港裡的水泵，臨時安置處的衛生環境就不會恢復得這麼快。返校那天，我們特別向這群工人致敬。","en":"If the workers had not salvaged the water pump that sank into the harbor in the savage storm, sanitation at the temporary shelter would not have recovered so quickly. On the day we went back to school, we saluted these workers.","words":[{"en":"salute","zh":"敬禮；致敬"},{"en":"salvage","zh":"搶救、打撈"},{"en":"sanitation","zh":"（環境）衛生"},{"en":"savage","zh":"野蠻的；兇猛的"}]},{"id":"L6-S02","level":6,"letter":"S","n":2,"zh":"學姊拍下海鷗飛過一段風景秀麗的海岸。光看照片，誰都會以為沙灘很寧靜，根本猜不到她在取景時得多挑剔，才能避開排隊的人潮。","en":"My senior photographed seagulls flying over a scenic stretch of coast. From the photo alone, anyone would think the beach was serene and would never guess how selective she had to be when framing the shot to avoid the crowds lining up.","words":[{"en":"scenic","zh":"風景優美的"},{"en":"seagull/gull","zh":"海鷗"},{"en":"selective","zh":"有選擇性的"},{"en":"serene","zh":"寧靜的、沉著的"}]},{"id":"L6-S03","level":6,"letter":"S","n":3,"zh":"那位警佐既沒有長篇說教，也沒有輕蔑受騙的人。他把一名連續詐欺犯寄的訊息給我們看，問我們能否看出對方是如何用免費餐券引誘學生交出帳戶資料的。","en":"The sergeant neither gave a long sermon nor showed scorn for the people who had been tricked. He showed us messages sent by a serial scammer and asked if we could see how he used free meal vouchers to seduce students into handing over their account information.","words":[{"en":"scorn","zh":"輕蔑、藐視"},{"en":"seduce","zh":"誘惑"},{"en":"sergeant","zh":"中士、警佐"},{"en":"serial","zh":"連續的；連載、連續劇"},{"en":"sermon","zh":"講道、佈道"}]},{"id":"L6-S04","level":6,"letter":"S","n":4,"zh":"雕刻家仔細檢查過木像，才用螺絲起子拆下底座，輕輕刮掉鞋底的舊膠。更讓她吃驚的是木像手裡的小卷軸，上頭刻著工班當年的午餐帳，寫的是每人一份麵，師傅多一顆蛋。","en":"After the sculptor carefully examined the wooden figure, she removed the base with a screwdriver and gently scraped the old glue off the soles. What surprised her more was the little scroll in the figure's hand, carved with the workers' lunch bill from long ago: one serving of noodles each, with an extra egg for the master.","words":[{"en":"scrape","zh":"刮、擦傷"},{"en":"screwdriver","zh":"螺絲起子"},{"en":"scroll","zh":"捲動（螢幕）；卷軸"},{"en":"sculptor","zh":"雕刻家"},{"en":"serving","zh":"（食物的）一份"},{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"}]},{"id":"L6-S05","level":6,"letter":"S","n":5,"zh":"校方把維修預算砍半，已經是個挫折。舊工坊確實有缺點，但要是我們只因為它看起來破舊就拆了它，未免太短視。","en":"The school cutting the repair budget in half was already a setback. The old workshop does have shortcomings, but tearing it down just because it looks shabby would be shortsighted.","words":[{"en":"setback","zh":"挫折、退步"},{"en":"shabby","zh":"破舊的"},{"en":"shortcoming","zh":"缺點、短處"},{"en":"shortsighted","zh":"近視的、目光短淺的"}]},{"id":"L6-S06","level":6,"letter":"S","n":6,"zh":"阿公拖著腳走進理髮店時，我還以為他是來幫我磨利剪刀的。沒想到他把電動刮鬍刀塞進我手裡，自己坐上理髮椅，還提醒我別刮得太靠近他下巴上的疤。","en":"When Grandpa shuffled into the barbershop, I thought he had come to help me sharpen my scissors. Instead, he put an electric shaver in my hand, sat in the barber's chair, and reminded me not to shave too close to the scar on his chin.","words":[{"en":"sharpen","zh":"削尖、磨利"},{"en":"shaver","zh":"電動刮鬍刀"},{"en":"shuffle","zh":"拖著腳走；洗（牌）"},{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"}]},{"id":"L6-S07","level":6,"letter":"S","n":7,"zh":"主任在廢紙堆裡發現一份完整的學生名冊，便要人把每一頁都切碎。學區總監說，這樣草率地處理學生資料，他只得宣布暫停回收作業。","en":"The director found a complete list of students in a pile of waste paper and had every page shredded. The superintendent said that because student information had been handled so sloppily, he had to announce a suspension of recycling.","words":[{"en":"shred","zh":"碎片；切絲、撕碎"},{"en":"sloppy","zh":"馬虎的、邋遢的"},{"en":"superintendent","zh":"主管、督學；（大樓）管理員"},{"en":"suspension","zh":"暫停；停學、停職；懸吊"}]},{"id":"L6-S08","level":6,"letter":"S","n":8,"zh":"我才剛按下快門，身後就傳來一聲尖叫。一隻麻雀從矮灌木裡飛了出來，嚇到了蹲在我身後的小弟。","en":"I had just pressed the shutter when a shriek came from behind me. A sparrow had flown out of a low shrub and frightened my little brother squatting behind me.","words":[{"en":"shriek","zh":"尖叫"},{"en":"shrub","zh":"灌木"},{"en":"shutter","zh":"百葉窗；（相機）快門"},{"en":"sparrow","zh":"麻雀"}]},{"id":"L6-S09","level":6,"letter":"S","n":9,"zh":"工程社想簡化直播設備，讓兩臺攝影機按一個鈕就能同步錄影。我起初對這個設計心存懷疑，直到親手試過才體會到它簡潔的好處。","en":"The engineering club wanted to simplify the livestream equipment so two cameras could record simultaneously at the press of one button. I was skeptical of this design at first, until I tried it myself and appreciated the benefits of its simplicity.","words":[{"en":"simplicity","zh":"簡單、樸素"},{"en":"simplify","zh":"簡化"},{"en":"simultaneous","zh":"同時的"},{"en":"skeptical","zh":"懷疑的"}]},{"id":"L6-S10","level":6,"letter":"S","n":10,"zh":"我略讀了辭典的補遺，發現編者為每個地方俚語都列了一個同義詞。同義詞選得再準，讀者若沒聽過當地人講這句話，還是很難聽出原句的幽默。","en":"I skimmed the dictionary's supplement and found that the editors listed a synonym for every local slang expression. No matter how well the synonym is chosen, if readers have never heard local people say the phrase, it is still hard to hear the humor in the original.","words":[{"en":"skim","zh":"略讀；撇去"},{"en":"slang","zh":"俚語"},{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"},{"en":"supplement","zh":"補充；補充品；增刊"},{"en":"synonym","zh":"同義詞"}]},{"id":"L6-S11","level":6,"letter":"S","n":11,"zh":"導覽員以莊重的語氣讀出日記中描述平民遭到屠殺的那一段。政府當年曾壓制相關報導，直到另一份日記出土，人們才知道是誰殺害了前來救人的記者。","en":"The guide read in a solemn voice the part of the diary describing the slaughter of civilians. The government suppressed reports about it back then, and not until another diary was found did people learn who slew the reporter who came to help.","words":[{"en":"slaughter","zh":"屠殺；屠宰"},{"en":"solemn","zh":"嚴肅的、莊重的"},{"en":"suppress","zh":"鎮壓；抑制"}]},{"id":"L6-S12","level":6,"letter":"S","n":12,"zh":"經濟衰退讓這片貧民窟裡愈來愈多人瀕臨餓死。餐館老闆自己也曾整天找工作、餓著肚子回家，因此很同情這些人，讓他們在打烊後免費用餐。","en":"The economic slump pushed more and more people in this slum toward starvation. The restaurant owner had once spent whole days looking for work and come home hungry, so he sympathized with them and let them eat for free after closing.","words":[{"en":"slum","zh":"貧民窟"},{"en":"slump","zh":"暴跌；重重地坐下"},{"en":"starvation","zh":"飢餓、餓死"},{"en":"sympathize","zh":"同情、憐憫"}]},{"id":"L6-S13","level":6,"letter":"S","n":13,"zh":"那名狡猾的商人原以為，把野鳥的蛋藏進運動鞋就能走私入境。偏偏正是他在通關前鬼鬼祟祟地調換鞋盒的舉動，引起了海關人員的注意。","en":"The sly merchant thought he could smuggle wild bird eggs in by hiding them in sneakers. But it was his sneaky switching of shoe boxes before customs that caught the officers' attention.","words":[{"en":"sly","zh":"狡猾的"},{"en":"smuggle","zh":"走私"},{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"},{"en":"sneaky","zh":"鬼鬼祟祟的"}]},{"id":"L6-S14","level":6,"letter":"S","n":14,"zh":"我原想去山裡享受獨處，卻發現山屋裡連一間空房都沒有。隔壁床的人整夜打鼾，我清晨打的那個噴嚏倒把他吵醒了。","en":"I wanted to enjoy some solitude in the mountains, but there was not a single empty room in the hut. The person in the next bed snored all night, and the sneeze I let out at dawn woke him up.","words":[{"en":"sneeze","zh":"噴嚏"},{"en":"snore","zh":"打鼾"},{"en":"solitude","zh":"孤獨、單獨"}]},{"id":"L6-S15","level":6,"letter":"S","n":15,"zh":"那位擅長交際的社會學教授自稱是社會主義者。有學生問她如何得知年輕人怎麼看社會主義，她說自己每次散會後都會留下來和大家聊天交朋友。","en":"The sociable sociology professor calls herself a socialist. When a student asked how she knew what young people think about socialism, she said she always stayed to socialize with everyone after meetings.","words":[{"en":"sociable","zh":"好交際的"},{"en":"socialism","zh":"社會主義"},{"en":"socialist","zh":"社會主義者；社會主義的"},{"en":"socialize","zh":"交際、社交；使社會化"},{"en":"sociology","zh":"社會學"}]},{"id":"L6-S16","level":6,"letter":"S","n":16,"zh":"畢業生自發地唱起校歌，想安慰那位剛失去摯友的同學。讓他悲傷的臉上浮出笑意的，正是大家為了表達團結而一起唱出好友最喜歡的那一句。","en":"The graduates spontaneously sang the school song to soothe a classmate who had just lost a close friend. What brought a smile to his sorrowful face was everyone singing his friend's favorite line together in solidarity.","words":[{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"},{"en":"solidarity","zh":"團結"},{"en":"soothe","zh":"安撫、緩和"},{"en":"sorrowful","zh":"悲傷的"},{"en":"spontaneous","zh":"自發的、自然的"}]},{"id":"L6-S17","level":6,"letter":"S","n":17,"zh":"太空船的返回艙預定落在海峽中央。任務發言人說，萬一洋流把它帶進另一個主權國家的領海，回收船就得先獲得該國同意才能進入。","en":"The spacecraft's return capsule is scheduled to land in the middle of the strait. The mission spokesperson said if ocean currents carried it into another sovereign country's waters, the recovery ship would need that country's permission before going in.","words":[{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"},{"en":"sovereign","zh":"有主權的；君主"},{"en":"spacecraft/spaceship","zh":"太空船"},{"en":"spokesperson/spokesman/spokeswoman","zh":"發言人、代言人"},{"en":"strait","zh":"海峽"}]},{"id":"L6-S18","level":6,"letter":"S","n":18,"zh":"燈光從跨越河面的橋上一路亮起，沿著螺旋形步道向上延伸。我從未見過這麼壯觀的景象，當晚的燦爛光輝連最好的照片也拍不出來。","en":"The lights came on from the bridge spanning the river and went up along the spiral walkway. I had never seen such a spectacle, and the splendor of that night could not be captured even by the best photo.","words":[{"en":"span","zh":"（一段）時間、跨度；橫跨"},{"en":"spectacle","zh":"壯觀的景象；（spectacles）眼鏡"},{"en":"spiral","zh":"螺旋（形的）"},{"en":"splendor","zh":"光輝、壯麗"}]},{"id":"L6-S19","level":6,"letter":"S","n":19,"zh":"那名女運動員在終點前停下來扶起對手，因此成了眾人注目的焦點。正是她展現的運動家精神，促使教練重新思考，頒獎時除了完賽時間還該看重什麼。","en":"The sportswoman became the focus of the spotlight when she stopped before the finish line to help her opponent up. It was the sportsmanship she showed that spurred the coach to think again about what besides finishing times should be valued at the awards.","words":[{"en":"sportsman/sportswoman","zh":"運動員"},{"en":"sportsmanship","zh":"運動家精神"},{"en":"spotlight","zh":"聚光燈；焦點"},{"en":"spur","zh":"刺激、促使"}]},{"id":"L6-S20","level":6,"letter":"S","n":20,"zh":"阿城身材矮小，步伐卻比我們誰都長。吊橋一晃，他就踉蹌了一下，老師喊他先穩住身體，等橋面靜止再走。","en":"A-Cheng is small in stature, but his stride is longer than any of ours. When the suspension bridge swayed, he staggered, and the teacher called out for him to stabilize himself first and wait until the bridge was stationary before walking on.","words":[{"en":"stabilize","zh":"使穩定"},{"en":"stagger","zh":"搖搖晃晃地走；使震驚"},{"en":"stationary","zh":"不動的、靜止的"},{"en":"stature","zh":"身高；聲望"},{"en":"stride","zh":"大步走；進展"},{"en":"suspension","zh":"暫停；停學、停職；懸吊"}]},{"id":"L6-S21","level":6,"letter":"S","n":21,"zh":"文具店答應補貼印刷費，前提是得有三十人訂閱校刊。為了讓讀者知道本學期的訂閱費包含郵資，我們把印有費用說明的訂閱單釘在每份樣刊後面。","en":"The stationery store agreed to subsidize the printing cost on the condition that thirty people subscribed to the school magazine. To let readers know that this term's subscription included postage, we stapled a subscription form explaining the fee to the back of every sample copy.","words":[{"en":"sneaker(s)","zh":"運動鞋"},{"en":"staple","zh":"釘書針；用釘書針釘；主食、主要的"},{"en":"stationery","zh":"文具、信紙"},{"en":"subscribe","zh":"訂閱"},{"en":"subscription","zh":"訂閱（費）"},{"en":"subsidize","zh":"補助、資助"}]},{"id":"L6-S22","level":6,"letter":"S","n":22,"zh":"劇中那位政治家召集所有部屬，請他們改寫一項過時的法規。演到這裡，臺下有人問，為什麼受這項法規影響最深的人反而沒有受到邀請。","en":"The statesman in the play summons all his subordinates and asks them to rewrite an outdated statute. At this point, someone in the audience asked why the people most affected by the statute were not invited.","words":[{"en":"statesman","zh":"政治家"},{"en":"statute","zh":"法令、法規"},{"en":"subordinate","zh":"下屬；次要的"},{"en":"summon","zh":"召喚、召集"}]},{"id":"L6-S23","level":6,"letter":"S","n":23,"zh":"小安請繼父與繼母各寫一段話放進紀念冊。身為兩人的繼子，他最感動的是，兩人雖然姓氏不同，卻在信末為他許下了同一個心願。","en":"Xiao-An asked his stepfather and stepmother to each write a paragraph for his memory book. As their stepchild, what moved him most was that although they have different surnames, they made the same wish for him at the end of their letters.","words":[{"en":"stepchild","zh":"繼子女"},{"en":"stepfather","zh":"繼父"},{"en":"stepmother","zh":"繼母"},{"en":"surname","zh":"姓"}]},{"id":"L6-S24","level":6,"letter":"S","n":24,"zh":"我們帶收容所的狗去河堤散步，讓牠們聞聞草叢裡各種氣味，接受些刺激。途中發現一隻流浪狗被繩圈勒著脖子，要是我們沒及時割斷繩子，牠當時就會窒息而死。","en":"We took the shelter dogs for a stroll along the riverbank so they could smell all kinds of things in the grass for some stimulation. On the way we found a stray dog with a loop of rope around its neck. If we had not cut the rope in time, it would have been strangled and suffocated.","words":[{"en":"stimulation","zh":"刺激、激勵"},{"en":"strangle","zh":"勒死、掐死"},{"en":"stray","zh":"迷路的、流浪的；走失"},{"en":"stroll","zh":"散步、漫步"},{"en":"suffocate","zh":"（使）窒息"}]},{"id":"L6-S25","level":6,"letter":"S","n":25,"zh":"一連串無人接聽的電話讓廣播劇充滿懸疑。最後一頁劇本直到錄音前才交給配音員，結局讓她吃驚到連最後一句臺詞都念得結結巴巴。","en":"A succession of unanswered phone calls filled the radio play with suspense. The last page of the script was not given to the voice actress until just before recording, and the ending stunned her so much that she stuttered her last line.","words":[{"en":"stun","zh":"使震驚；擊昏"},{"en":"stutter","zh":"口吃、結巴"},{"en":"succession","zh":"連續；繼承"},{"en":"suspense","zh":"懸疑、焦慮"}]},{"id":"L6-S26","level":6,"letter":"S","n":26,"zh":"我覺得那件短外套很時髦，但這是主觀的看法。如果只憑一張照片就斷言新款在各方面都勝過舊款，那樣的判斷就太膚淺了。","en":"I think that short jacket is stylish, but that is a subjective view. Judging from one photo alone that the new style is superior in every way would be superficial.","words":[{"en":"stylish","zh":"時髦的、有型的"},{"en":"subjective","zh":"主觀的、個人的"},{"en":"superficial","zh":"表面的、膚淺的"}]},{"id":"L6-S27","level":6,"letter":"S","n":27,"zh":"連續三場比賽，她都超越了自己的紀錄。她那位迷信的叔叔看完錄影，斷言她三場比賽穿的一定都是那雙幸運紅襪。","en":"In three successive races, she surpassed her own record. After watching the videos, her superstitious uncle declared that she must have worn her lucky red socks in all three.","words":[{"en":"successive","zh":"連續的"},{"en":"superstitious","zh":"迷信的"},{"en":"surpass","zh":"超越"}]},{"id":"L6-S28","level":6,"letter":"S","n":28,"zh":"洪水一退，救援站接到的求助就激增，志工忙得應接不暇。一位退休醫師提著行李箱進來，裡面裝的正是大家一直在找的外科手術器械。","en":"As soon as the flood went down, calls for help at the rescue station surged, and the volunteers were overwhelmed. A retired doctor came in carrying a suitcase, and inside were exactly the surgical instruments everyone had been looking for.","words":[{"en":"suitcase","zh":"行李箱"},{"en":"surge","zh":"激增；洶湧"},{"en":"surgical","zh":"外科的、手術的"}]},{"id":"L6-S29","level":6,"letter":"S","n":29,"zh":"交響曲演出前，我在音樂廳外看見一大群蜜蜂飛過兩座彼此對稱的花圃。園丁說，這樣的對稱象徵曲中兩個聲部的對話，一個聲部唱出樂句，另一個便回應。","en":"Before the symphony, I saw a swarm of bees fly over two flower beds outside the concert hall that mirrored each other. The gardener said the symmetry symbolized the conversation between two parts in the piece: one part sings a phrase, and the other answers.","words":[{"en":"swarm","zh":"（昆蟲）群；蜂擁"},{"en":"symbolize","zh":"象徵"},{"en":"symmetry","zh":"對稱、勻稱"},{"en":"symphony","zh":"交響樂、交響曲"}]},{"id":"L6-S30","level":6,"letter":"S","n":30,"zh":"阿姨把自己熬的梅子糖漿淋在冰上，冰隨即染成淡紅色。她說，要是當時加了合成色素，眼前這碗冰的顏色就會更深，梅子的香氣卻還是跟現在一樣淡。","en":"My aunt poured the plum syrup she made over the ice, and the ice turned light red. She said if she had added synthetic coloring, the bowl of ice would be darker, but the plum smell would still be as light as it is now.","words":[{"en":"synthetic","zh":"合成的、人造的"},{"en":"syrup","zh":"糖漿"}]},{"id":"L6-T01","level":6,"letter":"T","n":1,"zh":"老紡織廠的露臺上掛著一排棕褐色的紡織品。比起整塊布，我更想拍下布角那枚燕子商標，因為外婆年輕時為它畫的草圖我至今還留著。","en":"A row of tan textiles hung on the terrace of the old textile mill. Rather than a whole piece of cloth, I wanted to photograph the swallow trademark in the corner, because I still keep the sketch Grandma drew for it when she was young.","words":[{"en":"tan","zh":"曬成的古銅色；曬黑"},{"en":"terrace","zh":"露臺；梯田"},{"en":"textile","zh":"紡織品"},{"en":"trademark","zh":"商標"}]},{"id":"L6-T02","level":6,"letter":"T","n":2,"zh":"曲子的速度愈快，我們就愈難踮著腳尖連轉三圈。反覆排這一段已經夠乏味了，更令人厭煩的是，每次失誤音樂都得從頭放。","en":"The faster the tempo, the harder it was for us to turn three times in a row on tiptoe. Rehearsing this part again and again was tedious enough, and what was even more tiresome was that the music had to start over after every mistake.","words":[{"en":"tedious","zh":"冗長乏味的"},{"en":"tempo","zh":"節奏、速度"},{"en":"tiptoe","zh":"踮著腳走；腳尖"},{"en":"tiresome","zh":"令人厭煩的"}]},{"id":"L6-T03","level":6,"letter":"T","n":3,"zh":"我在交換申請截止前上傳了成績單，但當地電信服務中斷，系統無法傳送檔案。電信服務恢復後，校方問我能否提供紀錄，證明我當時確實已經嘗試送件。","en":"I uploaded my transcript before the exchange application deadline, but the local telecommunications service was down and the system could not transmit the file. After the service was restored, the school asked if I could provide records proving that I had really tried to submit it.","words":[{"en":"telecommunications","zh":"電信、通訊"},{"en":"transcript","zh":"成績單；逐字稿"},{"en":"transmit","zh":"傳送、傳播、傳染"}]},{"id":"L6-T04","level":6,"letter":"T","n":4,"zh":"銀行櫃員把存摺塞進信封時，發現一張小花書籤掉了出來，便追到門口還給我。書籤在她眼裡縱然只是個小玩意兒，對我來說卻是外婆疼愛我的象徵。","en":"When the bank teller tucked my passbook into an envelope, she noticed a little flower bookmark fall out and ran to the door to give it back to me. Though the bookmark may be a trifle in her eyes, to me it is a token of Grandma's love.","words":[{"en":"teller","zh":"銀行櫃員；講述者"},{"en":"token","zh":"代幣；象徵"},{"en":"trifle","zh":"瑣事、小事"},{"en":"tuck","zh":"塞進、把……塞好"}]},{"id":"L6-T05","level":6,"letter":"T","n":5,"zh":"基金會的受託管理人和房客達成暫定協議，讓房客照原來的租金住到六月底。至於此後得付多少，要等到下次會議才會決定。","en":"The foundation's trustee reached a tentative agreement with the tenants, letting them stay at the old rent until the end of June. How much they will pay thereafter will not be decided until the next meeting.","words":[{"en":"tenant","zh":"房客、承租人"},{"en":"tentative","zh":"暫定的、試探性的"},{"en":"thereafter","zh":"其後、從那時以後"},{"en":"trustee","zh":"受託人、董事"}]},{"id":"L6-T06","level":6,"letter":"T","n":6,"zh":"社團把來自熱帶地區的幼苗移植到窗邊。老師請我從最後一排讀出溫度計的刻度，又把它朝我傾斜，讓我比較從兩個角度讀到的數字。","en":"The club transplanted seedlings from the tropics to the window. The teacher asked me to read the thermometer from the back row and then tilted it toward me so I could compare the numbers I read from two angles.","words":[{"en":"thermometer","zh":"溫度計、體溫計"},{"en":"tilt","zh":"傾斜"},{"en":"transplant","zh":"移植"},{"en":"tropic","zh":"回歸線；（the tropics）熱帶地區"}]},{"id":"L6-T07","level":6,"letter":"T","n":7,"zh":"龍捲風扯下了招牌，暴雨又把街道變成一道洪流。一片混亂中，最先發現還有兩個孩子困在公車亭裡的，正是巷口的店長。","en":"The tornado tore down signs, and the heavy rain turned the street into a torrent. In the turmoil, the first person to notice that two children were still trapped in the bus shelter was the manager of the shop at the end of the lane.","words":[{"en":"tornado","zh":"龍捲風"},{"en":"torrent","zh":"急流；傾盆大雨"},{"en":"turmoil","zh":"騷動、混亂"}]},{"id":"L6-T08","level":6,"letter":"T","n":8,"zh":"公民老師問，如果國庫裡有一兆元，我們會怎麼分配給不同世代的人。我們先算出每項計畫十年的成本，才有辦法替自己的分配方式辯護。","en":"Our civics teacher asked how we would divide a trillion dollars in the treasury among people of different generations. Only after we worked out the ten-year cost of each plan could we defend our way of dividing the money.","words":[{"en":"treasury","zh":"國庫、財政部"},{"en":"trillion","zh":"兆（10 的 12 次方）"}]},{"id":"L6-T09","level":6,"letter":"T","n":9,"zh":"我們跋涉了六個鐘頭，終於在薄暮時分抵達山中的溪邊。當我們沿淺灘追著一尾逆流而上的鱒魚走時，頭頂的第一批星星已經開始閃爍了。","en":"After a six-hour trek, we finally reached the stream in the mountains at twilight. As we followed a trout swimming upstream through the shallows, the first stars began to twinkle above us.","words":[{"en":"trek","zh":"長途跋涉、徒步旅行"},{"en":"trout","zh":"鱒魚"},{"en":"twilight","zh":"黃昏、暮光"},{"en":"twinkle","zh":"閃爍、閃耀"}]},{"id":"L6-U01","level":6,"letter":"U","n":1,"zh":"要是我們沒有低估替學生餐廳募款的迫切性，就不會等到房東寄來最後一封催租通知才開會。社員全體一致同意把園遊會收入撥給餐廳，並說明這筆資助是無條件的。","en":"If we had not underestimated the urgency of raising money for the student cafeteria, we would not have waited until the landlord sent his final rent notice to hold a meeting. The members voted unanimously to give the fair's income to the cafeteria and made clear that the support was unconditional.","words":[{"en":"unanimous","zh":"全體一致的"},{"en":"unconditional","zh":"無條件的"},{"en":"underestimate","zh":"低估"},{"en":"urgency","zh":"緊急、迫切"}]},{"id":"L6-U02","level":6,"letter":"U","n":2,"zh":"車站正下方的地下道正在整修，臨時圍籬擋住了朝上的箭頭。站務員改把出口標誌吊在天花板上，好讓旅客即使看不見箭頭，往上看也能找到出口。","en":"The underpass directly underneath the station is being repaired, and a temporary fence blocks the upward arrows. The station staff hung the exit signs from the ceiling instead, so travelers who cannot see the arrows can still find the exit by looking up.","words":[{"en":"underneath","zh":"在……的下面"},{"en":"underpass","zh":"地下道"},{"en":"upward","zh":"向上的"},{"en":"upward/upwards","zh":"向上"}]},{"id":"L6-U03","level":6,"letter":"U","n":3,"zh":"歷史社為一幅描繪起義的壁畫揭幕，畫中的年輕人正試圖團結不同族群。策展人被問起為何留了一面空牆，她說是為了讓觀眾寫下國家統一對各自家庭的意義。","en":"The history club unveiled a mural of an uprising in which young people try to unify different groups. When the curator was asked why she left one wall empty, she said it was so visitors could write what national unification means to their families.","words":[{"en":"unification","zh":"統一"},{"en":"unify","zh":"統一、使成一體"},{"en":"unveil","zh":"揭幕；公布"},{"en":"uprising","zh":"起義、暴動"}]},{"id":"L6-U04","level":6,"letter":"U","n":4,"zh":"引座員站得筆直，一句話也沒說，只用手勢示意我們入座。每套餐具旁都放著一張卡片，請我們交換座位，用新座位上的器具為對方準備一道菜。","en":"The usher stood upright and did not utter a word, only gesturing for us to sit. Beside each set of utensils was a card asking us to switch seats and use the utensils at our new seats to prepare a dish for each other.","words":[{"en":"upright","zh":"直立的；正直的"},{"en":"usher","zh":"帶位員；引導"},{"en":"utensil","zh":"（廚房）器具、餐具"},{"en":"utter","zh":"說出、發出；完全的"}]},{"id":"L6-V01","level":6,"letter":"V","n":1,"zh":"在職業探索課上，一位獸醫帶我們清點巡迴診所裡的疫苗。有人問她何時認定照顧動物是自己的天職，她說正是老師第一次帶她到偏鄉替狗打預防針的那天。","en":"In our vocational exploration class, a veterinarian had us count the vaccines in her mobile clinic. When someone asked when she decided that caring for animals was her vocation, she said it was the day her teacher first took her to vaccinate dogs in a remote village.","words":[{"en":"vaccine","zh":"疫苗"},{"en":"veterinarian/vet","zh":"獸醫"},{"en":"vocation","zh":"職業、天職"},{"en":"vocational","zh":"職業的"}]},{"id":"L6-V02","level":6,"letter":"V","n":2,"zh":"舞臺的天鵝絨布幕升起時，扮演甜點師的演員仍戴著面紗。我們先看見鍋子上方冒出水蒸氣，接著才聞到她剛加入的香草精。","en":"When the velvet curtain rose, the actress playing a pastry chef still wore a veil. First we saw vapor rising above the pot, and then we smelled the vanilla she had just added.","words":[{"en":"vanilla","zh":"香草"},{"en":"vapor","zh":"蒸氣"},{"en":"veil","zh":"面紗"},{"en":"velvet","zh":"天鵝絨"}]},{"id":"L6-V03","level":6,"letter":"V","n":3,"zh":"這齣戲裡，自認必能得勝的反派認定，勝利者有資格批評別人的惡習。編劇讓他在鏡前排練得獎感言，用這場戲點出他最大的惡習正是虛榮。","en":"In this play, the villain, sure that he will win, believes the victor has the right to criticize others' vices. The writer has him rehearse his acceptance speech in front of a mirror, using the scene to show that his greatest vice is vanity.","words":[{"en":"vanity","zh":"虛榮（心）"},{"en":"vice","zh":"惡習、惡行"},{"en":"victor","zh":"勝利者"},{"en":"villain","zh":"反派、壞人"}]},{"id":"L6-V04","level":6,"letter":"V","n":4,"zh":"那位多才多藝的小提琴手也教發音。為了讓我們明白喉頭的振動和琴弦的振動有什麼相似之處，她先讓我們一邊發母音一邊摸喉頭，再讓我們輕撥琴弦，看它怎麼振動。","en":"The versatile violinist also teaches pronunciation. To help us see how the vibration in the throat is like the vibration of a string, she first had us touch our throats while saying vowels and then had us pluck a string gently to see how it vibrates.","words":[{"en":"versatile","zh":"多才多藝的；多用途的"},{"en":"vibrate","zh":"振動、顫動"},{"en":"vibration","zh":"振動、顫動"},{"en":"violinist","zh":"小提琴家"},{"en":"vowel","zh":"母音"}]},{"id":"L6-V05","level":6,"letter":"V","n":5,"zh":"開發商想砍掉葡萄園外的原始林來蓋別墅，還要把老葡萄藤移到入口。若非居民行使了否決權，那些藤如今已成了別墅的裝飾品。","en":"The developer wanted to cut down the virgin forest outside the vineyard to build villas and move the old vines to the entrance. If the residents had not used their veto, those vines would now be decorations for the villas.","words":[{"en":"veto","zh":"否決（權）"},{"en":"villa","zh":"別墅"},{"en":"vine","zh":"藤蔓、葡萄藤"},{"en":"vineyard","zh":"葡萄園"},{"en":"virgin","zh":"處女；未開發的"}]},{"id":"L6-V06","level":6,"letter":"V","n":6,"zh":"爺爺曾是個精力充沛的舞者，手術後卻連一首曲子也跳不完。他重返舞池時，步子雖然少了當年的勁道，眼裡的生命力卻一點也沒少。","en":"Grandpa was once a vigorous dancer, but after his surgery he could not finish even one song. When he returned to the dance floor, his steps had lost the vigor of the old days, but the vitality in his eyes had not faded at all.","words":[{"en":"vigor","zh":"精力、活力"},{"en":"vigorous","zh":"精力充沛的；強而有力的"},{"en":"vitality","zh":"活力、生命力"}]},{"id":"L6-W01","level":6,"letter":"W","n":1,"zh":"探訪犬才剛走進病房就搖起尾巴。那位筋疲力盡的老人一見到牠，終於笑了，眼角的皺紋也隨著笑容加深。","en":"The visiting dog started to wag its tail as soon as it walked into the ward. When the weary old man saw it, he finally smiled, and the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes deepened with his smile.","words":[{"en":"wag","zh":"搖（尾巴）"},{"en":"ward","zh":"病房"},{"en":"weary","zh":"疲倦的"},{"en":"wrinkle","zh":"皺紋；起皺"}]},{"id":"L6-W02","level":6,"letter":"W","n":2,"zh":"木工師傅替這座胡桃木衣櫃的表面做了防水處理，並把保證書放進上層抽屜。他提醒我們，搬動衣櫃前若沒先拆下櫃門，保證書就不會涵蓋搬運造成的損壞。","en":"The carpenter made the surface of this walnut wardrobe waterproof and put the warranty in the top drawer. He reminded us that if we did not take off the doors before moving the wardrobe, the warranty would not cover damage caused by moving it.","words":[{"en":"walnut","zh":"核桃"},{"en":"wardrobe","zh":"衣櫃；（個人的）全部服裝"},{"en":"warrant","zh":"搜索票、拘票；使有必要"},{"en":"warranty","zh":"保固、保證書"},{"en":"waterproof","zh":"防水的"}]},{"id":"L6-W03","level":6,"letter":"W","n":3,"zh":"警方帶著搜索票到碼頭檢查一批威士忌。船長被問起為何沒有提供貨物來源時，打開帳冊，指出負責登記那一欄的人其實是貨主。","en":"The police took a warrant to the wharf to check a shipment of whiskey. When the captain was asked why he had withheld the source of the goods, he opened the account book and pointed out that the person responsible for filling in that column was actually the owner of the goods.","words":[{"en":"warrant","zh":"搜索票、拘票；使有必要"},{"en":"wharf","zh":"碼頭"},{"en":"whiskey/whisky","zh":"威士忌酒"}]},{"id":"L6-W04","level":6,"letter":"W","n":4,"zh":"隔壁那位寡婦每天去批發市場，挑有益健康的食材煮湯。有人問她獨自一人是怎麼熬過喪夫後種種苦難的，她說每天來陪她喝湯的朋友從沒讓她獨自面對。","en":"The widow next door goes to the wholesale market every day to choose wholesome ingredients for soup. When someone asked how she got through all the woes after losing her husband alone, she said the friends who came to share soup with her every day never let her face them alone.","words":[{"en":"wholesale","zh":"批發（的）；大規模的"},{"en":"wholesome","zh":"有益健康的"},{"en":"widow/widower","zh":"寡婦／鰥夫"},{"en":"woe","zh":"悲哀、悲痛"}]},{"id":"L6-W05","level":6,"letter":"W","n":5,"zh":"林場打算僱用當地的勞動人口修復步道。我陪工頭勘查路線時，看見兩名工人正和一截卡住的粗樹根搏鬥，頭頂那隻啄木鳥卻始終沒停下來看他們一眼。","en":"The forest farm plans to hire the local workforce to repair the trail. When I went with the foreman to check the route, I saw two workers wrestling with a thick stuck root, while the woodpecker above never stopped to look at them.","words":[{"en":"woodpecker","zh":"啄木鳥"},{"en":"workforce","zh":"勞動力、全體員工"},{"en":"wrestle","zh":"摔角；搏鬥"}]},{"id":"L6-Y01","level":6,"letter":"Y","n":1,"zh":"搬到外縣市讀書後，我才發現自己有多渴望再和媽媽過一個悠閒的星期六。以前上完瑜伽課，我們總會分吃一杯優格，坐到店家準備打烊才回家。","en":"After moving to another county to study, I found how much I yearned for another lazy Saturday with Mom. After yoga class, we used to share a cup of yogurt and sit there until the shop was about to close before going home.","words":[{"en":"yearn","zh":"渴望、想念"},{"en":"yoga","zh":"瑜伽"},{"en":"yogurt","zh":"優格"}]},{"id":"L6-Z01","level":6,"letter":"Z","n":1,"zh":"我把鏡頭拉近，讓整張照片只留下接棒時交會的那兩隻手。隊長原以為交棒的是隊友，卻一眼就認出了自己拇指上的舊傷疤。","en":"I zoomed in so the whole photo only showed the two hands meeting at the baton pass. The captain thought it was a teammate passing the baton, but he recognized at once the old scar on his own thumb.","words":[{"en":"zoom","zh":"（鏡頭）拉近放大；急速上升"}]}]`);export{e as default};
